eduled_status_plural":"Video call scheduled for ${date}, in ${numberofdays} days","ahd_aef_priority_action_scheduled_status_singular":"Video call scheduled for ${date}, in ${numberofday} day","ahd_ahr_section_sub_section":"This rating reflects your adherence to Amazon’s selling policies. <a href=/help/hub/reference/G200205250?ref=ahd-ahr-lm target=‘_blank’>Learn more</a>.","ahd_ahr_section_title":"Account Health Rating","ahd_back_button":"Back","ahd_banner_account_atrisk_header":"Your account is at risk of deactivation.","ahd_banner_account_pending_header":"Your account is pending deactivation.","ahd_br_store":"Brazil (Amazon.com.br)","ahd_brkyc_priority_action":"Brazil identity verification","ahd_brkyc_rap_action":"You are required to submit your identity verification information before the due date.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_action":"Submit your identity verification information to reactivate your account.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_message":"Your account has been deactivated because we were not able to validate your identity information.","ahd_ca_store":"Canada (Amazon.ca)","ahd_cakyc_priority_action":"Canada identity verification","ahd_cakyc_rap_action":"Provide your identity verification information by the due date shown to avoid account deactivation. ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_header":"Why do I have to provide this information?","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_header2":"How much time do I have to provide the information? ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_header3":"What will happen if I do not provide the required information? ","ahd_cancel_button":"Cancel","ahd_close_button":"Close","ahd_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_subtitle":"You have one or more outstanding action items that are required before you can begin selling. ","ahd_complete_status":"COMPLETED","ahd_compliance_widget_button":"Submit compliance information","ahd_compliance_widget_description":"Submit compliance information to prove regulatory compliance.","ahd_dac7_rap_action":"You are now required to submit your DAC7 information before the due date.","ahd_dac7_rap_deactivated_message":"Your account has been deactivated for non-compliance with the Directive on Administrative Cooperation – 7th Amendment (DAC7)","ahd_days":"Days","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_subtitle":"Submit information to complete verification requirements to sell in Brazil.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_subtitle":"Submit information to complete verification requirements to sell in Canada.","ahd_edit_button":"Edit","ahd_educational_banner_header":"Complete your priority actions","ahd_educational_banner_subheader":"You have one or more outstanding action items that will result in account deactivation if not completed by the listed date.","ahd_fhdds_priority_action":"IEN required for UK shipments received","ahd_floating_widget_action_panel_close":"Close","ahd_funds_potential_withheld":"Funds may be withheld","ahd_incomplete_status":"INCOMPLETE","ahd_inform_ac_educational_subheader":"You have one or more outstanding action items that may result in future account deactivation.","ahd_inform_ac_no_poc":"Identity information not provided. If you previously submitted a government-issued record or tax document in lieu of this information, you are certifying that there have been no changes to that submission.","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p2":"You are now required to certify that your information below is up to date within 10 days of first viewing this notice. Failure to certify will put your account at risk of deactivation.","ahd_inform_ac_refresh_update_info":"If you have updated any information below, please click here to refresh the page and see the new information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"Address","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_button":"Certify","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_your_info_button":"Certify your information","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"Name","ahd_inform_act_ac_notice_title":"Notice","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"Phone","ahd_inform_act_ac_short_description":"Review 