ni_warn_impressum":"Impressum","inform_mobile_notification_description":"Go to your Account Health page to review your pending INFORM Act verification requirements.","inform_mobile_notification_description_full":"Your Amazon.com seller account is at risk of deactivation. Go to your Account Health page to review your pending INFORM Act verification requirements.","mobile_tutorial_inform_act_description":"To comply with the INFORM Consumers Act, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending.","rv-link-button":"Go to violations","sc_homepage_pending_deactivation":"A critical event has occurred with your account that has caused it to be pending deactivation. ","sc_inform_act_hold_banner":"Your account is at risk of deactivation and disbursements are on hold","sc_navbar_ah_ppc_desc":"View all policy violations that may result in content removal or account deactivation. ","schp_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_header":"Complete your outstanding verification requirements to begin selling on Amazon.","schp_inventory_restriction_card":"Address your account health issues to remove the inventory restrictions on your account.","ship_to_xborder_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are conducting cross-border sales into ${COUNTRY} from other EU country and, therefore, you are required to provide a valid ${COUNTRY} VAT number.","sp-aha-check-eligibility-button":"See what it takes to qualify","sp-permanent-call-me-now-need-help":"Need help?","sp-permanent-call-me-now-prompt":"Speak to an account health specialist","sp_health_amazon_fulfilled_metrics_caption":"Fulfilled by Amazon","sp_health_atoz_guarantee_claims_caption":"A-to-z Guarantee claims","sp_health_cancellation_rate_subtitle":"<b>Target</b>: under ${hash-get targetValue}","sp_health_chargeback_claims_caption":"Chargeback claims","sp_health_gl_office_product":"Office Products","sp_health_late_shipment_rate_subtitle":"<b>Target</b>: under ${hash-get targetValue}","sp_health_mobile_info_bar_label":"Violations","sp_health_mobile_info_bar_label_ahr_filter_enabled":"Violations or more","sp_health_nav_account_health":"Account Health","sp_health_nav_eligibilities":"Eligibilities","sp_health_nav_performance_over_time":"Performance Over Time","sp_health_nav_reports":"Reports","sp_health_negative_feedback_caption":"Negative feedback","sp_health_number_days":"${hash-get number_days} days","sp_health_orders_of_total":"${hash-get orders_number} of ${hash-get orders_total} orders","sp_health_orders_of_total_orders":"${hash-get orders_number} of ${hash-get orders_total} orders","sp_health_product_condition_customer_complaints":"Product Condition Customer Complaints","sp_health_risk_banner_unitotd":"Your On-Time Delivery Rate is ${unitOTDRiskData.getFormattedValue()}; the target is ${unitOTDRiskData.getFormattedTarget()}.","sp_health_shipments_of_total_shipments":"${hash-get shipments_number} of ${hash-get shipments_total} shipments","sp_health_suspected_intellectual_property_violations":"Suspected Intellectual Property Violations","sp_health_view_details":"View details","sp_health_view_details_pagination_index":"\\\\${currentIndex} of \\\\${lastIndex}","sp_health_violation_details_next":"Next","sp_health_violation_details_selling_assistant_title":"Ask Seller Assistant","sp_health_violation_details_stale_page_dialog_title":"Page not found","sp_health_violation_details_stale_page_message":"This page no longer exists.","sp_navbar_more_button":"More","sp_pw_health_detail_table_appeal_violation_link":"Appeal","sp_st_heading_order_image":"Image","sp_st_heading_order_title":"Title","submission_status_ahd_review_submission_pending_status":"Status: Our evaluation is in progress.","tab_demo_name":"Tab name {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_text":"Content for initially selected tab","tab_demo_text":"Content for tab {tabId}","ts-ingress-ahd":" <a id=\'submission-channel-link\' href=\'#\'>Report abuse</a> of Amazon policies."}},"en-AU":{"pages.floatingWidget":{"DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_content":"You’re part of an experiment to improve seller experience: starting now, strong performance on Buyer Contact Rate, Contact Response Time and Buyer Dissatisfaction Rate can boost your AHR score! This change helps AHR reward excellent customer service. Check your customer service performance on Feedback Manager now.","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_cta_done":"Feedback Manager","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_header":"Earn AHR (Account Health Rating) points for strong customer service","DYK_JP_LINE_content":"Amazon LINE Official Account sends selected notifications about the notifications we sent via email and Seller Central requiring actions by Sellers regarding topics such as your account’s status, listing status and payment disbursement errors. Connect your Seller Central account to the LINE official account to receive notifications via LINE and avoid missing important notifications. Learn More","DYK_JP_LINE_header":"You can connect with LINE account to receive personalised important messages that matters to your account health.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_content":"Great news! You\'re within 60 days of qualifying for Account Health Assurance (AHA). Maintain your Account Health Rating above 250 and keep a verified emergency contact number on file to secure enhanced account protection. We\'ll notify you via email once you\'re automatically enrolled.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_header":"Nearing Account Health Assurance enrolment","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_content":"Your Account Health Rating has moved into At risk or Unhealthy status. Click “Call me now” to speak with an Account Health Specialist and protect your selling privileges.","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_cta_done":"Call me now","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_header":"Your Account Health Rating needs attention","DYK_SSAT_CFT_DietarySupp_content":"Protect your Dietary Supplement listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_Toys_content":"Protect your Toys category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_artscrafts_content":"Protect your Arts and Crafts Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_buttoncellbatteryproducts_content":"Protect your Button Cell Battery Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_childrensproducts_content":"Protect your Children\'s Products Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_cta_done":"Sign Up Today","DYK_SSAT_CFT_electronics_content":"Protect your Electronics Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_emobilityproducts_content":"Protect your E-Mobility Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_firesafety_content":"Protect your Fire Safety category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_furniture_content":"Protect your Furniture Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_header":"Simplify Compliance: Enrol in Compliance Fast-track Today","DYK_SSAT_CFT_infantbabyproducts_content":"Protect your Infant and Baby Products Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_ppe_content":"Protect your Personal Protection Equipment category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_EDU_JULY":"Keys to the Account Health Rating","DYK_SSAT_EDU_content":"AHR monitors your account\'s deactivation risk through a point system. You gain points for successfully fulfilling orders. You lose points points when policy violations are detected and recover points when you successfully address those violations. Review your Account Health dashboard often and address policy violations as they arise.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_content":"We’re excited to announce Seller Challenge, a new feature for Account Health Assurance sellers. Seller Challenge provides a limited number of opportunities to request a separate review of listing issues through your Account Health page. Once you’ve submitted a challenge, we’ll strive to respond with a decision in 48 hours.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_cta_done":"Learn more","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop_header":"Healthy AHR tip","ahd_dyk_bhdr_content":"We recommend delivering more than 90% of your Amazon Business commercial shipments during business hours to maintain a good customer experience","ahd_dyk_bhdr_cta":"View performance","ahd_dyk_bhdr_header":"Your business hour delivery rate is low.","ahd_dyk_br_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Your Amazon.com.br (Brazil) store is at risk of deactivation.","ahd_dyk_de_sup_label":"To comply with the EPR: Germany Single Use Plastic policy (effective since January 1, 2025), take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for each brand and product type combination. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GA4JYZX23CLK8WFW\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_de_sup_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): Germany Single Use Plastic","ahd_dyk_de_sup_weee_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): Germany WEEE","ahd_dyk_description_eukyc":"In accordance with EU regulations, you must complete an account verification process. Go to the Identity Information page to complete verification. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G201200780 \\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_label":"To comply with the EPR: take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for each brand and product type combination. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GYDCAK9ZR6VJH2X3\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR)","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_label":"To comply with the EPR: EU Batteries policy (effective from August 18, 2025), take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for your product categories. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GPVDATLHQ6PRQNSW\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): EU Batteries","ahd_dyk_fhdds_cta":"Review Shipments","ahd_dyk_fhdds_description":"Provide the import details for all your applicable shipments in your Shipping Queue before they disrupt your business. Missing import details could restrict your ability to create new UK shipments.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.com.br/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.com.br</a> store.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.ca/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.ca</a> store.","ahd_dyk_title_eukyc":"Complete your EU Know Your Customer (KYC) verification","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description":"To comply with the GPSR, which comes into effect on December 13, 2024, please provide additional compliance information for your products to avoid impact on your listings. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_task":"You have listings affected by the General Product Safety Regulation (GPSR).","ahd_floating_widget_aha_ec_description":"As a member of the AHA program, you are <b>required</b> to maintain a valid emergency contact number. Verify your emergency contact details to retain AHA eligibility, so our specialists can reach out to help you address critical account health-related issues before they disrupt your business.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_action_panel_title":"Emergency contact information update","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_food_and_safety_heading":"You have repeat violations for food and product safety issues","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_ip_heading":"You have repeat violations for received intellectual property complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_listing_heading":"You have repeat violations for listing policy violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_other_heading":"You have repeat violations for other policy violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_auth_heading":"You have repeat violations for product authenticity customer complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_cond_heading":"You have repeat violations for product condition customer complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_reviews_heading":"You have repeat violations for customer product reviews policy violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_reg_comp_heading":"You have repeat violations for regulatory compliance","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_rp_heading":"You have repeat violations for Restricted Product Policy","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_sip_heading":"You have repeat violations for suspected intellectual property violations","ahd_floating_widget_resolve_now_button_text":"Resolve now","cs_nerd_suggestion_top_issues_action_vi":"View Issues","dyk_ahd_pra_rv":"You have repeat violations for Customer Product Reviews Policy Violations"},"pages.homepage":{"AHD_DD14_Base_Reserve":"Sales proceeds are held for 14 days after the delivery date and become available for disbursement starting on the 15th day after the delivery date. If the actual delivery date is not available, we use the latest estimated delivery date for the order. This is your default payment policy.","AHD_POA_APPEAL_ERROR_LOADING":"An error happened. Please refresh the page.","DR_VAT_AHD_NC_BANNER":"We’ve not been able to verify your business establishment for VAT purposes. To ensure accurate tax treatment, verify your establishment for VAT purposes.","DR_VAT_AHD_PRIORITY_ACTION":"Establishment verification required for VAT purposes","Engage_Appeal_05":"Seller code of conduct (favourably influencing customers to manipulate your sales ratings, feedback or reviews)","LocalizedPageTitleDashboard":"Performance Dashboard","LocalizedPageTitleDetailCustomerSatisfaction":"Customer Satisfaction details page.","LocalizedPageTitleDetailProductPolicies":"Product Policies details page.","NO_METRICS":"You currently don\'t have any orders counting towards this metric.\\n","RR_AHR_Warn_1":"Multiple selling accounts on Amazon","acf_banner_inform_act":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to start verification.","acf_inform_act_wait_text":"Thank you for verifying your identity. Check back in 24 hours for confirmation of whether any additional information is needed. ","acf_inform_act_widget_description":"After completing identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","addTab_label":"Add tab","aef_address_your_violation":"Address your violation","ags_pcx_voc_summary_voice_of_the_customer":"Voice of the customer","ahd_Inform_deposit_method":"Deposit method information","ahd_account_impacted_details":"Your account may be affected as detailed below:","ahd_account_regulatory_compliance":"Account Regulatory Compliance","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to start verification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_aha":"<b> Please note, if you have not completed all verification items when the INFORM Consumers Act takes effect, your account may be deactivated, regardless of your enrolment in Account Health Assurance.</b>","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_thankyou":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have completed all open verifications successfully. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_v2":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>US INFORM Consumers Act</a>, which comes into effect on June 27, 2023, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Visit the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Account Information</a> page to start verification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_school_supplies":"We\'ve identified you have listing(s) at risk of removal due to non-compliance to local, state and federal regulations regarding the sale of school supply products for children. To learn more about these compliance requirements, click <a href=/gp/help/external/help.html?itemID=XT3EFQS54LRKYM3&language=en_US&ref=ahd_uspc_adhoc_banner>here</a>. To prevent listing removal, please view your listings in scope of this compliance requirement <a href=/performance/account/health/product-policies?t=safe>here</a> and follow the guidance listed under \\"Next Steps\\" next to the listing(s) at risk of removal to ensure compliance with these requirements.","ahd_adhoc_mobile_inform_act_aha":"Note: If you do not complete all verification steps within the specified timelines, your account may be deactivated, regardless of your enrolment in Account Health Assurance.","ahd_aef_IPI_priority_action":"Virtual Identity Verification","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_join_call_link":"Visit <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">Identity Verification Portal</a> to join your scheduled video call.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_next_steps":"Visit the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">Identity Verification Portal</a>, to submit required documents and join a video call for virtual identity verification. You also have option to schedule a video call on a future date and time after submitting required documents.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason":"A review of your business has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity; this can, in accordance with Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>, lead to account deactivation. To protect our customers and selling partners, we need to verify the identity of our sellers through a virtual identity verification process that takes place on a video call. ","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason_eu":"A review of your business has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity; this can, in accordance with Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G201190440\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>, lead to account deactivation. To protect our customers and selling partners, we need to verify the identity of our sellers through a virtual identity verification process that takes place on a video call.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_review_fail":"A review of your business and the information you provided during your virtual identity verification, has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity, which is in violation of Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_under_review":"We are reviewing the information you provided for identity verification. The review process may take up to 5 business days.","ahd_aef_action_panel_RA_reason":"Our review indicates that you have a separate account that was deactivated for violating one of our policies. As a result, the current selling account is in violation of our ‘Multiple Selling Accounts on Amazon’ policy outlined in the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G1801\\">Seller Code of Conduct</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_post_deactivation_appeal":"If you believe your account has been deactivated in error, you can submit new information by clicking \'Appeal\' button below.","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_food_and_prod_subreason":"Food and product safety issues","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_listing_subreason":"Listing policy violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_other_subreason":"Other policy violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_auth_subreason":"Product authenticity customer complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_cond_subreason":"Product condition customer complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_review_subreason":"Customer product reviews policy violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reason":"Repeat violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reg_comp_subreason":"Regulatory compliance","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rip_subreason":"Received intellectual property complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rp_subreason":"Restricted product policy","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_sip_subreason":"Suspected intellectual property violations","ahd_aef_at_risk_HD_card_body":"To reactivate your disbursements, review your Priority Actions and address the outstanding action items.","ahd_aef_at_risk_card_sc_body":"You have one or more outstanding action items that will result in account deactivation.","ahd_aef_critical_message":"This critical issue if left unresolved will cause your account to be deactivated.","ahd_aef_critical_message_no_caps":"This critical issue if left unresolved will cause your account to be deactivated.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_body":"Address your account health issues to reactivate your account. Once the issues have been resolved, your account will be reactivated within 24 hours.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_sc_body":"Address your account health issues to reactivate your account.","ahd_aef_denver_eu":"Verify EU establishment for Value Added Tax (VAT)","ahd_aef_denver_info":"Information required","ahd_aef_denver_uk":"Verify UK establishment for Value Added Tax (VAT)","ahd_aef_educational_card_action":"Resolve Issues","ahd_aef_impact_header":"Account Health Impact","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_post_deactivation":"Click the ‘Appeal\' button below and follow the instructions provided in order to reactivate this selling account.","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_pre_deactivation":"Click the \'Appeal\' button below and follow the instructions provided in order to avoid deactivation of this selling account.","ahd_aef_next_steps_header":"Address Your Violation","ahd_aef_pending_critical":"Pending critical","ahd_aef_submit_header":"Submit your information","ahd_ahr_pending_critical":"Pending critical","ahd_all_issues":"All issues","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_body":"Your account will be considered for reactivation when your violations have been appealed successfully. ","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_header":"Your account has been deactivated. ","ahd_banner_block_mfn_at_risk_subtitle":"Your seller-fulfilled offers have been deactivated and your account is at-risk of deactivation. Complete your Priority Actions to reactivate your seller-fulfilled offers and prevent deactivation.","ahd_banner_block_mfn_subtitle":"Your seller-fulfilled offers have been deactivated. Complete your Priority Actions to reactivate your seller-fulfilled offers.","ahd_banner_eg_trn":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br>Your account is at-risk of deactivation because your Seller Central account does not include your valid Tax Registration Number. Visit the <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations> Tax Settings</a> page to update your Tax information within 90 days from the date of your first product listing on Amazon to avoid account deactivation. For more information, see the \\"Tax compliance frequently asked questions\\" <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC> help page. </a>","ahd_banner_resolve_issues_button":"Resolve issues","ahd_be_jsl_at_risk_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br> You have not provided your Belgian VAT Registration Number (VRN) or confirmation of Union One-Stop Shop (OSS) status for your home country in your Amazon Seller Central account. Refer to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/external/GGTX8THLMMDJ3WBP> new Belgian legislation</a> to know more about the requirement and provide information.","ahd_be_jsl_priority_action":"Belgium VAT legislation","ahd_brkyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Check your verification status on the <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional\\n?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity Information </a> page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"As per Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service and you are required to provide us with certain information or documents in order to facilitate these checks. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications.\\r\\n<br><br>Your account has been deactivated because we were not able to validate your identity information.<br><br> \\r\\nFor more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon </a> help page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_identity_info":"Visit the <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity Information</a>  page to complete verification.","ahd_brkyc_rap_intro":"As per Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You are required to provide us with certain information or documents in order to facilitate these checks. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications.\\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nFor more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon </a> help page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_verifying":"We are validating your information and may need to request details from you during this review. Please check the <a href=\'/performance/notifications\\r\\n?ref_=to_brkyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a> sections and respond to any requests relating to your Selling on Amazon account. This validation can take up to 24 hours and might take up to 10 working days in some cases. During this time, your Identity Information cannot be edited.","ahd_cakyc_rap_action_hd":"Provide your identity verification information by the due date shown to avoid account deactivation. If you do not start verification and have 15 days or less remaining, your ability to disburse funds from your Amazon.ca selling account will be restricted. Verification is required under Canadian law.","ahd_cakyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Check your verification status on the <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> Identity Information page</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"Your account has been deactivated because we were not able to validate your identity information.  Canadian laws require us to verify your identity so that we can allow you to use our service. To reactivate your account, submit information needed to verify your identity. \\r\\n<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page","ahd_cakyc_rap_identity_info":"Visit the <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> Identity Information page</a> to complete verification. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_intro":"Canadian law requires us to verify your identity to allow you to use our service. We need you to provide us with certain information and documents so that we can conduct these verification checks. <br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page or refer to your <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_self_trigger_cta":"By clicking \'Begin Verification\', you are proceeding with the Canada verification requirements. Visit the<a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> Identity Information page</a> to confirm next steps. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_verifying":"We are validating your information. This validation can take between 24 hours and 10 working days, in some cases. We may need to request details from you during this review. Please check the <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a> section and respond to any additional requests relating to your Selling on Amazon account.  \\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nDuring this time, your Identity Information cannot be edited.","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph":"The verification of your identity is required by law for the use of a selling on Amazon account. As per Canadian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You may need to provide us with certain information and documents in order to facilitate these checks.<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph2":"Amazon allows up to 60 days for you to complete re-verification. The does not include the time we take to complete the review. Your ability to sell and disburse funds may be restricted if re-verification is not completed within 60 days. When we require information, a notification will appear on your Account Information page. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications. ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph3":"You will eventually be unable to use your selling on Amazon account. Therefore, you will not be able to sell on Amazon.ca if the information is not provided. ","ahd_collusion_policy":"Selling Policies and Seller Code of Conduct","ahd_compliance_status":"Compliance Status","ahd_compliance_widget_ckp_redirect":"Launch compliance reference","ahd_critical_account_health_notification":"Critical Account Health Notification","ahd_critical_policy_violations":"Critical policy violations","ahd_dac7_at_risk_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation.</b><br><br> Your account is at risk of being deactivated because of missing tax information required under  <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB\\"> DAC7 legislation</a>. Visit the <a href= \\"/complianceportal\\">DAC7 Compliance Portal</a>  to start verification. ","ahd_dac7_compliant":"You are DAC7 compliant now!","ahd_dac7_priority_action":"DAC7 Information Required","ahd_dac7_priority_action_pending":"Pending verification","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_launch_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Launch the DAC7 Portal to submit your information</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal_status":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_status_blurb\'  target=\'_blank\'>Check your verification status on the DAC7 Portal</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_intro":"The <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/external/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB?ref_=to_dac_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Directive on Administrative Cooperation - 7th Amendment (DAC7)</a> is an EU regulation that requires Amazon to collect, verify and report due diligence, VAT/Tax and financial data of EU-resident Sellers irrespective of the Amazon store they sell in.","ahd_dac7_rap_verify_now_button":"Verify now","ahd_dac7_rap_verifying":"We are reviewing your DAC7 information. The review process usually takes 72 hours, but might take longer in some instances. Please check the status of your verification regularly in the DAC7 Portal below to know if we require more information.","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_description":"Go to the <a href=\'/hz/sc/account-information\' target=\'_blank\'>Account information</a> page to complete verification. ","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Your Amazon.ca (Canada) store is at risk of deactivation.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the Amazon.com.br store.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the Amazon.ca store.","ahd_eg_trn_deactivation_banner":"<b>Your account has been deactivated.</b><br><br> To reactivate your account, visit the <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations> Tax Settings</a> page to update your Tax information. For more information, see the \\"Tax compliance frequently asked questions\\" <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC>help page</a>. ","ahd_error_loading_submit":"An error happened. Please try submitting again.","ahd_eukyc_priority_action":"Identity verification","ahd_inform_ac_checkbox_error":"Click the checkbox to confirm that you have reviewed your information and certify that it is accurate and current.","ahd_inform_ac_edu_display_name":"Review your account information","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p1":"Under the US INFORM Consumers Act, you are required to keep certain business information (shown below) current and to electronically certify to Amazon that either you have updated your information or that the information already provided is still current. Certify that your information below is up to date within 10 days of viewing this notice, or your account will be at risk of deactivation. ","ahd_inform_ac_p1_header":"Get ready to certify your information","ahd_inform_ac_page1_checkbox":"Click the checkbox to confirm you have understand that once you go to the INFORM Act Notice and Certification page, you’ll receive a notice and have 10 days to update and certify your information.","ahd_inform_ac_page1_step1_intructions":"Go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Account Information</a> page or click the Edit button to update any information below that is incorrect. ","ahd_inform_ac_page2_certify_instructions":"If your information below is up to date, you can certify now. If any information is incorrect, go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Account Information</a> page to edit your information before clicking Certify.","ahd_inform_account_information_update_verification":"Your account information has been updated and we are verifying your information. Check back in 24 hours to determine if any additional steps are needed to begin the Annual Certification process.","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_confirmation":"By clicking Certify, I certify that I read the Notice above and that the information I provided to Amazon is true and correct, corresponds to my business and is not misappropriated.","ahd_inform_act_ac_edit_information":"Edit information","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"Email","ahd_inform_act_ac_not_required":"The INFORM Act does not yet apply to your business, so you’re not currently required to certify your information. We’ll notify you in the future if you’re required to certify your information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou":"Thank you for certifying that your business information is current. Your Account Health page will update in a few minutes to confirm you have completed your outstanding INFORM Act Notice and Certification requirement.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou_banner":"Thank you for certifying that your business information is current. Your Account Health page will update in a few minutes to confirm you have completed your outstanding INFORM Act Notice and Certification requirement.\\n<br><br>Please remember that you are required to keep your business information current and to certify at least annually that your name, address, phone number, email address, bank account information and Tax ID number are correct.","ahd_inform_act_ac_tin_field":"Tax Identification Number (TIN):","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions":"Please note that only the primary user or secondary user with authorised approvals to confirm/edit account information will be able to certify the information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions_error":"This information must be certified by the Account’s primary user or a secondary user authorised with approvals to confirm/edit account information.","ahd_inform_act_account_information":"Account information","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_deactivation_banner":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Because we have not received the requested information, your account has been deactivated. To reactivate your account, review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to complete verification. <br><br>Once you have completed verifications for all outstanding requirements, your account will be reactivated within 48 hours. ","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_hold_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation and disbursements for your Amazon selling account have been put on hold.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Because we have not received the requested information within the timelines specified in our communications, your disbursements are now placed on hold. To reactivate your disbursements, review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to start or complete your information submission.","ahd_inform_act_hold_wait_text":"To reactivate your disbursements and prevent your account from being deactivated, click on the action items below to go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> and complete the pending requirements. <br><br>Thank you for completing identity verification. Check back in 24 hours to find out whether any additional verification steps are needed.","ahd_inform_act_hold_widget_description":"To reactivate your disbursements and prevent your account from being deactivated, click on the action items below to go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> and complete the pending requirements. <br><br>After completing the identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_wait_text":"Click on the action items below to complete the pending requirements. Thank you for completing Identity verification. Check in 24 hours to find out whether any additional verification steps are needed.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_widget_description":"Click on the action items below to complete the pending requirements. After completing the Identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_need_help":"Need help? Visit the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act help page</a>.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have completed all open verifications successfully. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete_short":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have completed all open verifications successfully. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_inform_act_wait_text":"Thank you for verifying your identity. Check back in 24 hours for confirmation of whether any additional information is needed. <br><br> Click on the action items below to go to the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Seller Account Information</a> page and complete the pending requirements.","ahd_inform_act_widget_bank_account_field":"Bank account","ahd_inform_act_widget_business_address_field":"Business address","ahd_inform_act_widget_description":"Click on the action items below to go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> page and complete the pending requirements. <br><br> After completing Identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_widget_phone_number_field":"Phone Number","ahd_inform_act_widget_tax_id_field":"Tax ID number","ahd_inform_annual_certification":"Annual Certification","ahd_inform_annual_review_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7?ref_=ahd_annual_ inform_consumer_act\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, your Selling on Amazon account information must be certified on an annual basis. Visit the <a href=\\"/mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render?ref_=ahd_annual_inform_certification\\">Annual Certification</a> page to certify that your information is current.","ahd_inform_annual_review_seller_enforced":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, you must certify the accuracy of your Selling on Amazon account information at least annually. Because we have not received the requested certification, your account has been deactivated. To reactivate your account, visit the <a href=\\" /mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render\\">Annual Certification</a> page to certify that your information is current. <br><br> Once you have completed certification, your account will be reactivated within 48 hours.","ahd_inform_bav_not_verified":"You don\'t have a verified bank account or didn\'t assign the verified bank account as your default deposit method to the US marketplace. Verify and assign your bank account as default on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView> Deposit Methods </a>page.","ahd_inform_company_registration_number":"Company Registration Number: ","ahd_inform_confirmation_p1":"Please remember that you are required to keep your business information current and to certify at least annually that your name, address, phone number, email address, bank account information and tax ID number are correct.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p2":"If any of your information changes, Amazon will need to verify this new information as well. Please respond promptly to any information requests so that we can work with you to complete these additional verification steps and avoid account deactivation. For more information about the verification process, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act help page</a>.","ahd_inform_consumers_act_ac":"INFORM Act Notice and Certification","ahd_inform_consumers_act_annual":"INFORM Consumers Act Annual Certification ","ahd_inform_loading_error":"Go to the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information target=\\"_blank\\">Account information</a> page to review your current information.","ahd_inform_no_default_deposit":"You don\'t have a verified bank account or didn\'t assign the verified bank account as your default deposit method to the US marketplace. Verify and assign your bank account as default on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView> Deposit Methods</a> page.","ahd_inform_page1_checkbox":"I understand that once I proceed to the INFORM Act Notice and Certification, I must complete certification within 10 days to avoid the risk of account deactivation. ","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2b":"However, you do not need to wait to receive the formal notification, and can take action now to avoid the risk of account deactivation later.","ahd_inform_page1_proceed_title":"Proceed to INFORM Act Notice and Certification","ahd_inform_page1_step2_description":"If your information is up to date, or if you have just updated it, proceed to the next step – the notice and certification – to receive your formal notice and complete your certification. Once you’ve viewed this notice, the law will require you to certify your information within 10 days.","ahd_inform_sw_bav":"You must verify your active bank accounts. Verify your bank accounts here on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView> Deposit Methods</a> page.","ahd_inform_update_account_information_educational":"Visit the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Annual Certification</a> page to ensure your Selling on Amazon Account information is up to date.","ahd_itr_priority_action":"Italian tax ID for Italy based sellers required.","ahd_itr_rap_intro":"The <a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a> requires Italy based sellers who complete one or more transactions on Amazon.it to add their Italian codice fiscale in their Tax settings.","ahd_itr_remediation_corp":"Submit your Italian codice fiscale in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. According to our information (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), your account is registered as a company, and therefore we require your business registration number (known as \\"codice fiscale\\", corresponding to VAT ID without \\"IT\\" country code). Please refer to the Help page (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a>) for submission steps. You must ensure your legal name on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) and your business registration number in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Tax Authority database.","ahd_itr_remediation_individual":"Submit your Italian codice fiscale in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. According to our information (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), your account is registered as an individual, and therefore we require your Citizen ID (known as \\"codice fiscale\\"). Refer to the Help pages (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a>) for submission steps. You must ensure your legal name on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) and Citizen_ID number in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Tax Authority database.","ahd_itr_remediation_unkown":"Submit your information on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render). Companies must provide their business registration number (known as \\"codice fiscale\\", corresponding to VAT ID without \\"IT\\" country code), while Individual sellers, including sole proprietors (\\"P. IVA individuale\\") must upload their personal Citizen ID (also known as “codice fiscale”) in Tax Settings<https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. You must ensure your legal name on the Business Information Page <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render> and the codice fiscale in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Authority database.","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_details_fallback_text":"Have questions about maintaining a healthy account? Get personalised guidance from Seller Assistant.","ahd_more_information_hd":"More information","ahd_new_feature_announcement_body_new_filters":"You can now filter policy violations by action taken on affected listings. Go to the Product policy compliance page and click “Add filters” to filter violations.","ahd_other_policy_violation_title":"Other Policy Violations","ahd_payment_policy_hd_priority_action":"Your funds are on hold due to pending actions on your account. Review the <b>Priority actions</b> to reactivate your disbursements.","ahd_pp_mas_r_policies_code_of_conduct":"Selling Policies and Seller Code of Conduct","ahd_pr_form_address_header":"Address Non-Compliant Product Penalties to continue selling your products.","ahd_pr_form_address_sub_header":"As per the guidance from DOJ, Amazon simplifies your regulatory compliance obligations by reporting and paying  on behalf of your orders on Amazon and then recovering these amounts from your account.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_info":"In accordance with the EPA/DOJ Consent Decree, we are required to penalise Sellers for any violations on policies pertaining to EPA. Please find more information on <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account/health/product-policies\\">non-compliant products</a>, Calculate associated penalties, Reserves applied on your account and Communications sent to submit appeals. You will then be charged for any outstanding penalties.<br/><br/> Before we charge you for the penalties, we will place a hold on your account while giving you a chance to remediate your listing.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_title":"How Does This Work?","ahd_pr_form_impact_header":"Possible account impact are as detailed below:","ahd_pr_form_impact_p1":"Liability to pay penalties (refer violation details below","ahd_pr_form_impact_p3":"Negative impact on your account health which may lead to deactivation of your seller account","ahd_pr_form_note":"Please note: Before we charge you for the penalties, we will place a hold on your account for 30 days while give you a chance to remediate your listing.","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_body":"This product has been identified as a pesticide product, pesticide device or a product that contains pesticide claims. To be considered for reinstatement, please provide evidence of an EPA Registration number and/or EPA Establishment number or a certification that the product is exempt from EPA regulations. You will need to provide this information in the Pesticide Marking attribute for the listing. <a href=/help/hub/reference/GLX9EJX844SNJX7J> Instructions for completing this attribute are available on Seller Central.</a>","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_title":"Related Policy Information","ahd_pr_form_title":"Non-Compliant Product Details","ahd_priority_actions_cr":"Cancellation Rate (CR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_lsr":"Late Shipment Rate (LSR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_odr":"Order Defect Rate (ODR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_otdr":"On-time delivery rate (OTDR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_title":"Priority actions","ahd_pspp_priority_actions":"Complete pending Know Your Customer (KYC) review – Payment Service Provider","ahd_pspp_rap_intro":"Your bank account is not eligible for receiving disbursement. Work with your Payment Service Provider to complete pending Know Your Customer (KYC) review.","ahd_pspp_rap_next_steps":"Visit the <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GY8JTVAWBPQT2XFC?ref_=to_psp_faq_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Payment Service Provider FAQ</a> and <a href=\'/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView?ref_=to_deposit_method_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Deposit Methods</a> page for more information. ","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory":"Countries Impacted by Inventory Restrictions","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory_details":"Address the outstanding requirements to avoid disruption to your Fulfilled by Amazon Inventory and your import or export capabilities in the listed country.","ahd_rap_at_risk_regional_details":"The listed requirements are impacting your account health in multiple stores. Address the outstanding requirements to avoid account deactivation in all impacted stores.","ahd_rap_begin_verification":"Begin Verification ","ahd_rap_czech_republic":"Czechia","ahd_rap_enforced_inventory_details":"Address the outstanding requirements to remove the restrictions on your Fulfilled by Amazon Inventory and  import or export capabilities in the listed country.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p1":"The verification of your identity is required by law for the use of a selling on Amazon account. As required by Canadian and Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You may need to provide us with certain information and documents in order to facilitate these checks.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p3":"You can provide the required verification information at any time after you’ve registered. You will have limited access to your account until the information has been provided and verified.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p4":"If you would like to proceed and sell on Amazon.ca or Amazon.com.br, select the checkbox next to the store you would like to proceed with verification below. Once you have selected to proceed with verification, visit the Identity Information page to determine next steps.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p5":"If you want to proceed with verification for a single store first, only select that store from the list below. Once you have completed verification for that store, you will be notified to complete the required steps to begin verification for the other store.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_thankyou_p2":"We are validating your information and may need to request details from you during this review. This validation can take up to 24 hours and might take up to 10 working days in some cases. During this time, your identity information cannot be edited.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_check_verification_status":"Check your verification status and required next steps on the Account information page.","ahd_rap_past_due_inventory":"PAST DUE – Inventory capabilities restricted","ahd_rap_voluntary_submission_action":"Based on the information available to us you are not required to hold a ${countryName} VAT number, to comply with this requirement, you can either remove it from <a href=\'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Tax settings</a> or proceed with resolving the issue above.","ahd_regulatory_compliance":"Regulatory Compliance","ahd_related_accounts_policy_reason":"Seller code of conduct (Multiple Selling Accounts on Amazon)","ahd_sa_account_health_guidance_description":"Have questions about account health? Get personalised guidance from Seller Assistant.","ahd_sa_chat_about_account_health_text":"How\'s my Account Health?","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_label":"Summarise Product Compliance","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_text":"Can you summarise my product compliance violations?","ahd_save_changes_button":"Save changes","ahd_status_past_due":"Past Due","ahd_uaebizlicense_priority_action":"Upload your trade licence","ahd_vas_extension_extension_request_link":"submit the required documentation.","ahd_vas_priority_action":"European VAT Registration Requirements","ahd_vas_rap_deactivated_message":"The listed requirements are impacting your account health in multiple stores. Address the outstanding requirements for the listed country to reactivate your account in all impacted stores.","ahd_vas_rap_intro":"The <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GTQ23HPXBQK563WS\' target=\'_blank\'>European VAT registration requirements</a>  is a European Amazon Stores policy that requires all Selling Partners active in European stores to submit a valid VAT registration number whenever they have a requirement.  Review the Account Health Impact section to complete your outstanding requirements.","ahd_vas_rap_secondary_action":"If you do not have a VAT Registration Number for the listed country, visit the <a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>Business Information</a> portal and <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Tax Settings</a> portal to submit the required information (VAT number, name, address) for the following countries:","ahd_vas_rap_third_action":"If you have opted into Union One-Stop Shop (OSS) in your home country, please visit the <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Tax Settings</a> Page and select your home country from the Union One-Stop Shop (OSS) VAT Declaration menu. Ensure your Union One-Stop Shop (OSS) is enabled and that the name and address provided to Amazon match the ones provided to Authorities.","ahd_vas_rap_verifying":"We are reviewing your VAT Registration Numbers details. This can take up to 14 days. We will contact you if additional information are required.","ahd_view_all_pa":"View all priority actions (${totalCount})","ahd_violation_appeal_button":"Proceed with appeal","ahd_violation_details":"Violation details","ahd_violation_display_name":"Restricted product policy violation","ahd_violation_status_assessment_phase":"Penalties in Assessment Phase - Disbursements may be impacted.","ahd_w8_priority_action":"Updated US tax identity information required","ahd_w8_rap_action":"You are now required to complete your self-service tax interview before the due date. Your submission can take up to 24 hours to process.","ahd_w8_rap_deactivated_action":"Submit the required information to reactivate your account. Your submission can take up to 24 hours to process.","ahd_w8_rap_intro":"A new W-8 tax form is required. Once your form expires, your selling account will be temporarily deactivated until you provide updated tax information.\\n\\n<br><br>These requirements impact your account health in multiple stores.  Address the listed requirements to avoid account deactivation in all affected stores.\\n\\n<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G200663290?ref_=to_w8_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>US Income Reporting and Tax Identity Collection FAQ.</a>","ai_inform_page1_step1":"1. Go to your Account information page [link to Account information page here] to review your account information (and update, if necessary).","alert_variant_explanation_text":"As Katal components are extensions of HTML elements, JavaScript can interact with them the same as built-in HTML elements. Here, we see JavaScript changing the “variant” attribute on the alert.","components_containing_html_text":"Some components can contain HTML content, such as our KatalTabs component. These complex components provide an API, so developers and frameworks can interact with them.","custom_elements_text":"Katal gives developers the ability to use custom-designed elements to build their web pages. For example, if the developer needs a button, they can use <kat-button></kat-button> instead of building a button themselves.","demo_complex_header_text":"Demonstration: complex Katal components","demo_components_header_text":"Demonstration: using Katal components","demo_javascript_header_text":"Demonstration: JavaScript with Katal components","design_approved_text":"Katal offers design-approved components for use in web pages that can be configured with labels and custom settings. For example: regular buttons and secondary buttons, only different in their “variant” attribute.","discovery_ahd_ni_warn_pdp":"Product Detail Page","documentation_label":"Katal documentation","fba_inventory_uc_identifier":"Our records indicate that you are holding inventory in ${COUNTRY} through the Fulfilled by Amazon (FBA) program. As a seller using FBA services, you are required to provide a valid VAT registration number for each country where your inventory is stored. You can verify the countries where you have enabled FBA <a href=/fba/settings/ target=\\"_blank\\">here</a>.\\nPlease keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","greeting_description":"This is a sample Katal application, demonstrating how to use Katal components, as well as build-and-deploy tooling. Please contact the Katal team at colombia-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments. To continue this demo, please dismiss this alert.","greeting_description_mons_app":"This is a sample Katal application, demonstrating how to use Katal components with translations. Please contact the Katal team at katal-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments.","greeting_header":"Sample app information","information-requests":"Information requests","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Send feedback","mobile_ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"Please sign in to Seller Central from a web browser.","mobile_ahd_banner_eg_trn":"Update your tax registration number on the Tax Settings page in your Seller Central account.","poe_domestic_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicates that your sales in ${COUNTRY} exceed the domestic threshold for VAT registration.","ppc_fhdds_action_taken":"Risk of UK inbound restriction","ppc_fhdds_action_taken_past_due":"UK inbound capabilities are currently restricted","ppc_fhdds_reason":"FHDDS: Shipment Missing Import Entry Number (IEN)","primary_button_label":"Primary button","product-policy-compliance":"Product policy compliance","sample_app_page_title_text":"Sample application","sc_homepage_education_phase_description":"Address your account health to avoid the risk of future account deactivation.","sc_inform_act_view_account_health_banner":"Go to Account Health","sc_navbar_ah_cs_desc":"View your customer service performance metrics, including your order defect and invoice defect rates.","sc_navbar_ah_desc":"View your Account Health Rating, issues affecting your account health and violations that may result in content removal or account deactivation.","sc_navbar_ah_eligibilities_desc":"View benefits and programmes you may be eligible for.","sc_navbar_ah_myc_desc":"Ensure all your products comply with all applicable, laws, regulations and Amazon policies.","sc_navbar_ah_sp_desc":"View your shipping performance metrics, including Late Shipment Rate, Pre-fulfilment Cancellation Rate, Valid Tracking Rate and On-Time Delivery Rate.  ","schp_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_subtitle":"Go to your Account Health page and complete your priority actions to begin selling on Amazon.","schp_complete_priority_actions":"Complete your priority actions","secondary_button_label":"Secondary button","ship_from_non_poe_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are dispatching from ${COUNTRY}, which is different than your home country; therefore, you are required to provide a valid VAT Information Exchange System (VIES) VAT number or applicable VAT number for EU transactions. You can verify your dispatching address from the Shipping Settings page or from this <a href=/sbr target=\\"_blank\\">link</a>.\\nPlease keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","ship_from_poe_uc_identifier":"Our records indicate that your cross-border sales exceed €10,000 across EU countries. As a seller engaged in cross-border sales, you are required to provide either UOSS-enabled VAT number from you establishment country or valid VAT numbers for all countries you ship to.","ship_to_non_eu_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you have shipments exceeding €150 from outside EU into ${COUNTRY}. Therefore, you are required to provide a valid ${COUNTRY} VAT number or a declaration confirming that you are not the Importer Of Record for the shipment(s) above threshold.","ship_to_uoss_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are conducting cross-border sales into ${COUNTRY} from other EU country and, therefore, you are required to provide an UOSS-enabled VAT number from your establishment country or valid ${COUNTRY} VAT number.\\nPlease keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","sp-permanent-call-me-now-title":"Need Help?","sp_health_cancellation_rate_caption":"Cancellation Rate","sp_health_customer_satisfaction_information_label":"Order Defect Rate consists of three different metrics:","sp_health_dashboard_guardian_title_new":"Account Health Assurance","sp_health_dashboard_subheader":"To sell on Amazon, you must adhere to the below performance targets and policies.","sp_health_dashboard_title":"Account Health","sp_health_download_report_caption":"Download Report","sp_health_gl_watch":"Watch","sp_health_intellectual_property_customer_complaints":"Received Intellectual Property complaints","sp_health_late_shipment_rate_caption":"Late Shipment Rate","sp_health_listing_policy_customer_complaints":"Listing Policy Violations","sp_health_mobile_by_ahr_impact_tab_title":"By Account Health Rating Impact","sp_health_nav_myc":"Manage Your Compliance","sp_health_nav_orders_with_defects":"Orders with Defects","sp_health_not_available":"N/A","sp_health_order_defect_rate_caption":"Order Defect Rate","sp_health_pre_fulfillment_cancel_rate":"Pre-fulfilment Cancel Rate","sp_health_product_policies":"Product Policy Violations","sp_health_product_quality_popover":"This total will include complaints which you may have already addressed through a Plan of Action.","sp_health_product_safety_customer_complaints":"Food and Product Safety Issues","sp_health_restricted_products_violations_policy":"Restricted product policy violations","sp_health_risk_banner_vtr":"Your seller-fulfilled offers are at risk of deactivation. Your Valid Tracking Rate is ${hash-get metricValue}; the target is ${hash-get target}.","sp_health_seller_fulfilled_metrics_caption":"Seller Fulfilled","sp_health_shipping_bucket_caption":"Shipping Performance","sp_health_shipping_eligibilities":"View shipping eligibilities here","sp_health_time_window":"Time Window: ${hash-get numDays} days","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_caption":"Valid Tracking Rate","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_subtitle":"Target: over 95%","sp_health_violation_details_stale_page_button_label":"Back to Account Health","sp_mfn_at_risk_warning":"Your seller-fulfilled offers are at risk of deactivation","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_defects":"You do not currently have any defects for this order.","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_order":"This order doesn’t exist.","sp_st_date_range":"${hash-get startDate} - ${hash-get endDate}","sp_st_heading_order_asin":"Product","sp_st_heading_order_edd":"Expected Delivery Date","sp_st_heading_order_esd":"Expected Dispatch Date","sp_st_str_with_description":"${hash-get description}: ${hash-get str}","sp_st_zero_out_metrics_message":"Orders received prior to June 1 are not used to evaluate your account health and do not display here.","sp_vtr_list_ca":"1. Heavy and bulky items delivered by a carrier not integrated with Amazon. Learn more on integrated carriers.</br></br>2. Small and light items that have an order value less than CAD $30 (including delivery charges) and are delivered in Canada Post Standard Mail envelopes or First Class Mail envelopes.</br></br>3. International shipments dispatched from China that have an order value less than CAD $6 (including delivery charges)</br></br>4. International shipments dispatched from outside of the US and China.</br></br>5. Digital orders that cannot be physically delivered by a carrier, e.g. audio books","sp_zero_tolerance_banner_body":"Due to one or more critical violations, your account is pending deactivation. To prevent deactivation, please address these violations now. For more information, go to the <a href=/gp/help/G200205250>Account Health Rating program policy</a>.","tab_demo_generated_text":"Auto-generated tab {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Selected tab","ts-form-header":"Report abuse","valid_vat_number_uc_identifier":"Please keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","voluntary_vrn_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are not required to hold a VAT number in ${COUNTRY} but you have provided one on Seller Central that is currently not valid. To resolve this discrepancy, you can either remove the ${COUNTRY} VAT Number or provide a valid one. By removing your ${COUNTRY} VAT Number from Seller Central you are confirming that you are not required to hold one in ${COUNTRY}. We recommend consulting with a tax adviser to determine whether your overall business activities, both on and off Amazon, require VAT registration."}},"en-CA":{"pages.floatingWidget":{"DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_content":"You’re part of an experiment to improve seller experience: starting now, strong performance on Buyer Contact Rate, Contact Response Time, and Buyer Dissatisfaction Rate can boost your AHR (Account Health Rating) score! This change helps AHR reward excellent customer service. Check your customer service performance on Feedback Manager now.","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_cta_done":"Feedback Manager","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_header":"Earn AHR points for strong customer service","DYK_JP_LINE_content":"Amazon LINE Official Account sends selected notifications about the notifications we sent via email and Seller Central requiring actions by Sellers regarding topics such as your account’s status, listing status and payment disbursement errors. Connect your Seller Central account to the LINE official account to receive notifications via LINE and avoid missing important notifications. Learn More","DYK_JP_LINE_header":"You can connect with LINE account to receive personalized important messages that matters to your account health.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_content":"Great news! You’re within 60 days of qualifying for Account Health Assurance (AHA). Maintain your Account Health Rating above 250 and keep a verified emergency contact number on file to secure enhanced account protection. We’ll notify you via email once you’re automatically enrolled.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_header":"Nearing Account Health Assurance enrolment","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_content":"Your Account Health Rating has moved into At risk or Unhealthy status. Click “Call me now” to speak with an Account Health Specialist and protect your selling privileges.","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_cta_done":"Call me now","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_header":"Your Account Health Rating needs attention","DYK_SSAT_CFT_DietarySupp_content":"Protect your Dietary Supplement listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_Toys_content":"Protect your Toys category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_artscrafts_content":"Protect your Arts and Crafts Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_buttoncellbatteryproducts_content":"Protect your Button Cell Battery Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_childrensproducts_content":"Protect your Children\'s Products Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_cta_done":"Sign Up Today","DYK_SSAT_CFT_electronics_content":"Protect your Electronics Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_emobilityproducts_content":"Protect your E-Mobility Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_firesafety_content":"Protect your Fire Safety category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_furniture_content":"Protect your Furniture Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_header":"Simplify Compliance: Enrol in Compliance Fast-track Today","DYK_SSAT_CFT_infantbabyproducts_content":"Protect your Infant and Baby Products Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_ppe_content":"Protect your Personal Protection Equipment category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_EDU_JULY":"Keys to the Account Health Rating","DYK_SSAT_EDU_content":"AHR monitors your account\'s deactivation risk through a point system. You gain points for successfully fulfilling orders. You lose points when policy violations are detected and recover points when you successfully address those violations. Review your Account Health dashboard often and address policy violations as they arise.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_content":"We’re excited to announce Seller Challenge, a new feature for Account Health Assurance sellers. Seller Challenge provides a limited number of opportunities to request a separate review of listing issues through your Account Health page. Once you submit a challenge, we strive to respond with a decision in 48 hours.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_cta_done":"Learn more","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop_header":"Healthy AHR tip","ahd_dyk_bhdr_content":"We recommend delivering more than 90% of your Amazon Business commercial shipments during business hours to maintain a good customer experience","ahd_dyk_bhdr_cta":"View performance","ahd_dyk_bhdr_header":"Your business hour delivery rate is low.","ahd_dyk_br_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Your Amazon.com.br (Brazil) store is at-risk of deactivation.","ahd_dyk_de_sup_label":"To comply with the EPR: Germany Single Use Plastic policy (effective since January 1, 2025), take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for each brand and product type combination. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GA4JYZX23CLK8WFW\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_de_sup_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): Germany Single Use Plastic","ahd_dyk_de_sup_weee_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): Germany WEEE","ahd_dyk_description_eukyc":"In accordance with EU regulations, you must complete an account verification process. Go to the Identity Information page to complete verification. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G201200780 \\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_label":"To comply with the EPR: take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for each brand and product type combination. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GYDCAK9ZR6VJH2X3\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR)","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_label":"To comply with the EPR: EU Batteries policy (effective from August 18, 2025), take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for your product categories. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GPVDATLHQ6PRQNSW\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): EU Batteries","ahd_dyk_fhdds_cta":"Review Shipments","ahd_dyk_fhdds_description":"Provide the import details for all your applicable shipments in your Shipping Queue before they disrupt your business. Missing import details could restrict your ability to create new UK shipments.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.com.br/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.com.br</a> store.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.ca/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.ca</a> store.","ahd_dyk_title_eukyc":"Complete your EU Know Your Customer (KYC) verification","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description":"To comply with the GPSR, which goes into effect on December 13, 2024, please provide additional compliance information for your products to avoid impact to your listings. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_task":"You have listings impacted by the General Product Safety Regulation (GPSR).","ahd_floating_widget_aha_ec_description":"As a member of the AHA program, you are <b>required</b> to maintain a valid emergency contact number. Verify your emergency contact details to retain AHA eligibility, so our specialists can reach out to help you address critical account health-related issues before they disrupt your business.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_action_panel_title":"Emergency contact information update","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_food_and_safety_heading":"You have repeat violations for Food and Product Safety Issues","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_ip_heading":"You have repeat violations for received intellectual property complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_listing_heading":"You have repeat violations for Listing Policy Violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_other_heading":"You have repeat violations for Other Policy Violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_auth_heading":"You have repeat violations for Product Authenticity Customer Complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_cond_heading":"You have repeat violations for Product Condition Customer Complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_reviews_heading":"You have repeat violations for Customer Product Reviews Policy Violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_reg_comp_heading":"You have repeat violations for Regulatory Compliance","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_rp_heading":"You have repeat violations for Restricted Product Policy","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_sip_heading":"You have repeat violations for Suspected Intellectual Property Violations","ahd_floating_widget_resolve_now_button_text":"Resolve Now","cs_nerd_suggestion_top_issues_action_vi":"View Issues","dyk_ahd_pra_rv":"You have repeat violations for Customer Product Reviews Policy Violations"},"pages.homepage":{"AHD_DD14_Base_Reserve":"Sales proceeds are held for 14 days after the delivery date and become available for disbursement starting on the 15th day after the delivery date. If the actual delivery date is not available, we use the latest estimated delivery date for the order. This is your default payment policy.","AHD_POA_APPEAL_ERROR_LOADING":"An error happened. Please refresh the page.","DR_VAT_AHD_NC_BANNER":"We’ve not been able to verify your business establishment for VAT purposes. To ensure accurate tax treatment, verify your establishment for VAT purposes.","DR_VAT_AHD_PRIORITY_ACTION":"Establishment verification required for VAT purposes","Engage_Appeal_05":"Seller code of conduct (favourably influencing customers to manipulate your sales ratings, feedback or reviews)","LocalizedPageTitleDashboard":"Performance Dashboard","LocalizedPageTitleDetailCustomerSatisfaction":"Customer satisfaction details page.","LocalizedPageTitleDetailProductPolicies":"Product Policies details page.","NO_METRICS":"You currently don’t have any orders counting toward this metric.\\n","RR_AHR_Warn_1":"Multiple selling accounts on Amazon","acf_banner_inform_act":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to start verification.","acf_inform_act_wait_text":"Thank you for verifying identity. Check back in 24 hours for confirmation of whether any additional information is needed. ","acf_inform_act_widget_description":"After completing identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","addTab_label":"Add tab","aef_address_your_violation":"Address your violation","ags_pcx_voc_summary_voice_of_the_customer":"Voice of the Customer","ahd_Inform_deposit_method":"Deposit method information","ahd_account_impacted_details":"Your account may be impacted as detailed below:","ahd_account_regulatory_compliance":"Account regulatory compliance","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller account information</a> to start verification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_aha":"<b> Please note, if you have not completed all verification items when the INFORM Consumers Act takes effect, your account may be deactivated, regardless of your enrolment in Account Health Assurance.</b>","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_thankyou":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have completed all open verifications successfully. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_v2":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>US INFORM Consumers Act</a>, which goes into effect on June 27, 2023, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Visit the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Account information</a> page to start verification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_school_supplies":"We’ve identified you have listing(s) at risk of removal due to non-compliance to local, state and federal regulations regarding the sale of school supply products for children. To learn more about these compliance requirements, click <a href=/gp/help/external/help.html?itemID=XT3EFQS54LRKYM3&language=en_US&ref=ahd_uspc_adhoc_banner>here</a>. To prevent listing removal, please view your listings in scope of this compliance requirement <a href=/performance/account/health/product-policies?t=safe>here</a>, and follow the guidance listed under “Next Steps” next to the listing(s) at risk of removal to ensure compliance with these requirements.","ahd_adhoc_mobile_inform_act_aha":"Note: If you do not complete all verification steps within the specified timelines, your account may be deactivated, regardless of your enrolment in Account Health Assurance.","ahd_aef_IPI_priority_action":"Virtual Identity Verification","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_join_call_link":"Visit <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">Identity Verification Portal</a> to join your scheduled video call.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_next_steps":"Visit the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">Identity Verification Portal</a>, to submit required documents and join a video call for virtual identity verification. You also have option to schedule a video call on a future date and time after submitting required documents.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason":"A review of your business has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity; this can, in accordance with Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>, lead to account deactivation. To protect our customers and selling partners, we need to verify the identity of our sellers through a virtual identity verification process that takes place on a video call. ","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason_eu":"A review of your business has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity; this can, in accordance with Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G201190440\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>, lead to account deactivation. To protect our customers and selling partners, we need to verify the identity of our sellers through a virtual identity verification process that takes place on a video call.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_review_fail":"A review of your business and the information you provided during your virtual identity verification, has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity, which is in violation of Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_under_review":"We are reviewing the information you provided for identity verification. The review process may take up to 5 business days.","ahd_aef_action_panel_RA_reason":"Our review indicates that you have a separate account that was deactivated for violating one of our policies. As a result, the current selling account is in violation of our ‘Multiple Selling Accounts on Amazon’ policy outlined in the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G1801\\">Seller Code of Conduct</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_post_deactivation_appeal":"If you believe your account has been deactivated in error, you can submit new information by clicking \'Appeal\' button below.","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_food_and_prod_subreason":"Food and product safety issues","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_listing_subreason":"Listing policy violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_other_subreason":"Other policy violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_auth_subreason":"Product authenticity customer complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_cond_subreason":"Product condition customer complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_review_subreason":"Customer product reviews policy violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reason":"Repeat violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reg_comp_subreason":"Regulatory compliance","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rip_subreason":"Received intellectual property complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rp_subreason":"Restricted product policy","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_sip_subreason":"Suspected intellectual property violations","ahd_aef_at_risk_HD_card_body":"To reactivate your disbursements, review your Priority Actions and address the outstanding action items.","ahd_aef_at_risk_card_sc_body":"You have one or more outstanding action items that will result in account deactivation.","ahd_aef_critical_message":"This critical issue if left unresolved will cause your account to be deactivated.","ahd_aef_critical_message_no_caps":"This critical issue if left unresolved will cause your account to be deactivated.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_body":"Address your account health issues to reactivate your account. Once the issues have been resolved, your account will be reactivated within 24 hours.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_sc_body":"Address your account health issues to reactivate your account.","ahd_aef_denver_eu":"Verify EU establishment for Value Added Tax (VAT)","ahd_aef_denver_info":"Information required","ahd_aef_denver_uk":"Verify UK establishment for Value Added Tax (VAT)","ahd_aef_educational_card_action":"Resolve Issues","ahd_aef_impact_header":"Account health impact","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_post_deactivation":"Click the ‘Appeal\' button below and follow the instructions provided in order to reactivate this selling account.","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_pre_deactivation":"Click the \'Appeal\' button below and follow the instructions provided in order to avoid deactivation of this selling account.","ahd_aef_next_steps_header":"Address Your Violation","ahd_aef_pending_critical":"Pending critical","ahd_aef_submit_header":"Submit your information","ahd_ahr_pending_critical":"Pending critical","ahd_all_issues":"All issues","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_body":"Your account will be considered for reactivation when your violations have been successfully appealed. ","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_header":",Your account has been deactivated. ","ahd_banner_block_mfn_at_risk_subtitle":"Your seller-fulfilled offers have been deactivated and your account is at-risk of deactivation. Complete your Priority Actions to reactivate your seller-fulfilled offers and prevent deactivation.","ahd_banner_block_mfn_subtitle":"Your seller-fulfilled offers have been deactivated. Complete your Priority Actions to reactivate your seller-fulfilled offers.","ahd_banner_eg_trn":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br>Your account is at risk of deactivation because your Seller Central account does not include your valid Tax Registration Number. Visit the <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations> Tax Settings</a> page to update your Tax information within 90 days from the date of your first product listing on Amazon to avoid account deactivation. For more information, see the “Tax compliance frequently asked questions” <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC> help page. </a>","ahd_banner_resolve_issues_button":"Resolve issues","ahd_be_jsl_at_risk_banner":"<b> Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br> You have not provided your Belgian VAT registration number (VRN) or confirmation of Union One-Stop Shop (OSS) status for your home country in your Amazon Seller Central account. Refer to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/external/GGTX8THLMMDJ3WBP>new Belgian legislation</a> to know more about the requirement and provide information.","ahd_be_jsl_priority_action":"Belgium VAT legislation","ahd_brkyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Check your verification status on the <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional\\n?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity Information </a> page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"As per Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service and you are required to provide us with certain information or documents in order to facilitate these checks. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications.\\r\\n<br><br>Your account has been deactivated because we were not able to validate your identity information.<br><br> \\r\\nFor more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon </a> help page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_identity_info":"Visit the <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity Information</a>  page to complete verification.","ahd_brkyc_rap_intro":"As per Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You are required to provide us with certain information or documents in order to facilitate these checks. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications.\\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nFor more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon </a> help page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_verifying":"We are validating your information and may need to request details from you during this review. Please check the <a href=\'/performance/notifications\\r\\n?ref_=to_brkyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a> sections and respond to any requests relating to your Selling on Amazon account. This validation can take up to 24 hours and might take up to 10 working days in some cases. During this time, your Identity Information cannot be edited.","ahd_cakyc_rap_action_hd":"Provide your identity verification information by the due date shown to avoid account deactivation. If you do not start verification and have 15 days or less remaining, your ability to disburse funds from your Amazon.ca selling account will be restricted. Verification is required under Canadian law.","ahd_cakyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Check your verification status on the <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> Identity Information page</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"Your account has been deactivated because we were not able to validate your identity information.  Canadian laws require us to verify your identity so that we can allow you to use our service. To reactivate your account, submit information needed to verify your identity. \\r\\n<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page","ahd_cakyc_rap_identity_info":"Visit the <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> Identity Information page</a> to complete verification. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_intro":"Canadian law requires us to verify your identity to allow you to use our service. We need you to provide us with certain information and documents so that we can conduct these verification checks. <br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page or refer to your <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_self_trigger_cta":"By clicking \'Begin Verification\', you are proceeding with the Canada verification requirements. Visit the<a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> Identity Information page</a> to confirm next steps. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_verifying":"We are validating your information. This validation can take between 24 hours and 10 working days, in some cases. We may need to request details from you during this review. Please check the <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a> section and respond to any additional requests relating to your Selling on Amazon account.  \\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nDuring this time, your Identity Information cannot be edited.","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph":"The verification of your identity is required by law for the use of a selling on Amazon account. As per Canadian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You may need to provide us with certain information and documents in order to facilitate these checks.<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph2":"Amazon allows up to 60 days for you to complete re-verification. The does not include the time we take to complete the review. Your ability to sell and disburse funds may be restricted if re-verification is not completed within 60 days. When we require information, a notification will appear on your Account Information page. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications. ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph3":"You will eventually be unable to use your selling on Amazon account. Therefore, you will not be able to sell on Amazon.ca if the information is not provided. ","ahd_collusion_policy":"Selling Policies and Seller Code of Conduct","ahd_compliance_status":"Compliance status","ahd_compliance_widget_ckp_redirect":"Launch compliance reference","ahd_critical_account_health_notification":"Critical Account Health notification","ahd_critical_policy_violations":"Critical policy violations","ahd_dac7_at_risk_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation.</b><br><br> Your account is at risk of being deactivated because of missing tax information required under <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB\\">DAC7 legislation</a>. Visit the <a href= \\"/complianceportal\\">DAC7 Compliance Portal</a> to start verification. ","ahd_dac7_compliant":"You are DAC7 compliant now!","ahd_dac7_priority_action":"DAC7 information required","ahd_dac7_priority_action_pending":"Pending verification","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_launch_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Launch the DAC7 portal to submit your information</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal_status":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_status_blurb\'  target=\'_blank\'>Check your verification status on the DAC7 portal</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_intro":"The <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/external/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB?ref_=to_dac_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Directive on Administrative Cooperation – 7th Amendment (DAC7)</a> is an EU regulation that requires Amazon to collect, verify and report due diligence, VAT/tax and financial data of EU-resident sellers irrespective of the Amazon store they sell in.","ahd_dac7_rap_verify_now_button":"Verify now","ahd_dac7_rap_verifying":"We are reviewing your DAC7 information. The review process usually takes 72 hours, but might take longer in some instances. Please check the status of your verification regularly in the DAC7 Portal below to know if we require more information.","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_description":"Go to the <a href=\'/hz/sc/account-information\' target=\'_blank\'>Account information</a> page to complete verification. ","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Your Amazon.ca (Canada) store is at risk of deactivation.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the Amazon.com.br store.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the Amazon.ca store.","ahd_eg_trn_deactivation_banner":"<b>Your account has been deactivated.</b><br><br> To reactivate your account, visit the <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations>Tax settings</a> page to update your tax information. For more information, see the “Tax compliance frequently asked questions” <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC>help page</a>. ","ahd_error_loading_submit":"An error happened. Please try submitting again.","ahd_eukyc_priority_action":"Identity verification","ahd_inform_ac_checkbox_error":"Click the checkbox to confirm that you have reviewed your information and certify that it is accurate and current.","ahd_inform_ac_edu_display_name":"Review your account information","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p1":"Under the US INFORM Consumers Act, you are required to keep certain business information (shown below) current and to electronically certify to Amazon that either you have updated your information or that the information already provided is still current. Certify that your information below is up to date within 10 days of viewing this notice, or your account will be at risk of deactivation. ","ahd_inform_ac_p1_header":"Get ready to certify your information","ahd_inform_ac_page1_checkbox":"Click the checkbox to confirm you have understand that once you go to the INFORM Act notice and certification page, you’ll receive a notice and have 10 days to update and certify your information.","ahd_inform_ac_page1_step1_intructions":"Go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Account information</a> page or click the Edit button to update any information below that is incorrect. ","ahd_inform_ac_page2_certify_instructions":"If your information below is up to date, you can certify now. If any information is incorrect, go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Account information</a> page to edit your information before clicking Certify.","ahd_inform_account_information_update_verification":"Your account information has been updated and we are verifying your information. Check back in 24 hours to determine if any additional steps are needed to begin the annual certification process.","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_confirmation":"By clicking “Certify,” I certify that I read the notice above and that the information I provided to Amazon is true and correct, corresponds to my business and is not misappropriated.","ahd_inform_act_ac_edit_information":"Edit information","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"Email","ahd_inform_act_ac_not_required":"The INFORM Act does not yet apply to your business so you’re not currently required to certify your information. We’ll notify you in the future if you’re required to certify your information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou":"Thank you for certifying that your business information is current. Your Account Health page will update in a few minutes to confirm you have completed your outstanding INFORM Act Notice and Certification requirement.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou_banner":"Thank you for certifying that your business information is current. Your Account Health page will update in a few minutes to confirm you have completed your outstanding INFORM Act Notice and Certification requirement.\\n<br><br>Please remember that you are required to keep your business information current and to certify at least annually that your name, address, phone number, email address, bank account information and Tax ID number are correct.","ahd_inform_act_ac_tin_field":"Tax Identification Number (TIN):","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions":"Please note that only the primary user or secondary user with authorized approvals to Confirm/Edit Account Information will be able to certify the information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions_error":"This information must be certified by the account’s primary user or a secondary user authorized with permissions to confirm/edit account information.","ahd_inform_act_account_information":"Account information","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_deactivation_banner":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Because we have not received the requested information, your account has been deactivated. To reactivate your account, review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to complete verification. <br><br>Once you have completed verifications for all outstanding requirements, your account will be reactivated within 48 hours. ","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_hold_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation and disbursements for your Amazon selling account have been put on hold.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Because we have not received the requested information within the timelines specified in our communications, your disbursements are now placed on hold. To reactivate your disbursements, review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller account information</a> to start or complete your information submission.","ahd_inform_act_hold_wait_text":"To reactivate your disbursements and prevent your account from being deactivated, click on the action items below to go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> and complete the pending requirements. <br><br>Thank you for completing identity verification. Check back in 24 hours to find out whether any additional verification steps are needed.","ahd_inform_act_hold_widget_description":"To reactivate your disbursements and prevent your account from being deactivated, click on the action items below to go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> and complete the pending requirements. <br><br>After completing the Identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_wait_text":"Click on the action items below to complete the pending requirements. Thank you for completing Identity verification. Check in 24 hours to find out whether any additional verification steps are needed.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_widget_description":"Click on the action items below to complete the pending requirements. After completing the Identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_need_help":"Need help? Visit the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act help page</a>.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have completed all open verifications successfully. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete_short":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have completed all open verifications successfully. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_inform_act_wait_text":"Thank you for verifying identity. Check back in 24 hours for confirmation of whether any additional information is needed. <br><br> Click on the action items below to go to the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Seller account information</a> page and complete the pending requirements.","ahd_inform_act_widget_bank_account_field":"Bank Account","ahd_inform_act_widget_business_address_field":"Business address","ahd_inform_act_widget_description":"Click on the action items below to go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller account information</a> page and complete the pending requirements. <br><br> After completing Identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_widget_phone_number_field":"Phone number","ahd_inform_act_widget_tax_id_field":"Tax ID Number","ahd_inform_annual_certification":"Annual certification","ahd_inform_annual_review_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7?ref_=ahd_annual_ inform_consumer_act\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, your Selling on Amazon account information must be certified on an annual basis. Visit the <a href=\\"/mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render?ref_=ahd_annual_inform_certification\\">Annual certification</a> page to certify that your information is current.","ahd_inform_annual_review_seller_enforced":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, you must certify the accuracy of your Selling on Amazon account information at least annually. Because we have not received the requested certification, your account has been deactivated. To reactivate your account, visit the <a href=\\" /mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render\\">Annual certification</a> page to certify that your information is current. <br><br> Once you have completed certification, your account will be reactivated within 48 hours.","ahd_inform_bav_not_verified":"You don\'t have a verified bank account or didn\'t assign the verified bank account as your default deposit method to the US marketplace. Verify and assign your bank account as default on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView> Deposit Methods </a>page.","ahd_inform_company_registration_number":"Company Registration Number: ","ahd_inform_confirmation_p1":"Please remember that you are required to keep your business information current and to certify at least annually that your name, address, phone number, email address, bank account information and Tax ID number are correct.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p2":"If any of your information changes, Amazon will need to verify this new information as well. Please respond promptly to any information requests so that we can work with you to complete these additional verification steps and avoid account deactivation. For more information about the verification process, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act help page</a>.","ahd_inform_consumers_act_ac":"INFORM Act notice and certification","ahd_inform_consumers_act_annual":"INFORM Consumers Act Annual Certification ","ahd_inform_loading_error":"Go to the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information target=\\"_blank\\">Account information</a> page to review your current information.","ahd_inform_no_default_deposit":"You don\'t have a verified bank account or didn\'t assign the verified bank account as your default deposit method to the US marketplace. Verify and assign your bank account as default on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView> Deposit Methods</a> page.","ahd_inform_page1_checkbox":"I understand that once I proceed to the INFORM Act notice and certification, i must complete certification within 10 days to avoid the risk of account deactivation. ","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2b":"However, you do not need to wait to receive the formal notification and can take action now to avoid the risk of account deactivation later.","ahd_inform_page1_proceed_title":"Proceed to INFORM Act notice and certification","ahd_inform_page1_step2_description":"If your information is up to date, or if you have just updated it, proceed to the next step – the Notice and Certification – to receive your formal notice and complete your certification. Once you view this notice, the law requires you to certify your information within 10 days.","ahd_inform_sw_bav":"You must verify your active bank accounts. Verify your bank accounts here on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Deposit methods</a> page.","ahd_inform_update_account_information_educational":"Visit the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Annual certification</a> page to ensure your Selling on Amazon account information is up to date.","ahd_itr_priority_action":"Italian tax ID for Italy-based sellers required.","ahd_itr_rap_intro":"The <a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a> requires Italy-based sellers who complete one or more transactions on Amazon.it to add their Italian codice fiscale in their Tax settings.","ahd_itr_remediation_corp":"Submit your Italian codice fiscale in the Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. According to our information (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), your account is registered as a company; therefore, we require your business registration number (known as your “codice fiscale”, which corresponds to your Value Added Tax (VAT) ID without the “IT” country code). Please refer to the Help page (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a>) for submission steps. You must ensure that your legal name on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) and your business registration number in the Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Tax Authority database.","ahd_itr_remediation_individual":"Submit your Italian codice fiscale in the Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. According to our information (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), your account is registered as an individual; therefore, we require your Citizen ID (known as your “codice fiscale”). Refer to the Help pages (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a>) for submission steps. You must ensure that your legal name on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) and Citizen ID number in the Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Tax Authority database.","ahd_itr_remediation_unkown":"Submit your information on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render). Companies must provide their business registration number (known as their “codice fiscale”, which corresponds to their Value Added Tax (VAT) ID without the “IT” country code), while Individual sellers, including sole proprietors (‘P. IVA individuale’) must upload their personal Citizen ID (also known as their “codice fiscale”) in the Tax Settings<https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. You must ensure that your legal name on the Business Information Page <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render> and the codice fiscale in the Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Authority database.","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_details_fallback_text":"Have questions about maintaining a healthy account? Get personalized guidance from Seller Assistant.","ahd_more_information_hd":"More information","ahd_new_feature_announcement_body_new_filters":"You can now filter policy violations by action taken on impacted listings. Go to the Product policy compliance page and click “Add filters” to filter violations.","ahd_other_policy_violation_title":"Other policy violations","ahd_payment_policy_hd_priority_action":"Your funds are on hold due to pending actions on your account. Review the <b>Priority actions</b> to reactivate your disbursements.","ahd_pp_mas_r_policies_code_of_conduct":"Selling Policies and Seller Code of Conduct","ahd_pr_form_address_header":"Address Non-Compliant Product Penalties to continue selling your products.","ahd_pr_form_address_sub_header":"As per the guidance from DOJ, Amazon simplifies your regulatory compliance obligations by reporting and paying  on behalf of your orders on Amazon and then recovering these amounts from your account.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_info":"In accordance with the EPA/DOJ Consent Decree, we are required to penalize Sellers for any violations on policies pertaining to EPA. Please find more information on <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account/health/product-policies\\">non-compliant products</a>, Calculate associated penalties, Reserves applied on your account and Communications sent to submit appeals. You will then be charged for any outstanding penalties.<br/><br/> Before we charge you for the penalties, we will place a hold on your account while giving you a chance to remediate your listing.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_title":"How Does This Work?","ahd_pr_form_impact_header":"Possible account impact are as detailed below:","ahd_pr_form_impact_p1":"Liability to pay penalties (go to violation details below)","ahd_pr_form_impact_p3":"Negative impact on your account health, which may lead to deactivation of your seller account","ahd_pr_form_note":"Please note: Before we charge you for the penalties, we will place a hold on your account for 30 days while give you a chance to remediate your listing.","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_body":"This product has been identified as a pesticide product, pesticide device or a product that contains pesticide claims. To be considered for reinstatement, please provide evidence of an EPA Registration number and/or EPA Establishment number or a certification that the product is exempt from EPA regulations. You will need to provide this information in the Pesticide Marking attribute for the listing. <a href=/help/hub/reference/GLX9EJX844SNJX7J> Instructions for completing this attribute are available on Seller Central.</a>","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_title":"Related Policy Information","ahd_pr_form_title":"Non-Compliant Product Details","ahd_priority_actions_cr":"Cancellation Rate (CR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_lsr":"Late Shipment Rate (LSR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_odr":"Order Defect Rate (ODR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_otdr":"On-time delivery rate (OTDR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_title":"Priority Actions","ahd_pspp_priority_actions":"Complete pending Know Your Customer (KYC) review – Payment Service Provider","ahd_pspp_rap_intro":"Your bank account is not eligible for receiving disbursement. Work with your Payment Service Provider to complete pending Know Your Customer (KYC) review.","ahd_pspp_rap_next_steps":"Visit the <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GY8JTVAWBPQT2XFC?ref_=to_psp_faq_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Payment Service Provider FAQ</a> and <a href=\'/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView?ref_=to_deposit_method_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Deposit methods</a> page for more information. ","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory":"Countries Impacted by Inventory Restrictions","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory_details":"Address the outstanding requirements to avoid disruption to your Fulfilled by Amazon Inventory and your import or export capabilities in the listed country.","ahd_rap_at_risk_regional_details":"The listed requirements are impacting your account health in multiple stores. Address the outstanding requirements to avoid account deactivation in all impacted stores.","ahd_rap_begin_verification":"Begin Verification ","ahd_rap_czech_republic":"Czechia","ahd_rap_enforced_inventory_details":"Address the outstanding requirements to remove the restrictions on your Fulfilled by Amazon Inventory and  import or export capabilities in the listed country.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p1":"The verification of your identity is required by law for the use of a selling on Amazon account. As required by Canadian and Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You may need to provide us with certain information and documents in order to facilitate these checks.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p3":"You can provide the required verification information at any time after you’ve registered. You will have limited access to your account until the information has been provided and verified.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p4":"If you would like to proceed and sell on Amazon.ca or Amazon.com.br, select the checkbox next to the store you would like to proceed with verification below. Once you have selected to proceed with verification, visit the Identity Information page to determine next steps.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p5":"If you want to proceed with verification for a single store first, select only that store from the list below. Once you have completed verification for that store, you will be notified to complete the required steps to begin verification for the other store.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_thankyou_p2":"We are validating your information and may need to request details from you during this review. This validation can take up to 24 hours and might take up to 10 working days in some cases. During this time, your Identity Information cannot be edited.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_check_verification_status":"Check your verification status and required next steps on the Account Information page.","ahd_rap_past_due_inventory":"PAST DUE - Inventory Capabilities Restricted","ahd_rap_voluntary_submission_action":"Based on the information available to us, you are not required to hold a ${countryName} VAT number. To comply with this requirement, you can either remove it from <a href=\'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Tax settings</a> or proceed with resolving the issue above.","ahd_regulatory_compliance":"Regulatory Compliance","ahd_related_accounts_policy_reason":"Seller code of conduct (multiple selling accounts on Amazon)","ahd_sa_account_health_guidance_description":"Have questions about account health? Get personalized guidance from Seller Assistant.","ahd_sa_chat_about_account_health_text":"How\'s my Account Health?","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_label":"Summarize Product Compliance","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_text":"Can you summarize my product compliance violations?","ahd_save_changes_button":"Save changes","ahd_status_past_due":"Past Due","ahd_uaebizlicense_priority_action":"Upload your trade licence","ahd_vas_extension_extension_request_link":"submit the required documentation.","ahd_vas_priority_action":"European VAT Registration Requirements","ahd_vas_rap_deactivated_message":"The listed requirements are impacting your account health in multiple stores. Address the outstanding requirements for the listed country to reactivate your account in all impacted stores.","ahd_vas_rap_intro":"The <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GTQ23HPXBQK563WS\' target=\'_blank\'>European VAT registration requirements</a>  is a European Amazon Stores policy that requires all Selling Partners active in European stores to submit a valid VAT registration number whenever they have a requirement.  Review the Account Health Impact section to complete your outstanding requirements.","ahd_vas_rap_secondary_action":"If you do not have a VAT Registration Number for the listed country, visit the <a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>Business Information</a> portal and <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Tax Settings</a> portal to submit the required information (VAT number, name, address) for the following countries:","ahd_vas_rap_third_action":"If you have opted into Union One-Stop Shop (OSS) in your home country, please visit the <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Tax Settings</a> Page and select your home country from the Union One-Stop Shop (OSS) VAT Declaration menu. Ensure your Union One-Stop Shop (OSS) is enabled and that the name and address provided to Amazon match the ones provided to Authorities.","ahd_vas_rap_verifying":"We are reviewing your VAT Registration Numbers details. This can take up to 14 days. We will contact you if additional information are required.","ahd_view_all_pa":"View all priority actions (${totalCount})","ahd_violation_appeal_button":"Proceed with appeal","ahd_violation_details":"Violation details","ahd_violation_display_name":"Restricted product policy violation","ahd_violation_status_assessment_phase":"Penalties in Assessment Phase - Disbursements may be impacted.","ahd_w8_priority_action":"Updated US Tax identity information required","ahd_w8_rap_action":"You are now required to complete your self-service tax interview before the due date. Your submission can take up to 24 hours to process.","ahd_w8_rap_deactivated_action":"Submit the required information to reactivate your account. Your submission can take up to 24 hours to process.","ahd_w8_rap_intro":"A new W-8 tax form is required. Once your form expires, your selling account will be temporarily deactivated until you provide updated tax information.\\n\\n<br><br>These requirements impact your account health in multiple stores.  Address the listed requirements to avoid account deactivation in all impacted stores.\\n\\n<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G200663290?ref_=to_w8_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>US Income Reporting & Tax Identity Collection FAQ.</a>","ai_inform_page1_step1":"1. Go to your Account Information page [link to Account Information page here] to review your account information (and update, if necessary).","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Because Katal components are extensions of HTML elements, JavaScript can interact with them the same as built-in HTML elements. Here we see JavaScript changing the “variant” attribute on the alert.","components_containing_html_text":"Some components can contain HTML content, like our KatalTabs component. These complex components provide an API so developers and frameworks can interact with them.","custom_elements_text":"Katal gives developers the ability to use custom-designed elements to build their web pages. For example, if the developer needs a button, they can use <kat-button></kat-button> instead of building a button themselves.","demo_complex_header_text":"Demonstration: complex Katal components","demo_components_header_text":"Demonstration: using Katal components","demo_javascript_header_text":"Demonstration: JavaScript with Katal components","design_approved_text":"Katal offers design-approved components for use in web pages that can be configured with labels and custom settings. For example: regular buttons and secondary buttons, different only in their “variant” attribute.","discovery_ahd_ni_warn_pdp":"Product Detail Page","documentation_label":"Katal documentation","fba_inventory_uc_identifier":"Our records indicate that you are holding inventory in ${COUNTRY} through the Fulfilled by Amazon (FBA) program. As a seller using FBA services, you are required to provide a valid VAT registration number for each country where your inventory is stored. You can verify the countries where you have enabled FBA <a href=/fba/settings/ target=\\"_blank\\">here</a>.\\nPlease keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","greeting_description":"This is a sample Katal application, demonstrating how to use Katal components, as well as build-and-deploy tooling. Please contact the Katal team at colombia-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments. To continue this demo, please dismiss this alert.","greeting_description_mons_app":"This is a sample Katal application, demonstrating how to use Katal components with translations. Please contact the Katal team at katal-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments.","greeting_header":"Sample app information","information-requests":"Information requests","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Send feedback","mobile_ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"Please sign in to Seller Central from a web browser.","mobile_ahd_banner_eg_trn":"Update your tax registration number on the Tax settings page in your Seller Central account.","poe_domestic_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicates that your sales in ${COUNTRY} exceed the domestic threshold for VAT registration.","ppc_fhdds_action_taken":"Risk of UK inbound restriction","ppc_fhdds_action_taken_past_due":"UK inbound capabilities are currently restricted","ppc_fhdds_reason":"FHDDS: Shipment Missing Import Entry Number (IEN)","primary_button_label":"Primary button","product-policy-compliance":"Product policy compliance","sample_app_page_title_text":"Sample application","sc_homepage_education_phase_description":"Address your Account Health to avoid the risk of future account deactivation.","sc_inform_act_view_account_health_banner":"Go to Account Health","sc_navbar_ah_cs_desc":"View your customer service performance metrics, including your order defect and invoice defect rates (IDRs).","sc_navbar_ah_desc":"View your Account Health Rating, issues affecting your account health and violations that may result in content removal or account deactivation.","sc_navbar_ah_eligibilities_desc":"View benefits and programs you may be eligible for.","sc_navbar_ah_myc_desc":"Ensure all your products comply with all applicable, laws, regulations and Amazon policies.","sc_navbar_ah_sp_desc":"View your shipping performance metrics, including Late Shipment Rate, Pre-fulfilment Cancellation Rate, Valid Tracking Rate and On-Time Delivery Rate.  ","schp_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_subtitle":"Go to your Account Health page and complete your Priority Actions to begin selling on Amazon.","schp_complete_priority_actions":"Complete your Priority Actions","secondary_button_label":"Secondary button","ship_from_non_poe_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are shipping from ${COUNTRY}, which is different than your home country; therefore, you are required to provide a valid VAT Information Exchange System (VIES) VAT number or applicable VAT number for EU transactions. You can verify your shipping address from the Shipping Settings page or from this <a href=/sbr target=\\"_blank\\">link</a>.\\nPlease keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","ship_from_poe_uc_identifier":"Our records indicate that your cross-border sales exceed €10,000 across EU countries. As a seller engaged in cross-border sales, you are required to provide either UOSS-enabled VAT number from you establishment country or valid VAT numbers for all countries you ship to.","ship_to_non_eu_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you have shipments exceeding €150 from outside EU into ${COUNTRY}. Therefore, you are required to provide a valid ${COUNTRY} VAT number or a declaration confirming that you are not the importer of record for the shipment(s) above threshold.","ship_to_uoss_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are conducting cross-border sales into ${COUNTRY} from other EU country and, therefore, you are required to provide an UOSS-enabled VAT number from your establishment country or valid ${COUNTRY} VAT number.\\nPlease keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","sp-permanent-call-me-now-title":"Need Help?","sp_health_cancellation_rate_caption":"Pre-fulfillment Cancel Rate","sp_health_customer_satisfaction_information_label":"Order Defect Rate consists of three different metrics:","sp_health_dashboard_guardian_title_new":"Account Health Assurance","sp_health_dashboard_subheader":"To sell on Amazon, you must adhere to the below-performance targets and policies.","sp_health_dashboard_title":"Account Health","sp_health_download_report_caption":"Download Report","sp_health_gl_watch":"Watch\\n","sp_health_intellectual_property_customer_complaints":"Received Intellectual Property complaints","sp_health_late_shipment_rate_caption":"Late Shipment Rate","sp_health_listing_policy_customer_complaints":"Listing Policy Violations","sp_health_mobile_by_ahr_impact_tab_title":"By Account Health Rating Impact","sp_health_nav_myc":"Manage Your Compliance","sp_health_nav_orders_with_defects":"Orders with Defects","sp_health_not_available":"N/A","sp_health_order_defect_rate_caption":"Order Defect Rate","sp_health_pre_fulfillment_cancel_rate":"Pre-fulfillment Cancel Rate","sp_health_product_policies":"Product Policy Compliance","sp_health_product_quality_popover":"This total will include complaints that you may have already addressed through a Plan of Action.","sp_health_product_safety_customer_complaints":"Food and Product Safety Issues","sp_health_restricted_products_violations_policy":"Restricted Product Policy Violations","sp_health_risk_banner_vtr":"Your seller-fulfilled offers are at risk of deactivation. Your Valid Tracking Rate is ${hash-get metricValue}; the target is ${hash-get target}.","sp_health_seller_fulfilled_metrics_caption":"Seller Fulfilled","sp_health_shipping_bucket_caption":"Shipping Performance","sp_health_shipping_eligibilities":"View shipping eligibilities here","sp_health_time_window":"Time Window: ${numDays} days","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_caption":"Valid Tracking Rate","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_subtitle":"<b>Target</b>: over ${hash-get targetValue}","sp_health_violation_details_stale_page_button_label":"Back to Account Health","sp_mfn_at_risk_warning":"Your seller-fulfilled offers are at risk of deactivation","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_defects":"You do not currently have any defects for this order.","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_order":"This order doesn\'t exist.","sp_st_date_range":"${hash-get startDate} - ${hash-get endDate}","sp_st_heading_order_asin":"Product","sp_st_heading_order_edd":"Expected Delivery Date","sp_st_heading_order_esd":"Expected Ship Date","sp_st_str_with_description":"${hash-get description}: ${hash-get str}","sp_st_zero_out_metrics_message":"Orders received prior to June 1 are not used to evaluate your account health and do not display here.","sp_vtr_list_ca":"1. Heavy and bulky items shipped by a carrier not integrated with Amazon. Learn more on integrated carriers.</br></br>2. Small and light items that have an order value less than $30 CAD (including shipping charges) and are shipped in Canada Post Standard Mail envelopes or First Class Mail envelopes.</br></br>3. International shipments shipped from China that have an order value less than CAD $6 (including shipping charges)</br></br>4. International shipments shipped from outside of US and China.</br></br>5. Digital orders that cannot be physically shipped by a carrier, e.g. audio books","sp_zero_tolerance_banner_body":"Due to one or more critical violations, your account is pending deactivation. To prevent deactivation, please address these violations now. For more information, go to the <a href=/gp/help/G200205250>Account Health Rating programme policy</a>.","tab_demo_generated_text":"Auto-generated tab {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Selected tab","ts-form-header":"Report abuse","valid_vat_number_uc_identifier":"Please keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","voluntary_vrn_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are not required to hold a VAT number in ${COUNTRY}, but you have provided one on Seller Central that is currently not valid. To resolve this discrepancy, you can either remove the ${COUNTRY} VAT number or provide a valid one. By removing your ${COUNTRY} VAT number from Seller Central, you are confirming that you are not required to hold one in ${COUNTRY}. We recommend consulting with a tax advisor to determine whether your overall business activities, both on and off Amazon, require VAT registration."}},"en-GB":{"pages.floatingWidget":{"DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_content":"You’re part of an experiment to improve seller experience: starting now, strong performance on Buyer Contact Rate, Contact Response Time and Buyer Dissatisfaction Rate can boost your AHR score! This change helps AHR reward excellent customer service. Check your customer service performance on Feedback Manager now.","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_cta_done":"Feedback Manager","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_header":"Earn AHR (Account Health Rating) points for strong customer service","DYK_JP_LINE_content":"Amazon LINE Official Account sends selected notifications about the notifications we sent via email and Seller Central requiring actions by Sellers regarding topics such as your account’s status, listing status and payment disbursement errors. Connect your Seller Central account to the LINE official account to receive notifications via LINE and avoid missing important notifications. Learn More","DYK_JP_LINE_header":"You can connect with LINE account to receive personalised important messages that matter to your account health.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_content":"Great news You’re within 60 days of qualifying for Account Health Assurance (AHA). Maintain your Account Health Rating above 250 and keep a verified emergency contact number on file to secure enhanced account protection. We’ll notify you via email once you’re automatically enrolled.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_header":"Nearing Account Health Assurance enrolment","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_content":"Your Account Health Rating has moved into At risk or Unhealthy status. Click “Call me now” to speak with an Account Health Specialist and protect your selling privileges.","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_cta_done":"Call me now","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_header":"Your Account Health Rating needs attention","DYK_SSAT_CFT_DietarySupp_content":"Protect your Dietary Supplement listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_Toys_content":"Protect your Toys category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_artscrafts_content":"Protect your Arts and Crafts category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_buttoncellbatteryproducts_content":"Protect your Button Cell Battery category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_childrensproducts_content":"Protect your Children’s Products category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_cta_done":"Sign up today","DYK_SSAT_CFT_electronics_content":"Protect your Electronics category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_emobilityproducts_content":"Protect your E-mobility category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_firesafety_content":"Protect your Fire Safety category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_furniture_content":"Protect your Furniture category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_header":"Simplify compliance: enrol in Compliance Fast-track today","DYK_SSAT_CFT_infantbabyproducts_content":"Protect your Infant and Baby Products category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_ppe_content":"Protect your Personal Protection Equipment category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_EDU_JULY":"Keys to the Account Health rating","DYK_SSAT_EDU_content":"AHR monitors your account’s deactivation risk through a point system. You gain points for successfully fulfilling orders. You lose points when policy violations are detected and recover points when you successfully address those violations. Review your Account Health dashboard often and address policy violations as they arise.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_content":"We’re excited to announce Seller Challenge, a new feature for Account Health Assurance sellers. Seller Challenge provides a limited number of opportunities to request a separate review of listing issues via your Account Health page. Once you submit a challenge, we strive to respond with a decision within 48 hours.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_cta_done":"Learn more","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop_header":"Healthy AHR tip","ahd_dyk_bhdr_content":"We recommend delivering more than 90% of your Amazon Business commercial shipments during business hours to maintain a good customer experience","ahd_dyk_bhdr_cta":"View Performance","ahd_dyk_bhdr_header":"Your Business Hour Delivery Rate is low.","ahd_dyk_br_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Your Amazon.com.br (Brazil) store is at risk of deactivation.","ahd_dyk_de_sup_label":"To comply with the EPR: Germany Single Use Plastic policy (effective since January 1, 2025), take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for each brand and product type combination. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GA4JYZX23CLK8WFW\\">Learn more</a>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n","ahd_dyk_de_sup_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): Germany Single Use Plastic","ahd_dyk_de_sup_weee_title":"You have listings affected by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): Germany WEEE","ahd_dyk_description_eukyc":"In accordance with EU regulations, you must complete an account verification process. Go to the Identity information page to complete verification. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G201200780 \\">Find out more</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_label":"To comply with the Extended Producer Responsibility: take action now by providing Extended Producer Responsibility registration numbers for each brand and product type combination. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GYDCAK9ZR6VJH2X3\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_title":"You have listings affected by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR)","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_label":"To comply with EPR: EU Batteries policy (effective from August 18, 2025), take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for your product categories. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GPVDATLHQ6PRQNSW\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): EU Batteries","ahd_dyk_fhdds_cta":"Review shipments","ahd_dyk_fhdds_description":"Provide the import details for all your applicable shipments in your Shipping Queue before they disrupt your business. Missing import details could restrict your ability to create new UK shipments.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.com.br/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.com.br</a> store.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.ca/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.ca</a> store.","ahd_dyk_title_eukyc":"Complete your EU Know Your Customer (KYC) verification","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description":"To comply with the GPSR, which goes into effect on December 13, 2024, please provide additional compliance information for your products to avoid impact to your listings. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_task":"You have listings impacted by the General Product Safety Regulation (GPSR).","ahd_floating_widget_aha_ec_description":"As a member of the AHA programme, you are <b>required</b> to maintain a valid emergency contact number. Verify your emergency contact details to retain AHA eligibility, so that our specialists can contact you to help you address critical account health-related issues before they disrupt your business.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_action_panel_title":"Emergency contact information update","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_food_and_safety_heading":"You have repeat violations for food and product safety issues","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_ip_heading":"You have repeat violations for Received intellectual property complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_listing_heading":"You have repeat violations for listing policy violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_other_heading":"You have repeat violations for other policy violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_auth_heading":"You have repeat violations for product authenticity customer complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_cond_heading":"You have repeat violations for product condition customer complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_reviews_heading":"You have repeat violations for customer product reviews policy violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_reg_comp_heading":"You have repeat violations for regulatory compliance","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_rp_heading":"You have repeat violations for Restricted Product policy","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_sip_heading":"You have repeat violations for suspected intellectual property violations","ahd_floating_widget_resolve_now_button_text":"Resolve now","cs_nerd_suggestion_top_issues_action_vi":"View issues","dyk_ahd_pra_rv":"You have repeat violations for Customer Product Reviews Policy Violations"},"pages.homepage":{"AHD_DD14_Base_Reserve":"Sales proceeds are held for 14 days after the delivery date and become available for disbursement starting on the 15th day after the delivery date. If the actual delivery date is not available, we use the latest estimated delivery date for the order. This is your default payment policy.","AHD_POA_APPEAL_ERROR_LOADING":"An error occurred. Please refresh the page.","DR_VAT_AHD_NC_BANNER":"We’ve not been able to verify your business establishment for VAT purposes. To ensure accurate tax treatment, verify your establishment for VAT purposes.","DR_VAT_AHD_PRIORITY_ACTION":"Establishment verification required for Value Added Tax (VAT) purposes","Engage_Appeal_05":"Seller code of conduct (favourably influencing customers to manipulate your sales ratings, feedback or reviews)","LocalizedPageTitleDashboard":"Performance dashboard","LocalizedPageTitleDetailCustomerSatisfaction":"Customer Satisfaction details page.","LocalizedPageTitleDetailProductPolicies":"Product policies detail page.","NO_METRICS":"You currently don’t have any orders counting toward this metric.\\n","RR_AHR_Warn_1":"Multiple selling accounts on Amazon","acf_banner_inform_act":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to start verification.","acf_inform_act_wait_text":"Thank you for verifying Identity. Check back in 24 hours for confirmation of whether any additional information is needed. ","acf_inform_act_widget_description":"After completing Identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","addTab_label":"Add tab","aef_address_your_violation":"Address your violation","ags_pcx_voc_summary_voice_of_the_customer":"Voice of the Customer","ahd_Inform_deposit_method":"Deposit method information","ahd_account_impacted_details":"Your account may be impacted as detailed below:","ahd_account_regulatory_compliance":"Account regulatory compliance","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to start verification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_aha":"<b> Please note: if you have not completed all verification items when the INFORM Consumers Act takes effect, your account may be deactivated, regardless of your enrolment in Account Health Assurance.</b>","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_thankyou":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have successfully completed all open verifications. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_v2":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>US INFORM Consumers Act</a>, which goes into effect on June 27, 2023, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Go to the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Account Information</a> page to start verification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_school_supplies":"We’ve identified you have listing(s) at risk of removal due to non-compliance to local, state and federal regulations regarding the sale of school supply products for children. To learn more about these compliance requirements, click <a href=/gp/help/external/help.html?itemID=XT3EFQS54LRKYM3&language=en_US&ref=ahd_uspc_adhoc_banner>here</a>. To prevent listing removal, please view your listings in scope of this compliance requirement <a href=/performance/account/health/product-policies?t=safe>here</a> and follow the guidance listed under “Next steps” next to the listing(s) at risk of removal to ensure compliance with these requirements.","ahd_adhoc_mobile_inform_act_aha":"Note: If you do not complete all verification steps within the specified time frames, your account may be deactivated, regardless of your enrolment in Account Health Assurance.","ahd_aef_IPI_priority_action":"Virtual identity verification","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_join_call_link":"Visit <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">Identity verification portal</a> to join your scheduled video call.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_next_steps":"Visit the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">Identity verification portal</a>, to submit required documents and join a video call for virtual identity verification. You also have option to schedule a video call on a future date and time after submitting required documents.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason":"A review of your business has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity; this can, in accordance with Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>, lead to account deactivation. To protect our customers and selling partners, we need to verify the identity of our sellers through a virtual identity verification process that takes place on a video call. ","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason_eu":"A review of your business has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity; this can, in accordance with Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G201190440\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>, lead to account deactivation. To protect our customers and selling partners, we need to verify the identity of our sellers through a virtual identity verification process that takes place on a video call.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_review_fail":"A review of your business and the information that you provided during your virtual identity verification, has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity, which is in violation of Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_under_review":"We are reviewing the information that you provided for identity verification. The review process may take up to five working days.","ahd_aef_action_panel_RA_reason":"Our review indicates that you have a separate account that was deactivated for violating one of our policies. As a result, the current selling account is in violation of our “Multiple selling accounts on Amazon” policy outlined in the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G1801\\">Seller Code of Conduct</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_post_deactivation_appeal":"If you believe that your account has been deactivated in error, you can submit new information by clicking “Appeal” button below.","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_food_and_prod_subreason":"Food and product safety issues","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_listing_subreason":"Listing policy violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_other_subreason":"Other policy violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_auth_subreason":"Product authenticity customer complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_cond_subreason":"Product condition customer complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_review_subreason":"Customer product reviews policy violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reason":"Repeat violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reg_comp_subreason":"Regulatory compliance","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rip_subreason":"Received intellectual property complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rp_subreason":"Restricted product policy","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_sip_subreason":"Suspected intellectual property violations","ahd_aef_at_risk_HD_card_body":"To reactivate your disbursements, review your priority actions and address the outstanding action items.","ahd_aef_at_risk_card_sc_body":"You have one or more outstanding action items that will result in account deactivation.","ahd_aef_critical_message":"This critical issue if left unresolved will cause your account to be deactivated.","ahd_aef_critical_message_no_caps":"This critical issue if left unresolved will cause your account to be deactivated.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_body":"Address your Account Health issues to reactivate your account. Once the issues have been resolved, your account will be reactivated within 24 hours.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_sc_body":"Address your account health issues to reactivate your account.","ahd_aef_denver_eu":"Verify EU establishment for Value Added Tax (VAT)","ahd_aef_denver_info":"Information required","ahd_aef_denver_uk":"Verify UK establishment for Value Added Tax (VAT)","ahd_aef_educational_card_action":"Resolve issues","ahd_aef_impact_header":"Account Health impact","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_post_deactivation":"Click the “Appeal” button below and follow the instructions provided in order to reactivate this selling account.","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_pre_deactivation":"Click the “Appeal” button below and follow the instructions provided in order to avoid deactivation of this selling account.","ahd_aef_next_steps_header":"Address your violation","ahd_aef_pending_critical":"Pending critical","ahd_aef_submit_header":"Submit your information","ahd_ahr_pending_critical":"Pending critical","ahd_all_issues":"All issues","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_body":"Your account will be considered for reactivation when your violations have been successfully appealed. ","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_header":"Your account has been deactivated. ","ahd_banner_block_mfn_at_risk_subtitle":"Your seller-fulfilled offers have been deactivated and your account is at risk of deactivation. Complete your priority actions to reactivate your seller-fulfilled offers and prevent deactivation.","ahd_banner_block_mfn_subtitle":"Your seller-fulfilled offers have been deactivated. Complete your priority actions to reactivate your seller-fulfilled offers.","ahd_banner_eg_trn":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br>Your account is at risk of deactivation because your Seller Central account does not include your valid tax registration number. Go to the <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations> Tax Settings</a> page to update your tax information within 90 days from the date of your first product listing on Amazon to avoid account deactivation. For more information, see the “Tax compliance frequently asked questions” <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC> help page. </a>","ahd_banner_resolve_issues_button":"Resolve issues","ahd_be_jsl_at_risk_banner":"<b> Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br> You have not provided your Belgian VAT registration number (VRN) or confirmation of Union One-Stop Shop (OSS) status for your home country in your Amazon Seller Central account. Refer to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/external/GGTX8THLMMDJ3WBP> new Belgian legislation</a> to know more about the requirement and provide information.","ahd_be_jsl_priority_action":"Belgium Value Added Tax (VAT) legislation","ahd_brkyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Check your verification status on the <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional\\n?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity Information </a> page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"As per Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service and you are required to provide us with certain information or documents in order to facilitate these checks. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications.\\r\\n<br><br>Your account has been deactivated because we were not able to validate your identity information.<br><br> \\r\\nFor more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon </a> help page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_identity_info":"Visit the <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity information</a> page to complete verification.","ahd_brkyc_rap_intro":"As per Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You are required to provide us with certain information or documents in order to facilitate these checks. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications.\\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nFor more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon </a> help page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_verifying":"We are validating your information and may need to request details from you during this review. Please check the <a href=\'/performance/notifications\\r\\n?ref_=to_brkyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a> sections and respond to any requests relating to your Selling on Amazon account. This validation can take up to 24 hours and might take up to 10 working days in some cases. During this time, your identity information cannot be edited.","ahd_cakyc_rap_action_hd":"Provide your identity verification information by the due date shown to avoid account deactivation. If you do not start verification and have 15 days or fewer remaining, your ability to disburse funds from your Amazon.ca selling account will be restricted. Verification is required under Canadian law.","ahd_cakyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Check your verification status on the <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> Identity information page</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"Your account has been deactivated because we were not able to validate your identity information.  Canadian laws require us to verify your identity so that we can allow you to use our service. To reactivate your account, submit information needed to verify your identity. \\r\\n<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page","ahd_cakyc_rap_identity_info":"Visit the <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity information page</a> to complete verification. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_intro":"Canadian law requires us to verify your identity to allow you to use our service. We need you to provide us with certain information and documents so that we can conduct these verification checks. <br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page or refer to your <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_self_trigger_cta":"By clicking “Begin verification”, you are proceeding with the Canada verification requirements. Visit the<a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> Identity information page</a> to confirm next steps. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_verifying":"We are validating your information. This validation can take between 24 hours and 10 working days, in some cases. We may need to request details from you during this review. Please check the <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a> section and respond to any additional requests relating to your Selling on Amazon account.  \\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nDuring this time, your identity information cannot be edited.","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph":"The verification of your identity is required by law for the use of a Selling on Amazon account. As per Canadian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You may need to provide us with certain information and documents in order to facilitate these checks.<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph2":"Amazon allows up to 60 days for you to complete re-verification. The does not include the time that we take to complete the review. Your ability to sell and disburse funds may be restricted if re-verification is not completed within 60 days. When we require information, a notification will appear on your Account information page. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications. ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph3":"You will eventually be unable to use your selling on Amazon account. Therefore, you will not be able to sell on Amazon.ca if the information is not provided. ","ahd_collusion_policy":"Selling policies and Seller Code of Conduct","ahd_compliance_status":"Compliance status","ahd_compliance_widget_ckp_redirect":"Launch compliance reference","ahd_critical_account_health_notification":"Critical Account Health Notification","ahd_critical_policy_violations":"Critical policy violations","ahd_dac7_at_risk_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation.</b><br><br> Your account is at risk of being deactivated because of missing tax information required under  <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB\\"> DAC7 legislation</a>. Go to the <a href= \\"/complianceportal\\">DAC7 Compliance Portal</a>  to start verification. ","ahd_dac7_compliant":"You are DAC7 compliant now","ahd_dac7_priority_action":"DAC7 information required","ahd_dac7_priority_action_pending":"Pending verification","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_launch_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Launch the DAC7 Portal to submit your information</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal_status":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_status_blurb\'  target=\'_blank\'>Check your verification status on the DAC7 Portal</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_intro":"The <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/external/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB?ref_=to_dac_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Directive on Administrative Cooperation – 7th Amendment (DAC7)</a> is an EU regulation that requires Amazon to collect, verify and report due diligence, Value Added Tax (VAT)/tax and financial data of EU-resident sellers irrespective of the Amazon store that they sell in.","ahd_dac7_rap_verify_now_button":"Verify now","ahd_dac7_rap_verifying":"We are reviewing your DAC7 information. The review process usually takes 72 hours, but might take longer in some instances. Please check the status of your verification regularly in the DAC7 Portal below to find out if we require more information.","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_description":"Go to the <a href=\'/hz/sc/account-information\' target=\'_blank\'>Account information</a> page to complete verification. ","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Your Amazon.ca (Canada) store is at risk of deactivation.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the Amazon.com.br store.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the Amazon.ca store.","ahd_eg_trn_deactivation_banner":"<b>Your account has been deactivated.</b><br><br> To reactivate your account, visit the <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations> Tax Settings</a> page to update your tax information. For more information, see the “Tax compliance frequently asked questions” <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC>help page</a>. ","ahd_error_loading_submit":"An error occurred. Please try submitting again.","ahd_eukyc_priority_action":"Identity verification","ahd_inform_ac_checkbox_error":"Click the checkbox to confirm that you have reviewed your information and certify that it is accurate and current.","ahd_inform_ac_edu_display_name":"Review your account information","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p1":"Under the US INFORM Consumers Act, you are required to keep certain business information (shown below) current and to electronically certify to Amazon that either you have updated your information or that the information already provided is still current. Certify that your information below is up to date within 10 days of viewing this notice, or your account will be at risk of deactivation. ","ahd_inform_ac_p1_header":"Get ready to certify your information","ahd_inform_ac_page1_checkbox":"Click the checkbox to confirm that you have understand that once you go to the INFORM Act Notice and Certification page, you’ll receive a notice and have 10 days to update and certify your information.","ahd_inform_ac_page1_step1_intructions":"Go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Account Information</a> page or click the Edit button to update any information below that is incorrect. ","ahd_inform_ac_page2_certify_instructions":"If your information below is up to date, you can certify now. If any information is incorrect, go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Account Information</a>  page to edit your information before clicking “Certify”.","ahd_inform_account_information_update_verification":"Your account information has been updated, and we are verifying your information. Check back in 24 hours to determine whether any additional steps are needed to begin the Annual Certification process.","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_confirmation":"By clicking “Certify”, I certify that I have read the notice above and that the information I provided to Amazon is true and correct, corresponds to my business and is not misappropriated.","ahd_inform_act_ac_edit_information":"Edit information","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"Email","ahd_inform_act_ac_not_required":"The INFORM Act does not yet apply to your business, so you’re not currently required to certify your information. We’ll notify you in the future if you’re required to certify your information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou":"Thank you for certifying that your business information is current. Your Account Health page will update in a few minutes to confirm that you have completed your outstanding INFORM Act Notice and Certification requirement.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou_banner":"Thank you for certifying that your business information is current. Your Account Health page will update in a few minutes to confirm you have completed your outstanding INFORM Act Notice and Certification requirement.\\n<br><br>Please remember that you are required to keep your business information current and to certify at least annually that your name, address, phone number, email address, bank account information, and Tax ID number are correct.","ahd_inform_act_ac_tin_field":"Tax Identification Number (TIN):","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions":"Please note that only the primary user or secondary user with authorised approval to confirm/edit account information will be able to certify the information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions_error":"This information must be certified by the Account’s primary user or a secondary user authorised with approval to confirm/edit account information.","ahd_inform_act_account_information":"Account information","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_deactivation_banner":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Because we have not received the requested information, your account has been deactivated. To reactivate your account, review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to complete verification. <br><br>Once you have completed verifications for all outstanding requirements, your account will be reactivated within 48 hours. ","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_hold_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation and disbursements for your Amazon selling account have been put on hold.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Because we have not received the requested information within the time frames specified in our communications, your disbursements are now placed on hold. To reactivate your disbursements, review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to start or complete your information submission.","ahd_inform_act_hold_wait_text":"To reactivate your disbursements and prevent your account from being deactivated, click on the action items below to go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> and complete the pending requirements. <br><br>Thank you for completing identity verification. Check back in 24 hours to find out whether any additional verification steps are needed.","ahd_inform_act_hold_widget_description":"To reactivate your disbursements and prevent your account from being deactivated, click on the action items below to go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> and complete the pending requirements. <br><br>After completing the identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_wait_text":"Click on the action items below to complete the pending requirements. Thank you for completing identity verification. Check in 24 hours to find out whether any additional verification steps are needed.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_widget_description":"Click on the action items below to complete the pending requirements. After completing the identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_need_help":"Need help? Go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act help page</a>.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have successfully completed all open verifications. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete_short":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have successfully completed all open verifications. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_inform_act_wait_text":"Thank you for verifying your identity. Check back in 24 hours for confirmation of whether any additional information is needed. <br><br> Click the action items below to go to the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Seller Account Information</a> page and complete the pending requirements.","ahd_inform_act_widget_bank_account_field":"Bank account","ahd_inform_act_widget_business_address_field":"Business address","ahd_inform_act_widget_description":"Click the action items below to go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> page and complete the pending requirements. <br><br> After completing identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_widget_phone_number_field":"Phone Number","ahd_inform_act_widget_tax_id_field":"Tax ID number","ahd_inform_annual_certification":"Annual Certification","ahd_inform_annual_review_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7?ref_=ahd_annual_ inform_consumer_act\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, your Selling on Amazon account information must be certified on an annual basis. Go to the <a href=\\"/mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render?ref_=ahd_annual_inform_certification\\">Annual Certification</a> page to certify that your information is current.","ahd_inform_annual_review_seller_enforced":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, you must certify the accuracy of your Selling on Amazon account information at least annually. Because we have not received the requested certification, your account has been deactivated. To reactivate your account, go to the <a href=\\" /mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render\\">Annual Certification</a> page to certify that your information is current. <br><br> Once you have completed certification, your account will be reactivated within 48 hours.","ahd_inform_bav_not_verified":"You don’t have a verified bank account or didn’t assign the verified bank account as your default deposit method to the US marketplace. Verify and assign your bank account as default on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Deposit methods </a>page.","ahd_inform_company_registration_number":"Company Registration Number: ","ahd_inform_confirmation_p1":"Please remember that you are required to keep your business information current and to certify at least annually that your name, address, phone number, email address, bank account information and tax ID number are correct.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p2":"If any of your information changes, Amazon will need to verify this new information as well. Please respond promptly to any information requests so that we can work with you to complete these additional verification steps and avoid account deactivation. For more information about the verification process, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act help page</a>.","ahd_inform_consumers_act_ac":"INFORM Act Notice and Certification","ahd_inform_consumers_act_annual":"INFORM Consumers Act Annual Certification ","ahd_inform_loading_error":"Go to the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information target=\\"_blank\\">Account Information</a> page to review your current information.","ahd_inform_no_default_deposit":"You don\'t have a verified bank account or didn\'t assign the verified bank account as your default deposit method to the US marketplace. Verify and assign your bank account as default on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView> Deposit Methods</a> page.","ahd_inform_page1_checkbox":"I understand that once I proceed to the INFORM Act Notice and Certification, I must complete certification within 10 days to avoid the risk of account deactivation. ","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2b":"However, you do not need to wait to receive the formal notification and can take action now to avoid the risk of account deactivation later.","ahd_inform_page1_proceed_title":"Proceed to INFORM Act Notice and Certification","ahd_inform_page1_step2_description":"If your information is up to date or if you have just updated it, proceed to the next step – the Notice and Certification – to receive your formal notice and complete your certification. Once you view this notice, the law requires you to certify your information within 10 days.","ahd_inform_sw_bav":"You must verify your active bank accounts. Verify your bank accounts here on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView> Deposit methods</a> page.","ahd_inform_update_account_information_educational":"Go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Annual Certification</a> page to ensure your Selling on Amazon account information is up to date.","ahd_itr_priority_action":"Italian tax ID for Italy-based sellers required.","ahd_itr_rap_intro":"The <a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a> requires Italy-based sellers who complete one or more transactions on Amazon.it to add their Italian codice fiscale in their Tax settings.","ahd_itr_remediation_corp":"Submit your Italian codice fiscale in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. According to our information (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), your account is registered as a company; therefore, we require your business registration number (known as your ‘codice fiscale’, which corresponds to your Value Added Tax (VAT) ID without the ‘IT’ country code). Please refer to the Help page (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a>) for submission steps. You must ensure that your legal name on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) and your business registration number in the Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Tax Authority database.","ahd_itr_remediation_individual":"Submit your Italian codice fiscale in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. According to our information (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), your account is registered as an individual; therefore, we require your Citizen ID (known as your ‘codice fiscale’). Refer to the Help pages (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a>) for submission steps. You must ensure that your legal name on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) and Citizen ID number in the Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Tax Authority database.","ahd_itr_remediation_unkown":"Submit your information on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render). Companies must provide their business registration number (known as their ‘codice fiscale’, which corresponds to their Value Added Tax (VAT) ID without the ‘IT’ country code), while Individual sellers, including sole proprietors (‘P. IVA individuale’) must upload their personal Citizen ID (also known as their ‘codice fiscale’) in the Tax Settings<https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. You must ensure that your legal name on the Business Information Page <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render> and the codice fiscale in the Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Authority database.","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_details_fallback_text":"Have questions about maintaining a healthy account? Get personalised guidance from Seller Assistant.","ahd_more_information_hd":"More information","ahd_new_feature_announcement_body_new_filters":"You can now filter policy violations by action taken on impacted listings. Go to the Product policy compliance page and click “Add filters” to filter violations.","ahd_other_policy_violation_title":"Other Policy Violations","ahd_payment_policy_hd_priority_action":"Your funds are on hold due to pending actions on your account. Review the <b>Priority actions</b> to reactivate your disbursements.","ahd_pp_mas_r_policies_code_of_conduct":"Selling policies and Seller Code of Conduct","ahd_pr_form_address_header":"Address non-compliant product penalties to continue selling your products.","ahd_pr_form_address_sub_header":"As per the guidance from DOJ, Amazon simplifies your regulatory compliance obligations by reporting and paying  on behalf of your orders on Amazon and then recovering these amounts from your account.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_info":"In accordance with the EPA/DOJ Consent Decree, we are required to penalise sellers for any violations on policies pertaining to EPA. Please find more information on <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account/health/product-policies\\">non-compliant products</a>, Calculate associated penalties, reserves applied on your account and communications sent to submit appeals. You will then be charged for any outstanding penalties.<br/><br/> Before we charge you for the penalties, we will place a hold on your account while giving you a chance to remediate your listing.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_title":"How does this work?","ahd_pr_form_impact_header":"Possible account impact are as detailed below:","ahd_pr_form_impact_p1":"Liability to pay penalties (go to violation details below)","ahd_pr_form_impact_p3":"Negative impact on your Account Health, which may lead to deactivation of your seller account","ahd_pr_form_note":"Please note: Before we charge you for the penalties, we will place a hold on your account for 30 days while give you a chance to remediate your listing.","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_body":"This product has been identified as a pesticide product, pesticide device or a product that contains pesticide claims. To be considered for reinstatement, please provide evidence of an EPA registration number and/or EPA establishment number or a certification that the product is exempt from EPA regulations. You will need to provide this information in the Pesticide Marking attribute for the listing. <a href=/help/hub/reference/GLX9EJX844SNJX7J> Instructions for completing this attribute are available on Seller Central.</a>","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_title":"Related policy information","ahd_pr_form_title":"Non-compliant product details","ahd_priority_actions_cr":"Cancellation rate (CR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_lsr":"Late Dispatch Rate (LDR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_odr":"Order Defect Rate (ODR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_otdr":"On-time delivery rate (OTDR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_title":"Priority actions","ahd_pspp_priority_actions":"Complete pending Know Your Customer (KYC) review – Payment Service Provider","ahd_pspp_rap_intro":"Your bank account is not eligible for receiving disbursement. Work with your Payment Service Provider to complete pending Know Your Customer (KYC) review.","ahd_pspp_rap_next_steps":"Visit the <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GY8JTVAWBPQT2XFC?ref_=to_psp_faq_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Payment Service Provider FAQ</a> and <a href=\'/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView?ref_=to_deposit_method_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Deposit methods</a> page for more information. ","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory":"Countries affected by inventory restrictions","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory_details":"Address the outstanding requirements to avoid disruption to your Fulfilled by Amazon inventory and your import or export capabilities in the listed country.","ahd_rap_at_risk_regional_details":"The listed requirements are affecting your Account Health in multiple stores. Address the outstanding requirements to avoid account deactivation in all affected stores.","ahd_rap_begin_verification":"Begin verification ","ahd_rap_czech_republic":"Czech Republic","ahd_rap_enforced_inventory_details":"Address the outstanding requirements to remove the restrictions on your Fulfilled by Amazon inventory and import or export capabilities in the listed country.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p1":"The verification of your identity is required by law for the use of a selling on Amazon account. As required by Canadian and Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You may need to provide us with certain information and documents in order to facilitate these checks.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p3":"You can provide the required verification information at any time after you’ve registered. You will have limited access to your account until the information has been provided and verified.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p4":"If you would like to proceed and sell on Amazon.ca or Amazon.com.br, select the checkbox next to the store that you would like to proceed with verification below. Once you have selected to proceed with verification, visit the Identity information page to determine next steps.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p5":"If you want to proceed with verification for a single store first, only select that store from the list below. Once you have completed verification for that store, you will be notified to complete the required steps to begin verification for the other store.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_thankyou_p2":"We are validating your information and may need to request details from you during this review. This validation can take up to 24 hours and might take up to 10 working days in some cases. During this time, your identity information cannot be edited.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_check_verification_status":"Check your verification status and required next steps on the Account information page.","ahd_rap_past_due_inventory":"PAST DUE – Inventory capabilities restricted","ahd_rap_voluntary_submission_action":"Based on the information available to us, you are not required to hold a ${countryName} VAT number. To comply with this requirement, you can either remove it from <a href=\'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Tax settings</a> or proceed with resolving the issue above.","ahd_regulatory_compliance":"Regulatory compliance","ahd_related_accounts_policy_reason":"Seller code of conduct (Multiple selling accounts on Amazon)","ahd_sa_account_health_guidance_description":"Have questions about account health? Get personalised guidance from Seller Assistant.","ahd_sa_chat_about_account_health_text":"How\'s my Account Health?","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_label":"Summarise Product Compliance","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_text":"Can you summarise my product compliance violations?","ahd_save_changes_button":"Save Changes","ahd_status_past_due":"Past Due","ahd_uaebizlicense_priority_action":"Upload your trade licence","ahd_vas_extension_extension_request_link":"submit the required documentation.","ahd_vas_priority_action":"European VAT registration requirements","ahd_vas_rap_deactivated_message":"The listed requirements are affecting your Account Health in multiple stores. Address the outstanding requirements for the listed country to reactivate your account in all affected stores.","ahd_vas_rap_intro":"The <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GTQ23HPXBQK563WS\' target=\'_blank\'>European VAT registration requirements</a>  is a European Amazon Stores policy that requires all selling partners active in European stores to submit a valid VAT registration number whenever they have a requirement.  Review the Account Health Impact section to complete your outstanding requirements.","ahd_vas_rap_secondary_action":"If you do not have a VAT registration number for the listed country, visit the <a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>Business information</a> portal and <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Tax settings</a> portal to submit the required information (VAT number, name, address) for the following countries:","ahd_vas_rap_third_action":"If you have opted into Union One-Stop Shop in your home country please visit <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Tax Settings</a> Page selecting your home country from the Union One-Stop Shop VAT Declaration menu. Ensure your Union One-Stop Shop is enabled and name and address provided to Amazon are matching the ones provided to Authorities.","ahd_vas_rap_verifying":"We are reviewing your VAT registration numbers details. This can take up to 14 days. We will contact you if additional information are required.","ahd_view_all_pa":"View all Priority Actions (${totalCount})","ahd_violation_appeal_button":"Proceed with appeal","ahd_violation_details":"Violation details","ahd_violation_display_name":"Restricted products policy violation","ahd_violation_status_assessment_phase":"Penalties in assessment phase – Disbursements may be impacted.","ahd_w8_priority_action":"Updated US Tax identity information required","ahd_w8_rap_action":"You are now required to complete your self-service tax interview before the due date. Your submission can take up to 24 hours to process.","ahd_w8_rap_deactivated_action":"Submit the required information to reactivate your account. Your submission can take up to 24 hours to process.","ahd_w8_rap_intro":"A new W-8 tax form is required. Once your form has expired, your selling account will be temporarily deactivated until you’ve provided updated tax information.\\n\\n<br><br>These requirements impact your account health in multiple stores.  Address the listed requirements to avoid account deactivation in all affected stores.\\n\\n<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G200663290?ref_=to_w8_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>US Income Reporting and Tax Identity Collection FAQ.</a>","ai_inform_page1_step1":"1. Go to your Account Information page [link to Account Information page here] to review your account information (and update, if necessary).","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Because Katal Components are extensions of HTML elements, JavaScript can interact with them the same as built-in HTML elements. Here we see JavaScript changing the “variant” attribute on the alert.","components_containing_html_text":"Some components can contain HTML content, like our KatalTabs component. These complex components provide an API so developers and frameworks can interact with them.","custom_elements_text":"Katal gives developers the ability to use custom-designed elements to build their web pages. For example, if the developer needs a button, they can use <kat-button></kat-button> instead of building a button themselves.","demo_complex_header_text":"Demonstration: Complex Katal Components","demo_components_header_text":"Demonstration: Using Katal Components","demo_javascript_header_text":"Demonstration: JavaScript with Katal Components","design_approved_text":"Katal offers design-approved components for use in web pages that can be configured with labels and custom settings. For example: regular buttons and secondary buttons, different only in their “variant” attribute.","discovery_ahd_ni_warn_pdp":"Product Detail Page","documentation_label":"Katal documentation","fba_inventory_uc_identifier":"Our records indicate that you are holding inventory in ${COUNTRY} through the Fulfilled by Amazon (FBA) programme. As a seller using FBA services, you are required to provide a valid VAT registration number for each country where your inventory is stored. You can verify the countries where you have enabled FBA <a href=/fba/settings/ target=\\"_blank\\">here</a>.\\nPlease bear in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","greeting_description":"This is a sample Katal application, demonstrating how to use Katal Components as well as build-and-deploy tooling. Please contact the Katal team at colombia-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments. To continue this demo, please dismiss this alert.","greeting_description_mons_app":"This is a sample Katal application, demonstrating how to use Katal Components with translations. Please contact the Katal team at katal-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments.","greeting_header":"Sample app information","information-requests":"Information requests","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Send feedback","mobile_ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"Please sign into Seller Central from a web browser.","mobile_ahd_banner_eg_trn":"Update your tax registration number on the Tax Settings page in your Seller Central account.","poe_domestic_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicates that your sales in ${COUNTRY} exceed the domestic threshold for VAT registration.","ppc_fhdds_action_taken":"Risk of UK inbound restriction","ppc_fhdds_action_taken_past_due":"UK inbound capabilities are currently restricted","ppc_fhdds_reason":"FHDDS: Shipment Missing Import Entry Number (IEN)","primary_button_label":"Primary button","product-policy-compliance":"Product policy compliance","sample_app_page_title_text":"Sample application","sc_homepage_education_phase_description":"Address your account health to avoid the risk of future account deactivation.","sc_inform_act_view_account_health_banner":"Go to Account Health","sc_navbar_ah_cs_desc":"View your Customer Service Performance Metrics, including your Order Defect and Invoice Defect Rate (IDR).","sc_navbar_ah_desc":"View your Account Health Rating, issues impacting your account health, and violations that may result in content removal or account deactivation.","sc_navbar_ah_eligibilities_desc":"View benefits and programmes you may be eligible for.","sc_navbar_ah_myc_desc":"Ensure all your products comply with all applicable, laws, regulations and Amazon policies.","sc_navbar_ah_sp_desc":"View your shipping performance metrics, including Late Dispatch Rate, Pre-Fulfilment Cancellation Rate, Valid Tracking Rate and On-Time Delivery Rate.  ","schp_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_subtitle":"Go to your Account Health page and complete your priority actions to begin selling on Amazon.","schp_complete_priority_actions":"Complete your priority actions","secondary_button_label":"Secondary button","ship_from_non_poe_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are shipping from ${COUNTRY} which is different than your home country, therefore, you are required to provide a valid VIES VAT number or applicable VAT number for EU transactions. You can verify your shipping address from Shipping Settings page or from this <a href=/sbr target=\\"_blank\\">link</a>.\\nPlease bear in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","ship_from_poe_uc_identifier":"Our records indicate that your cross-border sales exceed €10,000 across EU countries. As a seller engaged in cross-border sales, you are required to provide either UOSS-enabled VAT number from you establishment country or valid VAT numbers for all countries that you ship to.","ship_to_non_eu_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you have shipments exceeding €150 from outside EU into ${COUNTRY}. Therefore, you are required to provide a valid ${COUNTRY} VAT number or a declaration confirming that you are not the importer of record for the shipment(s) above threshold.","ship_to_uoss_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are conducting cross-border sales into ${COUNTRY} from other EU country and, therefore, you are required to provide an UOSS-enabled VAT number from your establishment country or valid ${COUNTRY} VAT number.\\nPlease bear in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","sp-permanent-call-me-now-title":"Need Help?","sp_health_cancellation_rate_caption":"Pre-Fulfilment cancellation rate","sp_health_customer_satisfaction_information_label":"Order Defect Rate consists of three different metrics:","sp_health_dashboard_guardian_title_new":"Account Health Assurance","sp_health_dashboard_subheader":"To sell on Amazon, you must adhere to the below performance targets and policies.","sp_health_dashboard_title":"Account Health","sp_health_download_report_caption":"Download Report","sp_health_gl_watch":"Watches","sp_health_intellectual_property_customer_complaints":"Received Intellectual Property Complaints","sp_health_late_shipment_rate_caption":"Late Dispatch Rate","sp_health_listing_policy_customer_complaints":"Listing policy violations","sp_health_mobile_by_ahr_impact_tab_title":"By Account Health Rating Impact","sp_health_nav_myc":"Manage your compliance","sp_health_nav_orders_with_defects":"Orders with Defects","sp_health_not_available":"N/A","sp_health_order_defect_rate_caption":"Order Defect Rate","sp_health_pre_fulfillment_cancel_rate":"Pre-fulfilment Cancel Rate","sp_health_product_policies":"Product Policy Compliance","sp_health_product_quality_popover":"This total will include complaints which you may have already addressed through a Plan of Action.","sp_health_product_safety_customer_complaints":"Food and Product Safety Issues","sp_health_restricted_products_violations_policy":"Restricted Product Policy Violations","sp_health_risk_banner_vtr":"Your seller-fulfilled offers are at risk of deactivation. Your Valid Tracking Rate is ${hash-get metricValue}; the target is ${hash-get target}.","sp_health_seller_fulfilled_metrics_caption":"Seller Fulfilled","sp_health_shipping_bucket_caption":"Delivery Performance","sp_health_shipping_eligibilities":"View delivery eligibilities here","sp_health_time_window":"Time Window: ${hash-get numDays} days","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_caption":"Valid Tracking Rate","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_subtitle":"<b>Target</b>: over ${hash-get targetValue}","sp_health_violation_details_stale_page_button_label":"Back to Account Health","sp_mfn_at_risk_warning":"Your Fulfilled by Merchant offers are at risk of deactivation","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_defects":"You do not currently have any defects for this order.","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_order":"This order doesn\'t exist.","sp_st_date_range":"${hash-get startDate} - ${hash-get endDate}","sp_st_heading_order_asin":"Product","sp_st_heading_order_edd":"Expected Delivery Date","sp_st_heading_order_esd":"Expected Dispatch Date","sp_st_str_with_description":"${hash-get description}: ${hash-get str}","sp_st_zero_out_metrics_message":"Orders received prior to June 1 are not used to evaluate your account health and do not display here.","sp_vtr_list_ca":"1. Heavy and bulky items delivered by a carrier not integrated with Amazon. Learn more on integrated carriers.</br></br>2. Small and light items that have an order value less than CAD $30 (including delivery charges) and are delivered in Canada Post Standard Mail envelopes or First Class Mail envelopes.</br></br>3. International shipments dispatched from China that have order value less than CAD $6 (including delivery charges)</br></br>4. International shipments dispatched from outside of the US and China.</br></br>5. Digital orders that cannot be physically delivered by a carrier, e.g. audio books","sp_zero_tolerance_banner_body":"Due to one or more critical violations, your account is pending deactivation. To prevent deactivation, please address these violations now. For more information, go to the <a href=/gp/help/G200205250>Account Health Rating programme policy</a>.","tab_demo_generated_text":"Auto-generated tab {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Selected tab","ts-form-header":"Report abuse","valid_vat_number_uc_identifier":"Please bear in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","voluntary_vrn_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are not required to hold a VAT number in ${COUNTRY}, but you have provided one on Seller Central that is currently not valid. To resolve this discrepancy, you can either remove the ${COUNTRY} VAT number or provide a valid one. By removing your ${COUNTRY} VAT number from Seller Central, you are confirming that you are not required to hold one in ${COUNTRY}. We recommend consulting with a tax advisor to determine whether your overall business activities, both on and off Amazon, require VAT registration."}},"en-IE":{"pages.floatingWidget":{"DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_content":"You’re part of an experiment to improve seller experience: starting now, strong performance on Buyer Contact Rate, Contact Response Time and Buyer Dissatisfaction Rate can boost your AHR score! This change helps AHR reward excellent customer service. Check your customer service performance on Feedback Manager now.","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_cta_done":"Feedback manager","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_header":"Earn AHR (account health rating) points for strong customer service","DYK_JP_LINE_content":"Amazon LINE Official Account sends selected notifications about the notifications we sent via email and Seller Central requiring actions by Sellers regarding topics such as your account’s status, listing status and payment disbursement errors. Connect your Seller Central account to the LINE official account to receive notifications via LINE and avoid missing important notifications. Learn more","DYK_JP_LINE_header":"You can connect with the LINE account to receive personalised important messages that matter to your account health.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_content":"Great news! You’re within 60 days of qualifying for Account Health Assurance (AHA). Maintain your Account Health Rating above 250 and keep a verified emergency contact number on file to secure enhanced account protection. We’ll notify you via email once you’ve been automatically enrolled.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_header":"Nearing Account Health Assurance enrolment","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_content":"Your Account Health Rating has moved into At risk or Unhealthy status. Click “Call me now” to speak with an Account Health Specialist and protect your selling privileges.","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_cta_done":"Call me now","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_header":"Your Account Health Rating needs attention","DYK_SSAT_CFT_DietarySupp_content":"Protect your Dietary Supplement listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_Toys_content":"Protect your Toys category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_artscrafts_content":"Protect your Arts and Crafts category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_buttoncellbatteryproducts_content":"Protect your Button Cell Battery category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_childrensproducts_content":"Protect your Children’s Products category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_cta_done":"Sign up today","DYK_SSAT_CFT_electronics_content":"Protect your Electronics category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_emobilityproducts_content":"Protect your E-mobility category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_firesafety_content":"Protect your Fire Safety category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_furniture_content":"Protect your Furniture category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_header":"Simplify compliance: enrol in Compliance Fast-track today","DYK_SSAT_CFT_infantbabyproducts_content":"Protect your Infant and Baby Products category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_ppe_content":"Protect your Personal Protection Equipment category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_EDU_JULY":"Keys to the Account Health rating","DYK_SSAT_EDU_content":"AHR monitors your account’s deactivation risk through a point system. You gain points for successfully fulfilling orders. You lose points when policy violations are detected and recover points when you successfully address those violations. Review your Account Health dashboard often and address policy violations as they arise.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_content":"We’re excited to announce Seller Challenge, a new feature for Account Health Assurance sellers. Seller Challenge provides a limited number of opportunities to request a separate review of listing issues through your Account Health page. Once you submit a challenge, we strive to respond with a decision in 48 hours.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_cta_done":"Learn more","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop_header":"Healthy account health rating tip","ahd_dyk_bhdr_content":"We recommend delivering more than 90% of your Amazon Business commercial shipments during business hours to maintain a good buyer experience","ahd_dyk_bhdr_cta":"View Performance","ahd_dyk_bhdr_header":"Your Business Hour Delivery Rate is low.","ahd_dyk_br_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Your Amazon.com.br (Brazil) store is at risk of deactivation.","ahd_dyk_de_sup_label":"To comply with the EPR: Germany Single Use Plastic policy (effective since January 1, 2025), take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for each brand and product type combination. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GA4JYZX23CLK8WFW\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_de_sup_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): Germany Single Use Plastic","ahd_dyk_de_sup_weee_title":"You have listings affected by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): Germany WEEE","ahd_dyk_description_eukyc":"In accordance with EU regulations, you must complete an account verification process. Go to the Identity information page to complete verification. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G201200780 \\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_label":"To comply with the Extended Producer Responsibility: take action now by providing Extended Producer Responsibility registration numbers for each brand and product type combination. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GYDCAK9ZR6VJH2X3\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_title":"You have listings affected by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR)","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_label":"To comply with the EPR: EU Batteries policy (effective from August 18, 2025), take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for your product categories. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GPVDATLHQ6PRQNSW\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): EU Batteries","ahd_dyk_fhdds_cta":"Review shipments","ahd_dyk_fhdds_description":"Provide the import details for all of your applicable shipments in your shipping queue before they disrupt your business. Missing import details could restrict your ability to create new UK shipments.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"You have outstanding action items before you can begin selling in the <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.com.br/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.com.br</a> store.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"You have outstanding action items before you can begin selling in the <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.ca/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.ca</a> store.","ahd_dyk_title_eukyc":"Complete your EU Know your customer (KYC) verification","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description":"To comply with the GPSR, which goes into effect on December 13, 2024, please provide additional compliance information for your products to avoid impact to your listings. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_task":"You have listings impacted by the General Product Safety Regulation (GPSR).","ahd_floating_widget_aha_ec_description":"As a member of the AHA programme, you are <b>required</b> to maintain a valid emergency contact number. Verify your emergency contact details to retain AHA eligibility, so our specialists can get in contact to help you address critical account health-related issues before they disrupt your business.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_action_panel_title":"Emergency contact information update","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_food_and_safety_heading":"You have repeat violations for food and product safety issues","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_ip_heading":"You have repeat violations for Received Intellectual Property Complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_listing_heading":"You have repeat violations for listing policy violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_other_heading":"You have repeat violations for other policy violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_auth_heading":"You have repeat violations for product authenticity customer complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_cond_heading":"You have repeat violations for product condition customer complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_reviews_heading":"You have repeat violations for Customer Product Reviews Policy violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_reg_comp_heading":"You have repeat violations for regulatory compliance","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_rp_heading":"You have repeat violations for Restricted Product Policy","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_sip_heading":"You have repeat violations for suspected intellectual property violations","ahd_floating_widget_resolve_now_button_text":"Resolve now","cs_nerd_suggestion_top_issues_action_vi":"View issues","dyk_ahd_pra_rv":"You have repeat violations for customer product reviews policy violations."},"pages.homepage":{"AHD_DD14_Base_Reserve":"Sales proceeds are held for 14 days after the delivery date and become available for disbursement starting on the 15th day after the delivery date. If the actual delivery date is not available, we use the latest estimated delivery date for the order. This is your default payment policy.","AHD_POA_APPEAL_ERROR_LOADING":"An error has occurred. Please refresh the page.","DR_VAT_AHD_NC_BANNER":"We haven’t been able to verify your business establishment for VAT purposes. To ensure accurate tax treatment, verify your establishment for VAT purposes.","DR_VAT_AHD_PRIORITY_ACTION":"Establishment verification required for VAT purposes","Engage_Appeal_05":"Seller code of conduct (favourably influencing customers to manipulate your sales ratings, feedback or reviews)","LocalizedPageTitleDashboard":"Performance dashboard","LocalizedPageTitleDetailCustomerSatisfaction":"Customer Satisfaction details page.","LocalizedPageTitleDetailProductPolicies":"Product policies details page.","NO_METRICS":"You currently don’t have any orders counting towards this metric.\\n","RR_AHR_Warn_1":"Multiple selling accounts on Amazon","acf_banner_inform_act":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller account information</a> to start verification.","acf_inform_act_wait_text":"Thank you for verifying identity. Check back in 24 hours for confirmation of whether any additional information is needed. ","acf_inform_act_widget_description":"After completing Identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","addTab_label":"Add tab","aef_address_your_violation":"Address your violation","ags_pcx_voc_summary_voice_of_the_customer":"Voice of the Customer","ahd_Inform_deposit_method":"Deposit method information","ahd_account_impacted_details":"Your account may be impacted as detailed below:","ahd_account_regulatory_compliance":"Account Regulatory Compliance","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to start verification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_aha":"<b> Please note, if you have not completed all verification items when the INFORM Consumers Act takes effect, your account may be deactivated, regardless of your enrolment in Account Health Assurance.</b>","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_thankyou":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have successfully completed all open verifications. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_v2":"<b>Your account is at-risk of deactivation.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>US INFORM Consumers Act</a>, which goes into effect on June 27, 2023, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Visit the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Account Information</a> page to start verification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_school_supplies":"We’ve identified that you have listing(s) at risk of removal due to non-compliance to local, state and federal regulations regarding the sale of school supply products for children. To learn more about these compliance requirements, click <a href=/gp/help/external/help.html?itemID=XT3EFQS54LRKYM3&language=en_US&ref=ahd_uspc_adhoc_banner>here</a>. To prevent listing removal, please view your listings in scope of this compliance requirement <a href=/performance/account/health/product-policies?t=safe>here</a> and follow the guidance listed under “Next Steps” next to the listing(s) at risk of removal to ensure compliance with these requirements.","ahd_adhoc_mobile_inform_act_aha":"Note: If you do not complete all verification steps within the specified timelines, your account may be deactivated, regardless of your enrolment in Account Health Assurance.","ahd_aef_IPI_priority_action":"Virtual identity verification","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_join_call_link":"Go to the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">Identity verification portal</a> to join your scheduled video call.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_next_steps":"Go to the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">Identity verification portal</a> to submit required documents and join a video call for virtual identity verification. You also have the option to schedule a video call at a future date and time after submitting required documents.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason":"A review of your business has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity. This can, in accordance with Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>, lead to account deactivation. To protect our customers and selling partners, we need to verify the identity of our sellers through a virtual identity verification process that takes place on a video call. ","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason_eu":"A review of your business has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity; this can, in accordance with Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G201190440\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>, lead to account deactivation. To protect our customers and selling partners, we need to verify the identity of our sellers through a virtual identity verification process that takes place on a video call.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_review_fail":"A review of your business and the information that you provided during your virtual identity verification has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity, which is in violation of Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_under_review":"We are reviewing the information you provided for identity verification. The review process may take up to five working days.","ahd_aef_action_panel_RA_reason":"Our review indicates that you have a separate account which has been deactivated for violating one of our policies. As a result, the current selling account is in violation of our “Multiple Selling Accounts on Amazon” policy outlined in the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G1801\\">Seller Code of Conduct</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_post_deactivation_appeal":"If you believe that your account has been deactivated in error, you can submit new information by clicking the “Appeal” button below.","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_food_and_prod_subreason":"Food and product safety issues","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_listing_subreason":"Listing policy violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_other_subreason":"Other policy violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_auth_subreason":"Product authenticity customer complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_cond_subreason":"Product condition customer complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_review_subreason":"Customer Product Reviews Policy violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reason":"Repeat violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reg_comp_subreason":"Regulatory compliance","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rip_subreason":"Received intellectual property complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rp_subreason":"Restricted Product Policy","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_sip_subreason":"Suspected intellectual property violations","ahd_aef_at_risk_HD_card_body":"To reactivate your disbursements, review your priority actions and address the outstanding action items.","ahd_aef_at_risk_card_sc_body":"You have one or more outstanding action items that will result in account deactivation.","ahd_aef_critical_message":"This critical issue, if left unresolved, will cause your account to be deactivated.","ahd_aef_critical_message_no_caps":"This critical issue, if left unresolved, will cause your account to be deactivated.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_body":"Address your account health issues to reactivate your account. Once the issues have been resolved, your account will be reactivated within 24 hours.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_sc_body":"Address your Account Health issues to reactivate your account.","ahd_aef_denver_eu":"Verify EU Establishment for Value Added Tax (VAT)","ahd_aef_denver_info":"Information required","ahd_aef_denver_uk":"Verify UK establishment for Value Added Tax (VAT)","ahd_aef_educational_card_action":"Resolve issues","ahd_aef_impact_header":"Account health impact","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_post_deactivation":"Click the “Appeal” button below and follow the instructions provided in order to reactivate this selling account.","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_pre_deactivation":"Click the “Appeal” button below and follow the instructions provided in order to avoid deactivation of this selling account.","ahd_aef_next_steps_header":"Address your violation","ahd_aef_pending_critical":"Pending critical","ahd_aef_submit_header":"Submit your information","ahd_ahr_pending_critical":"Pending critical","ahd_all_issues":"All issues","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_body":"Your account will be considered for reactivation when your violations have been successfully appealed. ","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_header":"Your account has been deactivated. ","ahd_banner_block_mfn_at_risk_subtitle":"Your seller-fulfilled offers have been deactivated and your account is at risk of deactivation. Complete your Priority Actions to reactivate your seller-fulfilled offers and prevent deactivation.","ahd_banner_block_mfn_subtitle":"Your seller-fulfilled offers have been deactivated. Complete your Priority Actions to reactivate your seller-fulfilled offers.","ahd_banner_eg_trn":"<b>Your account is at-risk of deactivation. </b><br><br>Your account is at-risk of deactivation because your Seller Central account does not include your valid tax registration number. Visit the <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations> Tax Settings</a> page to update your tax information within 90 days of the date of your first product listing on Amazon to avoid account deactivation. For more information, see the “Tax compliance frequently asked questions” <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC> help page. </a>","ahd_banner_resolve_issues_button":"Resolve issues","ahd_be_jsl_at_risk_banner":"<b> Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br> You have not provided your Belgian VAT Registration Number (VRN) or confirmation of Union One-Stop Shop (OSS) status for your home country in your Amazon Seller Central account. Refer to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/external/GGTX8THLMMDJ3WBP> new Belgian legislation</a> to know more about the requirement and provide information.","ahd_be_jsl_priority_action":"Belgium VAT legislation","ahd_brkyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Check your verification status on the <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional\\n?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity information </a> page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"As per Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service, and you are required to provide us with certain information or documents in order to facilitate these checks. We may provide additional information about the request in your performance notifications.\\r\\n<br><br>Your account has been deactivated because we were not able to validate your identity information.<br><br> \\r\\nFor more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon </a> help page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_identity_info":"Go to the <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity information</a> page to complete verification.","ahd_brkyc_rap_intro":"As per Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You are required to provide us with certain information or documents in order to facilitate these checks. We may provide additional information about the request in your performance notifications.\\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nFor more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon </a> help page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_verifying":"We are validating your information and may need to request details from you during this review. Please check the <a href=\'/performance/notifications\\r\\n?ref_=to_brkyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance notifications</a> sections and respond to any requests relating to your Selling on Amazon account. This validation can take up to 24 hours and might take up to 10 working days in some cases. During this time, your identity information cannot be edited.","ahd_cakyc_rap_action_hd":"Provide your identity verification information by the due date shown to avoid account deactivation. If you do not start verification and have 15 days or less remaining, your ability to disburse funds from your Amazon.ca selling account will be restricted. Verification is required under Canadian law.","ahd_cakyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Check your verification status on the <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> identity information page</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"Your account has been deactivated because we were not able to validate your identity information.  Canadian laws require us to verify your identity so that we can allow you to use our service. To reactivate your account, submit information needed to verify your identity. \\r\\n<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page","ahd_cakyc_rap_identity_info":"Go to the <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> Identity information page</a> to complete verification. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_intro":"Canadian law requires us to verify your identity to allow you to use our service. We need you to provide us with certain information and documents so that we can conduct these verification checks. <br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page or refer to your <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance notifications</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_self_trigger_cta":"By clicking “Begin verification”, you are proceeding with the Canada verification requirements. Go to the<a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> identity information page</a> to confirm next steps. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_verifying":"We are validating your information. This validation can take between 24 hours and 10 working days, in some cases. We may need to request details from you during this review. Please check the <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a> section and respond to any additional requests relating to your Selling on Amazon account.  \\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nDuring this time, your identity information cannot be edited.","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph":"The verification of your identity is required by law for the use of a selling on Amazon account. As per Canadian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You may need to provide us with certain information and documents in order to facilitate these checks.<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph2":"Amazon allows up to 60 days for you to complete re-verification. The does not include the time we take to complete the review. Your ability to sell and disburse funds may be restricted if re-verification is not completed within 60 days. When we require information, a notification will appear on your Account information page. We may provide additional information about the request in your performance notifications. ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph3":"You will eventually be unable to use your Selling on Amazon account. Therefore, you will not be able to sell on Amazon.ca if the information is not provided. ","ahd_collusion_policy":"Selling policies and Seller Code of Conduct","ahd_compliance_status":"Compliance status","ahd_compliance_widget_ckp_redirect":"Launch compliance reference","ahd_critical_account_health_notification":"Critical Account Health notification","ahd_critical_policy_violations":"Critical policy violations","ahd_dac7_at_risk_banner":"<b>Your account is at-risk of deactivation.</b><br><br> Your account is at risk of being deactivated because of missing tax information required under  <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB\\"> DAC7 legislation</a>. Visit the <a href= \\"/complianceportal\\">DAC7 Compliance Portal</a>  to start verification. ","ahd_dac7_compliant":"You are DAC7 compliant now!","ahd_dac7_priority_action":"DAC7 information required","ahd_dac7_priority_action_pending":"Pending verification","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_launch_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Launch the DAC7 portal to submit your information</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal_status":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_status_blurb\'  target=\'_blank\'>Check your verification status on the DAC7 portal</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_intro":"The <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/external/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB?ref_=to_dac_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Directive on Administrative Cooperation – 7th Amendment (DAC7)</a> is an EU regulation that requires Amazon to collect, verify and report due diligence, VAT/tax and financial data of EU-resident sellers irrespective of the Amazon store that they sell in.","ahd_dac7_rap_verify_now_button":"Verify now","ahd_dac7_rap_verifying":"We are reviewing your DAC7 information. The review process usually takes 72 hours, but might take longer in some instances. Please check the status of your verification regularly in the DAC7 Portal below to know if we require more information.","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_description":"Go to the <a href=\'/hz/sc/account-information\' target=\'_blank\'>Account information</a> page to complete verification. ","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Your Amazon.ca (Canada) store is at risk of deactivation.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"You have outstanding action items before you can begin selling in the Amazon.com.br store.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"You have outstanding action items before you can begin selling in the Amazon.ca store.","ahd_eg_trn_deactivation_banner":"<b>Your account has been deactivated.</b><br><br> To reactivate your account, visit the <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations> Tax Settings</a> page to update your Tax information. For more information, see the “Tax compliance frequently asked questions” <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC>help page</a>. ","ahd_error_loading_submit":"An error has occurred. Please try submitting again.","ahd_eukyc_priority_action":"Identity Verification","ahd_inform_ac_checkbox_error":"Tick the box to confirm that you have reviewed your information and certify that it is accurate and current.","ahd_inform_ac_edu_display_name":"Review your account information","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p1":"Under the US INFORM Consumers Act, you are required to keep certain business information (shown below) current and to electronically certify to Amazon that either you have updated your information or that the information already provided is still current. Certify that your information below is up to date within 10 days of viewing this notice, or your account will be at risk of deactivation. ","ahd_inform_ac_p1_header":"Get ready to certify your information","ahd_inform_ac_page1_checkbox":"Tick the box to confirm that you have understood that once you go to the INFORM Act Notice and Certification page, you’ll receive a notice and have 10 days to update and certify your information.","ahd_inform_ac_page1_step1_intructions":"Go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Account Information</a> page or click the Edit button to update any information below that is incorrect. ","ahd_inform_ac_page2_certify_instructions":"If your information below is up to date, you can certify now. If any information is incorrect, go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Account Information</a>  page to edit your information before clicking “Certify”.","ahd_inform_account_information_update_verification":"Your account information has been updated and we are verifying your information. Check back in 24 hours to determine if any additional steps are needed to begin the Annual Certification process.","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_confirmation":"By clicking “Certify” I certify that I’ve read the Notice above and that the information I’ve provided to Amazon is true and correct, corresponds to my business and is not misappropriated.","ahd_inform_act_ac_edit_information":"Edit information","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"Email address","ahd_inform_act_ac_not_required":"The INFORM Act does not yet apply to your business so you’re not currently required to certify your information. We’ll notify you in the future if you’re required to certify your information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou":"Thank you for certifying that your business information is current. Your Account health page will be updated in a few minutes to confirm that you have completed your outstanding INFORM Act notice and certification requirement.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou_banner":"Thank you for certifying that your business information is current. Your account health page will be updated in a few minutes to confirm that you have completed your outstanding INFORM Act notice and certification requirement.\\n<br><br>Please remember that you are required to keep your business information current and to certify at least annually that your name, address, phone number, email address, bank account information and Tax ID number are correct.","ahd_inform_act_ac_tin_field":"Tax identification number (TIN):","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions":"Please note that only the primary user or secondary user with authorised permissions to Confirm/Edit account information will be able to certify the information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions_error":"This information must be certified by the Account’s primary user or a secondary user authorised with permissions to Confirm/Edit account information.","ahd_inform_act_account_information":"Account information","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_deactivation_banner":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Because we have not received the requested information, your account has been deactivated. To reactivate your account, review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to complete verification. <br><br>After you have completed verifications for all outstanding requirements, your account will be reactivated within 48 hours. ","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_hold_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation and disbursements for your Amazon selling account have been put on hold.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Because we have not received the requested information within the timelines specified in our communications, your disbursements are now placed on hold. To reactivate your disbursements, review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to start or complete your information submission.","ahd_inform_act_hold_wait_text":"To reactivate your disbursements and prevent your account from being deactivated, click the action items below to go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> and complete the pending requirements. <br><br>Thank you for completing identity verification. Check back in 24 hours to find out whether any additional verification steps are needed.","ahd_inform_act_hold_widget_description":"To reactivate your disbursements and prevent your account from being deactivated, click the action items below to go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> and complete the pending requirements. <br><br>After completing the identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_wait_text":"Click on the action items below to complete the pending requirements. Thank you for completing identity verification. Check in 24 hours to find out whether any additional verification steps are needed.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_widget_description":"Click on the action items below to complete the pending requirements. After completing the identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_need_help":"Need help? Visit the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act Help page</a>.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have successfully completed all open verifications. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete_short":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have successfully completed all open verifications. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_inform_act_wait_text":"Thank you for verifying Identity. Check back in 24 hours for confirmation of whether any additional information is needed. <br><br> Click the action items below to go to the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Seller Account Information</a> page and complete the pending requirements.","ahd_inform_act_widget_bank_account_field":"Bank account","ahd_inform_act_widget_business_address_field":"Business address","ahd_inform_act_widget_description":"Click the action items below to go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> page and complete the pending requirements. <br><br> After completing Identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_widget_phone_number_field":"Phone number","ahd_inform_act_widget_tax_id_field":"Tax ID number","ahd_inform_annual_certification":"Annual certification","ahd_inform_annual_review_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7?ref_=ahd_annual_ inform_consumer_act\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, your Selling on Amazon account information must be certified on an annual basis. Visit the <a href=\\"/mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render?ref_=ahd_annual_inform_certification\\">Annual Certification</a> page to certify that your information is current.","ahd_inform_annual_review_seller_enforced":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, you must certify the accuracy of your Selling on Amazon account information at least annually. Because we have not received the requested certification, your account has been deactivated. To reactivate your account, visit the <a href=\\" /mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render\\">Annual Certification</a> page to certify that your information is current. <br><br> Once you have completed certification, your account will be reactivated within 48 hours.","ahd_inform_bav_not_verified":"You don’t have a verified bank account or didn’t assign the verified bank account as your default deposit method to the US marketplace. Verify and assign your bank account as the default on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView> Deposit methods </a>page.","ahd_inform_company_registration_number":"Company registration number: ","ahd_inform_confirmation_p1":"Please remember that you are required to keep your business information current and to certify at least annually that your name, address, phone number, email address, bank account information and Tax ID number are correct.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p2":"If any of your information changes, Amazon will need to verify this new information as well. Please respond promptly to any information requests so that we can work with you to complete these additional verification steps and avoid account deactivation. For more information about the verification process, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act Help page</a>.","ahd_inform_consumers_act_ac":"INFORM Act Notice and Certification","ahd_inform_consumers_act_annual":"INFORM Consumers Act Annual Certification ","ahd_inform_loading_error":"Go to the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information target=\\"_blank\\">Account information</a> page to review your current information.","ahd_inform_no_default_deposit":"You don’t have a verified bank account or didn’t assign the verified bank account as your default deposit method to the US marketplace. Verify and assign your bank account as the default on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView> Deposit methods </a>page.","ahd_inform_page1_checkbox":"I understand that once I proceed to the INFORM Act Notice and Certification, I must complete certification within 10 days to avoid the risk of account deactivation. ","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2b":"However, you do not need to wait to receive the formal notification and can take action now to avoid the risk of account deactivation later.","ahd_inform_page1_proceed_title":"Proceed to INFORM Act Notice and Certification","ahd_inform_page1_step2_description":"If your information is up to date, or if you have just updated it, proceed to the next step – the Notice and Certification – to receive your formal notice and complete your certification. Once you’ve viewed this notice, the law requires you to certify your information within 10 days.","ahd_inform_sw_bav":"You must verify your active bank accounts. Verify your bank accounts here on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView> Deposit methods</a> page.","ahd_inform_update_account_information_educational":"Visit the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Annual Certification</a> page to ensure that your Selling on Amazon Account information is up to date.","ahd_itr_priority_action":"Italian tax ID for Italy-based sellers required.","ahd_itr_rap_intro":"The <a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a> requires Italy-based sellers who complete one or more transactions on Amazon.it to add their Italian codice fiscale in their Tax settings.","ahd_itr_remediation_corp":"Submit your Italian codice fiscale in the Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. According to our information (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), your account is registered as a company; therefore, we require your business registration number (known as your ‘codice fiscale’, which corresponds to your Value Added Tax (VAT) ID without the ‘IT’ country code). Please refer to the Help page (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a>) for submission steps. You must ensure that your legal name on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) and your business registration number in the Tax Settings<https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Tax Authority database.","ahd_itr_remediation_individual":"Submit your Italian codice fiscale in the Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. According to our information (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), your account is registered as an individual; therefore, we require your Citizen ID (known as your ‘codice fiscale’). Refer to the Help pages (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a>) for submission steps. You must ensure that your legal name on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) and Citizen ID number in the Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Tax Authority database.","ahd_itr_remediation_unkown":"Submit your information on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render). Companies must provide their business registration number (known as their ‘codice fiscale’, which corresponds to their Value Added Tax (VAT) ID without the ‘IT’ country code), while Individual sellers, including sole proprietors (‘P. IVA individuale’) must upload their personal Citizen ID (also known as their ‘codice fiscale’) in the Tax Settings<https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. You must ensure that your legal name on the Business Information Page <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render> and the codice fiscale in the Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Authority database.","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_details_fallback_text":"Have questions about maintaining a healthy account? Get personalized guidance from Seller Assistant.","ahd_more_information_hd":"More information","ahd_new_feature_announcement_body_new_filters":"You can now filter policy violations by action taken on affected listings. Go to the Product policy compliance page and click “Add filters” to filter violations.","ahd_other_policy_violation_title":"Other Policy Violations","ahd_payment_policy_hd_priority_action":"Your funds are on hold due to pending actions on your account. Review the <b>Priority actions</b> to reactivate your disbursements.","ahd_pp_mas_r_policies_code_of_conduct":"Selling policies and Seller Code of Conduct","ahd_pr_form_address_header":"Address non-compliant product penalties to continue selling your products.","ahd_pr_form_address_sub_header":"As per the guidance from DOJ, Amazon simplifies your regulatory compliance obligations by reporting and paying on behalf of your orders on Amazon and then recovering these amounts from your account.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_info":"In accordance with the EPA/DOJ Consent Decree, we are required to penalise sellers for any violations on policies pertaining to EPA. Please find more information on <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account/health/product-policies\\">Non-compliant products</a>, Calculate associated penalties, Reserves applied on your account and Communications sent to submit appeals. You will then be charged for any outstanding penalties.<br/><br/> Before we charge you for the penalties, we will place a hold on your account while giving you a chance to remediate your listing.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_title":"How does this work?","ahd_pr_form_impact_header":"Possible account impact is as detailed below:","ahd_pr_form_impact_p1":"Liability to pay penalties (refer to the violation details below)","ahd_pr_form_impact_p3":"Negative impact on your account health, which may lead to deactivation of your seller account","ahd_pr_form_note":"Please note: Before we charge you for the penalties, we will place a hold on your account for 30 days to give you a chance to remediate your listing.","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_body":"This product has been identified as a pesticide product, pesticide device or a product that contains pesticide claims. To be considered for reinstatement, please provide evidence of an EPA Registration number and/or EPA Establishment number or a certification that the product is exempt from EPA regulations. You will need to provide this information in the pesticide marking attribute for the listing. <a href=/help/hub/reference/GLX9EJX844SNJX7J> Instructions for completing this attribute are available on Seller Central.</a>","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_title":"Related policy information","ahd_pr_form_title":"Non-compliant product details","ahd_priority_actions_cr":"Cancellation Rate (CR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_lsr":"Late Shipment (LSR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_odr":"Order Defect Report (ODR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_otdr":"On-time delivery rate (OTDR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_title":"Priority actions","ahd_pspp_priority_actions":"Complete pending know your customer (KYC) review – payment service provider","ahd_pspp_rap_intro":"Your bank account is not eligible for receiving disbursement. Work with your payment service provider to complete the pending know your customer (KYC) review.","ahd_pspp_rap_next_steps":"Go to the <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GY8JTVAWBPQT2XFC?ref_=to_psp_faq_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Payment service provider FAQ</a> and <a href=\'/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView?ref_=to_deposit_method_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Deposit methods</a> page for more information. ","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory":"Countries impacted by inventory restrictions","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory_details":"Address the outstanding requirements to avoid disruption to your Fulfilled by Amazon inventory and your import or export capabilities in the listed country.","ahd_rap_at_risk_regional_details":"The listed requirements are impacting your account health in multiple stores. Address the outstanding requirements to avoid account deactivation in all impacted stores.","ahd_rap_begin_verification":"Begin verification ","ahd_rap_czech_republic":"Czechia","ahd_rap_enforced_inventory_details":"Address the outstanding requirements to remove the restrictions on your Fulfilled by Amazon Inventory and import or export capabilities in the listed country.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p1":"The verification of your identity is required by law for the use of a Selling on Amazon account. As required by Canadian and Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You may need to provide us with certain information and documents in order to facilitate these checks.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p3":"You can provide the required verification information at any time after you’ve registered. You will have limited access to your account until the information has been provided and verified.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p4":"If you would like to proceed and sell on Amazon.ca or Amazon.com.br, select the tick box next to the store that you would like to proceed with verification below. Once you have selected to proceed with verification, go to the Identity information page to determine next steps.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p5":"If you want to proceed with verification for a single store first, select only that store from the list below. Once you have completed verification for that store, you will be notified to complete the required steps to begin verification for the other store.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_thankyou_p2":"We are validating your information and may need to request details from you during this review. This validation can take up to 24 hours and might take up to 10 working days in some cases. During this time, your identity information cannot be edited.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_check_verification_status":"Check your verification status and required next steps on the Account information page.","ahd_rap_past_due_inventory":"PAST DUE – inventory capabilities restricted","ahd_rap_voluntary_submission_action":"Based on the information available to us, you are not required to hold a ${countryName} VAT number. To comply with this requirement, you can either remove it from <a href=\'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Tax settings</a> or proceed with resolving the issue above.","ahd_regulatory_compliance":"Regulatory Compliance","ahd_related_accounts_policy_reason":"Seller code of conduct (multiple selling accounts on Amazon)","ahd_sa_account_health_guidance_description":"Have questions about account health? Get personalised guidance from Seller Assistant.","ahd_sa_chat_about_account_health_text":"How\'s my Account Health?","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_label":"Summarise Product Compliance","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_text":"Can you summarise my product compliance violations?","ahd_save_changes_button":"Save changes","ahd_status_past_due":"Overdue","ahd_uaebizlicense_priority_action":"Upload your trade licence","ahd_vas_extension_extension_request_link":"submit the required documentation.","ahd_vas_priority_action":"European VAT registration requirements","ahd_vas_rap_deactivated_message":"The listed requirements are impacting your account health in multiple stores. Address the outstanding requirements for the listed country to reactivate your account in all impacted stores.","ahd_vas_rap_intro":"The <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GTQ23HPXBQK563WS\' target=\'_blank\'>European VAT registration requirements</a>  is a European Amazon Stores policy that requires all selling partners active in European stores to submit a valid VAT registration number whenever they have a requirement.  Review the Account health impact section to complete your outstanding requirements.","ahd_vas_rap_secondary_action":"If you do not have a VAT registration number for the listed country, go to the <a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>Business Information</a> portal and <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Tax Settings</a> portal to submit the required information (VAT number, name, address) for the following countries:","ahd_vas_rap_third_action":"If you have opted into Union One-Stop Shop in your home country, please visit <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Tax Settings</a> Page and select your home country from the Union One-Stop Shop Value Added Tax (VAT) Declaration menu. Ensure that your Union One-Stop Shop is enabled and that the name and address provided to Amazon match the ones provided to the Authorities.","ahd_vas_rap_verifying":"We are reviewing your VAT registration numbers details. This can take up to 14 days. We will contact you if additional information is required.","ahd_view_all_pa":"View all Priority Actions (${totalCount})","ahd_violation_appeal_button":"Proceed with appeal","ahd_violation_details":"Violation details","ahd_violation_display_name":"Restricted product policy violation","ahd_violation_status_assessment_phase":"Penalties in assessment phase – disbursements may be affected.","ahd_w8_priority_action":"Updated US Tax identity information required","ahd_w8_rap_action":"You are now required to complete your self-service tax interview before the due date. Your submission can take up to 24 hours to process.","ahd_w8_rap_deactivated_action":"Submit the required information to reactivate your account. Your submission can take up to 24 hours to process.","ahd_w8_rap_intro":"A new W-8 tax form is required. Once your form has expired, your selling account will be temporarily deactivated until you’ve provided updated tax information.\\n\\n<br><br>These requirements impact your account health in multiple stores.  Address the listed requirements to avoid account deactivation in all affected stores.\\n\\n<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G200663290?ref_=to_w8_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>US Income Reporting and Tax Identity Collection FAQ.</a>","ai_inform_page1_step1":"1. Go to your Account information page [link to Account information page here] to review your account information (and update, if necessary).","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Because Katal Components are extensions of HTML elements, JavaScript can interact with them the same as built-in HTML elements. Here we see JavaScript changing the “variant” attribute on the alert.","components_containing_html_text":"Some components may contain HTML content, such as our KatalTabs component. These complex components provide an API so that developers and frameworks can interact with them.","custom_elements_text":"Katal gives developers the ability to use custom-designed elements to build their web pages. For example, if the developer needs a button, they can use <kat-button></kat-button> instead of building a button themselves.","demo_complex_header_text":"Demonstration: Complex Katal Components","demo_components_header_text":"Demonstration: Using Katal Components","demo_javascript_header_text":"Demonstration: JavaScript with Katal Components","design_approved_text":"Katal offers design-approved components for use in web pages that can be configured with labels and custom settings. For example: regular buttons and secondary buttons, different only in their “variant” attribute.","discovery_ahd_ni_warn_pdp":"Product detail page","documentation_label":"Katal documentation","fba_inventory_uc_identifier":"Our records indicate that you are holding inventory in ${COUNTRY} through the Fulfilment by Amazon (FBA) programme. As a seller using FBA services, you are required to provide a valid VAT registration number for each country where your inventory is stored. You can verify the countries where you have enabled FBA <a href=/fba/settings/ target=\\"_blank\\">here</a>.\\nPlease bear in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","greeting_description":"This is a sample Katal application, demonstrating how to use Katal Components as well as build-and-deploy tooling. Please contact the Katal team at colombia-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments. To continue this demo, please dismiss this alert.","greeting_description_mons_app":"This is a sample Katal application, demonstrating how to use Katal Components with translations. Please contact the Katal team at katal-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments.","greeting_header":"Sample app information","information-requests":"Information requests","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Send feedback","mobile_ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"Please sign in to Seller Central from a web browser.","mobile_ahd_banner_eg_trn":"Update your tax registration number on the Tax Settings page in your Seller Central account.","poe_domestic_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicates that your sales in ${COUNTRY} exceed the domestic threshold for VAT registration.","ppc_fhdds_action_taken":"Risk of UK inbounding restriction","ppc_fhdds_action_taken_past_due":"UK inbounding capabilities are currently restricted","ppc_fhdds_reason":"FHDDS: Shipment missing Import Entry Number (IEN)","primary_button_label":"Primary button","product-policy-compliance":"Product policy compliance","sample_app_page_title_text":"Sample application","sc_homepage_education_phase_description":"Address your account health to avoid the risk of future account deactivation.","sc_inform_act_view_account_health_banner":"Go to account health","sc_navbar_ah_cs_desc":"View your customer service performance metrics, including your order defect and invoice defect rates.","sc_navbar_ah_desc":"View your Account Health Rating, issues affecting your Account Health and violations that may result in content removal or account deactivation.","sc_navbar_ah_eligibilities_desc":"View benefits and programmes that you may be eligible for.","sc_navbar_ah_myc_desc":"Ensure that all your products comply with all applicable, laws, regulations and Amazon policies.","sc_navbar_ah_sp_desc":"View your shipping performance metrics, including late shipment rate, pre-fulfilment cancellation rate, valid tracking rate and on-time delivery rate.  ","schp_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_subtitle":"Go to your Account health page and complete your priority actions to begin selling on Amazon.","schp_complete_priority_actions":"Complete your priority actions","secondary_button_label":"Secondary button","ship_from_non_poe_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are dispatching from ${COUNTRY}, which is different than your home country; therefore, you are required to provide a valid VAT information exchange system VAT number or applicable VAT number for EU transactions. You can verify your dispatching address from the Shipping Settings page or from this <a href=/sbr target=\\"_blank\\">link</a>.\\nPlease bear in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","ship_from_poe_uc_identifier":"Our records indicate that your cross-border sales exceed €10,000 across EU countries. As a seller engaged in cross-border sales, you are required to provide either UOSS-enabled VAT number from you establishment country or valid VAT numbers for all countries that you ship to.","ship_to_non_eu_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you have shipments exceeding €150 from outside EU into ${COUNTRY}. Therefore, you are required to provide a valid ${COUNTRY} VAT number or a declaration confirming that you are not the importer of record for the shipment(s) above threshold.","ship_to_uoss_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are conducting cross-border sales into ${COUNTRY} from other EU country and, therefore, you are required to provide an UOSS-enabled VAT number from your establishment country or valid ${COUNTRY} VAT number.\\nPlease bear in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","sp-permanent-call-me-now-title":"Need help?","sp_health_cancellation_rate_caption":"Pre-fulfilment cancellation rate","sp_health_customer_satisfaction_information_label":"Order Defect Report consists of three different metrics:","sp_health_dashboard_guardian_title_new":"Account Health Assurance","sp_health_dashboard_subheader":"To sell on Amazon, you must adhere to the below performance targets and policies.","sp_health_dashboard_title":"Account health","sp_health_download_report_caption":"Download report","sp_health_gl_watch":"Watch","sp_health_intellectual_property_customer_complaints":"Received intellectual property complaints","sp_health_late_shipment_rate_caption":"Late dispatch rate","sp_health_listing_policy_customer_complaints":"Listing Policy Violations","sp_health_mobile_by_ahr_impact_tab_title":"By Impact on Account Health Rating","sp_health_nav_myc":"Manage your compliance","sp_health_nav_orders_with_defects":"Orders with defects","sp_health_not_available":"N/A","sp_health_order_defect_rate_caption":"Order defect rate","sp_health_pre_fulfillment_cancel_rate":"Pre-fulfilment Cancel Rate","sp_health_product_policies":"Product policy compliance","sp_health_product_quality_popover":"This total will include complaints which you may have already addressed through a Plan of Action.","sp_health_product_safety_customer_complaints":"Food and product safety issues","sp_health_restricted_products_violations_policy":"Restricted Product Policy Violations","sp_health_risk_banner_vtr":"Your seller-fulfilled offers are at risk of deactivation. Your valid tracking rate is ${hash-get metricValue}; the target is ${hash-get target}.","sp_health_seller_fulfilled_metrics_caption":"Seller Fulfilled","sp_health_shipping_bucket_caption":"Shipping Performance","sp_health_shipping_eligibilities":"View delivery eligibilities here","sp_health_time_window":"Time Window: ${hash-get numDays} days","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_caption":"valid tracking rate","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_subtitle":"<b>Target</b>: over ${hash-get targetValue}","sp_health_violation_details_stale_page_button_label":"Back to account health","sp_mfn_at_risk_warning":"Your seller-fulfilled offers are at risk of deactivation","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_defects":"You do not currently have any defects of this order.","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_order":"This order doesn\'t exist.","sp_st_date_range":"${hash-get startDate}–${hash-get endDate}","sp_st_heading_order_asin":"ASIN","sp_st_heading_order_edd":"Expected Delivery Date","sp_st_heading_order_esd":"Expected Dispatch Date","sp_st_str_with_description":"${hash-get description}: ${hash-get str}","sp_st_zero_out_metrics_message":"Orders received prior to 1 June are not used to evaluate your account health and are not displayed here.","sp_vtr_list_ca":"1. Heavy and bulky items delivered by a carrier not integrated with Amazon. Learn more on integrated carriers.</br></br>2. Small and light items that have an order value less than CAD $30 (including delivery charges) and are delivered in Canada Post Standard Mail envelopes or First Class Mail envelopes.</br></br>3. International shipments dispatched from China that have an order value less than CAD $6 (including delivery charges)</br></br>4. International shipments dispatched from outside of the US and China.</br></br>5. Digital orders that cannot be physically delivered by a carrier, e.g. audio books","sp_zero_tolerance_banner_body":"Due to one or more critical violations, your account is pending deactivation. To prevent deactivation, please address these violations now. For more information, go to the <a href=/gp/help/G200205250>account health rating programme policy</a>.","tab_demo_generated_text":"Auto-generated tab {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Selected tab","ts-form-header":"Report abuse","valid_vat_number_uc_identifier":"Please bear in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","voluntary_vrn_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are not required to hold a VAT number in ${COUNTRY}, but you have provided one on Seller Central that is currently not valid. To resolve this discrepancy, you can either remove the ${COUNTRY} VAT number or provide a valid one. By removing your ${COUNTRY} VAT number from Seller Central, you are confirming that you are not required to hold one in ${COUNTRY}. We recommend consulting with a tax advisor to determine whether your overall business activities, both on and off Amazon, require VAT registration."}},"en-IN":{"pages.floatingWidget":{"DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_content":"You’re part of an experiment to improve seller experience: starting now, strong performance on Buyer Contact Rate, Contact Response Time and Buyer Dissatisfaction Rate can boost your AHR (Account Health Rating) score! This change helps AHR reward excellent customer service. Check your customer service performance on Feedback Manager now.","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_cta_done":"Feedback Manager","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_header":"Earn AHR points for strong customer service","DYK_JP_LINE_content":"Amazon LINE Official Account sends selected notifications about the notifications we sent via e-mail and Seller Central requiring actions by Sellers regarding topics such as your account’s status, listing status and payment disbursement errors. Connect your Seller Central account to the LINE official account to receive notifications via LINE and avoid missing important notifications. Learn More","DYK_JP_LINE_header":"You can connect with LINE account to receive personalised important messages that matters to your account health.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_content":"Great news! You\'re within 60 days of qualifying for Account Health Assurance (AHA). Maintain your Account Health Rating above 250 and keep a verified emergency contact number on file to secure enhanced account protection. We\'ll notify you via email once you\'re automatically enrolled.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_header":"Nearing Account Health Assurance enrolment","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_content":"Your Account Health Rating has moved into At Risk or Unhealthy status. Click “Call Me Now” to speak with an Account Health Specialist and protect your selling privileges.","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_cta_done":"Call Me Now","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_header":"Your Account Health Rating Needs Attention","DYK_SSAT_CFT_DietarySupp_content":"Protect your Dietary Supplement listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_Toys_content":"Protect your Toys category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_artscrafts_content":"Protect your Arts and Crafts Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_buttoncellbatteryproducts_content":"Protect your Button Cell Battery Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_childrensproducts_content":"Protect your Children\'s Products Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_cta_done":"Sign Up Today","DYK_SSAT_CFT_electronics_content":"Protect your Electronics Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_emobilityproducts_content":"Protect your E-Mobility Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_firesafety_content":"Protect your Fire Safety category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_furniture_content":"Protect your Furniture Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_header":"Simplify Compliance: Enrol in Compliance Fast-track Today","DYK_SSAT_CFT_infantbabyproducts_content":"Protect your Infant and Baby Products Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_ppe_content":"Protect your Personal Protection Equipment category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_EDU_JULY":"Keys to the Account Health Rating","DYK_SSAT_EDU_content":"AHR monitors your account\'s deactivation risk through a point system. You gain points for successfully fulfilling orders. You lose points when policy violations are detected, and recover points when you successfully address those violations. Review your Account Health dashboard often and address policy violations as they arise.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_content":"We’re excited to announce Seller Challenge, a new feature for Account Health Assurance sellers. Seller Challenge provides a limited number of opportunities to request a separate review of listing issues through your Account Health page. Once you submit a challenge, we strive to respond with a decision in 48 hours.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_cta_done":"Learn More","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop_header":"Healthy AHR Tip","ahd_dyk_bhdr_content":"We recommend delivering more than 90% of your Amazon Business commercial shipments during business hours to maintain a good customer experience","ahd_dyk_bhdr_cta":"View Performance","ahd_dyk_bhdr_header":"Your Business Hour Delivery Rate is low.","ahd_dyk_br_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Your Amazon.com.br (Brazil) store is at-risk of deactivation.","ahd_dyk_de_sup_label":"To comply with the EPR: Germany Single Use Plastic policy (effective since January 1, 2025), take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for each brand and product type combination. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GA4JYZX23CLK8WFW\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_de_sup_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): Germany Single Use Plastic","ahd_dyk_de_sup_weee_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): Germany WEEE","ahd_dyk_description_eukyc":"In accordance with EU regulations, you must complete an account verification process. Go to the Identity Information page to complete verification. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G201200780 \\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_label":"To comply with the Extended Producer Responsibility: take action now by providing Extended Producer Responsibility registration numbers for each brand and product type combination. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GYDCAK9ZR6VJH2X3\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR)","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_label":"To comply with the EPR: EU Batteries policy (effective from August 18, 2025), take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for your product categories. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GPVDATLHQ6PRQNSW\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): EU Batteries","ahd_dyk_fhdds_cta":"Review Shipments","ahd_dyk_fhdds_description":"Provide the import details for all your applicable shipments in your Shipping Queue before they disrupt your business. Missing import details could restrict your ability to create new UK shipments.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.com.br/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.com.br</a> store.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.ca/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.ca</a> store.","ahd_dyk_title_eukyc":"Complete your EU Know Your Customer (KYC) verification","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description":"To comply with the GPSR, which goes into effect on December 13, 2024, please provide additional compliance information for your products to avoid impact to your listings. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_task":"You have listings impacted by the General Product Safety Regulation (GPSR).","ahd_floating_widget_aha_ec_description":"As a member of the AHA programme, you are <b>required</b> to maintain a valid emergency contact number. Verify your emergency contact details to retain AHA eligibility, so our specialists can get in contact to help you address critical account health-related issues before they disrupt your business.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_action_panel_title":"Emergency Contact Information Update","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_food_and_safety_heading":"You have repeat violations for Food and Product Safety Issues","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_ip_heading":"You have repeat violations for Received Intellectual Property Complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_listing_heading":"You have repeat violations for Listing Policy Violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_other_heading":"You have repeat violations for Other Policy Violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_auth_heading":"You have repeat violations for Product Authenticity Customer Complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_cond_heading":"You have repeat violations for Product Condition Customer Complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_reviews_heading":"You have repeat violations for Customer Product Reviews Policy Violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_reg_comp_heading":"You have repeat violations for Regulatory Compliance","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_rp_heading":"You have repeat violations for Restricted Product Policy","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_sip_heading":"You have repeat violations for Suspected Intellectual Property Violations","ahd_floating_widget_resolve_now_button_text":"Resolve Now","cs_nerd_suggestion_top_issues_action_vi":"View Issues","dyk_ahd_pra_rv":"You have repeat violations for Customer Product Reviews Policy Violations"},"pages.homepage":{"AHD_DD14_Base_Reserve":"Sales proceeds are held through 14 days after delivery date and become available for disbursement starting on the 15th day after delivery date. If actual delivery date is not available, then we use the latest estimated delivery date for the order. This is your default payment policy.","AHD_POA_APPEAL_ERROR_LOADING":"An error happened. Please refresh the page.","DR_VAT_AHD_NC_BANNER":"We have not been able to verify your business establishment for VAT purposes. To ensure accurate tax treatment, verify your establishment for VAT purposes.","DR_VAT_AHD_PRIORITY_ACTION":"Establishment Verification Required for VAT Purposes","Engage_Appeal_05":"Seller code of conduct (favourably influencing customers to manipulate your sales ratings, feedback or reviews)","LocalizedPageTitleDashboard":"Performance Dashboard","LocalizedPageTitleDetailCustomerSatisfaction":"Customer Satisfaction details page.","LocalizedPageTitleDetailProductPolicies":"Product Policies details page.","NO_METRICS":"You currently do not have any orders counting toward this metric.\\n","RR_AHR_Warn_1":"Multiple Selling Accounts on Amazon","acf_banner_inform_act":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to start verification.","acf_inform_act_wait_text":"Thank you for verifying Identity. Check back in 24 hours for confirmation of whether any additional information is needed. ","acf_inform_act_widget_description":"After completing Identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","addTab_label":"Add Tab","aef_address_your_violation":"Address Your Violation","ags_pcx_voc_summary_voice_of_the_customer":"Voice of the Customer","ahd_Inform_deposit_method":"Deposit Method Information","ahd_account_impacted_details":"Your account may be impacted as detailed below:","ahd_account_regulatory_compliance":"Account Regulatory Compliance","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to start verification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_aha":"<b> Please note, if you have not completed all verification items when the INFORM Consumers Act takes effect, your account may be deactivated, regardless of your enrolment in Account Health Assurance.</b>","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_thankyou":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have successfully completed all open verifications. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_v2":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>US INFORM Consumers Act</a>, which goes into effect on June 27, 2023, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Visit the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Account Information</a> page to start verification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_school_supplies":"We have identified that you have listing(s) at risk of removal due to non-compliance to local, state and federal regulations regarding the sale of school supply products for children. To learn more about these compliance requirements, click <a href=/gp/help/external/help.html?itemID=XT3EFQS54LRKYM3&language=en_US&ref=ahd_uspc_adhoc_banner>here</a>. To prevent listing removal, please view your listings in scope of this compliance requirement <a href=/performance/account/health/product-policies?t=safe>here</a>, and follow the guidance listed under ‘Next Steps’ next to the listing(s) at risk of removal to ensure compliance with these requirements.","ahd_adhoc_mobile_inform_act_aha":"Note: If you do not complete all verification steps within the specified timelines, your account may be deactivated, regardless of your enrolment in Account Health Assurance.","ahd_aef_IPI_priority_action":"Virtual Identity Verification","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_join_call_link":"Visit <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">Identity Verification Portal</a> to join your scheduled video call.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_next_steps":"Visit the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">Identity Verification Portal</a> to submit required documents and join a video call for virtual identity verification. You also have option to schedule a video call on a future date and time after submitting required documents.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason":"A review of your business has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity; this can, in accordance with Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>, lead to account deactivation. To protect our customers and selling partners, we need to verify the identity of our sellers through a virtual identity verification process that takes place on a video call. ","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason_eu":"A review of your business has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity; this can, in accordance with Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G201190440\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>, lead to account deactivation. To protect our customers and selling partners, we need to verify the identity of our sellers through a virtual identity verification process that takes place on a video call.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_review_fail":"A review of your business and the information that you provided during your virtual identity verification, has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity, which is in violation of Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_under_review":"We are reviewing the information that you provided for identity verification. The review process may take up to 5 business days.","ahd_aef_action_panel_RA_reason":"Our review indicates that you have a separate account that was deactivated for violating one of our policies. As a result, the current selling account is in violation of our ‘Multiple Selling Accounts on Amazon’ policy outlined in the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G1801\\">Seller Code of Conduct</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_post_deactivation_appeal":"If you believe that your account has been deactivated in error, you can submit new information by clicking \'Appeal\' button below.","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_food_and_prod_subreason":"Food and Product Safety Issues","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_listing_subreason":"Listing Policy Violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_other_subreason":"Other Policy Violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_auth_subreason":"Product Authenticity Customer Complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_cond_subreason":"Product Condition Customer Complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_review_subreason":"Customer Product Reviews Policy Violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reason":"Repeat Violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reg_comp_subreason":"Regulatory Compliance","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rip_subreason":"Received Intellectual Property Complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rp_subreason":"Restricted Product Policy","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_sip_subreason":"Suspected Intellectual Property Violations","ahd_aef_at_risk_HD_card_body":"To reactivate your disbursements, review your Priority Actions and address the outstanding action items.","ahd_aef_at_risk_card_sc_body":"You have one or more outstanding action items that will result in account deactivation.","ahd_aef_critical_message":"This critical issue if left unresolved will cause your account to be deactivated.","ahd_aef_critical_message_no_caps":"This critical issue if left unresolved will cause your account to be deactivated.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_body":"Address your account health issues to reactivate your account. Once the issues have been resolved, your account will be reactivated within 24 hours.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_sc_body":"Address your account health issues to reactivate your account.","ahd_aef_denver_eu":"Verify EU Establishment for Value Added Tax (VAT)","ahd_aef_denver_info":"Information Required","ahd_aef_denver_uk":"Verify UK Establishment for Value Added Tax (VAT)","ahd_aef_educational_card_action":"Resolve Issues","ahd_aef_impact_header":"Account Health Impact","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_post_deactivation":"Click the ‘Appeal\' button below and follow the instructions provided in order to reactivate this selling account.","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_pre_deactivation":"Click the \'Appeal\' button below and follow the instructions provided in order to avoid deactivation of this selling account.","ahd_aef_next_steps_header":"Address Your Violation","ahd_aef_pending_critical":"Pending Critical","ahd_aef_submit_header":"Submit Your Information","ahd_ahr_pending_critical":"Pending Critical","ahd_all_issues":"All Issues","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_body":"Your account will be considered for reactivation when your violations have been successfully appealed. ","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_header":"Your account has been deactivated. ","ahd_banner_block_mfn_at_risk_subtitle":"Your seller-fulfilled offers have been deactivated and your account is at risk of deactivation. Complete your Priority Actions to reactivate your seller-fulfilled offers and prevent deactivation.","ahd_banner_block_mfn_subtitle":"Your seller-fulfilled offers have been deactivated. Complete your Priority Actions to reactivate your seller-fulfilled offers.","ahd_banner_eg_trn":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br>Your account is at risk of deactivation because your Seller Central account does not include your valid Tax Registration Number. Visit the <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations> Tax Settings</a> page to update your Tax information within 90 days from the date of your first product listing on Amazon to avoid account deactivation. For more information, see the “Tax compliance frequently asked questions” <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC> help page. </a>","ahd_banner_resolve_issues_button":"Resolve Issues","ahd_be_jsl_at_risk_banner":"<b> Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br> You have not provided your Belgian VAT Registration Number (VRN) or confirmation of Union One-Stop Shop (OSS) status for your home country in your Amazon Seller Central account. Refer to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/external/GGTX8THLMMDJ3WBP>new Belgian legislation</a> to know more about the requirement and provide information.","ahd_be_jsl_priority_action":"Belgium VAT Legislation","ahd_brkyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Check your verification status on the <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional\\n?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity Information </a> page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"As per Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service and you are required to provide us with certain information or documents in order to facilitate these checks. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications.\\r\\n<br><br>Your account has been deactivated because we were not able to validate your identity information.<br><br> \\r\\nFor more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_identity_info":"Visit the <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity Information</a> page to complete verification.","ahd_brkyc_rap_intro":"As per Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You are required to provide us with certain information or documents in order to facilitate these checks. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications.\\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nFor more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_verifying":"We are validating your information and may need to request details from you during this review. Please check the <a href=\'/performance/notifications\\r\\n?ref_=to_brkyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a> sections and respond to any requests relating to your Selling on Amazon account. This validation can take up to 24 hours and might take up to 10 working days in some cases. During this time, your Identity Information cannot be edited.","ahd_cakyc_rap_action_hd":"Provide your identity verification information by the due date shown to avoid account deactivation. If you do not start verification and have 15 days or less remaining, your ability to disburse funds from your Amazon.ca selling account will be restricted. Verification is required under Canadian law.","ahd_cakyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Check your verification status on the <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity Information page</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"Your account has been deactivated because we were not able to validate your identity information.  Canadian laws require us to verify your identity so that we can allow you to use our service. To reactivate your account, submit information needed to verify your identity. \\r\\n<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page","ahd_cakyc_rap_identity_info":"Visit the <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity Information page</a> to complete verification. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_intro":"Canadian law requires us to verify your identity to allow you to use our service. We need you to provide us with certain information and documents so that we can conduct these verification checks. <br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page or refer to your <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_self_trigger_cta":"By clicking \'Begin Verification\', you are proceeding with the Canada verification requirements. Visit the <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity Information page</a> to confirm next steps. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_verifying":"We are validating your information. This validation can take between 24 hours and 10 working days, in some cases. We may need to request details from you during this review. Please check the <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a> section and respond to any additional requests relating to your Selling on Amazon account.  \\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nDuring this time, your Identity Information cannot be edited.","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph":"The verification of your identity is required by law for the use of a selling on Amazon account. As per Canadian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You may need to provide us with certain information and documents in order to facilitate these checks.<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph2":"Amazon allows up to 60 days for you to complete re-verification. This does not include the time that we take to complete the review. Your ability to sell and disburse funds may be restricted if re-verification is not completed within 60 days. When we require information, a notification will appear on your Account Information page. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications. ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph3":"You will eventually be unable to use your selling on Amazon account. Therefore, you will not be able to sell on Amazon.ca if the information is not provided. ","ahd_collusion_policy":"Selling policies and Seller Code of Conduct","ahd_compliance_status":"Compliance Status","ahd_compliance_widget_ckp_redirect":"Launch Compliance Reference","ahd_critical_account_health_notification":"Critical Account Health Notification","ahd_critical_policy_violations":"Critical Policy Violations","ahd_dac7_at_risk_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation.</b><br><br> Your account is at risk of being deactivated because of missing tax information required under <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB\\">DAC7 legislation</a>. Visit the <a href= \\"/complianceportal\\">DAC7 Compliance Portal</a> to start verification. ","ahd_dac7_compliant":"You are DAC7 compliant now!","ahd_dac7_priority_action":"DAC7 Information Required","ahd_dac7_priority_action_pending":"Pending Verification","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_launch_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Launch the DAC7 Portal to submit your information</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal_status":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_status_blurb\'  target=\'_blank\'>Check your verification status on the DAC7 Portal</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_intro":"The <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/external/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB?ref_=to_dac_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Directive on Administrative Cooperation - 7th Amendment (DAC7)</a> is an EU regulation that requires Amazon to collect, verify and report due diligence, VAT/Tax and financial data of EU-resident Sellers irrespective of the Amazon store in which they sell.","ahd_dac7_rap_verify_now_button":"Verify Now","ahd_dac7_rap_verifying":"We are reviewing your DAC7 information. The review process usually takes 72 hours, but might take longer in some instances. Please check the status of your verification regularly in the DAC7 Portal below to know if we require more information.","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_description":"Go to the <a href=\'/hz/sc/account-information\' target=\'_blank\'>Account Information</a> page to complete verification. ","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Your Amazon.ca (Canada) store is at-risk of deactivation.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the Amazon.com.br store.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the Amazon.ca store.","ahd_eg_trn_deactivation_banner":"<b>Your account has been deactivated.</b><br><br> To reactivate your account, visit the <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations>Tax Settings</a> page to update your Tax information. For more information, see the “Tax compliance frequently asked questions” <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC>help page</a>. ","ahd_error_loading_submit":"An error happened. Please try submitting again.","ahd_eukyc_priority_action":"Identity Verification","ahd_inform_ac_checkbox_error":"Click the checkbox to confirm that you have reviewed your information and certify that it is accurate and current.","ahd_inform_ac_edu_display_name":"Review Your Account Information","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p1":"Under the US INFORM Consumers Act, you are required to keep certain business information (shown below) current and to electronically certify to Amazon that either you have updated your information or that the information already provided is still current. Certify that your information below is up-to-date within 10 days of viewing this notice, or your account will be at risk of deactivation. ","ahd_inform_ac_p1_header":"Get Ready to Certify Your Information","ahd_inform_ac_page1_checkbox":"Click the checkbox to confirm that you have understood that once you go to the INFORM Act Notice and Certification page, you will receive a notice and have 10 days to update and certify your information.","ahd_inform_ac_page1_step1_intructions":"Go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Account Information</a> page or click the Edit button to update any information below that is incorrect. ","ahd_inform_ac_page2_certify_instructions":"If your information below is up to date, you can certify now. If any information is incorrect, go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Account Information</a> page to edit your information before clicking \'Certify\'.","ahd_inform_account_information_update_verification":"Your account information has been updated and we are verifying your information. Check back in 24 hours to determine if any additional steps are needed to begin the Annual Certification process.","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_confirmation":"By clicking \\"Certify\\" I certify that I read the Notice above and that the information I provided to Amazon is true and correct, corresponds to my business and is not misappropriated.","ahd_inform_act_ac_edit_information":"Edit Information","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"Email","ahd_inform_act_ac_not_required":"The INFORM Act does not yet apply to your business so you are not currently required to certify your information. We will notify you in the future if you are required to certify your information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou":"Thank you for certifying that your business information is current. Your Account Health page will be updated in a few minutes to confirm that you have completed your outstanding INFORM Act Notice and Certification requirement.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou_banner":"Thank you for certifying that your business information is current. Your Account Health page will be updated in a few minutes to confirm that you have completed your outstanding INFORM Act Notice and Certification requirement.\\n<br><br>Please remember that you are required to keep your business information current and to certify at least annually that your name, address, phone number, e-mail address, bank account information and Tax ID number are correct.","ahd_inform_act_ac_tin_field":"Tax Identification Number (TIN):","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions":"Please note that only the primary user or secondary user with authorised permissions to Confirm/Edit Account Information will be able to certify the information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions_error":"This information must be certified by the Account’s primary user or a secondary user authorised with permissions to Confirm/Edit Account Information.","ahd_inform_act_account_information":"Account Information","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_deactivation_banner":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Because we have not received the requested information, your account has been deactivated. To reactivate your account, review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to complete verification. <br><br>Once you have completed verifications for all outstanding requirements, your account will be reactivated within 48 hours. ","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_hold_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation and disbursements for your Amazon selling account have been put on hold.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Because we have not received the requested information within the timelines specified in our communications, your disbursements are now placed on hold. To reactivate your disbursements, review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to start or complete your information submission.","ahd_inform_act_hold_wait_text":"To reactivate your disbursements and prevent your account from being deactivated, click on the action items below to go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> and complete the pending requirements. <br><br>Thank you for completing identity verification. Check back in 24 hours to find out whether any additional verification steps are needed.","ahd_inform_act_hold_widget_description":"To reactivate your disbursements and prevent your account from being deactivated, click on the action items below to go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> and complete the pending requirements. <br><br>After completing the identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_wait_text":"Click on the action items below to complete the pending requirements. Thank you for completing Identity verification. Check in 24 hours to find out whether any additional verification steps are needed.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_widget_description":"Click on the action items below to complete the pending requirements. After completing the Identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_need_help":"Need help? Visit the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act Help page</a>.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have successfully completed all open verifications. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete_short":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have successfully completed all open verifications. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_inform_act_wait_text":"Thank you for verifying Identity. Check back in 24 hours for confirmation of whether any additional information is needed. <br><br> Click on the action items below to go to the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Seller Account Information</a> page and complete the pending requirements.","ahd_inform_act_widget_bank_account_field":"Bank Account","ahd_inform_act_widget_business_address_field":"Business Address","ahd_inform_act_widget_description":"Click on the action items below to go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> page and complete the pending requirements. <br><br> After completing Identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_widget_phone_number_field":"Phone Number","ahd_inform_act_widget_tax_id_field":"Tax ID Number","ahd_inform_annual_certification":"Annual Certification","ahd_inform_annual_review_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7?ref_=ahd_annual_ inform_consumer_act\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, your Selling on Amazon account information must be certified on an annual basis. Visit the <a href=\\"/mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render?ref_=ahd_annual_inform_certification\\">Annual Certification</a> page to certify that your information is current.","ahd_inform_annual_review_seller_enforced":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, you must certify the accuracy of your Selling on Amazon account information at least annually. Because we have not received the requested certification, your account has been deactivated. To reactivate your account, visit the <a href=\\" /mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render\\">Annual Certification</a> page to certify that your information is current. <br><br> Once you have completed certification, your account will be reactivated within 48 hours.","ahd_inform_bav_not_verified":"You do not have a verified bank account or did not assign the verified bank account as your default deposit method to the US marketplace. Verify and assign your bank account as default on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Deposit Methods</a> page.","ahd_inform_company_registration_number":"Company Registration Number: ","ahd_inform_confirmation_p1":"Please remember that you are required to keep your business information current and to certify at least annually that your name, address, phone number, e-mail address, bank account information and Tax ID number are correct.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p2":"If any of your information changes, Amazon will need to verify this new information as well. Please respond promptly to any information requests so that we can work with you to complete these additional verification steps and avoid account deactivation. For more information about the verification process, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act Help page</a>.","ahd_inform_consumers_act_ac":"INFORM Act Notice and Certification","ahd_inform_consumers_act_annual":"INFORM Consumers Act Annual Certification ","ahd_inform_loading_error":"Go to the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information target=\\"_blank\\">Account Information</a> page to review your current information.","ahd_inform_no_default_deposit":"You do not have a verified bank account or did not assign the verified bank account as your default deposit method to the US marketplace. Verify and assign your bank account as default on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Deposit Methods</a> page.","ahd_inform_page1_checkbox":"I understand that once I proceed to the INFORM Act Notice and Certification, I must complete certification within 10 days to avoid the risk of account deactivation. ","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2b":"However, you do not need to wait to receive the formal notification, and can take action now to avoid the risk of account deactivation later.","ahd_inform_page1_proceed_title":"Proceed to INFORM Act Notice and Certification","ahd_inform_page1_step2_description":"If your information is up to date, or if you have just updated it, proceed to the next step – the Notice and Certification – to receive your formal notice and complete your certification. Once you view this notice, the law requires you to certify your information within 10 days.","ahd_inform_sw_bav":"You must verify your active bank accounts. Verify your bank accounts here on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Deposit Methods</a> page.","ahd_inform_update_account_information_educational":"Visit the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Annual Certification</a> page to ensure that your Selling on Amazon Account information is up to date.","ahd_itr_priority_action":"Italian tax ID for Italy-based sellers required.","ahd_itr_rap_intro":"The <a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a> requires Italy-based sellers who complete one or more transactions on Amazon.it to add their Italian codice fiscale in their Tax settings.","ahd_itr_remediation_corp":"Submit your Italian codice fiscale in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. According to our information (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), your account is registered as a company, and therefore we require your business registration number (known as \\"codice fiscale\\", corresponding to VAT ID without \\"IT\\" country code). Please refer to the Help page (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a>) for submission steps. You must ensure your legal name on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) and your business registration number in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Tax Authority database.","ahd_itr_remediation_individual":"Submit your Italian codice fiscale in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. According to our information (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), your account is registered as an individual, and therefore we require your Citizen ID (known as \\"codice fiscale\\"). Refer to the Help pages (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a>) for submission steps. You must ensure your legal name on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) and Citizen_ID number in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Tax Authority database.","ahd_itr_remediation_unkown":"Submit your information on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render). Companies must provide their business registration number (known as \\"codice fiscale\\", corresponding to VAT ID without \\"IT\\" country code), while Individual sellers, including sole proprietors (\\"P. IVA individuale\\") must upload their personal Citizen ID (also known as “codice fiscale”) in Tax Settings<https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. You must ensure your legal name on the Business Information Page <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render> and the codice fiscale in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Authority database.","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_details_fallback_text":"Have questions about maintaining a healthy account? Get personalised guidance from Seller Assistant.","ahd_more_information_hd":"More Information","ahd_new_feature_announcement_body_new_filters":"You can now filter policy violations by action taken on impacted listings. Go to the Product Policy Compliance page and click \\"Add Filters\\" to filter violations.","ahd_other_policy_violation_title":"Other Policy Violations","ahd_payment_policy_hd_priority_action":"Your funds are on hold due to pending actions on your account. Review the <b>Priority Actions</b> to reactivate your disbursements.","ahd_pp_mas_r_policies_code_of_conduct":"Selling policies and Seller Code of Conduct","ahd_pr_form_address_header":"Address Non-Compliant Product Penalties to continue selling your products.","ahd_pr_form_address_sub_header":"As per the guidance from DOJ, Amazon simplifies your regulatory compliance obligations by reporting and paying on behalf of your orders on Amazon and then recovering these amounts from your account.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_info":"In accordance with the EPA/DOJ Consent Decree, we are required to penalise Sellers for any violations on policies pertaining to EPA. Please find more information on <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account/health/product-policies\\">non-compliant products</a>, Calculate associated penalties, Reserves applied on your account, and Communications sent to submit appeals. You will then be charged for any outstanding penalties.<br/><br/> Before we charge you for the penalties, we will place a hold on your account while giving you a chance to remediate your listing.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_title":"How Does This Work?","ahd_pr_form_impact_header":"Possible account impact are as detailed below:","ahd_pr_form_impact_p1":"Liability to pay penalties (refer to violation details below","ahd_pr_form_impact_p3":"Negative impact on your account health which may lead to deactivation of your seller account","ahd_pr_form_note":"Please note that before we charge you for the penalties, we will place a hold on your account for 30 days while giving you a chance to remediate your listing.","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_body":"This product has been identified as a pesticide product, pesticide device or a product that contains pesticide claims. To be considered for reinstatement, please provide evidence of an EPA Registration number and/or EPA Establishment number or a certification that the product is exempt from EPA regulations. You will need to provide this information in the Pesticide Marking attribute for the listing. <a href=/help/hub/reference/GLX9EJX844SNJX7J> Instructions for completing this attribute are available on Seller Central.</a>","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_title":"Related Policy Information","ahd_pr_form_title":"Non-Compliant Product Details","ahd_priority_actions_cr":"Cancellation Rate (CR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_lsr":"Late Shipment Rate (LSR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_odr":"Order Defect Rate (ODR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_otdr":"On-Time Delivery Rate (OTDR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_title":"Priority Actions","ahd_pspp_priority_actions":"Complete pending Know Your Customer (KYC) review – Payment Service Provider","ahd_pspp_rap_intro":"Your bank account is not eligible for receiving disbursement. Work with your Payment Service Provider to complete pending know-your-customer (KYC) review.","ahd_pspp_rap_next_steps":"Go to the <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GY8JTVAWBPQT2XFC?ref_=to_psp_faq_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Payment Service Provider FAQ</a> and <a href=\'/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView?ref_=to_deposit_method_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Deposit Methods</a> page for more information. ","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory":"Countries Impacted by Inventory Restrictions","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory_details":"Address the outstanding requirements to avoid disruption to your Fulfilled by Amazon Inventory and your import or export capabilities in the listed country.","ahd_rap_at_risk_regional_details":"The listed requirements are impacting your account health in multiple stores. Address the outstanding requirements to avoid account deactivation in all impacted stores.","ahd_rap_begin_verification":"Begin Verification ","ahd_rap_czech_republic":"Czech Republic","ahd_rap_enforced_inventory_details":"Address the outstanding requirements to remove the restrictions on your Fulfilled by Amazon Inventory and import or export capabilities in the listed country.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p1":"The verification of your identity is required by law for the use of a selling on Amazon account. As required by Canadian and Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You may need to provide us with certain information and documents in order to facilitate these checks.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p3":"You can provide the required verification information at any time after you have registered. You will have limited access to your account until the information has been provided and verified.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p4":"If you would like to proceed and sell on Amazon.ca or Amazon.com.br, select the checkbox next to the store that you would like to proceed with verification below. Once you have selected to proceed with verification, visit the Identity Information page to determine next steps.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p5":"If you want to proceed with verification for a single store first, select only that store from the list below. Once you have completed verification for that store, you will be notified to complete the required steps to begin verification for the other store.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_thankyou_p2":"We are validating your information and may need to request details from you during this review. This validation can take up to 24 hours and might take up to 10 working days in some cases. During this time, your Identity Information cannot be edited.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_check_verification_status":"Check your verification status and required next steps on the Account Information page.","ahd_rap_past_due_inventory":"PAST DUE - Inventory Capabilities Restricted","ahd_rap_voluntary_submission_action":"Based on the information available to us you are not required to hold a ${countryName} VAT number. To comply with this requirement, you can either remove it from <a href=\'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Tax Settings</a> or proceed with resolving the issue above.","ahd_regulatory_compliance":"Regulatory Compliance","ahd_related_accounts_policy_reason":"Seller code of conduct (Multiple Selling Accounts on Amazon)","ahd_sa_account_health_guidance_description":"Have questions about account health? Get personalised guidance from Seller Assistant.","ahd_sa_chat_about_account_health_text":"How\'s my Account Health?","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_label":"Summarise Product Compliance","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_text":"Can you summarise my product compliance violations?","ahd_save_changes_button":"Save Changes","ahd_status_past_due":"Past Due","ahd_uaebizlicense_priority_action":"Upload your trade licence","ahd_vas_extension_extension_request_link":"submit the required documentation.","ahd_vas_priority_action":"European VAT Registration Requirements","ahd_vas_rap_deactivated_message":"The listed requirements are impacting your account health in multiple stores. Address the outstanding requirements for the listed country to reactivate your account in all impacted stores.","ahd_vas_rap_intro":"The <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GTQ23HPXBQK563WS\' target=\'_blank\'>European VAT registration requirements</a> is a European Amazon Stores policy that requires all Selling Partners active in European stores to submit a valid VAT registration number whenever they have a requirement.  Review the Account Health Impact section to complete your outstanding requirements.","ahd_vas_rap_secondary_action":"If you do not have a VAT Registration Number for the listed country, visit the <a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>Business Information</a> portal and <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Tax Settings</a> portal to submit the required information (VAT number, name, address) for the following countries:","ahd_vas_rap_third_action":"If you have opted into Union One-Stop Shop (OSS) in your home country, please visit <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Tax Settings</a> Page and select your home country from the Union One-Stop Shop (OSS) Value Added Tax (VAT) Declaration menu. Ensure your Union One-Stop Shop (OSS) is enabled and that the name and address provided to Amazon match the ones provided to Authorities.","ahd_vas_rap_verifying":"We are reviewing your VAT Registration Numbers details. This can take up to 14 days. We will contact you if additional information is required.","ahd_view_all_pa":"View all Priority Actions (${totalCount})","ahd_violation_appeal_button":"Proceed with Appeal","ahd_violation_details":"Violation Details","ahd_violation_display_name":"Restricted Product Policy Violation","ahd_violation_status_assessment_phase":"Penalties in Assessment Phase - Disbursements may be impacted.","ahd_w8_priority_action":"Updated U.S. Tax Identity Information Required","ahd_w8_rap_action":"You are now required to complete your self-service tax interview before the due date. Your submission can take up to 24 hours to be processed.","ahd_w8_rap_deactivated_action":"Submit the required information to reactivate your account. Your submission can take up to 24 hours to be processed.","ahd_w8_rap_intro":"A new W-8 tax form is required. Once your form expires, your selling account will be temporarily deactivated until you provide updated tax information.\\n\\n<br><br>These requirements impact your account health in multiple stores.  Address the listed requirements to avoid account deactivation in all impacted stores.\\n\\n<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G200663290?ref_=to_w8_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>US Income Reporting & Tax Identity Collection FAQ.</a>","ai_inform_page1_step1":"1. Go to your Account Information page [link to Account Information page here] to review your account information (and update, if necessary).","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Because Katal Components are extensions of HTML elements, JavaScript can interact with them in the same way as built-in HTML elements. Here we see JavaScript changing the \'variant\' attribute on the alert.","components_containing_html_text":"Some components can contain HTML content, like our KatalTabs component. These complex components provide an API so developers and frameworks can interact with them.","custom_elements_text":"Katal gives developers the ability to use custom-designed elements to build their web pages. For example, if the developer needs a button, then they can use <kat-button></kat-button> instead of building a button themselves.","demo_complex_header_text":"Demonstration: Complex Katal Components","demo_components_header_text":"Demonstration: Using Katal Components","demo_javascript_header_text":"Demonstration: JavaScript with Katal Components","design_approved_text":"Katal offers design-approved components for use in web pages that can be configured with labels and custom settings. For example: regular buttons and secondary buttons, different only in their \'variant\' attribute.","discovery_ahd_ni_warn_pdp":"Product Detail Page","documentation_label":"Katal Documentation","fba_inventory_uc_identifier":"Our records indicate that you are holding inventory in ${COUNTRY} through the Fulfilled by Amazon (FBA) programme. As a seller using FBA services, you are required to provide a valid VAT registration number for each country where your inventory is stored. You can verify the countries where you have enabled FBA <a href=/fba/settings/ target=\\"_blank\\">here</a>.\\nPlease keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","greeting_description":"This is a sample Katal application, demonstrating how to use Katal Components as well as build-and-deploy tooling. Please contact the Katal team at colombia-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments. To continue this demo, please dismiss this alert.","greeting_description_mons_app":"This is a sample Katal application, demonstrating how to use Katal Components with translations. Please contact the Katal team at katal-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments.","greeting_header":"Sample App Information","information-requests":"Information Requests","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Send Feedback","mobile_ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"Please sign in to Seller Central from a web browser.","mobile_ahd_banner_eg_trn":"Update your tax registration number on the Tax Settings page in your Seller Central account.","poe_domestic_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that your sales in ${COUNTRY} exceed the domestic threshold for VAT registration.","ppc_fhdds_action_taken":"Risk of UK inbound restriction","ppc_fhdds_action_taken_past_due":"UK inbound capabilities are currently restricted","ppc_fhdds_reason":"FHDDS: Shipment Missing Import Entry Number (IEN)","primary_button_label":"Primary Button","product-policy-compliance":"Product Policy Compliance","sample_app_page_title_text":"Sample Application","sc_homepage_education_phase_description":"Address your account health to avoid the risk of future account deactivation.","sc_inform_act_view_account_health_banner":"Go to Account Health","sc_navbar_ah_cs_desc":"View your customer service performance metrics, including your order defect and invoice defect rates.","sc_navbar_ah_desc":"View your Account Health Rating, issues impacting your account health and violations that may result in content removal or account deactivation.","sc_navbar_ah_eligibilities_desc":"View benefits and programmes for which you may be eligible.","sc_navbar_ah_myc_desc":"Ensure that all your products comply with all applicable laws, regulations and Amazon policies.","sc_navbar_ah_sp_desc":"View your shipping performance metrics, including Late Shipment Rate, Pre-fulfilment Cancellation Rate, Valid Tracking Rate and On-Time Delivery Rate.  ","schp_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_subtitle":"Go to your Account Health page and complete your Priority Actions to begin selling on Amazon.","schp_complete_priority_actions":"Complete your Priority Actions","secondary_button_label":"Secondary Button","ship_from_non_poe_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are shipping from ${COUNTRY}, which is different than your home country; therefore, you are required to provide a valid VAT Information Exchange System (VIES) VAT number or applicable VAT number for EU transactions. You can verify your shipping address from the Shipping Settings page or from this <a href=/sbr target=\\"_blank\\">link</a>.\\nPlease keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","ship_from_poe_uc_identifier":"Our records indicate that your cross-border sales exceed €10,000 across EU countries. As a seller engaged in cross-border sales, you are required to provide either UOSS-enabled VAT number from your establishment country or valid VAT numbers for all countries to which you ship.","ship_to_non_eu_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you have shipments exceeding €150 from outside EU into ${COUNTRY}. Therefore, you are required to provide a valid ${COUNTRY} VAT number or a declaration confirming that you are not the Importer Of Record for the shipment(s) above threshold.","ship_to_uoss_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are conducting cross-border sales into ${COUNTRY} from other EU country and, therefore, you are required to provide an UOSS-enabled VAT number from your establishment country or valid ${COUNTRY} VAT number.\\nPlease keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","sp-permanent-call-me-now-title":"Need Help?","sp_health_cancellation_rate_caption":"Pre-fulfilment Cancel Rate","sp_health_customer_satisfaction_information_label":"Order Defect Rate consists of three different metrics:","sp_health_dashboard_guardian_title_new":"Account Health Assurance","sp_health_dashboard_subheader":"To sell on Amazon, you must adhere to the below performance targets and policies.","sp_health_dashboard_title":"Account Health","sp_health_download_report_caption":"Download Report","sp_health_gl_watch":"Watch","sp_health_intellectual_property_customer_complaints":"Received Intellectual Property Complaints","sp_health_late_shipment_rate_caption":"Late Dispatch Rate","sp_health_listing_policy_customer_complaints":"Listing Policy Violations","sp_health_mobile_by_ahr_impact_tab_title":"By Account Health Rating Impact","sp_health_nav_myc":"Manage Your Compliance","sp_health_nav_orders_with_defects":"Orders with Defects","sp_health_not_available":"N/A ","sp_health_order_defect_rate_caption":"Order Defect Rate","sp_health_pre_fulfillment_cancel_rate":"Pre-fulfillment Cancel Rate","sp_health_product_policies":"Product Policy Compliance","sp_health_product_quality_popover":"This total will include complaints which you may have already addressed through a Plan of Action.","sp_health_product_safety_customer_complaints":"Food and Product Safety Issues","sp_health_restricted_products_violations_policy":"Restricted Product Policy Violations","sp_health_risk_banner_vtr":"Your seller-fulfilled offers are at risk of deactivation. Your Valid Tracking Rate is ${hash-get metricValue}; the target is ${hash-get target}.","sp_health_seller_fulfilled_metrics_caption":"Seller Fulfilled","sp_health_shipping_bucket_caption":"Shipping Performance","sp_health_shipping_eligibilities":"View shipping eligibilities here","sp_health_time_window":"Time Window: ${hash-get numDays} days","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_caption":"Valid Tracking Rate","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_subtitle":"<b>Target</b>: over ${hash-get targetValue}","sp_health_violation_details_stale_page_button_label":"Back to Account Health","sp_mfn_at_risk_warning":"Your seller-fulfilled offers are at risk of deactivation","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_defects":"You do not currently have any defects for this order.","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_order":"This order doesn\'t exist.","sp_st_date_range":"${hash-get startDate} - ${hash-get endDate}","sp_st_heading_order_asin":"ASIN","sp_st_heading_order_edd":"Expected Deliver Date","sp_st_heading_order_esd":"Expected Ship Date","sp_st_str_with_description":"${hash-get description}: ${hash-get str}","sp_st_zero_out_metrics_message":"Orders received prior to June 1 are not used to evaluate your account health and do not display here.","sp_vtr_list_ca":"1. Heavy and bulky items shipped by a carrier not integrated with Amazon. Learn more on integrated carriers.</br></br>2. Small and light items that have order value less than $CAD 30 (including shipping charges) and are shipped in Canada Post Standard Mail envelopes or First Class Mail envelopes.</br></br>3. International shipments shipped from China that have order value less than $CAD 6 (including shipping charges)</br></br>4. International shipments shipped from outside of US and China.</br></br>5. Digital orders that cannot physically shipped by a carrier, e.g. Audio book","sp_zero_tolerance_banner_body":"Due to one or more critical violations, your account is pending deactivation. To prevent deactivation, please address these violations now. For more information, go to the <a href=/gp/help/G200205250>Account Health Rating programme policy</a>.","tab_demo_generated_text":"Auto Generated Tab {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Selected Tab","ts-form-header":"Report an abuse","valid_vat_number_uc_identifier":"Please keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","voluntary_vrn_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are not required to hold a VAT number in ${COUNTRY} but you have provided one on Seller Central that is currently not valid. To resolve this discrepancy, you can either remove the ${COUNTRY} VAT Number or provide a valid one. By removing your ${COUNTRY} VAT Number from Seller Central, you are confirming that you are not required to hold one in ${COUNTRY}. We recommend consulting with a tax adviser to determine whether your overall business activities, both on and off Amazon, require VAT registration."}},"en-SG":{"pages.floatingWidget":{"DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_content":"You\'re part of an experiment to improve seller experience: starting now, strong performance on Buyer Contact Rate, Contact Response Time and Buyer Dissatisfaction Rate can boost your AHR score! This change helps AHR reward excellent customer service. Check your customer service performance on Feedback Manager now.","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_cta_done":"Feedback Manager","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_header":"Earn AHR (Account Health Rating) points for strong customer service","DYK_JP_LINE_content":"Amazon LINE Official Account sends selected notifications about the notifications we sent via email and Seller Central requiring actions by Sellers regarding topics such as your account’s status, listing status and payment disbursement errors. Connect your Seller Central account to the LINE official account to receive notifications via LINE and avoid missing important notifications. Learn More","DYK_JP_LINE_header":"You can connect with LINE account to receive personalised important messages that matters to your account health.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_content":"Great news! You\'re within 60 days of qualifying for Account Health Assurance (AHA). Maintain your Account Health Rating above 250 and keep a verified emergency contact number on file to secure enhanced account protection. We\'ll notify you via email once you\'re automatically enrolled.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_header":"Nearing Account Health Assurance enrolment","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_content":"Your Account Health Rating has moved into At Risk or Unhealthy status. Click “Call Me Now” to speak with an Account Health Specialist and protect your selling privileges.","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_cta_done":"Call Me Now","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_header":"Your Account Health Rating Needs Attention","DYK_SSAT_CFT_DietarySupp_content":"Protect your Dietary Supplement listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_Toys_content":"Protect your Toys category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_artscrafts_content":"Protect your Arts and Crafts Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_buttoncellbatteryproducts_content":"Protect your Button Cell Battery Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_childrensproducts_content":"Protect your Children\'s Products Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_cta_done":"Sign Up Today","DYK_SSAT_CFT_electronics_content":"Protect your Electronics Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_emobilityproducts_content":"Protect your E-Mobility Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_firesafety_content":"Protect your Fire Safety category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_furniture_content":"Protect your Furniture Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_header":"Simplify Compliance: Enroll in Compliance Fast-track Today","DYK_SSAT_CFT_infantbabyproducts_content":"Protect your Infant and Baby Products Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_ppe_content":"Protect your Personal Protection Equipment category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_EDU_JULY":"Keys to the Account Health Rating","DYK_SSAT_EDU_content":"AHR monitors your account\'s deactivation risk through a point system. You gain points for successfully fulfilling orders. You lose points when policy violations are detected and recover points when you successfully address those violations. Review your Account Health dashboard often and address policy violations as they arise.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_content":"We’re excited to announce Seller Challenge, a new feature for Account Health Assurance sellers. Seller Challenge provides a limited number of opportunities to request a separate review of listing issues through your Account Health page. Once you submit a challenge, we strive to respond with a decision in 48 hours.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_cta_done":"Learn More","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop_header":"Healthy AHR Tip","ahd_dyk_bhdr_content":"We recommend delivering more than 90% of your Amazon Business commercial shipments during business hours to maintain a good customer experience","ahd_dyk_bhdr_cta":"View Performance","ahd_dyk_bhdr_header":"Your Business Hour Delivery Rate is low.","ahd_dyk_br_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Your Amazon.com.br (Brazil) store is at-risk of deactivation.","ahd_dyk_de_sup_label":"To comply with the EPR: Germany Single Use Plastic policy (effective since January 1, 2025), take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for each brand and product type combination. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GA4JYZX23CLK8WFW\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_de_sup_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): Germany Single Use Plastic","ahd_dyk_de_sup_weee_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): Germany WEEE","ahd_dyk_description_eukyc":"In accordance with EU regulations, you must complete an account verification process. Go to the Identity Information page to complete verification. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G201200780 \\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_label":"To comply with the EPR: take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for each brand and product type combination. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GYDCAK9ZR6VJH2X3\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR)","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_label":"To comply with the EPR: EU Batteries policy (effective from August 18, 2025), take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for your product categories. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GPVDATLHQ6PRQNSW\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): EU Batteries","ahd_dyk_fhdds_cta":"Review Shipments","ahd_dyk_fhdds_description":"Provide the import details for all your applicable shipments in your Shipping Queue before they disrupt your business. Missing import details could restrict your ability to create new UK shipments.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.com.br/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.com.br</a> store.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.ca/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.ca</a> store.","ahd_dyk_title_eukyc":"Complete your EU Know Your Customer (KYC) verification","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description":"To comply with the GPSR, which goes into effect on December 13, 2024, please provide additional compliance information for your products to avoid impact to your listings. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_task":"You have listings impacted by the General Product Safety Regulation (GPSR).","ahd_floating_widget_aha_ec_description":"As a member of the AHA programme, you are <b>required</b> to maintain a valid emergency contact number. Verify your emergency contact details to retain AHA eligibility, so our specialists can get in contact to help you address critical account health-related issues before they disrupt your business.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_action_panel_title":"Emergency Contact Information Update","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_food_and_safety_heading":"You have repeat violations for Food and Product Safety Issues","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_ip_heading":"You have repeat violations for Received Intellectual Property Complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_listing_heading":"You have repeat violations for Listing Policy Violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_other_heading":"You have repeat violations for Other Policy Violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_auth_heading":"You have repeat violations for Product Authenticity Customer Complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_cond_heading":"You have repeat violations for Product Condition Customer Complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_reviews_heading":"You have repeat violations for Customer Product Reviews Policy Violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_reg_comp_heading":"You have repeat violations for Regulatory Compliance","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_rp_heading":"You have repeat violations for Restricted Product Policy","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_sip_heading":"You have repeat violations for Suspected Intellectual Property Violations","ahd_floating_widget_resolve_now_button_text":"Resolve Now","cs_nerd_suggestion_top_issues_action_vi":"View Issues","dyk_ahd_pra_rv":"You have repeat violations for Customer Product Reviews Policy Violations"},"pages.homepage":{"AHD_DD14_Base_Reserve":"Sales proceeds are held for 14 days after the delivery date and become available for disbursement starting on the 15th day after the delivery date. If the actual delivery date is not available, we use the latest estimated delivery date for the order. This is your default payment policy.","AHD_POA_APPEAL_ERROR_LOADING":"An error happened. Please refresh the page.","DR_VAT_AHD_NC_BANNER":"We\'ve not been able to verify your business establishment for VAT purposes. To ensure accurate tax treatment, verify your establishment for VAT purposes.","DR_VAT_AHD_PRIORITY_ACTION":"Establishment Verification Required for VAT Purposes","Engage_Appeal_05":"Seller code of conduct (favourably influencing customers to manipulate your sales ratings, feedback or reviews)","LocalizedPageTitleDashboard":"Performance Dashboard","LocalizedPageTitleDetailCustomerSatisfaction":"Customer Satisfaction details page.","LocalizedPageTitleDetailProductPolicies":"Product Policies details page.","NO_METRICS":"You currently don’t have any orders counting toward this metric.\\n","RR_AHR_Warn_1":"Multiple Selling Accounts on Amazon","acf_banner_inform_act":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to start verification.","acf_inform_act_wait_text":"Thank you for verifying Identity. Check back in 24 hours for confirmation of whether any additional information is needed. ","acf_inform_act_widget_description":"After completing identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","addTab_label":"Add Tab","aef_address_your_violation":"Address Your Violation","ags_pcx_voc_summary_voice_of_the_customer":"Voice of the Customer","ahd_Inform_deposit_method":"Deposit Method Information","ahd_account_impacted_details":"Your account may be impacted as detailed below:","ahd_account_regulatory_compliance":"Account Regulatory Compliance","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to start verification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_aha":"<b> Please note, if you have not completed all verification items when the INFORM Consumers Act takes effect, your account may be deactivated, regardless of your enrolment in Account Health Assurance.</b>","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_thankyou":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have successfully completed all open verifications. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_v2":"<b>Your account is at-risk of deactivation.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>US INFORM Consumers Act</a>, which goes into effect on June 27, 2023, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Visit the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Account Information</a> page to start verification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_school_supplies":"We’ve identified you have listing(s) at risk of removal due to non-compliance to local, state, and federal regulations regarding the sale of school supply products for children. To learn more about these compliance requirements, click <a href=/gp/help/external/help.html?itemID=XT3EFQS54LRKYM3&language=en_US&ref=ahd_uspc_adhoc_banner>here</a>. To prevent listing removal, please view your listings in scope of this compliance requirement <a href=/performance/account/health/product-policies?t=safe>here</a>, and follow the guidance listed under ‘Next Steps’ next to the listing(s) at risk of removal to ensure compliance with these requirements.","ahd_adhoc_mobile_inform_act_aha":"Note: If you do not complete all verification steps within the specified timelines, your account may be deactivated, regardless of your enrollment in Account Health Assurance.","ahd_aef_IPI_priority_action":"Virtual Identity Verification","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_join_call_link":"Visit <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">Identity Verification Portal</a> to join your scheduled video call.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_next_steps":"Visit the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">Identity Verification Portal</a>, to submit required documents and join a video call for virtual identity verification. You also have option to schedule a video call on a future date and time after submitting required documents.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason":"A review of your business has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity; this can, in accordance with Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>, lead to account deactivation. To protect our customers and selling partners, we need to verify the identity of our sellers through a virtual identity verification process that takes place on a video call. ","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason_eu":"A review of your business has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity; this can, in accordance with Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G201190440\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>, lead to account deactivation. To protect our customers and selling partners, we need to verify the identity of our sellers through a virtual identity verification process that takes place on a video call.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_review_fail":"A review of your business and the information you provided during your virtual identity verification, has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity, which is in violation of Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_under_review":"We are reviewing the information you provided for identity verification. The review process may take up to 5 business days.","ahd_aef_action_panel_RA_reason":"Our review indicates that you have a separate account that was deactivated for violating one of our policies. As a result, the current selling account is in violation of our ‘Multiple Selling Accounts on Amazon’ policy outlined in the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G1801\\">Seller Code of Conduct</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_post_deactivation_appeal":"If you believe your account has been deactivated in error, you can submit new information by clicking \'Appeal\' button below.","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_food_and_prod_subreason":"Food and Product Safety Issues","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_listing_subreason":"Listing Policy Violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_other_subreason":"Other Policy Violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_auth_subreason":"Product Authenticity Customer Complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_cond_subreason":"Product Condition Customer Complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_review_subreason":"Customer Product Reviews Policy Violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reason":"Repeat Violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reg_comp_subreason":"Regulatory Compliance","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rip_subreason":"Received Intellectual Property Complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rp_subreason":"Restricted Product Policy","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_sip_subreason":"Suspected Intellectual Property Violations","ahd_aef_at_risk_HD_card_body":"To reactivate your disbursements, review your Priority Actions and address the outstanding action items.","ahd_aef_at_risk_card_sc_body":"You have one or more outstanding action items that will result in account deactivation.","ahd_aef_critical_message":"This critical issue if left unresolved will cause your account to be deactivated.","ahd_aef_critical_message_no_caps":"This critical issue if left unresolved will cause your account to be deactivated.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_body":"Address your account health issues to reactivate your account. Once the issues have been resolved, your account will be reactivated within 24 hours.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_sc_body":"Address your account health issues to reactivate your account.","ahd_aef_denver_eu":"Verify EU Establishment for Value Added Tax (VAT)","ahd_aef_denver_info":"Information Required","ahd_aef_denver_uk":"Verify UK Establishment for Value Added Tax (VAT)","ahd_aef_educational_card_action":"Resolve Issues","ahd_aef_impact_header":"Account Health Impact","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_post_deactivation":"Click the ‘Appeal\' button below and follow the instructions provided in order to reactivate this selling account.","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_pre_deactivation":"Click the \'Appeal\' button below and follow the instructions provided in order to avoid deactivation of this selling account.","ahd_aef_next_steps_header":"Address Your Violation","ahd_aef_pending_critical":"Pending Critical","ahd_aef_submit_header":"Submit Your Information","ahd_ahr_pending_critical":"Pending Critical","ahd_all_issues":"All Issues","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_body":"Your account will be considered for reactivation when your violations have been successfully appealed. ","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_header":"Your account has been deactivated. ","ahd_banner_block_mfn_at_risk_subtitle":"Your seller-fulfilled offers have been deactivated and your account is at-risk of deactivation. Complete your Priority Actions to reactivate your seller-fulfilled offers and prevent deactivation.","ahd_banner_block_mfn_subtitle":"Your seller-fulfilled offers have been deactivated. Complete your Priority Actions to reactivate your seller-fulfilled offers.","ahd_banner_eg_trn":"<b>Your account is at-risk of deactivation. </b><br><br>Your account is at-risk of deactivation because your Seller Central account does not include your valid Tax Registration Number. Visit the <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations> Tax Settings</a> page to update your Tax information within 90 days from the date of your first product listing on Amazon to avoid account deactivation. For more information, see the “Tax compliance frequently asked questions” <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC> help page. </a>","ahd_banner_resolve_issues_button":"Resolve Issues","ahd_be_jsl_at_risk_banner":"<b> Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br> You have not provided your Belgian VAT Registration Number (VRN) or confirmation of Union One-Stop Shop (OSS) status for your home country in your Amazon Seller Central account. Refer to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/external/GGTX8THLMMDJ3WBP> new Belgian legislation</a> to know more about the requirement and provide information.","ahd_be_jsl_priority_action":"Belgium Value Added Tax (VAT) Legislation","ahd_brkyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Check your verification status on the <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional\\n?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity Information </a> page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"As per Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service and you are required to provide us with certain information or documents in order to facilitate these checks. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications.\\r\\n<br><br>Your account has been deactivated because we were not able to validate your identity information.<br><br> \\r\\nFor more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon </a> help page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_identity_info":"Visit the <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity Information</a>  page to complete verification.","ahd_brkyc_rap_intro":"As per Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You are required to provide us with certain information or documents in order to facilitate these checks. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications.\\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nFor more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon </a> help page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_verifying":"We are validating your information and may need to request details from you during this review. Please check the <a href=\'/performance/notifications\\r\\n?ref_=to_brkyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a> sections and respond to any requests relating to your Selling on Amazon account. This validation can take up to 24 hours and might take up to 10 working days in some cases. During this time, your Identity Information cannot be edited.","ahd_cakyc_rap_action_hd":"Provide your identity verification information by the due date shown to avoid account deactivation. If you do not start verification and have 15 days or less remaining, your ability to disburse funds from your Amazon.ca selling account will be restricted. Verification is required under Canadian law.","ahd_cakyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Check your verification status on the <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> Identity Information page</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"Your account has been deactivated because we were not able to validate your identity information.  Canadian laws require us to verify your identity so that we can allow you to use our service. To reactivate your account, submit information needed to verify your identity. \\r\\n<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page","ahd_cakyc_rap_identity_info":"Visit the <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> Identity Information page</a> to complete verification. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_intro":"Canadian law requires us to verify your identity to allow you to use our service. We need you to provide us with certain information and documents so that we can conduct these verification checks. <br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page or refer to your <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_self_trigger_cta":"By clicking \'Begin Verification\', you are proceeding with the Canada verification requirements. Visit the<a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> Identity Information page</a> to confirm next steps. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_verifying":"We are validating your information. This validation can take between 24 hours and 10 working days, in some cases. We may need to request details from you during this review. Please check the <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a> section and respond to any additional requests relating to your Selling on Amazon account.  \\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nDuring this time, your Identity Information cannot be edited.","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph":"The verification of your identity is required by law for the use of a selling on Amazon account. As per Canadian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You may need to provide us with certain information and documents in order to facilitate these checks.<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph2":"Amazon allows up to 60 days for you to complete re-verification. The does not include the time we take to complete the review. Your ability to sell and disburse funds may be restricted if re-verification is not completed within 60 days. When we require information, a notification will appear on your Account Information page. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications. ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph3":"You will eventually be unable to use your selling on Amazon account. Therefore, you will not be able to sell on Amazon.ca if the information is not provided. ","ahd_collusion_policy":"Selling policies and Seller Code of Conduct","ahd_compliance_status":"Compliance Status","ahd_compliance_widget_ckp_redirect":"Launch compliance reference","ahd_critical_account_health_notification":"Critical Account Health Notification","ahd_critical_policy_violations":"Critical policy violations","ahd_dac7_at_risk_banner":"<b>Your account is at-risk of deactivation.</b><br><br> Your account is at risk of being deactivated because of missing tax information required under  <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB\\"> DAC7 legislation</a>. Visit the <a href= \\"/complianceportal\\">DAC7 Compliance Portal</a>  to start verification. ","ahd_dac7_compliant":"You are DAC7 compliant now!","ahd_dac7_priority_action":"DAC7 information required","ahd_dac7_priority_action_pending":"Pending Verification","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_launch_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Launch the DAC7 portal to submit your information</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal_status":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_status_blurb\'  target=\'_blank\'>Check your verification status on the DAC7 portal</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_intro":"The <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/external/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB?ref_=to_dac_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Directive on Administrative Cooperation – 7th Amendment (DAC7)</a> is an EU regulation that requires Amazon to collect, verify and report due diligence, VAT/tax and financial data of EU-resident sellers irrespective of the Amazon store they sell in.","ahd_dac7_rap_verify_now_button":"Verify Now","ahd_dac7_rap_verifying":"We are reviewing your DAC7 information. The review process usually takes 72 hours, but might take longer in some instances. Please check the status of your verification regularly in the DAC7 Portal below to know if we require more information.","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_description":"Go to the <a href=\'/hz/sc/account-information\' target=\'_blank\'>Account Information</a> page to complete verification. ","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Your Amazon.ca (Canada) store is at risk of deactivation.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the Amazon.com.br store.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the Amazon.ca store.","ahd_eg_trn_deactivation_banner":"<b>Your account has been deactivated.</b><br><br> To reactivate your account, visit the <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations> Tax Settings</a> page to update your Tax information. For more information, see the “Tax compliance frequently asked questions” <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC>help page</a>. ","ahd_error_loading_submit":"An error happened. Please try submitting again.","ahd_eukyc_priority_action":"Identity Verification","ahd_inform_ac_checkbox_error":"Click the checkbox to confirm that you have reviewed your information and certify that it is accurate and current.","ahd_inform_ac_edu_display_name":"Review Your Account Information","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p1":"Under the US INFORM Consumers Act, you are required to keep certain business information (shown below) current and to electronically certify to Amazon that either you have updated your information or that the information already provided is still current. Certify that your information below is up-to-date within 10 days of viewing this notice, or your account will be at risk of deactivation. ","ahd_inform_ac_p1_header":"Get Ready to Certify Your Information","ahd_inform_ac_page1_checkbox":"Click the checkbox to confirm you have understand that once you go to the INFORM Act Notice and Certification page, you’ll receive a notice and have 10 days to update and certify your information.","ahd_inform_ac_page1_step1_intructions":"Go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Account Information</a> page or click the Edit button to update any information below that is incorrect. ","ahd_inform_ac_page2_certify_instructions":"If your information below is up to date, you can certify now. If any information is incorrect, go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Account Information</a>  page to edit your information before clicking \'Certify\'.","ahd_inform_account_information_update_verification":"Your account information has been updated and we are verifying your information. Check back in 24 hours to determine if any additional steps are needed to begin the Annual Certification process.","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_confirmation":"By clicking \\"Certify\\" I certify that I read the Notice above and that the information I provided to Amazon is true and correct, corresponds to my business, and is not misappropriated.","ahd_inform_act_ac_edit_information":"Edit Information","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"Email","ahd_inform_act_ac_not_required":"The INFORM Act does not yet apply to your business so you’re not currently required to certify your information. We’ll notify you in the future if you’re required to certify your information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou":"Thank you for certifying that your business information is current. Your Account Health page will update in a few minutes to confirm you have completed your outstanding INFORM Act Notice and Certification requirement.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou_banner":"Thank you for certifying that your business information is current. Your Account Health page will update in a few minutes to confirm that you have completed your outstanding INFORM Act Notice and Certification requirement.\\n<br><br>Please remember that you are required to keep your business information current and to certify at least annually that your name, address, phone number, email address, bank account information and Tax ID number are correct.","ahd_inform_act_ac_tin_field":"Tax Identification Number (TIN):","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions":"Please note that only the primary user or secondary user with authorised permissions to Confirm/Edit Account Information will be able to certify the information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions_error":"This information must be certified by the Account’s primary user or a secondary user authorised with permissions to Confirm/Edit Account Information.","ahd_inform_act_account_information":"Account Information","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_deactivation_banner":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Because we have not received the requested information, your account has been deactivated. To reactivate your account, review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to complete verification. <br><br>Once you have completed verifications for all outstanding requirements, your account will be reactivated within 48 hours. ","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_hold_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation and disbursements for your Amazon selling account have been put on hold.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Because we have not received the requested information within the timelines specified in our communications, your disbursements are now placed on hold. To reactivate your disbursements, review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to start or complete your information submission.","ahd_inform_act_hold_wait_text":"To reactivate your disbursements and prevent your account from being deactivated, click on the action items below to go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> and complete the pending requirements. <br><br>Thank you for completing identity verification. Check back in 24 hours to find out whether any additional verification steps are needed.","ahd_inform_act_hold_widget_description":"To reactivate your disbursements and prevent your account from being deactivated, click on the action items below to go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> and complete the pending requirements. <br><br>After completing the identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_wait_text":"Click on the action items below to complete the pending requirements. Thank you for completing Identity verification. Check in 24 hours to find out whether any additional verification steps are needed.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_widget_description":"Click on the action items below to complete the pending requirements. After completing the Identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_need_help":"Need help? Visit the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act Help page</a>.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have successfully completed all open verifications. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete_short":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have successfully completed all open verifications. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_inform_act_wait_text":"Thank you for verifying Identity. Check back in 24 hours for confirmation of whether any additional information is needed. <br><br> Click on the action items below to go to the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Seller Account Information</a> page and complete the pending requirements.","ahd_inform_act_widget_bank_account_field":"Bank account","ahd_inform_act_widget_business_address_field":"Business address","ahd_inform_act_widget_description":"Click on the action items below to go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> page and complete the pending requirements. <br><br> After completing Identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_widget_phone_number_field":"Phone Number","ahd_inform_act_widget_tax_id_field":"Tax ID number","ahd_inform_annual_certification":"Annual Certification","ahd_inform_annual_review_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7?ref_=ahd_annual_ inform_consumer_act\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, your Selling on Amazon account information must be certified on an annual basis. Visit the <a href=\\"/mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render?ref_=ahd_annual_inform_certification\\">Annual Certification</a> page to certify that your information is current.","ahd_inform_annual_review_seller_enforced":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, you must certify the accuracy of your Selling on Amazon account information at least annually. Because we have not received the requested certification, your account has been deactivated. To reactivate your account, visit the <a href=\\" /mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render\\">Annual Certification</a> page to certify that your information is current. <br><br> Once you have completed certification, your account will be reactivated within 48 hours.","ahd_inform_bav_not_verified":"You don\'t have a verified bank account or didn\'t assign the verified bank account as your default deposit method to the US marketplace. Verify and assign your bank account as default on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView> Deposit Methods </a>page.","ahd_inform_company_registration_number":"Company Registration Number: ","ahd_inform_confirmation_p1":"Please remember that you are required to keep your business information current and to certify at least annually that your name, address, phone number, email address, bank account information, and Tax ID number are correct.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p2":"If any of your information changes, Amazon will need to verify this new information as well. Please respond promptly to any information requests so that we can work with you to complete these additional verification steps and avoid account deactivation. For more information about the verification process, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act Help page</a>.","ahd_inform_consumers_act_ac":"INFORM Act Notice and Certification","ahd_inform_consumers_act_annual":"INFORM Consumers Act Annual Certification ","ahd_inform_loading_error":"Go to the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information target=\\"_blank\\">Account information</a> page to review your current information.","ahd_inform_no_default_deposit":"You don’t have a verified bank account or didn’t assign the verified bank account as your default deposit method to the US marketplace. Verify and assign your bank account as default on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView> Deposit Methods</a> page.","ahd_inform_page1_checkbox":"I understand that once I proceed to the INFORM Act Notice and Certification, I must complete certification within 10 days to avoid the risk of account deactivation. ","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2b":"However, you do not need to wait to receive the formal notification, and can take action now to avoid the risk of account deactivation later.","ahd_inform_page1_proceed_title":"Proceed to INFORM Act Notice and Certification","ahd_inform_page1_step2_description":"If your information is up to date, or if you have just updated it, proceed to the next step – the notice and certification – to receive your formal notice and complete your certification. Once you’ve viewed this notice, the law will require you to certify your information within 10 days.","ahd_inform_sw_bav":"You must verify your active bank accounts. Verify your bank accounts here on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView> Deposit Methods</a> page.","ahd_inform_update_account_information_educational":"Visit the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Annual Certification</a> page to ensure your Selling on Amazon Account information is up to date.","ahd_itr_priority_action":"Italian tax ID for Italy-based sellers required.","ahd_itr_rap_intro":"The <a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law Number 157/2019</a> requires Italy-based sellers who complete one or more transactions on Amazon.it to add their Italian codice fiscale in their Tax settings.","ahd_itr_remediation_corp":"Submit your Italian codice fiscale in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. According to our information (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), your account is registered as a company, and therefore we require your business registration number (known as \\"codice fiscale\\", corresponding to VAT ID without \\"IT\\" country code). Please refer to the Help page (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a>) for submission steps. You must ensure your legal name on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) and your business registration number in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Tax Authority database.","ahd_itr_remediation_individual":"Submit your Italian codice fiscale in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. According to our information (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), your account is registered as an individual, and therefore we require your Citizen ID (known as \\"codice fiscale\\"). Refer to the Help pages (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a>) for submission steps. You must ensure your legal name on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) and Citizen_ID number in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Tax Authority database.","ahd_itr_remediation_unkown":"Submit your information on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render). Companies must provide their business registration number (known as \\"codice fiscale\\", corresponding to VAT ID without \\"IT\\" country code), while Individual sellers, including sole proprietors (\\"P. IVA individuale\\") must upload their personal Citizen ID (also known as “codice fiscale”) in Tax Settings<https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. You must ensure your legal name on the Business Information Page <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render> and the codice fiscale in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Authority database.","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_details_fallback_text":"Have questions about maintaining a healthy account? Get personalised guidance from Seller Assistant.","ahd_more_information_hd":"More Information","ahd_new_feature_announcement_body_new_filters":"You can now filter policy violations by action taken on impacted listings. Go to the Product Policy Compliance page and click \\"Add Filters\\" to filter violations.","ahd_other_policy_violation_title":"Other Policy Violations","ahd_payment_policy_hd_priority_action":"Your funds are on hold due to pending actions on your account. Review the <b>Priority Actions</b> to reactivate your disbursements.","ahd_pp_mas_r_policies_code_of_conduct":"Selling policies and Seller Code of Conduct","ahd_pr_form_address_header":"Address Non-Compliant Product Penalties to continue selling your products.","ahd_pr_form_address_sub_header":"As per the guidance from DOJ, Amazon simplifies your regulatory compliance obligations by reporting and paying  on behalf of your orders on Amazon and then recovering these amounts from your account.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_info":"In accordance with the EPA/DOJ Consent Decree, we are required to penalise Sellers for any violations on policies pertaining to EPA. Please find more information on <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account/health/product-policies\\">non-compliant products</a>, Calculate associated penalties, Reserves applied on your account and Communications sent to submit appeals. You will then be charged for any outstanding penalties.<br/><br/> Before we charge you for the penalties, we will place a hold on your account while giving you a chance to remediate your listing.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_title":"How Does This Work?","ahd_pr_form_impact_header":"Possible account impact are as detailed below:","ahd_pr_form_impact_p1":"Liability to pay penalties (refer violation details below","ahd_pr_form_impact_p3":"Negative impact on your account health which may lead to deactivation of your seller account","ahd_pr_form_note":"Please note: Before we charge you for the penalties, we will place a hold on your account for 30 days while give you a chance to remediate your listing.","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_body":"This product has been identified as a pesticide product, pesticide device or a product that contains pesticide claims. To be considered for reinstatement, please provide evidence of an EPA Registration number and/or EPA Establishment number or a certification that the product is exempt from EPA regulations. You will need to provide this information in the Pesticide Marking attribute for the listing. <a href=/help/hub/reference/GLX9EJX844SNJX7J> Instructions for completing this attribute are available on Seller Central.</a>","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_title":"Related Policy Information","ahd_pr_form_title":"Non-Compliant Product Details","ahd_priority_actions_cr":"Cancellation Rate (CR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_lsr":"Late Shipment Rate (LSR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_odr":"Order Defect Rate (ODR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_otdr":"On Time Delivery Rate (OTDR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_title":"Priority Actions","ahd_pspp_priority_actions":"Complete pending Know Your Customer (KYC) review – Payment Service Provider","ahd_pspp_rap_intro":"Your bank account is not eligible for receiving disbursement. Work with your Payment Service Provider to complete pending know-your-customer (KYC) review.","ahd_pspp_rap_next_steps":"Go to the <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GY8JTVAWBPQT2XFC?ref_=to_psp_faq_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Payment Service Provider FAQ</a> and <a href=\'/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView?ref_=to_deposit_method_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Deposit Methods</a> page for more information. ","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory":"Countries Impacted by Inventory Restrictions","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory_details":"Address the outstanding requirements to avoid disruption to your Fulfilled by Amazon Inventory and your import or export capabilities in the listed country.","ahd_rap_at_risk_regional_details":"The listed requirements are impacting your account health in multiple stores. Address the outstanding requirements to avoid account deactivation in all impacted stores.","ahd_rap_begin_verification":"Begin Verification ","ahd_rap_czech_republic":"Czechia","ahd_rap_enforced_inventory_details":"Address the outstanding requirements to remove the restrictions on your Fulfilled by Amazon Inventory and  import or export capabilities in the listed country.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p1":"The verification of your identity is required by law for the use of a selling on Amazon account. As required by Canadian and Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You may need to provide us with certain information and documents in order to facilitate these checks.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p3":"You can provide the required verification information at any time after you’ve registered. You will have limited access to your account until the information has been provided and verified.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p4":"If you would like to proceed and sell on Amazon.ca or Amazon.com.br, select the checkbox next to the store you would like to proceed with verification below. Once you have selected to proceed with verification, visit the Identity Information page to determine next steps.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p5":"If you want to proceed with verification for a single store first, select only that store from the list below. Once you have completed verification for that store, you will be notified to complete the required steps to begin verification for the other store.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_thankyou_p2":"We are validating your information and may need to request details from you during this review. This validation can take up to 24 hours and might take up to 10 working days in some cases. During this time, your Identity Information cannot be edited.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_check_verification_status":"Check your verification status and required next steps on the Account Information page.","ahd_rap_past_due_inventory":"PAST DUE - Inventory Capabilities Restricted","ahd_rap_voluntary_submission_action":"Based on the information available to us you are not required to hold a ${countryName} VAT number, to comply with this requirement you can either remove it from <a href=\'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Tax Settings</a> or proceed with resolving the issue above.","ahd_regulatory_compliance":"Regulatory Compliance","ahd_related_accounts_policy_reason":"Seller code of conduct (Multiple Selling Accounts on Amazon)","ahd_sa_account_health_guidance_description":"Have questions about account health? Get personalised guidance from Seller Assistant.","ahd_sa_chat_about_account_health_text":"How’s my Account Health?","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_label":"Summarise Product Compliance","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_text":"Can you summarise my product compliance violations?","ahd_save_changes_button":"Save changes","ahd_status_past_due":"Past Due","ahd_uaebizlicense_priority_action":"Upload your trade licence","ahd_vas_extension_extension_request_link":"submit the required documentation.","ahd_vas_priority_action":"European VAT Registration Requirements","ahd_vas_rap_deactivated_message":"The listed requirements are impacting your account health in multiple stores. Address the outstanding requirements for the listed country to reactivate your account in all impacted stores.","ahd_vas_rap_intro":"The <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GTQ23HPXBQK563WS\' target=\'_blank\'>European VAT registration requirements</a>  is a European Amazon Stores policy that requires all Selling Partners active in European stores to submit a valid VAT registration number whenever they have a requirement.  Review the Account Health Impact section to complete your outstanding requirements.","ahd_vas_rap_secondary_action":"If you do not have a VAT Registration Number for the listed country, visit the <a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>Business Information</a> portal and <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Tax Settings</a> portal to submit the required information (VAT number, name, address) for the following countries:","ahd_vas_rap_third_action":"If you have opted into Union One-Stop Shop in your home country please visit <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Tax Settings</a> Page selecting your home country from the Union One-Stop Shop Value Added Tax (VAT) Declaration menu. Ensure your Union One-Stop Shop is enabled and that the name and address provided to Amazon match those provided to Authorities.","ahd_vas_rap_verifying":"We are reviewing your VAT Registration Numbers details. This can take up to 14 days. We will contact you if additional information are required.","ahd_view_all_pa":"View all priority actions (${totalCount})","ahd_violation_appeal_button":"Proceed with Appeal","ahd_violation_details":"Violation Details","ahd_violation_display_name":"Restricted Product Policy Violation","ahd_violation_status_assessment_phase":"Penalties in Assessment Phase – Disbursements may be impacted.","ahd_w8_priority_action":"Updated US Tax Identity Information Required","ahd_w8_rap_action":"You are now required to complete your self-service tax interview before the due date. Your submission can take up to 24 hours to process.","ahd_w8_rap_deactivated_action":"Submit the required information to reactivate your account. Your submission can take up to 24 hours to process.","ahd_w8_rap_intro":"A new W-8 tax form is required. Once your form expires, your selling account will be temporarily deactivated until you provide updated tax information.\\n\\n<br><br>These requirements impact your account health in multiple stores.  Address the listed requirements to avoid account deactivation in all impacted stores.\\n\\n<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G200663290?ref_=to_w8_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>US Income Reporting and Tax Identity Collection FAQ.</a>","ai_inform_page1_step1":"1. Go to your Account Information page [link to Account Information page here] to review your account information (and update, if necessary).","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Because Katal Components are extensions of HTML elements, JavaScript can interact with them the same as built-in HTML elements. Here we see JavaScript changing the \'variant\' attribute on the alert.","components_containing_html_text":"Some components can contain HTML content, like our KatalTabs component. These complex components provide an API so developers and frameworks can interact with them.","custom_elements_text":"Katal gives developers the ability to use custom-designed elements to build their web pages. For example, if the developer needs a button, they can use <kat-button></kat-button> instead of building a button themselves.","demo_complex_header_text":"Demonstration: Complex Katal Components","demo_components_header_text":"Demonstration: Using Katal Components","demo_javascript_header_text":"Demonstration: JavaScript with Katal Components","design_approved_text":"Katal offers design-approved components for use in web pages that can be configured with labels and custom settings. For example: regular buttons and secondary buttons, different only in their \'variant\' attribute.","discovery_ahd_ni_warn_pdp":"Product Detail Page","documentation_label":"Katal Documentation","fba_inventory_uc_identifier":"Our records indicate that you are holding inventory in ${COUNTRY} through the Fulfilled by Amazon (FBA) program. As a seller using FBA services, you are required to provide a valid VAT registration number for each country where your inventory is stored. You can verify the countries where you have enabled FBA <a href=/fba/settings/ target=\\"_blank\\">here</a>.\\nPlease keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","greeting_description":"This is a sample Katal application, demonstrating how to use Katal Components as well as build-and-deploy tooling. Please contact the Katal team at colombia-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments. To continue this demo, please dismiss this alert.","greeting_description_mons_app":"This is a sample Katal application, demonstrating how to use Katal Components with translations. Please contact the Katal team at katal-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments.","greeting_header":"Sample App Information","information-requests":"Information Requests","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Send Feedback","mobile_ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"Please sign in to Seller Central from a web browser.","mobile_ahd_banner_eg_trn":"Update your tax registration number on the Tax Settings page in your Seller Central account.","poe_domestic_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicates that your sales in ${COUNTRY} exceed the domestic threshold for VAT registration.","ppc_fhdds_action_taken":"Risk of UK inbound restriction","ppc_fhdds_action_taken_past_due":"UK inbound capabilities are currently restricted","ppc_fhdds_reason":"FHDDS: Shipment Missing Import Entry Number (IEN)","primary_button_label":"Primary Button","product-policy-compliance":"Product Policy Compliance","sample_app_page_title_text":"Sample Application","sc_homepage_education_phase_description":"Address your account health to avoid the risk of future account deactivation.","sc_inform_act_view_account_health_banner":"Go to Account Health","sc_navbar_ah_cs_desc":"View your customer service performance metrics, including your order defect and invoice defect rates.","sc_navbar_ah_desc":"View your Account Health Rating, issues impacting your account health, and violations that may result in content removal or account deactivation.","sc_navbar_ah_eligibilities_desc":"View benefits and programmes you may be eligible for.","sc_navbar_ah_myc_desc":"Ensure all your products comply with all applicable, laws, regulations and Amazon policies.","sc_navbar_ah_sp_desc":"View your shipping performance metrics, including Late Shipment Rate, Pre-fulfilment Cancel Rate, Valid Tracking Rate and On-Time Delivery Rate.  ","schp_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_subtitle":"Go to your Account Health page and complete your Priority Actions to begin selling on Amazon.","schp_complete_priority_actions":"Complete your Priority Actions","secondary_button_label":"Secondary Button","ship_from_non_poe_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are dispatching from ${COUNTRY}, which is different than your home country. Therefore, you are required to provide a valid VAT Information Exchange System VAT number or applicable VAT number for EU transactions. You can verify your shipping address from the Shipping Settings page or from this <a href=/sbr target=\\"_blank\\">link</a>.\\nPlease keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","ship_from_poe_uc_identifier":"Our records indicate that your cross-border sales exceed €10,000 across EU countries. As a seller engaged in cross-border sales, you are required to provide either UOSS-enabled VAT number from you establishment country or valid VAT numbers for all countries you ship to.","ship_to_non_eu_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you have shipments exceeding €150 from outside EU into ${COUNTRY}. Therefore, you are required to provide a valid ${COUNTRY} VAT number or a declaration confirming that you are not the Importer Of Record for the shipment(s) above threshold.","ship_to_uoss_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are conducting cross-border sales into ${COUNTRY} from other EU country and, therefore, you are required to provide an UOSS-enabled VAT number from your establishment country or valid ${COUNTRY} VAT number.\\nPlease keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","sp-permanent-call-me-now-title":"Need Help?","sp_health_cancellation_rate_caption":"Pre-fulfilment Cancellation Rate","sp_health_customer_satisfaction_information_label":"Order Defect Report consists of three different metrics:","sp_health_dashboard_guardian_title_new":"Account Health Assurance","sp_health_dashboard_subheader":"To sell on Amazon, you must adhere to the below performance targets and policies.","sp_health_dashboard_title":"Account Health","sp_health_download_report_caption":"Download Report","sp_health_gl_watch":"Watch","sp_health_intellectual_property_customer_complaints":"Intellectual Property Complaints","sp_health_late_shipment_rate_caption":"Late Shipment Rate","sp_health_listing_policy_customer_complaints":"Listing Policy Violations","sp_health_mobile_by_ahr_impact_tab_title":"By Account Health Rating Impact","sp_health_nav_myc":"Manage Your Compliance","sp_health_nav_orders_with_defects":"Orders with Defects","sp_health_not_available":"N/A","sp_health_order_defect_rate_caption":"Order Defect Rate","sp_health_pre_fulfillment_cancel_rate":"Pre-fulfilment Cancel Rate","sp_health_product_policies":"Product Policy Compliance","sp_health_product_quality_popover":"This total will include complaints which you may have already addressed through a Plan of Action.","sp_health_product_safety_customer_complaints":"Food and Product Safety Issues","sp_health_restricted_products_violations_policy":"Restricted Product Policy Violations","sp_health_risk_banner_vtr":"Your seller-fulfilled offers are at risk of deactivation. Your Valid Tracking Rate is ${hash-get metricValue}; the target is ${hash-get target}.","sp_health_seller_fulfilled_metrics_caption":"Seller Fulfilled","sp_health_shipping_bucket_caption":"Delivery Performance","sp_health_shipping_eligibilities":"View delivery eligibilities here","sp_health_time_window":"Time Window: ${hash-get numDays} days","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_caption":"Valid tracking rate","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_subtitle":"<b>Target</b>: over ${hash-get targetValue}","sp_health_violation_details_stale_page_button_label":"Back to Account Health","sp_mfn_at_risk_warning":"Your seller-fulfilled offers are at risk of deactivation","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_defects":"You do not currently have any defects for this order.","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_order":"This order doesn\'t exist.","sp_st_date_range":"${hash-get startDate}-${hash-get endDate}","sp_st_heading_order_asin":"Product","sp_st_heading_order_edd":"Expected Delivery Date","sp_st_heading_order_esd":"Expected Dispatch Date","sp_st_str_with_description":"${hash-get description} : ${hash-get str}","sp_st_zero_out_metrics_message":"Orders received prior to June 1 are not used to evaluate your account health and do not display here.","sp_vtr_list_ca":"1. Heavy and bulky items shipped by a carrier not integrated with Amazon. Learn more on integrated carriers.</br></br>2. Small and light items that have an order value less than CAD $30 (including delivery charges) and are delivered in Canada Post Standard Mail envelopes or First Class Mail envelopes.</br></br>3. International shipments dispatched from China that have an order value less than CAD $6 (including delivery charges)</br></br>4. International shipments dispatched from outside of the US and China.</br></br>5. Digital orders that cannot be physically delivered by a carrier, e.g. audio books","sp_zero_tolerance_banner_body":"Due to one or more critical violations, your account is pending deactivation. To prevent deactivation, please address these violations now. For more information, go to the <a href=/gp/help/G200205250>Account Health Rating programme policy</a>.","tab_demo_generated_text":"Auto Generated Tab {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Selected Tab","ts-form-header":"Report abuse","valid_vat_number_uc_identifier":"Please keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","voluntary_vrn_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are not required to hold a VAT number in ${COUNTRY} but you have provided one on Seller Central that is currently not valid. To resolve this discrepancy, you can either remove the ${COUNTRY} VAT Number or provide a valid one. By removing your ${COUNTRY} VAT Number from Seller Central you are confirming that you are not required to hold one in ${COUNTRY}. We recommend consulting with a tax adviser to determine whether your overall business activities, both on and off Amazon, require VAT registration."}},"en-US":{"pages.floatingWidget":{"DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_content":"You\'re part of an experiment to improve seller experience: starting now, strong performance on Buyer Contact Rate, Contact Response Time, and Buyer Dissatisfaction Rate can boost your AHR score! This change helps AHR reward excellent customer service. Check your customer service performance on Feedback Manager now.","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_cta_done":"Feedback Manager","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_header":"Earn AHR points for strong customer service","DYK_JP_LINE_content":"Amazon LINE Official Account sends selected notifications about the notifications we sent via email and Seller Central requiring actions by Sellers regarding topics such as your account’s status, listing status, and payment disbursement errors. Connect your Seller Central account to the LINE official account to receive notifications via LINE and avoid missing important notifications. Learn More","DYK_JP_LINE_header":"You can connect with LINE account to receive personalized important messages that matters to your account health.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_content":"Great news! You\'re within 60 days of qualifying for Account Health Assurance (AHA). Maintain your Account Health Rating above 250 and keep a verified emergency contact number on file to secure enhanced account protection. We\'ll notify you via email once you\'re automatically enrolled.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_header":"Nearing Account Health Assurance enrollment","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_content":"Your Account Health Rating has moved into At Risk or Unhealthy status. Click \'Call Me Now\' to speak with an Account Health Specialist and protect your selling privileges.","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_cta_done":"Call Me Now","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_header":"Your Account Health Rating Needs Attention","DYK_SSAT_CFT_DietarySupp_content":"Protect your Dietary Supplement listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_Toys_content":"Protect your Toys category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_artscrafts_content":"Protect your Arts and Crafts Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_buttoncellbatteryproducts_content":"Protect your Button Cell Battery Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_childrensproducts_content":"Protect your Children\'s Products Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_cta_done":"Sign Up Today","DYK_SSAT_CFT_electronics_content":"Protect your Electronics Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_emobilityproducts_content":"Protect your E-Mobility Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_firesafety_content":"Protect your Fire Safety category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_furniture_content":"Protect your Furniture Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_header":"Simplify Compliance: Enroll in Compliance Fast-track Today","DYK_SSAT_CFT_infantbabyproducts_content":"Protect your Infant and Baby Products Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_ppe_content":"Protect your Personal Protection Equipment category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organization certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_EDU_JULY":"Keys to the Account Health Rating","DYK_SSAT_EDU_content":"AHR monitors your account\'s deactivation risk through a point system. You gain points for successfully fulfilling orders. You lose points points when policy violations are detected, and recover points when you successfully address those violations. Review your Account Health dashboard often and address policy violations as they arise.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_content":"We’re excited to announce Seller Challenge, a new feature for Account Health Assurance sellers. Seller Challenge provides a limited number of opportunities to request a separate review of listing issues through your Account Health page. Once you submit a challenge, we strive to respond with a decision in 48 hours.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_cta_done":"Learn More","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop_header":"Healthy AHR Tip","ahd_dyk_bhdr_content":"We recommend delivering more than 90% of your Amazon Business commercial shipments during business hours to maintain a good customer experience","ahd_dyk_bhdr_cta":"View Performance","ahd_dyk_bhdr_header":"Your Business Hour Delivery Rate is low.","ahd_dyk_br_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Your Amazon.com.br (Brazil) store is at-risk of deactivation.","ahd_dyk_de_sup_label":"To comply with the EPR: Germany Single Use Plastic policy (effective since January 1, 2025), take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for each brand and product type combination. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GA4JYZX23CLK8WFW\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_de_sup_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): Germany Single Use Plastic","ahd_dyk_de_sup_weee_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): Germany WEEE","ahd_dyk_description_eukyc":"In accordance with EU regulations, you must complete an account verification process. Go to the Identity Information page to complete verification. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G201200780 \\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_label":"To comply with the EPR: take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for each brand and product type combination. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GYDCAK9ZR6VJH2X3\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR)","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_label":"To comply with the EPR: EU Batteries policy (effective from August 18, 2025), take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for your product categories. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GPVDATLHQ6PRQNSW\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): EU Batteries","ahd_dyk_fhdds_cta":"Review Shipments","ahd_dyk_fhdds_description":"Provide the import details for all your applicable shipments in your Shipping Queue before they disrupt your business. Missing import details could restrict your ability to create new UK shipments.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.com.br/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.com.br</a> store.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.ca/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.ca</a> store.","ahd_dyk_title_eukyc":"Complete your EU Know Your Customer (KYC) verification","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description":"To comply with the GPSR, which goes into effect on December 13, 2024, please provide additional compliance information for your products to avoid impact to your listings. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_task":"You have listings impacted by the General Product Safety Regulation (GPSR).","ahd_floating_widget_aha_ec_description":"As a member of the AHA program, you are <b>required</b> to maintain a valid emergency contact number. Verify your emergency contact details to retain AHA eligibility, so our specialists can reach out to help you address critical account health-related issues before they disrupt your business.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_action_panel_title":"Emergency Contact Information Update","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_food_and_safety_heading":"You have repeat violations for Food and Product Safety Issues","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_ip_heading":"You have repeat violations for Received Intellectual Property Complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_listing_heading":"You have repeat violations for Listing Policy Violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_other_heading":"You have repeat violations for Other Policy Violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_auth_heading":"You have repeat violations for Product Authenticity Customer Complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_cond_heading":"You have repeat violations for Product Condition Customer Complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_reviews_heading":"You have repeat violations for Customer Product Reviews Policy Violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_reg_comp_heading":"You have repeat violations for Regulatory Compliance","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_rp_heading":"You have repeat violations for Restricted Product Policy","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_sip_heading":"You have repeat violations for Suspected Intellectual Property Violations","ahd_floating_widget_resolve_now_button_text":"Resolve Now","cs_nerd_suggestion_top_issues_action_vi":"View Issues","dyk_ahd_pra_rv":"You have repeat violations for customer product reviews policy violations."},"pages.homepage":{"AHD_DD14_Base_Reserve":"Sales proceeds are held through 14 days after delivery date and become available for disbursement starting on the 15th day after delivery date. If actual delivery date is not available, we use the latest estimated delivery date for the order. This is your default payment policy.","AHD_POA_APPEAL_ERROR_LOADING":"An error happened. Please refresh the page.","DR_VAT_AHD_NC_BANNER":"We\'ve not been able to verify your business establishment for VAT purposes. To ensure accurate tax treatment, verify your establishment for VAT purposes.","DR_VAT_AHD_PRIORITY_ACTION":"Establishment Verification Required for VAT Purposes","Engage_Appeal_05":"Seller code of conduct (favorably influencing customers to manipulate your sales ratings, feedback, or reviews)","LocalizedPageTitleDashboard":"Performance Dashboard","LocalizedPageTitleDetailCustomerSatisfaction":"Customer Satisfaction details page.","LocalizedPageTitleDetailProductPolicies":"Product Policies details page.","NO_METRICS":"You currently don’t have any orders counting toward this metric.\\r\\n","RR_AHR_Warn_1":"Multiple Selling Accounts on Amazon","acf_banner_inform_act":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to start verification.","acf_inform_act_wait_text":"Thank you for verifying Identity. Check back in 24 hours for confirmation of whether any additional information is needed. ","acf_inform_act_widget_description":"After completing Identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","addTab_label":"Add Tab","aef_address_your_violation":"Address Your Violation","ags_pcx_voc_summary_voice_of_the_customer":"Voice of the Customer","ahd_Inform_deposit_method":"Deposit Method Information","ahd_account_impacted_details":"Your account may be impacted as detailed below:","ahd_account_regulatory_compliance":"Account Regulatory Compliance","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to start verification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_aha":"<b> Please note, if you have not completed all verification items when the INFORM Consumers Act takes effect, your account may be deactivated, regardless of your enrollment in Account Health Assurance.</b>","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_thankyou":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have successfully completed all open verifications. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_v2":"<b>Your account is at-risk of deactivation.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>US INFORM Consumers Act</a>, which goes into effect on June 27, 2023, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Visit the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Account Information</a> page to start verification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_school_supplies":"We’ve identified you have listing(s) at risk of removal due to non-compliance to local, state, and federal regulations regarding the sale of school supply products for children. To learn more about these compliance requirements, click <a href=/gp/help/external/help.html?itemID=XT3EFQS54LRKYM3&language=en_US&ref=ahd_uspc_adhoc_banner>here</a>. To prevent listing removal, please view your listings in scope of this compliance requirement <a href=/performance/account/health/product-policies?t=safe>here</a>, and follow the guidance listed under ‘Next Steps’ next to the listing(s) at risk of removal to ensure compliance with these requirements.","ahd_adhoc_mobile_inform_act_aha":"Note: If you do not complete all verification steps within the specified timelines, your account may be deactivated, regardless of your enrollment in Account Health Assurance.","ahd_aef_IPI_priority_action":"Virtual Identity Verification","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_join_call_link":"Visit <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">Identity Verification Portal</a> to join your scheduled video call.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_next_steps":"Visit the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">Identity Verification Portal</a>, to submit required documents and join a video call for virtual identity verification. You also have option to schedule a video call on a future date and time after submitting required documents.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason":"A review of your business has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent, or illegal activity; this can, in accordance with Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>, lead to account deactivation. To protect our customers and selling partners, we need to verify the identity of our sellers through a virtual identity verification process that takes place on a video call. ","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason_eu":"A review of your business has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent, or illegal activity; this can, in accordance with Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G201190440\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>, lead to account deactivation. To protect our customers and selling partners, we need to verify the identity of our sellers through a virtual identity verification process that takes place on a video call.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_review_fail":"A review of your business and the information you provided during your virtual identity verification, has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent, or illegal activity, which is in violation of Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_under_review":"We are reviewing the information you provided for identity verification. The review process may take up to 5 business days.","ahd_aef_action_panel_RA_reason":"Our review indicates that you have a separate account that was deactivated for violating one of our policies. As a result, the current selling account is in violation of our ‘Multiple Selling Accounts on Amazon’ policy outlined in the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G1801\\">Seller Code of Conduct</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_post_deactivation_appeal":"If you believe your account has been deactivated in error, you can submit new information by clicking \'Appeal\' button below.","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_food_and_prod_subreason":"Food and Product Safety Issues","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_listing_subreason":"Listing Policy Violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_other_subreason":"Other Policy Violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_auth_subreason":"Product Authenticity Customer Complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_cond_subreason":"Product Condition Customer Complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_review_subreason":"Customer Product Reviews Policy Violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reason":"Repeat Violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reg_comp_subreason":"Regulatory Compliance","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rip_subreason":"Received Intellectual Property Complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rp_subreason":"Restricted Product Policy","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_sip_subreason":"Suspected Intellectual Property Violations","ahd_aef_at_risk_HD_card_body":"To reactivate your disbursements, review your Priority Actions and address the outstanding action items.","ahd_aef_at_risk_card_sc_body":"You have one or more outstanding action items that will result in account deactivation.","ahd_aef_critical_message":"This critical issue if left unresolved will cause your account to be deactivated.","ahd_aef_critical_message_no_caps":"This critical issue if left unresolved will cause your account to be deactivated.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_body":"Address your account health issues to reactivate your account. Once the issues have been resolved, your account will be reactivated within 24 hours.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_sc_body":"Address your account health issues to reactivate your account.","ahd_aef_denver_eu":"Verify EU Establishment for Value Added Tax (VAT)","ahd_aef_denver_info":"Information Required","ahd_aef_denver_uk":"Verify UK Establishment for Value Added Tax (VAT)","ahd_aef_educational_card_action":"Resolve Issues","ahd_aef_impact_header":"Account Health Impact","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_post_deactivation":"Click the ‘Appeal\' button below and follow the instructions provided in order to reactivate this selling account.","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_pre_deactivation":"Click the \'Appeal\' button below and follow the instructions provided in order to avoid deactivation of this selling account.","ahd_aef_next_steps_header":"Address Your Violation","ahd_aef_pending_critical":"Pending Critical","ahd_aef_submit_header":"Submit Your Information","ahd_ahr_pending_critical":"Pending Critical","ahd_all_issues":"All Issues","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_body":"Your account will be considered for reactivation when your violations have been successfully appealed. ","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_header":"Your account has been deactivated. ","ahd_banner_block_mfn_at_risk_subtitle":"Your seller-fulfilled offers have been deactivated and your account is at-risk of deactivation. Complete your Priority Actions to reactivate your seller-fulfilled offers and prevent deactivation.","ahd_banner_block_mfn_subtitle":"Your seller-fulfilled offers have been deactivated. Complete your Priority Actions to reactivate your seller-fulfilled offers.","ahd_banner_eg_trn":"<b>Your account is at-risk of deactivation. </b><br><br>Your account is at-risk of deactivation because your Seller Central account does not include your valid Tax Registration Number. Visit the <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations> Tax Settings</a> page to update your Tax information within 90 days from the date of your first product listing on Amazon to avoid account deactivation. For more information, see the “Tax compliance frequently asked questions” <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC> help page. </a>","ahd_banner_resolve_issues_button":"Resolve Issues","ahd_be_jsl_at_risk_banner":"<b> Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br> You have not provided your Belgian VAT Registration Number (VRN) or confirmation of Union One-Stop Shop (OSS) status for your home country in your Amazon Seller Central account. Refer to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/external/GGTX8THLMMDJ3WBP> new Belgian legislation</a> to know more about the requirement and provide information.","ahd_be_jsl_priority_action":"Belgium VAT Legislation","ahd_brkyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Check your verification status on the <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional\\n?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity Information </a> page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"As per Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service and you are required to provide us with certain information or documents in order to facilitate these checks. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications.\\r\\n<br><br>Your account has been deactivated because we were not able to validate your identity information.<br><br> \\r\\nFor more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon </a> help page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_identity_info":"Visit the <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity Information</a>  page to complete verification.","ahd_brkyc_rap_intro":"As per Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You are required to provide us with certain information or documents in order to facilitate these checks. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications.\\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nFor more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon </a> help page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_verifying":"We are validating your information and may need to request details from you during this review. Please check the <a href=\'/performance/notifications\\r\\n?ref_=to_brkyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a> sections and respond to any requests relating to your Selling on Amazon account. This validation can take up to 24 hours, and might take up to 10 working days in some cases. During this time, your Identity Information cannot be edited.","ahd_cakyc_rap_action_hd":"Provide your identity verification information by the due date shown to avoid account deactivation. If you do not start verification and have 15 days or less remaining, your ability to disburse funds from your Amazon.ca selling account will be restricted. Verification is required under Canadian law.","ahd_cakyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Check your verification status on the <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> Identity Information page</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"Your account has been deactivated because we were not able to validate your identity information.  Canadian laws require us to verify your identity so that we can allow you to use our service. To reactivate your account, submit information needed to verify your identity. \\r\\n<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page","ahd_cakyc_rap_identity_info":"Visit the <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> Identity Information page</a> to complete verification. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_intro":"Canadian law requires us to verify your identity to allow you to use our service. We need you to provide us with certain information and documents so that we can conduct these verification checks. <br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page or refer to your <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_self_trigger_cta":"By clicking \'Begin Verification\', you are proceeding with the Canada verification requirements. Visit the<a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> Identity Information page</a> to confirm next steps. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_verifying":"We are validating your information. This validation can take between 24 hours and 10 working days, in some cases. We may need to request details from you during this review. Please check the <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a> section and respond to any additional requests relating to your Selling on Amazon account.  \\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nDuring this time, your Identity Information cannot be edited.","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph":"The verification of your identity is required by law for the use of a selling on Amazon account. As per Canadian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You may need to provide us with certain information and documents in order to faciliate these checks.<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph2":"Amazon allows up to 60 days for you to complete re-verification. The does not include the time we take to complete the review. Your ability to sell and disburse funds may be restricted if re-verification is not completed within 60 days. When we require information, a notification will appear on your Account Information page. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications. ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph3":"You will eventually be unable to use your selling on Amazon account. Therefore, you will not be able to sell on Amazon.ca if the information is not provided. ","ahd_collusion_policy":"Selling policies and Seller Code of Conduct","ahd_compliance_status":"Compliance Status","ahd_compliance_widget_ckp_redirect":"Launch Compliance Reference","ahd_critical_account_health_notification":"Critical Account Health Notification","ahd_critical_policy_violations":"Critical Policy Violations","ahd_dac7_at_risk_banner":"<b>Your account is at-risk of deactivation.</b><br><br> Your account is at risk of being deactivated because of missing tax information required under  <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB\\"> DAC7 legislation</a>. Visit the <a href= \\"/complianceportal\\">DAC7 Compliance Portal</a>  to start verification. ","ahd_dac7_compliant":"You are DAC7 compliant now!","ahd_dac7_priority_action":"DAC7 Information Required","ahd_dac7_priority_action_pending":"Pending Verification","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_launch_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Launch the DAC7 Portal to submit your information</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal_status":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_status_blurb\'  target=\'_blank\'>Check your verification status on the DAC7 Portal</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_intro":"The <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/external/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB?ref_=to_dac_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Directive on Administrative Cooperation - 7th Amendment (DAC7)</a> is an EU regulation that requires Amazon to collect, verify and report due diligence, VAT/Tax and financial data of EU-resident Sellers irrespective of the Amazon store they sell in.","ahd_dac7_rap_verify_now_button":"Verify Now","ahd_dac7_rap_verifying":"We are reviewing your DAC7 information. The review process usually takes 72 hours, but might take longer in some instances. Please check the status of your verification regularly in the DAC7 Portal below to know if we require more information.","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_description":"Go to the <a href=\'/hz/sc/account-information\' target=\'_blank\'>Account Information</a> page to complete verification. ","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Your Amazon.ca (Canada) store is at-risk of deactivation.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the Amazon.com.br store.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the Amazon.ca store.","ahd_eg_trn_deactivation_banner":"<b>Your account has been deactivated.</b><br><br> To reactivate your account, visit the <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations> Tax Settings</a> page to update your Tax information. For more information, see the “Tax compliance frequently asked questions” <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC>help page</a>. ","ahd_error_loading_submit":"An error happened. Please try submitting again.","ahd_eukyc_priority_action":"Identity Verification","ahd_inform_ac_checkbox_error":"Click the checkbox to confirm that you have reviewed your information and certify that it is accurate and current.","ahd_inform_ac_edu_display_name":"Review Your Account Information","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p1":"Under the US INFORM Consumers Act, you are required to keep certain business information (shown below) current and to electronically certify to Amazon that either you have updated your information or that the information already provided is still current. Certify that your information below is up-to-date within 10 days of viewing this notice, or your account will be at risk of deactivation. ","ahd_inform_ac_p1_header":"Get Ready to Certify Your Information","ahd_inform_ac_page1_checkbox":"Click the checkbox to confirm you have understand that once you go to the INFORM Act Notice and Certification page, you’ll receive a notice and have 10 days to update and certify your information.","ahd_inform_ac_page1_step1_intructions":"Go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Account Information</a> page or click the Edit button to update any information below that is incorrect. ","ahd_inform_ac_page2_certify_instructions":"If your information below is up to date, you can certify now. If any information is incorrect, go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Account Information</a>  page to edit your information before clicking \'Certify\'.","ahd_inform_account_information_update_verification":"Your account information has been updated and we are verifying your information. Check back in 24 hours to determine if any additional steps are needed to begin the Annual Certification process.","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_confirmation":"By clicking \\"Certify\\" I certify that I read the Notice above and that the information I provided to Amazon is true and correct, corresponds to my business, and is not misappropriated.","ahd_inform_act_ac_edit_information":"Edit Information","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"Email","ahd_inform_act_ac_not_required":"The INFORM Act does not yet apply to your business so you’re not currently required to certify your information. We’ll notify you in the future if you’re required to certify your information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou":"Thank you for certifying that your business information is current. Your Account Health page will update in a few minutes to confirm you have completed your outstanding INFORM Act Notice and Certification requirement.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou_banner":"Thank you for certifying that your business information is current. Your Account Health page will update in a few minutes to confirm you have completed your outstanding INFORM Act Notice and Certification requirement.\\n<br><br>Please remember that you are required to keep your business information current and to certify at least annually that your name, address, phone number, email address, bank account information, and Tax ID number are correct.","ahd_inform_act_ac_tin_field":"Tax Identification Number (TIN):","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions":"Please note that only the primary user or secondary user with authorized permissions to Confirm/Edit Account Information will be able to certify the information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions_error":"This information must be certified by the Account’s primary user or a secondary user authorized with permissions to Confirm/Edit Account Information.","ahd_inform_act_account_information":"Account Information","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_deactivation_banner":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Because we have not received the requested information, your account has been deactivated. To reactivate your account, review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to complete verification. <br><br>Once you have completed verifications for all outstanding requirements, your account will be reactivated within 48 hours. ","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_hold_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation and disbursements for your Amazon selling account have been put on hold.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Because we have not received the requested information within the timelines specified in our communications, your disbursements are now placed on hold. To reactivate your disbursements, review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to start or complete your information submission.","ahd_inform_act_hold_wait_text":"To reactivate your disbursements and prevent your account from being deactivated, click on the action items below to go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> and complete the pending requirements. <br><br>Thank you for completing identity verification. Check back in 24 hours to find out whether any additional verification steps are needed.","ahd_inform_act_hold_widget_description":"To reactivate your disbursements and prevent your account from being deactivated, click on the action items below to go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> and complete the pending requirements. <br><br>After completing the identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_wait_text":"Click on the action items below to complete the pending requirements. Thank you for completing Identity verification. Check in 24 hours to find out whether any additional verification steps are needed.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_widget_description":"Click on the action items below to complete the pending requirements. After completing the Identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_need_help":"Need help? Visit the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act Help page</a>.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have successfully completed all open verifications. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete_short":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have successfully completed all open verifications. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_inform_act_wait_text":"Thank you for verifying Identity. Check back in 24 hours for confirmation of whether any additional information is needed. <br><br> Click on the action items below to go to the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Seller Account Information</a> page and complete the pending requirements.","ahd_inform_act_widget_bank_account_field":"Bank Account","ahd_inform_act_widget_business_address_field":"Business Address","ahd_inform_act_widget_description":"Click on the action items below to go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> page and complete the pending requirements. <br><br> After completing Identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_widget_phone_number_field":"Phone Number","ahd_inform_act_widget_tax_id_field":"Tax ID Number","ahd_inform_annual_certification":"Annual Certification","ahd_inform_annual_review_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7?ref_=ahd_annual_ inform_consumer_act\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, your Selling on Amazon account information must be certified on an annual basis. Visit the <a href=\\"/mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render?ref_=ahd_annual_inform_certification\\">Annual Certification</a> page to certify that your information is current.","ahd_inform_annual_review_seller_enforced":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, you must certify the accuracy of your Selling on Amazon account information at least annually. Because we have not received the requested certification, your account has been deactivated. To reactivate your account, visit the <a href=\\" /mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render\\">Annual Certification</a> page to certify that your information is current. <br><br> Once you have completed certification, your account will be reactivated within 48 hours.","ahd_inform_bav_not_verified":"You don\'t have a verified bank account or didn\'t assign the verified bank account as your default deposit method to the US marketplace. Verify and assign your bank account as default on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView> Deposit Methods </a>page.","ahd_inform_company_registration_number":"Company Registration Number: ","ahd_inform_confirmation_p1":"Please remember that you are required to keep your business information current and to certify at least annually that your name, address, phone number, email address, bank account information, and Tax ID number are correct.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p2":"If any of your information changes, Amazon will need to verify this new information as well. Please respond promptly to any information requests so that we can work with you to complete these additional verification steps and avoid account deactivation. For more information about the verification process, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act Help page</a>.","ahd_inform_consumers_act_ac":"INFORM Act Notice and Certification","ahd_inform_consumers_act_annual":"INFORM Consumers Act Annual Certification ","ahd_inform_loading_error":"Go to the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information target=\\"_blank\\">Account Information</a> page to review your current information.","ahd_inform_no_default_deposit":"You don\'t have a verified bank account or didn\'t assign the verified bank account as your default deposit method to the US marketplace. Verify and assign your bank account as default on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView> Deposit Methods</a> page.","ahd_inform_page1_checkbox":"I understand that once I proceed to the INFORM Act Notice and Certification, I must complete certification within 10 days to avoid the risk of account deactivation. ","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2b":"However, you do not need to wait to receive the formal notification, and can take action now to avoid the risk of account deactivation later.","ahd_inform_page1_proceed_title":"Proceed to INFORM Act Notice and Certification","ahd_inform_page1_step2_description":"If your information is up to date, or if you have just updated it, proceed to the next step – the Notice and Certification – to receive your formal notice and complete your certification. Once you view this notice, the law requires you to certify your information within 10 days.","ahd_inform_sw_bav":"You must verify your active bank accounts. Verify your bank accounts here on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView> Deposit Methods</a> page.","ahd_inform_update_account_information_educational":"Visit the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Annual Certification</a> page to ensure your Selling on Amazon Account information is up to date.","ahd_itr_priority_action":"Italian tax ID for Italy based sellers required.","ahd_itr_rap_intro":"The <a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a> requires Italy based sellers who complete one or more transactions on Amazon.it to add their Italian codice fiscale in their Tax settings.","ahd_itr_remediation_corp":"Submit your Italian codice fiscale in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. According to our information (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), your account is registered as a company, and therefore we require your business registration number (known as \\"codice fiscale\\", corresponding to VAT ID without \\"IT\\" country code). Please refer to the Help page (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a>) for submission steps. You must ensure your legal name on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) and your business registration number in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Tax Authority database.","ahd_itr_remediation_individual":"Submit your Italian codice fiscale in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. According to our information (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), your account is registered as an individual, and therefore we require your Citizen ID (known as \\"codice fiscale\\"). Refer to the Help pages (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a>) for submission steps. You must ensure your legal name on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) and Citizen_ID number in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Tax Authority database.","ahd_itr_remediation_unkown":"Submit your information on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render). Companies must provide their business registration number (known as \\"codice fiscale\\", corresponding to VAT ID without \\"IT\\" country code), while Individual sellers, including sole proprietors (\\"P. IVA individuale\\") must upload their personal Citizen ID (also known as “codice fiscale”) in Tax Settings<https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. You must ensure your legal name on the Business Information Page <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render> and the codice fiscale in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Authority database.","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_details_fallback_text":"Have questions about maintaining a healthy account? Get personalized guidance from Seller Assistant.","ahd_more_information_hd":"More Information","ahd_new_feature_announcement_body_new_filters":"You can now filter policy violations by action taken on impacted listings. Go to the Product Policy Compliance page and click \\"Add Filters\\" to filter violations.","ahd_other_policy_violation_title":"Other Policy Violations","ahd_payment_policy_hd_priority_action":"Your funds are on hold due to pending actions on your account. Review the <b>Priority actions</b> to reactivate your disbursements.","ahd_pp_mas_r_policies_code_of_conduct":"Selling policies and Seller Code of Conduct","ahd_pr_form_address_header":"Address Non-Compliant Product Penalties to continue selling your products.","ahd_pr_form_address_sub_header":"As per the guidance from DOJ, Amazon simplifies your regulatory compliance obligations by reporting and paying  on behalf of your orders on Amazon and then recovering these amounts from your account.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_info":"In accordance with the EPA/DOJ Consent Decree, we are required to penalize Sellers for any violations on policies pertaining to EPA. Please find more information on <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account/health/product-policies\\">non-compliant products</a>, Calculate associated penalties, Reserves applied on your account, and Communications sent to submit appeals. You will then be charged for any outstanding penalties.<br/><br/> Before we charge you for the penalties, we will place a hold on your account while giving you a chance to remediate your listing.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_title":"How Does This Work?","ahd_pr_form_impact_header":"Possible account impact are as detailed below:","ahd_pr_form_impact_p1":"Liability to pay penalties (refer violation details below","ahd_pr_form_impact_p3":"Negative impact on your account health which may lead to deactivation of your seller account","ahd_pr_form_note":"Please note: Before we charge you for the penalties, we will place a hold on your account for 30 days while give you a chance to remediate your listing.","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_body":"This product has been identified as a pesticide product, pesticide device, or a product that contains pesticide claims. To be considered for reinstatement, please provide evidence of an EPA Registration number and/or EPA Establishment number or a certification that the product is exempt from EPA regulations. You will need to provide this information in the Pesticide Marking attribute for the listing. <a href=/help/hub/reference/GLX9EJX844SNJX7J> Instructions for completing this attribute are available on Seller Central.</a>","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_title":"Related Policy Information","ahd_pr_form_title":"Non-Compliant Product Details","ahd_priority_actions_cr":"Cancellation Rate (CR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_lsr":"Late Shipment Rate (LSR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_odr":"Order Defect Rate (ODR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_otdr":"On Time Delivery Rate (OTDR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_title":"Priority Actions","ahd_pspp_priority_actions":"Complete pending Know Your Customer (KYC) review - Payment Service Provider","ahd_pspp_rap_intro":"Your bank account is not eligible for receiving disbursement. Work with your Payment Service Provider to complete pending know-your-customer (KYC) review.","ahd_pspp_rap_next_steps":"Visit the <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GY8JTVAWBPQT2XFC?ref_=to_psp_faq_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Payment Service Provider FAQ</a> and <a href=\'/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView?ref_=to_deposit_method_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Deposit Methods</a> page for more information. ","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory":"Countries Impacted by Inventory Restrictions","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory_details":"Address the outstanding requirements to avoid disruption to your Fulfilled by Amazon Inventory and your import or export capabilities in the listed country.","ahd_rap_at_risk_regional_details":"The listed requirements are impacting your account health in multiple stores. Address the outstanding requirements to avoid account deactivation in all impacted stores.","ahd_rap_begin_verification":"Begin Verification ","ahd_rap_czech_republic":"Czech Republic","ahd_rap_enforced_inventory_details":"Address the outstanding requirements to remove the restrictions on your Fullfilled by Amazon Inventory and  import or export capabilities in the listed country.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p1":"The verification of your identity is required by law for the use of a selling on Amazon account. As required by Canadian and Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You may need to provide us with certain information and documents in order to facilitate these checks.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p3":"You can provide the required verification information at any time after you’ve registered. You will have limited access to your account until the information has been provided and verified.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p4":"If you would like to proceed and sell on Amazon.ca or Amazon.com.br, select the checkbox next to the store you would like to proceed with verification below. Once you have selected to proceed with verification, visit the Identity Information page to determine next steps.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p5":"If you want to proceed with verification for a single store first, select only that store from the list below. Once you have completed verification for that store, you will be notified to complete the required steps to begin verification for the other store.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_thankyou_p2":"We are validating your information and may need to request details from you during this review. This validation can take up to 24 hours and might take up to 10 working days in some cases. During this time, your Identity Information cannot be edited.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_check_verification_status":"Check your verification status and required next steps on the Account Information page.","ahd_rap_past_due_inventory":"PAST DUE - Inventory Capabilities Restricted","ahd_rap_voluntary_submission_action":"Based on the information available to us you are not required to hold a ${countryName} VAT number, to comply with this requirement you can either remove it from <a href=\'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Tax Settings</a> or proceed with resolving the issue above.","ahd_regulatory_compliance":"Regulatory Compliance","ahd_related_accounts_policy_reason":"Seller code of conduct (Multiple Selling Accounts on Amazon)","ahd_sa_account_health_guidance_description":"Have questions about account health? Get personalized guidance from Seller Assistant.","ahd_sa_chat_about_account_health_text":"How\'s my Account Health?","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_label":"Summarize Product Compliance","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_text":"Can you summarize my product compliance violations?","ahd_save_changes_button":"Save Changes","ahd_status_past_due":"Past Due","ahd_uaebizlicense_priority_action":"Upload your trade license","ahd_vas_extension_extension_request_link":"submit the required documentation.","ahd_vas_priority_action":"European VAT Registration Requirements","ahd_vas_rap_deactivated_message":"The listed requirements are impacting your account health in multiple stores. Address the outstanding requirements for the listed country to reactivate your account in all impacted stores.","ahd_vas_rap_intro":"The <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GTQ23HPXBQK563WS\' target=\'_blank\'>European VAT registration requirements</a>  is a European Amazon Stores policy that requires all Selling Partners active in European stores to submit a valid VAT registration number whenever they have a requirement.  Review the Account Health Impact section to complete your outstanding requirements.","ahd_vas_rap_secondary_action":"If you do not have a VAT Registration Number for the listed country, visit the <a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>Business Information</a> portal and <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Tax Settings</a> portal to submit the required information (VAT number, name, address) for the following countries:","ahd_vas_rap_third_action":"If you have opted into Union-OSS in your home country please visit <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Tax Settings</a> Page selecting your home country from the Union-OSS VAT Declaration menu. Ensure your Union-OSS is enabled and name and address provided to Amazon are matching the ones provided to Authorities.","ahd_vas_rap_verifying":"We are reviewing your VAT Registration Numbers details. This can take up to 14 days. We will contact you if additional information are required.","ahd_view_all_pa":"View all Priority Actions (${totalCount})","ahd_violation_appeal_button":"Proceed with Appeal","ahd_violation_details":"Violation Details","ahd_violation_display_name":"Restricted Product Policy Violation","ahd_violation_status_assessment_phase":"Penalties in Assessment Phase - Disbursements may be impacted.","ahd_w8_priority_action":"Updated U.S. Tax Identity Information Required","ahd_w8_rap_action":"You are now required to complete your self-service tax interview before the due date. Your submission can take up to 24 hours to process.","ahd_w8_rap_deactivated_action":"Submit the required information to reactivate your account. Your submission can take up to 24 hours to process.","ahd_w8_rap_intro":"A new W-8 tax form is required. Once your form expires, your selling account will be temporarily deactivated until you provide updated tax information.\\n\\n<br><br>These requirements impact your account health in multiple stores.  Address the listed requirements to avoid account deactivation in all impacted stores.\\n\\n<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G200663290?ref_=to_w8_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>US Income Reporting & Tax Identity Collection FAQ.</a>","ai_inform_page1_step1":"1. Go to your Account Information page [link to Account Information page here] to review your account information (and update, if necessary).","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Because Katal Components are extensions of HTML elements, JavaScript can interact with them the same as built-in HTML elements. Here we see JavaScript changing the \'variant\' attribute on the alert.","components_containing_html_text":"Some components can contain HTML content, like our KatalTabs component. These complex components provide an API so developers and frameworks can interact with them.","custom_elements_text":"Katal gives developers the ability to use custom-designed elements to build their web pages. For example, if the developer needs a button, they can use <kat-button></kat-button> instead of building a button themselves.","demo_complex_header_text":"Demonstration: Complex Katal Components","demo_components_header_text":"Demonstration: Using Katal Components","demo_javascript_header_text":"Demonstration: JavaScript with Katal Components","design_approved_text":"Katal offers design-approved components for use in web pages that can be configured with labels and custom settings. For example: regular buttons and secondary buttons, different only in their \'variant\' attribute.","discovery_ahd_ni_warn_pdp":"Product Detail Page","documentation_label":"Katal Documentation","fba_inventory_uc_identifier":"Our records indicate that you are holding inventory in ${COUNTRY} through the Fulfilled by Amazon (FBA) program. As a seller using FBA services, you are required to provide a valid VAT registration number for each country where your inventory is stored. You can verify the countries where you have enabled FBA <a href=/fba/settings/ target=\\"_blank\\">here</a>.\\r\\nPlease keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","greeting_description":"This is a sample Katal application, demonstrating how to use Katal Components as well as build-and-deploy tooling. Please contact the Katal team at colombia-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments. To continue this demo, please dismiss this alert.","greeting_description_mons_app":"This is a sample Katal application, demonstrating how to use Katal Components with translations. Please contact the Katal team at katal-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments.","greeting_header":"Sample App Information","information-requests":"Information Requests","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Send Feedback","mobile_ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"Please sign in to Seller Central from a web browser.","mobile_ahd_banner_eg_trn":"Update your tax registration number on the Tax Settings page in your Seller Central account.","poe_domestic_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicates that your sales in ${COUNTRY} exceed the domestic threshold for VAT registration.","ppc_fhdds_action_taken":"Risk of UK inbounding restriction","ppc_fhdds_action_taken_past_due":"UK inbounding capabilities are currently restricted","ppc_fhdds_reason":"FHDDS: Shipment Missing Import Entry Number (IEN)","primary_button_label":"Primary Button","product-policy-compliance":"Product Policy Compliance","sample_app_page_title_text":"Sample Application","sc_homepage_education_phase_description":"Address your account health to avoid the risk of future account deactivation.","sc_inform_act_view_account_health_banner":"Go to Account Health","sc_navbar_ah_cs_desc":"View your customer service performance metrics, including your order defect and invoice defect rates.","sc_navbar_ah_desc":"View your Account Health Rating, issues impacting your account health, and violations that may result in content removal or account deactivation.","sc_navbar_ah_eligibilities_desc":"View benefits and programs you may be eligible for.","sc_navbar_ah_myc_desc":"Ensure all your products comply with all applicable, laws, regulations, and Amazon policies.","sc_navbar_ah_sp_desc":"View your shipping performance metrics, including Late Shipment Rate, Pre-fulfillment Cancel Rate, Valid Tracking Rate, and On-Time Delivery Rate.  ","schp_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_subtitle":"Go to your Account Health page and complete your Priority Actions to begin selling on Amazon.","schp_complete_priority_actions":"Complete your Priority Actions","secondary_button_label":"Secondary Button","ship_from_non_poe_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are shipping from ${COUNTRY} which is different than your home country, therefore, you are required to provide a valid VIES VAT number or applicable VAT number for EU transactions. You can verify your shipping address from Shipping Settings page or from this <a href=/sbr target=\\"_blank\\">link</a>.\\r\\nPlease keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","ship_from_poe_uc_identifier":"Our records indicate that your cross-border sales exceed €10,000 across EU countries. As a seller engaged in cross-border sales, you are required to provide either UOSS-enabled VAT number from you establishment country or valid VAT numbers for all countries you ship to.","ship_to_non_eu_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you have shipments exceeding €150 from outside EU into ${COUNTRY}. Therefore, you are required to provide a valid ${COUNTRY} VAT number or a declaration confirming that you are not the Importer Of Record for the shipment(s) above threshold.","ship_to_uoss_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are conducting cross-border sales into ${COUNTRY} from other EU country and, therefore, you are required to provide an UOSS-enabled VAT number from your establishment country or valid ${COUNTRY} VAT number.\\r\\nPlease keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","sp-permanent-call-me-now-title":"Need Help?","sp_health_cancellation_rate_caption":"Pre-fulfillment Cancel Rate","sp_health_customer_satisfaction_information_label":"Order Defect Rate consists of three different metrics:","sp_health_dashboard_guardian_title_new":"Account Health Assurance","sp_health_dashboard_subheader":"To sell on Amazon, you must adhere to the below performance targets and policies.","sp_health_dashboard_title":"Account Health","sp_health_download_report_caption":"Download Report","sp_health_gl_watch":"Watch","sp_health_intellectual_property_customer_complaints":"Received Intellectual Property Complaints","sp_health_late_shipment_rate_caption":"Late Shipment Rate","sp_health_listing_policy_customer_complaints":"Listing Policy Violations","sp_health_mobile_by_ahr_impact_tab_title":"By AHR Impact","sp_health_nav_myc":"Manage Your Compliance","sp_health_nav_orders_with_defects":"Orders with Defects","sp_health_not_available":"N/A","sp_health_order_defect_rate_caption":"Order Defect Rate","sp_health_pre_fulfillment_cancel_rate":"Pre-fulfillment Cancel Rate","sp_health_product_policies":"Product Policy Compliance","sp_health_product_quality_popover":"This total will include complaints which you may have already addressed through a Plan of Action.","sp_health_product_safety_customer_complaints":"Food and Product Safety Issues","sp_health_restricted_products_violations_policy":"Restricted Product Policy Violations","sp_health_risk_banner_vtr":"Your seller-fulfilled offers are at risk of deactivation. Your Valid Tracking Rate is ${hash-get metricValue}; the target is ${hash-get target}.","sp_health_seller_fulfilled_metrics_caption":"Seller Fulfilled","sp_health_shipping_bucket_caption":"Shipping Performance","sp_health_shipping_eligibilities":"View shipping eligibilities here","sp_health_time_window":"Time Window: ${hash-get numDays} days","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_caption":"Valid Tracking Rate","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_subtitle":"<b>Target</b>: over ${hash-get targetValue}","sp_health_violation_details_stale_page_button_label":"Back to Account Health","sp_mfn_at_risk_warning":"Your seller-fulfilled offers are at risk of deactivation","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_defects":"You do not currently have any defects of this order.","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_order":"This order doesn\'t exist.","sp_st_date_range":"${hash-get startDate} - ${hash-get endDate}","sp_st_heading_order_asin":"ASIN","sp_st_heading_order_edd":"Expected Deliver Date","sp_st_heading_order_esd":"Expected Ship Date","sp_st_str_with_description":"${hash-get description} : ${hash-get str}","sp_st_zero_out_metrics_message":"Orders received prior to June 1 are not used to evaluate your account health and do not display here.","sp_vtr_list_ca":"1. Heavy and bulky items shipped by a carrier not integrated with Amazon. Learn more on integrated carriers.</br></br>2. Small and light items that have order value less than $CAD 30 (including shipping charges) and are shipped in Canada Post Standard Mail envelopes or First Class Mail envelopes.</br></br>3. International shipments shipped from China that have order value less than $CAD 6 (including shipping charges)</br></br>4. International shipments shipped from outside of US and China.</br></br>5. Digital orders that cannot physically shipped by a carrier, e.g. Audio book","sp_zero_tolerance_banner_body":"Due to one or more critical violations, your account is pending deactivation. To prevent deactivation, please address these violations now. For more information, go to the <a href=/gp/help/G200205250>Account Health Rating program policy</a>.","tab_demo_generated_text":"Auto Generated Tab {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Selected Tab","ts-form-header":"Report an abuse","valid_vat_number_uc_identifier":"Please keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","voluntary_vrn_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are not required to hold a VAT number in ${COUNTRY} but you have provided one on Seller Central that is currently not valid. To resolve this discrepancy, you can either remove the ${COUNTRY} VAT Number or provide a valid one. By removing your ${COUNTRY} VAT Number from Seller Central you are confirming that you are not required to hold one in ${COUNTRY}. We recommend consulting with a tax advisor to determine whether your overall business activities, both on and off Amazon, require VAT registration."}},"en-ZA":{"pages.floatingWidget":{"DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_content":"You’re part of an experiment to improve seller experience: starting now, strong performance on Buyer Contact Rate, Contact Response Time and Buyer Dissatisfaction Rate can boost your AHR (account health rating) score! This change helps AHR reward excellent customer service. Check your customer service performance on Feedback Manager now.","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_cta_done":"Feedback Manager","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_header":"Earn AHR points for strong customer service","DYK_JP_LINE_content":"Amazon LINE Official Account sends selected notifications about the notifications we sent via email and Seller Central requiring actions by Sellers regarding topics such as your account’s status, listing status and payment disbursement errors. Connect your Seller Central account to the LINE official account to receive notifications via LINE and avoid missing important notifications. Learn More","DYK_JP_LINE_header":"You can connect with LINE account to receive personalised important messages that matters to your account health.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_content":"Great news! You’re within 60 days of qualifying for Account Health Assurance (AHA). Maintain your Account Health Rating above 250 and keep a verified emergency contact number on file to secure enhanced account protection. We’ll notify you via email once you’re automatically enrolled.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_header":"Nearing Account Health Assurance enrolment","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_content":"Your Account Health Rating has moved into At Risk or Unhealthy status. Click “Call Me Now” to speak with an Account Health Specialist and protect your selling privileges.","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_cta_done":"Call Me Now","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_header":"Your Account Health Rating Needs Attention","DYK_SSAT_CFT_DietarySupp_content":"Protect your Dietary Supplement listings through Compliance Fast-Track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_Toys_content":"Protect your Toys category listings through Compliance Fast-Track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_artscrafts_content":"Protect your Arts and Crafts Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_buttoncellbatteryproducts_content":"Protect your Button Cell Battery category listings through Compliance Fast-Track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_childrensproducts_content":"Protect your Children’s Products category listings through Compliance Fast-Track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_cta_done":"Sign up today","DYK_SSAT_CFT_electronics_content":"Protect your Electronics Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_emobilityproducts_content":"Protect your E-mobility category listings through Compliance Fast-Track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_firesafety_content":"Protect your Fire Safety category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_furniture_content":"Protect your Furniture Category listings through Compliance Fast-track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_header":"Simplify compliance: Enrol in Compliance Fast-Track today","DYK_SSAT_CFT_infantbabyproducts_content":"Protect your Infant and Baby Products category listings through Compliance Fast-Track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_ppe_content":"Protect your Personal Protection Equipment category listings through Compliance Fast-Track. Get automatic compliance validation when a participating organisation certifies your products, eliminating the need to submit compliance documentation.","DYK_SSAT_EDU_JULY":"Keys to the Account Health Rating","DYK_SSAT_EDU_content":"AHR monitors your account’s deactivation risk using a points system. You gain points for successfully fulfilling orders. You lose points when policy violations are detected and recover points when you successfully address those violations. Review your Account Health dashboard often and address policy violations as they arise.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_content":"We’re excited to announce Seller Challenge, a new feature for Account Health Assurance sellers. Seller Challenge provides a limited number of opportunities to request a separate review of listing issues through your Account Health page. Once you submit a challenge, we strive to respond with a decision in 48 hours.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_cta_done":"Learn more","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop_header":"Healthy AHR tip","ahd_dyk_bhdr_content":"We recommend delivering more than 90% of your Amazon Business commercial shipments during business hours to maintain a good customer experience","ahd_dyk_bhdr_cta":"View Performance","ahd_dyk_bhdr_header":"Your Business Hour Delivery Rate is low.","ahd_dyk_br_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Your Amazon.com.br (Brazil) store is at risk of deactivation.","ahd_dyk_de_sup_label":"To comply with the EPR: Germany Single Use Plastic policy (effective since January 1, 2025), take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for each brand and product type combination. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GA4JYZX23CLK8WFW\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_de_sup_title":"You have listings affected by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): Germany Single Use Plastic policy","ahd_dyk_de_sup_weee_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): Germany WEEE","ahd_dyk_description_eukyc":"In accordance with EU regulations, you must complete an account verification process. Go to the Identity information page to complete verification. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G201200780 \\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_label":"To comply with the EPR: take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for each brand and product type combination. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GYDCAK9ZR6VJH2X3\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_title":"You have listings impacted by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR)","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_label":"To comply with the EPR: EU Batteries policy (effective from August 18, 2025), take action now by providing EPR registration numbers for your product categories. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GPVDATLHQ6PRQNSW\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_title":"You have listings affected by Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR): EU Batteries","ahd_dyk_fhdds_cta":"Review shipments","ahd_dyk_fhdds_description":"Provide the import details for all your applicable shipments in your shipping queue before they disrupt your business. Missing import details could restrict your ability to create new UK shipments.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.com.br/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.com.br</a> store.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.ca/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.ca</a> store.","ahd_dyk_title_eukyc":"Complete your EU Know Your Customer (KYC) verification","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description":"To comply with the GPSR, which goes into effect on December 13, 2024, please provide additional compliance information for your products to avoid impact to your listings. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">Learn more</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_task":"You have listings affected by the General Product Safety Regulation (GPSR).","ahd_floating_widget_aha_ec_description":"As a member of the AHA programme, you are <b>required</b> to maintain a valid emergency contact number. Verify your emergency contact details to retain AHA eligibility, so our specialists can get in contact to help you address critical account health-related issues before they disrupt your business.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_action_panel_title":"Emergency contact information update","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_food_and_safety_heading":"You have repeat violations for Food and product safety issues","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_ip_heading":"You have repeat violations for receiving intellectual property complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_listing_heading":"You have repeat violations for Listing policy violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_other_heading":"You have repeat violations for Other policy violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_auth_heading":"You have repeat violations for Product authenticity customer complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_cond_heading":"You have repeat violations for Product condition customer complaints","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_reviews_heading":"You have repeat violations for Customer product reviews policy violations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_reg_comp_heading":"You have repeat violations for Regulatory compliance","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_rp_heading":"You have repeat violations of the Restricted Product policy","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_sip_heading":"You have repeat violations for Suspected intellectual property violations","ahd_floating_widget_resolve_now_button_text":"Resolve now","cs_nerd_suggestion_top_issues_action_vi":"View issues","dyk_ahd_pra_rv":"You have repeat violations for product review policy violations."},"pages.homepage":{"AHD_DD14_Base_Reserve":"Sales proceeds are held through 14 days after delivery date and become available for disbursement starting on the 15th day after delivery date. If the actual delivery date is not available, we use the latest estimated delivery date for the order. This is your default payment policy.","AHD_POA_APPEAL_ERROR_LOADING":"An error happened. Please refresh the page.","DR_VAT_AHD_NC_BANNER":"We’ve not been able to verify your business establishment for VAT purposes. To ensure accurate tax treatment, verify your establishment for VAT purposes.","DR_VAT_AHD_PRIORITY_ACTION":"Establishment Verification Required for VAT Purposes","Engage_Appeal_05":"Seller code of conduct (favourably influencing customers to manipulate your sales ratings, feedback or reviews)","LocalizedPageTitleDashboard":"Performance dashboard","LocalizedPageTitleDetailCustomerSatisfaction":"Customer satisfaction details page.","LocalizedPageTitleDetailProductPolicies":"Product policies details page.","NO_METRICS":"You don’t have any orders counting towards this metric at the moment.\\n","RR_AHR_Warn_1":"Multiple selling accounts on Amazon","acf_banner_inform_act":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller Account Information</a> to start verification.","acf_inform_act_wait_text":"Thank you for verifying Identity. Check back in 24 hours for confirmation of whether any additional information is needed. ","acf_inform_act_widget_description":"After completing Identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","addTab_label":"Add tab","aef_address_your_violation":"Address your violation","ags_pcx_voc_summary_voice_of_the_customer":"Voice of the Customer","ahd_Inform_deposit_method":"Deposit method information","ahd_account_impacted_details":"Your account may be affected as detailed below:","ahd_account_regulatory_compliance":"Account regulatory compliance","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller account information</a> to start verification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_aha":"<b> Please note that if you have not completed all verification items when the INFORM Consumers Act takes effect, your account may be deactivated, regardless of your enrolment in Account Health Assurance.</b>","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_thankyou":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have successfully completed all open verifications. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_v2":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>US INFORM Consumers Act</a>, which goes into effect on June 27, 2023, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Currently, you have one or more verification action items pending. Go to the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Account information</a> page to start verification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_school_supplies":"We’ve identified that you have listing(s) at risk of removal due to non-compliance to local, state and federal regulations regarding the sale of school supply products for children. To learn more about these compliance requirements, click <a href=/gp/help/external/help.html?itemID=XT3EFQS54LRKYM3&language=en_US&ref=ahd_uspc_adhoc_banner>here</a>. To prevent listing removal, please view your listings in scope of this compliance requirement <a href=/performance/account/health/product-policies?t=safe>here</a> and follow the guidance listed under “Next steps” beside the listing(s) at risk of removal to ensure compliance with these requirements.","ahd_adhoc_mobile_inform_act_aha":"Note: If you do not complete all verification steps within the specified timeline, your account may be deactivated, regardless of your enrolment in Account Health Assurance.","ahd_aef_IPI_priority_action":"Virtual identity verification","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_join_call_link":"Go to the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">Identity Verification Portal</a> to join your scheduled video call.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_next_steps":"Go to the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">Identity Verification Portal</a> to submit required documents and join a video call for virtual identity verification. You also have the option to schedule a video call at a future date and time after submitting required documents.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason":"A review of your business has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity; this can, in accordance with Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>, lead to account deactivation. To protect our customers and selling partners, we need to verify the identity of our sellers through a virtual identity verification process that takes place on a video call. ","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason_eu":"A review of your business has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity; this can, in accordance with Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G201190440\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>, lead to account deactivation. To protect our customers and selling partners, we need to verify the identity of our sellers through a virtual identity verification process that takes place on a video call.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_review_fail":"A review of your business and the information that you provided during your virtual identity verification has identified that your account may have been used for deceptive, fraudulent or illegal activity, which is in violation of Section 3 of the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_under_review":"We are reviewing the information that you provided for identity verification. The review process may take up to five working days.","ahd_aef_action_panel_RA_reason":"Our review has indicated that you have a separate account that was deactivated for violating one of our policies. As a result, the current selling account is in violation of our “Multiple Selling Accounts on Amazon” policy outlined in the <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G1801\\">Seller Code of Conduct</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_post_deactivation_appeal":"If you believe that your account has been deactivated in error, you can submit new information by clicking the “Appeal” button below.","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_food_and_prod_subreason":"Food and product safety issues","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_listing_subreason":"Listing policy violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_other_subreason":"Other policy violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_auth_subreason":"Product authenticity customer complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_cond_subreason":"Product condition customer complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_review_subreason":"Customer product reviews policy violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reason":"Repeat violations","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reg_comp_subreason":"Regulatory compliance","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rip_subreason":"Received intellectual property complaints","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rp_subreason":"Restricted product policy","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_sip_subreason":"Suspected intellectual property violations","ahd_aef_at_risk_HD_card_body":"To reactivate your disbursements, review your priority actions and address the outstanding action items.","ahd_aef_at_risk_card_sc_body":"You have one or more outstanding action items that will result in future account deactivation.","ahd_aef_critical_message":"This critical issue, if left unresolved, will cause your account to be deactivated.","ahd_aef_critical_message_no_caps":"This critical issue, if left unresolved, will cause your account to be deactivated.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_body":"Address your account health issues to reactivate your account. Once the issues have been resolved, your account will be reactivated within 24 hours.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_sc_body":"Address your account health issues to reactivate your account.","ahd_aef_denver_eu":"Verify EU establishment for Value Added Tax (VAT)","ahd_aef_denver_info":"Information required","ahd_aef_denver_uk":"Verify UK establishment for Value Added Tax (VAT)","ahd_aef_educational_card_action":"Resolve issues","ahd_aef_impact_header":"Account Health impact","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_post_deactivation":"Click the “Appeal” button below and follow the instructions provided in order to reactivate this selling account.","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_pre_deactivation":"Click the “Appeal” button below and follow the instructions provided in order to avoid deactivation of this selling account.","ahd_aef_next_steps_header":"Address Your Violation","ahd_aef_pending_critical":"Pending critical","ahd_aef_submit_header":"Submit your information","ahd_ahr_pending_critical":"Pending critical","ahd_all_issues":"All issues","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_body":"Your account will be considered for reactivation when your violations have been successfully appealed. ","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_header":"Your account has been deactivated. ","ahd_banner_block_mfn_at_risk_subtitle":"Your Fulfilled by Merchant offers have been deactivated and your account is at risk of deactivation. Complete your priority actions to reactivate your Fulfilled by Merchant offers and prevent deactivation.","ahd_banner_block_mfn_subtitle":"Your Fulfilled by Merchant offers have been deactivated. Complete your priority actions to reactivate your Fulfilled by Merchant offers.","ahd_banner_eg_trn":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br>Your account is at risk of deactivation because your Seller Central account does not include your valid tax registration number. Go to the <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations> Tax settings</a> page to update your tax information within 90 days from the date of your first product listing on Amazon to avoid account deactivation. For more information, go to the “Tax compliance frequently asked questions” <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC> help page. </a>","ahd_banner_resolve_issues_button":"Resolve issues","ahd_be_jsl_at_risk_banner":"<b> Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br> You have not provided your Belgian VAT Registration Number (VRN) or confirmation of Union One-Stop Shop (OSS) status for your home country in your Amazon Seller Central account. Go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/external/GGTX8THLMMDJ3WBP> new Belgian legislation</a> to find out more about the requirement and provide information.","ahd_be_jsl_priority_action":"Belgium VAT Legislation","ahd_brkyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Check your verification status on the <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional\\n?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity information </a> page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"As per Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service, and you are required to provide us with certain information or documents in order to facilitate these checks. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications.\\r\\n<br><br>Your account has been deactivated because we were not able to validate your identity information.<br><br> \\r\\nFor more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon </a> help page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_identity_info":"Go to the <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Identity information</a>  page to complete verification.","ahd_brkyc_rap_intro":"As per Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You are required to provide us with certain information or documents in order to facilitate these checks. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications.\\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nFor more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon </a> help page.","ahd_brkyc_rap_verifying":"We are validating your information and may need to request details from you during this review. Please check the <a href=\'/performance/notifications\\r\\n?ref_=to_brkyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a> sections and respond to any requests relating to your Selling on Amazon account. This validation can take up to 24 hours and might take up to 10 working days in some cases. During this time, your identity information cannot be edited.","ahd_cakyc_rap_action_hd":"Provide your identity verification information by the due date shown to avoid account deactivation. If you do not start verification and have 15 days or less remaining, your ability to disburse funds from your Amazon.ca selling account will be restricted. Verification is required under Canadian law.","ahd_cakyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Check your verification status on the <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> Identity information page</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"Your account has been deactivated because we were not able to validate your identity information.  Canadian laws require us to verify your identity so that we can allow you to use our service. To reactivate your account, submit the information that is needed to verify your identity. \\r\\n<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page","ahd_cakyc_rap_identity_info":"Visit the <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> Identity Information page</a> to complete verification. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_intro":"Canadian law requires us to verify your identity to allow you to use our service. We need you to provide us with certain information and documents so that we can conduct these verification checks. <br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page or refer to your <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance notifications</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_self_trigger_cta":"By clicking “Begin Verification”, you are proceeding with the Canada verification requirements. Visit the<a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> Identity Information page</a> to confirm next steps. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_verifying":"We are validating your information. This validation can take between 24 hours and ten working days in some cases. We may need to request details from you during this review. Please check the <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Performance Notifications</a> section and respond to any additional requests relating to your Selling on Amazon account.  \\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nDuring this time, your identity information cannot be edited.","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph":"The verification of your identity is required by law for the use of a Selling on Amazon account. As per Canadian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You may need to provide us with certain information and documents in order to facilitate these checks.<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Information required to sell on Amazon</a> help page","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph2":"Amazon allows up to 60 days for you to complete re-verification. The does not include the time we take to complete the review. Your ability to sell and disburse funds may be restricted if re-verification is not completed within 60 days. When we require information, a notification will appear on your Account Information page. We may provide additional information about the request in your Performance Notifications. ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph3":"You will eventually be unable to use your selling on Amazon account. Therefore, you will not be able to sell on Amazon.ca if the information is not provided. ","ahd_collusion_policy":"Selling policies and Seller Code of Conduct","ahd_compliance_status":"Compliance status","ahd_compliance_widget_ckp_redirect":"Launch compliance reference","ahd_critical_account_health_notification":"Critical Account Health Notification","ahd_critical_policy_violations":"Critical policy violations","ahd_dac7_at_risk_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation.</b><br><br> Your account is at risk of being deactivated because of missing tax information required under <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB\\"> DAC7 legislation</a>. Go to the <a href= \\"/complianceportal\\">DAC7 Compliance Portal</a>  to start verification. ","ahd_dac7_compliant":"You are DAC7 compliant now!","ahd_dac7_priority_action":"DAC7 information required","ahd_dac7_priority_action_pending":"Pending verification","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_launch_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Launch the DAC7 portal to submit your information</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal_status":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_status_blurb\'  target=\'_blank\'>Check your verification status on the DAC7 portal</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_intro":"The <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/external/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB?ref_=to_dac_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Directive on Administrative Cooperation – 7th Amendment (DAC7)</a> is an EU regulation that requires Amazon to collect, verify and report due diligence, VAT/tax and financial data of EU-resident sellers irrespective of the Amazon store they sell in.","ahd_dac7_rap_verify_now_button":"Verify now","ahd_dac7_rap_verifying":"We are reviewing your DAC7 information. The review process usually takes 72 hours, but might take longer in some instances. Please check the status of your verification regularly in the DAC7 portal below to find out whether we require more information.","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_description":"Go to the <a href=\'/hz/sc/account-information\' target=\'_blank\'>Account Information</a> page to complete verification. ","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Your Amazon.ca (Canada) store is at risk of deactivation.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the Amazon.com.br store.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"You have outstanding action items to begin selling in the Amazon.ca store.","ahd_eg_trn_deactivation_banner":"<b>Your account has been deactivated.</b><br><br> To reactivate your account, go to the <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations> Tax settings</a> page to update your tax information. For more information, go to the “Tax compliance frequently asked questions” <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC>help page</a>. ","ahd_error_loading_submit":"An error happened. Please try submitting again.","ahd_eukyc_priority_action":"Identity verification","ahd_inform_ac_checkbox_error":"Tick the box to confirm that you have reviewed your information and certify that it is accurate and current.","ahd_inform_ac_edu_display_name":"Review your account information","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p1":"Under the US INFORM Consumers Act, you are required to keep certain business information (shown below) current and to electronically certify to Amazon that either you have updated your information or that the information already provided is still current. Certify that your information below is up to date within 10 days of viewing this notice or your account will be at risk of deactivation. ","ahd_inform_ac_p1_header":"Get ready to certify your information","ahd_inform_ac_page1_checkbox":"Tick the box to confirm you have understood that once you go to the INFORM Act notice and certification page, you’ll receive a notice and have 10 days to update and certify your information.","ahd_inform_ac_page1_step1_intructions":"Go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Account information</a> page or click the Edit button to update any information below that is incorrect. ","ahd_inform_ac_page2_certify_instructions":"If your information below is up to date, you can certify now. If any information is incorrect, go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Account information</a>  page to edit your information before clicking “Certify”.","ahd_inform_account_information_update_verification":"Your account information has been updated and we are verifying your information. Check again in 24 hours to determine if any additional steps are needed to begin the annual certification process.","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_confirmation":"By clicking “Certify”, I certify that I’ve read the Notice above and that the information I’ve provided to Amazon is true and correct, corresponds to my business and is not misappropriated.","ahd_inform_act_ac_edit_information":"Edit information","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"Email address","ahd_inform_act_ac_not_required":"The INFORM Act does not yet apply to your business so you’re not currently required to certify your information. We’ll notify you in the future if you’re required to certify your information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou":"Thank you for certifying that your business information is current. Your Account Health page will be updated in a few minutes to confirm that you have completed your outstanding INFORM Act notice and certification requirement.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou_banner":"Thank you for certifying that your business information is current. Your Account Health page will be updated in a few minutes to confirm that you have completed your outstanding INFORM Act notice and certification requirement.\\n<br><br>Please remember that you are required to keep your business information current and to certify at least annually that your name, address, phone number, email address, bank account information and Tax ID number are correct.","ahd_inform_act_ac_tin_field":"Tax Identification Number (TIN):","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions":"Please note that only the primary user or secondary user with authorised permissions to confirm/edit account information will be able to certify the information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions_error":"This information must be certified by the account’s primary user or a secondary user authorised with permissions to confirm/edit account information.","ahd_inform_act_account_information":"Account information","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_deactivation_banner":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Because we have not received the requested information, your account has been deactivated. To reactivate your account, review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller account information</a> to complete verification. <br><br>After you have completed verifications for all outstanding requirements, your account will be reactivated within 48 hours. ","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_hold_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation and disbursements for your Amazon selling account have been put on hold.</b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon needs to collect and verify information about your Selling on Amazon account. Because we have not received the requested information within the timeline specified in our communications, your disbursements are now placed on hold. To reactivate your disbursements, review the list below and go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller account information</a> to start or complete your information submission.","ahd_inform_act_hold_wait_text":"To reactivate your disbursements and prevent your account from being deactivated, click the action items below to go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller account information</a> and complete the pending requirements. <br><br>Thank you for completing identity verification. Check again in 24 hours to find out whether any additional verification steps are needed.","ahd_inform_act_hold_widget_description":"To reactivate your disbursements and prevent your account from being deactivated, click the action items below to go to <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller account information</a> and complete the pending requirements. <br><br>After completing the identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_wait_text":"Click the action items below to complete the pending requirements. Thank you for completing identity verification. Check again in 24 hours to find out whether any additional verification steps are needed.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_widget_description":"Click the action items below to complete the pending requirements. After completing the identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_need_help":"Need help? Go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act help page</a>.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have successfully completed all open verifications. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete_short":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>We have successfully completed all open verifications. We appreciate your efforts in supporting this verification process.","ahd_inform_act_wait_text":"Thank you for verifying your identity. Check again in 24 hours for confirmation of whether any additional information is needed. <br><br> Click the action items below to go to the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Seller account information</a> page and complete the pending requirements.","ahd_inform_act_widget_bank_account_field":"Bank account","ahd_inform_act_widget_business_address_field":"Business address","ahd_inform_act_widget_description":"Click the action items below to go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Seller account information</a> page and complete the pending requirements. <br><br> After completing identity verification, you may be asked to verify one or more of the additional items below.","ahd_inform_act_widget_phone_number_field":"Phone number","ahd_inform_act_widget_tax_id_field":"Tax ID number","ahd_inform_annual_certification":"Annual certification","ahd_inform_annual_review_banner":"<b>Your account is at risk of deactivation. </b><br><br>To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7?ref_=ahd_annual_ inform_consumer_act\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, your Selling on Amazon account information must be certified on an annual basis. Go to the <a href=\\"/mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render?ref_=ahd_annual_inform_certification\\">Annual certification</a> page to certify that your information is current.","ahd_inform_annual_review_seller_enforced":"To comply with the <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, you must certify the accuracy of your Selling on Amazon account information at least annually. Because we have not received the requested certification, your account has been deactivated. To reactivate your account, go to the <a href=\\" /mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render\\">Annual certification</a> page to certify that your information is current. <br><br> After you’ve completed certification, your account will be reactivated within 48 hours.","ahd_inform_bav_not_verified":"You don’t have a verified bank account or didn’t assign the verified bank account as your default deposit method to the US marketplace. Verify and assign your bank account as the default on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView> Deposit methods </a>page.","ahd_inform_company_registration_number":"Company registration number: ","ahd_inform_confirmation_p1":"Please remember that you are required to keep your business information current and to certify at least annually that your name, address, phone number, email address, bank account information and Tax ID number are correct.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p2":"If any of your information changes, Amazon will need to verify this new information as well. Please respond promptly to any information requests so that we can work with you to complete these additional verification steps and avoid account deactivation. For more information about the verification process, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act help page</a>.","ahd_inform_consumers_act_ac":"INFORM Act notice and certification","ahd_inform_consumers_act_annual":"INFORM Consumers Act annual certification ","ahd_inform_loading_error":"Go to the <a href=/hz/sc/account-information target=\\"_blank\\">Account information</a> page to review your current information.","ahd_inform_no_default_deposit":"You don’t have a verified bank account or didn’t assign the verified bank account as your default deposit method to the US marketplace. Verify and assign your bank account as the default on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView> Deposit Methods </a>page.","ahd_inform_page1_checkbox":"I understand that once I proceed to the INFORM Act notice and certification, I must complete certification within 10 days to avoid the risk of account deactivation. ","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2b":"However, you do not need to wait to receive the formal notification and can take action now to avoid the risk of account deactivation later.","ahd_inform_page1_proceed_title":"Proceed to INFORM Act notice and certification","ahd_inform_page1_step2_description":"If your information is up to date, or if you have just updated it, proceed to the next step – the Notice and Certification – to receive your formal notice and complete your certification. Once you’ve viewed this notice, the law requires you to certify your information within 10 days.","ahd_inform_sw_bav":"You must verify your active bank accounts. Verify your bank accounts here on the <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView> Deposit methods</a> page.","ahd_inform_update_account_information_educational":"Go to the <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Annual certification</a> page to ensure that your Selling on Amazon account information is up to date.","ahd_itr_priority_action":"Italian tax ID for Italy-based sellers required.","ahd_itr_rap_intro":"The <a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a> requires Italy-based sellers who complete one or more transactions on Amazon.it to add their Italian codice fiscale in their Tax settings.","ahd_itr_remediation_corp":"Submit your Italian codice fiscale in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. According to our information (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), your account is registered as a company and therefore we require your business registration number (known as \'codice fiscale\', corresponding to VAT ID without \'IT\' country code). Please refer to the Help page (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a>) for submission steps. You must ensure your legal name on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) and your business registration number in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Tax Authority database.","ahd_itr_remediation_individual":"Submit your Italian codice fiscale in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. According to our information (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), your account is registered as an individual and therefore we require your Citizen ID (known as \'codice fiscale\'). Refer to the Help pages (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Italian law No. 157/2019</a>) for submission steps. You must ensure your legal name on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) and Citizen ID number in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Tax Authority database.","ahd_itr_remediation_unkown":"Submit your information on the Business Information page (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render). Companies must provide their business registration number (known as \'codice fiscale\', corresponding to their VAT ID without the \'IT\' country code), while Individual sellers, including sole proprietors (\'P. IVA individuale\') must upload their personal Citizen ID (also known as “codice fiscale”) in Tax Settings<https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. You must ensure your legal name on the Business Information Page <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render> and the codice fiscale in Tax Settings <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> match the Italian Authority database.","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_details_fallback_text":"Have questions about maintaining a healthy account? Get personalised guidance from Seller Assistant.","ahd_more_information_hd":"More information","ahd_new_feature_announcement_body_new_filters":"You can now filter policy violations by action taken on impacted listings. Go to the Product policy compliance page and click “Add filters” to filter violations.","ahd_other_policy_violation_title":"Other policy violations","ahd_payment_policy_hd_priority_action":"Your funds are on hold due to pending actions on your account. Review the <b>Priority actions</b> to reactivate your disbursements.","ahd_pp_mas_r_policies_code_of_conduct":"Selling policies and Seller Code of Conduct","ahd_pr_form_address_header":"Address Non-Compliant Product Penalties to continue selling your products.","ahd_pr_form_address_sub_header":"As per the guidance from DOJ, Amazon simplifies your regulatory compliance obligations by reporting and paying  on behalf of your orders on Amazon and then recovering these amounts from your account.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_info":"In accordance with the EPA/DOJ Consent Decree, we are required to penalise Sellers for any violations on policies pertaining to EPA. Please find more information on <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account/health/product-policies\\">non-compliant products</a>, Calculate associated penalties, Reserves applied on your account and Communications sent to submit appeals. You will then be charged for any outstanding penalties.<br/><br/> Before we charge you for the penalties, we will place a hold on your account while giving you a chance to remediate your listing.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_title":"How Does This Work?","ahd_pr_form_impact_header":"Possible account impact are as detailed below:","ahd_pr_form_impact_p1":"Liability to pay penalties (go to violation details below)","ahd_pr_form_impact_p3":"Negative impact on your account health which may lead to deactivation of your seller account","ahd_pr_form_note":"Please note: Before we charge you for the penalties, we will place a hold on your account for 30 days while give you a chance to remediate your listing.","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_body":"This product has been identified as a pesticide product, pesticide device or a product that contains pesticide claims. To be considered for reinstatement, please provide evidence of an EPA Registration number and/or EPA Establishment number or a certification that the product is exempt from EPA regulations. You will need to provide this information in the Pesticide Marking attribute for the listing. <a href=/help/hub/reference/GLX9EJX844SNJX7J> Instructions for completing this attribute are available on Seller Central.</a>","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_title":"Related Policy Information","ahd_pr_form_title":"Non-Compliant Product Details","ahd_priority_actions_cr":"Cancellation rate (CR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_lsr":"Late Shipment Rate (LSR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_odr":"Order Defect Rate (ODR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_otdr":"On-Time Delivery Rate (OTDR) violations","ahd_priority_actions_title":"Priority actions","ahd_pspp_priority_actions":"Complete pending Know Your Customer (KYC) review – Payment service provider","ahd_pspp_rap_intro":"Your bank account is not eligible for receiving disbursement. Work with your payment service provider to complete pending Know Your Customer (KYC) review.","ahd_pspp_rap_next_steps":"Go to the <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GY8JTVAWBPQT2XFC?ref_=to_psp_faq_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Payment Service Provider FAQ</a> and <a href=\'/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView?ref_=to_deposit_method_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Deposit methods</a> page for more information. ","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory":"Countries impacted by inventory restrictions","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory_details":"Address the outstanding requirements to avoid disruption to your Fulfilled by Amazon inventory and your import or export capabilities in the listed country.","ahd_rap_at_risk_regional_details":"The listed requirements are impacting your account health in multiple stores. Address the outstanding requirements to avoid account deactivation in all impacted stores.","ahd_rap_begin_verification":"Begin Verification ","ahd_rap_czech_republic":"Czech Republic","ahd_rap_enforced_inventory_details":"Address the outstanding requirements to remove the restrictions on your Fulfilled by Amazon inventory and import or export capabilities in the listed country.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p1":"The verification of your identity is required by law for the use of a selling on Amazon account. As required by Canadian and Brazilian laws, verifying your identity is required to allow you to use our service. You may need to provide us with certain information and documents in order to facilitate these checks.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p3":"You can provide the required verification information at any time after you’ve registered. You will have limited access to your account until the information has been provided and verified.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p4":"If you would like to proceed and sell on Amazon.ca or Amazon.com.br, select the checkbox next to the store you would like to proceed with verification below. Once you have selected to proceed with verification, visit the Identity Information page to determine the next steps.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p5":"If you want to proceed with verification for a single store first, only select that store from the list below. Once you have completed verification for that store, you will be notified to complete the required steps to begin verification for the other store.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_thankyou_p2":"We are validating your information and may need to request details from you during this review. This validation can take up to 24 hours and might take up to 10 working days in some cases. During this time, your Identity Information cannot be edited.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_check_verification_status":"Check your verification status and required next steps on the Account Information page.","ahd_rap_past_due_inventory":"PAST DUE – inventory capabilities restricted","ahd_rap_voluntary_submission_action":"Based on the information available to us, you are not required to hold a ${countryName} VAT number. To comply with this requirement, you can either remove it from <a href=\'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Tax settings</a> or proceed with resolving the issue above.","ahd_regulatory_compliance":"Regulatory compliance","ahd_related_accounts_policy_reason":"Seller code of conduct (multiple selling accounts on Amazon)","ahd_sa_account_health_guidance_description":"Have questions about account health? Get personalised guidance from Seller Assistant.","ahd_sa_chat_about_account_health_text":"How\'s my Account Health?","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_label":"Summarise Product Compliance","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_text":"Can you summarise my product compliance violations?","ahd_save_changes_button":"Save changes","ahd_status_past_due":"Past due","ahd_uaebizlicense_priority_action":"Upload your trade licence","ahd_vas_extension_extension_request_link":"Submit the required documentation.","ahd_vas_priority_action":"European VAT registration requirements","ahd_vas_rap_deactivated_message":"The listed requirements are impacting your account health in multiple stores. Address the outstanding requirements for the listed country to reactivate your account in all impacted stores.","ahd_vas_rap_intro":"The <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GTQ23HPXBQK563WS\' target=\'_blank\'>European VAT registration requirements</a>  is a European Amazon Stores policy that requires all selling partners active in European stores to submit a valid VAT registration number whenever they have a requirement.  Review the Account Health Impact section to complete your outstanding requirements.","ahd_vas_rap_secondary_action":"If you do not have a VAT registration number for the listed country, visit the <a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>Business information</a> portal and <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Tax settings</a> portal to submit the required information (VAT number, name, address) for the following countries:","ahd_vas_rap_third_action":"If you have opted into Union-OSS in your home country, please visit the <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Tax Settings</a> Page selecting your home country from the Union-OSS VAT Declaration menu. Ensure your Union-OSS is enabled and name and address provided to Amazon are matching the ones provided to Authorities.","ahd_vas_rap_verifying":"We are reviewing your VAT registration numbers details. This can take up to 14 days. We will contact you if additional information is required.","ahd_view_all_pa":"View all Priority Actions (${totalCount})","ahd_violation_appeal_button":"Proceed with appeal","ahd_violation_details":"Violation details","ahd_violation_display_name":"Restricted Product policy violation","ahd_violation_status_assessment_phase":"Penalties in Assessment Phase – Disbursements may be impacted.","ahd_w8_priority_action":"Updated US tax identity information required","ahd_w8_rap_action":"You are now required to complete your self-service tax interview before the due date. Your submission can take up to 24 hours to process.","ahd_w8_rap_deactivated_action":"Submit the required information to reactivate your account. Your submission can take up to 24 hours to process.","ahd_w8_rap_intro":"A new W-8 tax form is required. After your form expires, your selling account will be temporarily deactivated until you provide updated tax information.\\n\\n<br><br>These requirements impact your account health in multiple stores.  Address the listed requirements to avoid account deactivation in all impacted stores.\\n\\n<br><br>For more information, go to the <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G200663290?ref_=to_w8_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>US Income Reporting & Tax Identity Collection FAQ.</a>","ai_inform_page1_step1":"1. Go to your Account information page [link to Account information page here] to review your account information (and update, if necessary).","alert_variant_explanation_text":"As Katal components are extensions of HTML elements, JavaScript can interact with them in the same way as with built-in HTML elements. Here, we see JavaScript changing the “variant” attribute on the alert.","components_containing_html_text":"Some components can contain HTML content, such as our KatalTabs component. These complex components provide an API so that developers and frameworks can interact with them.","custom_elements_text":"Katal gives developers the ability to use custom-designed elements to build their web pages. For example, if the developer needs a button, then they can use <kat-button></kat-button> instead of building a button themselves.","demo_complex_header_text":"Demonstration: complex Katal components","demo_components_header_text":"Demonstration: using Katal components","demo_javascript_header_text":"Demonstration: JavaScript with Katal components","design_approved_text":"Katal offers design-approved components for use in web pages that can be configured with labels and custom settings. For example, regular buttons and secondary buttons whose only difference is in their “variant” attribute.","discovery_ahd_ni_warn_pdp":"Product Detail Page","documentation_label":"Katal documentation","fba_inventory_uc_identifier":"Our records indicate that you are holding inventory in ${COUNTRY} through the Fulfilled by Amazon (FBA) programme. As a seller using Fulfilment by Amazon services, you are required to provide a valid VAT registration number for each country where your inventory is stored. You can verify the countries where you have enabled FBA <a href=/fba/settings/ target=\\"_blank\\">here</a>.\\nPlease keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","greeting_description":"This is a sample Katal application demonstrating how to use Katal components, as well as build-and-deploy tooling. Please contact the Katal team at colombia-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments. To continue this demo, please dismiss this alert.","greeting_description_mons_app":"This is a sample Katal application demonstrating how to use Katal components with translations. Please contact the Katal team at katal-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments.","greeting_header":"Sample app information","information-requests":"Information requests","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Send feedback","mobile_ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"Please sign in to Seller Central from a web browser.","mobile_ahd_banner_eg_trn":"Update your tax registration number on the Tax settings page in your Seller Central account.","poe_domestic_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicates that your sales in ${COUNTRY} exceed the domestic threshold for VAT registration.","ppc_fhdds_action_taken":"Risk of UK inbound restrictions","ppc_fhdds_action_taken_past_due":"UK inbound capabilities are currently restricted","ppc_fhdds_reason":"FHDDS: Shipment Missing Import Entry Number (IEN)","primary_button_label":"Primary button","product-policy-compliance":"Product policy compliance","sample_app_page_title_text":"Sample application","sc_homepage_education_phase_description":"Address your Account Health to avoid the risk of future account deactivation.","sc_inform_act_view_account_health_banner":"Go to Account Health","sc_navbar_ah_cs_desc":"View your customer service performance metrics, including your order defect and invoice defect rates.","sc_navbar_ah_desc":"View your Account Health rating, issues impacting your Account Health and violations that may result in content removal or account deactivation.","sc_navbar_ah_eligibilities_desc":"View benefits and programmes that you may be eligible for.","sc_navbar_ah_myc_desc":"Ensure that all of your products comply with all applicable laws, regulations and Amazon policies.","sc_navbar_ah_sp_desc":"View your shipping performance metrics, including late shipment rate, pre-fulfilment cancel rate, valid tracking rate and on-time delivery rate.  ","schp_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_subtitle":"Go to your Account Health page and complete your Priority Actions to begin selling on Amazon.","schp_complete_priority_actions":"Complete your priority actions","secondary_button_label":"Secondary button","ship_from_non_poe_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are dispatching from ${COUNTRY} which is different than your home country; therefore, you are required to provide a valid VAT Information Exchange System (VIES) VAT number or applicable VAT number for EU transactions. You can verify your dispatch address from the Dispatch Settings page or from this <a href=/sbr target=\\"_blank\\">link</a>.\\nPlease keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","ship_from_poe_uc_identifier":"Our records indicate that your cross-border sales exceed €10,000 across EU countries. As a seller engaged in cross-border sales, you are required to provide either UOSS-enabled VAT number from you establishment country or valid VAT numbers for all countries you ship to.","ship_to_non_eu_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you have shipments exceeding €150 from outside EU into ${COUNTRY}. Therefore, you are required to provide a valid ${COUNTRY} VAT number or a declaration confirming that you are not the Importer Of Record for the shipment(s) above threshold.","ship_to_uoss_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are conducting cross-border sales into ${COUNTRY} from other EU country and, therefore, you are required to provide an UOSS-enabled VAT number from your establishment country or valid ${COUNTRY} VAT number.\\nPlease keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","sp-permanent-call-me-now-title":"Need Help?","sp_health_cancellation_rate_caption":"Pre-fulfilment Cancel Rate","sp_health_customer_satisfaction_information_label":"Order Defect Rate consists of three different metrics:","sp_health_dashboard_guardian_title_new":"Account Health assurance","sp_health_dashboard_subheader":"To sell on Amazon, you must adhere to the below performance targets and policies.","sp_health_dashboard_title":"Account Health","sp_health_download_report_caption":"Download report","sp_health_gl_watch":"Watch","sp_health_intellectual_property_customer_complaints":"Received Intellectual Property Complaints","sp_health_late_shipment_rate_caption":"Late Shipment Rate","sp_health_listing_policy_customer_complaints":"Listing Policy Violations","sp_health_mobile_by_ahr_impact_tab_title":"By Account Health Rating Impact","sp_health_nav_myc":"Manage your compliance","sp_health_nav_orders_with_defects":"Orders with Defects","sp_health_not_available":"N/A","sp_health_order_defect_rate_caption":"Order Defect Rate","sp_health_pre_fulfillment_cancel_rate":"Pre-fulfilment Cancel Rate","sp_health_product_policies":"Product Policy Compliance","sp_health_product_quality_popover":"This total will include complaints which you may have already addressed through a Plan of Action.","sp_health_product_safety_customer_complaints":"Food and Product Safety Issues","sp_health_restricted_products_violations_policy":"Restricted Product Policy Violations","sp_health_risk_banner_vtr":"Your Fulfilled by Merchant offers are at risk of deactivation. Your valid tracking rate is ${hash-get metricValue}; the target is ${hash-get target}.","sp_health_seller_fulfilled_metrics_caption":"Seller-fulfilled","sp_health_shipping_bucket_caption":"Shipping Performance","sp_health_shipping_eligibilities":"View delivery eligibilities here","sp_health_time_window":"Time Window: ${hash-get numDays} days","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_caption":"Valid Tracking Rate","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_subtitle":"<b>Target</b>: over ${hash-get targetValue}","sp_health_violation_details_stale_page_button_label":"Back to Account Health","sp_mfn_at_risk_warning":"Your Fulfilled by Merchant offers are at risk of deactivation","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_defects":"You do not currently have any defects for this order.","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_order":"This order doesn\'t exist.","sp_st_date_range":"${hash-get startDate} - ${hash-get endDate}","sp_st_heading_order_asin":"Product","sp_st_heading_order_edd":"Expected Delivery Date","sp_st_heading_order_esd":"Expected Dispatch Date","sp_st_str_with_description":"${hash-get description}: ${hash-get str}","sp_st_zero_out_metrics_message":"Orders received prior to June 1 are not used to evaluate your account health and aren’t displayed here.","sp_vtr_list_ca":"1. Heavy and bulky items dispatched by a courier not integrated with Amazon. Learn more on integrated couriers.</br></br>2. Small and light items that have an order value less than $CAD 30 (including delivery charges) and are dispatched in Canada Post Standard Mail envelopes or First Class Mail envelopes.</br></br>3. International shipments dispatched from China that have an order value less than $CAD 6 (including delivery charges)</br></br>4. International shipments dispatched from outside of US and China.</br></br>5. Digital orders that cannot physically dispatched by a courier, e.g. Audio book","sp_zero_tolerance_banner_body":"Due to one or more critical violations, your account is pending deactivation. To prevent deactivation, please address these violations now. For more information, go to the <a href=/gp/help/G200205250>Account Health Rating programme policy</a>.","tab_demo_generated_text":"Auto-generated tab {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Selected tab","ts-form-header":"Report an abuse","valid_vat_number_uc_identifier":"Please keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","voluntary_vrn_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are not required to hold a VAT number in ${COUNTRY}, but you have provided one on Seller Central that is currently not valid. To resolve this discrepancy, you can either remove the ${COUNTRY} VAT Number or provide a valid one. By removing your ${COUNTRY} VAT Number from Seller Central, you are confirming that you are not required to hold one in ${COUNTRY}. We recommend consulting with a tax advisor to determine whether your overall business activities, both on and off Amazon, require VAT registration."}}}'),JSON.parse('{"es":{"pages.floatingWidget":{"DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_cta_done":"Administrador de valoraciones","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_cta_done":"Más información","ahd_dyk_fhdds_cta":"Revisar envíos","ahd_dyk_title_eukyc":"Completa el proceso de verificación de la identidad del cliente de la UE","ahd_floating_widget_resolve_now_button_text":"Resolver ahora","ahd_floating_widget_title":"¿Sabías que...?","ahd_floating_widget_view_all":"Ver todo {count}"},"pages.homepage":{"RR_AHR_Warn_1":"Varias cuentas de vendedor en Amazon","ags_pcx_voc_summary_voice_of_the_customer":"Opinión del cliente","ahd_SOrigin_priority_action":"Información del beneficiario","ahd_account_regulatory_compliance":"Cumplimiento normativo de la cuenta","ahd_aef_action_HD":"Pagos retenidos","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reg_comp_subreason":"Cumplimiento normativo","ahd_aef_critical":"Crítico","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_action":"Reactivar ahora","ahd_aef_denver_info":"Información obligatoria","ahd_aef_impact_header":"Impacto en el estado de la cuenta","ahd_aef_priority_action_completed_status":"Completado","ahd_aef_priority_action_pending_review_status":"Pendiente de revisión","ahd_banner_account_atrisk_header":"Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación.","ahd_banner_account_pending_header":"Tu cuenta está pendiente de desactivación.","ahd_br_store":"Brasil (Amazon.com.br)","ahd_ca_store":"Canadá (Amazon.ca)","ahd_cakyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Comprueba el estado de verificación en la página <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Información de identidad</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_identity_info":"Consulta la página <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Información de identidad</a> para completar la verificación. ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_header":"¿Por qué tengo que proporcionar esta información?","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_header2":"¿Cuánto tiempo tengo para proporcionar la información? ","ahd_cancel_button":"Cancelar","ahd_close_button":"Cerrar","ahd_collusion_policy":"Políticas de ventas y código de conducta del vendedor","ahd_complete_status":"COMPLETADO","ahd_dac7_rap_verify_now_button":"Verificar ahora","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_description":"Ve a la página <a href=\'/hz/sc/account-information\' target=\'_blank\'>Información de cuenta</a> para completar la verificación. ","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Tu tienda en Amazon.ca (Canadá) está en riesgo de desactivación.","ahd_edit_button":"Modificar","ahd_floating_widget_action_panel_close":"Cerrar","ahd_incomplete_status":"INCOMPLETO","ahd_inform_ac_p1_header":"Prepárate para certificar tu información","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"Dirección","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_button":"Certificar","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"Correo electrónico","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"Nombre","ahd_inform_act_ac_notice_title":"Aviso","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"Teléfono","ahd_inform_act_ac_tax_field":"Número de identificación fiscal","ahd_inform_act_ac_tin_field":"Número de identificación fiscal:","ahd_inform_act_mobile_widget_help":"Más información sobre la Ley INFORM","ahd_inform_act_need_help":"¿Necesitas ayuda? Consulta la <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>página de ayuda de la Ley INFORM</a>.","ahd_inform_act_widget_bank_account_field":"Cuenta bancaria","ahd_inform_act_widget_identity_field":"Identidad","ahd_inform_act_widget_pending_status":"En curso","ahd_inform_act_widget_phone_number_field":"Número de teléfono","ahd_inform_act_widget_tax_id_field":"Número de identificación fiscal","ahd_inform_annual_certification":"Certificación anual","ahd_inform_company_registration_number":"Número de registro de la empresa: ","ahd_inform_compliance_action_name":"Nombre","ahd_inform_consumers_act_ac":"Aviso y certificación de la Ley INFORM","ahd_inform_page1_button":"Continuar","ahd_itr_rap_pending_deactivation":"Tu cuenta está pendiente de desactivación.","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_suggestion_fallback_text":"Chat sobre el estado de la cuenta","ahd_more_information_hd":"Más información","ahd_new_feature_announcement_got_it_button":"Entendido ","ahd_past_due":"VENCIDO","ahd_pp_mas_r_policies_code_of_conduct":"Políticas de ventas y código de conducta del vendedor","ahd_priority_actions_compliant":"Verificación de identidad completada","ahd_priority_actions_hd":"Pagos retenidos","ahd_priority_actions_title":"Acciones prioritarias","ahd_priority_actions_verification_status":"Iniciar verificación","ahd_rap_at_risk_deactivation":"Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación.","ahd_rap_austria":"Austria","ahd_rap_begin_verification":"Iniciar verificación ","ahd_rap_belgium":"Bélgica","ahd_rap_bulgaria":"Bulgaria","ahd_rap_check_verification":"Comprobar estado de verificación","ahd_rap_close":"Cerrar","ahd_rap_croatia":"Croacia","ahd_rap_cyprus":"Chipre","ahd_rap_czech_republic":"República Checa","ahd_rap_denmark":"Dinamarca","ahd_rap_estonia":"Estonia","ahd_rap_finland":"Finlandia","ahd_rap_france":"Francia","ahd_rap_germany":"Alemania","ahd_rap_greece":"Grecia","ahd_rap_hungary":"Hungría","ahd_rap_ireland":"Irlanda","ahd_rap_italy":"Italia","ahd_rap_latvia":"Letonia","ahd_rap_lithuania":"Lituania","ahd_rap_luxembourg":"Luxemburgo","ahd_rap_malta":"Malta","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p2":"¿Cuánto tiempo tengo para proporcionar la información?","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_select_stores":"Seleccionar tiendas ","ahd_rap_norway":"Noruega","ahd_rap_pending_deactivation":"Tu cuenta está pendiente de desactivación.","ahd_rap_poland":"Polonia","ahd_rap_portugal":"Portugal","ahd_rap_romania":"Rumanía","ahd_rap_slovakia":"Eslovaquia","ahd_rap_slovenia":"Eslovenia","ahd_rap_spain":"España","ahd_rap_sweden":"\\r\\nSuecia","ahd_rap_switzerland":"Suiza","ahd_regulatory_compliance":"Cumplimiento normativo","ahd_related_accounts_policy_reason":"Código de conducta del vendedor (varias cuentas de vendedor en Amazon)","ahd_sa_chat_about_account_health_label":"Chat sobre el estado de la cuenta","ahd_sa_chat_about_account_health_text":"¿Cómo está el estado de mi cuenta?","ahd_save_changes_button":"Guardar cambios","ahd_status_only":"Estado","ahd_status_past_due":"Vencido","ahd_view_all_pa":"Ver todas las acciones prioritarias (${totalCount})","ahd_violation_details":"Detalles de la infracción","ahd_violation_status_open":"Abierto","continue_button_label":"Continuar","discovery_ahd_ni_warn_amazon_search":"Términos de búsqueda de Amazon","discovery_ahd_ni_warn_pdp":"Página de detalles del producto","documentation_label":"Documentación de Katal","greeting_header":"Ejemplo de información de la aplicación","information-requests":"Solicitudes de información","mobile_ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"Inicia sesión en Seller Central desde un navegador web.","primary_button_label":"Botón principal","sample_app_page_title_text":"Aplicación de muestra","secondary_button_label":"Botón secundario","sp-permanent-call-me-now-title":"¿Necesitas ayuda?","sp_health_amazon_fulfilled_metrics_caption":"Gestionado por Amazon","sp_health_dashboard_title":"Estado de la cuenta","sp_health_gl_office_product":"Productos de oficina","sp_health_gl_watch":"Reloj","sp_health_mobile_info_bar_label":"Infracciones","sp_health_nav_account_health":"Estado de la cuenta","sp_health_nav_orders_with_defects":"Pedidos defectuosos","sp_health_negative_feedback_caption":"Valoraciones negativas","sp_health_not_available":"N/A","sp_health_number_days":"${hash-get number_days} días","sp_health_orders_of_total":"${hash-get orders_number} de ${hash-get orders_total} pedidos","sp_health_orders_of_total_orders":"${hash-get orders_number} de ${hash-get orders_total} pedidos","sp_health_shipments_of_total_shipments":"${hash-get shipments_number} de ${hash-get shipments_total} envíos","sp_health_view_details":"Ver detalles","sp_health_view_details_pagination_index":"\\\\${currentIndex} de \\\\${lastIndex}","sp_health_violation_details_next":"Siguiente","sp_health_violation_details_stale_page_message":"Esta página ya no existe.","sp_navbar_more_button":"Más","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_order":"Este pedido no existe.","sp_pw_health_detail_table_appeal_violation_link":"Recurrir","sp_st_heading_order_asin":"ASIN","sp_st_heading_order_esd":"Fecha prevista de envío","sp_st_heading_order_image":"Imagen","sp_st_heading_order_title":"Título","tab_demo_selected_name":"Pestaña seleccionada","tab_demo_text":"Contenido de la pestaña {tabId}"}},"es-ES":{"pages.floatingWidget":{"DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_content":"Formas parte de un experimento para mejorar el servicio que te prestamos: a partir de ahora, un buen rendimiento en la ratio de consultas de los clientes, tiempo de respuesta y ratio de insatisfacción del cliente puede mejorar tu nivel del estado de la cuenta. Con este cambio, el programa Nivel del estado de la cuenta puede recompensarte por proporcionar un servicio de atención al cliente excelente. Comprueba la calidad del servicio al cliente en el Administrador de valoraciones.","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_header":"Obtén puntos del nivel del estado de la cuenta al ofrecer un buen servicio de atención al cliente","DYK_JP_LINE_content":"La cuenta oficial de LINE de Amazon envía determinadas notificaciones por correo electrónico y Seller Central en las que se solicitan acciones por parte de los vendedores en relación con temas como el estado de la cuenta, estado de los listings y errores en los pagos. Conecta tu cuenta de Seller Central a la cuenta oficial de LINE para recibir notificaciones a través de LINE y evitar perderte notificaciones importantes. Más información","DYK_JP_LINE_cta_done":"Más información sobre las notificaciones críticas LINE","DYK_JP_LINE_header":"Puedes conectar tu cuenta de LINE para recibir mensajes importantes personalizados que afecten al estado de la cuenta.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_content":"¡Buenas noticias! Estás a 60 días de registrarte en Protección del estado de la cuenta. Mantén tu nivel del estado de la cuenta por encima de 250 y un número de contacto para emergencias verificado para garantizar una protección mejorada de la cuenta. Una vez que te hayamos registrado automáticamente, te lo notificaremos por correo electrónico.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_cta_done":"Más información sobre Protección del estado de la cuenta","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_header":"Ya queda poco para que te registremos en Protección del estado de la cuenta","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_content":"El nivel del estado de la cuenta ha cambiado a \\"En riesgo\\" o \\"No adecuado\\". Haz clic en \\"Llamadme ahora\\" para hablar con un especialista en estado de la cuenta y proteger tus permisos de venta.","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_cta_done":"Llamadme ahora","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_header":"Tu nivel del estado de la cuenta requiere atención","DYK_SSAT_CFT_DietarySupp_content":"Protege tus listings de la categoría Suplementos alimenticios con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén validación automática del cumplimiento normativo cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, lo que elimina la necesidad de presentar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_Toys_content":"Protege tus listings de la categoría Juguetes con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén validación automática del cumplimiento normativo cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, lo que elimina la necesidad de presentar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_artscrafts_content":"Protege tus listings de la categoría Manualidades con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén validación automática del cumplimiento normativo cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, lo que elimina la necesidad de presentar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_buttoncellbatteryproducts_content":"Protege tus listings de la categoría Pila de botón con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén validación automática del cumplimiento normativo cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, lo que elimina la necesidad de presentar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_childrensproducts_content":"Protege tus listings de la categoría Productos infantiles con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén validación automática del cumplimiento normativo cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, lo que elimina la necesidad de presentar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_cta_done":"Regístrate hoy mismo","DYK_SSAT_CFT_electronics_content":"Protege tus listings de la categoría Dispositivos electrónicos con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén validación automática del cumplimiento normativo cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, lo que elimina la necesidad de presentar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_emobilityproducts_content":"Protege tus listings de la categoría Dispositivos electrónicos de movilidad con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén validación automática del cumplimiento normativo cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, lo que elimina la necesidad de presentar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_firesafety_content":"Protege tus listings de la categoría Seguridad contra incendios con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén validación automática del cumplimiento normativo cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, lo que elimina la necesidad de presentar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_furniture_content":"Protege tus listings de la categoría Mobiliario con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén validación automática del cumplimiento normativo cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, lo que elimina la necesidad de presentar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_header":"Simplifica el cumplimiento normativo: inscríbete hoy mismo en el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo","DYK_SSAT_CFT_infantbabyproducts_content":"Protege tus listings de la categoría Productos para bebé con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén validación automática del cumplimiento normativo cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, lo que elimina la necesidad de presentar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_ppe_content":"Protege tus listings de la categoría Equipo de protección individual con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén validación automática del cumplimiento normativo cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, lo que elimina la necesidad de presentar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_EDU_JULY":"Claves del nivel del estado de la cuenta","DYK_SSAT_EDU_content":"El nivel del estado de la cuenta supervisa el riesgo de desactivación de tu cuenta a través de un sistema de puntos. Obtienes puntos por gestionar correctamente los pedidos. Perderás puntos cuando se detecten incumplimientos de políticas y los recuperarás cuando soluciones esos incumplimientos correctamente. Revisa tu panel \\"Estado de la cuenta\\" con frecuencia y aborda los incumplimientos de políticas a medida que surjan.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_content":"Es un placer anunciar \\"Objeciones del vendedor\\", una nueva herramienta para los vendedores de Protección del estado de la cuenta. Esta herramienta te ofrece un número limitado de oportunidades para solicitar una revisión de las incidencias con los listings a través de la página \\"Estado de la cuenta\\". Cuando presentes una objeción, nos esforzaremos por responder con una decisión en un plazo de 48 horas.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_header":"Presentamos \\"Objeciones del vendedor\\"","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop":"¿Sabías que, siempre y cuando no tengas infracciones, tu puntuación no bajará de 200 aunque tu número de pedidos se esté reduciendo?","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop_header":"Consejo para conseguir un nivel del estado de la cuenta estable","ahd_dyk_bhdr_content":"Te recomendamos que entregues más del 90 % de tus envíos comerciales de Amazon Business durante el horario laboral para garantizar la satisfacción del cliente.","ahd_dyk_bhdr_cta":"Ver rendimiento","ahd_dyk_bhdr_header":"Tu ratio de entregas en horario laboral es baja.","ahd_dyk_br_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Tu tienda de Amazon.com.br (Brasil) está en riesgo de desactivación.","ahd_dyk_cta_done":"Completado","ahd_dyk_cta_eukyc":"Completar verificación","ahd_dyk_de_sup_label":"Para cumplir los requisitos relativos a la responsabilidad ampliada del productor sobre plásticos de solo uso de Alemania (que entró en vigor el 1 de enero de 2025), proporciona los números de registro de la responsabilidad ampliada del productor para cada combinación de marca y tipo de producto. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GA4JYZX23CLK8WFW\\">Más información</a>","ahd_dyk_de_sup_title":"Tienes listings sujetos a la política de responsabilidad ampliada del productor sobre plásticos de un solo uso de Alemania","ahd_dyk_de_sup_weee_title":"Tienes listings sujetos a la política de responsabilidad ampliada del productor sobre RAEE en Alemania","ahd_dyk_description_eukyc":"De acuerdo con la normativa de la UE, tienes que completar el proceso de verificación de la cuenta. Ve a la página \\"Información de identidad\\" para completar la verificación. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G201200780 \\">Más información</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_label":"Para cumplir los requisitos relativos a la responsabilidad ampliada del productor, proporciona los números de registro de la responsabilidad ampliada del productor para cada combinación de marca y tipo de producto. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GYDCAK9ZR6VJH2X3\\">Más información</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_title":"Tienes listings sujetos a la responsabilidad ampliada del productor","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_label":"Para cumplir los requisitos relativos a la responsabilidad ampliada del productor sobre pilas y baterías de la UE (que entra en vigor el 18 de agosto de 2025), proporciona los números de registro de la responsabilidad ampliada del productor para tus categorías de producto. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GPVDATLHQ6PRQNSW\\">Más información</a>","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_title":"Tienes listings sujetos a la política de responsabilidad ampliada del productor sobre pilas y baterías de la UE","ahd_dyk_fhdds_description":"Proporciona los detalles de importación de todos tus envíos correspondientes en \\"Envíos en espera\\" antes de que afecten a tu negocio. Si faltan detalles de importación, tu capacidad para crear nuevos envíos en el Reino Unido se podría restringir.","ahd_dyk_fhdds_header":"Faltan los números de entrada de importaciones (IEN) en algunos envíos.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"Tienes medidas pendientes para empezar a vender en la tienda de <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.com.br/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.com.br</a>.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_subtitle":"Envía la información necesaria para completar los requisitos de verificación para vender en Brasil.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"Tienes medidas pendientes para empezar a vender en la tienda de <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.ca/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.ca</a>.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_subtitle":"Envía la información necesaria para completar los requisitos de verificación para vender en Canadá.","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description":"Para cumplir el GPSR, que entrará en vigor el 13 de diciembre de 2024, proporciona información adicional sobre cumplimiento normativo de tus productos para evitar que tus listings se vean afectados. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">Más información</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description_post_impact":"Para cumplir el Reglamento relativo a la seguridad general de los productos (que entra en vigor el 13 de diciembre de 2024) y evitar la desactivación de listings, proporciona más información sobre el cumplimiento normativo de tus productos. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">Más información</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_task":"Tienes listings afectados por el Reglamento relativo a la seguridad general de los productos.","ahd_floating_widget_aha_ec_description":"Como miembro del programa Protección del estado de la cuenta, <b>tienes que</b> mantener un número de contacto para emergencias válido. Comprueba los datos de contacto para emergencias para seguir cumpliendo los requisitos de Protección del estado de la cuenta. De esta forma, nuestros especialistas podrán contactar contigo para ayudarte a solucionar incidencias esenciales relacionadas con el estado de tu cuenta antes de que interrumpan tu negocio.","ahd_floating_widget_aha_ec_description_phase2":"Comprueba tu número de contacto que aparece a continuación para mantener las ventajas de AHA ininterrumpidas.","ahd_floating_widget_cta_button":"Ver listings","ahd_floating_widget_ec_action_panel_title":"Actualización de los datos de contacto para emergencias","ahd_floating_widget_ec_aha_description":"Comprueba los datos de contacto para emergencias para que nuestros especialistas contacten contigo para ayudarte a solucionar incidencias esenciales relacionadas con el estado de tu cuenta antes de que interrumpan tu negocio.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_cta_button":"Completar verificación","ahd_floating_widget_ec_description":"Comprueba los datos de contacto para emergencias para que nuestros especialistas contacten contigo para ayudarte a solucionar incidencias esenciales relacionadas con el estado de tu cuenta antes de que interrumpan tu negocio.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_task":"No se ha verificado la información de contacto para emergencias","ahd_floating_widget_new_tag":"¡NOVEDAD!","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_food_and_safety_heading":"Tienes infracciones reiteradas por incidencias relativas a la seguridad de productos y alimentos","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_ip_heading":"Tienes infracciones reiteradas por reclamaciones sobre propiedad intelectual recibidas","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_listing_heading":"Tienes infracciones reiteradas por incumplimientos de la política de publicación","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_many_policies_heading":"Has infringido varias políticas de forma reiterada","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_other_heading":"Tienes infracciones reiteradas por otros incumplimientos de políticas","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_auth_heading":"Tienes infracciones reiteradas por reclamaciones por autenticidad del producto","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_cond_heading":"Tienes infracciones reiteradas por reclamaciones de clientes sobre el estado del producto","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_reviews_heading":"Tienes infracciones reiteradas por incumplimientos de la política de reseñas de productos","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_reg_comp_heading":"Tienes infracciones reiteradas de cumplimiento normativo","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_rp_heading":"Has infringido la política de productos excluidos de forma reiterada","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_sip_heading":"Tienes infracciones reiteradas por supuestos incumplimientos de la propiedad intelectual","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_violations_body":"El incumplimiento reiterado de la misma política de venta puede dar como resultado la desactivación de la cuenta. Resuelve estas incidencias para evitar interrupciones innecesarias de tu cuenta de vendedor.","ahd_rap_begin_verification_cta":"Iniciar verificación","cs_nerd_suggestion_top_issues_action_vi":"Ver pedidos expedidos","dyk_ahd_pra_rv":"Tienes infracciones reiteradas por incumplimientos de la política de reseñas de productos."},"pages.homepage":{"AHD_DD14_Base_Reserve":"Los ingresos se retienen durante 14 días después de la fecha de entrega y están disponibles para su pago a partir del día 15 después de la fecha de entrega. Si la fecha de entrega real no está disponible, utilizaremos la fecha de entrega prevista más reciente para el pedido. Esta es la política de pagos predeterminada.","AHD_POA_APPEAL_ERROR_LOADING":"Se ha producido un error. Actualiza la página.","DR_VAT_AHD_NC_BANNER":"No hemos podido verificar tu domicilio social a efectos fiscales. Para garantizar un tratamiento fiscal preciso, verifica tu domicilio fiscal a efectos fiscales.","DR_VAT_AHD_PRIORITY_ACTION":"Se requiere verificación del domicilio social a efectos fiscales","Engage_Appeal_05":"Código de conducta del vendedor (influir favorablemente en los clientes para manipular tus puntuaciones de ventas, valoraciones o reseñas)","LocalizedPageTitleDashboard":"Panel de control de rendimiento","LocalizedPageTitleDetailCustomerSatisfaction":"Página de detalles de Satisfacción del cliente.","LocalizedPageTitleDetailProductPolicies":"Página de detalles de las políticas del producto.","NO_METRICS":"Actualmente, no hay ningún pedido para calcular esta estadística.\\n","acf_banner_inform_act":"Para cumplir la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">Ley INFORM Consumers</a>, tenemos que recopilar y verificar información sobre tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon. Actualmente, tienes uno o varios elementos pendientes de verificación. Revisa la lista siguiente y ve a <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Información de la cuenta de vendedor</a> para iniciar la verificación.","acf_inform_act_wait_text":"Gracias por verificar la identidad. Vuelve en 24 horas para confirmar si se necesita más información. ","acf_inform_act_widget_description":"Después de completar la verificación de la identidad, es posible que solicitemos que verifiques uno o varios de los siguientes elementos.","addTab_label":"Añadir pestaña","aef_address_your_violation":"Soluciona la infracción","ahd_Inform_deposit_method":"Datos de cuenta bancaria","ahd_account_health_notification":"Notificación sobre el estado de la cuenta","ahd_account_impacted_details":"Es posible que tu cuenta se vea afectada tal y como se detalla a continuación:","ahd_action_due":"Fecha límite","ahd_action_panel_hd":"Los pagos de tus cuentas de vendedor de Amazon se han retenido.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"<b>Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación.</b><br><br>Para cumplir la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">Ley INFORM Consumers</a>, tenemos que recopilar y verificar información sobre tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon. Actualmente, tienes una o más verificaciones pendientes. Revisa la lista siguiente y ve a <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Información de la cuenta de vendedor</a> para iniciar la verificación.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_aha":"<b> Ten en cuenta que, si no has completado todos los pasos de verificación cuando la Ley INFORM Consumers entre en vigor, es posible que desactivemos tu cuenta, independientemente de que te hayas registrado en \\"Protección del estado de la cuenta\\".</b>","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_thankyou":"<b>Ley INFORM Consumers de EE. UU.</b><br><br>Hemos completado correctamente todas las verificaciones abiertas. Agradecemos tu colaboración en este proceso de verificación.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_v2":"<b>Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación.</b><br><br>Para cumplir la <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>Ley INFORM Consumers de EE. UU.</a>, que entrará en vigor el 27 de junio de 2023, tenemos que recopilar y verificar información sobre tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon. Actualmente, tienes una o más verificaciones pendientes. Ve a <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Información de cuenta</a> para iniciar la verificación.","ahd_adhoc_banner_school_supplies":"Hemos detectado que tienes listings en riesgo de retirada debido al incumplimiento de las normativas nacionales, estatales y federales en relación con la venta de material escolar para niños. Para más información sobre estos requisitos de cumplimiento normativo, haz clic <a href=/gp/help/external/help.html?itemID=XT3EFQS54LRKYM3&language=en_US&ref=ahd_uspc_adhoc_banner>aquí</a>. Para evitar la retirada de listings, consulta <a href=/performance/account/health/product-policies?t=safe>aquí</a> los listings sujetos a este requisito de cumplimiento normativo y sigue las instrucciones que se indican en \\"Siguientes pasos\\" junto a los listings en riesgo de retirada para garantizar el cumplimiento de estos requisitos.","ahd_adhoc_mobile_inform_act_aha":"Nota: Si no completas todos los pasos de verificación en los plazos especificados, es posible que desactivemos tu cuenta, independientemente de que te hayas registrado en \\"Protección del estado de la cuenta\\".","ahd_aef_IPI_priority_action":"Verificación virtual de la identidad","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_contact_us":"Para consultas, contacta con nosotros a través de seller-reactivation-appeals@amazon.com.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_instruction":"Tienes que presentar documentos y asistir a una videollamada para verificar la identidad.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_join_call_link":"Ve al <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">portal de verificación de la identidad</a> para unirte a la videollamada programada.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_next_steps":"Ve al <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">portal de verificación de la identidad</a> para presentar los documentos obligatorios y unirte a una videollamada para la verificación virtual de la identidad. También tienes la opción de programar una videollamada en una fecha y hora futuras después de presentar los documentos obligatorios.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason":"Tras revisar tu empresa, hemos detectado que es posible que tu cuenta se haya utilizado para actividades engañosas, fraudulentas o ilegales, lo cual puede dar lugar a la desactivación de la cuenta de acuerdo con la sección 3 del <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Acuerdo de Amazon Services Business Solutions</a>. Para proteger a nuestros clientes y colaboradores comerciales, tenemos que verificar la identidad de nuestros vendedores mediante un proceso de verificación virtual de la identidad que se lleva a cabo a través de una videollamada. ","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason_eu":"Una revisión de tu empresa ha identificado que tu cuenta se ha utilizado para actividades engañosas, fraudulentas o ilegales; esto puede dar lugar a la desactivación de la cuenta de acuerdo con la sección 3 del <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G201190440\\">Acuerdo de Amazon Services Business Solutions</a>. Para proteger a nuestros clientes y colaboradores comerciales, tenemos que verificar la identidad de nuestros vendedores mediante un proceso de verificación virtual de la identidad que se lleva a cabo a través de una videollamada.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_review_fail":"Tras revisar tu empresa y la información que has proporcionado durante la verificación virtual de la identidad, hemos detectado que es posible que tu cuenta se haya utilizado con fines engañosos, fraudulentos o ilegales, lo que infringe la sección 3 del <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Acuerdo de Amazon Services Business Solutions</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_under_review":"Estamos revisando la información que nos has proporcionado para verificar tu identidad. El proceso de revisión puede durar hasta 5 días laborables.","ahd_aef_action_panel_RA_reason":"Nuestra revisión indica que tienes una cuenta aparte que se ha desactivado por infringir una de nuestras políticas. Por tanto, la cuenta actual infringe nuestra política de tener varias cuentas de vendedor en Amazon, tal y como se describe en el <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G1801\\">Código de conducta del vendedor</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_post_deactivation_appeal":"Si crees que tu cuenta se ha desactivado por error, puedes presentar nueva información. Para ello, haz clic en \\"Recurrir\\" a continuación.","ahd_aef_action_panel_scheduled_status_plural":"Has programado una videollamada para la verificación virtual de la identidad el ${date}, dentro de ${numberofdays} días.","ahd_aef_action_panel_scheduled_status_singular":"Has programado una videollamada para la verificación virtual de la identidad el ${date}, dentro de ${numberofday} día.","ahd_aef_action_panel_verify_button":"Validar","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_food_and_prod_subreason":"Incidencias relativas a la seguridad de productos y alimentos","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_listing_subreason":"Incumplimiento de políticas de publicación","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_other_subreason":"Otros incumplimientos de políticas","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_auth_subreason":"Reclamaciones por autenticidad del producto","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_cond_subreason":"Reclamaciones de clientes sobre el estado del producto","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_review_subreason":"Incumplimientos de políticas sobre reseñas de productos","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reason":"Infracciones reiteradas","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rip_subreason":"Reclamaciones sobre propiedad intelectual recibidas","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rp_subreason":"Política de productos excluidos","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_sip_subreason":"Supuestas infracciones de la propiedad intelectual","ahd_aef_at_risk_HD_card_body":"Para reactivar los pagos, revisa las acciones prioritarias y soluciona las que están pendientes.","ahd_aef_at_risk_HD_card_title":"Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación y los pagos de tu cuenta de vendedor de Amazon se han retenido.","ahd_aef_at_risk_card_sc_body":"Tienes una o varias acciones pendientes que darán lugar a la desactivación de la cuenta.","ahd_aef_critical_message":"Tu cuenta se desactivará si no se resuelve esta incidencia.","ahd_aef_critical_message_no_caps":"Tu cuenta se desactivará si no se resuelve esta incidencia.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_body":"Resuelve las incidencias sobre el estado de la cuenta para reactivarla. Una vez resueltas las incidencias, la cuenta se reactivará en un plazo de 24 horas.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_sc_body":"Resuelve las incidencias sobre el estado de la cuenta para reactivarla.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_title":"Tu cuenta se ha desactivado","ahd_aef_denver_eu":"Verificar el establecimiento en la UE para el impuesto sobre el valor añadido (IVA)","ahd_aef_denver_uk":"Verificar el establecimiento en el Reino Unido para el impuesto sobre el valor añadido (IVA)","ahd_aef_educational_card_action":"Resolver incidencias","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_post_deactivation":"Haz clic en \\"Recurrir\\" a continuación y sigue las instrucciones que se indican para reactivar esta cuenta de vendedor.","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_pre_deactivation":"Haz clic en \\"Recurrir\\" a continuación y sigue las instrucciones que se indican para evitar la desactivación de esta cuenta de vendedor.","ahd_aef_next_steps_header":"Soluciona la infracción","ahd_aef_pending_critical":"Acciones críticas pendientes","ahd_aef_pending_critical_message":"Si no se resuelve, la situación se volverá crítica y se desactivará tu cuenta.","ahd_aef_pending_critical_message_no_cap":"Si no se resuelve, la situación se volverá crítica y se desactivará tu cuenta.","ahd_aef_pending_deactivation_HD_card_title":"Tu cuenta está pendiente de desactivación y los pagos de tu cuenta de vendedor en nuestra tienda se han retenido.","ahd_aef_priority_action_scheduled_status_plural":"Videollamada programada para el ${date}, dentro de ${numberofdays} días","ahd_aef_priority_action_scheduled_status_singular":"Videollamada programada para el ${date}, dentro de ${numberofday} día","ahd_aef_submit_header":"Presentar la información","ahd_ahr_pending_critical":"Acciones críticas pendientes","ahd_ahr_section_sub_section":"Esta valoración informa de tu cumplimiento con las políticas de venta de Amazon. <a href=/help/hub/reference/G200205250?ref=ahd-ahr-lm target=‘_blank’>Más información</a>.","ahd_ahr_section_title":"Nivel del estado de la cuenta","ahd_all_issues":"Todas las incidencias","ahd_back_button":"Volver","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_body":"Si presentas un recurso por estas infracciones y este se resuelve a tu favor, consideraremos reactivar tu cuenta. ","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_header":"Tu cuenta se ha desactivado. ","ahd_banner_block_mfn_at_risk_subtitle":"Se han desactivado tus ofertas autogestionadas y tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación. Completa tus acciones prioritarias para reactivar las ofertas autogestionadas y evitar que se desactiven.","ahd_banner_block_mfn_subtitle":"Tus ofertas autogestionadas se han desactivado. Completa tus acciones prioritarias para reactivar las ofertas autogestionadas.","ahd_banner_eg_trn":"<b>Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación. </b><br><br>Tu cuenta de Seller Central está en riesgo de desactivación porque no incluye un número de registro a efectos fiscales válido. Visita la página <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations>Configuración de impuestos</a> para actualizar la información fiscal en un plazo de 90 días a partir de la fecha de tu primer listing de producto en Amazon y evitar la desactivación de la cuenta. Para más información, consulta \\"Preguntas frecuentes sobre cumplimiento fiscal\\"<a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC>. </a>","ahd_banner_resolve_issues_button":"Resolver incidencias","ahd_be_jsl_at_risk_banner":"<b> Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación. </b><br><br> No has proporcionado tu número de identificación fiscal belga o no has confirmado el estado de la Ventanilla Única del IVA (OSS) de tu país de origen en tu cuenta de Seller Central de Amazon. Consulta la <a href=/help/hub/reference/external/GGTX8THLMMDJ3WBP>nueva legislación belga</a> para obtener más información sobre este requisito y proporcionar la información.","ahd_be_jsl_priority_action":"Legislación de Bélgica sobre el IVA","ahd_brkyc_priority_action":"Verificación de la identidad de Brasil","ahd_brkyc_rap_action":"Tienes que presentar la información de verificación de identidad antes de la fecha de vencimiento.","ahd_brkyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Comprueba el estado de la verificación en la página <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional\\n?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Información de identidad</a>.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_action":"Presenta los datos de verificación de identidad para reactivar tu cuenta.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"Según las leyes brasileñas, tienes que verificar tu identidad para que puedas utilizar nuestro servicio y tienes la obligación de proporcionarnos determinada información o documentación para facilitar esas comprobaciones. Es posible que te proporcionemos información adicional sobre la solicitud en \\"Notificaciones de performance\\".\\r\\n<br><br>Tu cuenta se ha desactivado porque no hemos podido validar tu información de identidad.<br><br> \\r\\nPara más información, consulta <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Información indispensable para vender en Amazon</a>.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_message":"Tu cuenta se ha desactivado porque no hemos podido validar tu información de identidad.","ahd_brkyc_rap_identity_info":"Ve a la página <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Información de identidad</a> para completar la verificación.","ahd_brkyc_rap_intro":"Las leyes brasileñas nos obligan a verificar tu identidad para que puedas usar nuestro servicio. Para facilitar el proceso, necesitamos que nos proporciones determinada información o documentación. Es posible que te proporcionemos información adicional sobre la solicitud en \\"Notificaciones de performance\\".\\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nPara más información, consulta <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Información indispensable para vender en Amazon</a>.","ahd_brkyc_rap_verifying":"Estamos validando la información y es posible que te solicitemos más detalles durante la revisión. Consulta las <a href=\'/performance/notifications\\r\\n?ref_=to_brkyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Notificaciones de performance</a> y responde a cualquier solicitud relacionada con tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon. Esta validación puede tardar hasta 24 horas y, en algunos casos, hasta 10 días laborables. Durante este periodo, tu información de identidad no se puede modificar.","ahd_cakyc_priority_action":"Verificación de la identidad en Canadá","ahd_cakyc_rap_action":"Proporciona la información de verificación de tu identidad antes de la fecha de vencimiento indicada para evitar la desactivación de la cuenta. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_action_hd":"Proporciona la información de verificación de la identidad antes de la fecha de vencimiento indicada para evitar la desactivación de la cuenta. Si no empiezas la verificación y te quedan 15 días o menos, se restringirá tu capacidad para desembolsar fondos desde tu cuenta de vendedor de Amazon.ca. La ley canadiense requiere verificación.","ahd_cakyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"Tu cuenta se ha desactivado porque no hemos podido validar tu información de identidad.  Las leyes canadienses nos obligan a verificar tu identidad para que podamos permitirte utilizar nuestro servicio. Para reactivar tu cuenta, envía la información obligatoria para verificar tu identidad. \\r\\n<br><br>Para más información, consulta <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Información indispensable para vender en Amazon</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_intro":"Las leyes canadienses nos obligan a verificar tu identidad para que puedas utilizar nuestro servicio. Necesitamos que nos proporciones cierta información y documentación para que podamos llevar a cabo estas comprobaciones de verificación. <br><br>Para más información, consulta <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Información indispensable para vender en Amazon</a> o ve a <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Notificaciones de performance</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_self_trigger_cta":"Al hacer clic en \\"Iniciar verificación\\", comenzarás el proceso de verificación en la tienda de Canadá. Consulta la página <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Información de identidad</a> para confirmar los siguientes pasos. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_verifying":"Estamos validando tu información. En algunos casos, esta validación puede tardar entre 24 horas y 10 días laborables. Es posible que te solicitemos más datos durante la revisión. Consulta la sección <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Notificaciones de performance</a> y responde a cualquier solicitud adicional relacionada con tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon.  \\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nDurante este periodo, tu información de identidad no se puede modificar.","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_header3":"¿Qué ocurre si no proporciono la información solicitada? ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph":"El uso de una cuenta de Vender en Amazon exige por ley la verificación de tu identidad. Las leyes canadienses nos obligan a verificar tu identidad para que puedas usar nuestro servicio. Para facilitar el proceso, podríamos solicitarte determinada información y documentación.<br><br>Para más información, consulta <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Información indispensable para vender en Amazon</a>.","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph2":"Tendrás hasta 60 días para completar las nuevas verificaciones. Esto no incluye el tiempo que tardemos en completar la revisión por nuestra parte. Tu capacidad para vender y retirar fondos podría verse restringida si las nuevas verificaciones no se completan en un plazo de 60 días. Cuando necesitemos información, aparecerá una notificación en \\"Información de la cuenta\\". Es posible que te proporcionemos información adicional sobre la solicitud en \\"Notificaciones de performance\\". ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph3":"Llegará un momento en el que no puedas usar tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon. Es decir, no podrás vender en Amazon.ca si no facilitas esa información. ","ahd_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_subtitle":"Tienes una o más medidas pendientes que tienes que tomar antes de empezar a vender. ","ahd_compliance_status":"Estado de cumplimiento normativo","ahd_compliance_widget_button":"Enviar información sobre cumplimiento normativo","ahd_compliance_widget_ckp_redirect":"Lanzamiento de Referencia sobre cumplimiento normativo","ahd_compliance_widget_description":"Envía la información sobre cumplimiento normativo para demostrar que cumples las normativas.","ahd_critical_account_health_notification":"Notificación crítica sobre el estado de la cuenta","ahd_critical_policy_violations":"Incumplimiento de políticas críticas","ahd_dac7_at_risk_banner":"<b>Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación.</b><br><br> Tu cuenta corre el riesgo de que se desactive debido a que falta información fiscal obligatoria en virtud de la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB\\">legislación DAC7</a>. Ve al <a href= \\"/complianceportal\\">portal de cumplimiento de la DAC7</a> para iniciar la verificación. ","ahd_dac7_compliant":"Ahora cumples los requisitos de la DAC7.","ahd_dac7_priority_action":"Información obligatoria sobre la DAC7","ahd_dac7_priority_action_pending":"Por verificar","ahd_dac7_rap_action":"Tienes que presentar la información de la DAC7 antes de la fecha de vencimiento.","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_launch_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Accede al portal de la DAC7 para presentar la información</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal_status":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_status_blurb\'  target=\'_blank\'>Comprueba el estado de verificación en el portal de la DAC7</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_deactivated_message":"Tu cuenta se ha desactivado por incumplimiento de la Directiva relativa a la cooperación administrativa: 7.ª enmienda (DAC7)","ahd_dac7_rap_intro":"La <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/external/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB?ref_=to_dac_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Directiva relativa a la cooperación administrativa: 7.ª enmienda (DAC7)</a> es una directiva de la UE que requiere que recopilemos, verifiquemos y declaremos los datos de diligencia debida, del IVA, fiscales y financieros de los vendedores residentes en la UE, independientemente de las tiendas en las que vendan.","ahd_dac7_rap_verifying":"La información de la DAC7 está en revisión. Este proceso suele tardar 72 horas, pero puede tardar más en algunos casos. Comprueba el estado de la verificación con regularidad en el portal de la DAC7 que aparece a continuación para saber si necesitamos más información.","ahd_days":"días","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"Tienes medidas pendientes para empezar a vender en la tienda de Amazon.com.br.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_subtitle":"Envía la información necesaria para completar los requisitos de verificación para vender en Brasil.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"Tienes medidas pendientes para empezar a vender en la tienda de Amazon.ca.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_subtitle":"Envía la información necesaria para completar los requisitos de verificación para vender en Canadá.","ahd_educational_banner_header":"Lleva a cabo las acciones prioritarias","ahd_educational_banner_subheader":"Tienes uno o varias acciones pendientes que darán lugar a la desactivación de la cuenta si no se llevan a cabo antes de la fecha indicada.","ahd_eg_trn_deactivation_banner":"<b>Tu cuenta se ha desactivado.</b><br><br> Para reactivar tu cuenta, visita la página <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations>Configuración de impuestos</a> para actualizar la información fiscal. Para más información, consulta <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC>la página de ayuda</a> \\"Preguntas frecuentes sobre cumplimiento fiscal\\". ","ahd_error_loading_submit":"Se ha producido un error. Intenta presentarlo de nuevo.","ahd_eukyc_priority_action":"Verificación de la identidad","ahd_fhdds_priority_action":"El IEN es obligatorio para los envíos recibidos en el Reino Unido","ahd_funds_potential_withheld":"Es posible que se retengan los fondos","ahd_inform_ac_checkbox_error":"Haz clic en la casilla de verificación para confirmar que has revisado la información y certificar que es correcta y está actualizada.","ahd_inform_ac_edu_display_name":"Revisa la información de tu cuenta","ahd_inform_ac_educational_subheader":"Tienes una o varias acciones pendientes que podrían dar lugar a la desactivación de tu cuenta en el futuro.","ahd_inform_ac_no_poc":"No se ha proporcionado la información de identidad. Si ya enviaste un documento fiscal o registro emitido por el gobierno en lugar de esta información, certificas que no se han producido cambios en esa documentación.","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p1":"De conformidad con la Ley INFORM Consumers de EE. UU., tienes la obligación de mantener actualizada determinada información de la empresa (que se indica a continuación) y certificarnos electrónicamente que has actualizado la información o que la información que ya hubieras proporcionado aún está actualizada. Certifica que la siguiente información está actualizada en un plazo de 10 días a partir de la recepción de este aviso, o tu cuenta entrará en riesgo de desactivación. ","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p2":"Ahora tienes la obligación de certificar que la información que se muestra a continuación está actualizada en un plazo de 10 días a partir del primer aviso. Si no lo certificas, tu cuenta entrará en riesgo de desactivación.","ahd_inform_ac_page1_checkbox":"Haz clic en la casilla de verificación para confirmar que comprendes que, una vez que vayas a la página \\"Aviso y certificación de la Ley INFORM\\", recibirás un aviso y dispondrás de 10 días para actualizar y certificar la información.","ahd_inform_ac_page1_step1_intructions":"Ve a la página <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Información de cuenta</a> o haz clic en \\"Modificar\\" para actualizar la información siguiente que pueda no ser correcta. ","ahd_inform_ac_page2_certify_instructions":"Si la información que aparece a continuación está actualizada, ya puedes certificarla. Si alguna información es incorrecta, ve a la página <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Información de cuenta</a> para modificarla antes de hacer clic en \\"Certificar\\".","ahd_inform_ac_refresh_update_info":"Si has actualizado alguna de la información que se muestra a continuación, haz clic aquí para actualizar la página y ver la información nueva.","ahd_inform_account_information_update_verification":"La información de tu cuenta se ha actualizado y estamos verificándola. Vuelve en 24 horas para determinar si tienes que hacer algo más para iniciar el proceso de certificación anual.","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_confirmation":"Al hacer clic en \\"Certificar\\", certifico que he leído el aviso anterior y que la información que he proporcionado a Amazon es veraz y correcta, corresponde a mi negocio y no se ha obtenido indebidamente.","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_your_info_button":"Certifica la información","ahd_inform_act_ac_edit_information":"Modificar información","ahd_inform_act_ac_not_required":"La Ley INFORM todavía no se aplica a tu empresa, por lo que actualmente no tienes obligación de certificar tu información. En el futuro, te notificaremos si tienes que certificar la información.","ahd_inform_act_ac_short_description":"Revisa y completa los requisitos pendientes de la Ley INFORM Consumers.","ahd_inform_act_ac_step1_title":"Revisa y actualiza la información","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou":"Gracias por certificar que la información de tu empresa está actualizada. La página \\"Estado de la cuenta\\" se actualizará dentro de unos minutos para confirmar que has completado el requisito de notificación y certificación de la Ley INFORM pendiente.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou_banner":"Gracias por certificar que la información de tu empresa está actualizada. La página \\"Estado de la cuenta\\" se actualizará dentro de unos minutos para confirmar que has completado el requisito pendiente de Aviso y certificación de la Ley INFORM.\\n<br><br>Recuerda que tienes que mantener actualizada la información de tu empresa y certificar al menos una vez al año que tu nombre, dirección, número de teléfono, dirección de correo electrónico, datos bancarios y número de identificación fiscal sean correctos.","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions":"Ten en cuenta que sólo el usuario principal o secundario con autorización para confirmar o modificar la información de la cuenta podrá certificar la información.","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions_error":"Esta información tiene que estar certificada por el usuario principal de la cuenta o un usuario secundario autorizado para confirmar o modificar la información de la cuenta.","ahd_inform_act_account_information":"Información de la cuenta","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_deactivation_banner":"Para cumplir la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">Ley INFORM Consumers</a>, tenemos que recopilar y verificar información sobre tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon. Dado que no hemos recibido la información solicitada, tu cuenta se ha desactivado. Para reactivar la cuenta, revisa la siguiente lista y ve a <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Información de la cuenta de vendedor</a> para completar la verificación. <br><br>Una vez que hayas completado las verificaciones de todos los requisitos pendientes, tu cuenta se reactivará en un plazo de 48 horas. ","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_hold_banner":"<b>Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación y los pagos de tu cuenta de vendedor de Amazon se han retenido.</b><br><br>Para cumplir la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">Ley INFORM Consumers</a>, tenemos que recopilar y verificar información sobre tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon. Como no hemos recibido la información solicitada dentro de los plazos especificados en nuestras comunicaciones, tus pagos se han retenido. Para reactivar los pagos, revisa la lista siguiente y ve a <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Información de la cuenta de vendedor</a> para iniciar o completar el envío de la información.","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_ending":"Cuenta bancaria acabada en","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"Datos de cuenta bancaria","ahd_inform_act_debit_card_ending":"La tarjeta de débito que termina en","ahd_inform_act_dismiss":"Omitir","ahd_inform_act_dismiss_button":"Omitir","ahd_inform_act_hold_wait_text":"Para reactivar tus pagos y evitar que se desactive tu cuenta, haz clic en los siguientes elementos de acción para ir a <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Información de la cuenta de vendedor</a> y completar los requisitos pendientes. <br><br>Gracias por completar la verificación de identidad. Comprueba en 24 horas si es necesario hacer algún otro paso de verificación.","ahd_inform_act_hold_widget_description":"Para reactivar tus pagos y evitar que se desactive tu cuenta, haz clic en los siguientes elementos de acción para ir a <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Información de la cuenta de vendedor</a> y completar los requisitos pendientes. <br><br>Después de completar la verificación de identidad, es posible que te solicitemos que verifiques uno o varios de los siguientes elementos.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_wait_text":"Haz clic en los elementos que aparecen a continuación para completar los requisitos pendientes. Gracias por completar la verificación de identidad. Comprueba en 24 horas si es necesario hacer algún otro paso de verificación.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_widget_description":"Haz clic en los elementos que aparecen a continuación para completar los requisitos pendientes. Después de completar la verificación de identidad, es posible que te solicitemos que verifiques uno o varios de los siguientes elementos.","ahd_inform_act_short_description":"Revisa y completa los requisitos pendientes de la Ley INFORM sobre consumo.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete":"<b>Ley INFORM Consumers de EE. UU.</b><br><br>Hemos completado correctamente todas las verificaciones abiertas. Agradecemos tu colaboración en este proceso de verificación.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete_short":"<b>Ley INFORM Consumers de EE. UU.</b><br><br>Hemos completado correctamente todas las verificaciones abiertas. Agradecemos tu colaboración en este proceso de verificación.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete_widget":"Hemos completado correctamente todas las verificaciones abiertas. Agradecemos tu colaboración en este proceso de verificación.","ahd_inform_act_wait_text":"Gracias por verificar la identidad. Vuelve en 24 horas para confirmar si se necesita más información. <br><br>Haz clic en los elementos que aparecen a continuación para ir a la página <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Información de la cuenta de vendedor</a> y completar los requisitos pendientes.","ahd_inform_act_widget_business_address_field":"Domicilio social","ahd_inform_act_widget_description":"Haz clic en los elementos que aparecen a continuación para ir a la página <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Información de la cuenta de vendedor</a> y completar los requisitos pendientes. <br><br> Después de completar la verificación de identidad, es posible que te solicitemos que verifiques uno o varios de los siguientes elementos.","ahd_inform_act_widget_title":"Ley INFORM Consumers de EE. UU.","ahd_inform_act_widget_unverified_status":"sin verificar","ahd_inform_annual_cerification_risk_banner":"Es obligatorio que mantengas actualizada la información de tu empresa y que la certifiques","ahd_inform_annual_review_banner":"<b>Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación. </b><br><br>Para cumplir la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7?ref_=ahd_annual_ inform_consumer_act\\">Ley INFORM Consumers</a>, la información de tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon tiene que estar certificada con carácter anual. Ve a la página <a href=\\"/mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render?ref_=ahd_annual_inform_certification\\">Certificación anual</a> para confirmar que tu información esté actualizada.","ahd_inform_annual_review_complete":"<b>Ley INFORM Consumers</b><br><br> Gracias por completar todos los requisitos pendientes.","ahd_inform_annual_review_seller_enforced":"Para cumplir la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">Ley INFORM Consumers</a>, tienes que certificar que la información de tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon es precisa al menos una vez al año. Dado que no hemos recibido la certificación solicitada, tu cuenta se ha desactivado. Para reactivar tu cuenta, visita la página <a href=\\" /mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render\\">Certificación anual</a> para certificar que tu información está actualizada. <br><br>Una vez que hayas completado la certificación, tu cuenta se reactivará en un plazo de 48 horas.","ahd_inform_annual_review_thank_you_dismiss_button":"Omitir","ahd_inform_bav_not_verified":"No tienes una cuenta bancaria verificada o no has asignado la cuenta bancaria verificada como predeterminada en el sitio web de EE. UU. Comprueba tu cuenta bancaria y establécela como predeterminada en la página <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Datos de cuenta bancaria</a>.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p1":"Recuerda que tienes que mantener actualizada la información de tu empresa y certificar al menos una vez al año que tu nombre, dirección, número de teléfono, dirección de correo electrónico, datos bancarios y número de identificación fiscal sean correctos.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p2":"Si alguno de tus datos cambia, también tendremos que verificar esta nueva información. Responde rápidamente a cualquier solicitud de información para que podamos llevar a cabo estos pasos de verificación adicionales y evitar la desactivación de tu cuenta. Para más información sobre el proceso de verificación, consulta la <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>página de ayuda de la Ley INFORM</a>.","ahd_inform_consumers_act_annual":"Certificación anual de la Ley INFORM Consumers ","ahd_inform_debit_card":"Para seguir recibiendo pagos del sitio web de EE. UU., tienes que verificar tu cuenta bancaria secundaria activa. Para ello, ve a <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Datos de cuenta bancaria</a>.","ahd_inform_loading_error":"Ve a la página <a href=/hz/sc/account-information target=\\"_blank\\">Información de cuenta</a> para revisar tu información actual.","ahd_inform_no_default_deposit":"No tienes una cuenta bancaria verificada o no la has asignado como método de depósito predeterminado en el sitio web de EE. UU. Comprueba y establece la cuenta bancaria como predeterminada en <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Datos de cuenta bancaria</a>.","ahd_inform_page1_checkbox":"Entiendo que, una vez vaya a la página \\"Aviso y certificación de la Ley INFORM\\", tengo que completar la certificación en un plazo de 10 días para evitar el riesgo de desactivación de la cuenta. ","ahd_inform_page1_instructions":"Revisa y certifica la información en dos sencillos pasos:","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2a":"Empezaremos a enviar a los vendedores una notificación formal para que revisen y certifiquen que la información de su empresa sea correcta.","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2b":"Sin embargo, no tienes que esperar a recibir la notificación formal; puedes tomar las medidas necesarias ahora para evitar que la cuenta corra el riesgo de desactivación más adelante.","ahd_inform_page1_proceed_title":"Continuar a \\"Aviso y certificación de la Ley INFORM\\"","ahd_inform_page1_step2_description":"Si la información está actualizada o acabas de actualizarla, ve al siguiente paso, \\"Aviso y certificación\\", para recibir el aviso formal y completar la certificación. Cuando veas este aviso, la ley exige que certifiques tu información en un plazo de 10 días.","ahd_inform_page_1_p1":"Tenemos el firme compromiso de ofrecer un servicio de compra fiable tanto para ti como para los clientes. Para cumplirlo, recopilaremos y verificaremos ciertos datos empresariales al menos una vez al año, como la información que exige la Ley INFORM Consumers de EE. UU.","ahd_inform_sw_bav":"Tienes que verificar tus cuentas bancarias activas. Verifica tus cuentas bancarias en <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Datos de cuenta bancaria</a>.","ahd_inform_tax_q_redirect":"Ve al <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/1099KTaxInformation/step/1099KTaxInformation?immediateRedirect=true&intent=INFORM_ACT target=\\"_blank\\">cuestionario sobre información fiscal de INFORM</a> para revisar la información actual.","ahd_inform_update_account_information_educational":"Visita la página <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Certificación anual</a> para asegurarte de que la información de tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon esté actualizada.","ahd_itr_extension_extension_request_link":"presenta la documentación necesaria.","ahd_itr_extension_request":"Si quieres solicitar una ampliación o exención de estos requisitos, ${appealUrl}.","ahd_itr_priority_action":"Se requiere el número de identificación fiscal italiano para vendedores con sede en Italia.","ahd_itr_rap_appeals":"He actualizado la información de mi \\"codice fiscale\\" italiano en \\"Configuración de impuestos\\" y me gustaría solicitar una nueva validación.","ahd_itr_rap_at_risk_deactivation":"Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación.","ahd_itr_rap_deactivated_message":"Tu cuenta se ha desactivado.","ahd_itr_rap_dispute":"No estoy de acuerdo con la decisión de Amazon sobre la validación de mi \\"codice fiscale\\" italiano.","ahd_itr_rap_intro":"La <a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>ley italiana n.º 157/2019</a> exige que los vendedores con sede en Italia efectúen una o más transacciones en Amazon.it para añadir su \\"codice fiscale\\" en \\"Configuración de impuestos\\".","ahd_itr_remediation_corp":"Envía tu código fiscal italiano (\\"codice fiscale\\") en \\"Configuración de impuestos\\" <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. Según nuestra información (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), tu cuenta está registrada como empresa y, por lo tanto, necesitamos tu número de registro de la empresa (conocido como \\"codice fiscale\\", que se corresponde con el número de identificación fiscal sin código de país \\"IT\\"). Consulta en la página de ayuda (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Ley italiana n.º 157/2019</a>) los pasos que tienes que seguir para enviar los datos. Asegúrate de que la razón social que figura en la página \\"Información de la empresa\\" (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) y el número de registro de la empresa que aparece en \\"Configuración de impuestos\\" <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> coincidan con los de base de datos de la autoridad fiscal italiana.","ahd_itr_remediation_individual":"Envía tu código fiscal italiano (\\"codice fiscale\\") en \\"Configuración de impuestos\\" <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. Según nuestra información (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), tu cuenta está registrada como persona física y, por lo tanto, necesitamos tu documento de identidad (conocido como \\"codice fiscale\\"). Consulta en la página de ayuda (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>Ley italiana n.º 157/2019</a>) los pasos que tienes que seguir para enviar los datos. Asegúrate de que la razón social que figura en la página \\"Información de la empresa\\" (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) y el documento de identidad que aparece en \\"Configuración de impuestos\\" <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> coincidan con los de base de datos de la autoridad fiscal italiana.","ahd_itr_remediation_unkown":"Presenta la información en la página \\"Información de la empresa \\"(https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render). Las empresas tienen que proporcionar su número de registro mercantil (conocido como \\"codice fiscale\\", correspondiente al número de identificación fiscal sin el código de país \\"IT\\"), mientras que los vendedores particulares (también las sociedades unipersonales) (\\"P. IVA individuale\\"), tienen que subir su DNI personal (también conocido como \\"codice fiscale\\") en Configuración de impuestos\\"<https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. Asegúrate de que la razón social que figura en la página \\"Información de la empresa\\" (<https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render>) y el código fiscal (\\"codice fiscale\\") que aparece en \\"Configuración de impuestos\\" <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> coincidan con los de la base de datos de la autoridad fiscal italiana.","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_details_fallback_text":"¿Tienes preguntas sobre cómo mantener una cuenta en buen estado? Obtén asesoramiento personalizado del Asistente de vendedores.","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_title":"Preguntar al Asistente de vendedores","ahd_mvblsivna_priority_action":"Completa la verificación","ahd_new_feature":"NOVEDAD","ahd_new_feature_announcement_body_new_filters":"Ahora puedes filtrar los incumplimientos de políticas según las medidas que has tomado para los listings afectados. Ve a la página \\"Cumplimiento de las políticas de producto\\" y haz clic en \\"Añadir filtros\\" para filtrar las infracciones.","ahd_new_feature_announcement_header":"Anuncio de nuevo servicio","ahd_new_feature_announcement_title_new_filters":"Se han añadido nuevos filtros","ahd_other_policy_violation_title":"Otros incumplimientos de políticas","ahd_payment_policy_hd_priority_action":"Tus fondos están retenidos porque hay acciones pendientes en tu cuenta. Revisa las <b>Acciones prioritarias</b> para reactivar tus pagos.","ahd_post_enforcement_non_deactivation_subheader":"Tienes una o varias acciones pendientes que están afectando al estado de la cuenta.","ahd_pr_form_address_header":"Paga las sanciones por los productos que no cumplen los requisitos para seguir vendiendo tus productos.","ahd_pr_form_address_sub_header":"Según las directrices del Departamento de Justicia, facilitamos el cumplimiento de tus obligaciones normativas. Para ello, declaramos tus pedidos en Amazon y pagamos por ellos y, a continuación, recuperamos estos importes de tu cuenta.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_info":"De acuerdo con el Decreto de consentimiento de la EPA o Departamento de Justicia de EE. UU., tenemos la obligación de penalizar a los vendedores por cualquier infracción de las políticas relacionadas con la EPA. Encontrarás más información sobre los <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account/health/product-policies\\">productos que no cumplen los requisitos</a>, cálculo de las sanciones asociadas, retenciones en tu cuenta y comunicaciones enviadas para presentar recursos. A continuación, se te cobrará cualquier sanción pendiente.<br/><br/> Antes de que te cobremos las sanciones, haremos una retención en tu cuenta y te daremos la oportunidad de corregir el listing.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_title":"¿Cómo funciona este servicio?","ahd_pr_form_impact_header":"A continuación, se detalla el posible impacto en la cuenta:","ahd_pr_form_impact_p1":"Responsabilidad de pago de las sanciones (consulta los detalles de la infracción a continuación).","ahd_pr_form_impact_p2":"El listing permanecerá suprimido de acuerdo con las directrices del Departamento de Justicia y Agencia de Protección Medioambiental","ahd_pr_form_impact_p3":"Impacto negativo en el estado de la cuenta, lo que puede dar lugar a la desactivación de tu cuenta de vendedor","ahd_pr_form_note":"Nota: Antes de que te cobremos las sanciones, haremos una retención en tu cuenta durante 30 días y te daremos la oportunidad de corregir el listing.","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_body":"Hemos identificado que este producto es un pesticida, dispositivo pesticida o producto que contiene declaraciones sobre pesticidas. Para que se pueda considerar la posibilidad de restablecerlo, proporciona pruebas de un número de registro de la EPA o un número de establecimiento de la EPA, o una certificación de que el producto está exento de las normativas de la EPA. Tendrás que proporcionar esta información en el atributo de marcado de pesticidas del listing. <a href=/help/hub/reference/GLX9EJX844SNJX7J> Las instrucciones para completar este atributo están disponibles en Seller Central.</a>","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_title":"Información sobre políticas relacionada","ahd_pr_form_title":"Detalles del producto que no cumple los requisitos","ahd_pre_enforcment_non_deactivation_subheader":"Tienes una o varias acciones pendientes que podrían dar lugar a una interrupción de tu cuenta en el futuro.","ahd_priority_actions_address_by_date":"Abordar a más tardar el {date}, dentro de {daysremaining} días","ahd_priority_actions_cr":"Incumplimientos de la ratio de cancelaciones","ahd_priority_actions_description":"Aborda las siguientes incidencias para evitar la desactivación de tu cuenta.","ahd_priority_actions_lsr":"Incumplimiento de la ratio de envíos atrasados","ahd_priority_actions_odr":"Incumplimientos de la ratio de pedidos defectuosos","ahd_priority_actions_otdr":"Incumplimientos de la ratio de entregas a tiempo","ahd_priority_actions_verification_title":"Completar los requisitos de verificación","ahd_pspp_priority_actions":"Completa el proceso de verificación de la identidad del cliente pendiente: proveedor de servicio de pagos","ahd_pspp_rap_intro":"Tu cuenta bancaria no es apta para recibir pagos. Colabora con tu proveedor de servicio de pagos para completar el proceso de verificación de la identidad del cliente pendiente.","ahd_pspp_rap_next_steps":"Para más información, consulta <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GY8JTVAWBPQT2XFC?ref_=to_psp_faq_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Preguntas frecuentes sobre proveedores de servicio de pagos</a> y <a href=\'/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView?ref_=to_deposit_method_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Datos de cuenta bancaria</a>. ","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory":"Países afectados por las restricciones de inventario","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory_details":"Aborda las incidencias con los requisitos pendientes para evitar interrupciones en tu inventario gestionado por Amazon y tus capacidades de importación o exportación en el país indicado.","ahd_rap_at_risk_regional_details":"Los requisitos indicados afectan al estado de la cuenta en varias tiendas. Aborda las incidencias con los requisitos pendientes para evitar la desactivación de tu cuenta en todas las tiendas afectadas.","ahd_rap_begin_verification_cta":"Iniciar verificación","ahd_rap_deactivated_message":"Tu cuenta se ha desactivado.","ahd_rap_enforced_inventory_details":"Aborda las incidencias con los requisitos pendientes para eliminar las restricciones de tu inventario gestionado por Amazon y tus capacidades de importación o exportación en el país indicado.","ahd_rap_netherlands":"Países Bajos","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p1":"El uso de una cuenta de Vender en Amazon exige por ley la verificación de tu identidad. Tal y como requiere la legislación canadiense y brasileña, tenemos que verificar tu identidad para que puedas utilizar nuestro servicio. Para facilitar el proceso, podríamos solicitarte determinada información y documentación.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p3":"Puedes proporcionar la información de verificación necesaria en cualquier momento después de haberte registrado. El acceso a tu cuenta se limitará hasta que la información se haya proporcionado y verificado.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p4":"Si quieres continuar y vender en Amazon.ca o Amazon.com.br, marca la casilla situada junto a la tienda en la que quieras continuar con la verificación a continuación. Una vez que hayas seleccionado proceder con la verificación, consulta la página \\"Información de identidad\\" para determinar los pasos que debes seguir a continuación.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p5":"Si quieres proceder primero con la verificación de una única tienda, selecciona sólo esa tienda de la siguiente lista. Una vez que hayas completado la verificación de la tienda, se te notificará para completar los pasos necesarios para iniciar la verificación de la otra tienda.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_thankyou_p1":"Gracias por iniciar el proceso de verificación.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_thankyou_p2":"Estamos validando la información y es posible que te solicitemos más detalles durante la revisión. Esta validación puede tardar hasta 24 horas y, en algunos casos, hasta 10 días laborables. Durante este periodo, tu información de identidad no se puede modificar.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_check_verification_status":"Comprueba el estado de la verificación y siguientes pasos necesarios en la página \\"Información de la cuenta\\".","ahd_rap_or":"O","ahd_rap_past_due_inventory":"VENCIDA: capacidades de inventario restringidas","ahd_rap_the_uk":"el Reino Unido","ahd_rap_uk":"Reino Unido","ahd_rap_voluntary_submission_action":"De acuerdo con la información de la que disponemos, no tienes obligación de tener un número de identificación fiscal de ${countryName}. Para cumplir con este requisito, puedes eliminarlo de <a href=\'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Configuración de impuestos</a> o continuar con la resolución del problema anterior.","ahd_sa_account_health_guidance_description":"¿Tienes preguntas sobre el estado de la cuenta? Obtén asesoramiento personalizado del Asistente de vendedores.","ahd_sa_ask_seller_assistant_title":"Preguntar al Asistente de vendedores","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_label":"Resumir el cumplimiento normativo de los productos","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_text":"¿Puedes resumir mis infracciones de cumplimiento normativo de los productos?","ahd_uaebizlicense_priority_action":"Sube tu licencia comercial","ahd_vas_extension_extension_request_link":"Envía la documentación necesaria.","ahd_vas_extension_request":"Si quieres solicitar una extensión o no estás de acuerdo con la decisión que hemos tomado, <a href=\\"${appealUrl}\\" target=\\"_blank\\">presenta la documentación necesaria.</a>","ahd_vas_it_reason":"Número de identificación fiscal italiano no válido","ahd_vas_priority_action":"Requisitos del registro a efectos fiscales en Europa","ahd_vas_rap_action_address_country":" <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Verifica o actualiza la información de la dirección</a>","ahd_vas_rap_action_address_review":"<a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Revisar la información presentada sobre la dirección</a>","ahd_vas_rap_action_name_country":" <a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>Verifica o actualiza la información del nombre</a>","ahd_vas_rap_action_name_review":"<a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>Revisar la información presentada sobre el nombre</a>","ahd_vas_rap_action_vat_country":"<a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Verifica o actualiza el número de identificación fiscal</a> ","ahd_vas_rap_action_vat_review":"<a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Revisar el número de identificación fiscal presentado</a> ","ahd_vas_rap_deactivated_message":"Los requisitos indicados afectan al estado de la cuenta en varias tiendas. Aborda las incidencias con los requisitos pendientes del país indicado para reactivar tu cuenta en todas las tiendas afectadas.","ahd_vas_rap_intro":"Los <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GTQ23HPXBQK563WS\' target=\'_blank\'>requisitos del registro a efectos fiscales en Europa</a> son una política de nuestras tiendas europeas que obliga a todos los colaboradores comerciales que estén activos en las tiendas europeas a presentar un número de identificación fiscal válido cuando sea necesario.  Consulta la sección \\"Impacto en el estado de la cuenta\\" para completar los requisitos pendientes.","ahd_vas_rap_secondary_action":"Si no dispones de un número de identificación fiscal del país indicado, ve al portal <a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>Información de la empresa</a> y al portal <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Configuración de impuestos</a> para presentar la información obligatoria (número de identificación fiscal, nombre y dirección) en los siguientes países:","ahd_vas_rap_third_action":"Si te has dado de alta en la Ventanilla Única del IVA (OSS) en tu país de origen, consulta la página <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Configuración de impuestos</a> seleccionando el país de origen en el menú \\"Declaración de IVA de Ventanilla Única del IVA (OSS) de la Unión Europea\\". Asegúrate de que tu Ventanilla Única del IVA (OSS) de la Unión Europea esté activada y el nombre y dirección que nos has proporcionado coincidan con los presentados a las autoridades.","ahd_vas_rap_verifying":"Estamos revisando los datos de tus números de identificación fiscal. Podemos tardar hasta 14 días en completar la revisión. Contactaremos contigo si necesitamos más información.","ahd_violation_appeal_button":"Continuar con el recurso","ahd_violation_display_name":"Incumplimiento de políticas de productos excluidos","ahd_violation_status_assessment_phase":"Sanciones en la fase de evaluación: los pagos pueden verse afectados.","ahd_w8_priority_action":"Se requieren los datos fiscales actualizados de EE. UU.","ahd_w8_rap_action":"Ahora tienes que completar el cuestionario de autoservicio sobre información fiscal antes de la fecha de vencimiento. El envío puede tardar hasta 24 horas en procesarse.","ahd_w8_rap_deactivated_action":"Presenta la información obligatoria para reactivar tu cuenta. El envío puede tardar hasta 24 horas en procesarse.","ahd_w8_rap_intro":"Tienes que presentar un nuevo formulario fiscal W-8. En cuanto venza, tu cuenta de vendedor se desactivará temporalmente hasta que proporciones información fiscal actualizada.\\n\\n<br><br>Estos requisitos afectan al estado de la cuenta en varias tiendas.  Aborda los requisitos indicados para evitar la desactivación de tu cuenta en todas las tiendas afectadas.\\n\\n<br><br>Para más información, consulta <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G200663290?ref_=to_w8_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Preguntas frecuentes sobre la declaración de ingresos y recopilación de datos fiscales de EE. UU.</a>","ahd_w8_rap_tax_interview":"<a href=\'/hz/account-info/tax-interview-redirect?ref_=to_w8_from_launch_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Completa el cuestionario de autoservicio sobre información fiscal para presentar la información obligatoria.</a>","ahdpars_spx_myc_dashboard_mainHeader1":"Gestionar tu cumplimiento normativo","ahr-status-badge-great":"Adecuado","ai_inform_page1_step1":"1. Ve a la página \\"Información de la cuenta\\" [enlace a la página \\"Información de la cuenta\\"] para revisar la información de tu cuenta (y actualizarla, si procede).","ai_inform_page1_step2":"2. Cuando hayas confirmado que la información sea correcta, vuelve a esta página y haz clic en el enlace siguiente para recibir el aviso formal y completar la certificación.","alert_variant_demo_description":"JavaScript ha cambiado la variante de este componente de aviso","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Dado que los componentes de Katal son extensiones de elementos HTML, JavaScript puede interactuar con ellos de la misma forma que los elementos HTML integrados. Aquí vemos que JavaScript cambia el atributo \\"variant\\" en el aviso.","components_containing_html_text":"Algunos componentes pueden contener HTML, como el componente KatalTabs. Estos componentes complejos proporcionan una API para que los desarrolladores y entornos de trabajo puedan interactuar con ellos.","custom_elements_text":"Katal ofrece a los desarrolladores la posibilidad de utilizar elementos personalizados para crear sus páginas web. Por ejemplo, si el desarrollador necesita un botón, puede utilizar <kat-button></kat-button> en lugar de crear un botón por sí mismo.","demo_complex_header_text":"Demostración: componentes de Katal complejos","demo_components_header_text":"Demostración: uso de componentes de Katal","demo_javascript_header_text":"Demostración: JavaScript con componentes de Katal","design_approved_text":"Katal ofrece componentes autorizados para su uso en páginas web que se pueden configurar con etiquetas y configuraciones personalizadas. Por ejemplo: botones normales y botones secundarios, diferentes sólo en el atributo \\"variant\\".","discovery_ahd_ni_warn_impressum":"Impressum","fba_inventory_uc_identifier":"Nuestros registros indican que tienes inventario almacenado en ${COUNTRY} a través del programa Logística de Amazon. Al ser un vendedor que utiliza los servicios de Logística de Amazon, tienes que proporcionar un número de identificación fiscal válido para cada país donde esté almacenado tu inventario. Puedes comprobar los países en los que has activado Logística de Amazon <a href=/fba/settings/ target=\\"_blank\\">aquí</a>.\\r\\nTen en cuenta que tienes que proporcionar un número de identificación fiscal válido que se haya activado para transacciones intracomunitarias.","greeting_description":"Este es un ejemplo de aplicación de Katal que muestra cómo utilizar componentes de Katal, así como herramientas para desarrollo e implementación. Ponte en contacto con el equipo de Katal a través de colombia-team@amazon.com si tienes alguna pregunta o comentario. Para continuar con esta demostración, omite este aviso.","greeting_description_mons_app":"Este es un ejemplo de aplicación de Katal que muestra cómo utilizar componentes de Katal con traducciones. Ponte en contacto con el equipo de Katal a través de katal-team@amazon.com si tienes alguna pregunta o comentario.","inform_mobile_notification_description":"Ve a la página \\"Estado de la cuenta\\" para revisar los requisitos de verificación pendientes de la Ley INFORM.","inform_mobile_notification_description_full":"Tu cuenta de vendedor de Amazon.com está en riesgo de desactivación. Ve a la página \\"Estado de la cuenta\\" para revisar los requisitos de verificación pendientes de la Ley INFORM.","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Enviar comentarios","mobile_ahd_banner_eg_trn":"Actualiza tu número de registro a efectos fiscales en la página \\"Configuración de impuestos\\" de tu cuenta de Seller Central.","mobile_tutorial_inform_act_description":"Para cumplir la Ley INFORM Consumers, tenemos que recopilar y verificar información sobre tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon. Actualmente, tienes una o más verificaciones pendientes.","poe_domestic_uc_identifier":"Nuestros registros internos indican que tus ventas en ${COUNTRY} superan el umbral nacional del registro a efectos fiscales.","ppc_fhdds_action_taken":"Riesgo de restricción de entrada en el Reino Unido","ppc_fhdds_action_taken_past_due":"Actualmente, las capacidades de envío en el Reino Unido están excluidas","ppc_fhdds_reason":"Sistema de declaración de diligencia debida de centros logísticos (FHDDS): al envío le falta el número de entrada de importaciones (IEN)","product-policy-compliance":"Cumplimiento de las políticas relativas a los productos","rv-link-button":"Ir a las infracciones","sc_homepage_education_phase_description":"Aborda el estado de tu cuenta para evitar el riesgo de que se desactive en el futuro.","sc_homepage_pending_deactivation":"Se ha producido un evento crítico en tu cuenta que ha provocado que esté pendiente de desactivación. ","sc_inform_act_hold_banner":"Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación y los pagos están retenidos","sc_inform_act_view_account_health_banner":"Ve a \\"Estado de la cuenta\\"","sc_navbar_ah_cs_desc":"Consulta tus estadísticas de calidad del servicio de atención al cliente, como las ratios de pedidos defectuosos y de defectos de facturación.","sc_navbar_ah_desc":"Consulta tu Nivel del estado de la cuenta, incidencias que afectan al estado de tu cuenta e infracciones que puedan dar lugar a la retirada del contenido o a la desactivación de la cuenta.","sc_navbar_ah_eligibilities_desc":"Consulta las ventajas y programas a los que puedes optar.","sc_navbar_ah_myc_desc":"Asegúrate de que todos tus productos cumplan con todas las leyes, normativas y políticas de Amazon aplicables.","sc_navbar_ah_ppc_desc":"Consulta todos los incumplimientos de políticas que puedan dar lugar a la retirada de contenido o a la desactivación de la cuenta. ","sc_navbar_ah_sp_desc":"Consulta tus estadísticas de rendimiento de envíos, como la ratio de envíos atrasados, ratio de cancelaciones previas al envío, ratio de envíos con seguimiento y ratio de entregas a tiempo.  ","schp_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_header":"Completa los requisitos de verificación pendientes para empezar a vender en nuestra tienda.","schp_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_subtitle":"Ve a la página \\"Estado de la cuenta\\" y completa tus acciones prioritarias para empezar a vender en nuestra tienda.","schp_complete_priority_actions":"Lleva a cabo las acciones prioritarias","schp_inventory_restriction_card":"Aborda las incidencias con el estado de la cuenta para eliminar las restricciones de inventario de tu cuenta.","ship_from_non_poe_uc_identifier":"Nuestros registros internos indican que envías desde ${COUNTRY}, el cual no es tu país de origen, por lo que tienes que proporcionar un número de identificación fiscal válido en el sistema VIES o un número de identificación fiscal aplicable para las transacciones en la UE. Puedes verificar tu dirección de envío en la página \\"Configuración de envíos\\" o desde este <a href=/sbr target=\\"_blank\\">enlace</a>.\\nTen en cuenta que tienes que proporcionar un número de identificación fiscal válido que se haya activado para transacciones intracomunitarias.","ship_from_poe_uc_identifier":"Nuestros registros indican que tus ventas transfronterizas superan los 10 000 € en los países de la UE. Al ser un vendedor que hace ventas transfronterizas, tienes que proporcionar un número de identificación fiscal habilitado para la Ventanilla Única del IVA (OSS) del país de tu domicilio fiscal o números de identificación fiscal válidos de todos los países a los que envías productos.","ship_to_non_eu_uc_identifier":"Nuestros registros internos indican que tienes envíos superiores a 150 € desde fuera de la UE a ${COUNTRY}. Por lo tanto, tienes que proporcionar un número de identificación fiscal de ${COUNTRY} válido o una declaración que confirme que no eres el importador de registro de los envíos que superan el umbral.","ship_to_uoss_uc_identifier":"Nuestros registros internos indican que haces ventas transfronterizas a ${COUNTRY} desde otro país de la UE y, por lo tanto, tienes que proporcionar un número de identificación fiscal habilitado para la Ventanilla Única del IVA (OSS) del país de tu domicilio fiscal o un número de identificación fiscal de ${COUNTRY} válido.\\r\\nTen en cuenta que tienes que proporcionar un número de identificación fiscal válido que se haya activado para transacciones intracomunitarias.","ship_to_xborder_uc_identifier":"Nuestros registros internos indican que haces ventas transfronterizas a ${COUNTRY} desde otro país de la UE y, por lo tanto, tienes que proporcionar un número de identificación fiscal de ${COUNTRY} válido.","sp-aha-check-eligibility-button":"Consulta lo necesario para optar a este programa","sp-permanent-call-me-now-need-help":"¿Necesita Ayuda?","sp-permanent-call-me-now-prompt":"Habla con un especialista en el estado de la cuenta","sp_health_atoz_guarantee_claims_caption":"Reclamaciones bajo la Garantía de la A a la Z","sp_health_cancellation_rate_caption":"Ratio de cancelaciones previas al envío","sp_health_cancellation_rate_subtitle":"<b>Objetivo</b>: menos de ${hash-get targetValue}","sp_health_chargeback_claims_caption":"Reclamaciones por reversión de cargo","sp_health_customer_satisfaction_information_label":"La ratio de pedidos defectuosos se compone de varias estadísticas:","sp_health_dashboard_guardian_title_new":"Control del estado de la cuenta","sp_health_dashboard_subheader":"Para vender en Amazon, debes cumplir los siguientes objetivos y políticas de rendimiento.","sp_health_download_report_caption":"Descargar informe","sp_health_intellectual_property_customer_complaints":"Reclamaciones sobre propiedad intelectual recibidas","sp_health_late_shipment_rate_caption":"Ratio de envíos atrasados","sp_health_late_shipment_rate_subtitle":"<b>Objetivo</b>: menos de ${hash-get targetValue}","sp_health_listing_policy_customer_complaints":"Incumplimiento de políticas de publicación","sp_health_mobile_by_ahr_impact_tab_title":"Por impacto en el nivel del estado de la cuenta","sp_health_mobile_info_bar_label_ahr_filter_enabled":"Infracciones o más","sp_health_nav_eligibilities":"Aptitud para servicios","sp_health_nav_myc":"Gestionar tu cumplimiento normativo","sp_health_nav_performance_over_time":"Historial de rendimiento","sp_health_nav_reports":"Informes","sp_health_order_defect_rate_caption":"Ratio de pedidos defectuosos","sp_health_pre_fulfillment_cancel_rate":"Ratio de cancelaciones previas al envío","sp_health_product_condition_customer_complaints":"Reclamaciones por estado del producto","sp_health_product_policies":"Cumplimiento de las políticas de producto","sp_health_product_quality_popover":"Este total incluye las reclamaciones que posiblemente ya hayas abordado mediante un plan de acción.","sp_health_product_safety_customer_complaints":"Problemas relativos a la seguridad de productos y alimentos","sp_health_restricted_products_violations_policy":"Infracciones de la política de productos excluidos","sp_health_risk_banner_unitotd":"Tu ratio de entregas a tiempo es ${unitOTDRiskData.getFormattedValue()}; el objetivo es ${unitOTDRiskData.getFormattedTarget()}.","sp_health_risk_banner_vtr":"Tus ofertas gestionadas por el vendedor podrían desactivarse. Tu ratio de envíos con seguimiento es ${hash-get metricValue}; el objetivo es ${hash-get target}.","sp_health_seller_fulfilled_metrics_caption":"Gestionado por el vendedor","sp_health_shipping_bucket_caption":"Rendimiento de envíos","sp_health_shipping_eligibilities":"Ver aptitud para envío Premium","sp_health_suspected_intellectual_property_violations":"Supuestas infracciones de la propiedad intelectual","sp_health_time_window":"Período de tiempo: ${hash-get numDays} días","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_caption":"Ratio de envíos con seguimiento","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_subtitle":"<b>Objetivo</b>: más de ${hash-get targetValue}","sp_health_violation_details_selling_assistant_title":"Preguntar al Asistente de vendedores","sp_health_violation_details_stale_page_button_label":"Volver a \\"Estado de la cuenta\\"","sp_health_violation_details_stale_page_dialog_title":"Página no encontrada","sp_mfn_at_risk_warning":"Tus ofertas gestionadas por el vendedor están en riesgo de desactivación","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_defects":"Ahora mismo no tienes ningún defecto en este pedido.","sp_st_date_range":"${hash-get startDate} - ${hash-get endDate}","sp_st_heading_order_edd":"Fecha prevista de entrega","sp_st_str_with_description":"${hash-get description} : ${hash-get str}","sp_st_zero_out_metrics_message":"Los pedidos recibidos antes del 1 de junio no cuentan a la hora de evaluar el estado de tu cuenta, por lo que no se muestran aquí.","sp_vtr_list_ca":"1. Productos pesados y voluminosos enviados por un transportista no integrado con Amazon. Más información sobre los transportistas integrados.</br></br>2. Productos pequeños y ligeros de pedidos con un valor inferior a 30 CAD (lo que incluye los gastos de envío) y que se envíen en sobres de correo estándar o preferente de Canada Post.</br></br>3. Envíos internacionales desde China de pedidos con un valor inferior a 6 CAD (lo que incluye los gastos de envío).</br></br>4. Envíos internacionales desde fuera de EE. UU. y China.</br></br>5. Pedidos digitales que un transportista no pueda enviar físicamente (por ejemplo, audiolibros).","sp_zero_tolerance_banner_body":"Debido a una o más infracciones críticas, tu cuenta está pendiente de desactivación. Para evitar la desactivación, aborda estas infracciones de inmediato. Para más información, consulta <a href=/gp/help/G200205250>Política del programa Nivel del estado de la cuenta</a>.","submission_status_ahd_review_submission_pending_status":"Estado: La evaluación está en curso.","tab_demo_generated_text":"Pestaña \\"Generado automáticamente\\" {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"Nombre de pestaña {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_text":"Contenido de la pestaña seleccionada inicialmente","ts-form-header":"Denunciar un uso indebido","ts-ingress-ahd":" <a id=\'submission-channel-link\' href=\'#\'>Informa de un uso indebido</a> de las políticas de Amazon.","valid_vat_number_uc_identifier":"Ten en cuenta que tienes que proporcionar un número de identificación fiscal válido que se haya activado para transacciones intracomunitarias.","voluntary_vrn_uc_identifier":"Nuestros registros internos indican que no tienes obligación de tener un número de identificación fiscal en ${COUNTRY}, pero has proporcionado uno en Seller Central que no es válido actualmente. Para resolver esta discrepancia, puedes eliminar el número de identificación fiscal de ${COUNTRY} o proporcionar uno válido. Al eliminar tu número de identificación fiscal de ${COUNTRY} de Seller Central, confirmas que no tienes obligación de disponer de uno en ${COUNTRY}. Te recomendamos que consultes a un asesor fiscal para determinar si tus actividades comerciales generales, tanto dentro como fuera de Amazon, requieren el registro a efectos fiscales."}},"es-MX":{"pages.floatingWidget":{"DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_content":"Formas parte de un experimento para mejorar la experiencia del vendedor: a partir de ahora, el desempeño del porcentaje de contacto del comprador, tiempo de respuesta y porcentaje de respuestas no satisfactorias pueden mejorar tu Calificación del Estado de la Cuenta. Este cambio ayuda a la Calificación del Estado de la Cuenta a recompensar un excelente servicio de atención al cliente. Comprueba ahora la calidad del servicio de atención al cliente en Administrador de valoraciones.","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_header":"Gana puntos de Calificación del Estado de la Cuenta para ofrecer un servicio de atención al cliente sólido","DYK_JP_LINE_content":"La cuenta oficial de Amazon LINE envía notificaciones sobre las notificaciones que enviamos por correo electrónico y Seller Central en las que se requieren acciones por parte de los vendedores en relación con temas como el estado de tu cuenta, el estado de tus listados y los errores de pago. Conecta tu cuenta de Seller Central con la cuenta oficial de LINE para recibir notificaciones a través de LINE y evitar perder notificaciones importantes. Más información","DYK_JP_LINE_cta_done":"Más información sobre las notificaciones de LINE","DYK_JP_LINE_header":"Puedes conectar con una cuenta de LINE para recibir mensajes personalizados que conciernen al estado de tu cuenta.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_content":"Tenemos buenas noticias. Estás a 60 días de poder registrarte en Garantía del estado de la cuenta. Mantén la Calificación del Estado de la Cuenta por encima de 250 y un número de contacto para emergencias verificado para garantizar una mayor protección de la cuenta. Te notificaremos por correo electrónico una vez que se te registre automáticamente.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_cta_done":"Más información sobre Garantía del estado de la cuenta","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_header":"Ya queda poco para que te registremos en Garantía del estado de la cuenta","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_content":"Tu Calificación del Estado de la Cuenta pasó al estado “En riesgo” o “Inadecuado”. Haz clic en “Llámame ahora” para hablar con un especialista en estado de la cuenta y proteger tus privilegios de venta.","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_cta_done":"Llámame ahora","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_header":"Tu Calificación del Estado de la Cuenta necesita atención","DYK_SSAT_CFT_DietarySupp_content":"Protege tus listados de la categoría Suplementos alimenticios con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén la validación de cumplimiento automática cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, con lo que no tendrás que enviar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_Toys_content":"Protege tus listados de la categoría Juguetes con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén la validación de cumplimiento automática cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, con lo que no tendrás que enviar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_artscrafts_content":"Protege tus listados de la categoría Arte y manualidades con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén la validación de cumplimiento automática cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, con lo que no tendrás que enviar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_buttoncellbatteryproducts_content":"Protege tus listados de la categoría Batería de botón con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén la validación de cumplimiento automática cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, con lo que no tendrás que enviar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_childrensproducts_content":"Protege tus listados de la categoría Productos infantiles con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén la validación de cumplimiento automática cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, con lo que no tendrás que enviar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_cta_done":"Regístrate hoy","DYK_SSAT_CFT_electronics_content":"Protege tus listados de la categoría Electrónicos con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén la validación de cumplimiento automática cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, con lo que no tendrás que enviar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_emobilityproducts_content":"Protege tus listados de la categoría Movilidad electrónica con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén la validación de cumplimiento automática cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, con lo que no tendrás que enviar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_firesafety_content":"Protege tus listados de la categoría Seguridad contra incendios con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén la validación de cumplimiento automática cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, con lo que no tendrás que enviar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_furniture_content":"Protege tus listados de la categoría Muebles con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén la validación de cumplimiento automática cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, con lo que no tendrás que enviar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_header":"Simplifica el cumplimiento: regístrate hoy mismo en el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo","DYK_SSAT_CFT_infantbabyproducts_content":"Protege tus listados de la categoría Productos para bebé con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén la validación de cumplimiento automática cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, con lo que no tendrás que enviar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_ppe_content":"Protege tus listados de la categoría Equipo de protección personal con el Proceso directo para el cumplimiento normativo. Obtén la validación de cumplimiento automática cuando una organización participante certifique tus productos, con lo que no tendrás que enviar la documentación de cumplimiento.","DYK_SSAT_EDU_JULY":"Conceptos clave de la Calificación del Estado de la Cuenta","DYK_SSAT_EDU_content":"Con la Calificación del Estado de la Cuenta, se supervisa el riesgo de desactivación de tu cuenta a través de un sistema de puntos. Obtienes puntos por gestionar pedidos correctamente. Pierdes puntos cuando se detectan incumplimientos de políticas y recuperas puntos cuando resuelves correctamente esas infracciones. Revisa el panel de control “Estado de la cuenta” a menudo y resuelve los incumplimientos de políticas a medida que surjan.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_content":"Nos complace anunciar Desafío al vendedor, una nueva función para los vendedores de Garantía del estado de la cuenta. Desafío al vendedor ofrece un número limitado de oportunidades para solicitar una revisión separada de los problemas de publicación a través de la página “Estado de la cuenta”. Una vez enviado el desafío, nos esforzamos por responder con una decisión en un plazo de 48 horas.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_header":"Presentamos Desafío al vendedor","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop":"¿Sabías que, siempre y cuando no se produzcan infracciones, tu puntuación no será inferior a 200, incluso si el número de pedidos es menor?","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop_header":"Consejos para una Calificación del Estado de la Cuenta correcta","ahd_dyk_bhdr_content":"Te recomendamos que entregues más del 90 % de tus envíos comerciales de Amazon Business durante el horario laboral para mantener una buena experiencia del cliente.","ahd_dyk_bhdr_cta":"Ver el desempeño","ahd_dyk_bhdr_header":"Tu porcentaje de entregas en horas de trabajo es bajo.","ahd_dyk_br_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Tu tienda en Amazon.com.br (Brasil) está en riesgo de desactivación.","ahd_dyk_cta_done":"Finalizado","ahd_dyk_cta_eukyc":"Completar la verificación","ahd_dyk_de_sup_label":"Para cumplir con la política de EPR: plástico de uso único de Alemania (en vigor desde el 1 de enero de 2025), proporciona los números de registro de EPR para cada combinación de marca y tipo de producto. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GA4JYZX23CLK8WFW\\">Más información</a>","ahd_dyk_de_sup_title":"Tus listados se vieron afectados por Responsabilidad extendida del productor (EPR): plástico de uso único para Alemania","ahd_dyk_de_sup_weee_title":"Tus listados se vieron afectados por Responsabilidad extendida del productor (EPR): WEEE de Alemania","ahd_dyk_description_eukyc":"De acuerdo con las normativas de la UE, tienes que completar un proceso de verificación de la cuenta. Ve a la página “Información de identidad” para completar la verificación. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G201200780 \\">Más información</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_label":"Para cumplir con la EPR: toma las medidas necesarias y proporciona los números de registro de EPR para cada combinación de marca y tipo de producto. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GYDCAK9ZR6VJH2X3\\">Más información</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_title":"Tus listados se vieron afectados por la Responsabilidad extendida del productor (EPR).","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_label":"Para cumplir con la política de EPR: baterías de la Unión Europea (en vigor a partir del 18 de agosto de 2025), proporciona los números de registro de EPR para las categorías de tus productos. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GPVDATLHQ6PRQNSW\\">Más información</a>","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_title":"Tus listados se vieron afectados por Responsabilidad extendida del productor (EPR): baterías de la Unión Europea","ahd_dyk_fhdds_description":"Proporciona los detalles de importación de todos tus envíos correspondientes en Envíos en espera antes de que esto interrumpa tu negocio. La falta de detalles de importación podría restringir tu capacidad para crear nuevos envíos en el Reino Unido.","ahd_dyk_fhdds_header":"A tus envíos les faltan los números de entrada de importación (IEN).","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"Hay acciones pendientes que tienes que completar si quieres comenzar a vender en la tienda de <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.com.br/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.com.br</a>.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_subtitle":"Envía los datos y completa los requisitos de verificación para vender en Brasil.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"Hay acciones pendientes que tienes que completar si quieres comenzar a vender en la tienda de <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.ca/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.ca</a>.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_subtitle":"Envía los datos y completa los requisitos de verificación para vender en Canadá.","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description":"Para cumplir el Reglamento relativo a la seguridad general de los productos, que entra en vigor el 13 de diciembre de 2024, tienes que proporcionar más información de cumplimiento normativo sobre tus productos para evitar que se vean afectados en tus listados. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">Más información</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description_post_impact":"Para cumplir con el GPSR (en vigor desde el 13 de diciembre de 2024) y evitar la desactivación de listados, toma las medidas necesarias proporcionando información adicional sobre el cumplimiento de tus productos. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">Más información</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_task":"Tienes listados afectados por el Reglamento relativo a la seguridad general de los productos (GPSR).","ahd_floating_widget_aha_ec_description":"Como miembro del programa Garantía del estado de la cuenta, <b>tienes</b> que mantener un número de contacto para emergencias válido. Verifica tus datos de contacto para emergencias para mantener la aptitud para Garantía del estado de la cuenta, para que nuestros especialistas se contacten con el fin de ayudarte a resolver problemas importantes relacionados con el estado de la cuenta antes de que esto afecte tu negocio.","ahd_floating_widget_aha_ec_description_phase2":"Verifica tu número de contacto a continuación para mantener los beneficios de Garantía del estado de la cuenta.","ahd_floating_widget_cta_button":"Ver listados","ahd_floating_widget_ec_action_panel_title":"Actualización de información de contacto para emergencias","ahd_floating_widget_ec_aha_description":"Verifica tus datos de contacto para emergencias para que nuestros especialistas se contacten con el fin de ayudarte a resolver problemas importantes relacionados con el estado de la cuenta antes de que esto afecte tu negocio.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_cta_button":"Completa la verificación","ahd_floating_widget_ec_description":"Verifica tus datos de contacto para emergencias para que nuestros especialistas se contacten con el fin de ayudarte a resolver problemas importantes relacionados con el estado de la cuenta antes de que esto afecte tu negocio.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_task":"No se verificó tu información de contacto para emergencias","ahd_floating_widget_new_tag":"NUEVO","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_food_and_safety_heading":"Tienes infracciones repetidas por problemas de seguridad de los productos y alimentos","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_ip_heading":"Infringiste repetidamente las quejas de propiedad intelectual recibidas","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_listing_heading":"Tienes infracciones repetidas a las políticas de publicación","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_many_policies_heading":"Repetiste incumplimientos de varias políticas","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_other_heading":"Tienes infracciones repetidas por otras infracciones de políticas","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_auth_heading":"Tienes infracciones repetidas por quejas de clientes sobre autenticidad de productos","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_cond_heading":"Tienes infracciones repetidas por quejas de clientes sobre el estado del producto","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_reviews_heading":"Tienes infracciones repetidas por incumplimiento de las políticas de reseñas de producto","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_reg_comp_heading":"Tienes infracciones repetidas por cumplimiento normativo","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_rp_heading":"Infringiste repetidamente la política de productos restringidos","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_sip_heading":"Tienes infracciones repetidas que se sospecha son incumplimientos de los derechos la propiedad intelectual","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_violations_body":"Los incumplimientos repetidos de las políticas de una misma política de venta pueden conllevar la desactivación de la cuenta. Resuelve estos problemas para evitar la interrupción innecesaria de tu cuenta de vendedor.","ahd_rap_begin_verification_cta":"Empezar verificación","cs_nerd_suggestion_top_issues_action_vi":"Ver problemas","dyk_ahd_pra_rv":"Tienes infracciones repetidas por incumplimientos de las políticas de reseñas de producto"},"pages.homepage":{"AHD_DD14_Base_Reserve":"Los ingresos por ventas se retienen hasta 14 días después de la fecha de entrega y se encuentran disponibles para el pago a partir del día 15 tras la fecha de entrega. Si la fecha de entrega real no está disponible, usaremos la última fecha de entrega prevista para el pedido. Esta es tu política de pago predeterminada.","AHD_POA_APPEAL_ERROR_LOADING":"Se produjo un error. Actualiza la página.","DR_VAT_AHD_NC_BANNER":"No pudimos verificar tu establecimiento comercial a efectos del IVA. Para garantizar un tratamiento fiscal preciso, verifica tu establecimiento a efectos del IVA.","DR_VAT_AHD_PRIORITY_ACTION":"Es obligatoria una verificación del establecimiento a efectos del IVA","Engage_Appeal_05":"Código de conducta del vendedor (que influye favorablemente a los clientes para que manipulen tus calificaciones de ventas, valoraciones o reseñas)","LocalizedPageTitleDashboard":"Panel de control de desempeño","LocalizedPageTitleDetailCustomerSatisfaction":"Página de detalles de satisfacción del cliente.","LocalizedPageTitleDetailProductPolicies":"Página de detalles de la política de productos.","NO_METRICS":"En este momento, no hay pedidos contabilizados para esta estadística.\\n","acf_banner_inform_act":"Para cumplir con la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">Ley INFORM</a>, Amazon tiene que recopilar y verificar información sobre tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon. Actualmente tienes una o más acciones de verificación pendientes. Revisa la lista que aparece a continuación y ve a <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Información de la cuenta de vendedor</a> para iniciar la verificación.","acf_inform_act_wait_text":"Gracias por verificar la identidad. Vuelve en 24 horas para confirmar si necesitamos más información. ","acf_inform_act_widget_description":"Después de verificar la identidad, es posible que se te solicite que verifiques uno o más de los elementos adicionales que aparecen a continuación.","addTab_label":"Pestaña Agregar","aef_address_your_violation":"Resuelve la infracción","ahd_Inform_deposit_method":"Información del método de depósito","ahd_account_health_notification":"Notificación del estado de la cuenta","ahd_account_impacted_details":"Tu cuenta puede verse afectada como se detalla a continuación:","ahd_action_due":"Vencimiento","ahd_action_panel_hd":"Los pagos de tus cuentas de vendedor de Amazon se pusieron en espera.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"<b>Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación.</b><br><br>Para cumplir con la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">Ley INFORM</a>, Amazon tiene que recopilar y verificar información sobre tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon. Actualmente tienes una o más acciones de verificación pendientes. Revisa la lista que aparece a continuación y ve a <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Información de la cuenta de vendedor</a> para iniciar la verificación.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_aha":"<b> Ten en cuenta que si no completaste todos los elementos de verificación cuando entra en vigor la Ley INFORM, es posible que tu cuenta se desactive, independientemente de tu registro en la Garantía del estado de la cuenta.</b>","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_thankyou":"<b>Ley INFORM de EE. UU.</b><br><br>Completamos correctamente todas las verificaciones abiertas. Agradecemos tu asistencia durante el proceso de verificación.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_v2":"<b>Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación.</b><br><br>Para cumplir con la <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>Ley INFORM de EE. UU.</a>, que entrará en vigor el 27 de junio de 2023, Amazon tiene que recopilar y verificar información sobre tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon. Actualmente tienes una o más acciones de verificación pendientes. Consulta la página <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Información de la cuenta</a> para iniciar la verificación.","ahd_adhoc_banner_school_supplies":"Detectamos que tienes listados en riesgo de retiro debido al incumplimiento de las normativas locales, estatales y federales sobre la venta de productos escolares para niños. Para más información sobre estos requisitos de cumplimiento, haz clic <a href=/gp/help/external/help.html?itemID=XT3EFQS54LRKYM3&language=en_US&ref=ahd_uspc_adhoc_banner>aquí</a>. Para evitar el retiro del listado, consulta los listados sujetos a este requisito de conformidad <a href=/performance/account/health/product-policies?t=safe>aquí</a> y sigue las instrucciones que se indican en “Próximos pasos” junto a los listados en riesgo de a fin de garantizar el cumplimiento de estos requisitos.","ahd_adhoc_mobile_inform_act_aha":"Nota: Si no completas todos los pasos de verificación en el plazo especificado, es posible que tu cuenta se desactive, independientemente de tu registro en la Garantía del estado de la cuenta.","ahd_aef_IPI_priority_action":"Verificación virtual de identidad","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_contact_us":"Si tienes alguna pregunta, contáctanos a través de seller-reactivation-appeals@amazon.com.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_instruction":"Tienes que enviar los documentos y hacer una videollamada para verificar tu identidad.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_join_call_link":"Ve al <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">Portal de verificación de identidad</a> para unirte a la videollamada programada.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_next_steps":"Ve al <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">Portal de verificación de identidad</a> para enviar los documentos obligatorios y unirte a una videollamada para la verificación virtual de identidad. También tienes la opción de programar una videollamada en una fecha y hora futuras después de enviar los documentos obligatorios.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason":"Tras una revisión de tu empresa, se identificó que tu cuenta pudo haberse usado para actividades engañosas, fraudulentas o ilegales. De acuerdo con la Sección 3 del <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Acuerdo de Amazon Services Business Solutions</a>, lo cual puede provocar su desactivación. Para proteger a nuestros clientes y colaboradores comerciales, tenemos que verificar la identidad de nuestros vendedores mediante un proceso de verificación virtual de identidad que se hace con una videollamada. ","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason_eu":"Tras una revisión de tu empresa, se identificó que tu cuenta pudo haberse usado para actividades engañosas, fraudulentas o ilegales. De acuerdo con la Sección 3 del <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G201190440\\">Acuerdo de Amazon Services Business Solutions</a>, esto puede provocar su desactivación. Para proteger a nuestros clientes y colaboradores comerciales, tenemos que verificar la identidad de nuestros vendedores mediante un proceso de verificación virtual de identidad que se hace con una videollamada.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_review_fail":"Tras una revisión de tu empresa y de la información que proporcionaste durante la verificación virtual de identidad, se identificó que tu cuenta pudo haberse usado para actividades engañosas, fraudulentas o ilegales, lo que constituye una infracción a la Sección 3 del <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Acuerdo de Amazon Services Business Solutions</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_under_review":"Estamos revisando la información que proporcionaste para la verificación de identidad. Este proceso puede tardar hasta 5 días hábiles.","ahd_aef_action_panel_RA_reason":"Nuestra revisión indica que tienes una cuenta aparte que se desactivó por infringir una de nuestras políticas. Por tanto, la cuenta de vendedor actual infringe la política de tener varias cuentas de vendedor en Amazon, descrita en el <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G1801\\">Código de conducta del vendedor</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_post_deactivation_appeal":"Si crees que tu cuenta se desactivó por error, puedes enviar nueva información haciendo clic en “Apelar” a continuación.","ahd_aef_action_panel_scheduled_status_plural":"Programaste una videollamada para la verificación virtual de identidad el ${date}, en ${numberofdays} días.","ahd_aef_action_panel_scheduled_status_singular":"Programaste una videollamada para la verificación virtual de identidad el ${date}, en ${numberofday} día.","ahd_aef_action_panel_verify_button":"Verificar","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_food_and_prod_subreason":"Problemas de seguridad de productos y alimentos","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_listing_subreason":"Incumplimiento de políticas de listados","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_other_subreason":"Informar de otras infracciones de la política","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_auth_subreason":"Quejas de autenticidad de productos de clientes","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_cond_subreason":"Quejas de clientes sobre el estado del producto","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_review_subreason":"Incumplimientos de las políticas de reseñas de productos","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reason":"Incumplimientos repetidos","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rip_subreason":"Quejas de propiedad intelectual recibidas","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rp_subreason":"Política de productos restringidos","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_sip_subreason":"Supuestas infracciones de derechos de propiedad intelectual","ahd_aef_at_risk_HD_card_body":"Para reactivar los pagos, revisa las acciones prioritarias y resuelve las que están pendientes.","ahd_aef_at_risk_HD_card_title":"Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación y los pagos de tu cuenta de vendedor de Amazon están retenidos.","ahd_aef_at_risk_card_sc_body":"Tienes una o más acciones pendientes que provocarán la desactivación de la cuenta.","ahd_aef_critical_message":"Si este problema crítico se deja sin resolver, la cuenta se desactivará.","ahd_aef_critical_message_no_caps":"Si este problema crítico se deja sin resolver, la cuenta se desactivará.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_body":"Resuelve los problemas de Estado de la cuenta para reactivarla. Una vez que se resuelvan, la cuenta se reactivará en un plazo de 24 horas.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_sc_body":"Resuelve los problemas de Estado de la cuenta para reactivarla.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_title":"Tu cuenta se desactivó","ahd_aef_denver_eu":"Verificar el domicilio fiscal en la UE a efectos del Impuesto al Valor Agregado (IVA)","ahd_aef_denver_uk":"Verificar el domicilio fiscal en el Reino Unido a efectos del Impuesto al Valor Agregado (IVA)","ahd_aef_educational_card_action":"Resolver problemas","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_post_deactivation":"Haz clic en “Apelar” a continuación y sigue las instrucciones para reactivar esta cuenta de vendedor.","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_pre_deactivation":"Haz clic en “Apelar” a continuación y sigue las instrucciones para evitar la desactivación de esta cuenta de vendedor.","ahd_aef_next_steps_header":"Resuelve la infracción","ahd_aef_pending_critical":"Problema crítico pendiente","ahd_aef_pending_critical_message":"Si no se resuelve, este problema será crítico y provocará la desactivación de la cuenta.","ahd_aef_pending_critical_message_no_cap":"Si no se resuelve, este problema será crítico y provocará la desactivación de la cuenta.","ahd_aef_pending_deactivation_HD_card_title":"Tu cuenta está pendiente de desactivación y los pagos de tu cuenta de vendedor de Amazon están retenidos.","ahd_aef_priority_action_scheduled_status_plural":"Videollamada programada para el ${date}, en ${numberofdays} días","ahd_aef_priority_action_scheduled_status_singular":"Videollamada programada para el ${date}, en ${numberofday} día","ahd_aef_submit_header":"Enviar información","ahd_ahr_pending_critical":"Pendiente de importancia","ahd_ahr_section_sub_section":"Esta calificación refleja tu cumplimiento de las políticas de ventas de Amazon. <a href=/help/hub/reference/G200205250?ref=ahd-ahr-lm target=‘_blank’>Más información</a>.","ahd_ahr_section_title":"Calificación del estado de la cuenta","ahd_all_issues":"Todos los problemas","ahd_back_button":"Atrás","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_body":"Se considerará la reactivación de la cuenta cuando se apelen correctamente los incumplimientos. ","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_header":"Tu cuenta se desactivó. ","ahd_banner_block_mfn_at_risk_subtitle":"Se desactivaron tus ofertas gestionadas por el vendedor y tu cuenta está en riesgo de ser desactivadas. Completa tus acciones prioritarias para reactivar las ofertas gestionadas por el vendedor y evitar la desactivación.","ahd_banner_block_mfn_subtitle":"Se desactivaron tus ofertas gestionadas por el vendedor. Completa tus acciones de prioridad para reactivar las ofertas gestionadas por el vendedor.","ahd_banner_eg_trn":"<b>Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación. </b><br><br>Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación porque tu cuenta de Seller Central no incluye tu número de identificación fiscal válido. Consulta la página </a> Configuración de impuestos<a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations> y actualiza tu información fiscal en un plazo de 90 días a partir de la fecha del primer listado de productos en Amazon para evitar la desactivación de la cuenta. Para más información, consulta la página de ayuda “Preguntas frecuentes sobre impuestos” <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC>. </a>","ahd_banner_resolve_issues_button":"Resolver problemas","ahd_be_jsl_at_risk_banner":"<b> Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación. </b><br><br>No proporcionaste tu número de identificación de IVA belga (VRN) ni la confirmación del estado de la Ventanilla Única del IVA (OSS) para tu país de origen en la cuenta de Seller Central de Amazon. Para más información sobre este requisito y proporcionar información, consulta la <a href=/help/hub/reference/external/GGTX8THLMMDJ3WBP> nueva legislación belga</a>.","ahd_be_jsl_priority_action":"Legislación sobre IVA de Bélgica","ahd_brkyc_priority_action":"Verificación de identidad de Brasil","ahd_brkyc_rap_action":"Tienes que enviar la información de verificación de identidad antes de la fecha de vencimiento.","ahd_brkyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Comprueba el estado de verificación en la página <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional\\n?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Información de identidad</a>.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_action":"Envía la información de verificación de identidad para reactivar tu cuenta.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"De acuerdo con la legislación de Brasil, es obligatorio que se verifique tu identidad para que puedas usar nuestro servicio. Además, tienes que proporcionarnos ciertos datos o documentos con el fin de agilizar estas comprobaciones. Es posible que te proporcionemos información adicional sobre la solicitud mediante las notificaciones de desempeño.\\r\\n<br><br>Se desactivó tu cuenta porque no pudimos validar tu información de identidad.<br><br> \\r\\nPara más información, ve a la página de ayuda <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Información necesaria para vender en Amazon</a>.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_message":"Se desactivó tu cuenta porque no pudimos validar tu información de identidad.","ahd_brkyc_rap_identity_info":"Consulta la página <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Información de identidad</a> para completar la verificación.","ahd_brkyc_rap_intro":"De acuerdo con la legislación de Brasil, es obligatorio que se verifique tu identidad para que puedas usar nuestro servicio. Tienes que proporcionarnos ciertos datos o documentos con el fin de agilizar estas comprobaciones. Es posible que te proporcionemos información adicional sobre la solicitud mediante las notificaciones de desempeño.\\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nPara más información, ve a la página de ayuda <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Información necesaria para vender en Amazon</a>.","ahd_brkyc_rap_verifying":"Estamos validando la información y es posible que tengamos que solicitarte algunos detalles durante esta revisión. Consulta las secciones de <a href=\'/performance/notifications\\r\\n?ref_=to_brkyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Notificaciones de desempeño</a> y responde a todas las solicitudes relacionadas con tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon. Esta validación puede tardar hasta 24 horas y, en algunos casos, podría demorar hasta 10 días hábiles. Durante este tiempo, no se puede modificar la información de identidad.","ahd_cakyc_priority_action":"Verificación de identidad de Canadá","ahd_cakyc_rap_action":"Proporciona la información para la verificación de la identidad antes de la fecha de vencimiento indicada para evitar la desactivación de la cuenta. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_action_hd":"Proporciona la información para la verificación de la identidad antes de la fecha de vencimiento indicada a fin de evitar la desactivación de la cuenta. Si no inicias la verificación y te quedan 15 días o menos, tu capacidad para pagar fondos desde tu cuenta de vendedor de Amazon.ca quedará restringida. La verificación es obligatoria, en virtud de la legislación canadiense.","ahd_cakyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"Se desactivó tu cuenta porque no pudimos validar tu información de identidad.  Las leyes canadienses requieren que verifiquemos tu identidad para que podamos permitirte usar nuestro servicio. Para reactivar tu cuenta, envía la información necesaria para verificar tu identidad. \\r\\n<br><br>Para más información, ve a <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Información necesaria para vender en Amazon</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_intro":"La legislación canadiense requiere que verifiquemos tu identidad para que puedas usar nuestro servicio. Es necesario que nos proporciones cierta información y documentos para que podamos hacer estas comprobaciones de verificación. <br><br>Para más información, ve a <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Información necesaria para vender en Amazon</a> o <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Notificaciones de desempeño</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_self_trigger_cta":"Al hacer clic en “Iniciar verificación”, comenzará la verificación en la tienda de Canadá. Consulta la página <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Información de identidad</a> para confirmar los siguientes pasos. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_verifying":"Estamos validando tu información. En algunos casos, esta validación puede tardar entre 24 horas y 10 días hábiles. Es posible que necesitemos solicitarte más datos durante esta revisión. Consulta la sección <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Notificaciones de desempeño</a> y responde a todas las solicitudes adicionales relacionadas con tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon.  \\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nDurante este tiempo, no se puede modificar la información de identidad.","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_header3":"¿Qué ocurre si no proporciono la información obligatoria? ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph":"El uso de una cuenta de Vender en Amazon exige por ley la verificación de tu identidad. De acuerdo con la legislación de Canadá, es obligatorio que se verifique tu identidad para que puedas usar nuestro servicio. Es posible que tengas que proporcionarnos determinada información y documentación con el fin de agilizar las comprobaciones.<br><br>Para más información, ve a <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Información necesaria para vender en Amazon</a>.","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph2":"Amazon permite hasta 60 días para que completes la nueva verificación. No incluye el tiempo que tomamos para completar la revisión. Podrían restringirse tus permisos para vender y desembolsar fondos si la nueva verificación no se completa en un plazo de 60 días. Cuando necesitemos información, aparecerá una notificación en la página “Información de cuenta”. Es posible que te proporcionemos información adicional acerca de la solicitud mediante las notificaciones de desempeño. ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph3":"Llegará un momento en que no puedas usar tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon. Por lo tanto, no podrás vender en Amazon.ca si no proporcionas la información. ","ahd_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_subtitle":"Tienes una o más acciones pendientes que son obligatorias para poder empezar a vender. ","ahd_compliance_status":"Estado de cumplimiento","ahd_compliance_widget_button":"Enviar información sobre cumplimiento","ahd_compliance_widget_ckp_redirect":"Referencia de cumplimiento de lanzamiento","ahd_compliance_widget_description":"Envía información sobre cumplimiento para demostrar el cumplimiento normativo.","ahd_critical_account_health_notification":"Notificación de estado crítico de la cuenta","ahd_critical_policy_violations":"Incumplimientos graves de políticas","ahd_dac7_at_risk_banner":"<b>Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación.</b><br><br> Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación debido a que falta información fiscal requerida por la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB\\">legislación DAC7</a>. Consulta el <a href= \\"/complianceportal\\">Portal de cumplimiento de DAC7</a> para iniciar la verificación. ","ahd_dac7_compliant":"Ya cumples con los requisitos de la DAC7.","ahd_dac7_priority_action":"Información obligatoria de DAC7","ahd_dac7_priority_action_pending":"Verificación pendiente","ahd_dac7_rap_action":"Ahora tienes que enviar tu información de DAC7 antes de la fecha de vencimiento.","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_launch_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Abre el portal de DAC7 para enviar tu información</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal_status":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_status_blurb\'  target=\'_blank\'>Comprueba el estado de verificación en el portal de DAC7</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_deactivated_message":"Tu cuenta se desactivó porque no cumple con la 7.ª enmienda de la Directiva relativa a la cooperación administrativa (DAC7)","ahd_dac7_rap_intro":"La <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/external/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB?ref_=to_dac_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>7.ª enmienda de la Directiva relativa a la cooperación administrativa (DAC7)</a> es un reglamento de la UE que exige a Amazon recopilar, verificar y notificar la diligencia debida, así como los datos financieros e impositivos o relativos al IVA, de los vendedores residentes en la UE, independientemente de la tienda de Amazon en la que vendan.","ahd_dac7_rap_verifying":"Estamos revisando tu información de la DAC7. Por lo general, el proceso de revisión tarda 72 horas, pero puede tardar más en algunos casos. Comprueba el estado de verificación regularmente en el portal de la DAC7 a continuación para saber si necesitamos más información.","ahd_days":"Días","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"Tienes acciones pendientes que se tienen que completar si quieres comenzar a vender en la tienda de Amazon.com.br.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_subtitle":"Envía los datos y completa los requisitos de verificación para vender en Brasil.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"Tienes acciones pendientes que se tienen que completar si quieres comenzar a vender en la tienda de Amazon.ca.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_subtitle":"Envía los datos y completa los requisitos de verificación para vender en Canadá.","ahd_educational_banner_header":"Completa tus acciones prioritarias","ahd_educational_banner_subheader":"Tienes una o más acciones pendientes que, si no se completan en la fecha indicada, derivarán en la desactivación de la cuenta.","ahd_eg_trn_deactivation_banner":"<b>Tu cuenta se desactivó.</b><br><br> Para reactivar tu cuenta, consulta la página <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations>Configuración de impuestos</a> a fin de actualizar tu información fiscal. Para más información, consulta la <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC>página de ayuda</a> “Preguntas frecuentes sobre impuestos”. ","ahd_error_loading_submit":"Se produjo un error. Vuelve a intentar el envío.","ahd_eukyc_priority_action":"Verificación de identidad","ahd_fhdds_priority_action":"IEN necesario para envíos recibidos en el Reino Unido","ahd_funds_potential_withheld":"Los fondos podrían retenerse","ahd_inform_ac_checkbox_error":"Activa la casilla de verificación para establecer que revisaste la información y certificar que es correcta y actual.","ahd_inform_ac_edu_display_name":"Revisar la información de tu cuenta","ahd_inform_ac_educational_subheader":"Tienes una o más acciones pendientes que podrían dar lugar a la desactivación de tu cuenta en el futuro.","ahd_inform_ac_no_poc":"No se proporcionó información de identidad. Si enviaste previamente un registro o documento fiscal emitido por el gobierno en lugar de esta información, certificas que no hubo cambios en esa solicitud.","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p1":"De acuerdo con la Ley INFORM de EE. UU., tienes que mantener cierta información empresarial (que se muestra a continuación) actualizada y certificar electrónicamente ante Amazon que actualizaste tu información o que la información que ya proporcionaste está actualizada. Certifica que la siguiente información está actualizada en un plazo de 10 días después de ver este aviso, o tu cuenta correrá riesgo de que se la desactive. ","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p2":"Ahora tienes que certificar que la siguiente información está actualizada en un plazo de 10 días a partir de la primera vez que veas este aviso. De lo contrario, corres el riesgo de desactivación.","ahd_inform_ac_page1_checkbox":"Activa la casilla de verificación para confirmar que entiendes que una vez que vayas a la página de aviso y certificación de la Ley INFORM, recibirás un aviso y tendrás 10 días para actualizar y certificar tu información.","ahd_inform_ac_page1_step1_intructions":"Ve a la página <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Información de cuenta</a> o haz clic en “Modificar” para cambiar cualquier dato que sea incorrecto a continuación. ","ahd_inform_ac_page2_certify_instructions":"Si la siguiente información está actualizada, puedes certificar ahora. Si hay alguna información incorrecta, ve a la página <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Información de cuenta</a> para editar la información antes de hacer clic en “Certificar”.","ahd_inform_ac_refresh_update_info":"Si actualizaste cualquier información a continuación, haz clic aquí para actualizar la página y ver la nueva información.","ahd_inform_account_information_update_verification":"La información de tu cuenta se modificó y la estamos verificando. Vuelve en 24 horas para determinar si es necesario llevar a cabo algún paso adicional para iniciar el proceso de certificación anual.","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_confirmation":"Al hacer clic en “Certificar”, afirmo que leí el aviso anterior y que la información que proporcioné a Amazon es verdadera y correcta, corresponde a mi negocio y no está tergiversada de ninguna manera.","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_your_info_button":"Certifica tu información","ahd_inform_act_ac_edit_information":"Editar información","ahd_inform_act_ac_not_required":"La Ley INFORM aún no se aplica a tu empresa, por lo que actualmente no tienes obligación de certificar tu información. Te notificaremos en el futuro si tienes que certificarla.","ahd_inform_act_ac_short_description":"Revisa y completa tus requisitos pendientes de la Ley INFORM.","ahd_inform_act_ac_step1_title":"Revisar y actualizar la información","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou":"Gracias por certificar que la información de tu empresa está actualizada. La página “Estado de la cuenta” se actualizará en unos minutos para confirmar que cumpliste el requisito de Aviso y certificación de la Ley INFORM que tenías pendiente.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou_banner":"Gracias por certificar que la información de tu empresa está actualizada. La página “Estado de la cuenta” se actualizará en unos minutos para confirmar que cumpliste el requisito de Aviso y certificación de la Ley INFORM que tenías pendiente.\\n<br><br>Recuerda que tienes que mantener actualizada la información de tu empresa y certificar, al menos, una vez al año, que tu nombre, dirección, número de teléfono, dirección de correo electrónico, datos bancarios y número de identificación fiscal son correctos.","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions":"Ten en cuenta que sólo el usuario principal o el usuario secundario con permisos autorizados para confirmar o modificar la información de la cuenta podrá certificar la información.","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions_error":"Esta información tiene que estar certificada por el usuario principal de la cuenta o un usuario secundario autorizado con permisos para confirmar o modificar la información de la cuenta.","ahd_inform_act_account_information":"Información de cuenta","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_deactivation_banner":"Para cumplir con la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">Ley INFORM</a>, Amazon tiene que recopilar y verificar información sobre tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon. Tu cuenta se desactivó debido a que no recibimos la información solicitada. Para reactivar tu cuenta, revisa la lista que aparece a continuación y ve a la <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Información de la cuenta de vendedor</a> a fin de completar la verificación. <br><br>Una vez que completes las verificaciones de todos los requisitos pendientes, tu cuenta se reactivará en un plazo de 48 horas. ","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_hold_banner":"<b>Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación y los pagos de tu cuenta de vendedor de Amazon se pusieron en espera.</b><br><br>Para cumplir con la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">Ley INFORM</a>, Amazon tiene que recopilar y verificar información sobre tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon. Debido a que no recibimos la información solicitada en el plazo especificado en nuestras comunicaciones, tus pagos se pusieron en espera. Para reactivar tus pagos, revisa la lista que aparece a continuación y ve a <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Información de la cuenta de vendedor</a> a fin de iniciar o completar el envío de la información.","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_ending":"Cuenta bancaria que termina en","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"Datos bancarios","ahd_inform_act_debit_card_ending":"Tarjeta de débito que termina en","ahd_inform_act_dismiss":"Descartar","ahd_inform_act_dismiss_button":"Descartar","ahd_inform_act_hold_wait_text":"Para reactivar tus pagos y evitar la desactivación de tu cuenta, haz clic en las acciones que aparecen a continuación para ir a la <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Información de la cuenta de vendedor</a> y completar los requisitos pendientes. <br><br>Gracias por completar la verificación de identidad. Vuelve en 24 horas para saber si es necesario llevar a cabo algún otro paso de verificación.","ahd_inform_act_hold_widget_description":"Para reactivar tus pagos y evitar la desactivación de tu cuenta, haz clic en las acciones que aparecen a continuación para ir a la <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Información de la cuenta de vendedor</a> y completar los requisitos pendientes. <br><br>Después de completar la verificación de identidad, es posible que se te solicite que verifiques uno o más de los elementos adicionales que aparecen a continuación.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_wait_text":"Haz clic en las acciones que aparecen a continuación para completar los requisitos pendientes. Gracias por completar la verificación de identidad. Revisa en 24 horas para saber si es necesario completar algún otro paso de verificación.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_widget_description":"Haz clic en las acciones que aparecen a continuación para completar los requisitos pendientes. Después de completar la verificación de identidad, es posible que se te solicite que verifiques uno o más de los elementos adicionales que aparecen a continuación.","ahd_inform_act_short_description":"Revisa y completa tus requisitos pendientes de la Ley de Integridad, Notificación y Equidad en los Mercados Minoristas en Línea para los Consumidores.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete":"<b>Ley INFORM de EE. UU.</b><br><br>Completamos correctamente todas las verificaciones abiertas. Agradecemos tu asistencia durante el proceso de verificación.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete_short":"<b>Ley INFORM de EE. UU.</b><br><br>Completamos correctamente todas las verificaciones abiertas. Agradecemos tu asistencia durante el proceso de verificación.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete_widget":"Completamos correctamente todas las verificaciones abiertas. Agradecemos tu asistencia durante el proceso de verificación.","ahd_inform_act_wait_text":"Gracias por verificar la identidad. Vuelve en 24 horas para confirmar si necesitamos más información. <br><br> Haz clic en las acciones que aparecen a continuación para ir a la página <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Información de la cuenta de vendedor</a> y completa los requisitos pendientes.","ahd_inform_act_widget_business_address_field":"Dirección de la empresa","ahd_inform_act_widget_description":"Haz clic en las acciones que aparecen a continuación para ir a la página <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Información de la cuenta de vendedor</a> y completa los requisitos pendientes. <br><br> Después de verificar la identidad, es posible que se te solicite que verifiques uno o más de los elementos adicionales que aparecen a continuación.","ahd_inform_act_widget_title":"Ley de Integridad, Notificación y Equidad en los Mercados Minoristas en Línea para los Consumidores","ahd_inform_act_widget_unverified_status":"no verificado","ahd_inform_annual_cerification_risk_banner":"Debes mantener actualizada la información de tu empresa y certificar","ahd_inform_annual_review_banner":"<b>Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación. </b><br><br>Para cumplir con la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7?ref_=ahd_annual_ inform_consumer_act\\">Ley INFORM</a>, la información de tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon tiene que certificarse de forma anual. Consulta la página <a href=\\"/mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render?ref_=ahd_annual_inform_certification\\">Certificación anual</a> para certificar que tu información está actualizada.","ahd_inform_annual_review_complete":"<b>Ley INFORM Consumers</b><br><br> Gracias por cumplir con todos los requisitos pendientes.","ahd_inform_annual_review_seller_enforced":"Para cumplir con la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">Ley INFORM Consumers</a>, tienes que certificar la veracidad de la información de tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon al menos cada año. Tu cuenta se desactivó debido a que no recibimos el certificado solicitado. Para reactivar tu cuenta, consulta la página <a href=\\" /mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render\\">Certificación anual</a> a fin de certificar que tu información está actualizada. <br><br> Una vez que completes la comprobación, tu cuenta se reactivará en un plazo de 48 horas.","ahd_inform_annual_review_thank_you_dismiss_button":"Descartar","ahd_inform_bav_not_verified":"No tienes una cuenta bancaria verificada o no la asignaste como tu método de depósito predeterminado al sitio web de Estados Unidos de América. Verifica y asigna tu cuenta bancaria como predeterminada en la página <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Método de depósito</a>.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p1":"Recuerda que tienes que mantener actualizada la información de tu empresa y certificar, al menos, una vez al año, que tu nombre, dirección, número de teléfono, dirección de correo electrónico, datos bancarios y número de identificación fiscal son correctos.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p2":"Si alguno de tus datos cambia, Amazon también tendrá que verificar esta nueva información. Responde rápidamente a cualquier solicitud de información para que podamos trabajar contigo para completar estos pasos de verificación adicionales y evitar la desactivación de la cuenta. Para más información sobre el proceso de verificación, ve a la <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>página de ayuda de la Ley INFORM</a>.","ahd_inform_consumers_act_annual":"Certificación anual de la Ley INFORM ","ahd_inform_debit_card":"Tienes que verificar tu cuenta bancaria secundaria activa para seguir recibiendo pagos del sitio web de Estados Unidos de América. Verifica tu cuenta bancaria en la página <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Método de depósito</a>.","ahd_inform_loading_error":"Ve a la página <a href=/hz/sc/account-information target=\\"_blank\\">Información de cuenta</a> para revisar los datos actuales.","ahd_inform_no_default_deposit":"No tienes una cuenta bancaria verificada o no la asignaste como tu método de depósito predeterminado al sitio web de Estados Unidos de América. Verifica y asigna tu cuenta bancaria como predeterminada en la página <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Método de depósito</a>.","ahd_inform_page1_checkbox":"Entiendo que una vez que procedo al aviso y certificación de la Ley INFORM, tengo que completar la certificación en un plazo de 10 días para evitar el riesgo de desactivación de la cuenta. ","ahd_inform_page1_instructions":"Revisa y certifica tu información en dos sencillos pasos:","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2a":"Comenzaremos a enviar a los vendedores una notificación formal para revisar y certificar que la información de su empresa sea correcta.","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2b":"Sin embargo, no tienes que esperar a recibir la notificación formal y puedes tomar medidas ahora para evitar el riesgo de desactivación de la cuenta más tarde.","ahd_inform_page1_proceed_title":"Proceder al aviso y certificación de la Ley INFORM (Ley de Integridad, Notificación y Equidad en los Mercados Minoristas en Línea para los Consumidores)","ahd_inform_page1_step2_description":"Si tu información está actualizada, o si la acabas de actualizar, procede al paso siguiente (aviso y certificación) para recibir tu aviso formal y completar la certificación. Una vez que veas este aviso, la ley exige que certifiques tu información en un plazo de 10 días.","ahd_inform_page_1_p1":"Nos comprometemos a ofrecer una experiencia de compra confiable tanto para ti como para los clientes. Para cumplir este estándar, recolectaremos y verificaremos cierta información comercial que nos proporciones al menos una vez al año, lo que incluye la información requerida por la Ley INFORM Consumers de EE. UU.","ahd_inform_sw_bav":"Tienes que verificar tus cuentas bancarias activas. Verifica tus cuentas bancarias aquí en la página <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Método de depósito</a>.","ahd_inform_tax_q_redirect":"Ve a la página <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/1099KTaxInformation/step/1099KTaxInformation?immediateRedirect=true&intent=INFORM_ACT target=\\"_blank\\">Cuestionario fiscal de INFORM</a> para revisar los datos actuales.","ahd_inform_update_account_information_educational":"Consulta la página <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Certificación anual</a> para asegurarte de que la información de tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon está actualizada.","ahd_itr_extension_extension_request_link":"envía la documentación obligatoria.","ahd_itr_extension_request":"Si quieres solicitar una extensión o una exención de estos requisitos, ${appealUrl}.","ahd_itr_priority_action":"Se requiere el número de identificación fiscal italiano para los vendedores con sede en Italia.","ahd_itr_rap_appeals":"Actualicé mi información fiscal de códigos italianos en “Configuración de impuestos” y quiero solicitar una revalidación.","ahd_itr_rap_at_risk_deactivation":"Tu cuenta corre riesgo de desactivación.","ahd_itr_rap_deactivated_message":"Tu cuenta se desactivó.","ahd_itr_rap_dispute":"No estoy de acuerdo con la decisión de Amazon sobre la validación de mi código fiscal italiano.","ahd_itr_rap_intro":"La <a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>ley italiana n.º 157/2019</a> exige que los vendedores con sede en Italia que hagan una o más transacciones en Amazon.it agreguen su configuración de impuestos.","ahd_itr_remediation_corp":"Envía tu código fiscal italiano en “Configuración de impuestos” <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. Según nuestra información (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), tu cuenta está registrada como empresa y, por lo tanto, necesitamos tu número de registro comercial (conocido como “codice fiscale”, correspondiente al número de registro de IVA sin el código de país “IT”). Consulta las páginas de ayuda (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>ley italiana n.º 157/2019</a>) para ver los pasos de envío. Asegúrate de que tu razón social de la página “Información de la empresa” (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) y el número de registro comercial de “Configuración de impuestos” <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> coincidan con la base de datos de la autoridad tributaria italiana.","ahd_itr_remediation_individual":"Envía tu código fiscal italiano en “Configuración de impuestos” <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. Según nuestra información (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), tu cuenta está registrada como persona física y, por lo tanto, necesitamos tu ID (conocido como “codice fiscale”). Consulta las páginas de ayuda (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>ley italiana n.º 157/2019</a>) para ver los pasos de envío. Asegúrate de que tu razón social de la página “Información de la empresa” (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) y el número de identificación social de “Configuración de impuestos” <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> coincidan con la base de datos de la autoridad tributaria italiana.","ahd_itr_remediation_unkown":"Envía la información de la página “Información de la empresa” (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render). Las empresas deben proporcionar su número de registro comercial (conocido como “codice fiscale”, correspondiente al número de registro de IVA sin el código de país “IT”), mientras que los vendedores individuales, incluidos los propietarios individuales (“P. IVA individuale”) deben cargar su ID personal (también conocido como “codice fiscale”) en “Configuración de impuestos”<https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. Asegúrate de que tu razón social que figura en la página “Información de la empresa” <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render> y el código fiscal que aparece en “Configuración de impuestos”<https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> coincidan con la base de datos de la autoridad italiana.","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_details_fallback_text":"¿Tienes preguntas sobre cómo mantener una cuenta en buen estado? Obtén asesoramiento personalizado del Asistente de vendedor.","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_title":"Pregunta al Asistente de vendedores","ahd_mvblsivna_priority_action":"Completar la verificación","ahd_new_feature":"NUEVO","ahd_new_feature_announcement_body_new_filters":"Ahora puedes filtrar los incumplimientos de políticas según las acciones adoptadas sobre los listados afectados. Ve a la página “Cumplimiento de la política de productos” y haz clic en “Agregar filtros” para filtrar las infracciones.","ahd_new_feature_announcement_header":"Anuncio sobre nueva funcionalidad","ahd_new_feature_announcement_title_new_filters":"Se agregaron filtros nuevos","ahd_other_policy_violation_title":"Informar de otras infracciones de la política","ahd_payment_policy_hd_priority_action":"Tus fondos están retenidos debido a acciones pendientes en tu cuenta. Revisa las <b>acciones de prioritarias</b> para reactivar los pagos.","ahd_post_enforcement_non_deactivation_subheader":"Tienes una o más acciones pendientes que están afectando al estado de la cuenta.","ahd_pr_form_address_header":"Resuelve las penalizaciones por productos que no cumplen los requisitos para seguir vendiendo tus productos.","ahd_pr_form_address_sub_header":"Según las directrices del Departamento de Justicia de EE. UU., Amazon simplifica tus obligaciones de cumplimiento normativo mediante la declaración y pago en tu nombre de los pedidos en Amazon y recuperación de estos importes de tu cuenta.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_info":"De acuerdo con el Decreto de consentimiento EPA/DOJ, estamos obligados a penalizar a los vendedores por cualquier incumplimiento de las políticas relacionadas con la EPA. Más información sobre los <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account/health/product-policies\\">productos que no cumplen con los requisitos</a>, el cálculo de las penalizaciones asociadas, reservas aplicadas a tu cuenta y comunicaciones enviadas para enviar apelaciones. A continuación, se te cobrará cualquier penalización pendiente.<br/><br/>Antes de que te cobremos las penalizaciones, retendremos tu cuenta mientras te damos la oportunidad de corregir el listado.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_title":"¿Cómo funciona?","ahd_pr_form_impact_header":"Las posibles repercusiones en la cuenta se detallan a continuación:","ahd_pr_form_impact_p1":"Responsabilidad del pago de penalizaciones (consulta los detalles de la infracción a continuación)","ahd_pr_form_impact_p2":"El listado permanecerá suprimido de acuerdo con las directrices de la Agencia de Protección Ambiental o Departamento de Justicia de EE. UU.","ahd_pr_form_impact_p3":"El impacto negativo en el estado de la cuenta puede conllevar la desactivación de tu cuenta de vendedor","ahd_pr_form_note":"Ten en cuenta que antes de cobrarte las penalizaciones, retendremos tu cuenta durante 30 días y te daremos la oportunidad de corregir el listado.","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_body":"Este producto se identificó como un producto pesticida, dispositivo plaguicida o producto que se afirma que contiene pesticidas. Para que se pueda considerar el restablecimiento, proporciona pruebas de un número de registro de la EPA o número de establecimiento de la EPA, o una certificación de que el producto está exento de las normativas de la EPA. Tendrás que proporcionar esta información en el atributo de marcado de pesticidas del listado. <a href=/help/hub/reference/GLX9EJX844SNJX7J> Encontrarás instrucciones para completar este atributo en Seller Central.</a>","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_title":"Información relacionada con la política","ahd_pr_form_title":"Detalles del producto que no cumple con los requisitos","ahd_pre_enforcment_non_deactivation_subheader":"Tienes una o más acciones pendientes que podrían dar lugar a la interrupción de tu cuenta en el futuro.","ahd_priority_actions_address_by_date":"Proceder a más tardar el {date} en {daysremaining} días","ahd_priority_actions_cr":"Incumplimientos del porcentaje de cancelaciones","ahd_priority_actions_description":"Aborda los siguientes problemas para evitar la desactivación de la cuenta.","ahd_priority_actions_lsr":"Incumplimientos del porcentaje de envíos atrasados","ahd_priority_actions_odr":"Incumplimientos del porcentaje de pedidos defectuosos","ahd_priority_actions_otdr":"Infracciones del porcentaje de entregas a tiempo","ahd_priority_actions_verification_title":"Completar requisitos de verificación","ahd_pspp_priority_actions":"Completar la revisión pendiente del proceso de verificación de la identidad del cliente: proveedor de servicios de pago","ahd_pspp_rap_intro":"La cuenta bancaria no es apta para recibir pagos. Colabora con tu proveedor de servicios de pago para completar la revisión del proceso de verificación de la identidad del cliente.","ahd_pspp_rap_next_steps":"Para más información, consulta la página <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GY8JTVAWBPQT2XFC?ref_=to_psp_faq_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Preguntas frecuentes sobre proveedores de servicios de pago</a> y <a href=\'/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView?ref_=to_deposit_method_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Método de depósito</a>. ","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory":"Países afectados por restricciones de inventario","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory_details":"Aborda los requisitos pendientes para evitar la interrupción del inventario gestionado por Amazon y de tus capacidades de importación y exportación en el país indicado.","ahd_rap_at_risk_regional_details":"Los requisitos enumerados están afectando el estado de tu cuenta en varias tiendas. Aborda los requisitos pendientes para evitar su desactivación en todas las tiendas afectadas.","ahd_rap_begin_verification_cta":"Empezar verificación","ahd_rap_deactivated_message":"Tu cuenta se desactivó.","ahd_rap_enforced_inventory_details":"Aborda los requisitos pendientes para eliminar las restricciones sobre tu inventario gestionado por Amazon y las capacidades de importación o exportación en el país indicado.","ahd_rap_netherlands":"Países Bajos","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p1":"La legislación exige la verificación de tu identidad para el uso de una cuenta de Vender en Amazon. De acuerdo con la legislación de Brasil y Canadá, es obligatorio que se verifique tu identidad para que puedas usar nuestro servicio. Es posible que tengas que proporcionarnos determinada información y documentación con el fin de agilizar estas comprobaciones.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p3":"Puedes proporcionar la información de verificación obligatoria en cualquier momento después de registrarte. Tendrás acceso limitado a tu cuenta hasta que la información se haya proporcionado y verificado.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p4":"Si quieres continuar y vender en Amazon.ca o Amazon.br, marca la casilla de verificación situada junto a la tienda para la que quieras hacer la verificación. A continuación, consulta la página “Información de identidad” para determinar los próximos pasos.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p5":"Si primero quieres hacer la verificación de una única tienda, selecciona sólo esa tienda de la lista que aparece a continuación. Una vez que hayas completado la verificación de esa tienda, se te notificará que completes los pasos obligatorios para iniciar la verificación de la otra.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_thankyou_p1":"Gracias por iniciar el proceso de verificación","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_thankyou_p2":"Estamos validando la información y es posible que tengamos que solicitarte algunos detalles durante esta revisión. Esta validación puede tardar hasta 24 horas y, en algunos casos, podría demorar hasta 10 días hábiles. Durante este tiempo, no se puede modificar la información de identidad.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_check_verification_status":"Comprueba el estado de verificación y los próximos pasos obligatorios en la página “Información de cuenta”.","ahd_rap_or":"O bien:","ahd_rap_past_due_inventory":"VENCIDO: capacidades de inventario restringidas","ahd_rap_the_uk":"Reino Unido","ahd_rap_uk":"Reino Unido","ahd_rap_voluntary_submission_action":"Según la información que tenemos disponible, no es obligatorio que tengas un ${countryName} número de identificación fiscal. Para cumplir con este requisito, puedes eliminarlo de la <a href=\'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Configuración fiscal</a> o continuar con la resolución del problema anterior.","ahd_sa_account_health_guidance_description":"¿Tienes preguntas sobre el estado de la cuenta? Obtén asesoramiento personalizado del Asistente de vendedor.","ahd_sa_ask_seller_assistant_title":"Pregunta al Asistente de vendedores","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_label":"Resumir cumplimiento de productos","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_text":"¿Se pueden resumir mis infracciones de cumplimiento de productos?","ahd_uaebizlicense_priority_action":"Cargar tu licencia comercial","ahd_vas_extension_extension_request_link":"envía la documentación obligatoria.","ahd_vas_extension_request":"Si quieres solicitar una ampliación o no estás de acuerdo con la decisión de Amazon, <a href=\\"${appealUrl}\\" target=\\"_blank\\">envía la documentación obligatoria.</a>","ahd_vas_it_reason":"Número de registro de IVA italiano no válido","ahd_vas_priority_action":"Requisitos para el registro del IVA europeo","ahd_vas_rap_action_address_country":" <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Verificar o actualizar la información de la dirección</a>","ahd_vas_rap_action_address_review":"<a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Revisar la información enviada sobre la dirección</a>","ahd_vas_rap_action_name_country":" <a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>Verificar o actualizar la información del nombre</a>","ahd_vas_rap_action_name_review":"<a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>Revisar la información enviada sobre el nombre</a>","ahd_vas_rap_action_vat_country":"<a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Verificar o actualizar número de identificación fiscal</a> ","ahd_vas_rap_action_vat_review":"<a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Revisar el número de identificación fiscal enviado</a> ","ahd_vas_rap_deactivated_message":"Los requisitos enumerados están afectando el estado de tu cuenta en varias tiendas. Para reactivar tu cuenta en todas las tiendas afectadas, responde a los requisitos pendientes de dicho país.","ahd_vas_rap_intro":"Los <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GTQ23HPXBQK563WS\' target=\'_blank\'>requisitos para el registro del IVA europeo</a> constituyen una política de las tiendas europeas de Amazon que exige que todos los colaboradores comerciales activos en las tiendas europeas envíen un número de registro de IVA válido siempre que tengan que cumplir un requisito.  Consulta la sección “Impacto en el estado de la cuenta” para completar los requisitos pendientes.","ahd_vas_rap_secondary_action":"Si no dispones de un número de registro de IVA en el país indicado, consulta el portal de <a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>Información de la empresa</a> y <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Configuración de impuestos</a> para enviar los datos obligatorios (número de identificación fiscal, nombre, dirección) de los siguientes países:","ahd_vas_rap_third_action":"Si elegiste la Ventanilla Única del IVA (OSS) de la Unión en tu país de origen, consulta la página <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Configuración de impuestos</a>. Para ello, selecciona tu país de origen en el menú de la declaración de la Ventanilla Única del IVA (OSS) de la Unión. Asegúrate de que tu Ventanilla Única del IVA (OSS) de la Unión esté activada y que el nombre y la dirección proporcionados a Amazon coincidan con los que proporcionaste a las Autoridades.","ahd_vas_rap_verifying":"Estamos revisando los detalles de tus números de registro de IVA. Este proceso puede tardar hasta 14 días. Te contactaremos si necesitamos más información.","ahd_violation_appeal_button":"Proceder con la apelación","ahd_violation_display_name":"Incumplimiento de la política de productos restringidos","ahd_violation_status_assessment_phase":"Penalizaciones en fase de evaluación: los pagos pueden verse afectados.","ahd_w8_priority_action":"Se actualizaron los datos fiscales de EE. UU. obligatorios","ahd_w8_rap_action":"Ahora, tienes que completar el cuestionario sobre información fiscal de autoservicio antes de la fecha límite. La solicitud puede tardar hasta 24 horas en procesarse.","ahd_w8_rap_deactivated_action":"Envía la información obligatoria para reactivar tu cuenta. La solicitud puede tardar hasta 24 horas en procesarse.","ahd_w8_rap_intro":"Se requiere un nuevo formulario fiscal W-8. Una vez que venza el formulario, tu cuenta de vendedor se desactivará temporalmente hasta que proporciones información fiscal actualizada.\\n\\n<br><br>Estos requisitos afectan al estado de tu cuenta en varias tiendas.  Aborda los requisitos indicados para evitar que se desactive tu cuenta en todas las tiendas afectadas.\\n\\n<br><br>Para más información, ve a <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G200663290?ref_=to_w8_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Preguntas frecuentes sobre la declaración de ingresos y recopilación de datos fiscales de los Estados Unidos.</a>","ahd_w8_rap_tax_interview":"<a href=\'/hz/account-info/tax-interview-redirect?ref_=to_w8_from_launch_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Completa el cuestionario sobre información fiscal de autoservicio para enviar los datos obligatorios.</a>","ahdpars_spx_myc_dashboard_mainHeader1":"Administrar tu cumplimiento","ahr-status-badge-great":"Saludable","ai_inform_page1_step1":"1. Ve a la página “Información de cuenta” [enlace a la página “Información de cuenta” aquí] para revisar la información de tu cuenta (y actualizar, si es necesario).","ai_inform_page1_step2":"2. Una vez que hayas confirmado que la información es correcta, vuelve a esta página y haz clic en el enlace que aparece a continuación para recibir tu aviso formal y un certificado completo.","alert_variant_demo_description":"JavaScript cambia la variante de este componente de aviso","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Dado que los componentes Katal son extensiones de elementos HTML, JavaScript puede interactuar con ellos de la misma manera que con los elementos HTML integrados. Aquí vemos que JavaScript cambia el atributo “variante” en el aviso.","components_containing_html_text":"Algunos componentes pueden tener contenido HTML, como nuestro componente KatalTabs. Estos componentes complejos proporcionan una API para que los desarrolladores y marcos puedan interactuar con ellos.","custom_elements_text":"Katal ofrece a los desarrolladores la posibilidad de usar elementos personalizados para crear sus páginas web. Por ejemplo, si el desarrollador necesita un botón, puede usar <kat-button></kat-button> en lugar de crearlo él mismo.","demo_complex_header_text":"Demostración: componentes Katal complejos","demo_components_header_text":"Demostración: uso de componentes Katal","demo_javascript_header_text":"Demostración: JavaScript con componentes Katal","design_approved_text":"Katal ofrece componentes con diseño aprobado para su uso en páginas web que se pueden configurar con etiquetas y parámetros personalizados, por ejemplo, botones normales y secundarios, diferentes sólo en el atributo “variante”.","discovery_ahd_ni_warn_impressum":"Información de la empresa","fba_inventory_uc_identifier":"Nuestros registros indican que tienes inventario retenido en ${COUNTRY} por medio del programa gestionado por Amazon (Logística de Amazon). Si usas los servicios de Logística de Amazon, tendrás que proporcionar un número de registro de IVA válido para cada país donde tengas almacenado tu inventario. Puedes verificar aquí los países en los que activaste Logística de Amazon <a href=/fba/settings/ target=\\"_blank\\">aquí</a>.\\r\\nTen en cuenta que tienes que proporcionar un número de registro del Impuesto al Valor Agregado (IVA) válido que se haya activado para las transacciones dentro de la UE.","greeting_description":"Esta es una aplicación Katal de muestra, que ilustra cómo usar los componentes de Katal, así como las herramientas de creación y ejecución. Contacta al equipo de Katal en colombia-team@amazon.com si tienes preguntas o comentarios. Para continuar con esta demostración, descarta este aviso.","greeting_description_mons_app":"Esta es una aplicación Katal de ejemplo, en la que se muestra cómo usar los componentes de Katal con traducciones. Contacta al equipo de Katal en katal-team@amazon.com si tienes preguntas o comentarios.","inform_mobile_notification_description":"Ve a la página “Estado de la cuenta” para revisar los requisitos de verificación pendientes de la Ley INFORM.","inform_mobile_notification_description_full":"Tu cuenta de vendedor de Amazon.com está en riesgo de desactivación. Ve a la página “Estado de la cuenta” para revisar los requisitos de verificación pendientes de la Ley INFORM.","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Enviar valoraciones","mobile_ahd_banner_eg_trn":"Modifica tu número de identificación fiscal en la página “Configuración de impuestos” de tu cuenta de Seller Central.","mobile_tutorial_inform_act_description":"Para cumplir con la Ley INFORM, Amazon tiene que recopilar y verificar información sobre tu cuenta de Vender en Amazon. Actualmente tienes una o más acciones de verificación pendientes.","poe_domestic_uc_identifier":"Nuestros registros internos indican que tus ventas en ${COUNTRY} superan el umbral nacional de registro de IVA.","ppc_fhdds_action_taken":"Riesgo de restricción de envío entrante en el Reino Unido","ppc_fhdds_action_taken_past_due":"La capacidad de envío entrante en el Reino Unido está restringida en este momento","ppc_fhdds_reason":"FHDDS: Falta el número de entrada de importación (IEN) del envío","product-policy-compliance":"Cumplimiento de la política de productos","rv-link-button":"Ir a infracciones","sc_homepage_education_phase_description":"Aborda el estado de tu cuenta para evitar el riesgo de desactivación en el futuro.","sc_homepage_pending_deactivation":"Se produjo un evento crítico con tu cuenta que provocó que esté en riesgo de que se la desactive. ","sc_inform_act_hold_banner":"Tu cuenta está en riesgo de desactivación y los pagos están retenidos.","sc_inform_act_view_account_health_banner":"Ve a “Estado de la cuenta”","sc_navbar_ah_cs_desc":"Consulta las estadísticas de calidad del servicio de atención al cliente, como los porcentajes de pedidos y facturas defectuosos.","sc_navbar_ah_desc":"Consulta la Calificación del Estado de la Cuenta, los problemas que afectan el estado de la cuenta y las infracciones que pueden tener como consecuencia su desactivación o que se retire el contenido.","sc_navbar_ah_eligibilities_desc":"Consulta para qué beneficios y programas puedes ser apto.","sc_navbar_ah_myc_desc":"Asegúrate de que todos tus productos cumplen con todas las leyes, reglamentaciones y políticas de Amazon aplicables.","sc_navbar_ah_ppc_desc":"Consulta los incumplimientos de políticas que pueden conllevar que se retire el contenido o se desactive tu cuenta. ","sc_navbar_ah_sp_desc":"Consulta las estadísticas de desempeño de envío, como el porcentaje de envíos atrasados, porcentaje de cancelaciones previas al envío, porcentaje de envíos con seguimiento válido y porcentaje de entregas a tiempo.  ","schp_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_header":"Completa los requisitos de verificación pendientes para empezar a vender en Amazon.","schp_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_subtitle":"Para empezar a vender en Amazon, ve a la página “Estado de la cuenta” y completa las acciones prioritarias.","schp_complete_priority_actions":"Completa tus acciones prioritarias","schp_inventory_restriction_card":"Atiende los problemas del estado de la cuenta para eliminar las restricciones de inventario de tu cuenta.","ship_from_non_poe_uc_identifier":"Nuestros registros internos indican que haces envíos desde ${COUNTRY}, que no es tu país de origen. Por lo tanto, tienes que proporcionar un número de identificación fiscal del sistema de intercambio de información sobre el IVA; sistema VIES válido para las transacciones en la UE. Puedes verificar tu dirección de envío en la página “Configuración de envíos” o en este <a href=/sbr target=\\"_blank\\">enlace</a>.\\nTen en cuenta que tienes que proporcionar un número de registro del IVA válido activado para las transacciones dentro de la UE.","ship_from_poe_uc_identifier":"Nuestros registros indican que tus ventas transfronterizas superan los EUR 10 000 en los países de la UE. Como vendedor que realiza ventas internacionales, debes proporcionar un número de identificación fiscal que sea compatible con la UOSS del país de tu domicilio fiscal o números de identificación fiscal válidos para todos los países a los que realizas envíos.","ship_to_non_eu_uc_identifier":"Nuestros registros internos indican que tienes envíos superiores a EUR 150 desde fuera de la UE hacia ${COUNTRY}. Por lo tanto, debes proporcionar un número de identificación fiscal de ${COUNTRY} válido o una declaración que confirme que no eres el importador nominal del envío por encima del umbral.","ship_to_uoss_uc_identifier":"Nuestros registros internos indican llevas a cabo ventas transfronterizas en ${COUNTRY} desde otros países de la UE y, por lo tanto, tienes que proporcionar un número de identificación fiscal válido para UOSS de tu país de establecimiento o un número de identificación fiscal de ${COUNTRY} IVA válido.\\r\\nTen en cuenta que tienes que proporcionar un número de registro del Impuesto al Valor Agregado (IVA) válido que se haya activado para las transacciones dentro de la UE.","ship_to_xborder_uc_identifier":"Nuestros registros internos indican que llevas a cabo ventas transfronterizas en ${COUNTRY} desde otros países de la UE y, por lo tanto, tienes que proporcionar un número de identificación fiscal de ${COUNTRY} válido.","sp-aha-check-eligibility-button":"Consulta los requisitos para poder participar","sp-permanent-call-me-now-need-help":"¿Necesitas ayuda?","sp-permanent-call-me-now-prompt":"Habla con un especialista en el estado de la cuenta.","sp_health_atoz_guarantee_claims_caption":"Reclamos bajo la Garantía de la A a la Z","sp_health_cancellation_rate_caption":"Porcentaje de cancelaciones previas al envío","sp_health_cancellation_rate_subtitle":"<b>Objetivo</b>: menos del ${hash-get targetValue}","sp_health_chargeback_claims_caption":"Reclamos por reversión de cargo","sp_health_customer_satisfaction_information_label":"El porcentaje de pedidos defectuosos consta de tres estadísticas diferentes:","sp_health_dashboard_guardian_title_new":"Garantía del estado de la cuenta","sp_health_dashboard_subheader":"Para vender en Amazon, debes cumplir con los siguientes objetivos de desempeño y políticas.","sp_health_download_report_caption":"Descargar reporte","sp_health_intellectual_property_customer_complaints":"Quejas de propiedad intelectual recibidas","sp_health_late_shipment_rate_caption":"Porcentaje de envíos atrasados","sp_health_late_shipment_rate_subtitle":"<b>Objetivo</b>: menos del ${hash-get targetValue}","sp_health_listing_policy_customer_complaints":"Incumplimiento de políticas de listados","sp_health_mobile_by_ahr_impact_tab_title":"Impacto por Calificación del Estado de la Cuenta","sp_health_mobile_info_bar_label_ahr_filter_enabled":"Incumplimientos o más","sp_health_nav_eligibilities":"Elegibilidad","sp_health_nav_myc":"Administra tu cumplimiento","sp_health_nav_performance_over_time":"Historial de desempeño","sp_health_nav_reports":"Reportes","sp_health_order_defect_rate_caption":"Porcentaje de pedidos defectuosos","sp_health_pre_fulfillment_cancel_rate":"Porcentaje de cancelaciones previas al envío","sp_health_product_condition_customer_complaints":"Reclamos de clientes por estado del producto","sp_health_product_policies":"Cumplimiento de la política de productos","sp_health_product_quality_popover":"Este total incluye las quejas que posiblemente hayas enviado mediante un plan de acción.","sp_health_product_safety_customer_complaints":"Problemas de seguridad de productos y alimentos","sp_health_restricted_products_violations_policy":"Incumplimientos de la política de Productos restringidos","sp_health_risk_banner_unitotd":"Tu porcentaje de entregas a tiempo es del ${unitOTDRiskData.getFormattedValue()}. El objetivo es de ${unitOTDRiskData.getFormattedTarget()}.","sp_health_risk_banner_vtr":"Las ofertas gestionadas por el vendedor están en riesgo de desactivación. Tu porcentaje de envíos con seguimiento válido es ${hash-get metricValue}, y el objetivo es ${hash-get target}.","sp_health_seller_fulfilled_metrics_caption":"Autogestionado","sp_health_shipping_bucket_caption":"Desempeño de envíos","sp_health_shipping_eligibilities":"Ver envío aquí","sp_health_suspected_intellectual_property_violations":"Supuestas infracciones de derechos de propiedad intelectual","sp_health_time_window":"Franja de tiempo: ${hash-get numDays} días","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_caption":"Porcentaje de envíos con seguimiento válido","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_subtitle":"<b>Objetivo</b>: Superior al ${hash-get targetValue}","sp_health_violation_details_selling_assistant_title":"Pregunta al Asistente de vendedores","sp_health_violation_details_stale_page_button_label":"Volver a “Estado de la cuenta”","sp_health_violation_details_stale_page_dialog_title":"No se encontró la página","sp_mfn_at_risk_warning":"Las ofertas gestionadas por el vendedor están en riesgo de desactivación","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_defects":"Actualmente no tienes ningún defecto en este pedido.","sp_st_date_range":"Del ${hash-get startDate} al ${hash-get endDate}","sp_st_heading_order_edd":"Fecha de entrega prevista","sp_st_str_with_description":"${hash-get description}: ${hash-get str}","sp_st_zero_out_metrics_message":"Los pedidos recibidos antes del 1 de junio no se usan para evaluar el estado de la cuenta y no se muestran aquí.","sp_vtr_list_ca":"1. Artículos pesados y voluminosos enviados por un transportista no integrado de Amazon. Obtén más información sobre los transportistas integrados.</br></br>2. Productos pequeños y ligeros con un valor inferior a CAD 30 (incluidos los gastos de envío) y que se envíen en sobres estándar de Canada Post o sobres de First Class Mail.</br></br>3. Envíos internacionales enviados desde China con un valor de pedido inferior a CAD 6 (incluidos los cargos por envío).</br></br>4. Envíos internacionales enviados desde fuera de EE. UU. y China.</br></br>5. Pedidos digitales que un transportista no pueda enviar físicamente (p. ej., un audiolibro).","sp_zero_tolerance_banner_body":"Tu cuenta está pendiente de desactivación debido a una o más infracciones importantes. Para evitar la desactivación, te pedimos que resuelvas estas infracciones ahora. Para más información, ve a <a href=/gp/help/G200205250>Política del programa Calificación del Estado de la Cuenta</a>.","submission_status_ahd_review_submission_pending_status":"Estado: nuestra evaluación está en curso.","tab_demo_generated_text":"Pestaña generada automáticamente {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"Nombre de la pestaña {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_text":"Contenido para la pestaña seleccionada inicialmente","ts-form-header":"Informar sobre una violación de política","ts-ingress-ahd":" <a id=\'submission-channel-link\' href=\'#\'>Reportar un uso indebido</a> de las políticas de Amazon.","valid_vat_number_uc_identifier":"Ten en cuenta que tienes que proporcionar un número de registro del Impuesto al Valor Agregado (IVA) válido que se haya activado para las transacciones dentro de la UE.","voluntary_vrn_uc_identifier":"Nuestros registros internos indican que no tienes obligación de conservar un número de identificación fiscal en ${COUNTRY}, pero proporcionaste uno en Seller Central que no es válido en este momento. Para resolver esta discrepancia, puedes eliminar el número de identificación fiscal de ${COUNTRY} o proporcionar uno válido. Al eliminar tu número de identificación fiscal de ${COUNTRY} en Seller Central, confirmas que no tienes obligación de conservar uno en ${COUNTRY}. Te recomendamos que consultes a un asesor fiscal para determinar si tus actividades comerciales generales, tanto dentro como fuera de Amazon, requieren de un registro de IVA."}}}'),JSON.parse('{"fr":{"pages.floatingWidget":{"DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_cta_done":"Gestionnaire des évaluations","DYK_SSAT_EDU_JULY":"Clés de l’évaluation de l’état du compte","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_cta_done":"En savoir plus","ahd_dyk_cta_done":"Terminé","ahd_dyk_fhdds_cta":"Consulter les expéditions","ahd_floating_widget_new_tag":"NOUVEAU !","ahd_floating_widget_resolve_now_button_text":"Résoudre maintenant","ahd_floating_widget_title":"Le saviez-vous ?","ahd_floating_widget_view_all":"Afficher tout {count}","ahd_rap_begin_verification_cta":"Commencer la vérification","cs_nerd_suggestion_top_issues_action_vi":"Afficher les problèmes"},"pages.homepage":{"AHD_DD14_Base_Reserve":"Les recettes des ventes sont conservées jusqu\'à 14 jours après la date de livraison et peuvent faire l\'objet d\'un versement à compter du 15e jour suivant la date de livraison. Si la date de livraison réelle n\'est pas disponible, nous utilisons la dernière date de livraison estimée de la commande. Il s\'agit de votre politique de paiement par défaut.","AHD_POA_APPEAL_ERROR_LOADING":"Une erreur s’est produite. Actualisez la page.","LocalizedPageTitleDashboard":"Tableau de bord Performances","RR_AHR_Warn_1":"Plusieurs comptes de vente sur Amazon","ags_pcx_voc_summary_voice_of_the_customer":"Voix du client","ahd_Inform_deposit_method":"Informations sur le mode de versement","ahd_SOrigin_priority_action":"Informations sur le bénéficiaire effectif","ahd_account_impacted_details":"Votre compte peut être affecté comme indiqué ci-dessous :","ahd_action_due":"Échéance","ahd_aef_action_HD":"Versements en attente","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_contact_us":"Si vous avez des questions, n’hésitez pas à nous contacter à l’adresse seller-reactivation-appeals@amazon.com.","ahd_aef_action_panel_verify_button":"Vérifier","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_auth_subreason":"Réclamations des clients concernant l’authenticité des produits","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reason":"Violations répétées","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reg_comp_subreason":"Conformité à la réglementation","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rp_subreason":"Politique relative aux produits soumis à des restrictions","ahd_aef_at_risk_HD_card_title":"Votre compte risque d’être désactivé et les versements de votre compte vendeur Amazon ont été mis en attente.","ahd_aef_critical":"Critique","ahd_aef_critical_message":"Si ce problème critique n’est pas résolu, votre compte sera désactivé.","ahd_aef_critical_message_no_caps":"Si ce problème critique n’est pas résolu, votre compte sera désactivé.","ahd_aef_denver_info":"Informations requises","ahd_aef_educational_card_action":"Résoudre les problèmes","ahd_aef_impact_header":"Impact sur l’état du compte","ahd_aef_priority_action_completed_status":"Terminé","ahd_aef_priority_action_pending_review_status":"En attente d’examen","ahd_ahr_section_title":"Évaluation de l’état du compte","ahd_all_issues":"Tous les problèmes","ahd_back_button":"Retour","ahd_banner_account_atrisk_header":"Votre compte risque d’être désactivé.","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_header":"Votre compte a été désactivé. ","ahd_banner_account_pending_header":"Votre compte est en attente de désactivation.","ahd_banner_resolve_issues_button":"Résoudre les problèmes","ahd_be_jsl_priority_action":"Législation belge en matière de TVA","ahd_br_store":"Brésil (Amazon.com.br)","ahd_brkyc_priority_action":"Vérification de l’identité au Brésil","ahd_brkyc_rap_action":"Vous devez soumettre vos informations de vérification d’identité avant la date d’échéance.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_action":"Soumettez vos informations de vérification d’identité pour réactiver votre compte.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_message":"Votre compte a été désactivé, car nous n’avons pas pu valider vos informations d’identité.","ahd_brkyc_rap_identity_info":"Consultez la page <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Informations d’identité</a> pour terminer la vérification.","ahd_ca_store":"Canada (Amazon.ca)","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_header3":"Que se passera-t-il si je ne fournis pas les informations requises ? ","ahd_cancel_button":"Annuler","ahd_close_button":"Fermer","ahd_collusion_policy":"Politiques de vente et code de conduite du vendeur","ahd_complete_status":"TERMINÉ","ahd_days":"Jours","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_description":"Accédez à la page <a href=\'/hz/sc/account-information\' target=\'_blank\'>Informations sur le compte</a> pour terminer la vérification. ","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Votre boutique Amazon.ca (Canada) risque d’être désactivée.","ahd_edit_button":"Modifier","ahd_eukyc_priority_action":"Vérification de l’identité","ahd_floating_widget_action_panel_close":"Fermer","ahd_funds_potential_withheld":"Les fonds peuvent être retenus","ahd_incomplete_status":"INCOMPLET","ahd_inform_ac_edu_display_name":"Vérifier les informations de votre compte","ahd_inform_ac_educational_subheader":"Vous avez une ou plusieurs actions en attente pouvant entraîner la désactivation de votre compte à l’avenir.","ahd_inform_ac_p1_header":"Préparez-vous à certifier vos informations","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"Adresse","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_button":"Certifier","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_your_info_button":"Certifier vos informations","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"Nom","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"Téléphone","ahd_inform_act_ac_step1_title":"Vérifier et mettre à jour vos informations","ahd_inform_act_ac_tax_field":"Numéro d’identification fiscale","ahd_inform_act_ac_tin_field":"Numéro d’identification fiscale :","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_ending":"Compte bancaire dont le numéro se termine par","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"Informations sur le compte bancaire","ahd_inform_act_debit_card_ending":"Carte de débit dont le numéro se termine","ahd_inform_act_dismiss":"Ignorer","ahd_inform_act_dismiss_button":"Ignorer","ahd_inform_act_widget_bank_account_field":"Compte bancaire","ahd_inform_act_widget_business_address_field":"Adresse commerciale","ahd_inform_act_widget_identity_field":"Identité","ahd_inform_act_widget_pending_status":"En cours","ahd_inform_act_widget_phone_number_field":"Numéro de téléphone","ahd_inform_act_widget_tax_id_field":"Numéro d’identification fiscale","ahd_inform_act_widget_unverified_status":"non vérifié","ahd_inform_annual_certification":"Certification annuelle","ahd_inform_annual_review_thank_you_dismiss_button":"Ignorer","ahd_inform_company_registration_number":"Numéro d’immatriculation de la société : ","ahd_inform_compliance_action_name":"Nom","ahd_inform_page1_button":"Continuer","ahd_inform_page1_instructions":"Vérifiez et certifiez vos informations dès maintenant en deux étapes simples :","ahd_inform_update_account_information_educational":"Consultez la page <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Certification annuelle</a> pour vous assurer que les informations de votre compte Vendre sur Amazon sont à jour.","ahd_itr_priority_action":"Numéro fiscal italien requis pour les vendeurs basés en Italie.","ahd_itr_rap_at_risk_deactivation":"Votre compte risque d’être désactivé.","ahd_itr_rap_deactivated_message":"Votre compte a été désactivé.","ahd_itr_rap_pending_deactivation":"Votre compte est en attente de désactivation.","ahd_more_information_hd":"Plus d’informations","ahd_new_feature":"NOUVEAU !","ahd_new_feature_announcement_body_new_filters":"Vous pouvez désormais filtrer les violations de politiques en fonction des mesures prises sur les produits mis en vente affectés. Dans le tableau de bord État du compte, accédez à l’onglet Politique de conformité des produits et cliquez sur Ajouter des filtres pour filtrer les violations.","ahd_new_feature_announcement_got_it_button":"OK ","ahd_new_feature_announcement_header":"Annonce d’une nouvelle fonctionnalité","ahd_new_feature_announcement_title_new_filters":"Nouveaux filtres ajoutés","ahd_past_due":"EN RETARD","ahd_post_enforcement_non_deactivation_subheader":"Vous avez une ou plusieurs actions en attente qui affectent l’état de votre compte.","ahd_pp_mas_r_policies_code_of_conduct":"Politiques de vente et code de conduite du vendeur","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_title":"Comment ça marche ?","ahd_pr_form_impact_header":"L’impact potentiel sur le compte est détaillé ci-dessous :","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_title":"Informations relatives à la politique","ahd_pr_form_title":"Détails sur les produits non conformes","ahd_priority_actions_compliant":"Vérification d’identité terminée","ahd_priority_actions_hd":"Versements en attente","ahd_priority_actions_lsr":"Violations du taux d’expéditions en retard","ahd_priority_actions_odr":"Violations du taux de commandes défectueuses","ahd_priority_actions_title":"Actions prioritaires","ahd_rap_at_risk_deactivation":"Votre compte risque d’être désactivé.","ahd_rap_austria":"Autriche","ahd_rap_begin_verification":"Commencer la vérification ","ahd_rap_begin_verification_cta":"Commencer la vérification","ahd_rap_belgium":"Belgique","ahd_rap_bulgaria":"Bulgarie","ahd_rap_close":"Fermer","ahd_rap_croatia":"Croatie","ahd_rap_cyprus":"Chypre","ahd_rap_czech_republic":"République tchèque","ahd_rap_deactivated_message":"Votre compte a été désactivé.","ahd_rap_denmark":"Danemark","ahd_rap_estonia":"Estonie","ahd_rap_finland":"Finlande","ahd_rap_france":"France","ahd_rap_germany":"Allemagne","ahd_rap_greece":"Grèce","ahd_rap_hungary":"Hongrie","ahd_rap_ireland":"Irlande","ahd_rap_italy":"Italie","ahd_rap_latvia":"Lettonie","ahd_rap_lithuania":"Lituanie","ahd_rap_luxembourg":"Luxembourg","ahd_rap_malta":"Malte","ahd_rap_netherlands":"Pays-Bas","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_thankyou_p1":"Merci d’avoir commencé votre processus de vérification.","ahd_rap_norway":"Norvège","ahd_rap_or":"OU","ahd_rap_pending_deactivation":"Votre compte est en attente de désactivation.","ahd_rap_poland":"Pologne","ahd_rap_portugal":"Portugal","ahd_rap_romania":"Roumanie","ahd_rap_slovakia":"Slovaquie","ahd_rap_slovenia":"Slovénie","ahd_rap_spain":"Espagne","ahd_rap_sweden":"\\r\\nSuède","ahd_rap_switzerland":"Suisse","ahd_rap_the_uk":"Royaume-Uni","ahd_rap_uk":"Royaume-Uni","ahd_regulatory_compliance":"Conformité à la réglementation","ahd_related_accounts_policy_reason":"Code de conduite du vendeur (Plusieurs comptes de vente sur Amazon)","ahd_sa_chat_about_account_health_text":"Comment va la santé de mon compte ?","ahd_save_changes_button":"Enregistrer les modifications","ahd_status_only":"Statut","ahd_status_past_due":"En retard","ahd_vas_it_reason":"Numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA italienne non valide","ahd_vas_rap_action_name_country":" <a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>Vérifier/mettre à jour les informations du nom</a>","ahd_vas_rap_action_vat_country":"<a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Vérifier/mettre à jour le numéro de TVA</a> ","ahd_vas_rap_action_vat_review":"<a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Vérifier le numéro de TVA soumis</a> ","ahd_vas_rap_verifying":"Nous examinons actuellement vos numéros d’immatriculation à la TVA. Cette opération peut prendre jusqu’à 14 jours. Nous vous contacterons si des informations complémentaires sont requises.","ahd_view_all_pa":"Afficher toutes les actions prioritaires (${totalCount})","ahd_violation_appeal_button":"Poursuivre la contestation","ahd_violation_details":"Détails de la violation","ahd_violation_status_assessment_phase":"Sanctions lors de la phase d’évaluation : les versements peuvent être affectés.","ahd_violation_status_open":"Ouvrir","ahd_w8_rap_action":"Vous devez maintenant remplir votre questionnaire fiscal en libre-service avant la date d’échéance. Le traitement de votre soumission peut prendre jusqu’à 24 heures.","ahd_w8_rap_deactivated_action":"Soumettez les informations requises pour réactiver votre compte. Le traitement de votre soumission peut prendre jusqu’à 24 heures.","ahd_w8_rap_tax_interview":"<a href=\'/hz/account-info/tax-interview-redirect?ref_=to_w8_from_launch_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Remplissez votre questionnaire fiscal en libre-service pour soumettre les informations requises.</a>","ahdpars_spx_myc_dashboard_mainHeader1":"Gérer votre conformité","ai_inform_page1_step1":"1. Accédez à la page Informations sur le compte [lien vers la page Informations sur le compte ici] pour consulter les informations de votre compte (et mettre à jour si nécessaire).","alert_variant_demo_description":"La variante de ce composant d’alerte a été modifiée par JavaScript","continue_button_label":"Continuer","custom_elements_text":"Katal donne aux développeurs la possibilité d’utiliser des éléments personnalisés pour créer leurs pages Web. Par exemple, si le développeur a besoin d’un bouton, il peut utiliser <kat-button></kat-button> au lieu de créer un bouton lui-même.","demo_javascript_header_text":"Démonstration : JavaScript avec des composants Katal","discovery_ahd_ni_warn_amazon_search":"Termes de recherche Amazon","discovery_ahd_ni_warn_impressum":"Impressum","discovery_ahd_ni_warn_pdp":"Page détaillée du produit","information-requests":"Demandes d’informations","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Envoyer vos commentaires","mobile_ahd_banner_eg_trn":"Mettez à jour votre numéro d’immatriculation fiscale sur la page Paramètres fiscaux de votre compte Seller Central.","ppc_fhdds_action_taken_past_due":"Les capacités d’expéditions entrantes au Royaume-Uni sont actuellement restreintes","ppc_fhdds_reason":"FHDDS : expédition sans numéro d’entrée d’importation (IEN)","primary_button_label":"Bouton principal","product-policy-compliance":"Politique de conformité des produits","rv-link-button":"Accéder aux violations","sample_app_page_title_text":"Exemple d’application","sc_inform_act_hold_banner":"Votre compte risque d’être désactivé et les versements sont en attente","schp_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_subtitle":"Accédez à la page État du compte et effectuez vos Actions prioritaires pour commencer à vendre sur Amazon.","schp_complete_priority_actions":"Effectuez vos actions prioritaires","secondary_button_label":"Bouton secondaire","sp-permanent-call-me-now-title":"Besoin d’aide ?","sp_health_amazon_fulfilled_metrics_caption":"Expédié par Amazon","sp_health_atoz_guarantee_claims_caption":"Réclamations au titre de la Garantie A à Z","sp_health_cancellation_rate_subtitle":"<b>Objectif</b> : inférieur à ${hash-get targetValue}","sp_health_chargeback_claims_caption":"Contestations de prélèvement","sp_health_customer_satisfaction_information_label":"Le taux de commandes défectueuses comprend trois statistiques différentes :","sp_health_dashboard_guardian_title_new":"Assurance État du compte","sp_health_dashboard_title":"État du compte","sp_health_download_report_caption":"Télécharger le rapport","sp_health_late_shipment_rate_subtitle":"<b>Objectif</b> : inférieur à ${hash-get targetValue}","sp_health_mobile_info_bar_label":"Violations","sp_health_mobile_info_bar_label_ahr_filter_enabled":"Violations ou plus","sp_health_nav_myc":"Gérer votre conformité","sp_health_nav_orders_with_defects":"Commandes défectueuses","sp_health_nav_performance_over_time":"Performances au fil du temps","sp_health_nav_reports":"Rapports","sp_health_negative_feedback_caption":"Évaluations négatives","sp_health_number_days":"${hash-get number_days} jours","sp_health_order_defect_rate_caption":"Taux de commandes défectueuses","sp_health_product_policies":"Politique de conformité des produits","sp_health_restricted_products_violations_policy":"Violations de la politique relative aux produits soumis à des restrictions","sp_health_risk_banner_unitotd":"Votre taux de livraisons dans les délais est de ${unitOTDRiskData.getFormattedValue()} ; l’objectif est de ${unitOTDRiskData.getFormattedTarget()}.","sp_health_seller_fulfilled_metrics_caption":"Expédié par le vendeur","sp_health_suspected_intellectual_property_violations":"Suspicion de violations de propriété intellectuelle","sp_health_time_window":"Fenêtre horaire : ${hash-get numDays} jours","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_caption":"Taux de suivi valide","sp_health_valid_tracking_rate_subtitle":"<b>Objectif</b> : supérieur à ${hash-get targetValue}","sp_health_view_details":"Afficher les détails","sp_health_view_details_pagination_index":"\\\\${currentIndex} sur \\\\${lastIndex}","sp_health_violation_details_next":"Suivant","sp_health_violation_details_stale_page_dialog_title":"Page introuvable","sp_health_violation_details_stale_page_message":"Cette page n’existe plus.","sp_navbar_more_button":"Plus","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_defects":"Cette commande ne présente actuellement aucun défaut.","sp_order_defects_by_order_no_order":"Cette commande n’existe pas.","sp_pw_health_detail_table_appeal_violation_link":"Contestation","sp_st_heading_order_asin":"ASIN","sp_st_heading_order_edd":"Date de livraison estimée","sp_st_heading_order_esd":"Date d’expédition estimée","sp_st_heading_order_image":"Image","sp_st_heading_order_title":"Titre","sp_st_str_with_description":"${hash-get description} : ${hash-get str}","sp_st_zero_out_metrics_message":"Les commandes reçues avant le 1er juin ne sont pas utilisées pour évaluer l’état de votre compte et ne s’affichent pas ici.","tab_demo_generated_text":"Onglet généré automatiquement {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"Nom de l’onglet {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Onglet sélectionné","tab_demo_selected_text":"Contenu de l’onglet initialement sélectionné","tab_demo_text":"Contenu de l’onglet {tabId}","ts-ingress-ahd":" <a id=\'submission-channel-link\' href=\'#\'>Signalez un abus</a> des politiques d\'Amazon."}},"fr-BE":{"pages.floatingWidget":{"DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_content":"Vous participez à une expérience visant à améliorer l’expérience vendeur : à compter de maintenant, de bonnes performances en matière de taux de contacts avec les acheteurs, de délai de réponse et de taux de mécontentement des acheteurs peuvent booster votre score d’évaluation de l’état du compte ! Ce changement permet à l’évaluation de l’état du compte de récompenser un excellent service client. Vérifiez vos performances du service client sur le Gestionnaire des évaluations dès maintenant.","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_header":"Optimisez votre l’évaluation de l’état du compte grâce à un service client de qualité","DYK_JP_LINE_content":"Le compte officiel Amazon LINE envoie des notifications sélectionnées concernant les notifications que nous avons envoyées par e-mail et via Seller Central, celles nécessitant que les vendeurs prennent des mesures concernant des sujets tels que l’état de leur compte et de leurs mises en vente et les erreurs de versement des paiements. Connectez votre compte Seller Central au compte officiel LINE pour recevoir des notifications via LINE et éviter de manquer des notifications importantes. En savoir plus","DYK_JP_LINE_cta_done":"En savoir plus sur les notifications essentielles LINE","DYK_JP_LINE_header":"Vous pouvez vous connecter à votre compte LINE pour recevoir des messages personnalisés importants qui comptent pour l’état de votre compte.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_content":"Bonne nouvelle ! Vous êtes éligible à l’assurance pour l’état du compte dans les 60 jours. Conservez une évaluation de l’état du compte supérieure à 250 et conservez un numéro de contact d’urgence valide pour garantir une protection améliorée de votre compte. Nous vous informerons par e-mail une fois que vous serez automatiquement inscrit.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_cta_done":"En savoir plus sur l’assurance pour l’état du compte (AHA)","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_header":"Inscription à l’assurance pour l’état du compte","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_content":"Votre évaluation de l’état du compte a maintenant le statut À risque ou Mauvais. Cliquez sur « Appelez-moi maintenant » pour discuter avec un spécialiste de l’état du compte afin de protéger vos droits de vente.","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_cta_done":"Appelez-moi maintenant.","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_header":"Votre évaluation de l’état du compte demande votre attention.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_DietarySupp_content":"Protégez vos mises en vente de compléments alimentaires par le biais de la Conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à envoyer des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_Toys_content":"Protégez vos mises en vente dans la catégorie Jeux et Jouets par le biais de la Conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à envoyer des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_artscrafts_content":"Protégez vos produits mis en vente de la catégorie Arts et Artisanat grâce à la conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à envoyer des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_buttoncellbatteryproducts_content":"Protégez vos mises en vente de la catégorie Piles bouton par le biais de la Conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à envoyer des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_childrensproducts_content":"Protégez vos mises en vente de la catégorie Produits pour enfants par le biais de la Conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à envoyer des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_cta_done":"Inscrivez-vous aujourd’hui","DYK_SSAT_CFT_electronics_content":"Protégez vos produits mis en vente de la catégorie Produits électroniques par le biais de la conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à envoyer des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_emobilityproducts_content":"Protégez vos mises en vente de la catégorie E-mobilité par le biais de la Conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à envoyer des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_firesafety_content":"Protégez vos produits mis en vente de la catégorie Sécurité incendie par le biais de la conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à envoyer des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_furniture_content":"Protégez vos produits mis en vente dans la catégorie Meubles par le biais de la conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à envoyer des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_header":"Simplifiez la conformité : inscrivez-vous à la Conformité simplifiée dès aujourd’hui","DYK_SSAT_CFT_infantbabyproducts_content":"Protégez vos mises en vente des catégories Bébé et Puériculture par le biais de la Conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à envoyer des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_ppe_content":"Protégez vos mises en vente de la catégorie Équipements de protection individuelle par le biais de la Conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à envoyer des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_EDU_content":"L’évaluation de l’état du compte surveille les risques de désactivation de votre compte par le biais d’un système de points. Vous gagnez des points pour traiter les commandes avec succès. Vous perdez des points lorsque des violations de politiques sont détectées, et vous récupérez des points lorsque vous les traitez avec succès. Consultez régulièrement votre tableau de bord État du compte et traitez les violations de politiques à mesure qu’elles se produisent.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_content":"Nous sommes ravis d’annoncer le lancement du programme Défi Vendeur, une nouvelle fonctionnalité destinée aux vendeurs bénéficiant de l’Assurance pour l’état du compte. Le programme Défi Vendeur offre un nombre limité de recommandations pour demander un examen distinct des problèmes de mise en vente via votre page État du compte. Une fois que vous avez soumis un défi, nous nous efforçons de vous communiquer une décision sous 48 heures.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_header":"Présentation de Défi Vendeur","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop":"Saviez-vous que tant que vous n’aurez commis aucune violation, votre score ne sera pas inférieur à 200, même si votre nombre de commandes diminue ?","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop_header":"Conseil pour une bonne évaluation de l’état du compte","ahd_dyk_bhdr_content":"Nous vous recommandons de livrer plus de 90 % de vos expéditions commerciales Amazon Business pendant les heures ouvrables afin de maintenir une bonne expérience client.","ahd_dyk_bhdr_cta":"Consulter les performances","ahd_dyk_bhdr_header":"Votre taux de livraison pendant les heures ouvrables est faible.","ahd_dyk_br_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Votre boutique Amazon.com.br (Brésil) risque d’être désactivée.","ahd_dyk_cta_eukyc":"Effectuer la vérification","ahd_dyk_de_sup_label":"Conformément à la politique allemande relative aux produits plastiques à usage unique : REP (en vigueur depuis le 1er janvier 2025), prenez les mesures nécessaires dès maintenant en fournissant des numéros d’immatriculation REP pour chaque combinaison de type de produit et de marque. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GA4JYZX23CLK8WFW\\">En savoir plus</a>","ahd_dyk_de_sup_title":"Vous avez des mises en vente concernées par la responsabilité élargie des producteurs (REP) : plastique à usage unique en Allemagne","ahd_dyk_de_sup_weee_title":"Vous avez des mises en vente concernées par la responsabilité élargie des producteurs (REP) : DEEE en Allemagne","ahd_dyk_description_eukyc":"Conformément à la réglementation européenne, vous devez effectuer une procédure de vérification de votre compte. Consultez la page Informations d’identité pour terminer la vérification. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G201200780 \\">En savoir plus</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_label":"Conformément à la REP, prenez les mesures nécessaires dès maintenant en fournissant des numéros d’immatriculation REP pour chaque combinaison de type de produit et de marque. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GYDCAK9ZR6VJH2X3\\">En savoir plus</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_title":"Vous avez des mises en vente concernées par la responsabilité élargie des producteurs (REP)","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_label":"Conformément à la politique relative aux piles et batteries pour l’UE : REP (en vigueur depuis le 18 août 2025), prenez les mesures nécessaires dès maintenant en fournissant les numéros d’immatriculation REP pour vos catégories de produits. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GPVDATLHQ6PRQNSW\\">En savoir plus</a>","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_title":"Vous avez des mises en vente concernées par la responsabilité élargie des producteurs (REP) : piles et batteries pour l’UE","ahd_dyk_fhdds_description":"Ajoutez les informations d’importation pour toutes vos expéditions concernées dans votre Aperçu des expéditions afin d’éviter toute perturbation de votre activité. L’absence de détails sur l’importation peut restreindre votre capacité à créer de nouvelles expéditions au Royaume-Uni.","ahd_dyk_fhdds_header":"Certaines de vos expéditions n’ont pas de numéro d’importation (IEN).","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"Vous avez des actions en suspens avant de pouvoir commencer à vendre dans la boutique <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.com.br/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.com.br</a>.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_subtitle":"Soumettez des informations pour compléter les exigences de vérification pour vendre au Brésil.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"Vous avez des actions en suspens avant de pouvoir commencer à vendre dans la boutique <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.ca/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.ca</a>.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_subtitle":"Soumettez des informations pour compléter les exigences de vérification pour vendre au Canada.","ahd_dyk_title_eukyc":"Effectuez votre vérification européenne Connaissance du client (KYC)","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description":"Afin de vous conformer au règlement GPSR, qui entre en vigueur le 13 décembre 2024, veuillez fournir des informations de conformité supplémentaires pour vos produits afin d\'éviter tout impact sur vos offres. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">En savoir plus</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description_post_impact":"Pour respecter le règlement RSGP (entrant en vigueur le 13 décembre 2024) et empêcher la désactivation des produits mis en vente, prenez des mesures dès maintenant en fournissant des informations de conformité supplémentaires pour vos produits. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">En savoir plus</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_task":"Vous avez des mises en vente concernées par le Règlement relatif à la sécurité générale des produits (RSGP).","ahd_floating_widget_aha_ec_description":"En tant que membre du programme d’Assurance État du compte, vous <b>devez</b> conserver un numéro de contact d’urgence valide. Vérifiez vos coordonnées d’urgence pour rester éligible au programme d’Assurance État du compte afin que nos spécialistes puissent vous contacter et vous aider à résoudre les problèmes majeurs liés à l’état de votre compte avant qu’ils ne perturbent votre activité.","ahd_floating_widget_aha_ec_description_phase2":"Vérifiez votre numéro de contact ci-dessous pour conserver les avantages du programme AHA sans interruption.","ahd_floating_widget_cta_button":"Afficher les mises en vente","ahd_floating_widget_ec_action_panel_title":"Mise à jour des coordonnées de contact en cas d’urgence","ahd_floating_widget_ec_aha_description":"Vérifiez vos coordonnées d’urgence afin que nos spécialistes puissent vous contacter pour vous aider à résoudre les problèmes majeurs liés à l’état de votre compte avant qu’ils ne perturbent votre activité.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_cta_button":"Effectuer la vérification","ahd_floating_widget_ec_description":"Vérifiez vos coordonnées d’urgence afin que nos spécialistes puissent vous contacter pour vous aider à résoudre les problèmes majeurs liés à l’état de votre compte avant qu’ils ne perturbent votre activité.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_task":"Vos coordonnées d’urgence n’ont pas été vérifiées","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_food_and_safety_heading":"Vous avez des violations répétées de type « Problèmes liés à la sécurité des denrées alimentaires et des produits ».","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_ip_heading":"Vous avez des violations répétées pour la réception de réclamations au titre de la propriété intellectuelle.","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_listing_heading":"Vous avez des violations répétées de type « Violations de politiques relatives à la mise en vente ».","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_many_policies_heading":"Vous avez des violations répétées pour plusieurs politiques.","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_other_heading":"Vous avez des violations répétées de type « Autres violations de politiques ».","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_auth_heading":"Vous avez des violations répétées de type « Réclamations des clients concernant l’authenticité des produits ».","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_cond_heading":"Vous avez des violations répétées de type « Réclamations clients relatives à l’état des produits ».","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_reviews_heading":"Vous avez des violations répétées de type « Violations de politiques relatives aux commentaires clients sur les produits ».","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_reg_comp_heading":"Vous avez des violations répétées de type « Conformité aux règlements ».","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_rp_heading":"Vous avez des violations répétées de la politique relative aux produits soumis à des restrictions.","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_sip_heading":"Vous avez des violations répétées de type « Soupçons de violation de propriété intellectuelle ».","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_violations_body":"Les violations répétées d’une même politique de vente peuvent entraîner la désactivation du compte. Corrigez ces problèmes pour éviter toute interruption inutile affectant votre compte vendeur.","dyk_ahd_pra_rv":"Vous avez des violations répétées Violations de la politique relatives aux commentaires client sur les produits"},"pages.homepage":{"DR_VAT_AHD_NC_BANNER":"Nous n’avons pas pu vérifier l’implantation de votre entreprise aux fins de la TVA. Pour garantir l’exactitude du traitement fiscal, attestez votre pays d’implantation aux fins de la TVA.","DR_VAT_AHD_PRIORITY_ACTION":"Vérification de l’implantation requise aux fins de la TVA","Engage_Appeal_05":"Code de conduite du vendeur (influencer les clients de manière avantageuse pour manipuler vos notes de vente, vos commentaires ou vos avis)","LocalizedPageTitleDetailCustomerSatisfaction":"page Détails satisfaction client.","LocalizedPageTitleDetailProductPolicies":"Page détaillée sur les politiques des produits.","NO_METRICS":"Vous n’avez actuellement aucune commande contribuant à cet indicateur.\\n","acf_banner_inform_act":"Afin de respecter la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">loi américaine de protection des consommateurs (INFORM Consumers Act)</a>, Amazon doit collecter et vérifier les informations relatives à votre compte Vendre sur Amazon. Actuellement, vous avez un ou plusieurs éléments à vérifier. Consultez la liste ci-dessous et accédez à <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Informations sur le Compte Vendeur</a> pour démarrer la vérification.","acf_inform_act_wait_text":"Merci d’avoir confirmé votre identité. Revenez dans 24 heures pour vérifier si des informations supplémentaires sont requises. ","acf_inform_act_widget_description":"Une fois la vérification d’identité terminée, il peut vous être demandé de confirmer l’un ou plusieurs des éléments supplémentaires ci-dessous.","addTab_label":"Ajouter un onglet","aef_address_your_violation":"Remédier à votre violation","ahd_account_health_notification":"Notification sur l’état du compte Amazon","ahd_account_regulatory_compliance":"Conformité à la réglementation","ahd_action_panel_hd":"Les versements de vos comptes vendeur Amazon ont été mis en attente.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"<b>Votre compte risque d’être désactivé.</b><br><br>Afin de respecter la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">loi américaine pour les consommateurs (INFORM Consumers Act)</a>, Amazon doit collecter et vérifier les informations relatives à votre compte Vendre sur Amazon. Actuellement, vous avez un ou plusieurs éléments à vérifier. Consultez la liste ci-dessous et accédez à <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Informations sur le Compte Vendeur</a> pour démarrer la vérification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_aha":"<b> Remarque : si vous n’avez pas terminé tous les articles de vérification lorsque la loi sur les consommateurs INFORM prend effet, votre compte peut être désactivé, quelle que soit votre inscription au programme Assurance État du compte.</b>","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_thankyou":"<b>Loi américaine pour les consommateurs (INFORM Consumers Act)</b><br><br>Nous avons terminé toutes les vérifications en cours. Nous apprécions vos efforts en faveur de ce processus de vérification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_v2":"<b>Votre compte risque d’être désactivé.</b><br><br>Afin de respecter la <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>loi américaine sur les consommateurs INFORM</a>, qui entre en vigueur le 27 juin 2023, Amazon doit collecter et vérifier les informations relatives à votre compte Vendre sur Amazon. Actuellement, vous avez un ou plusieurs éléments à vérifier. Consultez la page <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Informations sur le compte</a> pour commencer la vérification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_school_supplies":"Nous avons identifié que vous possédez une ou plusieurs mises en vente susceptibles d’être retirées en raison de la non-conformité aux réglementations locales, étatiques et fédérales concernant la vente de fournitures scolaires pour enfants. Pour en savoir plus sur ces exigences de conformité, cliquez <a href=/gp/help/external/help.html?itemID=XT3EFQS54LRKYM3&language=en_US&ref=ahd_uspc_adhoc_banner>ici</a>. Pour éviter le retrait d’une mise en vente, consultez vos mises en vente couvertes par cette exigence de conformité <a href=/performance/account/health/product-policies?t=safe>ici</a>et suivez les instructions répertoriées sous « Étapes suivantes » en regard de la ou des mises en vente susceptibles d’être retirées afin de vous assurer de la conformité à ces exigences.","ahd_adhoc_mobile_inform_act_aha":"Remarque : si vous n’effectuez pas toutes les étapes de vérification dans les délais spécifiés, il se peut que votre compte soit désactivé, quelle que soit votre inscription au programme Account Health Assurance (Assurance État du compte).","ahd_aef_IPI_priority_action":"Vérification virtuelle d’identité","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_instruction":"Vous devez soumettre des documents et assister à un appel vidéo pour la vérification de votre identité.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_join_call_link":"Rendez-vous sur le <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">portail de vérification d’identité</a> pour vous joindre à l’appel vidéo programmé.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_next_steps":"Consultez le <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">portail de vérification d’identité</a> pour soumettre les documents requis et prendre part à un appel vidéo pour la vérification virtuelle d’identité. Vous avez également la possibilité de programmer un appel vidéo à une date et une heure ultérieures après avoir soumis les documents requis.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason":"Un examen de votre activité a révélé que votre compte a peut-être été utilisé à des fins frauduleuses, trompeuses ou illégales, ce qui peut, conformément à l’article 3 du <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">contrat Amazon Services Business Solutions</a>, conduire à la désactivation de votre compte. Pour protéger nos clients et nos partenaires de vente, nous devons vérifier l’identité de nos vendeurs via un processus de vérification d’identité virtuelle qui se déroule par appel vidéo. ","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason_eu":"Un examen de votre activité a révélé que votre compte a peut-être été utilisé à des fins frauduleuses, trompeuses ou illégales, ce qui peut, conformément à l’article 3 du <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G201190440\\">contrat Amazon Services Business Solutions</a>, conduire à la désactivation de votre compte. Pour protéger nos clients et nos partenaires de vente, nous devons vérifier l’identité de nos vendeurs via un processus de vérification d’identité virtuelle qui se déroule par appel vidéo.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_review_fail":"L’examen de votre activité et des informations que vous avez fournies lors de votre vérification virtuelle d’identité ont révélé que votre compte a peut-être été utilisé à des fins frauduleuses, trompeuses ou illégales, ce qui constitue une violation de l’article 3 du <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">contrat Amazon Services Business Solutions</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_under_review":"Nous examinons actuellement les informations que vous nous avez fournies pour vérifier votre identité. Le processus d’examen peut prendre jusqu’à cinq jours ouvrés.","ahd_aef_action_panel_RA_reason":"Notre examen indique que vous disposez d’un compte distinct qui a été désactivé en raison d’une violation de l’une de nos politiques. Par conséquent, le compte vendeur actuel enfreint notre Politique Amazon relative aux comptes vendeur multiples, définie dans le <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G1801\\">Code de conduite du vendeur</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_post_deactivation_appeal":"Si vous pensez que votre compte a été désactivé par erreur, vous pouvez soumettre de nouvelles informations en cliquant sur le bouton « Contester » ci-dessous.","ahd_aef_action_panel_scheduled_status_plural":"Vous avez programmé un appel vidéo pour votre vérification virtuelle d’identité le ${date}, dans ${numberofdays} jours.","ahd_aef_action_panel_scheduled_status_singular":"Vous avez programmé un appel vidéo pour votre vérification virtuelle d’identité le ${date}, dans ${numberofday} jour.","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_food_and_prod_subreason":"Problèmes liés à la sécurité des denrées alimentaires et des produits","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_listing_subreason":"Violations de politiques sur la mise en vente","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_other_subreason":"Autres violations de politiques","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_cond_subreason":"Réclamations clients relatives à l’état des produits","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_review_subreason":"Violations de politiques relatives aux commentaires client sur les produits","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rip_subreason":"Réclamations concernant la propriété intellectuelle reçues","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_sip_subreason":"Soupçons de violation de propriété intellectuelle","ahd_aef_at_risk_HD_card_body":"Pour réactiver vos versements, consultez vos actions prioritaires et traitez les actions en attente.","ahd_aef_at_risk_card_sc_body":"Vous avez une ou plusieurs actions en suspens qui entraîneront la désactivation de votre compte.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_action":"Réactiver maintenant","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_body":"Résolvez les problèmes liés à l’état de votre compte pour le réactiver. Une fois les problèmes résolus, votre compte sera réactivé dans un délai de 24 heures.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_sc_body":"Résolvez les problèmes liés à l’état de votre compte pour le réactiver.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_title":"Votre compte a été désactivé.","ahd_aef_denver_eu":"Vérifiez l’implantation dans l’UE pour la taxe sur la valeur ajoutée (TVA).","ahd_aef_denver_uk":"Vérifiez l’implantation au Royaume-Uni pour la taxe sur la valeur ajoutée (TVA).","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_post_deactivation":"Cliquez sur le bouton « Contester » ci-dessous et suivez les instructions fournies afin de réactiver ce compte vendeur.","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_pre_deactivation":"Cliquez sur le bouton « Contester » ci-dessous et suivez les instructions fournies afin d’éviter la désactivation de ce compte vendeur.","ahd_aef_next_steps_header":"Remédier à votre violation","ahd_aef_pending_critical":"Évènement critique en attente","ahd_aef_pending_critical_message":"Cela deviendra critique si ce n’est pas résolu et entraînera la désactivation de votre compte.","ahd_aef_pending_critical_message_no_cap":"Cela deviendra critique si ce n’est pas résolu et entraînera la désactivation de votre compte.","ahd_aef_pending_deactivation_HD_card_title":"La désactivation de votre compte est en attente et les versements de votre compte vendeur Amazon ont été mis en attente.","ahd_aef_priority_action_scheduled_status_plural":"Appel vidéo prévu pour le ${date}, dans ${numberofdays} jours","ahd_aef_priority_action_scheduled_status_singular":"Appel vidéo prévu pour le ${date}, dans ${numberofday} jour","ahd_aef_submit_header":"Soumettre vos informations","ahd_ahr_pending_critical":"Évènement critique en attente","ahd_ahr_section_sub_section":"Cette évaluation indique votre respect des politiques de vente d’Amazon. <a href=/help/hub/reference/G200205250?ref=ahd-ahr-lm target=‘_blank’>En savoir plus</a>.","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_body":"Une fois les violations contestées avec succès, votre compte sera examiné en vue d’être réactivé. ","ahd_banner_block_mfn_at_risk_subtitle":"Vos offres Expédié par le vendeur ont été désactivées et votre compte risque de l’être également. Réalisez vos Actions prioritaires pour réactiver vos offres Expédié par le vendeur et empêcher sa désactivation.","ahd_banner_block_mfn_subtitle":"Vos offres Expédié par le vendeur ont été désactivées. Réalisez vos Actions prioritaires pour réactiver vos offres Expédié par le vendeur.","ahd_banner_eg_trn":"<b>Votre compte risque d’être désactivé. </b><br><br>Votre compte risque d’être désactivé, car votre compte Seller Central n’inclut pas votre numéro d’immatriculation fiscale valide. Consultez la page </a>Paramètres fiscaux<a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations> pour mettre à jour vos informations fiscales dans un délai de 90 jours à compter de la date de votre première mise en vente de produit sur Amazon, afin d’éviter la désactivation de votre compte. Pour plus d’informations, consultez la page d’aide « Foire aux questions sur la conformité des taxes »<a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC>. </a>","ahd_be_jsl_at_risk_banner":"<b>Votre compte risque d’être désactivé. </b><br><br> Vous n’avez pas fourni votre numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA belge (VRN) ou confirmé le statut de l’Union One-Stop Shop (OSS) pour votre pays de résidence dans votre compte Amazon Seller Central. Consultez la <a href=/help/hub/reference/external/GGTX8THLMMDJ3WBP> nouvelle législation belge</a> pour en savoir plus sur cette obligation et fournir des informations.","ahd_brkyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Consultez le statut de votre vérification sur la page <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional\\n?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Informations sur l’identité </a>.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"Conformément à la législation brésilienne, la vérification de votre identité est obligatoire pour que vous puissiez utiliser notre service et vous devez nous fournir certains renseignements ou documents afin de faciliter ces vérifications. Nous sommes susceptibles de vous fournir des informations supplémentaires sur cette demande dans vos notifications sur la performance.\\r\\n<br><br>Votre compte a été désactivé, car nous n’avons pas pu valider vos informations d’identité.<br><br> \\r\\nPour plus d’informations, consultez la page d’aide <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Informations requises pour vendre sur Amazon</a>.","ahd_brkyc_rap_intro":"Conformément à la législation brésilienne, la vérification de votre identité est obligatoire pour que vous puissiez utiliser notre service. Vous devez nous fournir certaines informations ou certains documents afin de faciliter ces vérifications. Nous sommes susceptibles de vous fournir des informations supplémentaires sur cette demande dans vos notifications sur la performance.\\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nPour plus d’informations, consultez la page d’aide <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Informations requises pour vendre sur Amazon</a>.","ahd_brkyc_rap_verifying":"Nous sommes en train de valider vos informations et vous demanderons peut-être des renseignements pendant cet examen. Vérifiez les sections <a href=\'/performance/notifications\\r\\n?ref_=to_brkyc_pn_from_intro_blurb’target=’_blank’>Notifications sur la performance</a> et répondez à toutes les demandes relatives à votre compte Vendre sur Amazon. Cette validation peut prendre jusqu’à 24 heures, voire 10 jours ouvrés dans certains cas. Durant cette période, les informations relatives à votre identité ne peuvent pas être modifiées.","ahd_cakyc_priority_action":"Vérification de l’identité au Canada","ahd_cakyc_rap_action":"Fournissez vos informations de vérification d’identité avant la date d’échéance indiquée afin d’éviter la désactivation du compte. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_action_hd":"Fournissez vos informations de vérification d’identité avant la date d’échéance indiquée afin d’éviter la désactivation du compte. Si vous ne commencez pas la vérification et que vous disposez encore de 15 jours ou moins, votre capacité à verser des fonds depuis votre compte vendeur Amazon.ca sera entravée. La vérification est requise par la loi canadienne.","ahd_cakyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Vérifiez l’état de votre vérification sur la page <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Informations sur l’identité</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"Votre compte a été désactivé, car nous n’avons pas pu valider vos informations d’identité.  Les lois canadiennes exigent que nous vérifiions votre identité afin que nous puissions vous permettre d’utiliser notre service. Pour réactiver votre compte, soumettez les informations nécessaires pour vérifier votre identité. \\r\\n<br><br>Pour plus d’informations, consultez la page d’aide <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Informations requises pour vendre sur Amazon</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_identity_info":"Consultez la page <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Informations d’identité</a> pour terminer la vérification. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_intro":"La loi canadienne exige que nous vérifiions votre identité pour vous permettre d’utiliser notre service. Vous devez nous fournir certaines informations et certains documents afin que nous puissions effectuer ces vérifications. <br><br>Pour plus d’informations, consultez la page d’aide <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Informations requises pour vendre sur Amazon</a> ou consultez vos <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Notifications sur la performance</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_self_trigger_cta":"En cliquant sur « Commencer la vérification », vous allez poursuivre la vérification des conditions pour le Canada. Consultez la page <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Informations d’identité</a> pour confirmer les étapes suivantes. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_verifying":"Nous sommes en train de valider vos informations. Dans certains cas, cette validation peut prendre entre 24 heures et 10 jours ouvrés. Il est possible que nous devions vous demander plus de détails au cours de cet examen. Consultez la section <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Notifications sur la performance</a> et répondez à toute demande supplémentaire relative à votre compte de vente sur Amazon.  \\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nDurant cette période, les informations relatives à votre identité ne peuvent pas être modifiées.","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_header":"Pourquoi dois-je fournir ces informations ?","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_header2":"Combien de temps ai-je pour fournir ces informations ? ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph":"La loi nous oblige à vérifier votre identité pour vous permettre d’utiliser un compte de vente sur Amazon. Conformément à la législation canadienne, la vérification de votre identité est obligatoire pour que vous puissiez utiliser notre service. Vous devrez peut-être nous fournir certaines informations et certains documents afin de faciliter ces vérifications.<br><br>Pour plus d’informations, consultez la page d’aide <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Informations requises pour vendre sur Amazon</a>.","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph2":"Amazon dispose d’un délai maximum de 60 jours pour effectuer la revérification. Cela n’inclut pas le temps dont nous avons besoin pour effectuer la vérification. Votre capacité à vendre et verser des fonds peut être restreinte si la revérification n’est pas terminée dans un délai de 60 jours. Lorsque nous avons besoin d’informations, une notification apparaît sur la page Informations sur le compte. Nous sommes susceptibles de vous fournir des informations supplémentaires sur cette demande dans vos notifications sur la performance. ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph3":"À terme, vous ne pourrez plus utiliser votre compte de vente sur Amazon. Vous ne pourrez donc plus vendre sur Amazon.ca si vous ne fournissez pas ces informations. ","ahd_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_subtitle":"Vous avez une ou plusieurs actions en suspens à terminer avant de pouvoir commencer à vendre vos produits. ","ahd_compliance_status":"Statut de conformité","ahd_compliance_widget_button":"Soumettre des informations de conformité","ahd_compliance_widget_ckp_redirect":"Référence de conformité de lancement","ahd_compliance_widget_description":"Soumettez des informations de conformité pour prouver la conformité à la réglementation.","ahd_critical_account_health_notification":"Notification critique sur l’état du compte","ahd_critical_policy_violations":"Violations de politiques essentielles","ahd_dac7_at_risk_banner":"<b>Votre compte risque d’être désactivé.</b><br><br> Votre compte risque d’être désactivé en raison d’informations fiscales requises manquantes, conformément à la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB\\">législation DAC7</a>. Consultez le <a href= \\"/complianceportal\\">Portail de Conformité DAC7</a> pour commencer la vérification. ","ahd_dac7_compliant":"Vous êtes conforme au DAC7 maintenant !","ahd_dac7_priority_action":"Informations DAC7 requises","ahd_dac7_priority_action_pending":"Vérification en attente","ahd_dac7_rap_action":"Vous devez désormais soumettre vos informations relatives au DAC7 avant la date d’échéance.","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_launch_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Lancer le portail DAC7 pour soumettre vos informations</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal_status":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_status_blurb\'  target=\'_blank\'>Vérifier l’état de votre vérification sur le portail DAC7</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_deactivated_message":"Votre compte a été désactivé pour non-conformité au 7e amendement à la Directive relative à la coopération administrative (DAC7)","ahd_dac7_rap_intro":"Le <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/external/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB?ref_=to_dac_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>7e amendement à la Directive relative à la coopération administrative (DAC7)</a> est un règlement de l’Union européenne qui oblige Amazon à collecter, vérifier et déclarer les données de diligence raisonnée, de TVA/fiscales et financières des vendeurs résidant dans l’UE, quel que soit le site de vente Amazon dans lequel ils vendent.","ahd_dac7_rap_verify_now_button":"Procéder à la vérification","ahd_dac7_rap_verifying":"Nous examinons actuellement vos informations relatives au DAC7. Le processus d’examen prend généralement 72 heures, mais peut parfois prendre plus de temps dans certains cas. Vérifiez régulièrement l’état de votre vérification dans le portail DAC7 ci-dessous pour savoir si nous avons besoin de plus d’informations.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"Vous avez des actions en suspens avant de commencer à vendre dans la boutique Amazon.com.br.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_subtitle":"Soumettez des informations pour compléter les exigences de vérification pour vendre au Brésil.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"Vous avez des actions en suspens avant de commencer à vendre dans la boutique Amazon.ca.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_subtitle":"Soumettez des informations pour compléter les exigences de vérification pour vendre au Canada.","ahd_educational_banner_header":"Complétez vos actions prioritaires","ahd_educational_banner_subheader":"Vous avez une ou plusieurs actions en attente qui entraîneront la désactivation du compte si elles ne sont pas effectuées d’ici la date indiquée.","ahd_eg_trn_deactivation_banner":"<b>Votre compte a été désactivé.</b><br><br> Pour réactiver votre compte, rendez-vous sur la page <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations>Paramètres fiscaux</a> et mettez à jour vos informations fiscales. Pour plus d’informations, consultez la <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC>page d’aide</a> « Foire aux questions sur la conformité fiscale». ","ahd_error_loading_submit":"Une erreur s’est produite. Essayez de soumettre à nouveau la demande.","ahd_fhdds_priority_action":"IEN requis pour les expéditions reçues au Royaume-Uni","ahd_inform_ac_checkbox_error":"Cochez la case pour confirmer que vous avez passé en revue vos informations et que vous certifiez qu’elles sont exactes et à jour.","ahd_inform_ac_no_poc":"Informations d’identité non fournies. Si vous avez déjà soumis un document fiscal ou un document officiel à la place de ces informations, vous certifiez qu’aucune modification n’a été apportée aux documents soumis.","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p1":"En vertu de la loi américaine sur l’information des consommateurs (US INFORM Consumers Act), vous devez tenir certaines informations commerciales (voir ci-dessous) à jour et certifier électroniquement à Amazon que vous avez mis à jour vos informations ou que les informations déjà fournies sont toujours à jour. Certifiez que vos informations ci-dessous sont à jour dans les 10 jours suivant la consultation de cette notification, faute de quoi votre compte risque d’être désactivé. ","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p2":"Vous avez désormais 10 jours, suite à la première consultation de cette notification, pour certifier que les informations ci-dessous sont à jour. En l’absence de certification, votre compte risque d’être désactivé.","ahd_inform_ac_page1_checkbox":"Cochez la case pour confirmer que vous comprenez qu’une fois que vous serez sur la page Notification et Certification relative à la loi sur l’information (INFORM Act), vous recevrez une notification et disposerez de 10 jours pour mettre à jour et certifier vos informations.","ahd_inform_ac_page1_step1_intructions":"Accédez à la page <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Infos sur le compte</a> ou cliquez sur le bouton Modifier pour mettre à jour les informations incorrectes ci-dessous. ","ahd_inform_ac_page2_certify_instructions":"Si vos informations ci-dessous sont à jour, vous pouvez les certifier dès maintenant. Si des informations sont incorrectes, accédez à la page <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Informations sur le compte</a> pour les modifier avant de cliquer sur « Certifier ».","ahd_inform_ac_refresh_update_info":"Si vous avez mis à jour des informations ci-dessous, cliquez ici pour actualiser la page et consulter les nouvelles informations.","ahd_inform_account_information_update_verification":"Les informations de votre compte ont été mises à jour et nous sommes en train de les vérifier. Revenez dans 24 heures et déterminez si des étapes supplémentaires sont nécessaires pour commencer le processus de certification annuelle.","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_confirmation":"En cliquant sur « Certifier », je certifie que j’ai lu la notification ci-dessus et que les informations que j’ai fournies à Amazon sont exactes et correctes, correspondent à mon activité et ne sont pas détournées.","ahd_inform_act_ac_edit_information":"Modifier les informations","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"E-mail","ahd_inform_act_ac_not_required":"La loi sur l’information (INFORM Act) ne s’applique pas encore à votre entreprise. Vous n’êtes donc pas tenu de certifier vos informations. Nous vous informerons ultérieurement si vous devez certifier vos informations.","ahd_inform_act_ac_notice_title":"Notification","ahd_inform_act_ac_short_description":"Vérifiez vos exigences en attente en ce qui concerne la loi sur l’information des consommateurs (INFORM Act) et conformez-vous-y.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou":"Merci d’avoir certifié que les informations relatives à votre entreprise sont à jour. Votre page État du compte sera mise à jour dans quelques minutes pour confirmer que vous avez respecté les exigences relatives à la Notification et Certification conformément à la loi sur l’information (INFORM Act).","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou_banner":"Merci d’avoir certifié que les informations relatives à votre entreprise sont à jour. Votre page État du compte sera mise à jour dans quelques minutes pour confirmer que vous vous êtes acquitté des exigences en attente relatives à la notification et à la certification de la loi sur l’information des consommateurs (INFORM Act).\\n<br><br>N’oubliez pas que vous devez tenir vos informations commerciales à jour et certifier au moins une fois par an que votre nom, votre adresse, votre numéro de téléphone, votre adresse e-mail, vos coordonnées bancaires et votre numéro d’identification fiscale sont corrects.","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions":"Notez que seul l’utilisateur principal ou secondaire disposant d’autorisations pour confirmer/modifier les informations du compte sera en mesure de les certifier.","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions_error":"Ces informations doivent être certifiées par l’utilisateur principal du compte ou un utilisateur secondaire autorisé à confirmer/modifier les informations du compte.","ahd_inform_act_account_information":"Informations de compte","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_deactivation_banner":"Afin de respecter la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">loi américaine pour les consommateurs (INFORM Consumers Act)</a>, Amazon doit collecter et vérifier les informations relatives à votre compte Vendre sur Amazon. Comme nous n’avons pas reçu les informations demandées, votre compte a été désactivé. Pour réactiver votre compte, consultez la liste ci-dessous et accédez à <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Informations sur le compte vendeur</a> afin de terminer la vérification. <br><br>Une fois que vous aurez vérifié toutes les exigences requises, votre compte sera réactivé sous 48 heures. ","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_hold_banner":"<b>Votre compte risque d’être désactivé et les versements de votre compte vendeur Amazon ont été mis en attente.</b><br><br>Afin de respecter la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">loi américaine pour les consommateurs (INFORM Consumers Act)</a>, Amazon doit collecter et vérifier les informations relatives à votre compte Vendre sur Amazon. Comme nous n’avons pas reçu les informations demandées dans les délais indiqués dans nos communications, vos versements sont désormais mis en attente. Pour réactiver vos versements, consultez la liste ci-dessous et accédez aux <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Informations sur le Compte Vendeur</a> pour commencer ou finaliser vos soumissions d’informations.","ahd_inform_act_hold_wait_text":"Pour réactiver vos versements et empêcher la désactivation de votre compte, cliquez sur les actions ci-dessous pour accéder à <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Informations sur le compte vendeur</a> et remplir les exigences requises. <br><br>Nous vous remercions d’avoir terminé la vérification de votre identité. Vérifiez dans 24 heures si d’autres étapes de vérification sont nécessaires.","ahd_inform_act_hold_widget_description":"Pour réactiver vos versements et empêcher la désactivation de votre compte, cliquez sur les actions ci-dessous pour accéder à <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Informations sur le compte vendeur</a> et remplir les exigences requises. <br><br>Une fois la vérification d’identité terminée, il peut vous être demandé de confirmer l’un ou plusieurs des éléments supplémentaires ci-dessous.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_wait_text":"Cliquez sur les actions ci-dessous pour remplir les exigences requises. Nous vous remercions d’avoir terminé la vérification de votre identité. Vérifiez dans 24 heures si d’autres étapes de vérification sont nécessaires.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_widget_description":"Cliquez sur les actions ci-dessous pour remplir les exigences requises. Une fois la vérification d’identité terminée, il peut vous être demandé de confirmer l’un ou plusieurs des éléments supplémentaires ci-dessous.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_widget_help":"En savoir plus sur la loi INFORM","ahd_inform_act_need_help":"Besoin d’aide ? Consultez <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>la page d’aide relative à la loi sur l’information (INFORM Act)</a>.","ahd_inform_act_short_description":"Vérifiez vos exigences en attente en ce qui concerne la loi sur l’information des consommateurs (INFORM Act) et conformez-vous-y.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete":"<b>Loi américaine pour les consommateurs (INFORM Consumers Act)</b><br><br>Nous avons terminé toutes les vérifications en cours. Nous apprécions vos efforts en faveur de ce processus de vérification.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete_short":"<b>Loi américaine pour les consommateurs (INFORM Consumers Act)</b><br><br>Nous avons terminé toutes les vérifications en cours. Nous apprécions vos efforts en faveur de ce processus de vérification.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete_widget":"Nous avons réussi à finaliser toutes les vérifications en cours. Nous apprécions vos efforts en faveur de ce processus de vérification.","ahd_inform_act_wait_text":"Merci d’avoir confirmé votre identité. Revenez dans 24 heures pour vérifier si des informations supplémentaires sont requises. <br><br> Cliquez sur les actions ci-dessous pour accéder à la page <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Informations sur le compte vendeur</a> et remplir les exigences requises.","ahd_inform_act_widget_description":"Cliquez sur les actions ci-dessous pour accéder à la page <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Informations sur le Compte Vendeur</a> et remplir les exigences requises. <br><br>Une fois la vérification d’identité terminée, il peut vous être demandé de confirmer l’un ou plusieurs des éléments supplémentaires ci-dessous.","ahd_inform_act_widget_title":"Loi INFORM relative aux consommateurs","ahd_inform_annual_cerification_risk_banner":"Vous devez tenir à jour les informations sur votre activité pour obtenir la certification","ahd_inform_annual_review_banner":"<b>Votre compte risque d’être désactivé. </b><br><br>Afin de respecter la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7?ref_=ahd_annual_ inform_consumer_act\\">loi sur l’information des consommateurs</a>, les informations de votre compte Vendre sur Amazon doivent être certifiées chaque année. Consultez la page <a href=\\"/mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render?ref_=ahd_annual_inform_certification\\">Certification Annuelle</a> pour certifier que vos informations sont à jour.","ahd_inform_annual_review_complete":"<b>Loi sur les consommateurs INFORM</b><br><br> Merci de remplir toutes les exigences restantes.","ahd_inform_annual_review_seller_enforced":"Pour vous conformer à la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">loi sur les consommateurs INFORM</a>, vous devez certifier l’exactitude des informations de votre compte Vendre sur Amazon au moins une fois par an. Comme nous n’avons pas reçu la certification demandée, votre compte a été désactivé. Pour réactiver votre compte, rendez-vous sur la page <a href=\\" /mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render\\">Certification annuelle</a> afin de certifier que vos informations sont à jour. <br><br> Une fois la certification terminée, votre compte sera réactivé dans un délai de 48 heures.","ahd_inform_bav_not_verified":"Vous n’avez pas de compte bancaire vérifié ou n’avez pas désigné ce dernier comme mode de versement par défaut sur le site de vente américain. Vérifiez et désignez votre compte bancaire par défaut sur la page <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Mode de versement</a>.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p1":"N’oubliez pas que vous devez tenir vos informations commerciales à jour et certifier au moins une fois par an que votre nom, votre adresse, votre numéro de téléphone, votre adresse e-mail, vos coordonnées bancaires et votre numéro d’identification fiscale sont corrects.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p2":"Si l’une de vos informations change, Amazon devra également vérifier ces nouvelles informations. Répondez rapidement à toute demande d’informations afin que nous puissions travailler avec vous pour terminer ces étapes de vérification supplémentaires et éviter toute désactivation de compte. Pour plus d’informations sur le processus de vérification, consultez <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>la page d’aide relative à la loi sur l’information (INFORM Act)</a>.","ahd_inform_consumers_act_ac":"Notification et Certification conformément à la loi sur l’information (INFORM Act)","ahd_inform_consumers_act_annual":"Certification annuelle de la loi américaine pour les consommateurs (INFORM Consumers Act) ","ahd_inform_debit_card":"Vous devez vérifier votre compte bancaire actif secondaire pour continuer à recevoir des versements pour le site de vente américain. Vérifiez votre compte bancaire sur la page <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Mode de versement</a>.","ahd_inform_loading_error":"Accédez à la page <a href=/hz/sc/account-information target=\\"_blank\\">Informations sur le compte</a> pour consulter vos données actuelles.","ahd_inform_no_default_deposit":"Vous n’avez pas de compte bancaire vérifié ou vous n’avez pas désigné le compte vérifié comme mode de versement par défaut sur le site de vente des États-Unis. Vérifiez et désignez votre compte bancaire par défaut sur la page <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Mode de versement</a>.","ahd_inform_page1_checkbox":"Je comprends qu’une fois que j’aurai accédé à la page Notification et Certification relative à la loi sur l’information (INFORM Act), je dois effectuer la certification dans un délai de 10 jours afin d’éviter tout risque de désactivation du compte. ","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2a":"Nous commencerons à envoyer une notification formelle aux vendeurs pour qu’ils vérifient et certifient que les informations sur leur entreprise sont correctes.","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2b":"Vous ne devez toutefois pas attendre de recevoir la notification officielle et vous pouvez prendre des mesures dès maintenant pour éviter le risque d’une désactivation ultérieure de votre compte.","ahd_inform_page1_proceed_title":"Passer à la page Notification et Certification conformément à la loi sur l’information (INFORM Act)","ahd_inform_page1_step2_description":"Si vos informations sont à jour ou que vous venez de les mettre à jour, passez à l’étape suivante (l’avis et la certification) pour recevoir une notification officielle et terminer votre certification. Après avoir reçu cette notification, vous devez certifier vos informations dans un délai de 10 jours conformément à la loi.","ahd_inform_page_1_p1":"Nous nous engageons à offrir une expérience d’achat digne de confiance pour vous et pour les clients. Afin de respecter cet engagement, nous collecterons et vérifierons certaines informations commerciales auprès de vous au moins une fois par an, notamment les informations requises par la loi américaine sur la protection des consommateurs INFORM.","ahd_inform_sw_bav":"Vous devez vérifier vos comptes bancaires actifs. Vérifiez vos comptes bancaires sur la page <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Mode de versement</a>.","ahd_inform_tax_q_redirect":"Rendez-vous sur la page du <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/1099KTaxInformation/step/1099KTaxInformation?immediateRedirect=true&intent=INFORM_ACT target=\\"_blank\\">questionnaire fiscal INFORM</a> pour consulter vos informations actuelles.","ahd_itr_extension_extension_request_link":"Soumettez les documents requis.","ahd_itr_extension_request":"Si vous souhaitez demander une extension ou une exemption de ces exigences, ${appealUrl}.","ahd_itr_rap_appeals":"J’ai mis à jour mes informations fiscales italiennes dans les paramètres fiscaux et je souhaite demander une nouvelle validation.","ahd_itr_rap_dispute":"Je ne suis pas d’accord avec la décision d’Amazon concernant la validation de mon code fiscal italien.","ahd_itr_rap_intro":"La <a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>loi italienne no 157/2019</a> oblige les vendeurs basés en Italie effectuant une ou plusieurs transactions sur Amazon.it à ajouter leur « codice fiscale » italien dans leurs paramètres fiscaux.","ahd_itr_remediation_corp":"Soumettez votre codice fiscale italien dans les paramètres fiscaux <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. Selon nos informations (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), votre compte est enregistré en tant que société et nous avons donc besoin de votre numéro d’immatriculation commerciale (appelé « codice fiscale », correspondant au numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA sans le code pays « IT »). Consultez la page d’aide (sur la <a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>loi italienne no 157/2019</a>) pour connaître les étapes de soumission. Vous devez vous assurer que votre nom légal figurant sur la page Informations commerciales (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) et que votre numéro d’immatriculation commerciale figurant dans les paramètres fiscaux <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> correspondent à la base de données de l’administration fiscale italienne.","ahd_itr_remediation_individual":"Soumettez votre codice fiscale italien dans les paramètres fiscaux <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. Selon nos informations (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), votre compte est enregistré en tant que personne physique et nous avons donc besoin de votre identifiant national (appelé « codice fiscale »). Consultez les pages d’aide (sur la <a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>loi italienne no 157/2019</a>) pour connaître les étapes de soumission. Vous devez vous assurer que votre nom légal figurant sur la page Informations commerciales (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) et que le numéro Citizen_ID figurant dans les paramètres fiscaux <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> correspondent à la base de données de l’administration fiscale italienne.","ahd_itr_remediation_unkown":"Soumettez vos informations sur la page Informations commerciales (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render). Les sociétés doivent fournir leur numéro d’immatriculation commerciale (appelé « codice fiscale », correspondant au numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA sans le code pays « IT »), tandis que les vendeurs individuels, y compris les propriétaires seuls (« P IVA individuale »), doivent charger leur numéro d’identification nationale personnelle (également appelé « codice fiscale ») dans les paramètres fiscaux <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. Vous devez vous assurer que votre nom légal figurant sur la page des informations commerciales <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render> et que le codice fiscale figurant des paramètres fiscaux <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> correspondent à la base de données de l’administration italienne.","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_details_fallback_text":"Vous avez des questions sur le maintien d’un bon état de compte ? Obtenez des conseils personnalisés de la part de l’assistance aux vendeurs.","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_suggestion_fallback_text":"Échanger dans le chat à propos de l’état des comptes","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_title":"Interroger l’assistant pour les vendeurs","ahd_mvblsivna_priority_action":"Terminez votre vérification","ahd_other_policy_violation_title":"Autres violations de politiques","ahd_payment_policy_hd_priority_action":"Vos fonds sont en attente en raison d’actions en attente sur votre compte. Consultez les <b>Actions prioritaires</b> pour réactiver vos versements.","ahd_pr_form_address_header":"Traitez les sanctions pour les produits non conformes pour continuer à vendre vos produits.","ahd_pr_form_address_sub_header":"Conformément aux instructions du ministère de la Justice (DOJ), Amazon simplifie vos obligations de conformité aux règlements en faisant les déclarations et les paiements pour vos commandes sur Amazon, puis en récupérant ces montants depuis votre compte.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_info":"Conformément au décret de consentement EPA/DOJ, nous sommes tenus de pénaliser les vendeurs pour toute violation des politiques relatives à l’EPA. Vous trouverez plus d’informations sur les <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account/health/product-policies\\">produits non conformes</a>, Calculer les pénalités associées, Réserves appliquées à votre compte et Communications envoyées pour soumettre des contestations. Vous serez alors facturé pour toutes les pénalités en attente.<br/><br/> Avant de vous facturer les pénalités, nous bloquerons votre compte tout en vous donnant l’opportunité de corriger votre mise en vente.","ahd_pr_form_impact_p1":"Responsabilité à payer des pénalités (consultez les détails de la violation ci-dessous)","ahd_pr_form_impact_p2":"La mise en vente restera supprimée conformément aux instructions de l’EPA/DOJ","ahd_pr_form_impact_p3":"Effet négatif sur l’état de votre compte, ce qui peut conduire à la désactivation de votre compte vendeur","ahd_pr_form_note":"Remarque : avant de vous facturer des pénalités, nous bloquerons votre compte pendant 30 jours, tout en vous donnant l’opportunité de corriger votre mise en vente.","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_body":"Ce produit a été identifié comme pesticide, dispositif antiparasitaire ou produit contenant des allégations pesticides. Pour que votre demande de réintégration soit prise en considération, veuillez fournir la preuve d’un numéro d’immatriculation de l’EPA et/ou d’un numéro d’établissement de l’EPA, ou encore une certification attestant que le produit est exempté des réglementations de l’EPA. Vous devrez fournir ces informations dans l’attribut Marquage des pesticides de la mise en vente. <a href=/help/hub/reference/GLX9EJX844SNJX7J> Les instructions pour remplir cet attribut sont disponibles sur Seller Central.</a>","ahd_pre_enforcment_non_deactivation_subheader":"Vous avez une ou plusieurs actions en attente pouvant entraîner la désactivation de votre compte à l’avenir.","ahd_priority_actions_address_by_date":"À traiter d’ici le {date} dans {daysremaining} jours","ahd_priority_actions_cr":"Violations liées au taux d’annulations (CR)","ahd_priority_actions_description":"Corriger les problèmes ci-dessous pour empêcher la désactivation du compte.","ahd_priority_actions_otdr":"Infractions liées au taux de livraisons dans les délais","ahd_priority_actions_verification_status":"Démarrer la vérification","ahd_priority_actions_verification_title":"Compléter les exigences de vérification","ahd_pspp_priority_actions":"Terminer l’évaluation Connaissance du client (KYC) en attente : Fournisseur de services de paiement","ahd_pspp_rap_intro":"Votre compte bancaire n’est pas éligible pour recevoir des versements. Collaborez avec votre fournisseur de services de paiement pour terminer l’examen de connaissance du client (KYC) en attente.","ahd_pspp_rap_next_steps":"Pour plus d’informations, consultez les pages <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GY8JTVAWBPQT2XFC?ref_=to_psp_faq_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>FAQ sur les fournisseurs de services de paiement</a> et <a href=\'/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView?ref_=to_deposit_method_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Modes de versement</a>. ","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory":"Pays concernés par des restrictions de stock","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory_details":"Respectez les exigences en attente afin d’éviter toute interruption de votre stock Expédié par Amazon et de vos capacités d’importation ou d’exportation dans le pays répertorié.","ahd_rap_at_risk_regional_details":"Les exigences répertoriées affectent l’état de votre compte dans plusieurs boutiques. Répondez aux exigences en suspens pour éviter la désactivation du compte dans toutes les boutiques affectées.","ahd_rap_check_verification":"Consulter l’état de vérification","ahd_rap_enforced_inventory_details":"Respectez les exigences en attente afin de lever les restrictions liées à votre stock Expédié par Amazon et à vos capacités d’importation ou d’exportation dans le pays répertorié.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p1":"La loi nous oblige à vérifier votre identité pour vous permettre d’utiliser un compte Vendre sur Amazon. En vertu des lois canadiennes et brésiliennes, il est nécessaire de vérifier votre identité afin de vous permettre d’utiliser notre service. Vous devrez peut-être nous fournir certaines informations ou certains documents afin de faciliter ces contrôles.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p2":"Combien de temps ai-je pour fournir ces informations ?","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p3":"Vous pouvez fournir les informations de vérification requises à tout moment après votre inscription. L’accès à votre compte peut être limité jusqu’à ce que les informations aient été fournies et vérifiées.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p4":"Si vous souhaitez continuer et vendre sur Amazon.ca ou Amazon.com.br, cochez la case située en regard de la boutique pour laquelle vous souhaitez procéder à la vérification ci-dessous. Une fois que vous avez choisi de procéder à la vérification, rendez-vous sur la page Informations d’identité pour connaître les étapes suivantes.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p5":"Si vous souhaitez procéder à la vérification d’une boutique en particulier, sélectionnez uniquement cette boutique dans la liste ci-dessous. Une fois la vérification terminée pour cette boutique, vous serez averti de suivre les étapes requises pour commencer la vérification pour l’autre boutique.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_select_stores":"Sélectionner les boutiques ","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_thankyou_p2":"Nous sommes en train de valider vos informations et vous demanderons peut-être des renseignements pendant cet examen. Cette validation peut prendre jusqu’à 24 heures, voire 10 jours ouvrés dans certains cas. Durant cette période, les informations relatives à votre identité ne peuvent pas être modifiées.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_check_verification_status":"Consultez l’état de votre vérification ainsi que les étapes suivantes requises sur la page Informations sur le compte.","ahd_rap_past_due_inventory":"En retard : restrictions concernant les capacités de stock","ahd_rap_voluntary_submission_action":"D’après les informations dont nous disposons, vous n’êtes pas tenu de détenir un numéro de TVA dans ce pays : ${countryName}. Pour vous conformer à cette exigence, vous pouvez soit le supprimer des <a href=\'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Paramètres fiscaux</a>, soit procéder à la résolution du problème ci-dessus.","ahd_sa_account_health_guidance_description":"Vous avez des questions sur l’état du compte ? Obtenez des conseils personnalisés de la part de l’assistance aux vendeurs.","ahd_sa_ask_seller_assistant_title":"Interroger l’assistant pour les partenaires de vente","ahd_sa_chat_about_account_health_label":"Échanger dans le chat à propos de l’état des comptes","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_label":"Synthétiser la conformité des produits","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_text":"Pouvez-vous résumer mes violations de conformité des produits ?","ahd_uaebizlicense_priority_action":"Chargez votre licence commerciale","ahd_vas_extension_extension_request_link":"Soumettez les documents requis.","ahd_vas_extension_request":"Si vous souhaitez demander une extension ou que vous n’êtes pas d’accord avec la décision d’Amazon, <a href=\\"${appealUrl}\\" target=\\"_blank\\">envoyez les documents requis.</a>","ahd_vas_priority_action":"Exigences d’identification à la TVA européenne","ahd_vas_rap_action_address_country":" <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Vérifier/mettre à jour les informations concernant l’adresse</a>","ahd_vas_rap_action_address_review":"<a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Vérifier les informations soumises concernant l’adresse</a>","ahd_vas_rap_action_name_review":"<a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>Vérifier les informations soumises concernant le nom</a>","ahd_vas_rap_deactivated_message":"Les exigences répertoriées affectent l’état de votre compte dans plusieurs boutiques. Traitez les exigences en attente pour le pays répertorié afin de réactiver votre compte dans toutes les boutiques concernées.","ahd_vas_rap_intro":"Les <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GTQ23HPXBQK563WS\' target=\'_blank\'>exigences d’immatriculation à la TVA européenne</a> sont une politique des boutiques Amazon européennes qui exige que tous les partenaires de vente actifs dans les boutiques européennes soumettent un numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA valide dès lors que cela est nécessaire.  Consultez la section « Impact sur l’état du compte » pour répondre à vos exigences en suspens.","ahd_vas_rap_secondary_action":"Si vous ne disposez pas d’un numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA pour le pays répertorié, consultez le portail <a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>Informations commerciales</a> et le portail <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Paramètres fiscaux</a> pour soumettre les informations requises (numéro de TVA, nom, adresse) pour les pays suivants :","ahd_vas_rap_third_action":"Si vous avez souscrit à la déclaration OSS de l’Union européenne dans votre pays de résidence, consultez la page <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Paramètres fiscaux</a> en sélectionnant votre pays de résidence dans le menu Déclaration de TVA via le guichet unique de l’Union européenne (OSS). Assurez-vous que votre UOSS est activé et que le nom et l’adresse fournis à Amazon correspondent à ceux fournis aux autorités.","ahd_violation_display_name":"Violation de la politique relative aux produits soumis à des restrictions","ahd_w8_priority_action":"Informations sur l’identité fiscale aux États-Unis mises à jour requises.","ahd_w8_rap_intro":"Un nouveau formulaire fiscal W-8 est requis. Une fois votre formulaire expiré, votre compte vendeur sera temporairement désactivé jusqu’à ce que vous fournissiez des informations fiscales mises à jour.\\n\\n<br><br>Ces exigences affectent l’état de votre compte dans plusieurs sites de vente.  Répondez aux exigences indiquées pour éviter la désactivation du compte sur tous les sites de vente affectés.\\n\\n<br><br>Pour plus d’informations, consultez la <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G200663290?ref_=to_w8_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>FAQ sur les déclarations de revenus et la collecte d’informations d’identité fiscale aux États-Unis.</a>","ahr-status-badge-great":"Bon","ai_inform_page1_step2":"2. Une fois que vous avez confirmé l’exactitude de vos informations, retournez sur cette page et cliquez sur le lien ci-dessous pour recevoir votre notification formelle et terminer la certification.","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Étant donné que les composants Katal sont des extensions d’éléments HTML, JavaScript peut interagir avec eux de la même manière que les éléments HTML intégrés. Ici, nous constatons que JavaScript modifie l’attribut « variant » de l’alerte.","components_containing_html_text":"Certains composants peuvent accueillir du contenu HTML, comme notre composant KatalTabs. Ces composants complexes fournissent une API permettant aux développeurs ou aux frameworks d’interagir avec eux.","demo_complex_header_text":"Démonstration : Composants Katal complexes","demo_components_header_text":"Démonstration : utilisation des composants Katal","design_approved_text":"Katal propose des composants dont le design est approuvé pour une utilisation sur des pages Web, et qui peuvent être configurés avec des étiquettes et des paramètres personnalisés. Par exemple : des boutons principaux et des boutons secondaires qui diffèrent uniquement par leur attribut « variant ».","documentation_label":"Documentation sur Katal","fba_inventory_uc_identifier":"Nos dossiers indiquent que vous avez du stock lié au programme Expédié par Amazon dans le pays suivant : ${COUNTRY}. En tant que vendeur utilisant les services Expédié par Amazon, vous devez fournir un numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA valide pour chaque pays dans lequel votre stock est entreposé. Vous pouvez vérifier les pays dans lesquels vous avez activé le service Expédié par Amazon <a href=/fba/settings/ target=\\"_blank\\">ici</a>.\\r\\nN’oubliez pas que vous devez soumettre un numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA qui est valide et qui a été activé pour les transactions intracommunautaires.","greeting_description":"Voici un exemple d’application Katal, qui montre comment utiliser les composants Katal ainsi que l’outil de création et de déploiement. Pour toute question ou tout commentaire, contactez l’équipe Katal à l’adresse colombia-team@amazon.com. Pour continuer cette démonstration, ignorez cette alerte.","greeting_description_mons_app":"Voici un exemple d’application Katal, qui montre comment utiliser les composants Katal pour des traductions. Pour toute question ou tout commentaire, contactez l’équipe Katal à l’adresse katal-team@amazon.com.","greeting_header":"Exemple d’informations d’application","inform_mobile_notification_description":"Rendez-vous sur la page État du compte pour consulter vos exigences de vérification requises concernant la loi INFORM.","inform_mobile_notification_description_full":"Votre compte vendeur Amazon risque d’être désactivé. Rendez-vous sur la page État du compte pour consulter vos exigences de vérification requises concernant la loi INFORM.","mobile_ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"Inscrivez-vous à Seller Central à partir d’un navigateur Web.","mobile_tutorial_inform_act_description":"Afin de respecter la loi américaine pour les consommateurs (INFORM Consumers Act), Amazon doit collecter et vérifier les informations relatives à votre compte Vendre sur Amazon. Actuellement, vous avez un ou plusieurs éléments à vérifier.","poe_domestic_uc_identifier":"Nos dossiers internes indiquent que votre chiffre d’affaires dépasse le seuil national d’immatriculation à la TVA dans le pays suivant : ${COUNTRY}.","ppc_fhdds_action_taken":"Risque de restriction d’expéditions entrantes au Royaume-Uni","sc_homepage_education_phase_description":"Traitez l’état de votre compte pour éviter tout risque de désactivation future du compte.","sc_homepage_pending_deactivation":"Un événement critique s’est produit avec votre compte et l’a amené à être en attente de désactivation. ","sc_inform_act_view_account_health_banner":"Accéder à État du compte","sc_navbar_ah_cs_desc":"Consultez vos indicateurs de performances du service client, y compris votre taux de commandes défectueuses et votre taux de défaut de facturation.","sc_navbar_ah_desc":"Consultez votre Évaluation de l’état du compte, les problèmes affectant l’État de votre compte et les violations pouvant entraîner le retrait du contenu ou la désactivation du compte.","sc_navbar_ah_eligibilities_desc":"Consultez les avantages et programmes auxquels vous êtes éligible.","sc_navbar_ah_myc_desc":"Assurez-vous que tous vos produits sont conformes à l’ensemble des lois, des réglementations et des politiques Amazon en vigueur.","sc_navbar_ah_ppc_desc":"Affichez toutes les violations de politiques pouvant entraîner la suppression du contenu ou la désactivation du compte. ","sc_navbar_ah_sp_desc":"Consultez vos indicateurs de performance en matière d’expédition, notamment le taux d’expéditions en retard, le taux d’annulations de commandes avant traitement, le taux de suivi valide et le taux de livraisons dans les délais.  ","schp_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_header":"Complétez vos exigences de vérification en suspens pour commencer à vendre sur Amazon.","schp_inventory_restriction_card":"Résolvez les problèmes liés à l’état de votre compte pour lever les restrictions concernant le stock sur votre compte.","ship_from_non_poe_uc_identifier":"Nos dossiers internes indiquent que votre expédition provient de ${COUNTRY}, un pays différent de celui de votre pays d’origine. Par conséquent, vous devez fournir un numéro de TVA du Système d’échange d’informations sur la TVA (VIES) ou un numéro de TVA applicable pour les transactions effectuées dans l’UE. Vous pouvez vérifier votre adresse de livraison depuis la page Paramètres d’expédition ou depuis <a href=/sbr target=\\"_blank\\">ce lien</a>.\\nN’oubliez pas que vous devez soumettre un numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA qui est valide et qui a été activé pour les transactions intracommunautaires.","ship_from_poe_uc_identifier":"Nos dossiers indiquent que vos ventes transfrontalières entre les pays de l’UE dépassent 10 000 €. En tant que vendeur effectuant des ventes transfrontalières, vous devez fournir un numéro de TVA UOSS de votre pays d’établissement ou un numéro de TVA valide pour tous les pays vers lesquels vous expédiez vos produits.","ship_to_non_eu_uc_identifier":"Nos dossiers internes indiquent que vous avez des expéditions de plus de 150 € depuis des pays hors de l’UE vers le pays suivant : ${COUNTRY}. Par conséquent, vous devez fournir un numéro de TVA ${COUNTRY} valide ou une déclaration confirmant que vous n’êtes pas l’importateur officiel pour la ou les expéditions au-dessus du seuil.","ship_to_uoss_uc_identifier":"Nos dossiers internes indiquent que vous réalisez des ventes transfrontalières vers ${COUNTRY} depuis un autre pays de l’UE et, par conséquent, vous êtes tenu de fournir un numéro de TVA UOSS du pays d’établissement ou un numéro de TVA ${COUNTRY} valide.\\r\\nN’oubliez pas que vous devez soumettre un numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA qui est valide et qui a été activé pour les transactions intracommunautaires.","ship_to_xborder_uc_identifier":"Nos dossiers internes indiquent que vous réalisez des ventes transfrontalières vers ${COUNTRY} depuis un autre pays de l’UE et, par conséquent, vous êtes tenu de fournir un numéro de TVA ${COUNTRY} valide.","sp-aha-check-eligibility-button":"Découvrez les exigences pour être éligible.","sp-permanent-call-me-now-need-help":"Vous avez besoin d’aide ?","sp-permanent-call-me-now-prompt":"Adressez-vous à un spécialiste des états de compte","sp_health_cancellation_rate_caption":"Taux d’annulations de commandes avant traitement","sp_health_dashboard_subheader":"Pour pouvoir vendre sur Amazon, vous devez respecter les politiques et objectifs de performance ci-dessous.","sp_health_gl_office_product":"Fournitures scolaires et de bureau","sp_health_gl_watch":"Montres","sp_health_intellectual_property_customer_complaints":"Réclamations reçues au titre de la propriété intellectuelle","sp_health_late_shipment_rate_caption":"Taux d’expéditions en retard","sp_health_listing_policy_customer_complaints":"Violations de politiques de mise en vente de produits","sp_health_mobile_by_ahr_impact_tab_title":"Par impact pour l’évaluation de l’état du compte","sp_health_nav_account_health":"État du compte","sp_health_nav_eligibilities":"Éligibilité","sp_health_not_available":"Sans objet","sp_health_orders_of_total":"${hash-get orders_number} commandes sur ${hash-get orders_total}","sp_health_orders_of_total_orders":"${hash-get orders_number} commandes sur ${hash-get orders_total}","sp_health_pre_fulfillment_cancel_rate":"Taux d’annulations de commandes avant traitement","sp_health_product_condition_customer_complaints":"Réclamations du client sur l’état du produit","sp_health_product_quality_popover":"Ce total inclura les réclamations que vous avez peut-être déjà traitées dans le cadre d’un plan d’actions.","sp_health_product_safety_customer_complaints":"Problèmes liés à la sécurité des denrées alimentaires et des produits","sp_health_risk_banner_vtr":"Vos offres Expédié par le vendeur risquent d’être désactivées. Votre taux de suivi valide est de ${hash-get metricValue} ; l’objectif est de ${hash-get target}.","sp_health_shipments_of_total_shipments":"${hash-get shipments_number} sur ${hash-get shipments_total} expéditions","sp_health_shipping_bucket_caption":"Performances d’expédition","sp_health_shipping_eligibilities":"Afficher les éligibilités à l’expédition ici","sp_health_violation_details_selling_assistant_title":"Interroger l’assistant pour les vendeurs","sp_health_violation_details_stale_page_button_label":"Retour à la page État du compte","sp_mfn_at_risk_warning":"Vos offres Expédié par le vendeur risquent d’être désactivées.","sp_st_date_range":"${hash-get startDate} - ${hash-get endDate}","sp_vtr_list_ca":"1. Articles lourds et volumineux expédiés par un transporteur non intégré à Amazon. En savoir plus sur les transporteurs intégrés.</br></br>2. Produits Petits et Légers dont la valeur de la commande est inférieure à 30 $ CAD (frais d\'expédition compris) et qui sont expédiés dans des enveloppes Poste Canada - courrier standard ou courrier de première classe.</br></br>3. Expéditions internationales expédiées depuis la Chine dont la valeur de la commande est inférieure à 6 $CAD (frais d’expédition compris)</br></br>4. Expéditions internationales depuis des pays autres que les États-Unis et la Chine.</br></br>5. Commandes numériques qui ne peuvent pas être expédiées physiquement par un transporteur, par exemple : livres audio","sp_zero_tolerance_banner_body":"En raison d’une ou plusieurs violations critiques, votre compte est en attente de désactivation. Pour éviter la désactivation, merci de résoudre ces violations dès maintenant. Pour plus d’informations, consultez la <a href=/gp/help/G200205250>politique du programme d’évaluation de l’état du compte</a>.","submission_status_ahd_review_submission_pending_status":"État : notre évaluation est en cours","ts-form-header":"Signaler un abus","valid_vat_number_uc_identifier":"N’oubliez pas que vous devez soumettre un numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA qui est valide et qui a été activé pour les transactions intracommunautaires.","voluntary_vrn_uc_identifier":"Nos dossiers internes indiquent que vous n’êtes pas tenu d’avoir un numéro de TVA pour ${COUNTRY}, mais que vous avez fourni un numéro de TVA actuellement non valide sur Seller Central. Pour résoudre cette incohérence, vous pouvez soit supprimer le numéro de TVA ${COUNTRY} soit fournir un numéro valide. En supprimant votre numéro de TVA ${COUNTRY} de Seller Central, vous confirmez que vous n’êtes pas tenu d’en avoir un dans le pays suivant : ${COUNTRY}. Nous vous recommandons de consulter un conseiller fiscal pour déterminer si l’ensemble de vos activités commerciales, sur Amazon et en dehors d’Amazon, nécessite une immatriculation à la TVA."}},"fr-FR":{"pages.floatingWidget":{"DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_content":"Vous participez à une expérience visant à améliorer l’expérience vendeur : désormais, de bonnes performances en matière de taux de contacts avec les acheteurs, de délai de réponse et de taux de mécontentement des acheteurs peuvent booster votre score à l’évaluation de l’état du compte ! Ce changement permet à l’évaluation de l’état du compte de récompenser un service client de qualité. Vérifiez vos performances du service client dans le gestionnaire des évaluations dès maintenant.","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_header":"Obtenez des points à l’évaluation de l’état du compte en offrant un service client de qualité","DYK_JP_LINE_content":"Le compte Amazon LINE officiel envoie certaines notifications concernant les notifications que nous envoyons par e-mail et via Seller Central lorsque des actions sont requises de la part des vendeurs, notamment lorsqu’il s’agit de l’état de votre compte, de l’état des produits mis en vente ou des erreurs de versement de paiements. Connectez votre compte Seller Central au compte LINE officiel pour recevoir des notifications via LINE et éviter de manquer des notifications importantes. En savoir plus","DYK_JP_LINE_cta_done":"En savoir plus sur les notifications LINE importantes","DYK_JP_LINE_header":"Vous pouvez vous connecter avec votre compte LINE pour recevoir les messages personnalisés importants qui ont une incidence sur l’état de votre compte.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_content":"Bonne nouvelle ! Vous êtes éligible à l’assurance pour l’état du compte (AHA) dans les 60 jours. Maintenez l’évaluation de l’état de votre compte au-dessus de 250 et conservez un numéro de contact d’urgence vérifié dans votre dossier afin de bénéficier d’une protection renforcée de votre compte. Nous vous informerons par e-mail une fois que vous serez automatiquement inscrit.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_cta_done":"En savoir plus sur l’assurance pour l’état du compte","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_header":"Inscription imminente à l’assurance pour l’état du compte","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_content":"Votre évaluation de l’état du compte est maintenant à l’état En danger ou Maladie. Cliquez sur « Appelez-moi maintenant » pour discuter avec un spécialiste de l’état du compte et protéger vos droits de vente.","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_cta_done":"Appelez-moi maintenant","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_header":"Votre évaluation de l’état du compte requiert de l’attention","DYK_SSAT_CFT_DietarySupp_content":"Protégez vos produits mis en vente de la catégorie Compléments alimentaires grâce au service de Conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à soumettre des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_Toys_content":"Protégez vos produits mis en vente de la catégorie Jeux et jouets grâce au service de Conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à soumettre des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_artscrafts_content":"Protégez vos offres de la catégorie Arts et Artisanat grâce à la Conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à soumettre des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_buttoncellbatteryproducts_content":"Protégez vos produits mis en vente de la catégorie Piles boutons grâce au service de Conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à soumettre des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_childrensproducts_content":"Protégez vos produits mis en vente de la catégorie Produits pour enfants grâce au service de Conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à soumettre des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_cta_done":"S’inscrire aujourd’hui","DYK_SSAT_CFT_electronics_content":"Protégez vos produits mis en vente de la catégorie Électroniques grâce à la Conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à soumettre des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_emobilityproducts_content":"Protégez vos produits mis en vente de la catégorie E-mobilité grâce au service de Conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à soumettre des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_firesafety_content":"Protégez vos produits mis en vente de la catégorie Sécurité incendie grâce à la Conformité simplifiée Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à soumettre des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_furniture_content":"Protégez vos produits mis en vente de la catégorie Meubles grâce à la Conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à soumettre des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_header":"Simplification de la conformité : inscrivez-vous au service de Conformité simplifiée. dès aujourd’hui","DYK_SSAT_CFT_infantbabyproducts_content":"Protégez vos produits mis en vente de la catégorie Bébés et Puériculture grâce au service de Conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à soumettre des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_ppe_content":"Protégez vos produits mis en vente de la catégorie Équipement de protection individuelle grâce au service de Conformité simplifiée. Bénéficiez d’une validation automatique de la conformité lorsqu’une entreprise participante certifie vos produits, ce qui vous évite d’avoir à soumettre des documents de conformité.","DYK_SSAT_EDU_content":"L’évaluation de l’état du compte surveille les risques de désactivation de votre compte via un système de points. Vous gagnez des points lorsque vous traitez les commandes avec succès. Vous perdez des points lorsque des violations de politiques sont détectées, et vous récupérez des points lorsque vous les traitez avec succès. Consultez régulièrement votre tableau de bord État du compte et corrigez les violations de politiques qui surviennent.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_content":"Nous sommes heureux de vous annoncer l’arrivée du Défi vendeur, une nouvelle fonctionnalité destinée aux vendeurs Assurance pour l’état du compte. Le programme Défi vendeur offre un nombre limité de recommandations pour demander une évaluation séparée des problèmes liés aux produits mis en vente sur votre page État du compte. Lorsque vous soumettez un défi, nous nous efforçons de vous répondre dans un délai de 48 heures.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_header":"Présentation du Défi vendeur","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop":"Saviez-vous que tant que vous n’aurez pas de violation, votre score ne sera pas inférieur à 200, même si vous avez une diminution du nombre de commandes ?","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop_header":"Conseil d’évaluation de l’état du compte sain","ahd_dyk_bhdr_content":"Nous vous recommandons de livrer plus de 90 % de vos expéditions commerciales Amazon Business pendant les heures ouvrées afin de garantir une expérience client de qualité","ahd_dyk_bhdr_cta":"Afficher les performances","ahd_dyk_bhdr_header":"Votre taux de livraisons pendant les heures ouvrées est faible.","ahd_dyk_br_kyc_existing_seller_header":"Votre boutique sur Amazon.com.br (Brésil) risque d’être désactivée.","ahd_dyk_cta_eukyc":"Terminer la vérification","ahd_dyk_de_sup_label":"Conformément à la politique allemande relative aux produits en plastique à usage unique (en vigueur depuis le 1er janvier 2025) liée à la responsabilité élargie des producteurs, prenez les mesures nécessaires dès maintenant en fournissant les numéros d’inscription aux filières REP pour chaque combinaison de type de produit et de marque. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GA4JYZX23CLK8WFW\\">En savoir plus</a>","ahd_dyk_de_sup_title":"Vous avez des mises en vente concernées par la Responsabilité élargie des producteurs (REP) : politique allemande relative aux produits en plastique à usage unique","ahd_dyk_de_sup_weee_title":"Vous avez des produits mis en vente concernés par la responsabilité élargie des producteurs (REP) : DEEE en Allemagne","ahd_dyk_description_eukyc":"Conformément à la réglementation européenne, vous devez effectuer une procédure de vérification de compte. Consultez la page Informations d’identité pour terminer la vérification. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G201200780 \\">En savoir plus</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_label":"Pour respecter la réglementation relative à la REP, procédez comme suit : agissez dès maintenant en fournissant des numéros d’inscription aux filières REP pour chaque combinaison de marque et de type de produit. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GYDCAK9ZR6VJH2X3\\">En savoir plus</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_title":"Certains de vos produits mis en vente sont concernés par la REP.","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_label":"Conformément à la politique européenne relative aux piles et batteries (en vigueur à compter du 18 août 2025) liée à la responsabilité élargie des producteurs, prenez les mesures nécessaires dès maintenant en fournissant les numéros d’inscription aux filières REP pour vos catégories de produits. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GPVDATLHQ6PRQNSW\\">En savoir plus</a>","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_title":"Vous avez des mises en vente concernées par la Responsabilité élargie des producteurs (REP) : politique européenne relative aux piles et batteries","ahd_dyk_fhdds_description":"Fournissez les informations sur les importations pour toutes vos expéditions concernées dans votre Aperçu des expéditions avant que cela ne perturbe votre activité. L’absence d’informations sur les importations peut restreindre votre capacité à créer de nouvelles expéditions au Royaume-Uni.","ahd_dyk_fhdds_header":"Il manque des numéros d’importation (IEN) pour certaines expéditions.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"Vous avez des actions en attente pour commencer à vendre sur le site de vente <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.com.br/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.com.br</a>.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_subtitle":"Soumettez les informations pour remplir les exigences de vérification pour vendre au Brésil.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"Vous avez des actions en attente pour commencer à vendre sur le site de vente <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.ca/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.ca</a>.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_subtitle":"Soumettez les informations pour remplir les exigences de vérification pour vendre au Canada.","ahd_dyk_title_eukyc":"Terminez la vérification de votre connaissance client (KYC) dans l’Union européenne","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description":"Afin de vous conformer au règlement RSGP, qui entre en vigueur le 13 décembre 2024, fournissez des informations de conformité supplémentaires pour vos produits afin d’éviter tout impact sur vos produits mis en vente. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">En savoir plus</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description_post_impact":"Pour respecter le règlement relatif à la sécurité générale des produits (RSGP), entré en vigueur depuis le 13 décembre 2024, et empêcher la désactivation des produits mis en vente, prenez des mesures dès maintenant en fournissant des informations de conformité supplémentaires pour vos produits. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">En savoir plus</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_task":"Vous avez des produits mis en vente concernés par le Règlement sur la sécurité générale des produits (RSGP).","ahd_floating_widget_aha_ec_description":"En tant que membre du programme AHA, vous <b>devez</b> conserver un numéro de contact d’urgence valide. Vérifiez vos coordonnées d’urgence pour maintenir votre éligibilité au programme AHA, afin que nos spécialistes puissent vous contacter pour vous aider à résoudre les problèmes critiques liés à l’état de votre compte avant qu’ils ne perturbent votre activité.","ahd_floating_widget_aha_ec_description_phase2":"Vérifiez votre numéro de contact ci-dessous pour conserver les avantages ininterrompus du programme Assurance pour l’état du compte.","ahd_floating_widget_cta_button":"Afficher les produits mis en vente","ahd_floating_widget_ec_action_panel_title":"Mise à jour des coordonnées en cas d’urgence","ahd_floating_widget_ec_aha_description":"Vérifiez vos coordonnées d’urgence afin que nos spécialistes puissent vous contacter pour vous aider à résoudre les problèmes critiques liés à l’état de votre compte avant qu’ils ne perturbent votre activité.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_cta_button":"Vérification complète","ahd_floating_widget_ec_description":"Vérifiez vos coordonnées d’urgence afin que nos spécialistes puissent vous contacter pour vous aider à résoudre les problèmes critiques liés à l’état de votre compte avant qu’ils ne perturbent votre activité.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_task":"Vos coordonnées d’urgence ne sont pas vérifiées","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_food_and_safety_heading":"Votre compte présente des violations répétées pour des problèmes liés à la sécurité des denrées alimentaires et des produits","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_ip_heading":"Votre compte présente des violations répétées de la propriété intellectuelle qui ont donné lieu à des réclamations","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_listing_heading":"Votre compte présente des violations répétées des politiques de mise en vente","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_many_policies_heading":"Votre compte présente des violations répétées de plusieurs politiques","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_other_heading":"Votre compte présente des violations répétées pour d’autres violations de politiques","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_auth_heading":"Votre compte présente des violations répétées concernant les réclamations des clients concernant l’authenticité des produits","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_cond_heading":"Votre compte présente des violations répétées concernant les réclamations des clients concernant l’état des produits","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_reviews_heading":"Votre compte présente des violations répétées de la politique relative aux commentaires client sur les produits","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_reg_comp_heading":"Votre compte présente des violations répétées de la conformité réglementaire","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_rp_heading":"Votre compte présente des violations répétées de la politique relative aux produits soumis à des restrictions","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_sip_heading":"Votre compte présente des violations répétées pour suspicion de violations de propriété intellectuelle","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_violations_body":"Les violations de politiques répétées d’une même politique peuvent entraîner la désactivation du compte. Résolvez ces problèmes pour éviter toute interruption inutile de votre compte vendeur.","dyk_ahd_pra_rv":"Votre compte présente des violations répétées de la politique des commentaires client sur les produits"},"pages.homepage":{"DR_VAT_AHD_NC_BANNER":"Nous n’avons pas pu vérifier l’établissement de votre entreprise aux fins de la TVA. Pour garantir un traitement fiscal exact, vérifiez votre établissement aux fins de la TVA.","DR_VAT_AHD_PRIORITY_ACTION":"Vérification de l’établissement requise aux fins de la TVA","Engage_Appeal_05":"Code de conduite du vendeur (qui influence favorablement les clients pour manipuler des évaluations ou commentaires de vos ventes)","LocalizedPageTitleDetailCustomerSatisfaction":"page détaillée sur la satisfaction client.","LocalizedPageTitleDetailProductPolicies":"Page détaillée des politiques de produit.","NO_METRICS":"Vous n’avez actuellement aucune commande comptabilisant cette statistique.\\n","acf_banner_inform_act":"Afin de respecter la loi <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon doit collecter et vérifier les informations relatives à votre compte Vendre sur Amazon. Vous avez actuellement des éléments d’action de vérification en attente. Consultez la liste ci-dessous et accédez à l’option <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Informations sur le compte vendeur</a> pour démarrer la vérification.","acf_inform_act_wait_text":"Merci de vérifier votre identité. Revenez dans 24 heures pour confirmer si des informations supplémentaires sont requises. ","acf_inform_act_widget_description":"Une fois la vérification d’identité terminée, il peut vous être demandé de vérifier un ou plusieurs des éléments supplémentaires ci-dessous.","addTab_label":"Onglet Ajouter","aef_address_your_violation":"Remédier à votre problème de violation","ahd_account_health_notification":"Notification d’état du compte","ahd_account_regulatory_compliance":"Conformité réglementaire du compte","ahd_action_panel_hd":"Les versements vers vos comptes vendeur Amazon ont été mis en attente.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"<b>Votre compte risque d’être désactivé.</b><br><br>Afin de respecter la loi <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon doit collecter et vérifier les informations relatives à votre compte Vendre sur Amazon. Vous avez actuellement des éléments d’action de vérification en attente. Consultez la liste ci-dessous et accédez à l’option <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Informations sur le compte vendeur</a> pour démarrer la vérification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_aha":"<b> Remarque : si vous n’avez pas terminé tous les étapes de vérification lorsque la loi INFORM Consumers Act prendra effet, il se peut que votre compte soit désactivé, quelle que soit votre inscription au programme Assurance État du compte.</b>","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_thankyou":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>Nous avons terminé toutes les vérifications en cours. Merci pour les efforts que vous avez déployés afin de nous aider dans ce processus de vérification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_v2":"<b>Votre compte risque d’être désactivé.</b><br><br>Afin de respecter la loi <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>américaine INFORM Consumers Act</a>, qui entre en vigueur le 27 juin 2023, Amazon doit collecter et vérifier les informations relatives à votre compte Vendre sur Amazon. Vous avez actuellement des éléments d’action de vérification en attente. Consultez la page <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Informations sur le compte</a> pour commencer la vérification.","ahd_adhoc_banner_school_supplies":"Nous avons identifié que vous aviez des produits mis en vente susceptibles d’être retirés en raison de la non-conformité aux réglementations locales, étatiques et fédérales concernant la vente de fournitures scolaires pour enfants. Pour en savoir plus sur ces exigences de conformité, cliquez <a href=/gp/help/external/help.html?itemID=XT3EFQS54LRKYM3&language=en_US&ref=ahd_uspc_adhoc_banner>ici</a>. Pour éviter le retrait d’un produit mis en vente, consultez vos produits mis en vente couverts par cette exigence de conformité <a href=/performance/account/health/product-policies?t=safe>ici</a> et suivez les instructions répertoriées sous Étapes suivantes en regard du ou des produits mis en vente susceptibles d’être retirés afin de vous assurer de la conformité à ces exigences.","ahd_adhoc_mobile_inform_act_aha":"Remarque : si vous n’effectuez pas toutes les étapes de vérification dans les délais spécifiés, il se peut que votre compte soit désactivé, quelle que soit votre inscription au programme Assurance État du compte.","ahd_aef_IPI_priority_action":"Vérification d’identité virtuelle","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_instruction":"Vous devez soumettre des documents et participer à un appel vidéo pour vérifier votre identité.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_join_call_link":"Accédez au <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">portail de vérification de l’identité</a> pour participer à votre appel vidéo programmé.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_next_steps":"Accédez au <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">portail de vérification de l’identité</a> pour soumettre les documents requis et participer à un appel vidéo pour la vérification d’identité virtuelle. Vous avez également la possibilité de programmer un appel vidéo à une date et une heure ultérieures après avoir soumis les documents requis.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason":"Un examen de votre activité a révélé que votre compte a peut-être été utilisé à des fins trompeuses, frauduleuses ou illégales, ce qui peut conduire à la désactivation de votre compte, conformément à la section 3 du <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Contrat Amazon Services Business Solutions</a>. Pour protéger nos clients et nos partenaires de vente, nous devons vérifier l’identité de nos vendeurs via un processus de vérification d’identité virtuelle qui se déroule par appel vidéo. ","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason_eu":"Un examen de votre activité a révélé que votre compte a peut-être été utilisé à des fins trompeuses, frauduleuses ou illégales, ce qui peut conduire à la désactivation de votre compte, conformément à la section 3 du <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G201190440\\">Contrat Amazon Services Business Solutions</a>. Pour protéger nos clients et nos partenaires de vente, nous devons vérifier l’identité de nos vendeurs via un processus de vérification d’identité virtuelle qui se déroule par appel vidéo.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_review_fail":"Un examen de votre activité et des informations que vous avez fournies lors de votre vérification d’identité virtuelle a révélé que votre compte a peut-être été utilisé à des fins trompeuses, frauduleuses ou illégales, ce qui constitue une violation de la section 3 du <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Contrat Amazon Services Business Solutions</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_under_review":"Nous examinons actuellement les informations que vous nous avez fournies pour la vérification de l’identité. L’examen peut prendre jusqu’à 5 jours ouvrés.","ahd_aef_action_panel_RA_reason":"Notre examen indique que vous disposez d’un compte distinct qui a été désactivé pour violation de l’une de nos politiques. Par conséquent, le compte vendeur actuel enfreint notre politique relative aux comptes vendeur multiples sur Amazon, définie dans le <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G1801\\">Code de conduite du vendeur</a>.","ahd_aef_action_panel_post_deactivation_appeal":"Si vous pensez que votre compte a été désactivé par erreur, vous pouvez soumettre de nouvelles informations en cliquant sur le bouton Contester ci-dessous.","ahd_aef_action_panel_scheduled_status_plural":"Vous avez programmé un appel vidéo pour votre vérification d’identité virtuelle le ${date}, dans ${numberofdays} jours.","ahd_aef_action_panel_scheduled_status_singular":"Vous avez programmé un appel vidéo pour votre vérification d’identité virtuelle le ${date}, dans ${numberofday} jour.","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_food_and_prod_subreason":"Problèmes de sécurité sanitaire des aliments et des produits","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_listing_subreason":"Violations de politiques de produits mis en vente","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_other_subreason":"Violation d’une autre politique","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_cond_subreason":"Réclamations du client sur l’état du produit","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_review_subreason":"Violations de politiques des commentaires client sur les produits","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rip_subreason":"Réception de réclamations au titre de la propriété intellectuelle","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_sip_subreason":"Suspicion de violations de propriété intellectuelle","ahd_aef_at_risk_HD_card_body":"Pour réactiver vos versements, consultez vos Actions prioritaires et traitez les actions en attente.","ahd_aef_at_risk_card_sc_body":"Vous avez une ou plusieurs actions en attente qui entraîneront la désactivation de votre compte.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_action":"Réactivez maintenant","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_body":"Pour réactiver votre compte, vous devez résoudre les problèmes d’état du compte. Une fois les problèmes résolus, votre compte sera réactivé dans un délai de 24 heures.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_sc_body":"Pour réactiver votre compte, vous devez résoudre les problèmes d’état du compte.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_title":"Votre compte a été désactivé","ahd_aef_denver_eu":"Vérifiez l’implantation de la taxe sur la valeur ajoutée (TVA) dans l’Union européenne.","ahd_aef_denver_uk":"Vérifiez l’implantation de la taxe sur la valeur ajoutée (TVA) au Royaume-Uni.","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_post_deactivation":"Cliquez sur le bouton Contester ci-dessous et suivez les instructions fournies pour réactiver ce compte vendeur.","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_pre_deactivation":"Cliquez sur le bouton Contester ci-dessous et suivez les instructions fournies pour éviter la désactivation de ce compte vendeur.","ahd_aef_next_steps_header":"Remédier à votre problème de violation","ahd_aef_pending_critical":"État critique en attente","ahd_aef_pending_critical_message":"Cela deviendra critique si ce problème n’est pas résolu et votre compte sera désactivé.","ahd_aef_pending_critical_message_no_cap":"Cela deviendra critique si votre compte n’est pas résolu et que votre compte sera désactivé.","ahd_aef_pending_deactivation_HD_card_title":"Votre compte est en attente de désactivation et les versements de votre compte vendeur Amazon ont été mis en attente.","ahd_aef_priority_action_scheduled_status_plural":"Appel vidéo prévu le ${date}, dans ${numberofdays} jours","ahd_aef_priority_action_scheduled_status_singular":"Appel vidéo prévu le ${date}, dans ${numberofday} jour","ahd_aef_submit_header":"Envoyez vos informations","ahd_ahr_pending_critical":"État critique en attente","ahd_ahr_section_sub_section":"Cette évaluation reflète votre respect des politiques de vente d’Amazon. <a href=/help/hub/reference/G200205250?ref=ahd-ahr-lm target=‘_blank’>En savoir plus</a>","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_body":"Nous pourrons envisager la réactivation de votre compte, une fois que vous aurez contesté vos violations avec succès. ","ahd_banner_block_mfn_at_risk_subtitle":"Vos offres expédiées par le vendeur ont été désactivées et votre compte risque d’être désactivé. Complétez vos Actions prioritaires pour réactiver vos offres expédiées par le vendeur et empêcher leur désactivation.","ahd_banner_block_mfn_subtitle":"Vos offres expédiées par le vendeur ont été désactivées. Complétez vos Actions prioritaires pour réactiver vos offres expédiées par le vendeur.","ahd_banner_eg_trn":"<b>Votre compte risque d’être désactivé. </b><br><br>Votre compte risque d’être désactivé, car votre compte Seller Central ne comprend pas votre numéro d’immatriculation fiscale valide. Consultez la page <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations>Paramètres fiscaux</a> pour mettre à jour vos informations fiscales dans un délai de 90 jours à compter de la date de votre premier produit mis en vente sur Amazon, afin d’éviter la désactivation de votre compte. Pour plus d’informations, consultez la page d’aide <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC>Foire aux questions sur la conformité des taxes. </a>","ahd_be_jsl_at_risk_banner":"<b> Votre compte risque d’être désactivé. </b><br><br> Vous n’avez pas fourni votre numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA belge (VRN) ni confirmé le statut du guichet unique de l’Union européenne (OSS) dans votre pays de résidence sur votre compte Amazon Seller Central. Consultez la <a href=/help/hub/reference/external/GGTX8THLMMDJ3WBP>nouvelle législation belge</a> pour en savoir plus sur cette obligation et fournir des informations.","ahd_brkyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Vérifiez votre statut de vérification sur la page <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional\\n?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Informations sur votre identité</a>.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"Conformément à la législation brésilienne, la vérification de votre identité est requise pour que vous puissiez utiliser notre service et vous devez nous fournir certains renseignements ou documents afin de faciliter ces vérifications. Nous sommes susceptibles de vous fournir des informations supplémentaires sur cette demande dans vos notifications sur la performance.\\r\\n<br><br>Votre compte a été désactivé, car nous n’avons pas pu valider vos informations d’identité.<br><br> \\r\\nPour plus d’informations, consultez la page d’aide <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Informations requises pour vendre sur Amazon</a>.","ahd_brkyc_rap_intro":"Conformément aux lois brésiliennes, vous devez procéder à une vérification de votre identité pour pouvoir utiliser notre service. Certains documents ou informations vous seront demandés afin de faciliter ces vérifications. Nous sommes susceptibles de vous fournir des informations supplémentaires sur cette demande dans vos notifications sur la performance.\\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nPour plus d’informations, consultez la page d’aide <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Informations requises pour vendre sur Amazon</a>.","ahd_brkyc_rap_verifying":"Vos informations sont en cours de validation. Nous pourrons être amenés à vous demander des détails pendant cet examen. Vérifiez les sections <a href=\'/performance/notifications\\r\\n?ref_=to_brkyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Notifications sur la performance</a> et répondez à toute demande relative à votre compte Vendre sur Amazon. Cette validation peut prendre jusqu’à 24 heures, voire 10 jours ouvrés dans certains cas. Durant cette période, les informations relatives à votre identité ne peuvent pas être modifiées.","ahd_cakyc_priority_action":"Vérification d’identité au Canada","ahd_cakyc_rap_action":"Fournissez vos informations de vérification d’identité avant la date d’échéance indiquée pour éviter la désactivation du compte. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_action_hd":"Fournissez vos informations de vérification d’identité avant la date d’échéance indiquée pour éviter la désactivation du compte. Si vous ne commencez pas la vérification et que vous disposez encore de 15 jours ou moins, votre capacité à verser des fonds depuis votre compte vendeur Amazon.ca sera restreinte. La vérification est requise par la loi canadienne.","ahd_cakyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"Vérifiez le statut de votre vérification sur la <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> page Informations d’identité</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"Votre compte a été désactivé, car nous n’avons pas pu valider vos informations d’identité.  La loi canadienne exige que nous vérifiions votre identité pour que vous puissiez utiliser notre service. Pour réactiver votre compte, soumettez les informations requises afin que nous vérifiions votre identité. \\r\\n<br><br>Pour plus d’informations, consultez la page d’aide <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Informations requises pour vendre sur Amazon</a>","ahd_cakyc_rap_identity_info":"Consultez la <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> page Informations d’identité</a> pour terminer la vérification. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_intro":"La loi canadienne exige que nous vérifiions votre identité pour que vous puissiez utiliser notre service. Nous avons besoin que vous nous fournissiez certaines informations et certains documents afin que nous puissions effectuer ces vérifications. <br><br>Pour plus d’informations, consultez la page d’aide <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Informations requises pour vendre sur Amazon</a> ou référez-vous à votre section <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>notification sur la performance</a>.","ahd_cakyc_rap_self_trigger_cta":"En cliquant sur Commencer la vérification, vous effectuez la procédure de vérification d’identité au Canada. Consultez la<a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> page Informations sur l’identité</a> pour confirmer les étapes suivantes. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_verifying":"Nous sommes en train de valider vos informations. Dans certains cas, cette validation peut prendre entre 24 heures et 10 jours ouvrés. Il est possible que nous devions vous demander plus d’informations au cours de cette vérification. Consultez la section <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Notification sur la performance</a> et répondez à toute demande relative à votre compte Vendre sur Amazon.  \\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nDurant cette période, les informations relatives à votre identité ne peuvent pas être modifiées.","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_header":"Pour quelle raison dois-je fournir ces informations ?","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_header2":"Quel est le délai pour fournir les informations ? ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph":"Pour pouvoir utiliser un compte Vendre sur Amazon, la loi exige que vous procédiez à une vérification de votre identité. Conformément aux lois canadiennes, vous devez procéder à une vérification de votre identité pour pouvoir utiliser notre service. Certains documents et informations pourront vous être demandés afin de faciliter ces vérifications.<br><br>Pour plus d’informations, consultez la page d’aide <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Informations requises pour vendre sur Amazon</a>","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph2":"Amazon dispose d’un délai maximum de 60 jours pour effectuer la nouvelle vérification. Cela n’inclut pas le délai dont nous avons besoin pour terminer l’examen. Votre capacité à vendre et verser des fonds peut être restreinte si la nouvelle vérification n’est pas terminée dans un délai de 60 jours. Lorsque nous avons besoin d’informations, une notification apparaît sur la page d’informations de votre compte. Nous sommes susceptibles de vous fournir des informations supplémentaires sur cette demande dans vos notifications sur la performance. ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph3":"À terme, vous ne pourrez plus utiliser votre compte Vendre sur Amazon. Vous ne pourrez donc plus vendre sur Amazon.ca si vous ne fournissez pas ces informations. ","ahd_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_subtitle":"Vous avez une ou plusieurs actions en attente avant de pouvoir commencer à vendre vos produits. ","ahd_compliance_status":"État de conformité","ahd_compliance_widget_button":"Soumettre des informations sur la conformité","ahd_compliance_widget_ckp_redirect":"Lancer l’outil Référence de conformité","ahd_compliance_widget_description":"Soumettez des informations sur la conformité pour prouver la conformité réglementaire.","ahd_critical_account_health_notification":"Notification d’état du compte critique","ahd_critical_policy_violations":"Violations de politiques critiques","ahd_dac7_at_risk_banner":"<b>Votre compte risque d’être désactivé.</b><br><br> Votre compte risque d’être désactivé en raison d’informations fiscales manquantes requises par la <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB\\">réglementation DAC7</a>. Accédez au <a href= \\"/complianceportal\\">portail de conformité DAC7</a> pour commencer la vérification. ","ahd_dac7_compliant":"Vous êtes conforme à la DAC7 maintenant !","ahd_dac7_priority_action":"Informations requises de la DAC7","ahd_dac7_priority_action_pending":"En attente de vérification","ahd_dac7_rap_action":"Vous devez désormais soumettre vos informations de la DAC7 avant la date d’échéance.","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_launch_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Lancer le portail de la DAC7 pour soumettre vos informations</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal_status":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_status_blurb\'  target=\'_blank\'>Vérifiez l’état de votre vérification sur le portail de la DAC7</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_deactivated_message":"Votre compte a été désactivé pour non-conformité à la 7e révision de la Directive relative à la coopération administrative (DAC7)","ahd_dac7_rap_intro":"La <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/external/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB?ref_=to_dac_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>7e révision de la Directive relative à la coopération administrative (DAC7)</a> est un règlement de l’Union européenne qui oblige Amazon à collecter, vérifier et déclarer les données de vérification préalable, de TVA/fiscales et financières des vendeurs résidant dans l’UE, indépendamment de la boutique Amazon sur laquelle ils vendent.","ahd_dac7_rap_verify_now_button":"Vérifier maintenant","ahd_dac7_rap_verifying":"Nous examinons actuellement vos informations de la DAC7. Le processus d’examen prend généralement 72 heures, mais peut parfois prendre plus de temps dans certains cas. Vérifiez régulièrement l’état de votre vérification dans le portail de la DAC7 ci-dessous pour savoir si nous avons besoin de plus d’informations.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"Vous avez des actions en attente pour commencer à vendre sur le site de vente Amazon.com.br.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_subtitle":"Soumettez les informations pour remplir les exigences de vérification pour vendre au Brésil.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"Vous avez des actions en attente pour commencer à vendre sur le site de vente Amazon.ca.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_subtitle":"Soumettez les informations pour remplir les exigences de vérification pour vendre au Canada.","ahd_educational_banner_header":"Effectuez vos actions prioritaires","ahd_educational_banner_subheader":"Vous avez une ou plusieurs actions en attente qui entraîneront la désactivation du compte s’il n’a pas été complété à la date indiquée.","ahd_eg_trn_deactivation_banner":"<b>Votre compte a été désactivé.</b><br><br> Pour réactiver votre compte, consultez la page <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations>Paramètres fiscaux</a> et mettez à jour vos informations fiscales. Pour plus d’informations, consultez la page d’aide <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC>Foire aux questions sur la conformité fiscale</a>. ","ahd_error_loading_submit":"Une erreur s’est produite. Essayez de soumettre à nouveau.","ahd_fhdds_priority_action":"IEN requis pour les expéditions au Royaume-Uni reçues","ahd_inform_ac_checkbox_error":"Cochez la case pour confirmer que vous avez vérifié vos informations et certifier qu’elles sont exactes et à jour.","ahd_inform_ac_no_poc":"Informations d’identité non fournies. Si vous avez déjà soumis un document fiscal ou un document officiel à la place de ces informations, vous certifiez qu’aucune modification n’a été apportée à cette soumission.","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p1":"En vertu de la loi américaine INFORM Consumers Act, vous devez tenir certaines informations commerciales (ci-dessous) à jour et certifier électroniquement à Amazon que vous avez mis à jour vos informations ou que les informations déjà fournies sont toujours à jour. Certifiez que vos informations ci-dessous sont à jour dans les 10 jours suivant la consultation de cet avis, ou votre compte risque d’être désactivé. ","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p2":"Vous devez désormais certifier que les informations ci-dessous sont à jour dans les 10 jours suivant la première consultation de cet avis. Si vous ne les certifiez pas, votre compte risque d’être désactivé.","ahd_inform_ac_page1_checkbox":"Cochez la case pour confirmer que vous comprenez qu’une fois que vous serez sur la page Avis et certification de la loi INFORM Act, vous recevrez un avis et disposerez de 10 jours pour mettre à jour et certifier vos informations.","ahd_inform_ac_page1_step1_intructions":"Accédez à la page <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Informations sur le compte</a> ou cliquez sur le bouton Modifier pour mettre à jour les informations incorrectes ci-dessous. ","ahd_inform_ac_page2_certify_instructions":"Si vos informations ci-dessous sont à jour, vous pouvez les certifier dès maintenant. Si des informations sont incorrectes, accédez à la page <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Informations sur le compte</a> pour les modifier avant de cliquer sur Certifier.","ahd_inform_ac_refresh_update_info":"Si vous avez mis à jour les informations ci-dessous, cliquez ici pour actualiser la page et afficher les nouvelles informations.","ahd_inform_account_information_update_verification":"Les informations de votre compte ont été mises à jour et nous sommes en train de les vérifier. Revenez dans 24 heures pour déterminer si des étapes supplémentaires sont nécessaires pour commencer le processus de certification annuelle.","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_confirmation":"En cliquant sur Certifier, je certifie que j’ai lu l’avis ci-dessus et que les informations que j’ai fournies à Amazon sont vraies et correctes, correspondent à mon activité et ne sont pas détournées.","ahd_inform_act_ac_edit_information":"Modifiez les informations","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"Adresse e-mail","ahd_inform_act_ac_not_required":"La loi INFORM Act ne s’applique pas encore à votre entreprise. Vous n’êtes donc pas tenu de certifier vos informations. Nous vous informerons ultérieurement si vous êtes tenu de certifier vos informations.","ahd_inform_act_ac_notice_title":"Avis","ahd_inform_act_ac_short_description":"Vérifiez et complétez vos exigences en attente de la loi INFORM Consumers Act.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou":"Merci d’avoir certifié que les informations relatives à votre activité sont à jour. La page État du compte sera mise à jour dans quelques minutes pour confirmer que vous avez rempli vos obligations en attente concernant la certification et la notification de la loi INFORM.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou_banner":"Merci d’avoir certifié que les informations relatives à votre activité sont à jour. La page État du compte sera mise à jour dans quelques minutes pour confirmer que vous avez rempli vos obligations en attente concernant la certification et la notification de la loi INFORM.\\n<br><br>N’oubliez pas que vous devez maintenir vos informations commerciales à jour et certifier au moins une fois par an que votre nom, votre adresse, votre numéro de téléphone, votre adresse e-mail, vos coordonnées bancaires et votre numéro d’identification fiscale sont corrects.","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions":"Notez que seul l’utilisateur principal ou secondaire autorisé disposant des autorisations pour Confirmer/Modifier les informations sur le compte pourra certifier ces informations.","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions_error":"Ces informations doivent être certifiées par l’utilisateur principal du compte ou par un utilisateur secondaire autorisé à confirmer/modifier les informations du compte.","ahd_inform_act_account_information":"Informations sur le compte","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_deactivation_banner":"Afin de respecter la loi <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon doit collecter et vérifier les informations relatives à votre compte Vendre sur Amazon. Comme nous n’avons pas reçu les informations demandées, votre compte a été désactivé. Pour réactiver votre compte, consultez la liste ci-dessous et accédez à <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Informations sur le compte vendeur</a> pour terminer la vérification. <br><br>Une fois que vous aurez vérifié toutes les exigences en attente, votre compte sera réactivé sous 48 heures. ","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_hold_banner":"<b>Votre compte risque d’être désactivé et les versements de votre compte vendeur Amazon ont été mis en attente.</b><br><br>Afin de respecter la loi <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, Amazon doit collecter et vérifier les informations relatives à votre compte Vendre sur Amazon. Comme nous n’avons pas reçu les informations demandées dans les délais indiqués dans nos communications, vos versements sont désormais mis en attente. Pour réactiver vos versements, consultez la liste ci-dessous et accédez aux <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Informations sur le compte vendeur</a> pour commencer ou finaliser la soumission de vos informations.","ahd_inform_act_hold_wait_text":"Pour réactiver vos versements et empêcher la désactivation de votre compte, cliquez sur les actions ci-dessous pour accéder à l’option <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Informations sur le compte vendeur</a> et remplir les conditions en attente. <br><br>Merci d’avoir complété la vérification d’identité. Revenez dans 24 heures pour savoir si des étapes de vérification supplémentaires sont requises.","ahd_inform_act_hold_widget_description":"Pour réactiver vos versements et empêcher la désactivation de votre compte, cliquez sur les actions ci-dessous pour accéder à l’option <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Informations sur le compte vendeur</a> et remplir les conditions en attente. <br><br>Une fois la vérification d’identité terminée, il peut vous être demandé de vérifier un ou plusieurs des éléments supplémentaires ci-dessous.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_wait_text":"Cliquez sur les actions ci-dessous pour remplir les exigences en attente. Merci d’avoir complété la vérification d’identité. Revenez dans 24 heures pour savoir si des étapes de vérification supplémentaires sont requises.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_widget_description":"Cliquez sur les actions ci-dessous pour remplir les exigences en attente. Une fois la vérification d’identité terminée, il peut vous être demandé de vérifier un ou plusieurs des éléments supplémentaires ci-dessous.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_widget_help":"En savoir plus sur la loi INFORM Act","ahd_inform_act_need_help":"Vous avez besoin d’aide ? Consultez la <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>page d’aide sur la loi INFORM Act</a>.","ahd_inform_act_short_description":"Vérifiez et complétez vos exigences en attente de la loi INFORM Consumers Act.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>Nous avons terminé toutes les vérifications en cours. Merci pour les efforts que vous avez déployés afin de nous aider dans ce processus de vérification.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete_short":"<b>US INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br>Nous avons terminé toutes les vérifications en cours. Merci pour les efforts que vous avez déployés afin de nous aider dans ce processus de vérification.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete_widget":"Toutes les vérifications en cours ont bien été effectuées. Merci pour les efforts que vous avez déployés afin de nous aider dans ce processus de vérification.","ahd_inform_act_wait_text":"Merci de vérifier votre identité. Revenez dans 24 heures pour confirmer si des informations supplémentaires sont requises. <br><br> Cliquez sur les actions ci-dessous pour accéder à la page <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>Informations sur le compte vendeur</a> et remplir les exigences en attente.","ahd_inform_act_widget_description":"Cliquez sur les actions ci-dessous pour accéder à la page <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">Informations sur le compte vendeur</a> et remplir les exigences en attente. <br><br> Une fois la vérification d’identité terminée, il peut vous être demandé de vérifier un ou plusieurs des éléments supplémentaires ci-dessous.","ahd_inform_act_widget_title":"Loi sur les consommateurs INFORM","ahd_inform_annual_cerification_risk_banner":"Vous devez tenir à jour les informations sur votre activité et certifier","ahd_inform_annual_review_banner":"<b>Votre compte risque d’être désactivé. </b><br><br>Afin de respecter la loi <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7?ref_=ahd_annual_ inform_consumer_act\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, les informations de votre compte Vendre sur Amazon doivent être certifiées chaque année. Consultez la page <a href=\\"/mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render?ref_=ahd_annual_inform_certification\\">Certification annuelle</a> pour certifier que vos informations sont à jour..","ahd_inform_annual_review_complete":"<b>INFORM Consumers Act</b><br><br> Merci de remplir toutes les exigences restantes.","ahd_inform_annual_review_seller_enforced":"Afin de respecter la loi <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM Consumers Act</a>, vous devez certifier l’exactitude des informations de votre compte Vendre sur Amazon au moins une fois par an. Dans la mesure où nous n’avons pas reçu la certification demandée, votre compte a été désactivé. Pour réactiver votre compte, consultez la page <a href=\\" /mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render\\">Certification annuelle</a> afin de certifier que vos informations sont à jour. <br><br> Une fois la certification terminée, votre compte sera réactivé sous 48 heures.","ahd_inform_bav_not_verified":"Vous n’avez pas de compte bancaire vérifié ou n’avez pas désigné le compte bancaire vérifié comme mode de versement par défaut sur le site de vente américain. Vérifiez et attribuez votre compte bancaire par défaut sur la page <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Modes de versement</a>.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p1":"N’oubliez pas que vous devez maintenir vos informations commerciales à jour et certifier au moins une fois par an que votre nom, votre adresse, votre numéro de téléphone, votre adresse e-mail, vos coordonnées bancaires et votre numéro d’identification fiscale sont corrects.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p2":"Si l’une de vos informations change, Amazon devra également vérifier ces nouvelles informations. Répondez rapidement à toute demande d’informations pour que nous puissions vous aider à réaliser ces étapes de vérification supplémentaires afin d’éviter toute désactivation de compte. Pour plus d’informations sur le processus de vérification, consultez la page d’aide sur la loi <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act</a>.","ahd_inform_consumers_act_ac":"Avis et certification de la loi INFORM Act","ahd_inform_consumers_act_annual":"Certification annuelle de la loi sur les consommateurs INFORM ","ahd_inform_debit_card":"Vous devez vérifier votre compte bancaire actif secondaire pour continuer à recevoir des versements sur le site de vente américain. Vérifiez votre compte bancaire ici, sur la page <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Modes de versement</a>.","ahd_inform_loading_error":"Rendez-vous sur la page <a href=/hz/sc/account-information target=\\"_blank\\">Informations sur le compte</a> pour consulter vos informations actuelles.","ahd_inform_no_default_deposit":"Vous n’avez pas de compte bancaire vérifié ou n’avez pas désigné le compte bancaire vérifié comme mode de versement par défaut sur le site de vente américain. Vérifiez et attribuez votre compte bancaire par défaut sur la page <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Modes de versement</a>.","ahd_inform_page1_checkbox":"Je comprends qu’une fois que je procède à la procédure Avis et certification de la loi INFORM Act, je dois terminer la certification dans un délai de 10 jours afin d’éviter tout risque de désactivation de compte. ","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2a":"Nous enverrons aux vendeurs une notification officielle les invitant à vérifier et à certifier la validité de leurs renseignements commerciaux.","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2b":"Vous pouvez toutefois le faire dès maintenant pour éviter tout risque de désactivation future.","ahd_inform_page1_proceed_title":"Procédez à la procédure Avis et certification de la loi INFORM Act","ahd_inform_page1_step2_description":"Si vos informations sont à jour ou si vous venez de les mettre à jour, passez à l’étape suivante (Avis et certification) pour recevoir l’avis formel et terminer votre certification. Une fois que vous avez pris connaissance de cet avis, la loi vous oblige à certifier vos informations dans un délai de 10 jours.","ahd_inform_page_1_p1":"Nous nous efforçons en permanence de garantir une expérience d’achat digne de confiance, pour vous et vos clients. À cette fin, nous collecterons et vérifierons auprès de vous, au moins une fois par an, certains de vos renseignements commerciaux, notamment les informations requises par la loi américaine INFORM Consumers Act.","ahd_inform_sw_bav":"Vous devez vérifier vos comptes bancaires actifs. Vérifiez vos comptes bancaires ici, sur la page <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>Modes de versement</a>.","ahd_inform_tax_q_redirect":"Consultez la page du <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/1099KTaxInformation/step/1099KTaxInformation?immediateRedirect=true&intent=INFORM_ACT target=\\"_blank\\">questionnaire fiscal INFORM</a> pour consulter vos informations actuelles.","ahd_itr_extension_extension_request_link":"soumettez les documents requis.","ahd_itr_extension_request":"Si vous souhaitez demander une prorogation ou être exempté de ces exigences, consultez la page suivante : ${appealUrl}.","ahd_itr_rap_appeals":"J’ai mis à jour mes informations liées au Codice Fiscale italien dans les paramètres fiscaux et je souhaite demander une nouvelle validation.","ahd_itr_rap_dispute":"Je ne suis pas d’accord avec la décision d’Amazon concernant la validation de mon Codice Fiscale italien.","ahd_itr_rap_intro":"La <a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>loi italienne n° 157/2019</a> demande aux vendeurs basés en Italie qui réalisent une ou plusieurs transactions sur Amazon.it d’ajouter leur « codice fiscale » (code fiscal) italien dans leurs Paramètres fiscaux.","ahd_itr_remediation_corp":"Soumettez votre codice fiscale italien dans Paramètres fiscaux <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. Selon nos informations (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), votre compte est enregistré en tant que société et nous avons donc besoin de votre numéro d’inscription d’entreprise (appelé « codice fiscale », correspondant au numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA sans code pays « IT »). Consultez la page d’aide (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>loi italienne n° 157/2019</a>) pour connaître les étapes de soumission. Vous devez vous assurer que votre nom légal figurant sur la page Informations commerciales (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) et que votre numéro d’inscription d’entreprise dans Paramètres fiscaux <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> correspond à la base de données de l’administration fiscale italienne.","ahd_itr_remediation_individual":"Soumettez votre codice fiscale italien dans Paramètres fiscaux <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. Selon nos informations (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), votre compte est enregistré en tant que personne physique et nous avons donc besoin de votre pièce d’identité nationale (connue sous le nom de « codice fiscale »). Consultez les pages d’aide (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>loi italienne n° 157/2019</a>) pour connaître les étapes de soumission. Vous devez vous assurer que votre nom légal figurant sur la page Informations commerciales (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) et que le numéro d’identification de la personne figurant dans les Paramètres fiscaux <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> correspondent à la base de données de l’administration fiscale italienne.","ahd_itr_remediation_unkown":"Soumettez vos informations sur la page Informations commerciales (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render). Les sociétés doivent fournir leur numéro d’inscription d’entreprise (appelé « codice fiscale », correspondant au numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA sans code pays « IT »), tandis que les vendeurs individuels, y compris les propriétaires uniques (« P. IVA individuale »), doivent charger leur pièce d’identité nationale personnelle (également appelée « codice fiscale ») dans Paramètres fiscaux<https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. Vous devez vous assurer que votre nom légal figurant sur la page Informations commerciales <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render> et que le codice fiscale figurant dans Paramètres fiscaux <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns> correspond à la base de données de l’administration italienne.","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_details_fallback_text":"Vous avez des questions sur la tenue d’un compte sain ? Obtenez des conseils personnalisés de la part de l’assistant vendeur.","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_suggestion_fallback_text":"Chat sur l’état du compte","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_title":"Demander à l’assistant vendeur","ahd_mvblsivna_priority_action":"Effectuez votre vérification","ahd_other_policy_violation_title":"Violation d’une autre politique","ahd_payment_policy_hd_priority_action":"Vos fonds sont en suspens en raison d’actions en attente sur votre compte. Pour réactiver vos versements, consultez les <b>actions prioritaires</b>.","ahd_pr_form_address_header":"Traitez les sanctions pour les produits non conformes afin de continuer à vendre vos produits.","ahd_pr_form_address_sub_header":"Conformément aux instructions du ministère de la Justice, Amazon simplifie vos obligations de conformité réglementaire en déclarant et en payant en votre nom les taxes liées à vos commandes sur Amazon, puis en récupérant ces montants depuis votre compte.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_info":"Conformément au décret de consentement EPA/DOJ, nous sommes tenus de pénaliser les vendeurs pour toute violation des politiques relatives à l’EPA. Vous trouverez plus d’informations sur <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account/health/product-policies\\">les produits non conformes</a>, le calcul des sanctions associées, les réserves appliquées à votre compte et les communications envoyées pour soumettre des contestations. Vous serez alors facturé pour toutes les sanctions en attente.<br/><br/> Avant de vous facturer les sanctions, nous bloquerons votre compte tout en vous donnant l’opportunité de corriger votre produit mis en vente.","ahd_pr_form_impact_p1":"Obligation de payer des pénalités (consultez les détails de la violation ci-dessous","ahd_pr_form_impact_p2":"Le produit mis en vente restera supprimé conformément aux instructions de l’EPA/du ministère de la Justice","ahd_pr_form_impact_p3":"Impact négatif sur l’état de votre compte, ce qui peut conduire à la désactivation de votre compte vendeur","ahd_pr_form_note":"Remarque : avant de vous facturer des pénalités, nous bloquerons votre compte pendant 30 jours, tout en vous donnant l’opportunité de corriger votre produit mis en vente.","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_body":"Ce produit a été identifié comme pesticide, dispositif antiparasitaire ou produit contenant des propriétés pesticides. Pour qu’une demande de rétablissement soit envisagée, fournissez un numéro d’enregistrement de l’EPA et/ou un numéro d’établissement de l’EPA, ou une certification justifiant que le produit n’est pas soumis aux réglementations de l’EPA. Vous devez fournir ces informations dans l’attribut Marquage des pesticides de la mise en vente. <a href=/help/hub/reference/GLX9EJX844SNJX7J> Les instructions pour remplir cet attribut sont disponibles sur Seller Central.</a>","ahd_pre_enforcment_non_deactivation_subheader":"Vous avez une ou plusieurs actions en attente pouvant entraîner l’interruption de votre compte à l’avenir.","ahd_priority_actions_address_by_date":"Traitez-les d’ici le {date} dans un délai de {daysremaining} jours","ahd_priority_actions_cr":"Violations du taux d’annulations","ahd_priority_actions_description":"Corrigez les problèmes ci-dessous pour empêcher la désactivation du compte.","ahd_priority_actions_otdr":"Violations du taux de livraisons dans les délais","ahd_priority_actions_verification_status":"Commencer la vérification","ahd_priority_actions_verification_title":"Remplir les exigences de vérification","ahd_pspp_priority_actions":"Effectuez l’examen de connaissance client (KYC) en attente - Fournisseur se services de paiement","ahd_pspp_rap_intro":"Votre compte bancaire n’est pas éligible à la réception de versements. Contactez votre fournisseur de services de paiement pour effectuer l’examen de connaissance client (KYC) en attente.","ahd_pspp_rap_next_steps":"Consultez les pages <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GY8JTVAWBPQT2XFC?ref_=to_psp_faq_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>FAQ sur les fournisseurs de services de paiement</a> et <a href=\'/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView?ref_=to_deposit_method_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>Mode de versement</a> pour en savoir plus. ","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory":"Pays affectés par des restrictions de stock","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory_details":"Répondez exigences en suspens afin d’éviter toute interruption de votre stock Expédié par Amazon et de vos capacités d’importation ou d’exportation dans le pays indiqué.","ahd_rap_at_risk_regional_details":"Les exigences indiquées affectent l’état de votre compte sur plusieurs sites de vente. Répondez exigences en suspens pour éviter toute désactivation du compte sur tous les sites de vente concernés.","ahd_rap_check_verification":"Vérifier le statut de la vérification","ahd_rap_enforced_inventory_details":"Répondez exigences en suspens afin d’éliminer les restrictions portant sur votre stock Expédié par Amazon et vos capacités d’importation ou d’exportation dans le pays indiqué.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p1":"Pour pouvoir utiliser un compte Vendre sur Amazon, la loi exige que vous procédiez à une vérification de votre identité. Comme l’exigent les lois canadiennes et brésiliennes, vous devez procéder à une vérification de votre identité pour pouvoir utiliser notre service. Certains documents et informations pourront vous être demandés afin de faciliter ces vérifications.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p2":"Quel est le délai pour fournir les informations ?","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p3":"Vous pouvez fournir les informations de vérification requises à tout moment après votre inscription. L’accès à votre compte sera limité jusqu’à ce que les informations aient été fournies et vérifiées.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p4":"Si vous souhaitez continuer le processus et vendre sur Amazon.ca ou Amazon.com.br, cochez la case située en regard du site de vente sur lequel vous souhaitez effectuer la vérification ci-dessous. Une fois que vous avez choisi d’effectuer la vérification, consultez la page Informations d’identité pour connaître les étapes suivantes.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p5":"Si vous souhaitez d’abord effectuer la vérification pour un site de vente unique, sélectionnez uniquement ce site de vente dans la liste ci-dessous. Une fois la vérification terminée pour ce site de vente, vous serez averti que vous devez suivre les étapes requises pour commencer la vérification pour l’autre site de vente.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_select_stores":"Sélectionner les sites de vente ","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_thankyou_p2":"Vos informations sont en cours de validation. Nous pourrons être amenés à vous demander des détails pendant cet examen. Cette validation peut prendre jusqu’à 24 heures, voire 10 jours ouvrés dans certains cas. Durant cette période, les informations relatives à votre identité ne peuvent pas être modifiées.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_check_verification_status":"Vérifiez le statut de votre vérification et les étapes suivantes requises sur la page Informations sur le compte.","ahd_rap_past_due_inventory":"EN RETARD - Restrictions concernant les capacités de stock","ahd_rap_voluntary_submission_action":"D’après les informations dont nous disposons, vous n’êtes pas tenu d’avoir un numéro de TVA ${countryName}. Pour vous conformer à cette exigence, vous pouvez soit le supprimer des <a href=\'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Paramètres fiscaux</a>, soit procéder à la résolution du problème ci-dessus.","ahd_sa_account_health_guidance_description":"Vous avez des questions sur l’état du compte ? Obtenez des conseils personnalisés auprès de l’assistant vendeur.","ahd_sa_ask_seller_assistant_title":"Demander à l’assistant vendeur","ahd_sa_chat_about_account_health_label":"Chat sur l’état du compte","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_label":"Résumer la conformité des produits","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_text":"Pouvez-vous résumer mes infractions à la conformité des produits ?","ahd_uaebizlicense_priority_action":"Charger votre licence commerciale","ahd_vas_extension_extension_request_link":"soumettez les documents requis.","ahd_vas_extension_request":"Si vous souhaitez demander une extension ou que vous n’êtes pas d’accord avec la décision d’Amazon, <a href=\\"${appealUrl}\\" target=\\"_blank\\">soumettez les documents requis.</a>","ahd_vas_priority_action":"Exigences relatives à l’immatriculation à la TVA européenne","ahd_vas_rap_action_address_country":" <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Vérifier/mettre à jour les informations de l’adresse</a>","ahd_vas_rap_action_address_review":"<a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Vérifier les informations soumises sur l’adresse</a>","ahd_vas_rap_action_name_review":"<a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>Vérifier les informations soumises sur le nom</a>","ahd_vas_rap_deactivated_message":"Les exigences indiquées affectent l’état de votre compte sur plusieurs sites de vente. Répondez exigences en suspens pour le pays indiqué afin de réactiver votre compte sur tous les sites de vente concernés.","ahd_vas_rap_intro":"Les <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GTQ23HPXBQK563WS\' target=\'_blank\'>exigences relatives à l’immatriculation à la TVA en Europe</a> sont établies dans le cadre d’une politique applicable aux sites de vente Amazon en Europe, selon laquelle tous les partenaires de vente actifs sur des sites de vente en Europe doivent soumettre un numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA valide, conformément aux obligations en vigueur.  Consultez la section Impact sur l’état du compte pour répondre à vos exigences en attente.","ahd_vas_rap_secondary_action":"Si vous ne disposez pas d’un numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA pour le pays indiqué, accédez au portail <a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>Renseignements commerciaux</a> et au portail <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>Paramètres fiscaux</a> pour soumettre les informations requises (numéro de TVA, nom et adresse) pour les pays suivants :","ahd_vas_rap_third_action":"Si vous avez choisi l’option du guichet unique de l’Union européenne dans votre pays de résidence, accédez à la page <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>Paramètres fiscaux</a> en sélectionnant votre pays de résidence dans le menu Déclaration de TVA du guichet unique de l’Union européenne. Assurez-vous que l’option du guichet unique de l’Union européenne est activée et que le nom et l’adresse fournis à Amazon correspondent à ceux fournis aux autorités.","ahd_violation_display_name":"Violations de la politique de produits interdits","ahd_w8_priority_action":"Mise à jour des informations d’identité fiscale requises aux États-Unis","ahd_w8_rap_intro":"Un nouveau formulaire W-8 fiscal est requis. Une fois votre formulaire expiré, votre compte vendeur sera désactivé temporairement jusqu’à ce que vous fournissiez des informations fiscales mises à jour.\\n\\n<br><br>Ces exigences affectent l’état de votre compte sur plusieurs sites de vente.  Répondez aux exigences répertoriées pour éviter toute désactivation du compte sur tous les sites de vente concernés.\\n\\n<br><br>Pour en savoir plus, consultez la page <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G200663290?ref_=to_w8_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>Foire aux questions sur les déclarations de revenus et la collecte d’identité fiscale aux États-Unis.</a>","ahr-status-badge-great":"Sain","ai_inform_page1_step2":"2. Une fois que vous avez confirmé l’exactitude de vos informations, retournez sur cette page et cliquez sur le lien ci-dessous pour recevoir votre avis officiel et terminer la certification.","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Les composants Katal étant des extensions d’éléments HTML, JavaScript peut interagir avec eux de la même manière qu’avec les éléments HTML intégrés. Ici, nous constatons que JavaScript modifie l’attribut \'variant\' dans l’alerte.","components_containing_html_text":"Certains composants peuvent intégrer du contenu HTML, à l’instar de notre composant KatalTabs. Ces composants complexes fournissent une API permettant aux développeurs et aux infrastructures d’interagir avec eux.","demo_complex_header_text":"Démonstration : composants Katal complexes","demo_components_header_text":"Démonstration : utilisation de composants Katal","design_approved_text":"Katal propose des composants approuvés pour une utilisation sur des pages Web, qui peuvent être configurés avec des étiquettes et des paramètres personnalisés. Par exemple : les boutons standard et les boutons secondaires, dont la seule différence réside dans leur attribut \'variant\'.","documentation_label":"Documentation Katal","fba_inventory_uc_identifier":"Nos dossiers indiquent que vous détenez des stocks en ${COUNTRY} dans le cadre du programme Expédié par Amazon. En tant que vendeur utilisant les services Expédié par Amazon, vous devez fournir un numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA valide pour chaque pays dans lequel votre stock est entreposé. Vous pouvez vérifier les pays dans lesquels vous avez activé le service Expédié par Amazon <a href=/fba/settings/ target=\\"_blank\\">ici</a>.\\r\\nN’oubliez pas que vous devez soumettre un numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA valide qui a été activé pour les transactions intracommunautaires.","greeting_description":"Voici un exemple d’application Katal, qui montre comment utiliser les composants Katal ainsi que l’outil de création et de déploiement. Si vous avez des questions ou des commentaires, contactez l’équipe Katal à l’adresse colombia-team@amazon.com. Pour continuer cette démonstration, ignorez cette alerte.","greeting_description_mons_app":"Voici un exemple d’application Katal, qui montre comment utiliser les composants Katal avec des traductions. Si vous avez des questions ou des commentaires, contactez l’équipe Katal à l’adresse katal-team@amazon.com.","greeting_header":"Informations sur l’exemple d’application","inform_mobile_notification_description":"Consultez la page État du compte pour consulter vos exigences de vérification de la loi INFORM en attente.","inform_mobile_notification_description_full":"Votre compte vendeur Amazon.com risque d’être désactivé. Consultez la page État du compte pour consulter vos exigences de vérification de la loi INFORM en attente.","mobile_ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"Connectez-vous à Seller Central à partir d’un navigateur Web.","mobile_tutorial_inform_act_description":"Afin de respecter la loi INFORM Consumers Act, Amazon doit collecter et vérifier les informations relatives à votre compte Vendre sur Amazon. Vous avez actuellement des éléments d’action de vérification en attente.","poe_domestic_uc_identifier":"Nos dossiers internes indiquent que vos ventes en ${COUNTRY} dépassent le seuil national applicable à l’immatriculation à la TVA.","ppc_fhdds_action_taken":"Risque de restrictions sur les expéditions entrantes au Royaume-Uni","sc_homepage_education_phase_description":"Réglez l’état de votre compte pour éviter tout risque de désactivation future du compte.","sc_homepage_pending_deactivation":"Un événement critique est survenu dans votre compte et ce dernier risque d’être désactivé. ","sc_inform_act_view_account_health_banner":"Accédez à État du compte","sc_navbar_ah_cs_desc":"Consultez vos indicateurs de performance du service client, notamment votre taux de commandes défectueuses et votre taux de défaut de facturation.","sc_navbar_ah_desc":"Consultez votre évaluation de l’état du compte, et découvrez quels problèmes peuvent avoir un impact sur l’état de votre compte, ainsi que les violations pouvant entraîner une suppression de contenu ou une désactivation de compte.","sc_navbar_ah_eligibilities_desc":"Découvrez les bénéfices et programmes auxquels vous pouvez être éligible.","sc_navbar_ah_myc_desc":"Assurez-vous que tous vos produits sont conformes à l’ensemble des lois, réglementations et politiques Amazon en vigueur.","sc_navbar_ah_ppc_desc":"Découvrez toutes les violations de politiques pouvant entraîner une suppression de contenu ou une désactivation de compte. ","sc_navbar_ah_sp_desc":"Consultez vos indicateurs de performance liés à l’expédition, notamment le taux d’expéditions en retard, le taux d’annulations de commandes avant traitement, le taux de suivi valide et le taux de livraisons dans les délais.  ","schp_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_header":"Répondez aux exigences de vérification en attente pour commencer à vendre sur Amazon.","schp_inventory_restriction_card":"Résolvez les problèmes liés à l’état de votre compte pour supprimer les restrictions de stock sur votre compte.","ship_from_non_poe_uc_identifier":"Nos dossiers internes indiquent que vous expédiez depuis ${COUNTRY} un pays différent de celui de votre pays d’origine. Par conséquent, vous devez fournir un numéro de TVA VIES ou un numéro de TVA applicable pour les transactions effectuées dans l’UE. Vous pouvez vérifier votre adresse de livraison depuis la page Paramètres d’expédition ou depuis ce <a href=/sbr target=\\"_blank\\">lien</a>.\\nN’oubliez pas que vous devez soumettre un numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA valide qui a été activé pour les transactions intracommunautaires.","ship_from_poe_uc_identifier":"Nos dossiers indiquent que vos ventes transfrontalières dépassent 10 000 EUR dans les pays de l’Union européenne. En tant que vendeur effectuant des ventes transfrontalières, vous devez fournir un numéro de TVA du guichet unique de l’UE dans votre pays d’implantation ou un numéro de TVA valide pour tous les pays vers lesquels vous expédiez vos produits.","ship_to_non_eu_uc_identifier":"Nos dossiers internes indiquent que certaines de vos expéditions dépassent les 150 EUR depuis des pays en dehors de l’Union européenne vers ${COUNTRY}. Par conséquent, vous devez fournir un numéro de TVA ${COUNTRY} valide ou une déclaration confirmant que vous n’êtes pas l’importateur officiel pour la ou les expéditions dépassent le seuil.","ship_to_uoss_uc_identifier":"Nos dossiers internes indiquent que vous réalisez des ventes transfrontalières vers ${COUNTRY} depuis un autre pays de l’Union européenne. Par conséquent, vous êtes tenu de fournir un numéro de TVA du guichet unique de l’UE de votre pays d’implantation ou un numéro de TVA ${COUNTRY} valide.\\r\\nN’oubliez pas que vous devez soumettre un numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA valide qui a été activé pour les transactions intracommunautaires.","ship_to_xborder_uc_identifier":"Nos dossiers internes indiquent que vous réalisez des ventes transfrontalières vers ${COUNTRY} depuis un autre pays de l’Union européenne. Par conséquent, vous êtes tenu de fournir un numéro de TVA ${COUNTRY} valide.","sp-aha-check-eligibility-button":"Découvrez ce qu’il faut pour être éligible","sp-permanent-call-me-now-need-help":"Besoin d\'aide?","sp-permanent-call-me-now-prompt":"Adressez-vous à un spécialiste de l’état du compte","sp_health_cancellation_rate_caption":"Taux d\'annulations de commandes avant traitement","sp_health_dashboard_subheader":"Pour pouvoir vendre sur Amazon, vous devez respecter les objectifs de performance et les politiques décrits ci-dessous.","sp_health_gl_office_product":"Fournitures de bureau","sp_health_gl_watch":"Montre","sp_health_intellectual_property_customer_complaints":"Réception de réclamations au titre de la propriété intellectuelle","sp_health_late_shipment_rate_caption":"Taux d\'expéditions en retard","sp_health_listing_policy_customer_complaints":"Violations de politiques de produits mis en vente","sp_health_mobile_by_ahr_impact_tab_title":"Par impact de l’évaluation de l’état du compte","sp_health_nav_account_health":"Santé du compte","sp_health_nav_eligibilities":"Eligibilités","sp_health_not_available":"S/O","sp_health_orders_of_total":"${hash-get orders_number} sur ${hash-get orders_total} commandes","sp_health_orders_of_total_orders":"${hash-get orders_number} sur ${hash-get orders_total} commandes","sp_health_pre_fulfillment_cancel_rate":"Taux d\'annulation de commandes avant expédition","sp_health_product_condition_customer_complaints":"Réclamations des clients relatives à l’état des produits","sp_health_product_quality_popover":"Ce total comprendra les réclamations que vous avez peut-être déjà résolues par le biais d\'un plan d\'action.","sp_health_product_safety_customer_complaints":"Problèmes de sécurité sanitaire des aliments et des produits","sp_health_risk_banner_vtr":"Vos mises en vente expédiées par le vendeur risquent d’être désactivées. Votre taux de suivi valide est de ${hash-get metricValue} ; l’objectif est de ${hash-get target}.","sp_health_shipments_of_total_shipments":"${hash-get shipments_number} expéditions sur ${hash-get shipments_total}","sp_health_shipping_bucket_caption":"Performances d\'expédition","sp_health_shipping_eligibilities":"Voir les conditions d’expédition ici","sp_health_violation_details_selling_assistant_title":"Demander à l’assistant vendeur","sp_health_violation_details_stale_page_button_label":"Retour à État du compte","sp_mfn_at_risk_warning":"Vos produits mis en vente expédiés par le vendeur risquent d’être désactivés","sp_st_date_range":"${hash-get startDate} à ${hash-get endDate}","sp_vtr_list_ca":"1. Produits lourds et volumineux expédiés par un transporteur non intégré à Amazon. En savoir plus sur les transporteurs intégrés.</br></br>2. Les produits de petite taille dont la valeur de la commande est inférieure à 30 $ (frais d’expédition compris) et sont expédiés dans des enveloppes Poste Canada - courrier standard ou courrier de première classe.</br></br>3. Expéditions internationales depuis la Chine dont la valeur de la commande est inférieure à 6 $CAD (frais d\'expédition compris)</br></br>4. Expéditions internationales depuis des pays autres que les États-Unis et la Chine.</br></br>5. Commandes numériques qui ne peuvent pas être expédiées physiquement par un transporteur, par exemple : livres audio","sp_zero_tolerance_banner_body":"En raison d’une ou plusieurs violations critiques, votre compte est en cours de désactivation. Pour empêcher la désactivation, traitez ces violations dès maintenant. Pour plus d’informations, consultez la <a href=/gp/help/G200205250>politique du programme d’évaluation de l’état du compte</a>.","submission_status_ahd_review_submission_pending_status":"État : notre évaluation est en cours.","ts-form-header":"Signaler une violation de la politique","valid_vat_number_uc_identifier":"N’oubliez pas que vous devez soumettre un numéro d’immatriculation à la TVA valide qui a été activé pour les transactions intracommunautaires.","voluntary_vrn_uc_identifier":"Nos dossiers internes indiquent que vous n’êtes pas tenu de détenir un numéro de TVA pour ${COUNTRY}, mais que vous en avez fourni un sur Seller Central qui n’est actuellement pas valide. Pour résoudre cette incohérence, vous pouvez soit supprimer le numéro de TVA ${COUNTRY}, soit fournir un numéro valide. En supprimant votre numéro de TVA ${COUNTRY} de Seller Central, vous confirmez que vous n’êtes pas tenu d’en détenir un pour ${COUNTRY}. Nous vous recommandons de consulter un conseiller fiscal pour déterminer si l’ensemble de vos activités commerciales, sur Amazon et en dehors, nécessite une immatriculation à la TVA."}}}'),JSON.parse('{"gu":{"pages.floatingWidget":{"DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_content":"તમે સેલરના અનુભવને બહેતર બનાવવા માટેના પ્રયોગનો ભાગ છો: હમણાંથી, ખરીદનાર સંપર્ક દર, સંપર્ક પ્રતિભાવ સમય અને ખરીદનાર અસંતોષ દર પર સારું પરફોર્મન્સ તમારા AHR સ્કોરને વધારી શકે છે! આ ફેરફાર AHRને ઉત્તમ ગ્રાહક સેવાને રિવોર્ડ આપવામાં મદદ કરે છે. ફીડબેક મેનેજર પર તમારું કસ્ટમર સર્વિસ પરફોર્મન્સ હમણાં તપાસો.","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_cta_done":"ફીડબેક મેનેજર","DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_header":"સશક્ત ગ્રાહક સેવા માટે AHR પોઇન્ટ મેળવો","DYK_JP_LINE_content":"Amazon LINE ઓફિશિયલ એકાઉન્ટ, અમે ઇમેઇલ અને Seller Central દ્વારા મોકલેલા નોટિફિકેશન વિશે પસંદગીના નોટિફિકેશન મોકલે છે જેમાં સેલર્સ દ્વારા તમારા એકાઉન્ટની સ્ટેટસ, લિસ્ટિંગ સ્ટેટસ અને ચુકવણી ડિસબર્સમેન્ટ ભૂલો જેવા વિષયો પર પગલાં લેવાની જરૂર પડે છે. LINE દ્વારા નોટિફિકેશન મેળવવા અને મહત્વપૂર્ણ નોટિફિકેશન ચૂકી જવાનું ટાળવા માટે તમારા Seller Central એકાઉન્ટને LINE સત્તાવાર એકાઉન્ટ સાથે કનેક્ટ કરો. વધુ જાણો","DYK_JP_LINE_cta_done":"LINE નિર્ણાયક નોટિફિકેશન વિશે જાણો","DYK_JP_LINE_header":"તમે તમારા એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ માટે મહત્વપૂર્ણ વ્યક્તિગત મહત્વપૂર્ણ મેસેજ પ્રાપ્ત કરવા માટે LINE એકાઉન્ટ સાથે કનેક્ટ કરી શકો છો.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_content":"ગ્રેટ સેલર ન્યૂઝ! તમે એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ એશ્યોરન્સ (AHA) માટે લાયક બન્યાના 60 દિવસની અંદર છો. તમારા એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ રેટિંગને 250 થી ઉપર રાખો અને વધુ સારી એકાઉન્ટ સુરક્ષા મેળવવા માટે માન્ય ઇમરજન્સી સંપર્ક નંબર ફાઇલ પર રાખો. એકવાર તમે આપમેળે નોંધણી કરાવી લો પછી અમે તમને ઇમેઇલ દ્વારા સૂચિત કરીશું.","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_cta_done":"AHA વિશે જાણો","DYK_SSAT_AHAcountdown_header":"એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ એશ્યોરન્સ નોંધણી નજીક આવી રહી છે","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_content":"તમારું એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ રેટિંગ જોખમમાં અથવા અસ્વસ્થ સ્ટેટ્સ પર ખસેડાઈ ગયું છે. એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ સ્પેશિયાલિસ્ટ સાથે વાત કરવા અને તમારા સેલિંગ વિશેષાધિકારોનું રક્ષણ કરવા માટે \'મને અત્યારે કોલ કરો\' પર ક્લિક કરો.","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_cta_done":"મને અત્યારે કોલ કરો","DYK_SSAT_AHRunhealthy_header":"તમારી એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ રેટિંગ પર ધ્યાન આપવાની જરૂર છે","DYK_SSAT_CFT_DietarySupp_content":"કમ્પ્લાયન્સ ફાસ્ટ-ટ્રેક દ્વારા તમારી ડાયેટરી સપ્લિમેન્ટ કેટેગરી લિસ્ટિંગનું રક્ષણ કરો. જ્યારે કોઈ સહભાગી સંસ્થા તમારા પ્રોડક્ટ્સને પ્રમાણિત કરે છે ત્યારે આપમેળે કમ્પ્લાયન્સ માન્યતા મેળવો, જેનાથી કમ્પ્લાયન્સ દસ્તાવેજો સબમિટ કરવાની જરૂરિયાત દૂર થાય છે.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_Toys_content":"કમ્પ્લાયન્સ ફાસ્ટ-ટ્રેક દ્વારા તમારી રમકડાં કેટેગરી લિસ્ટિંગનું રક્ષણ કરો. જ્યારે કોઈ સહભાગી સંસ્થા તમારા પ્રોડક્ટ્સને પ્રમાણિત કરે છે ત્યારે આપમેળે કમ્પ્લાયન્સ માન્યતા મેળવો, જેનાથી કમ્પ્લાયન્સ દસ્તાવેજો સબમિટ કરવાની જરૂરિયાત દૂર થાય છે.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_artscrafts_content":"કમ્પ્લાયન્સ ફાસ્ટ-ટ્રેક દ્વારા તમારી આર્ટ્સ અને ક્રાફ્ટ કેટેગરી લિસ્ટિંગનું રક્ષણ કરો. જ્યારે કોઈ સહભાગી સંસ્થા તમારા પ્રોડક્ટ્સને પ્રમાણિત કરે છે ત્યારે આપમેળે કમ્પ્લાયન્સ માન્યતા મેળવો, જેનાથી કમ્પ્લાયન્સ દસ્તાવેજો સબમિટ કરવાની જરૂરિયાત દૂર થાય છે.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_buttoncellbatteryproducts_content":"કમ્પ્લાયન્સ ફાસ્ટ-ટ્રેક દ્વારા તમારી બટન સેલ બેટરી કેટેગરી લિસ્ટિંગનું રક્ષણ કરો. જ્યારે કોઈ સહભાગી સંસ્થા તમારા પ્રોડક્ટ્સને પ્રમાણિત કરે છે ત્યારે આપમેળે કમ્પ્લાયન્સ માન્યતા મેળવો, જેનાથી કમ્પ્લાયન્સ દસ્તાવેજો સબમિટ કરવાની જરૂરિયાત દૂર થાય છે.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_childrensproducts_content":"કમ્પ્લાયન્સ ફાસ્ટ-ટ્રેક દ્વારા તમારા બાળકોના પ્રોડક્ટ કેટેગરી લિસ્ટિંગનું રક્ષણ કરો. જ્યારે કોઈ સહભાગી સંસ્થા તમારા પ્રોડક્ટ્સને પ્રમાણિત કરે છે ત્યારે આપમેળે કમ્પ્લાયન્સ માન્યતા મેળવો, જેનાથી કમ્પ્લાયન્સ દસ્તાવેજો સબમિટ કરવાની જરૂરિયાત દૂર થાય છે.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_cta_done":"આજે જ સાઇન અપ કરો","DYK_SSAT_CFT_electronics_content":"કમ્પ્લાયન્સ ફાસ્ટ-ટ્રેક દ્વારા તમારી ઇલેકટ્રોનિક કેટેગરી લિસ્ટિંગનું રક્ષણ કરો. જ્યારે કોઈ સહભાગી સંસ્થા તમારા પ્રોડક્ટ્સને પ્રમાણિત કરે છે ત્યારે આપમેળે કમ્પ્લાયન્સ માન્યતા મેળવો, જેનાથી કમ્પ્લાયન્સ દસ્તાવેજો સબમિટ કરવાની જરૂરિયાત દૂર થાય છે.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_emobilityproducts_content":"કમ્પ્લાયન્સ ફાસ્ટ-ટ્રેક દ્વારા તમારી ઇ-મોબિલિટી કેટેગરી લિસ્ટિંગનું રક્ષણ કરો. જ્યારે કોઈ સહભાગી સંસ્થા તમારા પ્રોડક્ટ્સને પ્રમાણિત કરે છે ત્યારે આપમેળે કમ્પ્લાયન્સ માન્યતા મેળવો, જેનાથી કમ્પ્લાયન્સ દસ્તાવેજો સબમિટ કરવાની જરૂરિયાત દૂર થાય છે.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_firesafety_content":"કમ્પ્લાયન્સ ફાસ્ટ-ટ્રેક દ્વારા તમારી ફાયર સેફ્ટી કેટેગરી લિસ્ટિંગનું રક્ષણ કરો. જ્યારે કોઈ સહભાગી સંસ્થા તમારા પ્રોડક્ટ્સને પ્રમાણિત કરે છે ત્યારે આપમેળે કમ્પ્લાયન્સ માન્યતા મેળવો, જેનાથી કમ્પ્લાયન્સ દસ્તાવેજો સબમિટ કરવાની જરૂરિયાત દૂર થાય છે.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_furniture_content":"કમ્પ્લાયન્સ ફાસ્ટ-ટ્રેક દ્વારા તમારી ફર્નિચર કેટેગરી લિસ્ટિંગનું રક્ષણ કરો. જ્યારે કોઈ સહભાગી સંસ્થા તમારા પ્રોડક્ટ્સને પ્રમાણિત કરે છે ત્યારે આપમેળે કમ્પ્લાયન્સ માન્યતા મેળવો, જેનાથી કમ્પ્લાયન્સ દસ્તાવેજો સબમિટ કરવાની જરૂરિયાત દૂર થાય છે.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_header":"કમ્પ્લાયન્સને સરળ બનાવો: આજે જ કમ્પ્લાયન્સ ફાસ્ટ-ટ્રેકમાં નોંધણી કરો","DYK_SSAT_CFT_infantbabyproducts_content":"કમ્પ્લાયન્સ ફાસ્ટ-ટ્રેક દ્વારા તમારા ઇન્ફન્ટ અને બેબી પ્રોડક્ટ કેટેગરી લિસ્ટિંગનું રક્ષણ કરો. જ્યારે કોઈ સહભાગી સંસ્થા તમારા પ્રોડક્ટ્સને પ્રમાણિત કરે છે ત્યારે આપમેળે કમ્પ્લાયન્સ માન્યતા મેળવો, જેનાથી કમ્પ્લાયન્સ દસ્તાવેજો સબમિટ કરવાની જરૂરિયાત દૂર થાય છે.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_ppe_content":"કમ્પ્લાયન્સ ફાસ્ટ-ટ્રેક દ્વારા તમારી પર્સનલ પ્રોટેક્શન ઇક્વિપમેન્ટ કેટેગરી લિસ્ટિંગનું રક્ષણ કરો. જ્યારે કોઈ સહભાગી સંસ્થા તમારા પ્રોડક્ટ્સને પ્રમાણિત કરે છે ત્યારે આપમેળે કમ્પ્લાયન્સ માન્યતા મેળવો, જેનાથી કમ્પ્લાયન્સ દસ્તાવેજો સબમિટ કરવાની જરૂરિયાત દૂર થાય છે.","DYK_SSAT_EDU_JULY":"એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ રેટિંગની મહત્વપૂર્ણ બાબતો","DYK_SSAT_EDU_content":"AHR પોઇન્ટ સિસ્ટમ દ્વારા તમારા એકાઉન્ટના નિષ્ક્રિય થવાના જોખમને મોનિટર કરે છે. તમે સફળતાપૂર્વક ઓર્ડર ફુલફિલ કરવા માટે પોઇન્ટ મેળવો છો. જ્યારે પોલિસી ઉલ્લંઘનો મળી આવે છે ત્યારે તમે પોઈન્ટ ગુમાવો છો, અને જ્યારે તમે તે ઉલ્લંઘનોને સફળતાપૂર્વક ઉકેલો છો ત્યારે પોઈન્ટ પાછા મેળવો છો. તમારા એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ ડેશબોર્ડની વારંવાર સમીક્ષા કરો અને પોલિસી ઉલ્લંઘન ઉદ્ભવતા જ તેનો ઉકેલ લાવો.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_content":"અમે સેલર ચેલેન્જની જાહેરાત કરવા માટે ઉત્સાહિત છીએ, જે એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ એશ્યોરન્સ સેલરો માટે એક નવું ફીચર છે. સેલર ચેલેન્જ તમારા એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ પેજ દ્વારા લિસ્ટિંગ સમસ્યાઓની અલગ સમીક્ષાની વિનંતી કરવાની મર્યાદિત સંખ્યામાં તકો પૂરી પાડે છે. તમે એક ચેલેન્જ સબમિટ કરી દો તે પછી અમે 48 કલાકમાં નિર્ણય સાથે જવાબ આપવા માટે પ્રયત્ન કરીએ છીએ.","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_cta_done":"વધુ જાણો","DYK_SellerChallenge_launch_header":"પ્રસ્તુત છે સેલર ચેલેન્જ","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop":"શું તમે જાણો છો કે જ્યાં સુધી તમારા કોઈ ઉલ્લંઘન ન હોય, તમારા ઓર્ડરની સંખ્યા ઘટતી હોય તો પણ તમારો સ્કોર 200 થી નીચે નહીં આવે?","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop_header":"સ્વસ્થ AHR ટીપ","ahd_dyk_bhdr_content":"અમે સારા ગ્રાહક અનુભવ જાળવવા માટે વ્યવસાયિક કલાકો દરમિયાન તમારા Amazon Business વ્યાપારી શિપમેન્ટના 90% થી વધુ પહોંચાડવાની ભલામણ કરીએ છીએ","ahd_dyk_bhdr_cta":"પરફોર્મન્સ જુઓ","ahd_dyk_bhdr_header":"તમારા વ્યવસાય કલાકનો ડિલિવરી દર ઓછો છે.","ahd_dyk_br_kyc_existing_seller_header":"તમારા Amazon.com.br (બ્રાઝિલ) સ્ટોરને નિષ્ક્રિય કરવાનું જોખમ છે.","ahd_dyk_cta_done":"થઈ ગયું","ahd_dyk_cta_eukyc":"વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કરો","ahd_dyk_de_sup_label":"EPR (એક્સટેન્ડેડ પ્રોડ્યૂસર રિસ્પોન્સિબિલિટી): જર્મની સિંગલ યુઝ પ્લાસ્ટિક પોલિસી (1 જાન્યુઆરી, 2025 થી અસરકારક)નું પાલન કરવા માટે, દરેક બ્રાન્ડ અને પ્રોડક્ટ પ્રકારના સંયોજન માટે EPR રજિસ્ટ્રેશન નંબરો પ્રદાન કરીને હમણાં જ પગલાં લો. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GA4JYZX23CLK8WFW\\">વધુ જાણો</a>","ahd_dyk_de_sup_title":"તમારી લિસ્ટિંગ એક્સટેન્ડેડ પ્રોડ્યૂસર રિસ્પોન્સિબિલિટી (EPR): જર્મની સિંગલ યુઝ પ્લાસ્ટિક દ્વારા પ્રભાવિત થઈ છે","ahd_dyk_de_sup_weee_title":"તમારી પાસે વિસ્તૃત નિર્માતા જવાબદારી (EPR) દ્વારા પ્રભાવિત સૂચિઓ છે: જર્મની WEEE","ahd_dyk_description_eukyc":"EUના નિયમોના અનુપાલનમાં, તમારે એકાઉન્ટ વેરિફિકેશન પ્રક્રિયા પૂર્ણ કરવી આવશ્યક છે. વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે ઓળખ માહિતી પેજની મુલાકાત લો. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G201200780 \\">વધુ જાણો</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_label":"EPRનું પાલન કરવા માટે: દરેક બ્રાન્ડ અને પ્રોડક્ટ પ્રકારના સંયોજન માટે EPR રજિસ્ટ્રેશન નંબરો આપીને હમણાં જ પગલાં લો. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GYDCAK9ZR6VJH2X3\\">વધુ જાણો</a>","ahd_dyk_epr_title":"તમારી પાસે એક્સટેન્ડેડ પ્રોડ્યૂસર રિસ્પોન્સિબિલિટી (EPR) દ્વારા પ્રભાવિત લિસ્ટિંગ છે","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_label":"EPR: EU બેટરીઝ પોલિસી (18 ઓગસ્ટ, 2025 થી અસરકારક)નું પાલન કરવા માટે, તમારી પ્રોડક્ટ કેટેગરીઝ માટે EPR રજિસ્ટ્રેશન નંબરો પ્રદાન કરીને હમણાં જ પગલાં લો. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GPVDATLHQ6PRQNSW\\">વધુ જાણો</a>","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_title":"તમારી લિસ્ટિંગ એક્સટેન્ડેડ પ્રોડ્યૂસર રિસ્પોન્સિબિલિટી (EPR): EU બેટરીઝ દ્વારા પ્રભાવિત થઈ છે","ahd_dyk_fhdds_cta":"શિપમેન્ટ્સની સમીક્ષા કરો","ahd_dyk_fhdds_description":"તમારા બિઝનેસને વિક્ષેપિત કરે તે પહેલાં તમારી શિપિંગ કતારમાં તમારા બધા લાગુ શિપમેન્ટ માટે આયાત વિગતો પ્રદાન કરો. ખૂટતી આયાત વિગતો નવા UK શિપમેન્ટ બનાવવાની તમારી ક્ષમતાને પ્રતિબંધિત કરી શકે છે.","ahd_dyk_fhdds_header":"તમારી પાસે એવા શિપમેન્ટ છે જેમાં ઇમ્પોર્ટ એન્ટ્રી નંબર્સ (IENs) ખૂટે છે.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"<a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.com.br/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.com.br</a> સ્ટોરમાં વેચાણ શરૂ કરવા માટે તમારે અમુક પ્રક્રિયાઓ કરવાની બાકી છે.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_subtitle":"બ્રાઝિલમાં વેચવા માટે ચકાસણી આવશ્યકતાઓને પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે માહિતી સબમિટ કરો.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"<a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.ca/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.ca</a> સ્ટોરમાં વેચાણ શરૂ કરવા માટે તમારે અમુક પ્રક્રિયાઓ કરવાની બાકી છે.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_subtitle":"કેનેડામાં વેચવા માટે વેરિફિકેશન આવશ્યકતાઓ પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે માહિતી સબમિટ કરો.","ahd_dyk_title_eukyc":"તમારું EU તમારા ગ્રાહકને જાણો (KYC) વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કરો","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description":"GPSR, જે 13 ડિસેમ્બર, 2024 થી અમલમાં આવશે, તેનું પાલન કરવા માટે, કૃપા કરીને તમારી લિસ્ટિંગ પર અસર ટાળવા માટે તમારી પ્રોડક્ટ્સ માટે વધારાની અનુપાલન માહિતી પ્રદાન કરો. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">વધુ જાણો</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description_post_impact":"GPSR (13 ડિસેમ્બર, 2024 થી અસરકારક) નું પાલન કરવા અને લિસ્ટિંગને નિષ્ક્રિય થતી રોકવા માટે, તમારી પ્રોડક્ટ્સ માટે વધારાની અનુપાલન માહિતી પ્રદાન કરીને અત્યારે જ પગલાં લો. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">વધુ જાણો</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_task":"તમારી પાસે જનરલ પ્રોડક્ટ સેફ્ટી રેગ્યુલેશન (GPSR) દ્વારા પ્રભાવિત લિસ્ટિંગ છે.","ahd_floating_widget_aha_ec_description":"AHA પ્રોગ્રામના સભ્ય તરીકે, તમારે માન્ય ઇમરજન્સી સંપર્ક નંબર જાળવવો <b>જરૂરી</b> છે. AHA યોગ્યતા જાળવવા માટે તમારી કટોકટી સંપર્કની વિગતોની ચકાસણી કરો, જેથી તમારા વ્યવસાયને વિક્ષેપિત થાય તે પહેલાં અમારા નિષ્ણાતો એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ-સંબંધિત મુદ્દાઓને ધ્યાનમાં લેવામાં સહાય માટે પહોંચી શકે.","ahd_floating_widget_aha_ec_description_phase2":"AHA લાભો અવિરત રીતે મેળવવા માટે કૃપા કરીને નીચે આપેલા તમારા સંપર્ક નંબરની ચકાસણી કરો.","ahd_floating_widget_cta_button":"લિસ્ટિંગ જુઓ","ahd_floating_widget_ec_action_panel_title":"ઇમર્જન્સી સંપર્ક માહિતી અપડેટ","ahd_floating_widget_ec_aha_description":"તમારા બિઝનેસમાં ખલેલ પહોંચે તે પહેલાં, તમારી ઇમર્જન્સી સંપર્ક વિગતો ચકાસો જેથી અમારા નિષ્ણાતો એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ સંબંધિત મહત્વપૂર્ણ સમસ્યાઓનો ઉકેલ લાવવામાં તમારી મદદ કરી શકે.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_cta_button":"ચકાસણી પૂર્ણ કરો","ahd_floating_widget_ec_description":"તમારા બિઝનેસમાં ખલેલ પહોંચે તે પહેલાં, તમારી ઇમર્જન્સી સંપર્ક વિગતો ચકાસો જેથી અમારા નિષ્ણાતો એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ સંબંધિત મહત્વપૂર્ણ સમસ્યાઓનો ઉકેલ લાવવામાં તમારી મદદ કરી શકે.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_task":"તમારી ઇમરજન્સી સંપર્ક માહિતી ચકાસાયેલ નથી","ahd_floating_widget_new_tag":"નવું!","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_food_and_safety_heading":"તમે ખાદ્ય અને પ્રોડક્ટ સલામતી મુદ્દાઓ માટે વારંવાર ઉલ્લંઘનો કર્યા છે","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_ip_heading":"પ્રાપ્ત બૌદ્ધિક સંપત્તિ ફરિયાદો માટે તમે પુનરાવર્તન ઉલ્લંઘનો કર્યા છે","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_listing_heading":"લિસ્ટિંગ પોલિસી ઉલ્લંઘનો માટે તમારી પાસે વારંવાર ઉલ્લંઘનો છે","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_many_policies_heading":"તમે બહુવિધ પોલિસી માટે પુનરાવર્તિત ઉલ્લંઘનો કર્યા છે","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_other_heading":"અન્ય પોલિસીના ઉલંઘન માટે તમારી પાસે વારંવાર ઉલ્લંઘનો છે","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_auth_heading":"પ્રોડક્ટ ઓથેન્ટીસિટી કસ્ટમર કમ્પ્લેઇંટ્સ માટે તમારી પાસે પુનરાવર્તિત ઉલ્લંઘન છે","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_cond_heading":"પ્રોડક્ટ શરત ગ્રાહક ફરિયાદો માટે તમારી પાસે પુનરાવર્તિત ઉલ્લંઘન છે","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_reviews_heading":"ગ્રાહક પ્રોડક્ટ રિવ્યૂઝ પોલિસીના ઉલંઘન માટે તમારી પાસે વારંવાર ઉલ્લંઘનો છે","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_reg_comp_heading":"તમે નિયમનકારી પાલન માટે વારંવાર ઉલ્લંઘનો કર્યા છે","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_rp_heading":"તમે પ્રતિબંધિત પ્રોડક્ટ પોલિસી માટે પુનરાવર્તિત ઉલ્લંઘનો કર્યા છે","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_sip_heading":"શંકાસ્પદ બૌદ્ધિક સંપદા ઉલ્લંઘન માટે તમારી પાસે વારંવાર ઉલ્લંઘનો છે","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_violations_body":"સમાન વેચાણ પોલિસીના પુનરાવર્તિત પોલિસીના ઉલ્લંઘન એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિયતામાં પરિણમી શકે છે. તમારા સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટમાં બિનજરૂરી વિક્ષેપ ટાળવા માટે આ સમસ્યાઓનો ઉકેલ લાવો.","ahd_floating_widget_resolve_now_button_text":"હવે ઉકેલો","ahd_floating_widget_title":"શું તમે ખબર હતી?","ahd_floating_widget_view_all":"તમામ જુઓ {count}","ahd_rap_begin_verification_cta":"વેરિફિકેશન શરૂ કરો","cs_nerd_suggestion_top_issues_action_vi":"સમસ્યાઓ જુઓ","dyk_ahd_pra_rv":"કસ્ટમર પ્રોડક્ટ રિવ્યૂઝ પોલિસીના તમારી પાસે વારંવાર ઉલ્લંઘનો છે"},"pages.homepage":{"AHD_DD14_Base_Reserve":"સેલ્સ આવક ડિલિવરી તારીખના 14 દિવસ પછી રાખવામાં આવે છે અને ડિલિવરી તારીખ પછીના 15 મા દિવસે શરૂ થતા ડિસબર્સમેન્ટ માટે ઉપલબ્ધ બને છે. જો વાસ્તવિક ડિલિવરી તારીખ ઉપલબ્ધ ન હોય, તો અમે ઓર્ડર માટે નવીનતમ અંદાજિત ડિલિવરી તારીખનો ઉપયોગ કરીએ છીએ. આ તમારી ડિફોલ્ટ પેમેન્ટ પોલિસી છે.","AHD_POA_APPEAL_ERROR_LOADING":"એક ભૂલ થઈ. કૃપા કરી પેજ રિફ્રેશ કરો.","DR_VAT_AHD_NC_BANNER":"અમે VAT હેતુઓ માટે તમારા બિઝનેસની સ્થાપના ચકાસી શક્યા નથી. સચોટ ટેક્સ વ્યવસ્થાની ખાતરી કરવા માટે, VAT હેતુઓ માટે તમારી સ્થાપના ચકાસો.","DR_VAT_AHD_PRIORITY_ACTION":"VAT હેતુઓ માટે સ્થાપના ચકાસણી જરૂરી છે","Engage_Appeal_05":"સેલરની આચારસંહિતા (ગ્રાહકોને તમારી વેચાણ રેટિંગ, ફીડબેક અથવા રિવ્યૂમાં ફેરફાર કરવા માટે અનુકૂળ રીતે પ્રભાવિત કરવા)","LocalizedPageTitleDashboard":"પરફોર્મન્સ ડેશબોર્ડ","LocalizedPageTitleDetailCustomerSatisfaction":"ગ્રાહક સંતુષ્ટિ ડિટેલ પેજ.","LocalizedPageTitleDetailProductPolicies":"પ્રોડક્ટ પોલિસીઓ ડિટેલ પેજ.","NO_METRICS":"તમારી પાસે હાલમાં આ મેટ્રિકમાં ગણતા કોઈ ઓર્ડર નથી.\\n","RR_AHR_Warn_1":"Amazon પર બહુવિધ સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટ્સ","acf_banner_inform_act":"<a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">ગ્રાહકોને અધિનિયમની જાણ કરો</a>નું પાલન કરવા માટે, Amazon ને તમારા Amazon પર સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટ વિશેની માહિતી એકત્રિત કરવાની અને તેને વેરિફાય જરૂર છે. હાલમાં, તમારી પાસે એક અથવા વધુ વેરિફિકેશનના પગલાં બાકી છે. નીચેની સૂચિની સમીક્ષા કરો અને ચકાસણી શરૂ કરવા માટે <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">સેલર એકાઉન્ટ માહિતી</a> પર જાઓ.","acf_inform_act_wait_text":"ઓળખની ચકાસણી કરાવવા બદલ આભાર. કોઈપણ વધારાની માહિતીની જરૂર છે કે નહીં તેની પુષ્ટિ માટે 24 કલાકમાં પાછા તપાસો. ","acf_inform_act_widget_description":"ઓળખ વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કર્યા બાદ, તમને નીચેની એક અથવા વધુ વધારાની વસ્તુઓની ચકાસણી કરવા માટે કહેવામાં આવી શકે છે.","addTab_label":"ટેબ ઉમેરો","aef_address_your_violation":"તમારા ઉલ્લંઘનને સંબોધો","ags_pcx_voc_summary_voice_of_the_customer":"ગ્રાહકનો અવાજ","ahd_Inform_deposit_method":"ડિપોઝિટ પદ્ધતિની માહિતી","ahd_SOrigin_priority_action":"લાભાર્થી માલિકની માહિતી","ahd_account_health_notification":"એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ નોટિફિકેશન","ahd_account_impacted_details":"નીચે વિગતવાર જણાવ્યા અનુસાર તમારા એકાઉન્ટને અસર થઈ શકે છે:","ahd_account_regulatory_compliance":"એકાઉન્ટ નિયમનકારી પાલન","ahd_action_due":"બાકી","ahd_action_panel_hd":"તમારા Amazon સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટ્સ માટે ડિસબર્સમેન્ટ હોલ્ડ પર મૂકવામાં આવ્યા છે.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"<b>તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિયકરણના જોખમ પર છે.</b><br><br><a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">ગ્રાહકોને અધિનિયમની જાણ કરો</a>નું પાલન કરવા માટે, Amazon ને તમારા Amazon પર સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટ વિશેની માહિતી એકત્રિત કરવાની અને ચકાસવાની જરૂર છે. હાલમાં, તમારી પાસે એક અથવા વધુ વેરિફિકેશનના પગલાં બાકી છે. નીચેની સૂચિની સમીક્ષા કરો અને ચકાસણી શરૂ કરવા માટે </a>સેલર એકાઉન્ટ માહિતી<a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\"> પર જાઓ.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_aha":"<b>મહેરબાની કરીને નોંધ કરો કે, જો INFORM કન્ઝ્યુમર્સ એક્ટ અમલમાં આવે ત્યારે તમે બધી ચકાસણી વસ્તુઓ પૂર્ણ કરી નથી, તો એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ એશ્યોરન્સમાં તમારી નોંધણીને ધ્યાનમાં લીધા વગર તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય થઈ શકે છે.</b>","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_thankyou":"<b>યુએસ ઇન્ફોર્મ કન્ઝ્યુમર્સ એક્ટ</b> <br> <br> અમે સફળતાપૂર્વક તમામ ખુલ્લાં વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કર્યા છે. અમે આ વેરિફિકેશન પ્રક્રિયામાં સહયોગ આપવા બદલ તમારા પ્રયત્નોની પ્રશંસા કરીએ છીએ.","ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act_v2":"<b>તમારા એકાઉન્ટ પર નિષ્ક્રિયકરણનું જોખમ છે.</b><br><br><a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>ગ્રાહકોને અધિનિયમની જાણ કરો</a> નું પાલન કરવા માટે,જે 27 જૂન, 2023 થી અમલમાં આવે છે, Amazon ને તમારા Amazon પર સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટ વિશેની માહિતી એકત્રિત કરવાની અને તેને વેરિફાય કરવાની જરૂર છે. હાલમાં, તમારી પાસે એક અથવા વધુ વેરિફિકેશનના પગલાં બાકી છે. વેરિફિકેશન શરૂ કરવા માટે <a href=/hz/sc/account-information>એકાઉન્ટ માહિતી</a> પેજની મુલાકાત લો.","ahd_adhoc_banner_school_supplies":"અમે ઓળખી કાઢ્યું છે કે બાળકો માટે શાળા પુરવઠા પ્રોડક્ટના વેચાણ સંબંધિત સ્થાનિક, રાજ્ય અને ફેડરલ નિયમોનું પાલન ન કરવાને કારણે તમારી પાસે રીમુવલનું જોખમ ધરાવતા લિસ્ટિંગ (ઓ) છે. આ કમ્પલાયન્સ આવશ્યકતાઓ વિશે વધુ જાણવા માટે, <a href=/gp/help/external/help.html?itemID=XT3EFQS54LRKYM3&language=en_US&ref=ahd_uspc_adhoc_banner>અહીં</a> ક્લિક કરો. લિસ્ટિંગના રીમુવલને રોકવા માટે, કૃપા કરીને તમારી લિસ્ટિંગને આ કમ્પલાયન્સ જરૂરિયાતના સંદર્ભમાં <a href=/performance/account/health/product-policies?t=safe>અહીં</a> જુઓ, અને આ આવશ્યકતાઓના કમ્પલાયન્સને સુનિશ્ચિત કરવા માટે રીમુવલના જોખમે લિસ્ટિંગ(ઓ) ની બાજુમાં \'આગલા પગલાં\' હેઠળ સૂચિબદ્ધ માર્ગદર્શનનું પાલન કરો.","ahd_adhoc_mobile_inform_act_aha":"નોંધ: જો તમે નિર્દિષ્ટ સમયરેખામાં તમામ ચકાસણી પગલાંઓ પૂર્ણ કરતા નથી, તો એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ એશ્યોરન્સમાં તમારી નોંધણીને ધ્યાનમાં લીધા વગર તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય થઈ શકે છે.","ahd_aef_IPI_priority_action":"વર્ચ્યુઅલ આઈડેન્ટિટી વેરિફિકેશન","ahd_aef_action_HD":"ડિસબર્સમેન્ટ હોલ્ડ પર","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_contact_us":"જો તમને કોઈ પ્રશ્નો હોય, તો તમે seller-reactivation-appeals@amazon.com પર અમારો સંપર્ક કરી શકો છો.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_instruction":"તમારે દસ્તાવેજો સબમિટ કરવા અને ઓળખની ચકાસણી માટે વીડિયો કોલમાં હાજરી આપવાની જરૂર છે.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_join_call_link":"તમારા સુનિશ્ચિત વિડિઓ કોલમાં જોડાવા માટે <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">ઓળખ ચકાસણી પોર્ટલ</a>ની મુલાકાત લો.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_next_steps":"જરૂરી દસ્તાવેજો સબમિટ કરવા અને વર્ચ્યુઅલ આઈડેન્ટિટી વેરિફિકેશન માટે વીડિયો કોલમાં જોડાવા માટે <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/mario/ipi/IPISellerVerificationService/global/node/verificationRequired/render\\">આઈડેન્ટિટી વેરિફિકેશન પોર્ટલ</a>ની મુલાકાત લો. જરૂરી દસ્તાવેજો સબમિટ કર્યા પછી તમારી પાસે ભવિષ્યની તારીખ અને સમયે વીડિયો કોલ શેડ્યૂલ કરવાનો વિકલ્પ પણ છે.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason":"તમારા બિઝનેસની સમીક્ષા દ્વારા એ ઓળખી કાઢવામાં આવ્યું છે કે તમારા એકાઉન્ટનો ઉપયોગ ભ્રામક, છેતરપિંડી અથવા ગેરકાયદેસર પ્રવૃત્તિ માટે કરવામાં આવ્યો હોઈ શકે છે; આ, <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Amazon Services બિઝનેસ સલુશન્સ એગ્રીમેન્ટ</a>ના વિભાગ 3 અનુસાર, એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય કરવા તરફ દોરી શકે છે. અમારા ગ્રાહકો અને સેલિંગ પાર્ટનરને સુરક્ષિત કરવા માટે, અમારે વર્ચ્યુઅલ આઈડેન્ટિટી વેરિફિકેશન પ્રક્રિયા દ્વારા અમારા સેલર્સનું આઈડેન્ટિટી વેરિફિકેશન કરવાની જરૂર છે જે વીડિયો કૉલ પર થાય છે. ","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_reason_eu":"તમારા વ્યવસાયની સમીક્ષા દ્વારા એ ઓળખી કાઢવામાં આવ્યું છે કે તમારા એકાઉન્ટનો ઉપયોગ ભ્રામક, છેતરપિંડી અથવા ગેરકાયદેસર પ્રવૃત્તિ માટે કરવામાં આવ્યો હોઈ શકે છે; આ, <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G201190440\\">Amazon Services બિઝનેસ સોલ્યુશન્સ એગ્રીમેન્ટ</a>ના સેક્શન 3 અનુસાર, એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય કરવા તરફ દોરી શકે છે. અમારા ગ્રાહકો અને સેલિંગ પાર્ટનરને સુરક્ષિત કરવા માટે, અમારે વર્ચ્યુઅલ આઈડેન્ટિટી વેરિફિકેશન પ્રક્રિયા દ્વારા અમારા સેલર્સનું આઈડેન્ટિટી વેરિફિકેશન કરવાની જરૂર છે જે વીડિયો કોલ પર થાય છે.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_review_fail":"તમારા બિઝનેસની સમીક્ષા અને તમે તમારી વર્ચ્યુઅલ આઈડેન્ટિટી વેરિફિકેશન દરમિયાન પ્રદાન કરેલી માહિતી, એ ઓળખી કાઢ્યું છે કે તમારા એકાઉન્ટનો ઉપયોગ ભ્રામક, કપટપૂર્ણ અથવા ગેરકાયદેસર પ્રવૃત્તિ માટે કરવામાં આવ્યો હોઈ શકે છે, જે <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/external/G1791\\">Amazon Services બિઝનેસ સલુશન્સ એગ્રીમેન્ટ</a>ના વિભાગ 3 નું ઉલ્લંઘન કરે છે.","ahd_aef_action_panel_IPI_under_review":"ઓળખ ચકાસણી માટે તમે આપેલી માહિતીની અમે સમીક્ષા કરી રહ્યા છીએ. સમીક્ષા પ્રક્રિયામાં 5 કામકાજી દિવસ લાગી શકે છે.","ahd_aef_action_panel_RA_reason":"અમારું રિવ્યૂ સૂચવે છે કે તમારી પાસે એક અલગ એકાઉન્ટ છે જે અમારી પોલિસીઓમાંથી એકનું ઉલ્લંઘન કરવા બદલ નિષ્ક્રિય કરવામાં આવ્યું હતું. પરિણામે, વર્તમાન સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટ <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G1801\\">સેલર કોડ ઓફ કન્ડક્ટ</a>માં દર્શાવેલ અમારી ‘Amazon પર બહુવિધ સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટ’ પોલિસીનું ઉલ્લંઘન કરે છે.","ahd_aef_action_panel_post_deactivation_appeal":"જો તમે માનતા હોવ કે તમારું એકાઉન્ટ ભૂલથી નિષ્ક્રિય કરવામાં આવ્યું છે, તો તમે નીચેના \'અપીલ\' બટનને ક્લિક કરીને નવી માહિતી સબમિટ કરી શકો છો.","ahd_aef_action_panel_scheduled_status_plural":"તમે તમારા વર્ચ્યુઅલ આઈડેન્ટિટી વેરિફિકેશન માટે ${numberofdays} દિવસોમાં ${date}ના રોજ વીડિયો કૉલ શેડ્યૂલ કર્યો છે.","ahd_aef_action_panel_scheduled_status_singular":"તમે તમારા વર્ચ્યુઅલ આઈડેન્ટિટી વેરિફિકેશન માટે ${numberofday} દિવસમાં ${date}ના રોજ વીડિયો કૉલ શેડ્યૂલ કર્યો છે.","ahd_aef_action_panel_verify_button":"વેરિફાઈ કરો","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_food_and_prod_subreason":"ખોરાક અને પ્રોડક્ટ સલામતીની સમસ્યાઓ","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_listing_subreason":"લિસ્ટિંગ પોલિસીનું ઉલ્લંઘન","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_other_subreason":"અન્ય પોલિસી ઉલ્લંઘન","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_auth_subreason":"પ્રોડક્ટ ઓથેન્ટીસિટી કસ્ટમર કમ્પ્લેઇંટ્સ","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_cond_subreason":"પ્રોડક્ટની સ્થિતિ અંગે ગ્રાહક ફરિયાદો","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_prod_review_subreason":"કસ્ટમર પ્રોડક્ટ રિવ્યૂઝ પોલિસીનું ઉલ્લંઘન","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reason":"પુનરાવર્તન ઉલ્લંઘનો","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_reg_comp_subreason":"નિયમનકારી પાલન","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rip_subreason":"બૌદ્ધિક સંપત્તિની મળેલી ફરિયાદો","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_rp_subreason":"પ્રતિબંધિત પ્રોડક્ટ પોલિસી","ahd_aef_action_row_repeat_violations_sip_subreason":"શંકાસ્પદ બૌદ્ધિક સંપત્તિનું ઉલ્લંઘન","ahd_aef_at_risk_HD_card_body":"તમારા ડિસબર્સમેન્ટને ફરીથી સક્રિય કરવા માટે, તમારી પ્રાથમિકતા પગલાંઓને રિવ્યૂ કરો અને બાકી પગલાંની વસ્તુઓને સંબોધિત કરો.","ahd_aef_at_risk_HD_card_title":"તમારા એકાઉન્ટ પર નિષ્ક્રિય થવાનું જોખમ છે અને તમારા Amazon સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટ માટે ડિસબર્સમેન્ટ હોલ્ડ પર મૂકવામાં આવ્યા છે.","ahd_aef_at_risk_card_sc_body":"તમારી પાસે એક અથવા વધુ બાકી ક્રિયા વસ્તુઓ છે જેના પરિણામે એકાઉન્ટ ડીએક્ટિવેટ થશે.","ahd_aef_critical":"ક્રિટિકલ","ahd_aef_critical_message":"આ ગંભીર સમસ્યા જો વણઉકેલાયેલી રહે તો તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય થઈ જશે.","ahd_aef_critical_message_no_caps":"આ ગંભીર સમસ્યા જો વણઉકેલાયેલી રહે તો તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય થઈ જશે.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_action":"હમણાં ફરીથી સક્રિય કરો","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_body":"તમારા એકાઉન્ટને ફરીથી સક્રિય કરવા માટે તમારી એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ સમસ્યાઓને સંબોધિત કરો. એકવાર સમસ્યાઓ ઉકેલાઈ ગયા પછી, તમારું એકાઉન્ટ 24 કલાકની અંદર ફરીથી સક્રિય થઈ જશે.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_sc_body":"તમારા એકાઉન્ટને ફરીથી સક્રિય કરવા માટે તમારી એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ સમસ્યાઓને સંબોધિત કરો.","ahd_aef_deactivated_card_title":"તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય કરવામાં આવ્યું છે","ahd_aef_denver_eu":"વેલ્યૂ એડેડ ટેક્સ (VAT) માટે EU સ્થાપનાને વેરિફાય કરો","ahd_aef_denver_info":"માહિતીની આવશ્યક્તા","ahd_aef_denver_uk":"વેલ્યુ એડેડ ટેક્સ (VAT) માટે UK સ્થાપનાને વેરિફાય કરો","ahd_aef_educational_card_action":"સમસ્યાઓ ઉકેલો","ahd_aef_impact_header":"એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ અસર","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_post_deactivation":"નીચેના \'અપીલ\' બટનને ક્લિક કરો અને આ સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટને ફરીથી સક્રિય કરવા માટે આપેલી સૂચનાઓને અનુસરો.","ahd_aef_next_steps_appeal_pre_deactivation":"નીચેના \'અપીલ\' બટનને ક્લિક કરો અને આ સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટનું નિષ્ક્રિયકરણ ટાળવા માટે આપેલી સૂચનાઓને અનુસરો.","ahd_aef_next_steps_header":"તમારા ઉલ્લંઘનને સંબોધો","ahd_aef_pending_critical":"પેન્ડીંગ ક્રિટિકલ","ahd_aef_pending_critical_message":"જો ઉકેલવામાં ન આવે તો આ ગંભીર બની જશે અને તમારા એકાઉન્ટને નિષ્ક્રિય કરવામાં આવશે.","ahd_aef_pending_critical_message_no_cap":"જો ઉકેલવામાં ન આવે તો આ ગંભીર બની જશે અને તમારા એકાઉન્ટને નિષ્ક્રિય કરવામાં આવશે.","ahd_aef_pending_deactivation_HD_card_title":"તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિયકરણ માટે પેન્ડિંગ છે અને તમારા Amazon સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટ માટે ડિસબર્સમેન્ટ હોલ્ડ પર મૂકવામાં આવ્યા છે.","ahd_aef_priority_action_completed_status":"પૂર્ણ","ahd_aef_priority_action_pending_review_status":"બાકી સમીક્ષા","ahd_aef_priority_action_scheduled_status_plural":"${numberofdays} દિવસોમાં ${date} ના રોજ વીડિયો કૉલ શેડ્યૂલ કર્યો","ahd_aef_priority_action_scheduled_status_singular":"${numberofday} દિવસમાં ${date} ના રોજ વીડિયો કૉલ શેડ્યૂલ કર્યો છે","ahd_aef_submit_header":"તમારી માહિતી સબમિટ કરો","ahd_ahr_pending_critical":"પેન્ડીંગ ક્રિટિકલ","ahd_ahr_section_sub_section":"આ રેટિંગ Amazon ની સેલિંગ પોલીસીઓના તમે કરેલા અનુપાલનને પ્રતિબિંબિત કરે છે. <a href=/help/hub/reference/G200205250?ref=ahd-ahr-lm target=‘_blank’>વધુ જાણો</a>.","ahd_ahr_section_title":"અકાઉન્ટ સ્વાસ્થ્ય","ahd_all_issues":"તમામ સમસ્યાઓ","ahd_back_button":"પાછા","ahd_banner_account_atrisk_header":"તમારા એકાઉન્ટ પર નિષ્ક્રિય થવાનું જોખમ છે.","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_body":"જ્યારે તમારા ઉલ્લંઘનોની સફળતાપૂર્વક અપીલ કરવામાં આવી હોય ત્યારે તમારા એકાઉન્ટને ફરીથી સક્રિય કરવા માટે ધ્યાનમાં લેવામાં આવશે. ","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_header":"તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય કરવામાં આવ્યું છે. ","ahd_banner_account_pending_header":"તમારા એકાઉન્ટનું નિષ્ક્રિયકરણ પેન્ડીંગ છે.","ahd_banner_block_mfn_at_risk_subtitle":"તમારી સેલર-ફુલફિલ્ડ ઓફર્સ નિષ્ક્રિય થઈ ગઈ છે અને તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય થવાનું જોખમ છે. તમારી સેલર-ફુલફિલ્ડ ઓફર્સને ફરીથી સક્રિય કરવા અને નિષ્ક્રિયતાને રોકવા માટે તમારી પ્રાથમિકતા ક્રિયાઓ પૂર્ણ કરો.","ahd_banner_block_mfn_subtitle":"તમારી સેલર-ફુલફિલ્ડ ઓફર્સ નિષ્ક્રિય કરવામાં આવી છે. તમારી સેલર-ફુલફિલ્ડ ઓફર્સને ફરીથી સક્રિય કરવા માટે તમારી પ્રાથમિકતા ક્રિયાઓ પૂર્ણ કરો.","ahd_banner_eg_trn":"<b>તમારા એકાઉન્ટ પર નિષ્ક્રિયકરણનું જોખમ છે. </b><br><br>તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય થવાનું જોખમ છે કારણ કે તમારા Seller Central એકાઉન્ટમાં તમારો માન્ય ટેક્સ રજિસ્ટ્રેશન નંબર શામેલ નથી. એકાઉન્ટને નિષ્ક્રિય થતું ટાળવા માટે Amazon પર તમારી પ્રથમ પ્રોડક્ટ લિસ્ટિંગની તારીખથી 90 દિવસની અંદર તમારી ટેક્સ માહિતીને અપડેટ કરવા માટે <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations>ટેક્સ સેટિંગ</a> પેજની મુલાકાત લો. વધુ માહિતી માટે, “ટેક્સ કમ્પલાયન્સ વારંવાર પૂછાતા પ્રશ્નો” <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC> હેલ્પ પેજ જુઓ. </a>","ahd_banner_resolve_issues_button":"સમસ્યાઓ ઉકેલો","ahd_be_jsl_at_risk_banner":"<b> તમારા એકાઉન્ટ પર નિષ્ક્રિયકરણનું જોખમ છે. </b><br><br>તમે તમારા Amazon Seller Central એકાઉન્ટમાં તમારા પોતાના દેશ માટે તમારા બેલ્જિયમ VAT રજીસ્ટ્રેશન નંબર (VRN) અથવા યુનિયન વન-સ્ટોપ શોપ (OSS) સ્ટેટસની પુષ્ટિ પ્રદાન કરી નથી. જરૂરિયાત વિશે વધુ જાણવા અને માહિતી પ્રદાન કરવા માટે <a href=/help/hub/reference/external/GGTX8THLMMDJ3WBP> નવા બેલ્જિયન કાયદા</a>નો સંદર્ભ લો.","ahd_be_jsl_priority_action":"બેલ્જિયમ VAT કાયદો","ahd_br_store":"બ્રાઝિલ (Amazon.com.br)","ahd_brkyc_priority_action":"બ્રાઝિલ ઓળખ ચકાસણી","ahd_brkyc_rap_action":"તમારે નિયત તારીખ પહેલાં તમારી ઓળખ ચકાસણીની માહિતી સબમિટ કરવાની જરૂર છે.","ahd_brkyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"તમારું વેરિફિકેશન સ્ટેટસ <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional\\n?ref_=to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>ઓળખ માહિતી</a> પેજ પર ચકાસો.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_action":"તમારા એકાઉન્ટને ફરીથી સક્રિય કરવા માટે તમારી ઓળખ ચકાસણી માહિતી સબમિટ કરો.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"બ્રાઝિલના કાયદા મુજબ, તમને અમારી સેવાનો ઉપયોગ કરવાની મંજૂરી આપવા માટે તમારી ઓળખની ચકાસણી કરવી જરૂરી છે અને આ તપાસને સરળ બનાવવા માટે તમારે અમને ચોક્કસ માહિતી અથવા દસ્તાવેજો પ્રદાન કરવા જરૂરી છે. અમે તમારા પરફોર્મન્સ નોટિફિકેશનની વિનંતી વિશે વધારાની માહિતી પ્રદાન કરી શકીએ છીએ.\\r\\n<br><br>તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય થઈ ગયું છે કારણ કે અમે તમારી ઓળખ માહિતીને માન્ય કરવામાં સક્ષમ ન હતા.<br><br> \\r\\nવધુ માહિતી માટે, <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Amazon પર વેચવા માટે આવશ્યક માહિતી</a> હેલ્પ પેજ પર જાઓ.","ahd_brkyc_rap_deactivated_message":"તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય થઈ ગયું છે કારણ કે અમે તમારી ઓળખ માહિતીને માન્ય કરવામાં સક્ષમ ન હતા.","ahd_brkyc_rap_identity_info":"વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional?ref_=ahd_to_brkyc_identityinfo_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>ઓળખ માહિતી પેજ</a> ની મુલાકાત લો.","ahd_brkyc_rap_intro":"બ્રાઝિલના કાયદા મુજબ, તમને અમારી સેવાનો ઉપયોગ કરવાની મંજૂરી આપવા માટે તમારી ઓળખની ચકાસણી કરવી જરૂરી છે. આ તપાસોને સરળ બનાવવા માટે તમારે અમને અમુક માહિતી અથવા ડોક્યુમેન્ટ પ્રદાન કરવાની જરૂર પડી શકે છે. અમે તમારા પરફોર્મન્સ નોટિફિકેશનની વિનંતી વિશે વધારાની માહિતી પ્રદાન કરી શકીએ છીએ.\\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nવધુ માહિતી માટે, <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G201200780?ref_=to_brkyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Amazon પર વેચવા માટે આવશ્યક માહિતી</a> હેલ્પ પેજ પર જાઓ.","ahd_brkyc_rap_verifying":"અમે તમારી માહિતીને માન્ય કરી રહ્યા છીએ અને આ રિવ્યૂ દરમિયાન તમારી પાસેથી વિગતો માટે વિનંતી કરવાની જરૂર પડી શકે છે. કૃપા કરીને <a href=\'/performance/notifications\\r\\n?ref_=to_brkyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>પરફોર્મન્સ નોટિફિકેશન</a> વિભાગો તપાસો અને તમારા Amazon પર સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટ સંબંધિત કોઈપણ વિનંતીઓનો જવાબ આપો. આ માન્ય થવામાં 24 કલાક સુધીનો સમય લાગી શકે છે, અને કેટલાક કિસ્સાઓમાં 10 કામકાજી દિવસો સુધીનો સમય લાગી શકે છે. આ સમય દરમિયાન, તમારી ઓળખ માહિતીમાં ફેરફાર કરી શકાતો નથી.","ahd_ca_store":"કેનેડા (Amazon.ca)","ahd_cakyc_priority_action":"કેનેડાની ઓળખ ચકાસણી","ahd_cakyc_rap_action":"એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય થવાનું ટાળવા માટે દર્શાવેલ નિયત તારીખ સુધીમાં તમારી ઓળખ વેરિફિકેશન માહિતી પ્રદાન કરો. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_action_hd":"એકાઉન્ટ ડીએક્ટિવેટ થવાનું ટાળવા માટે દર્શાવેલ નિયત તારીખ સુધીમાં તમારી ઓળખ વેરિફિકેશન માહિતી પ્રદાન કરો. જો તમે વેરિફિકેશન શરૂ ન કરો અને 15 દિવસ કે તેથી ઓછા બાકી હોય, તો તમારા Amazon.ca સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટમાંથી ભંડોળ વિતરિત કરવાની તમારી ક્ષમતા પ્રતિબંધિત કરવામાં આવશે. કેનેડિયન કાયદા હેઠળ વેરિફિકેશન જરૂરી છે.","ahd_cakyc_rap_compliance_portal_status":"<a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> ઓળખ માહિતી</a> પેજ પર તમારી ચકાસણીનું સ્ટેટસ તપાસો.","ahd_cakyc_rap_deactivated_intro":"તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય થઈ ગયું છે કારણ કે અમે તમારી ઓળખ માહિતીને માન્ય કરવામાં સક્ષમ ન હતા.  કેનેડાના કાયદા મુજબ અમને તમારી ઓળખ વેરિફાઇ કરવાની જરૂર છે જેથી અમે તમને અમારી સેવાનો ઉપયોગ કરવાની મંજૂરી આપી શકીએ. તમારું એકાઉન્ટ ફરીથી સક્રિય કરવા માટે, તમારી ઓળખ ચકાસવા માટે જરૂરી માહિતી સબમિટ કરો. \\r\\n<br><br>વધુ માહિતી માટે, <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Amazon પર વેચવા માટે આવશ્યક માહિતી</a> હેલ્પ પેજ પર જાઓ","ahd_cakyc_rap_identity_info":"ચકાસણી પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે <a href=/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> ઓળખ માહિતી પેજ</a>ની મુલાકાત લો. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_intro":"કેનેડિયન કાયદામાં અમને અમારી સર્વિસનો ઉપયોગ કરવાની મંજૂરી આપવા માટે તમારી ઓળખ ચકાસવાની જરૂર છે. અમને જરૂર છે કે તમે અમને ચોક્કસ માહિતી અને દસ્તાવેજો પ્રદાન કરો જેથી અમે આ ચકાસણી તપાસ કરી શકીએ. <br><br>વધુ માહિતી માટે, <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Amazon પર વેચવા માટે આવશ્યક માહિતી</a> હેલ્પ પેજ પર જાઓ અથવા તમારા <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>પરફોર્મન્સ નોટિફિકેશન</a>નો સંદર્ભ લો.","ahd_cakyc_rap_self_trigger_cta":"‘વેરિફિકેશન શરૂ કરો’ પર ક્લિક કરીને, તમે કેનેડાની વેરિફિકેશન આવશ્યકતાઓ સાથે આગળ વધી રહ્યા છો. આગળના પગલાંની પુષ્ટિ કરવા માટે <a href=\'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_id_info_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'> ઓળખ માહિતી પેજ </a>ની મુલાકાત લો. ","ahd_cakyc_rap_verifying":"અમે તમારી માહિતીને માન્ય કરી રહ્યા છીએ. કેટલાક કિસ્સાઓમાં, આ માન્યતા માટે 24 કલાકથી 10 કામકાજી દિવસોનો સમય લાગી શકે છે. આ રિવ્યૂ દરમિયાન અમને તમારી પાસેથી વિગતોની વિનંતી કરવાની જરૂર પડી શકે છે. કૃપા કરીને <a href=/performance/notifications?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_pn_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>પરફોર્મન્સ નોટિફિકેશન</a> વિભાગ તપાસો અને તમારા Amazon પર સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટ સંબંધિત કોઈપણ વધારાની વિનંતીઓનો જવાબ આપો.  \\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\nઆ સમય દરમિયાન, તમારી ઓળખ માહિતીમાં ફેરફાર કરી શકાતો નથી.","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_header":"મારે આ માહિતી શા માટે આપવી પડશે?","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_header2":"માહિતી આપવા માટે મારી પાસે કેટલો સમય છે? ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_header3":"જો હું જરૂરી માહિતી ન આપું તો શું થશે? ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph":"Amazon પર સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટના ઉપયોગ માટે કાયદા દ્વારા તમારી ઓળખનું વેરિફિકેશન આવશ્યક છે. કેનેડિયનના કાયદા મુજબ, તમને અમારી સેવાનો ઉપયોગ કરવાની મંજૂરી આપવા માટે તમારી ઓળખની ચકાસણી કરવી જરૂરી છે. આ તપાસોને સરળ બનાવવા માટે તમારે અમને અમુક માહિતી અને ડોક્યુમેન્ટ પ્રદાન કરવાની જરૂર પડી શકે છે.<br><br>વધુ માહિતી માટે, <a href=/help/hub/reference/G6BPHKRRX6HGLSQ7?ref_=ahd_to_cakyc_help_from_intro_blurb\'target=\'_blank\'>Amazon પર વેચવા માટે આવશ્યક માહિતી</a> હેલ્પ પેજ પર જાઓ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph2":"Amazon તમને ફરીથી વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે 60 દિવસ સુધીની મંજૂરી આપે છે. તેમાં રિવ્યૂ પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે અમે જે સમય લઈએ છીએ તેનો સમાવેશ થતો નથી. જો 60 દિવસની અંદર પુનઃ-વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ ન થાય તો વેચવા અને ફંડ વિતરિત કરવાની તમારી ક્ષમતા પર પ્રતિબંધ મૂકવામાં આવી શકે છે. જ્યારે અમને માહિતીની જરૂર હોય, ત્યારે તમારા એકાઉન્ટ ઇન્ફર્મેશન પેજ પર એક નોટિફિકેશન દેખાશે. અમે તમારા પરફોર્મન્સ નોટિફિકેશનની વિનંતી વિશે વધારાની માહિતી પ્રદાન કરી શકીએ છીએ. ","ahd_cakyc_self_trigger_intro_paragraph3":"તમે આખરે તમારા Amazon પર સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટનો ઉપયોગ કરવામાં અસમર્થ હશો. તેથી, જો માહિતી પ્રદાન કરવામાં ન આવે, તો તમે Amazon.ca પર વેચી શકશો નહીં. ","ahd_cancel_button":"કેન્સલ કરો","ahd_close_button":"બંધ કરો","ahd_collusion_policy":"સેલિંગ પોલિસીઓ અને સેલર માટેની આચારસંહિતા","ahd_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_subtitle":"તમારે એક અથવા વધુ ક્રિયાઓ કરવાની બાકી છે જે તમે વેચાણ શરૂ કરી શકો તે પહેલાં જરૂરી છે. ","ahd_complete_status":"પૂર્ણ કર્યું","ahd_compliance_status":"કમ્પલાયન્સ સ્ટેટસ","ahd_compliance_widget_button":"અનુપાલનની માહિતી સબમિટ કરો","ahd_compliance_widget_ckp_redirect":"કમ્પલાયન્સ સંદર્ભ લોન્ચ કરો","ahd_compliance_widget_description":"નિયમનકારી અનુપાલન સાબિત કરવા માટે અનુપાલનની માહિતી સબમિટ કરો.","ahd_critical_account_health_notification":"નિર્ણાયક એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ નોટિફિકેશન","ahd_critical_policy_violations":"ગંભીર પોલિસી ઉલ્લંઘન","ahd_dac7_at_risk_banner":"<b>તમારા એકાઉન્ટ પર નિષ્ક્રિયકરણનું જોખમ છે.</b><br><br> <a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB\\">DAC7 કાયદા</a> હેઠળ ટેક્સ અંગેની માહિતીની આવશ્યક્તા ખૂટતી હોવાને કારણે તમારું એકાઉન્ટ પર નિષ્ક્રિય થવાનું જોખમ રહેલું છે. ચકાસણી શરૂ કરવા માટે <a href= \\"/complianceportal\\">DAC7 પાલન પોર્ટલ</a>ની મુલાકાત લો. ","ahd_dac7_compliant":"તમે હવે DAC7 કમ્પ્લાયન્ટ છો!","ahd_dac7_priority_action":"DAC7 માહિતીની આવશ્યક્તા","ahd_dac7_priority_action_pending":"પેન્ડીંગ વેરિફિકેશન","ahd_dac7_rap_action":"તમારે હવે નિયત તારીખ પહેલાં તમારી DAC7 માહિતી સબમિટ કરવાની જરૂર છે.","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_launch_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>તમારી માહિતી સબમિટ કરવા માટે DAC7 પોર્ટલ લોન્ચ કરો</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_compliance_portal_status":"<a href=\'/complianceportal?ref_=to_dac_portal_from_status_blurb\'  target=\'_blank\'>DAC7 પોર્ટલ પર તમારું વેરિફિકેશન સ્ટેટસ તપાસો</a>","ahd_dac7_rap_deactivated_message":"એડમિનિસ્ટ્રેટિવ કોઓપરેશન – 7મો સુધારો (DAC7)ના નિર્દેશનું પાલન ન કરવા બદલ તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય કરવામાં આવ્યું છે","ahd_dac7_rap_intro":"<a href=\'/help/hub/reference/external/GM472VUSJDLG2HSB?ref_=to_dac_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>ડિરેક્ટિવ ઓન એડમિનિસ્ટ્રેટિવ કોઓપરેશન - 7મો સુધારો (DAC7)</a> એ EU નિયમન છે જેમાં EU-નિવાસી સેલર્સ તેઓ સેલ કરે છે તે Amazon સ્ટોરને ધ્યાનમાં લીધા માટે Amazon માટે બાકી તપાસ, VAT/ટેક્સ અને નાણાકીય ડેટાને એકત્રિત કરવા, ચકાસવા અને રિપોર્ટ કરવા જરૂરી છે.","ahd_dac7_rap_verify_now_button":"હમણાં ચકાસો","ahd_dac7_rap_verifying":"અમે તમારી DAC7 માહિતીની સમીક્ષા કરી રહ્યા છીએ. સમીક્ષા પ્રક્રિયામાં સામાન્ય રીતે 72 કલાક લાગે છે, પરંતુ કેટલાક કિસ્સાઓમાં વધુ સમય લાગી શકે છે. અમને વધુ માહિતીની જરૂર છે કે નહીં તે જાણવા માટે કૃપા કરીને નીચે આપેલા DAC7 પોર્ટલમાં નિયમિતપણે તમારા વેરિફિકેશન સ્ટેટસને તપાસો.","ahd_days":"દિવસો","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_description":"વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે <a href=\'/hz/sc/account-information\' target=\'_blank\'>એકાઉન્ટ માહિતી</a> પેજ પર જાઓ. ","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_header":"તમારો Amazon.ca (કેનેડા) સ્ટોર ડીએક્ટિવેટ થવાના જોખમ પર છે.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"Amazon.com.br સ્ટોરમાં વેચાણ શરૂ કરવા માટે તમારે અમુક ક્રિયાઓ કરવાની બાકી છે.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_subtitle":"બ્રાઝિલમાં વેચવા માટે ચકાસણી આવશ્યકતાઓને પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે માહિતી સબમિટ કરો.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"Amazon.ca સ્ટોરમાં વેચાણ શરૂ કરવા માટે તમારે અમુક ક્રિયાઓ કરવાની બાકી છે.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_subtitle":"કેનેડામાં વેચવા માટે વેરિફિકેશન આવશ્યકતાઓ પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે માહિતી સબમિટ કરો.","ahd_edit_button":"ફેરફાર કરો","ahd_educational_banner_header":"તમારી પ્રાથમિક ક્રિયાઓ પૂર્ણ કરો","ahd_educational_banner_subheader":"તમારી પાસે એક અથવા વધુ બાકી પગલાં પૂર્ણ કરવાની વસ્તુઓ છે જે લિસ્ટેડ તારીખ સુધીમાં પૂર્ણ ન થાય તો એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિયતામાં પરિણમશે.","ahd_eg_trn_deactivation_banner":"<b>તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય કરવામાં આવ્યું છે.</b><br><br> તમારા એકાઉન્ટને ફરીથી સક્રિય કરવા માટે, તમારી ટેક્સ માહિતીને અપડેટ કરવા માટે <a href=/tax/consolidatedRegistrations>ટેક્સ સેટિંગ</a> પેજની મુલાકાત લો. વધુ માહિતી માટે, “ટેક્સ પાલન વારંવાર પૂછાતા પ્રશ્નો” <a href=/help/hub/reference/GHA5XK9VGEX9S9AC>હેલ્પ પેજ</a> જુઓ. ","ahd_error_loading_submit":"એક ભૂલ થઈ. કૃપા કરીને ફરીથી સબમિટ કરવાનો પ્રયાસ કરો.","ahd_eukyc_priority_action":"ઓળખ ચકાસણી","ahd_fhdds_priority_action":"પ્રાપ્ત થયેલ UK શિપમેન્ટ માટે IEN જરૂરી","ahd_floating_widget_action_panel_close":"બંધ કરો","ahd_funds_potential_withheld":"ફંડ રોકવામાં આવી શકે છે","ahd_incomplete_status":"અધૂરું","ahd_inform_ac_checkbox_error":"તમે તમારી માહિતીને રિવ્યૂ કરી છે અને પ્રમાણિત કરો છો કે તે સચોટ અને વર્તમાન છે તેની ખાતરી કરવા માટે ચેકબોક્સને ક્લિક કરો.","ahd_inform_ac_edu_display_name":"તમારી એકાઉન્ટ માહિતીને રિવ્યૂ કરો","ahd_inform_ac_educational_subheader":"તમે એક અથવા વધુ બાકી પગલાં ધરાવો છે કે જે ભવિષ્યમાં એકાઉન્ટ ડીએક્ટિવેશનમાં પરિણમી શકે છે.","ahd_inform_ac_no_poc":"ઓળખ માહિતી આપવામાં આવી નથી. જો તમે અગાઉ આ માહિતીના બદલે સરકાર દ્વારા જારી કરેલ રેકોર્ડ અથવા ટેક્સ દસ્તાવેજ સબમિટ કર્યો છે, તો તમે પ્રમાણિત કરી રહ્યા છો કે તે સબમિશનમાં કોઈ ફેરફાર કરવામાં આવ્યો નથી.","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p1":"યુ.એસ. INFORM કન્ઝ્યુમર્સ એક્ટ હેઠળ, તમારે ચોક્કસ વ્યવસાયિક માહિતી (નીચે બતાવેલ) તાજેતરની રાખવી જરૂરી છે અને ઇલેક્ટ્રોનિક રીતે Amazon ને પ્રમાણિત કરવું જરૂરી છે કે ક્યાં તો તમે તમારી માહિતી અપડેટ કરી છે અથવા પહેલાથી જ પ્રદાન કરેલી માહિતી હજી પણ તાજેતરની છે. આ નોટિસ જોયાના 10 દિવસની અંદર પ્રમાણિત કરો કે નીચે આપની માહિતી અપ-ટૂ-ડેટ છે, નહિ તો તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય થવાના જોખમ પર હશે. ","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p2":"આ નોટિસ પહેલીવાર જોયાના 10 દિવસની અંદર તમારે હવે પ્રમાણિત કરવું જરૂરી છે કે નીચે આપેલી તમારી માહિતી અપ ટુ ડેટ છે. પ્રમાણિત કરવામાં નિષ્ફળ જવા પર તમારા એકાઉન્ટને નિષ્ક્રિય થવાના જોખમમાં મૂકી દેશે.","ahd_inform_ac_p1_header":"તમારી માહિતીને પ્રમાણિત કરવા માટે તૈયાર થઈ જાઓ","ahd_inform_ac_page1_checkbox":"તમે INFORM એક્ટ નોટિસ અને સર્ટિફિકેશન પેજને સમજ્યા છો તેની ખાતરી કરવાના ચેકબોક્સમાં ક્લિક કરો છો, પછી તમને એક નોટિસ પ્રાપ્ત થશે અને તમારી માહિતીને અપડેટ કરવા અને પ્રમાણિત કરવા માટે 10 દિવસ હશે.","ahd_inform_ac_page1_step1_intructions":"નીચેની કોઈપણ ખોટી માહિતીને સાચી કરીને તેને અપડેટ કરવા માટે <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">એકાઉન્ટ માહિતી</a> પેજ પર જાઓ અથવા ફેરફાર કરો બટનને ક્લિક કરો. ","ahd_inform_ac_page2_certify_instructions":"જો નીચે તમારી માહિતી અપ ટુ ડેટ હોય, તો તમે અત્યારે પ્રમાણિત કરી શકો છો. જો કોઈ પણ માહિતી ખોટી હોય તો \'પ્રમાણિત\' ક્લિક કરતા પહેલા તમારી માહિતીમાં ફેરફાર કરવા માટે <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">એકાઉન્ટ માહિતી</a> પેજ પર જાઓ.","ahd_inform_ac_refresh_update_info":"જો તમે નીચે કોઈ માહિતી અપડેટ કરી હોય, તો કૃપા કરીને પેજને રિફ્રેશ કરવા અને નવી માહિતી જોવા માટે અહીં ક્લિક કરો.","ahd_inform_account_information_update_verification":"તમારા એકાઉન્ટની માહિતી અપડેટ કરવામાં આવી છે અને અમે તમારી માહિતીની ચકાસણી કરી રહ્યા છીએ. વાર્ષિક પ્રમાણીકરણ પ્રક્રિયા શરૂ કરવા માટે કોઈ વધારાના પગલાંની જરૂર છે કે નહીં તે નક્કી કરવા માટે 24 કલાકમાં પાછા તપાસો.","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"એડ્રેસ","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_button":"પ્રમાણિત કરો","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_confirmation":"“પ્રમાણિત કરો” ક્લિક કરીને હું પ્રમાણિત કરું છું કે મેં ઉપરની નોટિસ વાંચી છે અને મેં Amazon ને પ્રદાન કરેલી માહિતી સાચી અને ખરી છે, મારા બિઝનેસને સંબંધિત છે, અને ખોટી રીતે ઉઠાવેલી નથી.","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_your_info_button":"તમારી માહિતીને પ્રમાણિત કરો","ahd_inform_act_ac_edit_information":"માહિતી એડિટ કરો","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"ઇમેઇલ","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"નામ","ahd_inform_act_ac_not_required":"INFORM એક્ટ હજી તમારા વ્યવસાય પર લાગુ પડતો નથી તેથી તમારે હાલમાં તમારી માહિતીને પ્રમાણિત કરવાની જરૂર નથી. જો તમને તમારી માહિતીને પ્રમાણિત કરવાની જરૂર હોય તો અમે તમને ભવિષ્યમાં સૂચિત કરીશું.","ahd_inform_act_ac_notice_title":"નોટિસ","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"ફોન","ahd_inform_act_ac_short_description":"તમારી પેન્ડીંગ INFORM કન્ઝ્યુમર્સ એક્ટની આવશ્યકતાઓને રિવ્યૂ કરો અને પૂર્ણ કરો.","ahd_inform_act_ac_step1_title":"તમારી માહિતીને રિવ્યૂ કરો અને અપડેટ કરો","ahd_inform_act_ac_tax_field":"ટેક્સ ID નંબર","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou":"તમારા બિઝનેસની માહિતી તાજેતરની છે તે પ્રમાણિત કરવા બદલ આપનો આભાર. તમે તમારી બાકી INFORM એક્ટ નોટિસ અને સર્ટિફિકેશન આવશ્યકતા પૂર્ણ કરી છે તેની ખાતરી કરવા માટે તમારું એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ પેજ થોડી મિનિટોમાં અપડેટ થશે.","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou_banner":"તમારા બિઝનેસની માહિતી તાજેતરની છે તે પ્રમાણિત કરવા બદલ આપનો આભાર. તમે તમારી બાકી INFORM એક્ટ નોટિસ અને સર્ટિફિકેશન આવશ્યકતા પૂર્ણ કરી છે તેની ખાતરી કરવા માટે તમારું એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ પેજ થોડી મિનિટોમાં અપડેટ થશે.\\n<br><br>કૃપા કરીને યાદ રાખો કે તમારે તમારી બિઝનેસની માહિતી તાજેતરની રાખવાની અને ઓછામાં ઓછું વાર્ષિક રીતે પ્રમાણિત કરવું જરૂરી છે કે તમારું નામ, સરનામું, ફોન નંબર, ઇમેઇલ એડ્રેસ, બેંક એકાઉન્ટની માહિતી અને ટેક્સ ID નંબર સાચો છે.","ahd_inform_act_ac_tin_field":"ટેક્સ આઇડેન્ટિફિકેશન નંબર (TIN):","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions":"કૃપા કરીને નોંધ કરો કે એકાઉન્ટની માહિતીની પુષ્ટિ કરવાની/ફેરફાર કરવાની અધિકૃત પરમિશન ધરાવતા પ્રાઈમરી વપરાશકર્તા અથવા સેકન્ડરી વપરાશકર્તા જ માહિતીને પ્રમાણિત કરી શકશે.","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions_error":"આ માહિતી એકાઉન્ટના પ્રાઈમરી વપરાશકર્તા અથવા એકાઉન્ટ માહિતીની પુષ્ટિ કરવાની/ફેરફાર કરવાની પરમિશન ધરાવતા અધિકૃત સેકન્ડરી વપરાશકર્તા દ્વારા પ્રમાણિત હોવી આવશ્યક છે.","ahd_inform_act_account_information":"એકાઉન્ટની માહિતી","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_deactivation_banner":"<a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">ગ્રાહકોને અધિનિયમની જાણ કરો</a>નું પાલન કરવા માટે, Amazon ને તમારા Amazon પર સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટ વિશેની માહિતી એકત્રિત કરવાની અને તેને વેરિફાય જરૂર છે. કારણ કે અમને વિનંતી કરેલી માહિતી પ્રાપ્ત થઈ નથી, તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય થઈ ગયું છે. તમારા એકાઉન્ટને ફરીથી સક્રિય કરવા માટે, નીચેની સૂચિની સમીક્ષા કરો અને વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">સેલર એકાઉન્ટ માહિતી</a> પર જાઓ. <br><br>એકવાર તમે બાકી રહેતી બધી આવશ્યકતાઓ માટે વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કરી લો, પછી તમારું એકાઉન્ટ 48 કલાકની અંદર ફરીથી સક્રિય થઈ જશે. ","ahd_inform_act_adhoc_hold_banner":"<b>તમારા એકાઉન્ટ પર નિષ્ક્રિય થવાનું જોખમ છે અને તમારા Amazon સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટ માટે ડિસબર્સમેન્ટ હોલ્ડ પર મૂકવામાં આવ્યા છે.</b><br><br><a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">ગ્રાહકોને અધિનિયમની જાણ કરો</a>નું પાલન કરવા માટે, Amazon ને તમારા Amazon પર સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટ વિશેની માહિતી એકત્રિત કરવાની અને ચકાસવાની જરૂર છે. કારણ કે અમને અમારા સંદેશાવ્યવહારમાં ઉલ્લેખિત સમયરેખામાં વિનંતી કરેલી માહિતી પ્રાપ્ત થઈ નથી, તેથી તમારા ડિસબર્સમેન્ટ હવે હોલ્ડ પર મૂકવામાં આવ્યા છે. તમારા ડિસબર્સમેન્ટને ફરીથી સક્રિય કરવા માટે, નીચેની સૂચિની સમીક્ષા કરો અને તમારી માહિતી સબમિશન શરૂ કરવા અથવા પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">સેલર એકાઉન્ટ માહિતી</a> પર જાઓ.","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_ending":"આ નંબરથી સમાપ્ત થતું બેંક એકાઉન્ટ","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"બેન્ક એકાઉન્ટની માહિતી","ahd_inform_act_debit_card_ending":"ડેબિટ કાર્ડ જે આ નંબરથી સમાપ્ત થાય છે","ahd_inform_act_dismiss":"બરતરફ કરો","ahd_inform_act_dismiss_button":"બરતરફ કરો","ahd_inform_act_hold_wait_text":"તમારા ડિસબર્સમેન્ટને ફરીથી સક્રિય કરવા અને તમારા એકાઉન્ટને નિષ્ક્રિય થવાથી રોકવા માટે, બાકી રહેતી આવશ્યકતાઓને પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">સેલર એકાઉન્ટ માહિતી</a> પર જાઓ અને નીચેના પગલાંઓ પર ક્લિક કરો. <br><br>ઓળખ વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કરવા બદલ આભાર. કોઈપણ વધારાના વેરિફિકેશનના પગલાંની જરૂર છે કે કેમ તે જાણવા માટે 24 કલાકમાં પાછા તપાસો.","ahd_inform_act_hold_widget_description":"તમારા ડિસબર્સમેન્ટને ફરીથી સક્રિય કરવા અને તમારા એકાઉન્ટને નિષ્ક્રિય થવાથી રોકવા માટે, બાકી રહેતી આવશ્યકતાઓને પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">સેલર એકાઉન્ટ માહિતી</a> પર જાઓ અને નીચેના પગલાંઓ પર ક્લિક કરો. <br><br>ઓળખ વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કર્યા બાદ, તમને નીચેની એક અથવા વધુ વધારાની વસ્તુઓના વેરિફિકેશન માટે કહેવામાં આવી શકે છે.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_wait_text":"બાકી રહેતી આવશ્યકતાઓને પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે નીચેના પગલાંઓ પર ક્લિક કરો. ઓળખનું વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કરવા બદલ આભાર. કોઈપણ વધારાના વેરિફિકેશનના પગલાંની જરૂર છે કે કેમ તે જાણવા માટે 24 કલાકમાં તપાસ કરો.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_widget_description":"બાકી રહેતી આવશ્યકતાઓને પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે નીચેના પગલાંઓ પર ક્લિક કરો. ઓળખ ચકાસણી બાદ, તમને નીચેની એક અથવા વધુ વધારાની વસ્તુઓની ચકાસણી કરવા માટે કહેવામાં આવી શકે છે.","ahd_inform_act_mobile_widget_help":"INFORM એક્ટ વિશે વધુ જાણો","ahd_inform_act_need_help":"કોઈ મદદની જરૂર છે? <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM એક્ટ હેલ્પ પેજ</a>ની મુલાકાત લો.","ahd_inform_act_short_description":"તમારી બાકી ઇન્ફોર્મ કન્ઝ્યુમર્સ એક્ટની આવશ્યકતાઓની સમીક્ષા કરો અને પૂર્ણ કરો.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete":"<b>યુએસ ઇન્ફોર્મ કન્ઝ્યુમર્સ એક્ટ</b> <br> <br> અમે સફળતાપૂર્વક તમામ ખુલ્લાં વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કર્યા છે. અમે આ વેરિફિકેશન પ્રક્રિયામાં સહયોગ આપવા બદલ તમારા પ્રયત્નોની પ્રશંસા કરીએ છીએ.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete_short":"<b>યુએસ ઇન્ફોર્મ કન્ઝ્યુમર્સ એક્ટ</b> <br> <br> અમે સફળતાપૂર્વક તમામ ખુલ્લાં વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કર્યા છે. અમે આ વેરિફિકેશન પ્રક્રિયામાં સહયોગ આપવા બદલ તમારા પ્રયત્નોની પ્રશંસા કરીએ છીએ.","ahd_inform_act_verification_complete_widget":"અમે સફળતાપૂર્વક બધા બાકી વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કર્યા છે. અમે આ વેરિફિકેશન પ્રક્રિયામાં સહયોગ આપવા બદલ તમારા પ્રયત્નોની પ્રશંસા કરીએ છીએ.","ahd_inform_act_wait_text":"ઓળખની ચકાસણી કરાવવા બદલ આભાર. કોઈપણ વધારાની માહિતીની જરૂર છે કે નહીં તેની પુષ્ટિ માટે 24 કલાકમાં પાછા તપાસો. <br><br><a href=/hz/sc/account-information>સેલર એકાઉન્ટ માહિતી</a> પેજ પર જવા અને પેન્ડિંગ આવશ્યકતાઓને પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે નીચેના પગલાંઓ પર ક્લિક કરો.","ahd_inform_act_widget_bank_account_field":"બેંક એકાઉન્ટ","ahd_inform_act_widget_business_address_field":"બિઝનેસનું સરનામું","ahd_inform_act_widget_description":"<a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">સેલર એકાઉન્ટ માહિતી</a> પેજ પર જવા અને બાકી રહેતી આવશ્યકતાઓને પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે નીચેના પગલાંઓ પર ક્લિક કરો. <br><br> ઓળખ વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કર્યા બાદ, તમને નીચેની એક અથવા વધુ વધારાની વસ્તુઓની ચકાસણી કરવા માટે કહેવામાં આવી શકે છે.","ahd_inform_act_widget_identity_field":"ઓળખ","ahd_inform_act_widget_pending_status":"ઇન પ્રોગ્રેસ","ahd_inform_act_widget_phone_number_field":"ફોન નંબર","ahd_inform_act_widget_tax_id_field":"ટેક્સ ID નંબર","ahd_inform_act_widget_title":"INFORM કન્ઝ્યુમર એક્ટ","ahd_inform_act_widget_unverified_status":"વેરિફાય નથી","ahd_inform_annual_cerification_risk_banner":"તમારે તમારી વ્યવસાયની માહિતીને વર્તમાન રાખવાની અને પ્રમાણિત કરવાની જરૂર છે","ahd_inform_annual_certification":"વાર્ષિક પ્રમાણપત્ર","ahd_inform_annual_review_banner":"<b>તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિયકરણના જોખમ પર છે. </b><br><br><a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7?ref_=ahd_annual_ inform_consumer_act\\">INFORM કન્ઝ્યુમર્સ એક્ટ</a>નું પાલન કરવા માટે, તમારા Amazon પર સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટની માહિતી વાર્ષિક ધોરણે પ્રમાણિત થવી આવશ્યક છે. તમારી માહિતી તાજેતરની છે તે પ્રમાણિત કરવા માટે <a href=\\"/mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render?ref_=ahd_annual_inform_certification\\">વાર્ષિક પ્રમાણપત્ર</a> પેજની મુલાકાત લો.","ahd_inform_annual_review_complete":"<b>INFORM કન્ઝ્યુમર્સ એક્ટ</b> <br> <br> બાકી રહેતી બધી આવશ્યકતાઓને પૂર્ણ કરવા બદલ આભાર.","ahd_inform_annual_review_seller_enforced":"<a href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7\\">INFORM કન્ઝ્યુમર્સ એક્ટ</a>નું પાલન કરવા માટે, તમારે વાર્ષિક ધોરણે તમારા Amazon પર સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટ માહિતીની ચોકસાઈ પ્રમાણિત કરવી આવશ્યક છે. કારણ કે અમને વિનંતી કરેલ પ્રમાણપત્ર પ્રાપ્ત થયું નથી, તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય થઈ ગયું છે. તમારા એકાઉન્ટને ફરીથી સક્રિય કરવા માટે, તમારી માહિતી વર્તમાન છે તે પ્રમાણિત કરવા માટે <a href=\\" /mario/annual-cert/annual-certification/global/node/certify/render\\">વાર્ષિક પ્રમાણપત્ર</a> પેજની મુલાકાત લો. <br><br> એકવાર તમે પ્રમાણપત્ર પૂર્ણ કરી લો, તમારું એકાઉન્ટ 48 કલાકની અંદર ફરીથી સક્રિય થઈ જશે.","ahd_inform_annual_review_thank_you_dismiss_button":"બરતરફ કરો","ahd_inform_bav_not_verified":"તમારી પાસે વેરિફાય થયેલ બેંક એકાઉન્ટ નથી અથવા તેને US માર્કેટપ્લેસમાં ડિફોલ્ટ ડિપોઝિટ પદ્ધતિ તરીકે વેરિફાય થયેલ બેંક એકાઉન્ટ અસાઇન કરેલ નથી. <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>ડિપોઝિટ પદ્ધતિઓ</a> પેજ પર તમારા બેંક એકાઉન્ટને ડિફોલ્ટ તરીકે વેરિફાય કરો અને અસાઇન કરો.","ahd_inform_company_registration_number":"કંપની રજિસ્ટ્રેશન નંબર: ","ahd_inform_compliance_action_name":"નામ","ahd_inform_confirmation_p1":"કૃપા કરીને યાદ રાખો કે તમારે તમારી બિઝનેસની માહિતી તાજેતરની રાખવાની અને કે તમારું નામ, સરનામું, ફોન નંબર, ઇમેઇલ એડ્રેસ, બેંક એકાઉન્ટની માહિતી અને ટેક્સ ID નંબર સાચો છે તે ઓછામાં ઓછું વાર્ષિક પ્રમાણિત કરવું જરૂરી છે.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p2":"જો તમારી કોઈપણ માહિતીમાં ફેરફાર થાય તો Amazon ને આ નવી માહિતીને વેરિફાય કરવાની જરૂર પડશે. કૃપા કરીને કોઈપણ માહિતીની વિનંતીઓનો તાત્કાલિક જવાબ આપો જેથી અમે આ વધારાના ચકાસણી પગલાંઓ પૂર્ણ કરવા અને એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય થવાનું ટાળવા માટે તમારી સાથે કામ કરી શકીએ. ચકાસણી પ્રક્રિયા વિશે વધુ માહિતી માટે, <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>ઇન્ફોર્મ એક્ટ હેલ્પ પેજ</a> પર જાઓ.","ahd_inform_consumers_act_ac":"INFORM એક્ટ નોટિસ અને સર્ટિફિકેશન","ahd_inform_consumers_act_annual":"INFORM ગ્રાહકો અધિનિયમ વાર્ષિક પ્રમાણપત્ર ","ahd_inform_debit_card":"યુ.એસ. માર્કેટપ્લેસ માટે ડિસબર્સમેન્ટ રિસીવ કરવાનું ચાલુ રાખવા માટે તમારે તમારા સેકન્ડરી એક્ટિવ બેંક એકાઉન્ટને વેરિફાય કરાવવું આવશ્યક છે. તમારા બેંક એકાઉન્ટને <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>ડિપોઝિટ પદ્ધતિઓ</a> પેજ પર વેરિફાય કરો.","ahd_inform_loading_error":"તમારી વર્તમાન માહિતીની સમીક્ષા કરવા માટે કૃપા કરીને <a href=/hz/sc/account-information target=\\"_blank\\">એકાઉન્ટ માહિતી</a> પેજ પર જાઓ.","ahd_inform_no_default_deposit":"તમારી પાસે વેરિફાઈ કરેલ બેંક એકાઉન્ટ નથી અથવા યુ.એસ. માર્કેટપ્લેસને તમારી ડિફોલ્ટ ડિપોઝીટ પદ્ધતિ તરીકે વેરિફાઈ બેંક એકાઉન્ટ સોંપ્યું નથી. <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>ડિપોઝિટ પદ્ધતિઓ</a> પેજ પર તમારા બેંક એકાઉન્ટને ડિફોલ્ટ તરીકે વેરિફાઈ કરો અને સોંપો.","ahd_inform_page1_button":"આગળ વધો","ahd_inform_page1_checkbox":"હું સમજું છું કે હું INFORM એક્ટ સર્ટિફિકેશન પેજ પર જાઉં તે પછી એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય થવાના કોઈપણ જોખમને ટાળવા માટે મારે 10 દિવસની અંદર સર્ટિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કરવું આવશ્યક છે. ","ahd_inform_page1_instructions":"હવે બે સરળ પગલાઓમાં તમારી માહિતીને રિવ્યૂ કરો અને પ્રમાણિત કરો:","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2a":"અમે સેલરને તેમની બિઝનેસની માહિતી સાચી છે તેની સમીક્ષા કરવા અને પ્રમાણિત કરવા માટે ઔપચારિક નોટિફિકેશન મોકલવાનું શરૂ કરીશું.","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2b":"જો કે, તમારે ઔપચારિક નોટિફિકેશનની રાહ જોવાની જરૂર નથી, અને પાછળથી એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય થવાના જોખમને ટાળવા માટે અત્યારે પગલાં લઈ શકો છો.","ahd_inform_page1_proceed_title":"INFORM એક્ટ નોટિસ અને સર્ટિફિકેશન માટે આગળ વધો","ahd_inform_page1_step2_description":"જો તમારી માહિતી અપ ટુ ડેટ હોય, અથવા જો તમે હમણાં જ તેને અપડેટ કરી હોય, તો તમારી ઔપચારિક નોટિસ પ્રાપ્ત કરવા અને તમારું પ્રમાણપત્ર પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે આગળના પગલા - નોટિસ અને પ્રમાણપત્ર - પર આગળ વધો. એકવાર તમે આ નોટિસ જોઈ લો, પછી કાયદા અનુસાર તમારે 10 દિવસની અંદર તમારી માહિતીને પ્રમાણિત કરવી પડશે.","ahd_inform_page_1_p1":"અમે તમારા અને ગ્રાહકોના વિશ્વસનીય શોપિંગ અનુભવ માટે પ્રતિબદ્ધ છીએ. આ ધોરણને ટકાવી રાખવા માટે, અમે વાર્ષિક ધોરણે તમારી પાસેથી ચોક્કસ વ્યવસાયિક માહિતી એકત્રિત અને ચકાસણી કરીશું, જેમાં US INFORM કન્ઝ્યુમર્સ એક્ટ દ્વારા માહિતીની આવશ્યક્તા શામેલ છે.","ahd_inform_sw_bav":"તમારે તમારા એક્ટિવ બેંક એકાઉન્ટ્સને વેરિફાઈ કરવું આવશ્યક છે. તમારા બેંક એકાઉન્ટ્સ અહીં <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView>ડિપોઝિટ પદ્ધતિઓ</a> પેજ પર વેરિફાઈ કરો.","ahd_inform_tax_q_redirect":"તમારી વર્તમાન માહિતીની સમીક્ષા કરવા માટે <a href=/sw/AccountInfo/1099KTaxInformation/step/1099KTaxInformation?immediateRedirect=true&intent=INFORM_ACT target=\\"_blank\\">INFORM ટેક્સ પ્રશ્નાવલી</a> પેજ પર જાઓ.","ahd_inform_update_account_information_educational":"Amazon પર સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટ માહિતી અપ-ટૂ-ડેટ છે તેની ખાતરી કરવા માટે <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account-information\\">વાર્ષિક પ્રમાણપત્ર</a> પેજની મુલાકાત લો.","ahd_itr_extension_extension_request_link":"જરૂરી દસ્તાવેજો સબમિટ કરો.","ahd_itr_extension_request":"જો તમે આ આવશ્યકતાઓમાંથી એક્સ્ટેંશન કે એકઝમ્પશનની વિનંતી કરવા માંગતા હો, ${appealUrl}.","ahd_itr_priority_action":"ઈટલી સ્થિત સેલરો માટે ઈટાલિયન ટેક્સ ID આવશ્યક છે.","ahd_itr_rap_appeals":"મેં ટેક્સ સેટિંગ્સમાં મારી ઈટાલિયન કોડિસ ફિસ્કલની વિગતો અપડેટ કરી છે અને ફરીથી માન્યતાની વિનંતી કરવા માંગુ છું.","ahd_itr_rap_at_risk_deactivation":"તમારા એકાઉન્ટ પર નિષ્ક્રિય થવાનું જોખમ છે.","ahd_itr_rap_deactivated_message":"તમારું એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય કરવામાં આવ્યું છે.","ahd_itr_rap_dispute":"હું મારા ઈટાલિયન કોડિસ ફિસ્કલની માન્યતા અંગેના Amazonના નિર્ણય સાથે અસંમત છું.","ahd_itr_rap_intro":"<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>ઈટાલિયન કાયદા નં. 157/2019</a> મુજબ, ઈટલી સ્થિત સેલરો જે Amazon પર એક અથવા વધુ વ્યવહારો પૂર્ણ કરે છે તેમને તેમના ટેક્સ સેટિંગ્સમાં ઈટાલિયન કોડિસ ફિસ્કલ ઉમેરવાની જરૂર છે.","ahd_itr_rap_pending_deactivation":"તમારા એકાઉન્ટનું નિષ્ક્રિયકરણ બાકી છે.","ahd_itr_remediation_corp":"ટેક્સ સેટિંગ્સ <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>માં તમારો ઇટાલિયન કોડિસ ફિસ્કલ સબમિટ કરો. અમારી માહિતી મુજબ (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), તમારું એકાઉન્ટ કંપની તરીકે રજીસ્ટર થયેલ છે, અને તેથી અમને તમારો બિઝનેસ રજિસ્ટ્રેશન નંબર (“કોડિસ ફિસ્કલ” તરીકે ઓળખાય છે, “IT” દેશ કોડ વગર વેલ્યૂ એડેડ ટેક્સ (VAT) ID ને અનુરૂપ) જરૂરી છે. સબમિશન પગલાં માટે કૃપા કરીને સહાય પેજ (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>ઇટાલિયન કાયદા નંબર 157/2019</a>) નો સંદર્ભ લો. તમારે બિઝનેસની માહિતીના પેજ પર તમારું લીગલ નેમ (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) અને ટેક્સ સેટિંગ્સ <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>માં તમારો બિઝનેસ રજિસ્ટ્રેશન નંબર, ઇટાલિયન ટેક્સ ઓથોરિટી ડેટાબેઝ સાથે મેળ ખાય છે તેની ખાતરી કરવી આવશ્યક છે.","ahd_itr_remediation_individual":"ટેક્સ સેટિંગ્સ <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>માં તમારો ઇટાલિયન કોડિસ ફિસ્કલ સબમિટ કરો. અમારી માહિતી મુજબ (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render), તમારું એકાઉન્ટ વ્યક્તિગત તરીકે રજીસ્ટર થયેલ છે, અને તેથી અમને તમારા સિટિઝન ID (“કોડિસ ફિસ્કલ” તરીકે ઓળખાય છે) ની જરૂર છે. સબમિશન પગલાં માટે સહાય પેજ (<a href=’/help/hub/reference/external/G9WUUH6K5MFRTLRR’ target=\'_blank\'>ઇટાલિયન કાયદો નંબર 157/2019</a>) નો સંદર્ભ લો. તમારે બિઝનેસની માહિતીના પેજ પર તમારું લીગલ નેમ (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render) અને ટેક્સ સેટિંગ્સ <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>માં તમારો સિટિઝન ID, ઇટાલિયન ટેક્સ ઓથોરિટી ડેટાબેઝ સાથે મેળ ખાય છે તેની ખાતરી કરવી આવશ્યક છે.","ahd_itr_remediation_unkown":"બિઝનેસની માહિતીના પેજ પર તમારી માહિતી સબમિટ કરો (https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render). કંપનીઓએ તેમનો બિઝનેસ રજિસ્ટ્રેશન નંબર (\\"કોડિસ ફિસ્કલ\\" કહેવાય છે, જે \\"IT\\" દેશ કોડ વિના વેલ્યૂ એડેડ ટેક્સ (VAT) ID ની સમકક્ષ છે) પ્રદાન કરવો આવશ્યક છે, જ્યારે વ્યક્તિગત સેલર, જેમાં એકમાત્ર માલિકી ધરાવતા પ્રોપરાઈટર (“P. IVA individuale\\")નો સમાવેશ થાય છે, તેમણે ટેક્સ સેટિંગ્સમાં તેમનું વ્યક્તિગત સિટિઝન ID (\\"કોડિસ ફિસ્કલ\\" પણ કહેવાય છે) અપલોડ કરવું આવશ્યક છે<https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>. તમારે ખાતરી કરવી જોઈએ કે બિઝનેસની માહિતીના પેજ <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render> પર તમારું લીગલ નેમ અને ટેક્સ સેટિંગ્સ <https://www.sellercentral.amazon.dev/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns>માં કોડિસ ફિસ્કલ ઇટાલિયન ઓથોરિટી ડેટાબેઝ સાથે મેળ ખાય છે.","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_details_fallback_text":"હેલ્થી એકાઉન્ટ જાળવવા વિશે પ્રશ્નો છે? સેલર આસિસ્ટન્ટ પાસેથી વ્યક્તિગત માર્ગદર્શન મેળવો.","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_suggestion_fallback_text":"એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ વિશે ચેટ કરો","ahd_mobile_seller_assistant_title":"સેલર આસિસ્ટન્ટને પૂછો","ahd_more_information_hd":"વધુ માહિતી","ahd_mvblsivna_priority_action":"તમારું વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કરો","ahd_new_feature":"નવું!","ahd_new_feature_announcement_body_new_filters":"હવે તમે અસરગ્રસ્ત લિસ્ટિંગ પર લેવામાં આવેલી કાર્યવાહી દ્વારા પોલિસીના ઉલ્લંઘનોને ફિલ્ટર કરી શકો છો. પ્રોડક્ટ પોલિસી અનુપાલન પેજ પર જાઓ અને ઉલ્લંઘનોને ફિલ્ટર કરવા માટે \\"ફિલ્ટર્સ ઉમેરો\\" પર ક્લિક કરો.","ahd_new_feature_announcement_got_it_button":"સમજાઈ ગયું ","ahd_new_feature_announcement_header":"નવા ફીચરની જાહેરાત","ahd_new_feature_announcement_title_new_filters":"નવા ફિલ્ટર્સ ઉમેરવામાં આવ્યા","ahd_other_policy_violation_title":"અન્ય નીતિ ઉલ્લંઘનો","ahd_past_due":"પાછળના બાકી","ahd_payment_policy_hd_priority_action":"તમારા એકાઉન્ટ પર પેન્ડિંગ ક્રિયાઓને કારણે તમારા ફંડ હોલ્ડ પર છે. તમારા ડિસબર્સમેન્ટને ફરીથી સક્રિય કરવા માટે <b>પ્રાથમિકતા ક્રિયાઓ</b>ની સમીક્ષા કરો.","ahd_post_enforcement_non_deactivation_subheader":"તમારી એક અથવા વધુ કાર્ય આઇટમ્સ બાકી છે, જે તમારી એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થને પ્રભાવિત કરી રહી છે.","ahd_pp_mas_r_policies_code_of_conduct":"સેલિંગ પોલિસીઓ અને સેલર માટેની આચારસંહિતા","ahd_pr_form_address_header":"તમારી પ્રોડક્ટનું વેચાણ ચાલુ રાખવા માટે નોન-કમ્પ્લાયન્ટ પ્રોડક્ટ દંડને સંબોધિત કરો.","ahd_pr_form_address_sub_header":"DOJ પરના માર્ગદર્શન મુજબ, Amazon પરના તમારા ઓર્ડરની જાણ કરીને અને ચૂકવીને અને પછી તમારા ખાતામાંથી આ રકમો પુનઃપ્રાપ્ત કરીને Amazon તમારી નિયમનકારી પાલનની જવાબદારીઓને સરળ બનાવે છે.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_info":"EPA/DOJ સંમતિ હુકમનામા અનુસાર, અમને EPAને લગતી પોલિસીઓ પરના કોઈપણ ઉલ્લંઘન માટે સેલરોને દંડ કરવાની જરૂર છે. કૃપા કરીને <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account/health/product-policies\\">નોન-કમ્પ્લાયન્ટ પ્રોડક્ટ</a>, તમારા એકાઉન્ટ પર સંકળાયેલ દંડ, લાગુ રિઝર્વની ગણતરી કરો, અને અપીલ સબમિટ કરવા માટે મોકલવામાં આવેલા સંચાર પર વધુ માહિતી શોધો. ત્યારબાદ તમારી પાસેથી કોઈપણ બાકી દંડ માટે ચાર્જ લેવામાં આવશે.<br/><br/>અમે તમને દંડ માટે ચાર્જ કરીએ તે પહેલાં, અમે તમને તમારી લિસ્ટિંગની સુધારણા કરવાની તક આપતી વખતે તમારા એકાઉન્ટ પર હોલ્ડ રાખીશું.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_title":"આ કેવી રીતે કાર્ય કરે છે?","ahd_pr_form_impact_header":"સંભવિત એકાઉન્ટની અસરની વિગત નીચે આપેલી છે:","ahd_pr_form_impact_p1":"દંડ ચૂકવવાની જવાબદારી (નીચે ઉલ્લંઘનની વિગતોનો સંદર્ભ લો","ahd_pr_form_impact_p2":"EPA/DOJ દ્વારા માર્ગદર્શન અનુસાર લિસ્ટિંગ સપ્રેસ કરવામાં આવશે","ahd_pr_form_impact_p3":"તમારા એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ પર નકારાત્મક અસર જે તમારા સેલર એકાઉન્ટને નિષ્ક્રિય કરી શકે છે","ahd_pr_form_note":"કૃપા કરીને નોંધ કરો: અમે તમારી પાસેથી દંડ ચાર્જ કરતાં પહેલાં, અમે તમારા એકાઉન્ટ પર 30 દિવસ માટે હોલ્ડ રાખીશું જ્યારે તમને તમારી લિસ્ટિંગ સુધારવાની તક આપીશું.","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_body":"આ પ્રોડક્ટને જંતુનાશક પ્રોડક્ટ, જંતુનાશક ઉપકરણ અથવા જંતુનાશક દાવા ધરાવતી પ્રોડક્ટ તરીકે ઓળખવામાં આવી છે. પુનઃસ્થાપન માટે ધ્યાનમાં લેવા માટે, કૃપા કરીને EPA રજિસ્ટ્રેશન નંબર અને/અથવા EPA એસ્ટાબ્લિશમેન્ટ નંબરના પુરાવા અથવા પ્રમાણપત્ર પ્રદાન કરો કે પ્રોડક્ટને EPA નિયમોમાંથી મુક્તિ આપવામાં આવી છે. તમારે લિસ્ટિંગ માટે જંતુનાશક ચિહ્ન એટ્રિબ્યૂટમાં આ માહિતી પ્રદાન કરવાની જરૂર પડશે. <a href=/help/hub/reference/GLX9EJX844SNJX7J> આ એટ્રિબ્યૂટને પૂર્ણ કરવા માટેની સૂચનાઓ Seller Central પર ઉપલબ્ધ છે.</a>","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_title":"સંબંધિત પોલિસીની માહિતી","ahd_pr_form_title":"નોન-કમ્પ્લાયન્ટ પ્રોડક્ટની વિગતો","ahd_pre_enforcment_non_deactivation_subheader":"તમારી પાસે એક અથવા વધુ બાકી એક્શન આઇટમ્સ છે જેના પરિણામે ભવિષ્યમાં એકાઉન્ટમાં વિક્ષેપ પડી શકે છે.","ahd_priority_actions_address_by_date":"{daysremaining} દિવસમાં {date} સુધીમાં જાણ કરો","ahd_priority_actions_compliant":"ઓળખ ચકાસણી પૂર્ણ થઈ","ahd_priority_actions_cr":"કેન્સલેશન રેટ (CR) ઉલ્લંઘન","ahd_priority_actions_description":"એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિયકરણને રોકવા માટે નીચે આપેલી સમસ્યાઓને હલ કરો.","ahd_priority_actions_hd":"ડિસબર્સમેન્ટ હોલ્ડ પર","ahd_priority_actions_lsr":"લેટ શિપમેન્ટ રેટ (LSR) ઉલ્લંઘન","ahd_priority_actions_odr":"ઓર્ડર ડિફેક્ટ રેટ (ODR) ઉલ્લંઘન","ahd_priority_actions_otdr":"ઓન ટાઇમ ડિલિવરી રેટ (OTDR) ઉલ્લંઘનો","ahd_priority_actions_title":"પ્રાથમિકતા પર પગલાંઓ","ahd_priority_actions_verification_status":"વેરિફિકેશન શરૂ કરો","ahd_priority_actions_verification_title":"વેરિફિકેશનની આવશ્યકતાઓ પૂર્ણ કરો","ahd_pspp_priority_actions":"બાકી ‘તમારા ગ્રાહકને જાણો (KYC)’ સમીક્ષા પૂર્ણ કરો - ચુકવણી સેવા પ્રદાતા","ahd_pspp_rap_intro":"તમારું બેંક એકાઉન્ટ ડિસબર્સમેન્ટ રિસીવ કરવા માટે યોગ્યતા ધરાવતું નથી. બાકી રહેલ તમારા ગ્રાહકને જાણો (KYC) સમીક્ષા પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે તમારા ચુકવણી સેવા પ્રદાતા સાથે કામ કરો.","ahd_pspp_rap_next_steps":"વધુ માહિતી માટે <a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GY8JTVAWBPQT2XFC?ref_=to_psp_faq_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>ચુકવણી સેવા પ્રદાતા FAQ</a> અને <a href=\'/sw/AccountInfo/DepositMethodView/step/DepositMethodView?ref_=to_deposit_method_from_rap\' target=\'_blank\'>ડિપોઝિટ પદ્ધતિઓ</a> પેજની મુલાકાત લો. ","ahd_rap_at_risk_deactivation":"તમારા એકાઉન્ટ પર ડીએક્ટિવેશનનું જોખમ છે.","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory":"ઇન્વેન્ટરી પ્રતિબંધોથી પ્રભાવિત દેશો","ahd_rap_at_risk_inventory_details":"સૂચિબદ્ધ દેશમાં તમારી Amazon દ્વારા ફુલફિલ્ડ થયેલ અને તમારી આયાત અથવા નિકાસ ક્ષમતાઓમાં વિક્ષેપ ટાળવા માટે બાકી રહેલી આવશ્યકતાઓને પૂર્ણ કરો.","ahd_rap_at_risk_regional_details":"સૂચિબદ્ધ આવશ્યકતાઓ ઘણા બધા સ્ટોર્સમાં તમારા એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થને અસર કરી રહી છે. તમામ પ્રભાવિત સ્ટોર્સમાં એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિયતાને ટાળવા માટે બાકી આવશ્યકતાઓને સંબોધિત કરો.","ahd_rap_austria":"ઓસ્ટ્રિયા","ahd_rap_begin_verification":"ચકાસણી શરૂ કરો ","ahd_rap_begin_verification_cta":"વેરિફિકેશન શરૂ કરો","ahd_rap_belgium":"બેલ્જિયમ","ahd_rap_bulgaria":"બલ્ગેરિયા","ahd_rap_check_verification":"વેરિફિકેશન સ્ટેટસ તપાસો","ahd_rap_close":"બંધ કરો","ahd_rap_croatia":"ક્રોએશિયા","ahd_rap_cyprus":"સાયપ્રસ","ahd_rap_czech_republic":"ચેક રિપબ્લિક","ahd_rap_deactivated_message":"તમારું એકાઉન્ટ ડીએક્ટિવેટ કરવામાં આવ્યું છે.","ahd_rap_denmark":"ડેન્માર્ક","ahd_rap_enforced_inventory_details":"સૂચિબદ્ધ દેશમાં તમારી પૂર્ણ થયેલી Amazon ઇન્વેન્ટરી અને આયાત અથવા નિકાસ ક્ષમતાઓ પરના નિયંત્રણો દૂર કરવા માટે બાકી રહેલી આવશ્યકતાઓને સંબોધિત કરો.","ahd_rap_estonia":"એસ્ટોનિયા","ahd_rap_finland":"ફિનલેન્ડ","ahd_rap_france":"ફ્રાન્સ","ahd_rap_germany":"જર્મની","ahd_rap_greece":"ગ્રીસ","ahd_rap_hungary":"હંગેરી","ahd_rap_ireland":"આયર્લેન્ડ","ahd_rap_italy":"ઇટલી","ahd_rap_latvia":"લાતવિયા","ahd_rap_lithuania":"લિથુઆનિયા","ahd_rap_luxembourg":"લક્ઝમબર્ગ","ahd_rap_malta":"માલ્ટા","ahd_rap_netherlands":"નેધરલેન્ડ","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p1":"Amazon પર સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટના ઉપયોગ માટે કાયદા મુજબ તમારી ઓળખનું વેરિફિકેશન આવશ્યક છે. કેનેડિયન અને બ્રાઝિલિયન કાયદાઓની આવશ્યકતા મુજબ, તમને અમારી સેવાનો ઉપયોગ કરવાની મંજૂરી આપવા માટે તમારી ઓળખનું વેરિફિકેશન કરવું જરૂરી છે. આ તપાસોને સરળ બનાવવા માટે તમારે અમને અમુક માહિતી અને ડોક્યુમેન્ટ પ્રદાન કરવાની જરૂર પડી શકે છે.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p2":"માહિતી આપવા માટે મારી પાસે કેટલો સમય છે?","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p3":"તમે રજીસ્ટર કર્યા પછી કોઈપણ સમયે જરૂરી વેરિફિકેશન માહિતી પ્રદાન કરી શકો છો. જ્યાં સુધી માહિતી પૂરી પાડવામાં અને વેરિફિકેશન કરવામાં ન આવે ત્યાં સુધી તમારી પાસે તમારા એકાઉન્ટની મર્યાદિત ઍક્સેસ હશે.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p4":"જો તમે આગળ વધવા અને Amazon.ca અથવા Amazon.com પર વેચવા માંગતા હો, તો તમે નીચે વેરિફિકેશન સાથે આગળ વધવા માંગતા હોવ તે સ્ટોરની બાજુમાં ચેકબોક્સ પસંદ કરો. તમે વેરિફિકેશન સાથે આગળ વધવાનું પસંદ કર્યા પછી, આગલા પગલાઓ નક્કી કરવા માટે ઓળખ માહિતી પેજની મુલાકાત લો.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_p5":"જો તમે પહેલા એક જ સ્ટોર માટે વેરિફિકેશન સાથે આગળ વધવા માંગતા હો, તો નીચેની સૂચિમાંથી ફક્ત તે સ્ટોર પસંદ કરો. તમે તે સ્ટોર માટે વેરિફિકેશન પૂર્ણ કરી લો તે પછી, તમને અન્ય સ્ટોર માટે વેરિફિકેશન શરૂ કરવા માટે જરૂરી પગલાંઓ પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે સૂચિત કરવામાં આવશે.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_select_stores":"સ્ટોર્સ પસંદ કરો ","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_thankyou_p1":"તમારી વેરિફિકેશન પ્રક્રિયા શરૂ કરવા બદલ તમારો આભાર.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_ca_br_kyc_thankyou_p2":"અમે તમારી માહિતીને માન્ય કરી રહ્યા છીએ અને આ રિવ્યૂ દરમિયાન તમારી પાસેથી વિગતો માટે વિનંતી કરવાની જરૂર પડી શકે છે. આ માન્ય થવામાં 24 કલાક સુધીનો સમય લાગી શકે છે, અને કેટલાક કિસ્સાઓમાં 10 કામકાજી દિવસો સુધીનો સમય લાગી શકે છે. આ સમય દરમિયાન, તમારી ઓળખ માહિતીમાં ફેરફાર કરી શકાતો નથી.","ahd_rap_new_self_trigger_check_verification_status":"એકાઉન્ટ માહિતી પેજ પર તમારી વેરિફિકેશનની સ્થિતિ અને જરૂરી આગલા પગલાંઓ તપાસો.","ahd_rap_norway":"નોર્વે","ahd_rap_or":"અથવા","ahd_rap_past_due_inventory":"પાસ્ટ ડ્યુ - ઇન્વેન્ટરી ક્ષમતાઓ પ્રતિબંધિત","ahd_rap_pending_deactivation":"તમારા એકાઉન્ટનું ડીએક્ટિવેશન બાકી છે.","ahd_rap_poland":"પોલેન્ડ","ahd_rap_portugal":"પોર્ટુગલ","ahd_rap_romania":"રોમાનિયા","ahd_rap_slovakia":"સ્લોવેકિયા","ahd_rap_slovenia":"સ્લોવેનિયા","ahd_rap_spain":"સ્પેઇન","ahd_rap_sweden":"\\r\\nસ્વિડન","ahd_rap_switzerland":"સ્વિત્ઝર્લેન્ડ","ahd_rap_the_uk":"યુનાઇટેડ કિંગ્ડમ","ahd_rap_uk":"યુનાઇટેડ કિંગ્ડમ","ahd_rap_voluntary_submission_action":"અમને ઉપલબ્ધ માહિતીના આધારે તમારે ${countryName} VAT નંબર રાખવાની જરૂર નથી, આ જરૂરિયાતનું પાલન કરવા માટે તમે કાં તો તેને <a href=\'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>ટેક્સ સેટિંગ્સ</a> માંથી દૂર કરી શકો છો અથવા ઉપરોક્ત સમસ્યાને ઉકેલવા સાથે આગળ વધી શકો છો.","ahd_regulatory_compliance":"નિયમનકારી પાલન","ahd_related_accounts_policy_reason":"સેલર આચારસંહિતા (Amazon પર મલ્ટીપલ સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટ)","ahd_sa_account_health_guidance_description":"એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ વિશે પ્રશ્નો છે? સેલર આસિસ્ટન્ટ પાસેથી વ્યક્તિગત માર્ગદર્શન મેળવો.","ahd_sa_ask_seller_assistant_title":"સેલર આસિસ્ટન્ટને પૂછો","ahd_sa_chat_about_account_health_label":"એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ વિશે ચેટ કરો","ahd_sa_chat_about_account_health_text":"મારી એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ કેવી છે?","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_label":"પ્રોડક્ટ કોમ્પ્લાયન્સનો સારાંશ આપો","ahd_sa_summarize_product_compliance_text":"શું તમે મારા પ્રોડક્ટ કોમ્પ્લાયન્સના ઉલ્લંઘનનો સારાંશ આપી શકો છો?","ahd_save_changes_button":"ફેરફારો સેવ કરો","ahd_status_only":"સ્ટેટસ","ahd_status_past_due":"પાછળના બાકી","ahd_uaebizlicense_priority_action":"તમારું ટ્રેડ લાઇસન્સ અપલોડ કરો","ahd_vas_extension_extension_request_link":"જરૂરી ડોક્યુમેન્ટેશન સબમિટ કરો.","ahd_vas_extension_request":"જો તમે એક્સ્ટેંશનની વિનંતી કરવા માંગતા હો અથવા તમે Amazonના નિર્ણય સાથે અસંમત છો, તો <a href=\\"${appealUrl}\\" target=\\"_blank\\">જરૂરી દસ્તાવેજો સબમિટ કરો.</a>","ahd_vas_it_reason":"અમાન્ય ઇટાલિયન VAT રજીસ્ટ્રેશન નંબર","ahd_vas_priority_action":"યુરોપિયન VAT રજિસ્ટ્રેશન આવશ્યકતાઓ","ahd_vas_rap_action_address_country":" <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>સરનામાંની માહિતી ચકાસો/અપડેટ કરો</a>","ahd_vas_rap_action_address_review":"<a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>સબમિટ કરેલી સરનામાંની માહિતીને રિવ્યૂ કરો</a>","ahd_vas_rap_action_name_country":" <a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>નામની માહિતી ચકાસો/અપડેટ કરો</a>","ahd_vas_rap_action_name_review":"<a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>સબમિટ કરેલ નામની માહિતીને રિવ્યૂ કરો</a>","ahd_vas_rap_action_vat_country":"<a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>VAT નંબર ચકાસો/અપડેટ કરો</a> ","ahd_vas_rap_action_vat_review":"<a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>સબમિટ કરેલ VAT નંબરને રિવ્યૂ કરો</a> ","ahd_vas_rap_deactivated_message":"સૂચિબદ્ધ આવશ્યકતાઓ ઘણા બધા સ્ટોર્સમાં તમારા એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થને અસર કરી રહી છે. બધા પ્રભાવિત સ્ટોર્સમાં તમારા એકાઉન્ટને ફરીથી સક્રિય કરવા માટે સૂચિબદ્ધ દેશ માટેની બાકી આવશ્યકતાઓને પૂર્ણ કરો.","ahd_vas_rap_intro":"<a href=\'/help/hub/reference/GTQ23HPXBQK563WS\' target=\'_blank\'>યુરોપિયન VAT રજીસ્ટ્રેશન આવશ્યકતાઓ</a> એ EU Amazon પોલિસી છે જે EU સ્ટોર્સમાં એક્ટિવ બધા સેલિંગ પાર્ટનરને જ્યારે પણ આવશ્યકતા હોય ત્યારે માન્ય VAT રજીસ્ટ્રેશન નંબર સબમિટ કરવાની જરૂર છે.  તમારી બાકી આવશ્યકતાઓને પૂર્ણ કરવા માટે એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ ઇમ્પેક્ટ વિભાગને રિવ્યૂ કરો.","ahd_vas_rap_secondary_action":"જો તમારી પાસે લિસ્ટેડ દેશ માટે VAT રજીસ્ટ્રેશન નંબર ન હોય, તો નીચેના દેશો માટે જરૂરી માહિતી (VAT નંબર, નામ, સરનામું) સબમિટ કરવા માટે <a href= \'/mario/seller-verification/soa-coc/regional/node/verification-start/render\' target=\'_blank\'>બિઝનેસ માહિતી</a> પોર્ટલ અને <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'blank\'>ટેક્સ સેટિંગ્સ</a> પોર્ટલની મુલાકાત લો:","ahd_vas_rap_third_action":"જો તમે તમારા દેશમાં યુનિયન વન-સ્ટોપ શોપ (OSS)ની પસંદગી કરી હોય, તો કૃપા કરીને યુનિયન વન-સ્ટોપ શોપ (OSS) વેલ્યૂ એડેડ ટેક્સ (VAT) ડિકલેરેશન મેનૂમાંથી તમારા દેશને પસંદ કરીને <a href= \'/tax/consolidatedRegistrations?ref=sc_b2b_taxsettings_vrns\' target=\'_blank\'>ટેક્સ સેટિંગ</a> પેજની મુલાકાત લો. ખાતરી કરો કે તમારું યુનિયન વન-સ્ટોપ શોપ (OSS) સક્ષમ કરેલ છે અને Amazonને પ્રદાન કરેલ નામ અને સરનામું સત્તાવાળાઓને પ્રદાન કરેલા નામ અને સરનામાં સાથે મેળ ખાય છે.","ahd_vas_rap_verifying":"અમે તમારા VAT રજીસ્ટ્રેશન નંબરની વિગતોને રિવ્યૂ કરી રહ્યા છીએ. આમાં 14 દિવસ લાગી શકે છે. જો વધારાની માહિતી જરૂરી હશે તો અમે તમારો સંપર્ક કરીશું.","ahd_view_all_pa":"બધી પ્રાથમિકતા ક્રિયાઓ જુઓ (${totalCount})","ahd_violation_appeal_button":"અપીલ સાથે આગળ વધો","ahd_violation_details":"ઉલ્લંઘનની વિગતો","ahd_violation_display_name":"પ્રતિબંધિત પ્રોડક્ટ પોલિસીનું ઉલ્લંઘન","ahd_violation_status_assessment_phase":"આકારણી તબક્કામાં દંડ - ડિસબર્સમેન્ટ પર અસર થઈ શકે છે.","ahd_violation_status_open":"ઓપન કરો","ahd_w8_priority_action":"અપડેટ કરેલ U.S. ટેક્સ આઇડેન્ટિટી માહિતીની આવશ્યક્તા","ahd_w8_rap_action":"તમારે હવે નિયત તારીખ પહેલાં તમારું સેલ્ફ સર્વિસ ટેક્સ ઇન્ટરવ્યૂ પૂર્ણ કરવું જરૂરી છે. તમારા સબમિશન પર પ્રક્રિયા કરવામાં 24 કલાક જેટલો સમય લાગી શકે છે.","ahd_w8_rap_deactivated_action":"તમારા એકાઉન્ટને ફરીથી સક્રિય કરવા માટે જરૂરી માહિતી સબમિટ કરો. તમારા સબમિશન પર પ્રક્રિયા કરવામાં 24 કલાક જેટલો સમય લાગી શકે છે.","ahd_w8_rap_intro":"નવું W-8 ટેક્સ ફોર્મ જરૂરી છે. એકવાર તમારા ફોર્મની તારીખ સમાપ્ત થઈ જાય, પછી જ્યાં સુધી તમે અપડેટ કરેલી ટેક્સ માહિતી પ્રદાન ન કરો ત્યાં સુધી તમારું સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટ અસ્થાયી રૂપે નિષ્ક્રિય કરવામાં આવશે.\\n\\n<br><br>આ આવશ્યકતાઓ બહુવિધ સ્ટોર્સમાં તમારા એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થને અસર કરે છે.  તમામ પ્રભાવિત સ્ટોર્સમાં એકાઉન્ટ ડીએક્ટિવેશનને ટાળવા માટે લિસ્ટેડ આવશ્યકતાઓને સંબોધિત કરો.\\n\\n<br><br>વધુ માહિતી માટે, આની મુલાકાત લો <a href=\'help/hub/reference/G200663290?ref_=to_w8_help_from_intro_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>US ઇન્કમ રિપોર્ટિંગ અને ટેક્સ આઇડેન્ટિટી કલેક્શન FAQ.</a>","ahd_w8_rap_tax_interview":"<a href=\'/hz/account-info/tax-interview-redirect?ref_=to_w8_from_launch_blurb\' target=\'_blank\'>જરૂરી માહિતી સબમિટ કરવા માટે તમારું સેલ્ફ સર્વિસ ટેક્સ ઇન્ટરવ્યૂ પૂર્ણ કરો.</a>","ahdpars_spx_myc_dashboard_mainHeader1":"તમારું કોમ્પલાયન્સ મેનેજ કરો","ahr-status-badge-great":"તંદુરસ્ત","ai_inform_page1_step1":"1. તમારી એકાઉન્ટ માહિતીની સમીક્ષા કરવા માટે તમારા એકાઉન્ટ માહિતી પેજ પર જાઓ [એકાઉન્ટ માહિતી પૃષ્ઠ પર લિંક અહીં] (અને અપડેટ કરો, જો જરૂરી હોય તો).","ai_inform_page1_step2":"2. તમે પુષ્ટિ કરી લો કે તમારી માહિતી સાચી છે તે પછી આ પેજ પર પાછા આવો અને તમારી ઔપચારિક નોટિસ અને સંપૂર્ણતાનું પ્રમાણપત્ર પ્રાપ્ત કરવા માટે નીચેની લિંકને ક્લિક કરો.","alert_variant_demo_description":"આ એલર્ટ ઘટકના વેરિઅન્ટને JavaScript દ્વારા બદલવામાં આવ્યું છે","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Katal ઘટકો HTML ઘટકોના એક્સ્ટેન્શન્સ છે, તેથી JavaScript તેમની સાથે બિલ્ટ-ઇન HTML ઘટકોની જેમ જ ઇન્ટરેક્ટ કરી શકે છે. અહીં આપણે JavaScript ને એલર્ટ પર \'વેરિઅન્ટ\' એટ્રિબ્યૂટને બદલતા જોઈએ છીએ.","components_containing_html_text":"કેટલાક ઘટકોમાં HTML કન્ટેન્ટ શામેલ હોઈ શકે છે, જેમ કે અમારા KatalTabs ઘટક. આ જટિલ ઘટકો API પ્રદાન કરે છે જેથી ડેવલપર્સ અને ફ્રેમવર્ક્સ તેમની સાથે વાતચીત કરી શકે.","continue_button_label":"ચાલુ રાખો","custom_elements_text":"Katal ડેવલપર્સને તેમના વેબ પેજ બનાવવા માટે કસ્ટમ-ડિઝાઇન્ડ ઘટકોનો ઉપયોગ કરવાની ક્ષમતા આપે છે. ઉદાહરણ તરીકે, જો ડેવલપરને બટનની જરૂર હોય, તો તે કોઈ બટન જાતે બનાવવાને બદલે <kat-button></kat-button> નો ઉપયોગ કરી શકે છે.","demo_complex_header_text":"ડેમોસ્ટ્રેશન: જટિલ Katal ઘટકો","demo_components_header_text":"ડેમોસ્ટ્રેશન: Katal ઘટકોનો ઉપયોગ કરવો","demo_javascript_header_text":"ડેમોસ્ટ્રેશન: Katal ઘટકો સાથે JavaScript","design_approved_text":"Katal વેબ પેજમાં ઉપયોગ માટે ડિઝાઇન-મંજૂર કરેલ ઘટકો ઓફર કરે છે જેને લેબલ્સ અને કસ્ટમ સેટિંગ્સથી કન્ફિગર કરી શકાય છે. ઉદાહરણ તરીકે: નિયમિત બટનો અને સેકન્ડરી બટનો, ફક્ત તેમની \'વેરિઅન્ટ\' એટ્રિબ્યૂટમાં જ અલગ હોય છે.","discovery_ahd_ni_warn_amazon_search":"Amazon શોધ શબ્દો","discovery_ahd_ni_warn_impressum":"ઇમ્પ્રેસમ","discovery_ahd_ni_warn_pdp":"પ્રોડક્ટ ડિટેલ પેજ","documentation_label":"Katal દસ્તાવેજીકરણ","fba_inventory_uc_identifier":"અમારા રેકોર્ડ્સ દર્શાવે છે કે તમે Amazon દ્વારા ફુલફિલ્ડ થયેલ (Fulfillment By Amazon) પ્રોગ્રામ દ્વારા ${COUNTRY} માં ઇન્વેન્ટરી હોલ્ડ કરી રહ્યા છો. Fulfillment By Amazon સેવાઓનો ઉપયોગ કરતા સેલર તરીકે, તમારે દરેક દેશ માટે માન્ય VAT રજીસ્ટ્રેશન નંબર પ્રદાન કરવો જરૂરી છે જ્યાં તમારી ઇન્વેન્ટરી સ્ટોર કરેલ છે. તમે જે દેશોમાં Fulfillment By Amazon સક્ષમ કર્યું છે તે દેશોની ચકાસણી <a href=/fba/settings/ target=\\"_blank\\">અહીં</a> કરી શકો છો.\\r\\nકૃપા કરીને ધ્યાનમાં રાખો કે તમારે એક માન્ય VAT રજીસ્ટ્રેશન નંબર સબમિટ કરવો પડશે જે યુરોપિયન યુનિયનની અંદર વ્યવહારો માટે સક્રિય થયેલ છે.","greeting_description":"આ એક નમૂના માટે Katal એપ્લિકેશન છે, જે દર્શાવે છે કે Katal ઘટકો તેમજ બિલ્ડ-એન્ડ-ડિપ્લોય ટૂલિંગનો ઉપયોગ કેવી રીતે કરવો. કૃપા કરીને કોઈપણ પ્રશ્નો અથવા ટિપ્પણીઓ માટે colombia-team@amazon.com પર Katal ટીમનો સંપર્ક કરો. આ ડેમો ચાલુ રાખવા માટે, કૃપા કરીને આ એલર્ટને કાઢી નાખો.","greeting_description_mons_app":"આ એક નમૂના રૂપ Katal એપ્લિકેશન છે, જે અનુવાદો સાથે Katal ઘટકોનો ઉપયોગ કેવી રીતે કરવો તે દર્શાવે છે. કૃપા કરીને કોઈપણ પ્રશ્નો અથવા ટિપ્પણીઓ માટે katal-team@amazon.com પર Katal ટીમનો સંપર્ક કરો.","greeting_header":"સેમ્પલ એપની માહિતી","inform_mobile_notification_description":"તમારી પેન્ડિંગ INFORM એક્ટ ચકાસણી આવશ્યકતાઓની સમીક્ષા કરવા માટે તમારા એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ પેજ પર જાઓ.","inform_mobile_notification_description_full":"તમારું Amazon.com સેલર એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય થવાનું જોખમ ધરાવે છે. તમારી પેન્ડિંગ INFORM એક્ટ ચકાસણી આવશ્યકતાઓની સમીક્ષા કરવા માટે તમારા એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ પેજ પર જાઓ.","information-requests":"માહિતી વિનંતીઓ","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"ફીડબેક મોકલો","mobile_ahd_adhoc_banner_inform_act":"કૃપા કરીને વેબ બ્રાઉઝરથી Seller Central માં સાઇન ઇન કરો.","mobile_ahd_banner_eg_trn":"તમારા Seller Central એકાઉન્ટમાં ટેક્સ સેટિંગ પેજ પર તમારો ટેક્સ રજિસ્ટ્રેશન નંબર અપડેટ કરો.","mobile_tutorial_inform_act_description":"ગ્રાહકોને અધિનિયમની જાણ કરોનું પાલન કરવા માટે, Amazon ને તમારા Amazon પર સેલિંગ એકાઉન્ટ વિશેની માહિતી એકત્રિત કરવાની અને ચકાસવાની જરૂર છે. હાલમાં, તમારી પાસે એક અથવા વધુ વેરિફિકેશનના પગલાં બાકી છે.","poe_domestic_uc_identifier":"અમારા આંતરિક રેકોર્ડ દર્શાવે છે કે તમારા વેચાણના ${COUNTRY} VAT રજિસ્ટ્રેશન માટે સ્થાનિક મર્યાદા કરતાં વધી ગયા છે.","ppc_fhdds_action_taken":"UK ઈનબાઉન્ડિંગ પ્રતિબંધનું જોખમ","ppc_fhdds_action_taken_past_due":"UK ઈનબાઉન્ડિંગ ક્ષમતાઓ હાલમાં પ્રતિબંધિત છે","ppc_fhdds_reason":"FHDDS: શિપમેન્ટમાં ઇમ્પોર્ટ એન્ટ્રી નંબર (IEN) ખૂટે છે","primary_button_label":"પ્રાથમિક બટન","product-policy-compliance":"પ્રોડક્ટ પોલિસીનું પાલન","rv-link-button":"ઉલ્લંઘનો પર જાઓ","sample_app_page_title_text":"એપ્લિકેશનનું સેમ્પલ","sc_homepage_education_phase_description":"ભવિષ્યમાં એકાઉન્ટ નિષ્ક્રિય થવાના જોખમને ટાળવા માટે તમારી એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થને ધ્યાનમાં લો.","sc_homepage_pending_deactivation":"તમારા એકાઉન્ટ સાથે એક ગંભીર ઘટના બની છે જેના કારણે તેનું નિષ્ક્રિય થવાનું પેન્ડીંગ છે. ","sc_inform_act_hold_banner":"તમારા એકાઉન્ટ પર નિષ્ક્રિય થવાનું જોખમ છે અને ડિસબર્સમેન્ટ હોલ્ડ પર છે","sc_inform_act_view_account_health_banner":"એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ પર જાઓ","sc_navbar_ah_cs_desc":"તમારા ઓર્ડર ડિફેક્ટ અને ઇનવોઇસ ડિફેક્ટ રેટ સહિત તમારા કસ્ટમર સર્વિસ પરફોર્મન્સ મેટ્રિક્સ જુઓ.","sc_navbar_ah_desc":"તમારું એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ રેટિંગ, તમારા એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થને અસર કરતી સમસ્યાઓ, અને કન્ટેન્ટ રીમુવલ અથવા એકાઉન્ટ ડીએક્ટિવેશનમાં પરિણમી શકે તેવા ઉલ્લંઘનો જુઓ.","sc_navbar_ah_eligibilities_desc":"તમે જેના માટે યોગ્ય હોઈ શકો તે લાભો અને પ્રોગ્રામ્સ જુઓ.","sc_navbar_ah_myc_desc":"ખાતરી કરો કે તમારી બધી પ્રોડક્ટ તમામ લાગુ, કાયદા, નિયમો અને Amazon પોલિસીઓનું પાલન કરે છે.","sc_navbar_ah_ppc_desc":"કન્ટેન્ટ રીમુવલ અથવા એકાઉન્ટ ડીએક્ટિવેશનમાં પરિણમી શકે તેવા તમામ પોલિસીના ઉલ્લંધનો જુઓ. ","sc_navbar_ah_sp_desc":"લેટ શિપમેન્ટ રેટ, પ્રિ-ફુલફિલમેન્ટ કેન્સલેશન રેટ, માન્ય ટ્રેકિંગ રેટ અને ઓન-ટાઇમ ડિલિવરી રેટ સહિત તમારા શિપિંગ પરફોર્મન્સ મેટ્રિક્સ જુઓ.  ","schp_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_header":"Amazon પર સેલિંગ શરૂ કરવા માટે તમારી બાકી વેરિફિકેશન આવશ્યકતાઓ પૂર્ણ કરો.","schp_complete_outstanding_verification_new_seller_subtitle":"તમારા એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ પેજ પર જાઓ અને Amazon પર સેલિંગ શરૂ કરવા માટે તમારી પ્રાથમિકતા ક્રિયાઓ પૂર્ણ કરો.","schp_complete_priority_actions":"તમારી પ્રાથમિકતા ક્રિયાઓ પૂર્ણ કરો","schp_inventory_restriction_card":"તમારા એકાઉન્ટ પરના ઇન્વેન્ટ્રી પ્રતિબંધો દૂર કરવા માટે તમારા એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થની સમસ્યાઓનું નિરાકરણ કરો.","secondary_button_label":"સેકન્ડરી બટન","ship_from_non_poe_uc_identifier":"અમારા આંતરિક રેકોર્ડ્સ સૂચવે છે કે તમે ${COUNTRY} પરથી શિપિંગ કરી રહ્યા છો જેમાંથી તમારા પોતાના દેશ કરતાં અલગ છે, તેથી, તમારે EU વ્યવહારો માટે માન્ય VAT ઇન્ફોર્મેશન એક્સચેન્જ સિસ્ટમ (VIES) VAT નંબર અથવા લાગુ VAT નંબર પ્રદાન કરવાની જરૂર છે. તમે શિપિંગ સેટિંગ્સ પેજ પરથી અથવા આ <a href=/sbr target=\\"_blank\\">લિંક</a> પરથી તમારા શિપિંગ સરનામાંની ચકાસણી કરી શકો છો.\\nકૃપા કરીને ધ્યાનમાં રાખો કે તમારે એક માન્ય VAT રજિસ્ટ્રેશન નંબર સબમિટ કરવો પડશે જે યુરોપિયન યુનિયનની અંદર વ્યવહારો માટે સક્રિય થયેલ છે.","ship_from_poe_uc_identifier":"અમારા રેકોર્ડ્સ દર્શાવે છે કે EU દેશોમાં તમારું ક્રોસ બોર્ડર વેચાણ €10,000 થી વધુ છે. સરહદ પાર વેચાણમાં રોકાયેલા સેલર તરીકે, તમારે તમારા સ્થાપના દેશનો UOSS-સક્ષમ VAT નંબર અથવા તમે જે દેશોમાં મોકલો છો તે બધા દેશો માટે માન્ય VAT નંબર પ્રદાન કરવા જરૂરી છે.","ship_to_non_eu_uc_identifier":"અમારા આંતરિક રેકોર્ડ્સ દર્શાવે છે કે તમારી પાસે EU ની બહારથી ${COUNTRY} માં €150 થી વધુ શિપમેન્ટ છે. તેથી, તમારે માન્ય ${COUNTRY} VAT નંબર અથવા ઘોષણા પ્રદાન કરવી જરૂરી છે જે પુષ્ટિ કરે છે કે તમે થ્રેશોલ્ડથી ઉપરના શિપમેન્ટ માટે રેકોર્ડના ઈમ્પોર્ટર નથી.","ship_to_uoss_uc_identifier":"અમારા આંતરિક રેકોર્ડ્સ દર્શાવે છે કે તમે અન્ય EU દેશમાંથી ${COUNTRY} માં ક્રોસ-બોર્ડર વેચાણ કરી રહ્યા છો અને તેથી, તમારે તમારા સ્થાપના દેશનો UOSS-સક્ષમ VAT નંબર અથવા માન્ય ${COUNTRY} VAT નંબર પ્રદાન કરવો જરૂરી છે.\\r\\nકૃપા કરીને ધ્યાનમાં રાખો કે તમારે એક માન્ય VAT રજીસ્ટ્રેશન નંબર સબમિટ કરવો પડશે જે યુરોપિયન યુનિયનની અંદર વ્યવહારો માટે સક્રિય થયેલ છે.","ship_to_xborder_uc_identifier":"અમારા આંતરિક રેકોર્ડ્સ દર્શાવે છે કે તમે અન્ય EU દેશમાંથી ${COUNTRY} માં ક્રોસ-બોર્ડર વેચાણ કરી રહ્યા છો અને તેથી, તમારે માન્ય ${COUNTRY} VAT નંબર પ્રદાન કરવો જરૂરી છે.","sp-aha-check-eligibility-button":"પાત્ર થવા માટે શું જોઈશે તે જુઓ","sp-permanent-call-me-now-need-help":"કોઈ મદદની જરૂર છે?","sp-permanent-call-me-now-prompt":"એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ સ્પેશિયાલિસ્ટ સાથે વાત કરો","sp-permanent-call-me-now-title":"મદદની જરૂર છે?","sp_health_amazon_fulfilled_metrics_caption":"Amazon દ્વારા ફુલફિલ થયેલ","sp_health_atoz_guarantee_claims_caption":"A-to-z Guarantee કલેઇમ","sp_health_cancellation_rate_caption":"પ્રિ-ફુલફિલમેન્ટ કેન્સલ રેટ","sp_health_cancellation_rate_subtitle":"<b>લક્ષ્યાંક</b>: ${hash-get targetValue} હેઠળ","sp_health_chargeback_claims_caption":"ચાર્જબેક ક્લેમ્સ","sp_health_customer_satisfaction_information_label":"ઓર્ડર ડિફેક્ટ રેટમાં ત્રણ અલગ મેટ્રિક્સ શામેલ છે:","sp_health_dashboard_guardian_title_new":"એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ એશ્યોરન્સ","sp_health_dashboard_subheader":"Amazon પર વેચવા માટે, તમારે નીચેના પર્ફૉર્મન્સના લક્ષ્યાંકો અને નીતિઓનું પાલન કરવું આવશ્યક છે.","sp_health_dashboard_title":"એકાઉન્ટ હેલ્થ","sp_health_download_report_caption":"રિપોર્ટ ડાઉનલોડ કરો","sp_health_gl_office_product":"ઑફિસ ઉત્પાદો","sp_health_gl_watch":"જુઓ","sp_health_intellectual_property_customer_complaints":"પ્રાપ્ત બૌદ્ધિક સંપદાની ફરિયાદો","sp_health_late_shipment_rate_caption":"વિલંબિત શિપમેન્ટ દર","sp_health_late_shipment_rate_subtitle":"<b>લક્ષ્યાંક</b>: ${hash-get targetValue} હેઠળ","sp_health_listing_policy_customer_complaints":"લિસ્ટિંગ પોલિસીનું ઉલંઘન","sp_health_mobile_by_ahr_impact_t