 is pending deactivation. To prevent deactivation, please address these violations now. For more information, go to the <a href=/gp/help/G200205250>Account Health Rating program policy</a>.","submission_status_ahd_review_submission_pending_status":"Status: Our evaluation is in progress.","tab_demo_generated_text":"Auto Generated Tab {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"Tab name {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Selected Tab","tab_demo_selected_text":"Content for initially selected tab","tab_demo_text":"Content for tab {tabId}","ts-form-header":"Report an abuse","ts-ingress-ahd":" <a id=\'submission-channel-link\' href=\'#\'>Report abuse</a> of Amazon policies.","valid_vat_number_uc_identifier":"Please keep in mind that you have to submit a valid VAT registration number that has been activated for intra-EU transactions.","voluntary_vrn_uc_identifier":"Our internal records indicate that you are not required to hold a VAT number in ${COUNTRY} but you have provided one on Seller Central that is currently not valid. To resolve this discrepancy, you can either remove the ${COUNTRY} VAT Number or provide a valid one. By removing your ${COUNTRY} VAT Number from Seller Central you are confirming that you are not required to hold one in ${COUNTRY}. We recommend consulting with a tax advisor to determine whether your overall business activities, both on and off Amazon, require VAT registration."}}}'),{endpointMap:{ar:{"pages.floatingWidget":"translation-ar.json","pages.homepage":"translation-ar.json"},"ar-AE":{"pages.floatingWidget":"translation-ar.json","pages.homepage":"translation-ar.json"},bn:{"pages.floatingWidget":"translation-bn.json","pages.homepage":"translation-bn.json"},"bn-IN":{"pages.floatingWidget":"translation-bn.json","pages.homepage":"translation-bn.json"},de:{"pages.floatingWidget":"translation-de.json","pages.homepage":"translation-de.json"},"de-DE":{"pages.floatingWidget":"translation-de.json","pages.homepage":"translation-de.json"},en:{"pages.floatingWidget":"transl