توضيحي: مكونات Katal المعقدة","demo_components_header_text":"عرض توضيحي: استخدام مكونات Katal","demo_javascript_header_text":"عرض توضيحي: JavaScript مع مكونات Katal","design_approved_text":"يقدم Katal مكونات معتمدة التصميم لاستخدامها في صفحات الويب التي يمكن تهيئتها من خلال الملصقات والإعدادات المخصصة. فعلى سبيل المثال: تختلف الأزرار العادية والأزرار الثانوية باختلاف صفة \\"المتغير\\" الخاصة بها فقط.","documentation_label":"مستندات Katal","greeting_description":"هذا نموذج تطبيق Katal؛ حيث يوضح كيفية استخدام مكونات Katal، وكذلك أدوات الإنشاء والنشر. المرجو التواصل مع فريق Katal عبر colombia-team@amazon.com لطرح أي أسئلة أو إرسال أي ملاحظات. لمتابعة هذا العرض التوضيحي، المرجو تجاهل هذا التنبيه.","greeting_description_mons_app":"هذا نموذج تطبيق Katal؛ حيث يوضح كيفية استخدام مكونات Katal مع الترجمات. المرجو التواصل مع فريق Katal عبر katal-team@amazon.com لطرح أي أسئلة أو إرسال أي ملاحظات.","greeting_header":"معلومات عن نموذج التطبيق","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"إرسال التقييم","primary_button_label":"الزر الأساسي","sample_app_page_title_text":"نموذج التطبيق","secondary_button_label":"الزر الثانوي","tab_demo_generated_text":"تبويب تم إنشاؤه تلقائيًا {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"اسم التبويب {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"التبويب المحدد","tab_demo_selected_text":"محتوى التبويب المحدد مبدئيًا","tab_demo_text":"محتوى التبويب {tabId}"}}}')},82715:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"bn":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"ট্যাব যোগ করুন","ahd_cancel_button":"বাতিল","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"ঠিকানা","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"ইমেইল","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"নাম","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"ফোন","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"ব্যাংক অ্যাকাউন্টের তথ্য","ahd_inform_page1_button":"এগিয়ে যান","alert_variant_demo_description":"এই অ্যালার্ট উপাদানের প্রকরণ জাভাস্ক্রিপ্টের মাধ্যমে পরিবর্তন করা হচ্ছে","alert_variant_explanation_text":"যেহেতু Katal কম্পোনেন্টগুলি HTML এলিমেন্টের এক্সটেনশন, তাই JavaScript তাদের সঙ্গে বিল্ড-ইন HTML এলিমেন্টের মতই ইন্টারঅ্যাক্ট করতে পারে। এখানে আমরা দেখতে পাচ্ছি JavaScript অ্যালার্ট-এর \'variant\' অ্যাট্রিবিউট পরিবর্তন করছে।","components_containing_html_text":"কিছু উপাদানে HTML কনটেন্ট থাকতে পারে, যেমন আমাদের KatalTabs উপাদান। এই জটিল উপাদানগুলি একটি API প্রদান করে যাতে ডেভেলপার এবং ফ্রেমওয়ার্কগুলি তাদের সঙ্গে যোগাযোগ করতে পারে।","continue_button_label":"চালিয়ে যান","custom_elements_text":"কাটাল ডেভেলপারদের তাদের ওয়েব পেজ নির্মাণের জন্য কাস্টমভাবে ডিজাইন করা এলিমেন্টগুলি ব্যবহার করতে দেয়। উদাহরণস্বরূপ, যদি ডেভেলপারের একটি বাটনের প্রয়োজন হয়, তবে তাঁরা একটি বাটন তৈরির পরিবর্তে <kat-button></kat-button> ব্যবহার করতে পারেন।","demo_complex_header_text":"বিবরণ: জটিল কাটাল উপাদানগুলি","demo_components_header_text":"বিবরণ: কাটাল উপাদানের ব্যবহার","demo_javascript_header_text":"বিবরণ: কাটাল উপাদান সহ জাভাস্ক্রিপ্ট","design_approved_text":"Katal ওয়েব পেজগুলিতে ব্যবহারের জন্য ডিজাইন-অনুমোদিত কম্পোনেন্ট সরবরাহ করে যা লেবেল এবং কাস্টম সেটিংসের সঙ্গে কনফিগার করা যায়। যেমন: রেগুলার বাটন এবং সেকেন্ডারি বাটন, শুধুমাত্র তাদের ‘ভ্যারিয়েন্ট’ অ্যাট্রিবিউট আলাদা।","documentation_label":"কাটাল ডকুমেন্টেশন","greeting_description":"এটি একটি নমুনা কাটাল অ্যাপ্লিকেশন, যা প্রদর্শন করে কিভাবে কাটাল কম্পোনেন্ট এবং বিল্ড-এন্ড-ডেপ্লয় টুলিং ব্যবহার করা হয়। অনুগ্রহ করে কোন জিজ্ঞাসা বা মন্তব্যের জন্য colombia-team@amazon.com -এ কাটাল দলের সঙ্গে যোগাযোগ করুন। এই ডেমো চালিয়ে যেতে, অনুগ্রহ করে এই অ্যালার্টটি বাতিল করুন।","greeting_description_mons_app":"এটি একটি নমুনা কাটাল অ্যাপ্লিকেশন, যা অনুবাদের সঙ্গে কী করে কাটাল উপাদান ব্যবহার করা যায় তা দেখায়। অনুগ্রহ করে কোন জিজ্ঞাসা বা মন্তব্যের জন্য katal-team@amazon.com -এ কাটাল দলের সঙ্গে যোগাযোগ করুন।","greeting_header":"নমুনা অ্যাপের তথ্য","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"ফিডব্যাক পাঠান","primary_button_label":"মুখ্য বাটন","sample_app_page_title_text":"নমুনা অ্যাপ্লিকেশন","secondary_button_label":"সেকেন্ডারি বোতাম","tab_demo_generated_text":"অটো জেনারেটেড ট্যাব {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"ট্যাবের নাম {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"নির্বাচিত ট্যাব","tab_demo_selected_text":"প্রাথমিকভাবে নির্বাচিত ট্যাব-এর কনটেন্ট","tab_demo_text":"ট্যাব {tabId} এর জন্য কনটেন্ট"}}}')},23351:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"de":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"Tab hinzufügen","ahd_cancel_button":"Abbrechen","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"Adresse","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"E-Mail-Adresse","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"Name","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"Telefon","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"Bankverbindung","ahd_inform_page1_button":"Fortfahren","alert_variant_demo_description":"Bei dieser Hinweiskomponente wird ihre Variante durch JavaScript geändert","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Da Katal-Komponenten Erweiterungen von HTML-Elementen sind, kann JavaScript mit ihnen auf dieselbe Weise wie mit integrierten HTML-Elementen interagieren. Hier sehen wir, wie JavaScript das Attribut \\"variant\\" im Hinweis ändert.","components_containing_html_text":"Einige Komponenten können HTML-Inhalte enthalten, z. B. unsere KatalTabs-Komponente. Diese komplexen Komponenten stellen eine API bereit, sodass Entwickler und Frameworks mit ihnen interagieren können.","continue_button_label":"Weiter","custom_elements_text":"Katal bietet Entwicklern die Möglichkeit, benutzerdefinierte Elemente zur Erstellung ihrer Webseiten zu verwenden. Wenn der Entwickler beispielsweise eine Schaltfläche benötigt, kann er <kat-button></kat-button> verwenden, anstatt selbst eine Schaltfläche zu erstellen.","demo_complex_header_text":"Demo: Komplexe Katal-Komponenten","demo_components_header_text":"Demo: Verwendung von Katal-Komponenten","demo_javascript_header_text":"Demo: JavaScript mit Katal-Komponenten","design_approved_text":"Katal bietet für das Design genehmigte Komponenten zur Verwendung auf Webseiten, die mit Etiketten und benutzerdefinierten Einstellungen konfiguriert werden können. Beispiel: normale Schaltflächen und sekundäre Schaltflächen, die sich nur in ihrem Attribut \\"variant\\" unterscheiden.","documentation_label":"Katal-Dokumentation","greeting_description":"Dies ist eine Katal-Beispielanwendung, die zeigt, wie Katal-Komponenten sowie Tools zum Erstellen und Bereitstellen verwendet werden. Bei Fragen oder Anmerkungen wenden Sie sich an das Katal-Team unter colombia-team@amazon.com. Schließen Sie diesen Hinweis, um mit der Demo fortzufahren.","greeting_description_mons_app":"Dies ist eine Katal-Beispielanwendung, die zeigt, wie Katal-Komponenten mit Übersetzungen verwendet werden. Bei Fragen oder Anmerkungen wenden Sie sich an das Katal-Team unter katal-team@amazon.com.","greeting_header":"Beispiel-App-Informationen","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Feedback senden","primary_button_label":"Primäre Schaltfläche","sample_app_page_title_text":"Beispielanwendung","secondary_button_label":"Sekundäre Schaltfläche","tab_demo_generated_text":"Automatisch erstellter Tab {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"Tab-Name {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Ausgewählter Tab","tab_demo_selected_text":"Inhalt für ursprünglich ausgewählten Tab","tab_demo_text":"Inhalt für Tab {tabId}"}}}')},49447:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"en":{"pages.homepage":{"ahd_violation_status_assessment_phase":"Penalties in Assessment Phase - Disbursements may be impacted.","ahd_pr_form_title":"Non-Compliant Product Details","ahd_pr_form_address_header":"Address Non-Compliant Product Penalties to continue selling your products.","ahd_pr_form_address_sub_header":"As per the guidance from DOJ, Amazon simplifies your regulatory compliance obligations by reporting and paying  on behalf of your orders on Amazon and then recovering these amounts from your account.","ahd_pr_form_impact_header":"Possible account impact are as detailed below:","ahd_pr_form_impact_p1":"Liability to pay penalties (refer violation details below","ahd_pr_form_impact_p2":"The listing will remain suppressed in accordance to the guidance by EPA/DOJ","ahd_pr_form_impact_p3":"Negative impact on your account health which may lead to deactivation of your seller account","ahd_pr_form_note":"Please note: Before we charge you for the penalties, we will place a hold on your account for 30 days while give you a chance to remediate your listing.","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_title":"How Does This Work?","ahd_pr_form_how_it_works_info":"In accordance with the EPA/DOJ Consent Decree, we are required to penalize Sellers for any violations on policies pertaining to EPA. Please find more information on <a href=\\"/hz/sc/account/health/product-policies\\">non-compliant products</a>, Calculate associated penalties, Reserves applied on your account, and Communications sent to submit appeals. You will then be charged for any outstanding penalties.<br/><br/> Before we charge you for the penalties, we will place a hold on your account while giving you a chance to remediate your listing.","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_title":"Related Policy Information","ahd_pr_form_policy_info_body":"This product has been identified as a pesticide product, pesticide device, or a product that contains pesticide claims. To be considered for reinstatement, please provide evidence of an EPA Registration number and/or EPA Establishment number or a certification that the product is exempt from EPA regulations. You will need to provide this information in the Pesticide Marking attribute for the listing. <a href=/help/hub/reference/GLX9EJX844SNJX7J> Instructions for completing this attribute are available on Seller Central.</a>","ahd_violation_details":"Violation Details","ahd_violation_appeal_button":"Proceed with Appeal","ahd_violation_display_name":"Restricted Product Policy Violation","ahd_violation_status_open":"Open","ahd_ahr_pending_critical":"Pending Critical","ahd_all_issues":"All Issues","ahd_banner_account_atrisk_header":"Your account is at risk of deactivation.","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_body":"Your account will be considered for reactivation when your violations have been successfully appealed.","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_header":"Your account has been deactivated.","ahd_banner_account_pending_header":"Your account is pending deactivation.","ahd_banner_resolve_issues_button":"Resolve Issues","ahd_cancel_button":"Cancel","ahd_educational_banner_header":"Complete your Priority Actions","ahd_educational_banner_subheader":"You have one or more outstanding action items that will result in account deactivation if not completed by the listed date.","ahd_inform_ac_checkbox_error":"Click the checkbox to confirm that you have reviewed your information and certify that it is accurate and current.","ahd_inform_ac_edu_display_name":"Review Your Account Information","ahd_inform_ac_educational_subheader":"You have one or more outstanding action items that may result in future account deactivation.","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p1":"Under the US INFORM Consumers Act, you are required to keep certain business information (shown below) current and to electronically certify to Amazon that either you have updated your information or that the information already provided is still current. Certify that your information below is up-to-date within 10 days of viewing this notice, or your account will be at risk of deactivation.","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p2":"You are now required to certify that your information below is up to date within 10 days of first viewing this notice. Failure to certify will put your account at risk of deactivation.","ahd_inform_ac_p1_header":"Get Ready to Certify Your Information 2","ahd_inform_ac_page1_checkbox":"Click the checkbox to confirm you have understand that once you go to the INFORM Act Notice and Certification page, you’ll receive a notice and have 10 days to update and certify your information.","ahd_inform_ac_page1_step1_intructions":"Click “Edit” to update any information below that is incorrect, then click “Certify” above.","ahd_inform_ac_page2_certify_instructions":"If your information below is up to date, you can certify now. If any information is incorrect, please edit your information before clicking “Certify.”","ahd_inform_ac_refresh_update_info":"If you have updated any information below, please click here to refresh the page and see the new information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"Address","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_button":"Certify","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_confirmation":"By clicking \\"Certify\\" I certify that I read the Notice above and that the information I provided to Amazon is true and correct, corresponds to my business, and is not misappropriated.","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_your_info_button":"Certify your information","ahd_inform_act_ac_edit_information":"Edit Information","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"Name","ahd_inform_act_ac_not_required":"The INFORM Act does not yet apply to your business so you’re not currently required to certify your information. We’ll notify you in the future if you’re required to certify your information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_notice_title":"Notice","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"Phone","ahd_inform_act_ac_short_description":"Review and complete your pending INFORM Consumers Act requirements.","ahd_inform_act_ac_step1_title":"Review and update your information","ahd_inform_act_ac_tax_field":"Tax ID number","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou":"Thank you for certifying that your business information is current.","ahd_inform_act_ac_tin_field":"Tax Identification Number (TIN):","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions":"Please note that only the primary user or secondary user with authorized permissions to Confirm/Edit Account Information will be able to certify the information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions_error":"This information must be certified by the Account’s primary user or a secondary user authorized with permissions to Confirm/Edit Account Information.","ahd_inform_act_account_information":"Account Information","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_ending":"Bank account ending","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"Bank account information","ahd_inform_act_need_help":"Need help? Visit the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act Help page</a>.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p1":"To avoid any future disruptions to your account, please remember that you are required to keep your business information current and to certify at least annually that your name, address, phone number, email address, bank account information, and Tax ID number are correct.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p2":"If any of your information changes, Amazon will need to verify this new information as well. Please respond promptly to any information requests so that we can work with you to complete these additional verification steps and avoid account disruption. For more information about the verification process, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act Help page</a>.","ahd_inform_consumers_act_ac":"INFORM Act Notice and Certification","ahd_inform_page1_button":"Proceed","ahd_inform_page1_checkbox":"I understand that once I go to the INFORM Act Notice and Certification page, I must complete certification within 10 days to avoid the risk of account disruption.","ahd_inform_page1_instructions":"Review and certify your information now in two easy steps:","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2a":"Per the US INFORM Consumers Act, we will begin sending sellers a formal notification to review and certify that their business information is correct, which you must complete within 10 days to avoid the risk of account deactivation.","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2b":"However, you don’t have to wait and can take action to certify today.","ahd_inform_page1_step2_description":"Once you have confirmed that your information is correct, click the link below to receive your formal notice and complete certification.","ahd_inform_page_1_p1":"In our continued effort to provide you and customers with a trusted store experience, we will collect and verify certain business information from you at least annually.","ahd_past_due":"PAST DUE","ahd_priority_actions_address_by_date":"Address by {date} in {daysremaining} days","ahd_priority_actions_description":"Address the issues below to prevent account deactivation.","ahd_priority_actions_title":"Priority Actions","ahd_regulatory_compliance":"Regulatory Compliance","ai_inform_page1_step1":"1. Go to your Account Information page [link to Account Information page here] to review your account information (and update, if necessary).","ai_inform_page1_step2":"2. Once you have confirmed that your information is correct, return to this page and click the link below to receive your formal notice and complete certification.","alert_variant_demo_description":"This alert component is having its variant changed by JavaScript","continue_button_label":"Continue","sc_homepage_education_phase_description":"Address your account health to avoid the risk of future account deactivation.","sc_homepage_pending_deactivation":"A critical event has occurred with your account that has caused it to be pending deactivation.","sp_zero_tolerance_banner_body":"Due to one or more critical violations, your account is pending deactivation. To prevent deactivation, please address these violations now. For more information, go to the <a href=/gp/help/G200205250>Account Health Rating program policy</a>.","tab_demo_name":"Tab name {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_text":"Content for initially selected tab","tab_demo_text":"Content for tab {tabId}"}},"en-AU":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"Add tab","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"Email address","alert_variant_explanation_text":"As Katal components are extensions of HTML elements, JavaScript can interact with them the same as built-in HTML elements. Here, we see JavaScript changing the “variant” attribute on the alert.","components_containing_html_text":"Some components can contain HTML content, such as our KatalTabs component. These complex components provide an API, so developers and frameworks can interact with them.","custom_elements_text":"Katal gives developers the ability to use custom-designed elements to build their web pages. For example, if the developer needs a button, they can use <kat-button></kat-button> instead of building a button themselves.","demo_complex_header_text":"Demonstration: complex Katal components","demo_components_header_text":"Demonstration: using Katal components","demo_javascript_header_text":"Demonstration: JavaScript with Katal components","design_approved_text":"Katal offers design-approved components for use in web pages that can be configured with labels and custom settings. For example: regular buttons and secondary buttons, only different in their “variant” attribute.","documentation_label":"Katal documentation","greeting_description":"This is a sample Katal application, demonstrating how to use Katal components, as well as build-and-deploy tooling. Please contact the Katal team at colombia-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments. To continue this demo, please dismiss this alert.","greeting_description_mons_app":"This is a sample Katal application, demonstrating how to use Katal components with translations. Please contact the Katal team at katal-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments.","greeting_header":"Sample app information","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Send feedback","primary_button_label":"Primary button","sample_app_page_title_text":"Sample application","secondary_button_label":"Secondary button","tab_demo_generated_text":"Auto-generated tab {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Selected tab"}},"en-CA":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"Add tab","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"Email","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Because Katal components are extensions of HTML elements, JavaScript can interact with them the same as built-in HTML elements. Here we see JavaScript changing the “variant” attribute on the alert.","components_containing_html_text":"Some components can contain HTML content, like our KatalTabs component. These complex components provide an API so developers and frameworks can interact with them.","custom_elements_text":"Katal gi