ción: JavaScript con componentes de Katal","design_approved_text":"Katal ofrece componentes autorizados para su uso en páginas web que se pueden configurar con etiquetas y configuraciones personalizadas. Por ejemplo: botones normales y botones secundarios, diferentes sólo en el atributo \\"variant\\".","greeting_description":"Este es un ejemplo de aplicación de Katal que muestra cómo utilizar componentes de Katal, así como herramientas para desarrollo e implementación. Ponte en contacto con el equipo de Katal a través de colombia-team@amazon.com si tienes alguna pregunta o comentario. Para continuar con esta demostración, omite este aviso.","greeting_description_mons_app":"Este es un ejemplo de aplicación de Katal que muestra cómo utilizar componentes de Katal con traducciones. Ponte en contacto con el equipo de Katal a través de katal-team@amazon.com si tienes alguna pregunta o comentario.","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Enviar comentarios","tab_demo_generated_text":"Pestaña \\"Generado automáticamente\\" {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"Nombre de pestaña {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_text":"Contenido de la pestaña seleccionada inicialmente"}},"es-MX":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"Pestaña Agregar","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"Datos bancarios","alert_variant_demo_description":"JavaScript cambia la variante de este componente de aviso","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Dado que los componentes Katal son extensiones de elementos HTML, JavaScript puede interactuar con ellos de la misma manera que con los elementos HTML integrados. Aquí vemos que JavaScript cambia el atributo “variante” en el aviso.","components_containing_html_text":"Algunos componentes pueden tener contenido HTML, como nuestro componente KatalTabs. Estos componentes complejos proporcionan una API para que los desarrolladores y marcos puedan interactuar con ellos.","custom_elements_text":"Katal ofrece a los desarrolladores la posibilidad de usar elementos personalizados para crear sus páginas web. Por ejemplo, si el desarrollador necesita un botón, puede usar <kat-button></kat-button> en lugar de crearlo él mismo.","demo_complex_header_text":"Demostración: componentes Katal complejos","demo_components_header_text":"Demostración: uso de componentes Katal","demo_javascript_header_text":"Demostración: JavaScript con componentes Katal","design_approved_text":"Katal ofrece componentes con diseño aprobado para su uso en páginas web que se pueden configurar con etiquetas y parámetros personalizados, por ejemplo, botones normales y secundarios, diferentes sólo en el atributo “variante”.","greeting_description":"Esta es una aplicación Katal de muestra, que ilustra cómo usar los componentes de Katal, así como las herramientas de creación y ejecución. Contacta al equipo de Katal en colombia-team@amazon.com si tienes preguntas o comentarios. Para continuar con esta demostración, descarta este aviso.","greeting_description_mons_app":"Esta es una aplicación Katal de ejemplo, en la que se muestra cómo usar los componentes de Katal con traducciones. Contacta al equipo de Katal en katal-team@amazon.com si tienes preguntas o comentarios.","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Enviar valoraciones","tab_demo_generated_text":"Pestaña generada automáticamente {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"Nombre de la pestaña {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_text":"Contenido para la pestaña seleccionada inicialmente"}}}')},35015:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"fr":{"pages.homepage":{"ahd_cancel_button":"Annuler","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"Adresse","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"Nom","ahd_inform_page1_button":"Continuer","continue_button_label":"Continuer","primary_button_label":"Bouton principal","sample_app_page_title_text":"Exemple d’application","secondary_button_label":"Bouton secondaire","tab_demo_name":"Nom de l’onglet {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Onglet sélectionné"}},"fr-BE":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"Ajouter un onglet","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"E-mail","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"Téléphone","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"Informations sur le compte bancaire","alert_variant_demo_description":"La variante de ce composant d’alerte a été modifiée par JavaScript","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Étant donné que les composants Katal sont des extensions d’éléments HTML, JavaScript peut interagir avec eux de la même manière que les éléments HTML intégrés. Ici, nous constatons que JavaScript modifie l’attribut « variant » de l’alerte.","components_containing_html_text":"Certains composants peuvent accueillir du contenu HTML, comme notre composant KatalTabs. Ces composants complexes fournissent une API permettant aux développeurs ou aux frameworks d’interagir avec eux.","custom_elements_text":"Katal donne aux développeurs la possibilité d’utiliser des éléments personnalisés pour créer leurs pages Web. Par exemple, si le développeur a besoin d’un bouton, il peut utiliser <kat-button></kat-button> au lieu de créer un bouton lui-même.","demo_complex_header_text":"Démonstration : Composants Katal complexes","demo_components_header_text":"Démonstration : utilisation des composants Katal","demo_javascript_header_text":"Démonstration : JavaScript avec des composants Katal","design_approved_text":"Katal propose des composants dont le design est approuvé pour une utilisation sur des pages Web, et qui peuvent être configurés avec des étiquettes et des paramètres personnalisés. Par exemple : des boutons principaux et des boutons secondaires qui diffèrent uniquement par leur attribut « variant ».","documentation_label":"Documentation sur Katal","greeting_description":"Voici un exemple d’application Katal, qui montre comment utiliser les composants Katal ainsi que l’outil de création et de déploiement. Pour toute question ou tout commentaire, contactez l’équipe Katal à l’adresse colombia-team@amazon.com. Pour continuer cette démonstration, ignorez cette alerte.","greeting_description_mons_app":"Voici un exemple d’application Katal, qui montre comment utiliser les composants Katal pour des traductions. Pour toute question ou tout commentaire, contactez l’équipe Katal à l’adresse katal-team@amazon.com.","greeting_header":"Exemple d’informations d’application","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Envoyer vos commentaires","tab_demo_generated_text":"Onglet généré automatiquement {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_text":"Contenu de l’onglet initialement sélectionné","tab_demo_text":"Contenu de l’onglet {tabId}"}},"fr-CA":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"Ajouter un onglet","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"Courriel","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"Téléphone","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"Coordonnées de compte bancaire","alert_variant_demo_description":"La variante de ce composant d’alerte est modifiée par JavaScript","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Comme les composants Katal sont des extensions d’éléments HTML, JavaScript peut interagir avec eux de la même manière que les éléments HTML intégrés. Ici, nous voyons JavaScript changer l’attribut « variant » sur l’alerte.","components_containing_html_text":"Certains composants peuvent contenir du contenu HTML, comme notre composant KatalTabs. Ces composants complexes fournissent une API permettant aux développeurs et aux cadres d’interagir avec eux.","custom_elements_text":"Katal permet aux développeurs d’utiliser des éléments personnalisés pour créer leurs pages Web. Par exemple, si le développeur a besoin d’un bouton, il peut l’utiliser <kat-button> </kat-button> au lieu de créer lui-même un bouton.","demo_complex_header_text":"Démonstration : Composants Katal complexes","demo_components_header_text":"Démonstration : Utilisation de composants Katal","demo_javascript_header_text":"Démonstration : JavaScript avec composants Katal","design_approved_text":"Katal propose des composants approuvés pour la conception pour utilisation dans les pages Web qui peuvent être configurés avec des étiquettes et des paramètres personnalisés. Par exemple : boutons réguliers et boutons secondaires, différents uniquement dans leur attribut « variant ».","documentation_label":"Documentation Katal","greeting_description":"Il s’agit d’un exemple d’application Katal qui démontre comment utiliser les composants Katal et construire et déployer des outils. Veuillez communiquer avec l’équipe Katal à colombia-team@amazon.com pour toute question ou commentaire. Pour continuer cette démo, veuillez ignorer cette alerte.","greeting_description_mons_app":"Il s’agit d’un exemple d’application Katal qui démontre comment utiliser les composants Katal avec des traductions. Veuillez communiquer avec l’équipe Katal à katal-team@amazon.com pour toute question ou commentaire.","greeting_header":"Exemple d’information sur l’application","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Envoyer des commentaires","tab_demo_generated_text":"Onglet {tabId} généré automatiquement","tab_demo_selected_text":"Contenu de l’onglet sélectionné initialement","tab_demo_text":"Contenu pour l’onglet {tabId}"}},"fr-FR":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"Onglet Ajouter","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"Adresse e-mail","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"Numéro de téléphone","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"Informations sur le compte bancaire","alert_variant_demo_description":"La variante de ce composant d’alerte a été modifiée par JavaScript","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Les composants Katal étant des extensions d’éléments HTML, JavaScript peut interagir avec eux de la même manière qu’avec les éléments HTML intégrés. Ici, nous constatons que JavaScript modifie l’attribut \'variant\' dans l’alerte.","components_containing_html_text":"Certains composants peuvent intégrer du contenu HTML, à l’instar de notre composant KatalTabs. Ces composants complexes fournissent une API permettant aux développeurs et aux infrastructures d’interagir avec eux.","custom_elements_text":"Katal donne aux développeurs la possibilité d’utiliser des éléments personnalisés pour créer leurs pages Web. Par exemple, si le développeur a besoin d’un bouton, il peut utiliser <kat-button></kat-button> au lieu de créer un bouton lui-même.","demo_complex_header_text":"Démonstration : composants Katal complexes","demo_components_header_text":"Démonstration : utilisation de composants Katal","demo_javascript_header_text":"Démonstration : JavaScript avec des composants Katal","design_approved_text":"Katal propose des composants approuvés pour une utilisation sur des pages Web, qui peuvent être configurés avec des étiquettes et des paramètres personnalisés. Par exemple : les boutons standard et les boutons secondaires, dont la seule différence réside dans leur attribut \'variant\'.","documentation_label":"Documentation Katal","greeting_description":"Voici un exemple d’application Katal, qui montre comment utiliser les composants Katal ainsi que l’outil de création et de déploiement. Si vous avez des questions ou des commentaires, contactez l’équipe Katal à l’adresse colombia-team@amazon.com. Pour continuer cette démonstration, ignorez cette alerte.","greeting_description_mons_app":"Voici un exemple d’application Katal, qui montre comment utiliser les composants Katal avec des traductions. Si vous avez des questions ou des commentaires, contactez l’équipe Katal à l’adresse katal-team@amazon.com.","greeting_header":"Informations sur l’exemple d’application","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Envoyer vos commentaires","tab_demo_generated_text":"Onglet généré automatiquement {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_text":"Contenu de l’onglet initialement sélectionné","tab_demo_text":"Contenu de l’onglet {tabId}"}}}')},67778:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"gu":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"ટેબ ઉમેરો","ahd_cancel_button":"કેન્સલ કરો","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"એડ્રેસ","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"ઇમેઇલ","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"નામ","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"ફોન","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"બેન્ક એકાઉન્ટની માહિતી","ahd_inform_page1_button":"આગળ વધો","alert_variant_demo_description":"આ એલર્ટ ઘટકના વેરિઅન્ટને JavaScript દ્વારા બદલવામાં આવ્યું છે","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Katal ઘટકો HTML ઘટકોના એક્સ્ટેન્શન્સ છે, તેથી JavaScript તેમની સાથે બિલ્ટ-ઇન HTML ઘટકોની જેમ જ ઇન્ટરેક્ટ કરી શકે છે. અહીં આપણે JavaScript ને એલર્ટ પર \'વેરિઅન્ટ\' એટ્રિબ્યૂટને બદલતા જોઈએ છીએ.","components_containing_html_text":"કેટલાક ઘટકોમાં HTML કન્ટેન્ટ શામેલ હોઈ શકે છે, જેમ કે અમારા KatalTabs ઘટક. આ જટિલ ઘટકો API પ્રદાન કરે છે જેથી ડેવલપર્સ અને ફ્રેમવર્ક્સ તેમની સાથે વાતચીત કરી શકે.","continue_button_label":"ચાલુ રાખો","custom_elements_text":"Katal ડેવલપર્સને તેમના વેબ પેજ બનાવવા માટે કસ્ટમ-ડિઝાઇન્ડ ઘટકોનો ઉપયોગ કરવાની ક્ષમતા આપે છે. ઉદાહરણ તરીકે, જો ડેવલપરને બટનની જરૂર હોય, તો તે કોઈ બટન જાતે બનાવવાને બદલે <kat-button></kat-button> નો ઉપયોગ કરી શકે છે.","demo_complex_header_text":"ડેમોસ્ટ્રેશન: જટિલ Katal ઘટકો","demo_components_header_text":"ડેમોસ્ટ્રેશન: Katal ઘટકોનો ઉપયોગ કરવો","demo_javascript_header_text":"ડેમોસ્ટ્રેશન: Katal ઘટકો સાથે JavaScript","design_approved_text":"Katal વેબ પેજમાં ઉપયોગ માટે ડિઝાઇન-મંજૂર કરેલ ઘટકો ઓફર કરે છે જેને લેબલ્સ અને કસ્ટમ સેટિંગ્સથી કન્ફિગર કરી શકાય છે. ઉદાહરણ તરીકે: નિયમિત બટનો અને સેકન્ડરી બટનો, ફક્ત તેમની \'વેરિઅન્ટ\' એટ્રિબ્યૂટમાં જ અલગ હોય છે.","documentation_label":"Katal દસ્તાવેજીકરણ","greeting_description":"આ એક નમૂના માટે Katal એપ્લિકેશન છે, જે દર્શાવે છે કે Katal ઘટકો તેમજ બિલ્ડ-એન્ડ-ડિપ્લોય ટૂલિંગનો ઉપયોગ કેવી રીતે કરવો. કૃપા કરીને કોઈપણ પ્રશ્નો અથવા ટિપ્પણીઓ માટે colombia-team@amazon.com પર Katal ટીમનો સંપર્ક કરો. આ ડેમો ચાલુ રાખવા માટે, કૃપા કરીને આ એલર્ટને કાઢી નાખો.","greeting_description_mons_app":"આ એક નમૂના રૂપ Katal એપ્લિકેશન છે, જે અનુવાદો સાથે Katal ઘટકોનો ઉપયોગ કેવી રીતે કરવો તે દર્શાવે છે. કૃપા કરીને કોઈપણ પ્રશ્નો અથવા ટિપ્પણીઓ માટે katal-team@amazon.com પર Katal ટીમનો સંપર્ક કરો.","greeting_header":"સેમ્પલ એપની માહિતી","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"ફીડબેક મોકલો","primary_button_label":"પ્રાથમિક બટન","sample_app_page_title_text":"એપ્લિકેશનનું સેમ્પલ","secondary_button_label":"સેકન્ડરી બટન","tab_demo_generated_text":"ઓટો જનરેટ થયેલ ટેબ {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"ટેબનું નામ {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"પસંદ કરેલ ટેબ","tab_demo_selected_text":"શરૂઆતમાં પસંદ કરેલ ટેબ માટેની સામગ્રી","tab_demo_text":"{tabId} ટેબ માટે કન્ટેન્ટ"}}}')},77263:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"hi":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"टैब ऐड करें","ahd_cancel_button":"कैंसल करें","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"पता","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"ईमेल","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"नाम","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"फ़ोन","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"बैंक अकाउंट की जानकारी","ahd_inform_page1_button":"आगे बढ़ें","alert_variant_demo_description":"इस अलर्ट कॉम्पोनेन्ट का वैरिएंट JavaScript द्वारा बदला जा रहा है","alert_variant_explanation_text":"चूंकि, Katal कॉम्पोनेंट HTML एलिमेंट के एक्सटेंशन हैं, इसलिए JavaScript इनके साथ बिल्ट-इन HTML एलिमेंट की तरह ही इंटरैक्ट कर सकता है. यहां हम देखते हैं कि JavaScript, अलर्ट के \'वैरिएंट\' एट्रीब्यूट को बदल रहा है.","components_containing_html_text":"कुछ कॉम्पोनेंट में HTML कंटेंट हो सकता है, जैसे कि हमारा KatalTab कॉम्पोनेंट. ये कॉम्प्लेक्स कॉम्पोनेंट, API उपलब्ध करवाते हैं ताकि डेवलपर और फ़्रेमवर्क उनके साथ इंटरैक्ट कर सकें.","continue_button_label":"जारी रखें","custom_elements_text":"Katal में डेवलपर को अपने वेब पेज बनाने के लिए कस्टम डिज़ाइन वाले एलिमेंट का इस्तेमाल करने की सुविधा मिलती है. उदाहरण के लिए, अगर डेवलपर को बटन की ज़रूरत हो, तो वे खुद बटन बनाने के बजाय <kat-button></kat-button> का इस्तेमाल कर सकते हैं.","demo_complex_header_text":"डेमोंस्ट्रेशन : कॉम्पलेक्स Katal कॉम्पोनेंट","demo_components_header_text":"डेमोंस्ट्रेशन : Katal कॉम्पोनेंट का इस्तेमाल करना","demo_javascript_header_text":"डेमोंस्ट्रेशन : Katal कॉम्पोनेंट के साथ JavaScript","design_approved_text":"Katal, वेब पेज में इस्तेमाल के लिए मंज़ूर किए गए डिज़ाइन कॉम्पोनेंट ऑफ़र करता है जिन्हें लेबल और कस्टम सेटिंग के साथ कॉन्फ़िगर किया जा सकता है. उदाहरण के लिए : नियमित बटन और दूसरे बटन, सिर्फ़ उनके \'वेरिएंट\' एट्रीब्यूट अलग होते हैं.","documentation_label":"Katal दस्तावेज़","greeting_description":"यह सैंपल Katal ऐप्लिकेशन है जिसमें Katal कॉम्पोनेंट के इस्तेमाल के साथ-साथ टूल बनाने और डिप्लॉय करने का तरीका बताया गया है. कोई सवाल या कमेंट होने पर colombia-team@amazon.com पर Katal टीम से संपर्क करें. इस डेमो को जारी रखने के लिए इस अलर्ट को खारिज करें.","greeting_description_mons_app":"यह सैंपल Katal ऐप्लिकेशन है, जिसमें ट्रांसलेशन के मामले में Katal कॉम्पोनेंट का इस्तेमाल करने का तरीका बताया गया है. कोई सवाल या कमेंट होने पर katal-team@amazon.com पर Katal टीम से संपर्क करें.","greeting_header":"सैंपल ऐप की जानकारी","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"फ़ीडबैक भेजें","primary_button_label":"मुख्य बटन","sample_app_page_title_text":"सैंपल ऐप्लिकेशन","secondary_button_label":"सेकेंडरी बटन","tab_demo_generated_text":"ऑटो जनरेट किया गया टैब {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"टैब का नाम {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"चुना गया टैब","tab_demo_selected_text":"शुरुआत में चुने गए टैब के लिए कंटेंट","tab_demo_text":"टैब के लिए कंटेंट {tabId}"}}}')},47896:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"it":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"Aggiungi scheda","ahd_cancel_button":"Annulla","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"Indirizzo","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"E-mail","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"Nome","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"Telefono","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"Dati del conto bancario","ahd_inform_page1_button":"Avanti","alert_variant_demo_description":"Questo componente di avviso viene modificato nella sua variante da JavaScript","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Poiché i componenti Katal sono estensioni degli elementi HTML, JavaScript può interagire con i componenti e con gli elementi HTML integrati allo stesso modo. Qui vediamo JavaScript che modifica l\'attributo \\"variant\\" (variante) dell\'avviso.","components_containing_html_text":"Alcuni componenti possono includere contenuto HTML, come il nostro componente KatalTabs. Questi componenti complessi forniscono un\'API che consente agli sviluppatori e ai framework di interagire con i componenti stessi.","continue_button_label":"Continua","custom_elements_text":"Katal offre agli sviluppatori la possibilità di utilizzare elementi di design personalizzati per creare le proprie pagine web. Per esempio, se lo sviluppatore ha bisogno di un pulsante, può utilizzare <kat-button></kat-button> invece di crearne uno autonomamente.","demo_complex_header_text":"Dimostrazione: componenti Katal complessi","demo_components_header_text":"Dimostrazione: utilizzo dei componenti Katal","demo_javascript_header_text":"Dimostrazione: JavaScript con componenti Katal","design_approved_text":"Katal offre componenti con design approvato da utilizzare nelle pagine web che possono essere configurati con etichette e impostazioni personalizzate. Per esempio: pulsanti normali e pulsanti secondari, diversi solo per l\'attributo \\"variant\\" (variante).","documentation_label":"Documentazione Katal","greeting_description":"Questa è un\'applicazione Katal esempio che dimostra come utilizzare i componenti Katal e gli strumenti di compilazione e distribuzione. Per qualsiasi domanda o commento, contatta il team Katal all\'indirizzo colombia-team@amazon.com. Per continuare la dimostrazione, ignora l\'avviso.","greeting_description_mons_app":"Questa è un\'applicazione Katal esempio che dimostra come utilizzare i componenti Katal con le traduzioni. Per qualsiasi domanda o commento, contatta il team Katal all\'indirizzo katal-team@amazon.com.","greeting_header":"Informazioni sull\'app esempio","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Invia feedback","primary_button_label":"Pulsante principale","sample_app_page_title_text":"Applicazione esempio","secondary_button_label":"Pulsante secondario","tab_demo_generated_text":"Scheda generata automaticamente {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"Nome scheda {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Scheda selezionata","tab_demo_selected_text":"Contenuto della scheda inizialmente selezionata","tab_demo_text":"Contenuto della scheda {tabId}"}}}')},1145:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"ja":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"タブを追加","ahd_cancel_button":"キャンセル","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"住所","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"Eメール","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"名称","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"電話","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"銀行口座情報","ahd_inform_page1_button":"次に進む","alert_variant_demo_description":"このアラートコンポーネントのvariantはJavaScriptによって変更されています","alert_variant_explanation_text":"KatalコンポーネントはHTML要素の拡張であるため、JavaScriptは、組み込みのHTML要素と同じようにKatalコンポーネントとやり取りすることができます。ここでは、JavaScriptがアラートの「variant」属性を変更しています。","components_containing_html_text":"一部のコンポーネントには、HTMLコンテンツ（KatalTabsコンポーネントなど）を含めることができます。これらの複合コンポーネントはAPIを提供するため、開発者やフレームワークはこれらのコンポーネントとやり取りすることができます。","continue_button_label":"次へ","custom_elements_text":"Katalを使用すると、開発者は、独自にデザインされた要素を使用してウェブページを作成することができます。たとえば、ボタンが必要な場合、自分でボタンを作成する代わりに<kat-button></kat-button>を使用できます。","demo_complex_header_text":"デモ：Katalの複合コンポーネント","demo_components_header_text":"デモ：Katalコンポーネントの使用","demo_javascript_header_text":"デモ：Katalコンポーネントを使用したJavaScript","design_approved_text":"Katalは、ラベル付けやカスタム設定が可能な、ウェブページで使用するデザイン承認済みのコンポーネントを提供します。たとえば、「variant」属性だけが異なる通常のボタンとサブボタンを作成できます。","documentation_label":"Katalのドキュメント","greeting_description":"Katalのサンプルアプリケーションです。Katalコンポーネントの使用方法とビルド＆デプロイの手順を紹介します。ご不明な点やご意見がありましたら、Katalチーム（colombia-team@amazon.com）までご連絡ください。デモを続行するにはこのアラートを閉じてください。","greeting_description_mons_app":"Katalのサンプルアプリケーションです。Katalコンポーネントの使用方法を紹介します（字幕あり）。ご不明な点やご意見がありましたら、Katalチーム（katal-team@amazon.com）までご連絡ください。","greeting_header":"サンプルアプリ情報","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"フィードバックを送信","primary_button_label":"メインボタン","sample_app_page_title_text":"サンプルアプリケーション","secondary_button_label":"サブボタン","tab_demo_generated_text":"自動作成されたタブ{tabId}","tab_demo_name":"タブ名{tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"選択されたタブ","tab_demo_selected_text":"最初に選択されたタブのコンテンツ","tab_demo_text":"{tabId}タブのコンテンツ"}}}')},66576:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"kn":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"ಟ್ಯಾಬ್ ಸೇರಿಸಿ","ahd_cancel_button":"ಕ್ಯಾನ್ಸಲ್ ಮಾಡಿ","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"ವಿಳಾಸ","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"ಇಮೇಲ್","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"ಹೆಸರು","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"ಫೋನ್","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"ಬ್ಯಾಂಕ್ ಅಕೌಂಟ್ ಮಾಹಿತಿ","ahd_inform_page1_button":"ಮುಂದುವರೆಯಿರಿ","alert_variant_demo_description":"ಈ ಅಲರ್ಟ್ ಘಟಕವು JavaScript ನಿಂದ ಅದರ ರೂಪಾಂತರವನ್ನು ಬದಲಾಯಿಸುತ್ತಿದೆ","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Katal ಘಟಕಗಳು HTML ಅಂಶಗಳ ವಿಸ್ತರಣೆಗಳಾಗಿರುವುದರಿಂದ, ಅಂತರ್ನಿರ್ಮಿತ HTML ಅಂಶಗಳಂತೆಯೇ JavaScript ಅವರೊಂದಿಗೆ ಸಂವಹನ ನಡೆಸಬಹುದು. ಇಲ್ಲಿ ನಾವು JavaScript ಅಲರ್ಟ್ ನಲ್ಲಿ \'ರೂಪಾಂತರ\' ಗುಣಲಕ್ಷಣವನ್ನು ಬದಲಾಯಿಸುವುದನ್ನು ನೋಡುತ್ತೇವೆ.","components_containing_html_text":"ಕೆಲವು ಘಟಕಗಳು ನಮ್ಮ KatalTabs ಘಟಕದಂತೆ HTML ವಿಷಯವನ್ನು ಒಳಗೊಂಡಿರಬಹುದು. ಈ ಸಂಕೀರ್ಣ ಘಟಕಗಳು API ಅನ್ನು ಒದಗಿಸುತ್ತವೆ, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ಡೆವಲಪರ್‌ಗಳು ಮತ್ತು ಚೌಕಟ್ಟುಗಳು ಅವರೊಂದಿಗೆ ಸಂವಹನ ನಡೆಸಬಹುದು.","continue_button_label":"ಮುಂದುವರಿಯಿರಿ","custom_elements_text":"Katal ಡೆವಲಪರ್‌ರಿಗೆ ತಮ್ಮ ವೆಬ್ ಪುಟಗಳನ್ನು ನಿರ್ಮಿಸಲು ಕಸ್ಟಮ್-ವಿನ್ಯಾಸಗೊಳಿಸಿದ ಅಂಶಗಳನ್ನು ಬಳಸುವ ಸಾಮರ್ಥ್ಯವನ್ನು ನೀಡುತ್ತದೆ. ಉದಾಹರಣೆಗೆ, ಡೆವಲಪರ್‌ಗೆ ಬಟನ್ ಅಗತ್ಯವಿದ್ದರೆ, ಅವರು ಸ್ವತಃ ಬಟನ್ ಅನ್ನು ನಿರ್ಮಿಸುವ ಬದಲು <kat-button></kat-button> ಅನ್ನು ಬಳಸಬಹುದು.","demo_complex_header_text":"ಡೆಮೊನ್‌ಸ್ಟ್ರೇಶನ್: ಕಾಂಪ್ಲೆಕ್ಸ್ ಕಾರ್ಡ್ ಘಟಕಗಳು","demo_components_header_text":"ಡೆಮೊ: Katal ಘಟಕಗಳನ್ನು ಬಳಸುವುದು","demo_javascript_header_text":"ಡೆಮೊ: Katal ಘಟಕಗಳೊಂದಿಗೆ JavaScript","design_approved_text":"Katal ಲೇಬಲ್ ಗಳು ಮತ್ತು ಕಸ್ಟಮ್ ಸೆಟ್ಟಿಂಗ್ ಗಳೊಂದಿಗೆ ಕಾನ್ಫಿಗರ್ ಮಾಡಬಹುದಾದ ವೆಬ್ ಪುಟಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಬಳಕೆಗಾಗಿ ವಿನ್ಯಾಸ-ಅನುಮೋದಿತ ಘಟಕಗಳನ್ನು ನೀಡುತ್ತದೆ. ಉದಾಹರಣೆಗೆ: ನಿಯಮಿತ ಬಟನ್ ಗಳು ಮತ್ತು ಸೆಕೆಂಡರಿ ಬಟನ್ ಗಳು, ಅವುಗಳ \'ರೂಪಾಂತರ\' ಗುಣಲಕ್ಷಣದಲ್ಲಿ ಮಾತ್ರ ವಿಭಿನ್ನವಾಗಿವೆ.","documentation_label":"Katal ಡಾಕ್ಯುಮೆಂಟೇಶನ್","greeting_description":"ಇದು ಒಂದು ಮಾದರಿ Katal ಅಪ್ಲಿಕೇಶನ್, Katal ಘಟಕಗಳನ್ನು ಹೇಗೆ ಬಳಸುವುದು ಹಾಗು ಬಿಲ್ಡ್-ಮತ್ತು-ಡಿಪ್ಲಾಯ್ ಟೂಲಿಂಗ್ ಅನ್ನು ಹೇಗೆ ಬಳಸುವುದು ಎಂಬುದನ್ನು ತೋರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. Katal ತಂಡವನ್ನು ಸಂಪರ್ಕಿಸಿ colombia-team@amazon.com ಯಾವುದೇ ಪ್ರಶ್ನೆಗಳು ಅಥವಾ ಕಾಮೆಂಟ್ ಗಳೊಂದಿಗೆ. ಈ ಡೆಮೊ ಮುಂದುವರಿಸಲು, ಈ ಅಲರ್ಟ್ ಅನ್ನು ವಜಾಗೊಳಿಸಿ.","greeting_description_mons_app":"ಇದು ಒಂದು ಮಾದರಿ Katal ಅಪ್ಲಿಕೇಶನ್, Katal ಘಟಕಗಳನ್ನು ಅನುವಾದಗಳೊಂದಿಗೆ ಹೇಗೆ ಬಳಸುವುದು ಎಂಬುದನ್ನು ಇದು ತೋರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. Katal ತಂಡವನ್ನು ಸಂಪರ್ಕಿಸಿ katal-team@amazon.com ಯಾವುದೇ ಪ್ರಶ್ನೆಗಳು ಅಥವಾ ಕಾಮೆಂಟ್ ಗಳೊಂದಿಗೆ.","greeting_header":"ಮಾದರಿ ಅಪ್ಲಿಕೇಶನ್ ಮಾಹಿತಿ","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"ಫೀಡ್‌ಬ್ಯಾಕ್ ಕಳುಹಿಸಿ","primary_button_label":"ಪ್ರೈಮರಿ ಬಟನ್","sample_app_page_title_text":"ಮಾದರಿ ಅಪ್ಲಿಕೇಶನ್","secondary_button_label":"ಸೆಕೆಂಡರಿ ಬಟನ್","tab_demo_generated_text":"ಸ್ವಯಂ ರಚಿತವಾದ ಟ್ಯಾಬ್ {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"ಟ್ಯಾಬ್ ಹೆಸರು {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"ಆಯ್ಕೆಮಾಡಿದ ಟ್ಯಾಬ್","tab_demo_selected_text":"ಆರಂಭದಲ್ಲಿ ಆಯ್ಕೆಮಾಡಿದ ಟ್ಯಾಬ್ ಗಾಗಿ ವಿಷಯ","tab_demo_text":"ಟ್ಯಾಬ್ ಗಾಗಿ ವಿಷಯ {tabId}"}}}')},28896:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"ko":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"탭 추가","ahd_cancel_button":"취소","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"주소","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"이메일","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"이름","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"전화","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"은행 계좌 정보","ahd_inform_page1_button":"계속 진행","alert_variant_demo_description":"이 알림 구성 요소의 변형이 JavaScript에 의해 변경되었습니다.","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Katal 구성 요소가 HTML 요소의 확장이므로, JavaScript는 내장된 HTML 요소와 동일하게 Katal 구성 요소와 상호 작용할 수 있습니다. 여기에서 JavaScript가 알림의 \'변형\' 특성을 변경하는 것을 확인할 수 있습니다.","components_containing_html_text":"일부 구성 요소는 KatalTabs 구성 요소와 같은 HTML 콘텐츠를 포함할 수 있습니다. 이러한 복잡한 구성 요소는 개발자와 프레임워크가 상호 작용할 수 있도록 API를 제공합니다.","continue_button_label":"계속","custom_elements_text":"Katal은 개발자에게 사용자 지정 디자인 요소를 사용하여 웹 페이지를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. 예를 들어, 개발자가 버튼이 필요한 경우 직접 버튼을 생성하는 대신 <kat-button></kat-button> 버튼을 사용할 수 있습니다.","demo_complex_header_text":"데모: 복잡한 Katal 구성 요소","demo_components_header_text":"데모: Katal 구성 요소 사용","demo_javascript_header_text":"데모: Katal 구성 요소가 있는 JavaScript","design_approved_text":"Katal은 라벨 및 사용자 지정 설정으로 구성할 수 있는 웹 페이지에서 사용할 디자인 승인 구성 요소를 제공합니다. 예를 들어, 일반 버튼과 보조 버튼은 \'변형\' 특성에서만 다릅니다.","documentation_label":"Katal 문서","greeting_description":"이는 Katal 구성 요소와 생성 및 배포 도구를 사용하는 방법을 보여주는 샘플 Katal 애플리케이션입니다. 질문이나 의견이 있는 경우 Katal 팀에 이메일(colombia-team@amazon.com)을 보내 문의하십시오. 이 데모를 계속 진행하려면 해당 알림을 해제하십시오.","greeting_description_mons_app":"이는 번역과 함께 Katal 구성 요소를 사용하는 방법을 보여주는 샘플 Katal 애플리케이션입니다. 질문이나 의견이 있는 경우 Katal 팀에 이메일(katal-team@amazon.com)을 보내 문의하십시오.","greeting_header":"샘플 앱 정보","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"피드백 보내기","primary_button_label":"기본 버튼","sample_app_page_title_text":"샘플 애플리케이션","secondary_button_label":"보조 버튼","tab_demo_generated_text":"자동 생성 탭 {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"탭 이름 {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"선택한 탭","tab_demo_selected_text":"처음에 선택한 탭의 콘텐츠","tab_demo_text":"탭 {tabId}에 대한 콘텐츠"}}}')},40349:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"ml":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"ടാബ് ചേർക്കുക","ahd_cancel_button":"റദ്ദാക്കുക","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"വിലാസം","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"ഇ-മെയിൽ","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"പേര്","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"ഫോൺ","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"ബാങ്ക് അക്കൗണ്ട് വിവരങ്ങൾ","ahd_inform_page1_button":"തുടരുക","alert_variant_demo_description":"JavaScript വഴി ഈ അലേർട്ട് ഘടകം അതിന്‍റെ വേരിയന്റ് മാറ്റുന്നു","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Katal ഘടകങ്ങൾ HTML ഘടകങ്ങളുടെ വിപുലീകരണങ്ങളായതിനാൽ, HTML അന്തർനിർമ്മിത ഘടകങ്ങളെപ്പോലെ തന്നെ JavaScript-ന് അവയുമായി സംവദിക്കാൻ കഴിയും. JavaScript അലേർട്ട് \'വേരിയൻറ്\' ആട്രിബ്യൂട്ട് മാറ്റുന്നത് നമുക്ക് ഇവിടെ കാണാം.","components_containing_html_text":"ചില ഘടകങ്ങളിൽ നമ്മുടെ KatalTabs ഘടകം പോലെ തന്നെ HTML ഉള്ളടക്കവും അടങ്ങിയിരിക്കാം. ഈ സങ്കീർണ്ണ ഘടകങ്ങൾ ഒരു API നൽകുന്നതിനാൽ ഡെവലപ്പർമാർക്കും ഫ്രെയിംവർക്കുകൾക്കും അവയുമായി സംവദിക്കാൻ കഴിയും.","continue_button_label":"തുടരുക","custom_elements_text":"ഡെവലപ്പർമാർക്ക് അവരുടെ വെബ് പേജുകൾ നിർമ്മിക്കുന്നതിന് ഇഷ്ടാനുസൃതമായി രൂപകൽപ്പന ചെയ്ത ഘടകങ്ങൾ ഉപയോഗിക്കാനുള്ള കഴിവ് Katal നൽകുന്നു. ഉദാഹരണത്തിന് ഡെവലപ്പർക്ക് ഒരു ബട്ടൺ ആവശ്യമാണെങ്കിൽ, ഒരു ബട്ടൺ സ്വയം നിർമ്മിക്കുന്നതിന് പകരം അവർക്ക് <kat-button></kat-button> ഉപയോഗിക്കാം.","demo_complex_header_text":"അവതരണം: സങ്കീർണ്ണമായ Katal ഘടകങ്ങൾ","demo_components_header_text":"അവതരണം: സങ്കീർണ്ണമായ Katal ഉപയോഗിച്ച്","demo_javascript_header_text":"അവതരണം: Katal ഘടകങ്ങളുള്ള JavaScript","design_approved_text":"ലേബലുകളും ഇഷ്‌ടാനുസൃത ക്രമീകരണങ്ങളും ഉപയോഗിച്ച് ക്രമീകരിക്കാൻ കഴിയുന്ന വെബ് പേജുകളില്‍ ഉപയോഗിക്കുന്നതിനായി അംഗീകരിച്ച ഡിസൈൻ ഘടകങ്ങൾ Katal വാഗ്ദാനം ചെയ്യുന്നു. ഉദാഹരണത്തിന്: പതിവ് ബട്ടണുകളും ദ്വിതീയ ബട്ടണുകളും അവയുടെ \'വേരിയൻറ്\' ആട്രിബ്യൂട്ടിൽ മാത്രം വ്യത്യാസപ്പെട്ടിരിക്കുന്നു.","documentation_label":"Katal ഡോക്യുമെന്റേഷൻ","greeting_description":"Katal ഘടകങ്ങൾ എങ്ങനെ ഉപയോഗിക്കാമെന്നും അതുപോലെ തന്നെ നിര്‍മാണ-വിന്യാസ ഉപകരണങ്ങളും കാണിക്കുന്ന ഒരു സാമ്പിൾ Katal ആപ്ലിക്കേഷനാണ് ഇത്. എന്തെങ്കിലും ചോദ്യങ്ങളോ അഭിപ്രായങ്ങളോ ഉണ്ടെങ്കില്‍ Katal ടീമിനെ colombia-team@amazon.com എന്ന അഡ്രസില്‍ ബന്ധപ്പെടുക. ഈ ഡെമോ തുടരുന്നതിനായി ദയവായി ഈ അലേർട്ട് ഒഴിവാക്കുക.","greeting_description_mons_app":"വിവർത്തനങ്ങളോടെ Katal ഘടകങ്ങൾ എങ്ങനെ ഉപയോഗിക്കാമെന്ന് കാണിക്കുന്ന ഒരു സാമ്പിൾ Katal ആപ്ലിക്കേഷനാണിത്. എന്തെങ്കിലും ചോദ്യങ്ങളോ അഭിപ്രായങ്ങളോ ഉണ്ടെങ്കില്‍ Katal ടീമിനെ katal-team@amazon.com എന്ന വിലാസത്തിൽ ബന്ധപ്പെടുക.","greeting_header":"സാമ്പിൾ ആപ്ലിക്കേഷൻ വിവരങ്ങൾ","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"ഫീഡ്ബാക്ക് അയയ്ക്കുക","primary_button_label":"പ്രഥമ ബട്ടൺ","sample_app_page_title_text":"സാമ്പിൾ ആപ്ലിക്കേഷൻ","secondary_button_label":"ദ്വിതീയ ബട്ടൺ","tab_demo_generated_text":"സ്വയം സൃഷ്ടിക്കപ്പെട്ട ടാബ് {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"ടാബിന്റെ പേര് {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"തിരഞ്ഞെടുത്ത ടാബ്","tab_demo_selected_text":"തുടക്കത്തിൽ തിരഞ്ഞെടുത്ത ടാബിലുള്ള ഉള്ളടക്കം","tab_demo_text":"{tabId} എന്ന ടാബിൻ്റെ ഉള്ളടക്കം"}}}')},8002:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"mr":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"टॅब अ‍ॅड करा","ahd_cancel_button":"रद्द करा","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"पत्ता","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"ईमेल","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"नाव","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"फोन","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"बँक अकाउंट माहिती","ahd_inform_page1_button":"पुढे सुरू ठेवा","alert_variant_demo_description":"हा अलर्ट कम्पोनंट JavaScript द्वारे त्याचे व्हेरिएन्ट बदलत आहे","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Katal कम्पोनंट हे HTML घटकांचे एक्सटेंशन असल्यामुळे, JavaScript त्यांच्याशी बिल्ट-इन HTML घटकांप्रमाणेच इंटरॲक्ट करू शकते. येथे आपण JavaScript अलर्टवर \'व्हेरिएंट\' गुणविशेष बदलत असल्याचे पाहतो.","components_containing_html_text":"काही कम्पोनंटमध्ये आमच्या KatalTabs कम्पोनंटप्रमाणेच HTML कन्टेंट असू शकते. हे जटिल कम्पोनंट API प्रदान करतात जेणेकरुन विकसक आणि फ्रेमवर्क त्यांच्याशी योग्य मेळ साधू शकतील.","continue_button_label":"पुढे सुरू ठेवा","custom_elements_text":"Katal विकसकांना त्यांची वेब पृष्ठे तयार करण्यासाठी कस्टमाइझ म्हणजेच सानुकूल-डिझाइन केलेले घटक वापरण्याची क्षमता देते. उदाहरणार्थ, डेव्हलपरला एखाद्या बटणाची आवश्यकता असल्यास, ते स्वतः बटण तयार करण्याऐवजी <kat-button></kat-button> चा वापर करू शकतात.","demo_complex_header_text":"प्रात्यक्षिक: कॉम्प्लेक्स Katal कम्पोनंट","demo_components_header_text":"प्रात्यक्षिक: Katal कम्पोनंट वापरणे","demo_javascript_header_text":"प्रात्यक्षिक: Katal कम्पोनंटसह JavaScript","design_approved_text":"Katal वेबपृष्ठांमध्ये वापरण्यासाठी डिझाइन-मंजूर केलेले कम्पोनंट ऑफर करतात जे लेबल आणि सानुकूल सेटिंग्जसह कॉन्फिगर केले जाऊ शकतात. उदाहरणार्थ: नियमित बटणे आणि दुय्यम बटणे, केवळ त्यांच्या \'व्हेरिएंट\' गुणविशेषांमध्ये भिन्न.","documentation_label":"Katal दस्तऐवजीकरण","greeting_description":"Katal कम्पोनंटस तसेच बिल्ड-अँड-डिप्लॉय टूलिंग कसे वापरावे हे दर्शविणारे हे एक नमुना Katal अ‍ॅप्लिकेशन आहे. कृपया कोणत्याही प्रश्न किंवा टिप्पणीसाठी colombia-team@amazon.com या इमेल पत्त्यावर Katal टीमशी संपर्क साधा. हा डेमो सुरू ठेवण्यासाठी, कृपया हा अलर्ट काढून टाका.","greeting_description_mons_app":"अनुवादासह Katal कम्पोनंटस कसे वापरावे हे दर्शविणारे हे एक नमुना Katal अ‍ॅप्लिकेशन आहे. कृपया कोणत्याही प्रश्न किंवा टिप्पणीसाठी katal-team@amazon.com या इमेल पत्त्यावर Katal टीमशी संपर्क साधा.","greeting_header":"नमुना अ‍ॅपची माहिती","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"फीडबॅक पाठवा","primary_button_label":"प्राथमिक बटण","sample_app_page_title_text":"नमुना अ‍ॅप्लिकेशन","secondary_button_label":"दुय्यम बटण","tab_demo_generated_text":"आपोआप जनरेट झालेला टॅब {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"टॅबचे नाव {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"निवडलेले टॅब","tab_demo_selected_text":"प्रारंभी निवडलेल्या टॅबसाठी कन्टेंट","tab_demo_text":"टॅब {tabId} साठी कन्टेंट"}}}')},81294:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"nl":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"Tabblad toevoegen","ahd_cancel_button":"Annuleren","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"Adres","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"Naam","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"Telefoon","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"Bankrekeninggegevens","ahd_inform_page1_button":"Doorgaan","continue_button_label":"Doorgaan","demo_components_header_text":"Demonstratie: Katal-componenten gebruiken","demo_javascript_header_text":"Demonstratie: JavaScript met Katal-componenten","documentation_label":"Katal-documentatie","greeting_header":"Voorbeeldapp-informatie","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Feedback versturen","primary_button_label":"Primaire knop","sample_app_page_title_text":"Voorbeeld van toepassing","secondary_button_label":"Secundaire knop","tab_demo_generated_text":"Automatisch gegenereerd tabblad {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Geselecteerd tabblad","tab_demo_selected_text":"Inhoud voor het oorspronkelijk geselecteerde tabblad","tab_demo_text":"Inhoud voor tabblad {tabId}"}},"nl-BE":{"pages.homepage":{"ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"E-mailadres","alert_variant_demo_description":"De variant van dit waarschuwingsonderdeel wordt gewijzigd door JavaScript","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Omdat Katal-componenten extensies zijn van HTML-elementen, kan JavaScript er op dezelfde manier mee werken als met ingebouwde HTML-elementen. Hier zien we dat JavaScript het kenmerk \'variant\' van de waarschuwing wijzigt.","components_containing_html_text":"Sommige componenten kunnen HTML-content bevatten, zoals onze KatalTabs-component. Deze complexe componenten bieden een API zodat ontwikkelaars en kaderwerken ermee kunnen communiceren.","custom_elements_text":"Katal geeft ontwikkelaars de mogelijkheid om op maat gemaakte elementen te gebruiken om hun webpagina\'s te maken. Als de ontwikkelaar bijvoorbeeld een knop nodig heeft, kan deze deze gebruiken <kat-button></kat-button> in plaats van zelf een knop te maken.","demo_complex_header_text":"Demonstratie: complexe Katal-componenten","design_approved_text":"Katal biedt componenten die goedgekeurd zijn voor ontwerpen voor gebruik op webpagina\'s die kunnen worden geconfigureerd met etiketten en aangepaste instellingen. Bijvoorbeeld: gewone knoppen en secundaire knoppen, verschillen alleen in hun kenmerk \'variant\'.","greeting_description":"Dit is een voorbeeld van een Katal-toepassing die laat zien hoe je Katal-componenten en tools voor het bouwen en implementeren van gereedschappen kan gebruiken. Neem contact op met het Katal-team op colombia-team@amazon.com voor vragen of opmerkingen. Verwijder deze waarschuwing om door te gaan met deze \'demo.","greeting_description_mons_app":"Dit is een voorbeeld van Katal-toepassing die laat zien hoe je Katal-componenten kunt gebruiken met vertalingen. Neem contact op met het Katal-team op katal-team@amazon.com voor vragen of opmerkingen.","tab_demo_name":"Tabbladnaam {tabId}"}},"nl-NL":{"pages.homepage":{"ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"E-mail","alert_variant_demo_description":"De variant van dit waarschuwingscomponent wordt gewijzigd door JavaScript","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Omdat Katal-componenten extensies zijn van HTML-elementen, kan JavaScript op dezelfde manier met deze samenwerken als ingebouwde HTML-elementen. Hier zien we JavaScript het kenmerk \'variant\' in de waarschuwing veranderen.","components_containing_html_text":"Sommige componenten kunnen HTML-inhoud bevatten, zoals onze KatalTabs-component. Deze complexe componenten bieden een API zodat ontwikkelaars en frameworks ermee kunnen communiceren.","custom_elements_text":"Katal geeft ontwikkelaars de mogelijkheid om op maat gemaakte elementen te gebruiken om hun webpagina\'s te maken. Als de ontwikkelaar bijvoorbeeld een knop nodig heeft, kan deze <kat-button></kat-button> gebruiken in plaats van zelf een knop te maken.","demo_complex_header_text":"Demonstratie: Complexe Katal-componenten","design_approved_text":"Katal biedt componenten waarvan het ontwerp is goedgekeurd voor gebruik op webpagina\'s die kunnen worden geconfigureerd met etiketten en aangepaste instellingen. Bijvoorbeeld: gewone knoppen en secundaire knoppen, verschillen alleen in hun kenmerk \'variant\'.","greeting_description":"Dit is een voorbeeld van een Katal-toepassing, die laat zien hoe je Katal-componenten kunt gebruiken en ook de bouw-en-implementeer-tooling. Neem contact op met het Katal-team op colombia-team@amazon.com voor vragen of opmerkingen. Sluit deze waarschuwing om door te gaan met de demonstratie.","greeting_description_mons_app":"Dit is een voorbeeld van Katal-toepassing, die laat zien hoe je Katal-componenten kunt gebruiken met vertalingen. Neem contact op met het Katal-team op katal-team@amazon.com voor vragen of opmerkingen.","tab_demo_name":"Naam van tabblad {tabId}"}}}')},2089:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"pl":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"Dodaj kartę","ahd_cancel_button":"Anuluj","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"Adres","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"E-mail","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"Nazwa","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"Telefon","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"Informacje o rachunku bankowym","ahd_inform_page1_button":"Kontynuuj","alert_variant_demo_description":"Wartość atrybutu „variant” ostrzeżenia jest zmieniana przez JavaScript","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Ponieważ komponenty Katal Components są rozszerzeniami elementów HTML, JavaScript może wchodzić z nimi w interakcje tak samo jak z wbudowanymi elementami HTML. Tutaj widzimy, jak JavaScript zmienia atrybut „variant” w ostrzeżeniu.","components_containing_html_text":"Niektóre komponenty mogą zawierać treść HTML. Jest tak na przykład w przypadku komponentu KatalTabs. Są to złożone komponenty z interfejsem API, dzięki któremu programiści i platformy mogą wchodzić z nimi w interakcje.","continue_button_label":"Kontynuuj","custom_elements_text":"Katal umożliwia programistom wykorzystywanie niestandardowych elementów do budowy stron internetowych. Na przykład, jeśli programista potrzebuje przycisku, zamiast tworzyć go samodzielnie, może użyć <kat-button></kat-button>.","demo_complex_header_text":"Demo: Złożone komponenty Katal Components","demo_components_header_text":"Demo: Korzystanie z komponentów Katal Components","demo_javascript_header_text":"Demo: JavaScript z komponentami Katal Components","design_approved_text":"Katal oferuje sprawdzone komponenty przeznaczone do użytku na stronach internetowych. Możesz je konfigurować za pomocą etykiet i niestandardowych ustawień. Przykład: przyciski zwykłe i przyciski pomocnicze różniące się tylko wartością atrybutu „variant”.","documentation_label":"Dokumentacja Katal","greeting_description":"Oto przykład zastosowania Katal, w którym zaprezentowano, jak używać komponentów Katal Components oraz narzędzi do budowania i wdrażania. W razie pytań lub uwag skontaktuj się z zespołem Katal, pisząc na adres: colombia-team@amazon.com. Aby nie zamykać demo, odrzuć to ostrzeżenie.","greeting_description_mons_app":"Oto przykład zastosowania Katal, w którym zaprezentowano, jak używać komponentów Katal Components z tłumaczeniami. W razie pytań lub uwag skontaktuj się z zespołem Katal, pisząc na adres: katal-team@amazon.com.","greeting_header":"Informacje o przykładowej aplikacji","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Prześlij opinię","primary_button_label":"Przycisk podstawowy","sample_app_page_title_text":"Przykładowe zastosowanie","secondary_button_label":"Przycisk pomocniczy","tab_demo_generated_text":"Automatycznie wygenerowana karta {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"Nazwa karty {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Wybrana karta","tab_demo_selected_text":"Treści do początkowo wybranej karty","tab_demo_text":"Treści do karty {tabId}"}}}')},89353:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"pt":{"pages.homepage":{"ahd_cancel_button":"Cancelar","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"Endereço","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"E-mail","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"Nome","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"Telefone","ahd_inform_page1_button":"Continuar","continue_button_label":"Continuar","demo_complex_header_text":"Demonstração: componentes Katal complexos","demo_javascript_header_text":"Demonstração: JavaScript com componentes Katal","documentation_label":"Documentação do Katal","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Enviar comentários","secondary_button_label":"Botão secundário"}},"pt-BR":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"Adicionar guia","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"Dados bancários","alert_variant_demo_description":"O JavaScript está alterando a variante deste componente de alerta","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Como os componentes Katal são extensões de elementos HTML, o JavaScript pode interagir com eles da mesma forma que elementos HTML incorporados. Aqui, vemos o JavaScript alterando o atributo “variant” no alerta.","components_containing_html_text":"Alguns componentes podem incluir conteúdo HTML, como o componente KatalTabs. Esses componentes complexos fornecem uma API para que os desenvolvedores e as estruturas possam interagir com eles.","custom_elements_text":"O Katal oferece aos desenvolvedores a capacidade de usar elementos personalizados para criar suas páginas da Web. Por exemplo, se o desenvolvedor precisa de um botão, ele pode usar <kat-button></kat-button> em vez de criar um botão por conta própria.","demo_components_header_text":"Demonstração: usando componentes Katal","design_approved_text":"O Katal oferece componentes aprovados por projeto para uso em páginas da Web que podem ser configuradas com etiquetas e configurações personalizadas. Por exemplo: botões normais e botões secundários, diferentes apenas no atributo \\"variant\\".","greeting_description":"Este é um exemplo de aplicativo Katal, que demonstra como usar Componentes Katal, bem como ferramentas de compilação e implantação. Se tiver dúvidas ou comentários, entre em contato com a equipe do Katal pelo e-mail colombia-team@amazon.com. Para continuar com esta versão, descarte este alerta.","greeting_description_mons_app":"Este é um exemplo do aplicativo Katal, que demonstra como usar componentes Katal com traduções. Se tiver dúvidas ou comentários, entre em contato com a equipe do Katal pelo e-mail katal-team@amazon.com.","greeting_header":"Informações do aplicativo de amostra","primary_button_label":"Botão primário","sample_app_page_title_text":"Exemplo de inscrição","tab_demo_generated_text":"Guia gerada automaticamente {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"Nome da guia {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Guia selecionada","tab_demo_selected_text":"Conteúdo da guia inicialmente selecionada","tab_demo_text":"Conteúdo da guia {tabId}"}},"pt-PT":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"Adicionar separador","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"Informação sobre as contas bancárias","alert_variant_demo_description":"A variante deste componente de alerta é alterada pelo JavaScript","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Dado que os componentes Katal são extensões de elementos HTML, o JavaScript pode interagir com eles da mesma forma que os elementos HTML integrados. Aqui vemos o JavaScript a alterar o atributo \'variant\' no alerta.","components_containing_html_text":"Alguns componentes podem conter conteúdo HTML, como o nosso componente KatalTabs. Estes componentes complexos fornecem uma API para que os programadores e as estruturas possam interagir com eles.","custom_elements_text":"O Katal oferece aos programadores a possibilidade de usarem elementos personalizados para construírem as suas páginas Web. Por exemplo, se o programador precisar de um botão, poderá usar <kat-button></kat-button> em vez de criar um botão.","demo_components_header_text":"Demonstração: utilizar componentes Katal","design_approved_text":"O Katal oferece componentes com design aprovado para uso em páginas Web que podem ser configuradas com etiquetas e definições personalizadas. Por exemplo: botões normais e botões secundários, diferentes apenas no atributo \'variant\'.","greeting_description":"Esta é uma aplicação Katal de exemplo, que demonstra como usar componentes Katal, bem como ferramentas de construção e implementação. Contacte a equipa do Katal através do endereço colombia-team@amazon.com para qualquer dúvida ou comentário. Para continuar esta demonstração, rejeite este alerta.","greeting_description_mons_app":"Esta é uma aplicação Katal de exemplo, que demonstra como usar componentes Katal com traduções. Contacte a equipa do Katal através do endereço katal-team@amazon.com para qualquer dúvida ou comentário.","greeting_header":"Informações da app de exemplo","primary_button_label":"Botão principal","sample_app_page_title_text":"Aplicação de exemplo","tab_demo_generated_text":"Separador gerado automaticamente {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"Nome do separador {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Separador selecionado","tab_demo_selected_text":"Conteúdo para o separador inicialmente selecionado","tab_demo_text":"Conteúdo para separador {tabId}"}}}')},40710:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"sv":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"Lägg till flik","ahd_cancel_button":"Avbryt","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"Adress","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"E-post","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"Namn","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"Telefon","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"Information om bankkonto","ahd_inform_page1_button":"Fortsätt","alert_variant_demo_description":"Den här varningskomponentens variant ändras av JavaScript","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Eftersom Katal-komponenter är tillägg av HTML-element kan JavaScript interagera med dem på samma sätt som med inbyggda HTML-element. Här ser vi hur JavaScript ändrar attributet ”variant” i varningen.","components_containing_html_text":"Vissa komponenter kan ha HTML-innehåll, till exempel KatalTabs-komponenten. De här komplexa komponenterna tillhandahåller ett API så att utvecklare och ramverk kan interagera med dem.","continue_button_label":"Fortsätt","custom_elements_text":"Med Katal kan utvecklare skapa sina webbplatser med specialdesignade element. Om utvecklaren till exempel behöver en knapp kan de använda <kat-button></kat-button> i stället för att själva skapa en knapp.","demo_complex_header_text":"Demonstration: komplexa Katal-komponenter","demo_components_header_text":"Demonstration: använda Katal-komponenter","demo_javascript_header_text":"Demonstration: JavaScript med Katal-komponenter","design_approved_text":"Katal erbjuder designgodkända komponenter för webbplatser som kan konfigureras med etiketter och anpassade inställningar. Exempelvis: vanliga knappar och sekundära knappar som endast skiljer sig åt i attributet ”variant”.","documentation_label":"Dokumentation om Katal","greeting_description":"Det här är ett exempel på ett Katal-program som visar hur Katal-komponenter samt verktyg för att bygga och distribuera används. Kontakta Katal-teamet på colombia-team@amazon.com om du har några frågor eller kommentarer. Avfärda varningen för att fortsätta med demonstrationen.","greeting_description_mons_app":"Det här är ett exempel på ett Katal-program som visar hur Katal-komponenter används vid översättningar. Kontakta Katal-teamet på katal-team@amazon.com om du har några frågor eller kommentarer.","greeting_header":"Information om testapplikation","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Skicka feedback","primary_button_label":"Primär knapp","sample_app_page_title_text":"Testapplikation","secondary_button_label":"Sekundär knapp","tab_demo_generated_text":"Automatiskt genererad flik {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"Namn på flik {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Vald flik","tab_demo_selected_text":"Innehåll för initialt vald flik","tab_demo_text":"Innehåll för flik {tabId}"}}}')},63997:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"ta":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"டேபைச் சேர்","ahd_cancel_button":"கேன்சல் செய்யவும்","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"முகவரி","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"இமெயில்","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"பெயர்","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"தொலைபேசி","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"பேங்க் அக்கவுண்ட் தகவல்","ahd_inform_page1_button":"தொடரவும்","alert_variant_demo_description":"இந்த அலெர்ட் காம்ப்போனென்ட் அதன் மாறுபாட்டை JavaScript மூலம் மாற்றுகிறது","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Katal காம்ப்போனென்ட்கள் என்பவை HTML கூறுகளின் நீட்டிப்புகள் என்பதால், JavaScript அவற்றுடன் உள்ளமைக்கப்பட்ட HTML கூறுகளைப் போலவே தொடர்பு கொள்ளலாம். அலெர்ட்டில் JavaScript \'வேரியன்ட்\' அட்ரிபியூட்டை மாற்றுவதை இங்கே காண்கிறோம்.","components_containing_html_text":"சில காம்ப்போனென்ட்கள் எங்கள் KatalTabs காம்ப்போனென்ட் போன்ற HTML உள்ளடக்கத்தைக் கொண்டிருக்கலாம். இந்தச் சிக்கலான காம்ப்போனென்ட்கள் API ஐ வழங்குவதால் டெவலப்பர்கள் மற்றும் கட்டமைப்புகள் இவற்றுடன் தொடர்பு கொள்ள முடியும்.","continue_button_label":"தொடர்க","custom_elements_text":"Katal ஆனது டெவலப்பர்களுக்கு அவர்களின் வலைப்பக்கங்களை உருவாக்க கஸ்டம் டிசைன் செய்யப்பட்ட கூறுகளைப் பயன்படுத்துவதற்கான திறனை வழங்குகிறது. எடுத்துக்காட்டாக, டெவலப்பருக்கு ஒரு பட்டன் தேவைப்பட்டால், அவர்களே ஒரு பட்டனை உருவாக்குவதற்குப் பதிலாக <kat-button></kat-button> ஐப் பயன்படுத்தலாம்.","demo_complex_header_text":"செயல் விளக்கம்: சிக்கலான Katal காம்ப்போனென்ட்கள்","demo_components_header_text":"செயல் விளக்கம்: Katal காம்ப்போனென்ட்களைப் பயன்படுத்துதல்","demo_javascript_header_text":"செயல் விளக்கம்: Katal காம்ப்போனென்ட்களுடன் JavaScript","design_approved_text":"லேபிள்கள் மற்றும் கஸ்டம் செட்டிங்குகளுடன் கட்டமைக்கக்கூடிய வலைப்பக்கங்களில் பயன்படுத்துவதற்கு டிசைன் அப்ரூவ் செய்யப்பட்ட காம்ப்போனென்ட்களை Katal வழங்குகிறது. எடுத்துக்காட்டாக: வழக்கமான பட்டன்கள் மற்றும் செகண்டரி பட்டன்கள், அவற்றின் \'வேரியன்ட்\' அட்ரிபியூட்டில் மட்டுமே வேறுபடுகின்றன.","documentation_label":"Katal ஆவணங்கள்","greeting_description":"இது ஒரு மாதிரி Katal அப்ளிகேஷன் ஆகும், இது Katal காம்ப்போனென்ட்களை எப்படிப் பயன்படுத்துவது மற்றும் டூலிங்கை எப்படி உருவாக்குவது மற்றும் பயன்படுத்துவது என்பதை விளக்குகிறது. ஏதேனும் கேள்விகள் அல்லது கருத்துகள் இருந்தால் Katal குழுவை colombia-team@amazon.com என்ற முகவரியில் தொடர்புகொள்ளவும். இந்த டெமோவைத் தொடர, இந்த அலெர்ட்டை நிராகரிக்கவும்.","greeting_description_mons_app":"இது ஒரு மாதிரி Katal அப்ளிகேஷன் ஆகும், இது மொழிபெயர்ப்புகளுடன் Katal காம்ப்போனென்ட்களை எவ்வாறு பயன்படுத்துவது என்பதை விளக்குகிறது. ஏதேனும் கேள்விகள் அல்லது கருத்துகள் இருந்தால் katal-team@amazon.com முகவரியில் Katal குழுவைத் தொடர்பு கொள்ளவும்.","greeting_header":"மாதிரி ஆப் தகவல்","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"ஃபீட்பேக்கை அனுப்பவும்","primary_button_label":"பிரைமரி பட்டன்","sample_app_page_title_text":"மாதிரி அப்ளிகேஷன்","secondary_button_label":"செகண்டரி பட்டன்","tab_demo_generated_text":"தானாக ஜெனரேட் செய்யப்பட்ட டேப் {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"டேபின் பெயர் {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட டேப்","tab_demo_selected_text":"ஆரம்பத்தில் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட டேபிற்கான உள்ளடக்கம்","tab_demo_text":"டேபிற்கான உள்ளடக்கம் {tabId}"}}}')},45661:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"te":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"ట్యాబ్‌ను జోడించండి","ahd_cancel_button":"రద్దు చేయి","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"చిరునామా","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"ఇ-మెయిల్‌","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"పేరు","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"ఫోన్","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"బ్యాంక్ అకౌంట్ సమాచారం","ahd_inform_page1_button":"కొనసాగండి","alert_variant_demo_description":"ఈ అలర్ట్‌ కాంపొనెంట్‌లో ఉన్న దాని వేరియంట్ JavaScript ద్వారా మార్చబడింది","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Katal కాంపొనెంట్‌లు అనేవి HTML ఎలిమెంట్‌ల ఎక్స్‌టెన్షన్‌లు అయినందున, అంతర్నిర్మిత HTML ఎలిమెంట్‌ల లాగానే అదే రీతిలో JavaScript వాటితో ఇంటరాక్ట్ అవుతుంది. ఇక్కడ మనం JavaScript అలర్ట్‌లో \'వేరియంట్\' వివరాన్ని మార్చడం చూస్తాము.","components_containing_html_text":"కొన్ని కాంపొనెంట్‌లు మా KatalTabs కాంపొనెంట్‌ వంటి, HTML కంటెంట్‌ను కలిగి ఉండవచ్చు. ఈ కాంప్లెక్స్ కాంపొనెంట్‌లు APIని అందిస్తాయి కనుక డెవలపర్‌లు మరియు ఫ్రేమ్‌వర్క్‌లు వాటితో ఇంటరాక్ట్ కావచ్చు.","continue_button_label":"కొనసాగించండి","custom_elements_text":"డెవలపర్‌లు వారి వెబ్ పేజీలను బిల్డ్ చేసుకోవడానికి Katal వారికి అనుకూల రీతిలో డిజైన్ చేసిన ఎలిమెంట్‌లను ఉపయోగించే సామర్థ్యాన్ని అందిస్తుంది. ఉదాహరణకు, డెవలపర్‌లకు బటన్ అవసరం అయితే, వారు తమకు తాము బటన్‌ను డెవలప్ చేసుకోవడానికి బదులుగా <kat-button></kat-button>ని ఉపయోగించవచ్చు.","demo_complex_header_text":"ప్రదర్శన: కాంప్లెక్స్ కాటల్ కాంపొనెంట్‌లు","demo_components_header_text":"ప్రదర్శన: కాటల్ కాంపొనెంట్‌లను ఉపయోగించడం","demo_javascript_header_text":"ప్రదర్శన: కాటల్ కాంపొనెంట్‌లతో JavaScript","design_approved_text":"లేబుల్‌లు మరియు కస్టమ్ సెట్టింగ్‌లతో కాన్ఫిగర్ చేయగలిగే వెబ్ పేజీలలో ఉపయోగించడం కోసం డిజైన్ ఆమోదం పొందిన కాంపొనెంట్‌లను Katal అందిస్తుంది. ఉదాహరణకు: సాధారణ బటన్‌లు మరియు ద్వితీయ బటన్‌లు, వాటి \'వేరియంట్\' వివరంలో మాత్రమే భిన్నంగా ఉంటాయి.","documentation_label":"Katal డాక్యుమెంటేషన్","greeting_description":"ఇది ఒక శాంపిల్ Katal అప్లికేషన్, ఇది Katal కాంపొనెంట్‌లు అలాగే బిల్డ్ మరియు డెప్లాయ్ టూల్‌ను ఎలా ఉపయోగించాలో చూపుతుంది. ఏవైనా ప్రశ్నలు లేదా కామెంట్‌లు ఉంటే, colombia-team@amazon.com చిరునామా ద్వారా Katal టీమ్‌ని సంప్రదించండి. ఈ డెమోను కొనసాగించడానికి, ఈ అలర్ట్‌ను విస్మరించండి.","greeting_description_mons_app":"అనువాదాలతో కాటల్ కాంపొనెంట్‌లను ఎలా ఉపయోగించాలో ప్రదర్శించే ఒక శాంపిల్ కాటల్ అప్లికేషన్ ఇది. ఏవైనా ప్రశ్నలు లేదా కామెంట్‌లతో katal-team@amazon.com చిరునామాతో కాటల్ టీమ్‌ని సంప్రదించండి.","greeting_header":"శాంపిల్ యాప్ సమాచారం","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"ఫీడ్‌బ్యాక్‌ను పంపండి","primary_button_label":"ప్రాథమిక బటన్","sample_app_page_title_text":"శాంపిల్ అప్లికేషన్","secondary_button_label":"సెకండరీ బటన్","tab_demo_generated_text":"ఆటో జెనరేటెడ్ ట్యాబ్ {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"ట్యాబ్ పేరు {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"ఎంచుకున్న ట్యాబ్","tab_demo_selected_text":"ప్రారంభంలో ఎంచుకున్న ట్యాబ్ కోసం కంటెంట్","tab_demo_text":"{tabId} ట్యాబ్ కోసం కంటెంట్"}}}')},25374:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"th":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"เพิ่มแท็บ","ahd_cancel_button":"ยกเลิก","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"ที่อยู่","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"อีเมล","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"ชื่อ","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"โทรศัพท์","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"ข้อมูลบัญชีธนาคาร","ahd_inform_page1_button":"ดำเนินการต่อ","alert_variant_demo_description":"องค์ประกอบการแจ้งเตือนนี้มีตัวแปรที่เปลี่ยนแปลงด้วย JavaScript","alert_variant_explanation_text":"เนื่องจาก Katal Components เป็นส่วนขยายขององค์ประกอบ HTML, JavaScript จึงสามารถโต้ตอบกับ Katal Components ได้เช่นเดียวกับองค์ประกอบ HTML ในตัว ในที่นี้เราจะเห็น JavaScript เปลี่ยนแปลงคุณสมบัติ \\"ตัวแปร\\" ในการแจ้งเตือน","components_containing_html_text":"องค์ประกอบบางรายการอาจมีเนื้อหา HTML เช่น องค์ประกอบ KatalTabs ของเรา องค์ประกอบที่ซับซ้อนเหล่านี้จัดหา API เพื่อให้นักพัฒนาและเฟรมเวิร์กสามารถโต้ตอบกับองค์ประกอบได้","continue_button_label":"ดำเนินการต่อ","custom_elements_text":"Katal ให้นักพัฒนาสามารถใช้องค์ประกอบที่ออกแบบเองเพื่อสร้างหน้าเว็บของตน ตัวอย่างเช่น หากนักพัฒนาต้องการปุ่ม ก็สามารถใช้ <kat-button></kat-button> แทนการสร้างปุ่มด้วยตนเอง","demo_complex_header_text":"การสาธิต: Katal Components ที่ซับซ้อน","demo_components_header_text":"การสาธิต: การใช้ Katal Components","demo_javascript_header_text":"การสาธิต: JavaScript กับ Katal Components","design_approved_text":"Katal มอบองค์ประกอบที่ได้รับการอนุมัติการออกแบบเพื่อใช้ในหน้าเว็บซึ่งสามารถกำหนดค่าด้วยป้ายกำกับและการตั้งค่าแบบกำหนดเอง ตัวอย่างเช่น: ปุ่มทั่วไปและปุ่มรอง โดยแตกต่างกันที่คุณสมบัติ \\"ตัวแปร\\" เท่านั้น","documentation_label":"เอกสารประกอบของ Katal","greeting_description":"นี่เป็นแอปพลิเคชัน Katal ตัวอย่างซึ่งสาธิตวิธีใช้ Katal Components รวมถึงเครื่องมือการสร้างและปรับใช้ โปรดติดต่อทีมงานของ Katal ที่ colombia-team@amazon.com พร้อมคำถามหรือความคิดเห็นใดๆ หากต้องการชมการสาธิตนี้ต่อไป ให้ปิดการแจ้งเตือนนี้","greeting_description_mons_app":"นี่เป็นแอปพลิเคชัน Katal ตัวอย่างซึ่งสาธิตวิธีใช้ Katal Components กับการแปล โปรดติดต่อทีมงานของ Katal ที่ katal-team@amazon.com พร้อมคำถามหรือความคิดเห็นใดๆ","greeting_header":"ข้อมูลแอปตัวอย่าง","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"ส่งความคิดเห็น","primary_button_label":"ปุ่มหลัก","sample_app_page_title_text":"แอปพลิเคชันตัวอย่าง","secondary_button_label":"ปุ่มรอง","tab_demo_generated_text":"แท็บที่สร้างโดยอัตโนมัติ {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"ชื่อแท็บ {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"แท็บที่เลือก","tab_demo_selected_text":"เนื้อหาสำหรับแท็บที่เลือกไว้ตอนแรก","tab_demo_text":"เนื้อหาสำหรับแท็บ {tabId}"}}}')},32773:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"tr":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"Sekme ekle","ahd_cancel_button":"İptal et","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"Adres","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"E-posta","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"Ad","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"Telefon","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"Banka hesap bilgileri","ahd_inform_page1_button":"İlerle","alert_variant_demo_description":"Bu uyarı bileşeninin varyantı, JavaScript tarafından değiştiriliyor","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Katal bileşenleri, HTML öğelerinin uzantıları olduğu için JavaScript, dahili HTML öğeleriyle aynı şekilde söz konusu bileşenlerle etkileşime geçebilir. Burada, JavaScript\'in uyarıda \\"varyant\\" özniteliğini değiştirdiğini görüyoruz.","components_containing_html_text":"KatalTabs bileşenimiz gibi bazı bileşenlerde HTML içeriği bulunabilir. Bu karmaşık bileşenler, geliştiricilerin ve çerçevelerin bunlarla etkileşim kurabilmesi için bir API sağlar.","continue_button_label":"Devam et","custom_elements_text":"Katal, geliştiricilere web sayfalarını oluşturmak için özel olarak tasarlanmış öğeleri kullanma olanağı verir. Örneğin geliştirici bir düğmeye ihtiyaç duyuyorsa düğmeyi bizzat oluşturmak yerine <kat-button></kat-button> düğmesini kullanabilir.","demo_complex_header_text":"Gösterim: Karmaşık Katal bileşenleri","demo_components_header_text":"Gösterim: Katal bileşenlerini kullanma","demo_javascript_header_text":"Gösterim: Katal bileşenleri ile JavaScript","design_approved_text":"Katal, etiketler ve özel ayarlarla yapılandırılabilen web sayfalarında kullanılabilecek, tasarımı onaylanmış bileşenler sunar. Örneğin sadece \\"varyant\\" öznitelikleri farklı olan standart tuşlar ve ikincil tuşlar.","documentation_label":"Katal belgeleri","greeting_description":"Bu örnek Katal uygulaması, hem Katal bileşenlerinin hem de oluşturma ve dağıtma araçlarının nasıl kullanılacağını gösterir. Sorularınız veya yorumlarınız için colombia-team@amazon.com adresinden Katal ekibiyle iletişime geçin. Gösterime devam etmek için bu uyarıyı devre dışı bırakın.","greeting_description_mons_app":"Bu, Katal bileşenlerinin tercümelerle nasıl kullanılacağını gösteren örnek bir Katal uygulamasıdır. Sorularınız veya yorumlarınız için katal-team@amazon.com adresinden Katal ekibiyle iletişime geçin.","greeting_header":"Örnek uygulama bilgileri","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Geri bildirimi gönder","primary_button_label":"Birincil düğme","sample_app_page_title_text":"Örnek uygulama","secondary_button_label":"İkincil düğme","tab_demo_generated_text":"Otomatik olarak oluşturulan sekme {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"Sekme adı {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Seçilen sekme","tab_demo_selected_text":"Başlangıçta seçilen sekmenin içeriği","tab_demo_text":"{tabId} sekmesinin içeriği"}}}')},35193:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"vi":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"Thêm thẻ","ahd_cancel_button":"Hủy","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"Địa chỉ","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"Email","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"Tên","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"Điện thoại","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"Thông tin tài khoản ngân hàng","ahd_inform_page1_button":"Tiếp tục","alert_variant_demo_description":"JavaScript sẽ thay đổi biến thể của thành phần cảnh báo này","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Vì các thành phần Katal là phần mở rộng của các yếu tố HTML, nên JavaScript có thể tương tác với chúng giống như các yếu tố HTML được tích hợp. Ở đây chúng ta thấy JavaScript thay đổi thuộc tính \'variant\' trên cảnh báo.","components_containing_html_text":"Một số thành phần có thể chứa nội dung HTML, giống như thành phần KatalTabs của chúng tôi. Các thành phần phức tạp này cung cấp một API để các nhà phát triển và các khung có thể tương tác với chúng.","continue_button_label":"Tiếp tục","custom_elements_text":"Katal cho phép các nhà phát triển sử dụng các yếu tố được thiết kế tùy chỉnh để xây dựng trang web của mình. Ví dụ: nếu nhà phát triển cần một nút, họ có thể sử dụng <kat-button></kat-button> thay vì tự tạo một nút.","demo_complex_header_text":"Phần minh họa: Các thành phần Katal phức tạp","demo_components_header_text":"Phần minh họa: Sử dụng các thành phần Katal","demo_javascript_header_text":"Phần minh họa: JavaScript với các thành phần Katal","design_approved_text":"Katal cung cấp các thành phần đã được phê duyệt về thiết kế để sử dụng trong các trang web mà có thể được cấu hình bằng nhãn và cài đặt tùy chỉnh. Ví dụ: các nút thông thường và nút phụ, chỉ khác nhau về thuộc tính \'variant\' của chúng.","documentation_label":"Tài liệu Katal","greeting_description":"Đây là một ứng dụng Katal mẫu, minh họa cách sử dụng Katal Components cũng như công cụ xây dựng và triển khai. Vui lòng liên hệ với đội ngũ Katal qua colombia-team@amazon.com nếu có câu hỏi hoặc ý kiến nào. Để tiếp tục phần minh họa này, vui lòng loại bỏ cảnh báo này.","greeting_description_mons_app":"Đây là một ứng dụng Katal mẫu, trình bày cách sử dụng các thành phần Katal kèm theo các bản dịch. Vui lòng liên hệ với đội ngũ Katal qua katal-team@amazon.com nếu có bất kỳ câu hỏi hoặc ý kiến nào.","greeting_header":"Thông tin ứng dụng mẫu","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Gửi phản hồi","primary_button_label":"Nút chính","sample_app_page_title_text":"Ứng dụng mẫu","secondary_button_label":"Nút phụ","tab_demo_generated_text":"Thẻ được tạo tự động {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"Tên thẻ {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Thẻ đã chọn","tab_demo_selected_text":"Nội dung cho thẻ đã chọn ban đầu","tab_demo_text":"Nội dung cho thẻ {tabId}"}}}')},24128:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"zh":{"pages.homepage":{"ahd_cancel_button":"取消","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"地址","documentation_label":"Katal 文件"}},"zh-CN":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"添加选项卡","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"电子邮件","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"名称","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"电话","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"银行账户信息","ahd_inform_page1_button":"继续","alert_variant_demo_description":"此提醒组件的变体由 JavaScript 更改","alert_variant_explanation_text":"因为 Katal 组件是 HTML 元素的扩展，所以和内置 HTML 元素一样，也能与 JavaScript 进行交互。此处，我们看到 JavaScript 更改了提醒中的“变体”属性。","components_containing_html_text":"某些组件可以包含 HTML 内容，如我们的 KatalTabs 组件。这些复杂的组件提供一个 API，以便开发者和框架可以与其交互。","continue_button_label":"继续","custom_elements_text":"Katal 让开发者可以使用自定义设计的元素构建其网页。例如，如果开发者需要按钮，他们可以使用 <kat-button></kat-button>，而无需自己构建按钮。","demo_complex_header_text":"演示：复杂 Katal 组件","demo_components_header_text":"演示：使用 Katal 组件","demo_javascript_header_text":"演示：带 Katal 组件的 JavaScript","design_approved_text":"Katal 提供经过设计批准的组件，这些组件在网页中使用，可借助标签和自定义设置进行配置。例如：常规按钮和辅助按钮，仅在其“变体”属性方面有所不同。","greeting_description":"这是示例 Katal 应用，演示了如何使用 Katal 组件以及构建和部署工具。如有任何问题或意见，请发送电子邮件至 colombia-team@amazon.com 联系 Katal 团队。要继续此演示，请忽略此提醒。","greeting_description_mons_app":"这是示例 Katal 应用，演示了如何在翻译中使用 Katal 组件。如有任何问题或意见，请发送电子邮件至 katal-team@amazon.com 联系 Katal 团队。","greeting_header":"示例应用信息","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"发送反馈","primary_button_label":"主按钮","sample_app_page_title_text":"示例应用","secondary_button_label":"辅助按钮","tab_demo_generated_text":"自动生成的选项卡 {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"选项卡名称 {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"选定选项卡","tab_demo_selected_text":"最初选定选项卡的内容","tab_demo_text":"选项卡 {tabId} 的内容"}},"zh-TW":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"新增索引標籤","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"電子郵件","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"名稱","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"電話","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"銀行帳戶資訊","ahd_inform_page1_button":"繼續","alert_variant_demo_description":"此提醒元件正在透過 JavaScript 變更其變體","alert_variant_explanation_text":"由於 Katal 元件是 HTML 元素的擴充，因此 JavaScript 可以像內建的 HTML 元素一樣與它們進行互動。在這裡，我們看到 JavaScript 變更了提醒上的「variant」屬性。","components_containing_html_text":"有些元件可以包含 HTML 內容，例如我們的 KatalTabs 元件。這些複雜的元件提供了一個 API，因此開發人員和各種架構可以與它們進行互動。","continue_button_label":"繼續","custom_elements_text":"Katal 使開發人員能夠使用自訂設計的元素來建置自己的網頁。例如，如果開發人員需要按鈕，他們可以使用 <kat-button></kat-button> 而非自行建置按鈕。","demo_complex_header_text":"示範：複雜的 Katal 元件","demo_components_header_text":"示範：使用 Katal 元件","demo_javascript_header_text":"示範：JavaScript 和 Katal 元件","design_approved_text":"Katal 提供經過設計核准的元件，以供用於可以使用標籤和自訂設定進行配置的網頁。例如：一般按鈕和次要按鈕，只有在其「variant」屬性上有所不同。","greeting_description":"此為 Katal 範例應用程式，示範如何使用 Katal 元件以及「建置和部署」工具。如有任何疑問或意見，請透過 colombia-team@amazon.com 與 Katal 團隊聯絡。若要繼續此示範，請關閉此提醒。","greeting_description_mons_app":"這是一個 Katal 範例應用程式，示範如何將 Katal 元件與譯文搭配使用。如有任何疑問或意見，請透過 katal-team@amazon.com 與 Katal 團隊聯絡。","greeting_header":"範例應用程式資訊","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"傳送意見回饋","primary_button_label":"主要按鈕","sample_app_page_title_text":"範例應用程式","secondary_button_label":"次要按鈕","tab_demo_generated_text":"自動產生的索引標籤 {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"索引標籤名稱 {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"已選取的索引標籤","tab_demo_selected_text":"最初選取之索引標籤的內容","tab_demo_text":"索引標籤 {tabId} 的內容"}}}')},47103:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"und":{"pages.homepage":{"addTab_label":"Add Tab","ahd_ahr_pending_critical":"Pending Critical","ahd_all_issues":"All Issues","ahd_banner_account_atrisk_header":"Your account is at risk of deactivation.","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_body":"Your account will be considered for reactivation when your violations have been successfully appealed.","ahd_banner_account_deactivation_header":"Your account has been deactivated.","ahd_banner_account_pending_header":"Your account is pending deactivation.","ahd_banner_resolve_issues_button":"Resolve Issues","ahd_cancel_button":"Cancel","ahd_educational_banner_header":"Complete your Priority Actions","ahd_educational_banner_subheader":"You have one or more outstanding action items that will result in account deactivation if not completed by the listed date.","ahd_inform_ac_checkbox_error":"Click the checkbox to confirm that you have reviewed your information and certify that it is accurate and current.","ahd_inform_ac_edu_display_name":"Review Your Account Information","ahd_inform_ac_educational_subheader":"You have one or more outstanding action items that may result in future account deactivation.","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p1":"Under the US INFORM Consumers Act, you are required to keep certain business information (shown below) current and to electronically certify to Amazon that either you have updated your information or that the information already provided is still current. Certify that your information below is up-to-date within 10 days of viewing this notice, or your account will be at risk of deactivation.","ahd_inform_ac_notice_p2":"You are now required to certify that your information below is up to date within 10 days of first viewing this notice. Failure to certify will put your account at risk of deactivation.","ahd_inform_ac_p1_header":"Get Ready to Certify Your Information","ahd_inform_ac_page1_checkbox":"Click the checkbox to confirm you have understand that once you go to the INFORM Act Notice and Certification page, you’ll receive a notice and have 10 days to update and certify your information.","ahd_inform_ac_page1_step1_intructions":"Click “Edit” to update any information below that is incorrect, then click “Certify” above.","ahd_inform_ac_page2_certify_instructions":"If your information below is up to date, you can certify now. If any information is incorrect, please edit your information before clicking “Certify.”","ahd_inform_ac_refresh_update_info":"If you have updated any information below, please click here to refresh the page and see the new information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_address_field":"Address","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_button":"Certify","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_confirmation":"By clicking \\"Certify\\" I certify that I read the Notice above and that the information I provided to Amazon is true and correct, corresponds to my business, and is not misappropriated.","ahd_inform_act_ac_certify_your_info_button":"Certify your information","ahd_inform_act_ac_edit_information":"Edit Information","ahd_inform_act_ac_email_field":"Email","ahd_inform_act_ac_name_field":"Name","ahd_inform_act_ac_not_required":"The INFORM Act does not yet apply to your business so you’re not currently required to certify your information. We’ll notify you in the future if you’re required to certify your information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_notice_title":"Notice","ahd_inform_act_ac_phone_field":"Phone","ahd_inform_act_ac_short_description":"Review and complete your pending INFORM Consumers Act requirements.","ahd_inform_act_ac_step1_title":"Review and update your information","ahd_inform_act_ac_tax_field":"Tax ID number","ahd_inform_act_ac_thankyou":"Thank you for certifying that your business information is current.","ahd_inform_act_ac_tin_field":"Tax Identification Number (TIN):","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions":"Please note that only the primary user or secondary user with authorized permissions to Confirm/Edit Account Information will be able to certify the information.","ahd_inform_act_ac_user_permissions_error":"This information must be certified by the Account’s primary user or a secondary user authorized with permissions to Confirm/Edit Account Information.","ahd_inform_act_account_information":"Account Information","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_ending":"Bank account ending","ahd_inform_act_bank_account_field":"Bank account information","ahd_inform_act_need_help":"Need help? Visit the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act Help page</a>.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p1":"To avoid any future disruptions to your account, please remember that you are required to keep your business information current and to certify at least annually that your name, address, phone number, email address, bank account information, and Tax ID number are correct.","ahd_inform_confirmation_p2":"If any of your information changes, Amazon will need to verify this new information as well. Please respond promptly to any information requests so that we can work with you to complete these additional verification steps and avoid account disruption. For more information about the verification process, go to the <a href=/help/hub/reference/GJ4JUGLSAPRM3LU7>INFORM Act Help page</a>.","ahd_inform_consumers_act_ac":"INFORM Act Notice and Certification","ahd_inform_page1_button":"Proceed","ahd_inform_page1_checkbox":"I understand that once I go to the INFORM Act Notice and Certification page, I must complete certification within 10 days to avoid the risk of account disruption.","ahd_inform_page1_instructions":"Review and certify your information now in two easy steps:","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2a":"Per the US INFORM Consumers Act, we will begin sending sellers a formal notification to review and certify that their business information is correct, which you must complete within 10 days to avoid the risk of account deactivation.","ahd_inform_page1_paragraph_2b":"However, you don’t have to wait and can take action to certify today.","ahd_inform_page1_step2_description":"Once you have confirmed that your information is correct, click the link below to receive your formal notice and complete certification.","ahd_inform_page_1_p1":"In our continued effort to provide you and customers with a trusted store experience, we will collect and verify certain business information from you at least annually.","ahd_past_due":"PAST DUE","ahd_priority_actions_address_by_date":"Address by {date} in {daysremaining} days","ahd_priority_actions_description":"Address the issues below to prevent account deactivation.","ahd_priority_actions_title":"Priority Actions","ahd_regulatory_compliance":"Regulatory Compliance","ai_inform_page1_step1":"1. Go to your Account Information page [link to Account Information page here] to review your account information (and update, if necessary).","ai_inform_page1_step2":"2. Once you have confirmed that your information is correct, return to this page and click the link below to receive your formal notice and complete certification.","alert_variant_demo_description":"This alert component is having its variant changed by JavaScript","alert_variant_explanation_text":"Because Katal Components are extensions of HTML elements, JavaScript can interact with them the same as built-in HTML elements. Here we see JavaScript changing the \'variant\' attribute on the alert.","components_containing_html_text":"Some components can contain HTML content, like our KatalTabs component. These complex components provide an API so developers and frameworks can interact with them.","continue_button_label":"Continue","custom_elements_text":"Katal gives developers the ability to use custom-designed elements to build their web pages. For example, if the developer needs a button, they can use <kat-button></kat-button> instead of building a button themselves.","demo_complex_header_text":"Demonstration: Complex Katal Components","demo_components_header_text":"Demonstration: Using Katal Components","demo_javascript_header_text":"Demonstration: JavaScript with Katal Components","design_approved_text":"Katal offers design-approved components for use in web pages that can be configured with labels and custom settings. For example: regular buttons and secondary buttons, different only in their \'variant\' attribute.","documentation_label":"Katal Documentation","greeting_description":"This is a sample Katal application, demonstrating how to use Katal Components as well as build-and-deploy tooling. Please contact the Katal team at colombia-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments. To continue this demo, please dismiss this alert.","greeting_description_mons_app":"This is a sample Katal application, demonstrating how to use Katal Components with translations. Please contact the Katal team at katal-team@amazon.com with any questions or comments.","greeting_header":"Sample App Information","katal_hmd_send_feedback":"Send Feedback","primary_button_label":"Primary Button","sample_app_page_title_text":"Sample Application","sc_homepage_education_phase_description":"Address your account health to avoid the risk of future account deactivation.","sc_homepage_pending_deactivation":"A critical event has occurred with your account that has caused it to be pending deactivation.","secondary_button_label":"Secondary Button","sp_zero_tolerance_banner_body":"Due to one or more critical violations, your account is pending deactivation. To prevent deactivation, please address these violations now. For more information, go to the <a href=/gp/help/G200205250>Account Health Rating program policy</a>.","tab_demo_generated_text":"Auto Generated Tab {tabId}","tab_demo_name":"Tab name {tabId}","tab_demo_selected_name":"Selected Tab","tab_demo_selected_text":"Content for initially selected tab","tab_demo_text":"Content for tab {tabId}"}}}')},3306:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"ar":{"pages.floatingWidget":{"DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_cta_done":"إدارة التقييمات","DYK_SSAT_CFT_DietarySupp_content":"احمِ عروض المكملات الغذائية من خلال المسار السريع للامتثال. احصل على التحقق التلقائي من الامتثال عندما تقوم المؤسسة المشاركة بتوثيق منتجاتك، ما يستبعد الحاجة إلى تقديم وثائق الامتثال.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_Toys_content":"احمِ عروضك في فئة الألعاب من خلال المسار السريع للامتثال. احصل على التحقق التلقائي من الامتثال عندما تقوم المؤسسة المشاركة بتوثيق منتجاتك، ما يستبعد الحاجة إلى تقديم وثائق الامتثال.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_artscrafts_content":"احمِ عروضك في فئة الفنون والحرف من خلال المسار السريع للامتثال. احصل على التحقق التلقائي من الامتثال عندما تقوم المؤسسة المشاركة بتوثيق منتجاتك، ما يستبعد الحاجة إلى تقديم وثائق الامتثال.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_buttoncellbatteryproducts_content":"احمِ عروضك في فئة بطاريات الخلايا الزرية من خلال المسار السريع للامتثال. احصل على التحقق التلقائي من الامتثال عندما تقوم المؤسسة المشاركة بتوثيق منتجاتك، ما يستبعد الحاجة إلى تقديم وثائق الامتثال.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_childrensproducts_content":"احمِ عروضك في فئة منتجات الأطفال من خلال المسار السريع للامتثال. احصل على التحقق التلقائي من الامتثال عندما تقوم المؤسسة المشاركة بتوثيق منتجاتك، ما يستبعد الحاجة إلى تقديم وثائق الامتثال.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_cta_done":"اشترك اليوم","DYK_SSAT_CFT_electronics_content":"احمِ عروضك في فئة الأجهزة الإلكترونية من خلال المسار السريع للامتثال. احصل على التحقق التلقائي من الامتثال عندما تقوم المؤسسة المشاركة بتوثيق منتجاتك، ما يستبعد الحاجة إلى تقديم وثائق الامتثال.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_emobilityproducts_content":"احمِ عروضك في فئة أجهزة التنقل الإلكتروني من خلال المسار السريع للامتثال. احصل على التحقق التلقائي من الامتثال عندما تقوم المؤسسة المشاركة بتوثيق منتجاتك، ما يستبعد الحاجة إلى تقديم وثائق الامتثال.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_firesafety_content":"احمِ عروضك في فئة السلامة من الحرائق من خلال المسار السريع للامتثال. احصل على التحقق التلقائي من الامتثال عندما تقوم المؤسسة المشاركة بتوثيق منتجاتك، ما يستبعد الحاجة إلى تقديم وثائق الامتثال.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_furniture_content":"احمِ عروضك في فئة الأثاث من خلال المسار السريع للامتثال. احصل على التحقق التلقائي من الامتثال عندما تقوم المؤسسة المشاركة بتوثيق منتجاتك، ما يستبعد الحاجة إلى تقديم وثائق الامتثال.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_header":"تبسيط الامتثال: التسجيل في المسار السريع للامتثال اليوم","DYK_SSAT_CFT_infantbabyproducts_content":"احمِ عروضك في فئة منتجات الأطفال والرضع من خلال المسار السريع للامتثال. احصل على التحقق التلقائي من الامتثال عندما تقوم المؤسسة المشاركة بتوثيق منتجاتك، ما يستبعد الحاجة إلى تقديم وثائق الامتثال.","DYK_SSAT_CFT_ppe_content":"احمِ عروضك في فئة معدات الحماية الشخصية من خلال المسار السريع للامتثال. احصل على التحقق التلقائي من الامتثال عندما تقوم المؤسسة المشاركة بتوثيق منتجاتك، ما يستبعد الحاجة إلى تقديم وثائق الامتثال.","DYK_SSAT_EDU_JULY":"النقاط الأساسية الخاصة بمعدل صحة الحساب","DYK_SSAT_EDU_content":"إن معدل صحة الحساب يراقب خطر تعطيل حسابك من خلال نظام نقاط. تحصل على نقاط عند إتمام شحن الطلبات بنجاح. تخسر النقاط عند اكتشاف انتهاكات السياسة، وتستعيد النقاط عند معالجة تلك الانتهاكات بنجاح. راجع اللوحة الرئيسية \\"صحة الحساب\\" بشكل متكرر وقم بمعالجة انتهاكات السياسة عند حدوثها.","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop":"هل تعلم أنه طالما لم ترتكب أي انتهاكات، فلن تقل درجتك عن 200 حتى إذا كان لديك عدد متناقص من الطلبات؟","ahd_dyk_ahr_order_volume_drop_header":"نصيحة بشأن معدل صحة الحساب السليم","ahd_dyk_br_kyc_existing_seller_header":"متجرك على Amazon.com.br (البرازيل) معرض لخطر إلغاء التفعيل.","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_description":"انتقل إلى صفحة <a href=\'/hz/sc/account-information\' target=\'_blank\'>معلومات الحساب</a> لإكمال عملية التحقق. ","ahd_dyk_ca_kyc_existing_seller_header":"إن متجرك على Amazon.ca (كندا) معرض لخطر إلغاء التفعيل.","ahd_dyk_cta_done":"تم","ahd_dyk_cta_eukyc":"إكمال عملية التحقق","ahd_dyk_de_sup_label":"للامتثال لسياسة المسؤولية الممتدة للمنتِج (EPR) الخاصة بالخاصة بالمنتجات البلاستيكية ذات الاستعمال الواحد في ألمانيا، والتي دخلت حيز التنفيذ في 1 يناير 2025، بادر باتخاذ الإجراءات اللازمة من خلال تقديم أرقام التسجيل في إستراتيجية المسؤولية الممتدة للمنتِج لكل مجموعة من العلامات التجارية وأنواع المنتجات. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GA4JYZX23CLK8WFW\\">معرفة المزيد</a>","ahd_dyk_de_sup_title":"لديك عروض تتأثر بالمسؤولية الممتدة للمنتِج ‎(EPR): الخاصة بالمنتجات البلاستيكية ذات الاستعمال الواحد في ألمانيا","ahd_dyk_de_sup_weee_title":"لديك عروض تتأثر بالمسؤولية الممتدة للمنتِج ‎(EPR): نفايات المعدات الكهربائية والإلكترونية (WEEE) في ألمانيا","ahd_dyk_description_eukyc":"وفقًا للوائح الاتحاد الأوروبي، يجب عليك إكمال عملية التحقق من الحساب. انتقل إلى صفحة معلومات الهوية لإكمال التحقق. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/G201200780 \\">معرفة المزيد</a>","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_label":"للامتثال لسياسة المسؤولية الممتدة للمنتِج الخاصة ببطاريات الاتحاد الأوروبي، والتي ستدخل حيز التنفيذ في 18 أغسطس 2025، بادر باتخاذ الإجراءات اللازمة من خلال تقديم أرقام التسجيل في إستراتيجية المسؤولية الممتدة للمنتِج لفئات منتجاتك. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\" /help/hub/reference/GPVDATLHQ6PRQNSW\\">معرفة المزيد</a>","ahd_dyk_eu_batt_title":"لديك عروض تتأثر بالمسؤولية الممتدة للمنتِج ‎(EPR): الخاصة ببطاريات الاتحاد الأوروبي","ahd_dyk_fhdds_cta":"مراجعة الشحنات","ahd_dyk_fhdds_description":"قدّم تفاصيل الاستيراد لجميع الشحنات السارية الخاصة بك في صف الشحن قبل أن تعطل نشاطك التجاري. يمكن أن تحد تفاصيل الاستيراد المفقودة من قدرتك على إنشاء شحنات جديدة إلى المملكة المتحدة.","ahd_dyk_fhdds_header":"لديك شحنات تفتقد أرقام إدخال الاستيراد ‎(IENs)‎.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_header":"لديك عناصر عمل مُعلقة لبدء البيع في متجر <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.com.br/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.com.br</a>.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_br_subtitle":"يجب عليك إرسال المعلومات لاستكمال متطلبات التحقق للبيع في البرازيل.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_header":"لديك عناصر عمل مُعلقة لبدء البيع في متجر <a href=\\"https://sellercentral.amazon.ca/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Amazon.ca</a>.","ahd_dyk_new_self_trigger_ca_subtitle":"يجب عليك إرسال المعلومات لاستكمال متطلبات التحقق للبيع في كندا.","ahd_dyk_title_eukyc":"أكمل عملية التحقق الخاص بلوائح التعرف على العميل (KYC) في الاتحاد الأوروبي","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description":"للامتثال للوائح العامة لسلامة المنتج (GPSR) التي ستسري اعتبارًا من 13 ديسمبر 2024، المرجو تقديم معلومات إضافية بشأن امتثال منتجاتك لتجنب التأثير في عروضك. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">معرفة المزيد</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_description_post_impact":"للالتزام بقانون GPSR (الذي يدخل حيز التنفيذ اعتبارًا من 13 ديسمبر 2024) ولتجنب تعطيل العروض، اتخذ الإجراءات الآن من خلال تقديم معلومات امتثال إضافية لمنتجاتك. <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"/help/hub/reference/GQAYBJPNAZ2LMDDT\\">معرفة المزيد</a>","ahd_floating_widget_GPSR_task":"لديك عروض متأثرة بقرار السلامة العامة للمنتجات (GPSR)‎.","ahd_floating_widget_aha_ec_description":"بصفتك عضوًا في برنامج AHA، <b>مطلوب</b> منك الاحتفاظ برقم اتصال صالح في حالات الطوارئ. تحقَّق من تفاصيل التواصل الخاصة بك في حالات الطوارئ للحفاظ على أهليتك في برنامج AHA، حتى يتمكن المتخصصون لدينا من التواصل معك لمساعدتك في حل المشكلات الحرجة المتعلقة بصحة الحساب قبل أن تؤثر سلبًا في نشاطك التجاري.","ahd_floating_widget_cta_button":"الاطّلاع على العروض","ahd_floating_widget_ec_action_panel_title":"تحديث معلومات التواصل في حالات الطوارئ","ahd_floating_widget_ec_aha_description":"تحقَّق من تفاصيل التواصل الخاصة بك في حالات الطوارئ حتى يتمكن المتخصصون لدينا من التواصل معك لمساعدتك في حل المشاكل الحرجة المتعلقة بصحة الحساب قبل أن تؤثر سلبًا على نشاطك التجاري.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_cta_button":"عملية التحقق مكتملة","ahd_floating_widget_ec_description":"تحقَّق من تفاصيل التواصل الخاصة بك في حالات الطوارئ حتى يتمكن المتخصصون لدينا من التواصل معك لمساعدتك في حل المشاكل الحرجة المتعلقة بصحة الحساب قبل أن تؤثر سلبًا على نشاطك التجاري.","ahd_floating_widget_ec_task":"لم يتم التحقق من معلومات التواصل الخاصة بك في حالات الطوارئ","ahd_floating_widget_new_tag":"جديد!","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_food_and_safety_heading":"لديك انتهاكات متكررة \\"للمشكلات المتعلقة بسلامة الأغذية والمنتجات\\"","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_ip_heading":"لديك انتهاكات متكررة للشكاوى التي تم تلقيها بشأن الملكية الفكرية","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_listing_heading":"لديك انتهاكات متكررة \\"لانتهاكات سياسة العرض\\"","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_many_policies_heading":"لديك انتهاكات متكررة لسياسات متعددة","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_other_heading":"لديك انتهاكات متكررة \\"لانتهاكات السياسة الأخرى\\"","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_auth_heading":"لديك انتهاكات متكررة \\"لشكاوى العملاء بشأن صحة المنتج\\"","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_cond_heading":"لديك انتهاكات متكررة \\"لشكاوى العملاء المتعلقة بحالة المنتج\\"","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_prod_reviews_heading":"لديك انتهاكات متكررة \\"لانتهاكات سياسة آراء العملاء حول المنتج\\"","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_reg_comp_heading":"لديك انتهاكات متكررة \\"للامتثال للضوابط\\"","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_rp_heading":"لديك انتهاكات متكررة لسياسة المنتجات المقيدة","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_for_sip_heading":"لديك انتهاكات متكررة \\"لانتهاكات مشتبه فيها لحقوق الملكية الفكرية\\"","ahd_floating_widget_repeat_violations_body":"يمكن أن يؤدي تكرار انتهاكات السياسة لنفس عملية البيع إلى تعطيل الحساب. قم بحل هذه المشكلات لتجنب التعطل غير الضروري لحساب البيع الخاص بك.","ahd_floating_widget_resolve_now_button_text":"حل المشكلة الآن","ahd_floating_widget_title":"هل كنت تعلم؟","ahd_floating_widget_view_all":"عرض الكل {count}","ahd_rap_begin_verification_cta":"بدء التحقق","cs_nerd_suggestion_top_issues_action_vi":"عرض المشاكل"}}}')},74562:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"bn":{"pages.floatingWidget":{"DYK_AHR2launch_CSQ_12-2025_cta_done":"ফিডব্যাক ম্যানেজার","DYK_SSAT_CFT_DietarySupp_content":"আপনার সম্পূরক আহারের লিস্টিংগুলো কমপ্লায়েন্স ফাস্ট-ট্র্যাক ব্যবহার করে সুরক্ষিত রাখুন। যখন কোনো অংশীদার সংস্থা আপনার প্রোডাক্টগুলোকে প্রত্যয়িত করবে, তখন আপনার প্রোডাক্টগুলো স্বয়ংক্রিয়ভাবে নিয়মকানুন মেনে চলছে কিনা, তা যাচাই করা হবে,আলাদা করে কমপ্লায়েন্স সংক্রান্ত কাগজপত্র জমা দিতে হবে না।","DYK_SSAT_CFT_Toys_content":"আপনার খেলনার বিভাগের লিস্টিংগুলো কমপ্লায়েন্স ফাস্ট-ট্র্যাক ব্যবহার করে সুরক্ষিত রাখুন। যখন কোনো অংশীদার সংস্থা আপনার প্রোডাক্টগুলোকে প্রত্যয়িত করবে, তখন আপনার প্রোডাক্টগুলো স্বয়ংক্রিয়ভাবে নিয়মকানুন মেনে চলছে কিনা, তা যাচাই করা হবে,আলাদা করে কমপ্লায়েন্স সংক্রান্ত কাগজপত্র জমা দিতে হবে না।","DYK_SSAT_CFT_artscrafts_content":"আপনার শিল্পকলা (আর্ট ও ক্রাফট) বিভাগের লিস্টিংগুলো কমপ্লায়েন্স ফাস্ট-ট্র্যাকের সাহায্যে সুরক্ষিত রাখুন। কোনো অংশীদার সংস্থা আপনার প্রোডাক্টগুলোকে প্রত্যয়িত করলে, আপনার প্রোডাক্টগুলো নিয়মকানুন মেনে চলছে কি না, তা স্বয়ংক্রিয়ভাবে যাচাই হয়ে যাবে। ফলে আপনাকে আলাদা করে কমপ্লায়েন্স সংক্রান্ত কাগজপত্র জমা দিতে হবে না।","DYK_SSAT_CFT_buttoncellbatteryproducts_content":"আপনার বাটন সেল ব্যাটারি বিভাগের লিস্টিংগুলো কমপ্লায়েন্স ফাস্ট